66e88cfd434416cd1bd17ac0,Abiola Richard Olawole,+23408062715547,abiwealth@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hiring Manager\nTobams Group,\n\nDear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am writing to express my interest in the Finance Manager position at Tobams Group, as advertised. With over 13 years of progressive experience in financial management, strategy, and planning, I believe my background aligns with the expertise your company seeks. In my current role as Chief Finance Officer at Day Waterman College, I lead all financial operations, manage budgets, and provide critical financial reporting and analysis to support strategic decision-making.\n\nAt Day Waterman College, I am responsible for preparing financial statements in compliance with local and international standards, managing cash flow, and overseeing investment activities in consultation with brokers. My experience in strategic financial planning, ROI analysis, and managing external audits has equipped me with the skills necessary to meet Tobams Group’s need for a finance professional who can help build a robust financial foundation. Additionally, I have hands-on experience managing budgets and providing financial data that supports long-term goals—an ability I will leverage to contribute to the success of your startup projects.\n\nI am also adept in financial systems management, having worked extensively with accounting software like Sage Pastel Evolution. I am confident that my technical expertise, combined with my ability to lead financial operations and deliver investor-ready financial statements, will bring value to Tobams Group as it scales and seeks funding opportunities.\n\nI hold a BSc in Accounting and I am currently pursuing an MBA in Finance and Investment. I am also an Associate Member of the Institute of Chartered Accountants of Nigeria (ICAN). My qualifications, coupled with my extensive experience in financial management, align with the key skills and competencies you require for this role.\n\nI am excited about the opportunity to contribute to Tobams Group's growth and would welcome the chance to discuss how my experience and skills can help your company achieve its financial goals. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.\n\nYour faithfully,\nAbiola Olawole\n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726516475528_Resume-CV_Abiola Olawole-BSc & ACA.doc,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-16T19:54:37.433Z,2024-09-16T19:54:37.433Z,,,,,,,,,
