66e8928f434416cd1bd17ad3,Oluwatomisin Momoh,+2347030663019,momohtomisin@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nI am Oluwatomisin Momoh, a finance professional with over five years of experience in treasury, financial reporting, and analysis. My expertise spans various financial tools such as SAGE X3, QuickBooks, Microsoft Suite, and more. I currently serve as a Senior Financial Analyst (Liabilities) at Dorman Long Engineering, where I manage payroll accounting, project revenue recognition, and financial reporting. I have also worked with Ikeja Electric Plc and Marveglo Nigeria Limited, contributing to financial management, debt obligations, and cost-saving initiatives.\n\nI hold a Bachelor's degree in Accounting (First Class Honors) from Achievers University and am pursuing a Master’s degree in Finance at the University of Lagos. I am also a certified Financial Modeling & Valuation Analyst (FMVA) and an Associate Chartered Accountant (ACA). My training includes data analytics, business process management, and company performance analysis​",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726517901442_TMomoh cv (achieve).pdf,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-16T20:18:23.763Z,2024-09-16T20:18:23.763Z,,,,,,,,,
