66e897f1434416cd1bd17ae4,Faith Kikachukwu Aminaho ,+2348130264704,faithaminaho@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Faith Kikachukwu Aminaho and I hold a Bachelor of Science degree in accounting from the University of Port Harcourt, Nigeria with second class upper (2:1). I am currently a Master of Science student in Accounting and Finance in the University of Northampton, United Kingdom. I am also an Associate Chartered Accountant (ACA) with the Institute of Chartered Accountants of Nigeria (ICAN); my membership number with The Institute is MB060628. I am also currently an ACCA (Finalist).\n\nI have gained practice and industrial work experience in accounting for about six (6) years in Not-For-Profit Organizations, Retail industry, and Energy and Natural Resources industry, where I have carried out responsibilities such as assisting external auditors with audit requests and resolving any arising issue from audit testing procedures, preparing financial statements in compliance with International Financial Reporting Standards (IFRS) and Generally Accepted Accounting Principles (GAAP) for board and statutory audit, performing analytical review of company’s financial performance and position, designing and implementing efficient internal controls, ensuring compliance with tax laws and regulations, preparing management accounts and reports, building financial models, maintaining accounting records and documenting accounting files, procedures and workflows; amongst other responsibilities.\n\nIn the course of my work experience, I have developed strong commercial acumen and professional competence. I possess excellent communication, analytical, time management, accounting software and advanced Microsoft excel skills. I am passionate about accounting practice, and I am attentive to detail.\n\nI believe that I will contribute maximally to the achievement of your business objectives considering my positive work attitude, expertise, and experience over time.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/faithaminaho,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726519279000_Faith Aminaho CV(1).pdf,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-16T20:41:21.869Z,2024-09-16T20:41:21.869Z,,,,,,,,,
66e89c18434416cd1bd17af3,Adeoye Adeyeye,+23407085077679,Addey203@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"Dear Recruiting Manager,\n\nMy skills and experience align well with the advertised requirements for the role of  a Finance Controller and I am highly motivated to apply for the\n\nBelow are my core skills and competencies;\n\n1)    Financial management: I am highly skilled in organizational budgeting, forecasting and budgetary controls. I am able to analyze financial transactions and reports correctly to all categories of users\n\n2)    Coordination of internal and external audits: In my career, developed and implemented internal control / audit policies (as Head, Systems Control & Internal Audit), I have also coordinated annual audits by PWC, KPMG and Deloitte for my previous employers as Head of finance. I have gained relevant experience in carrying spot audits, periodic audits, providing schedules and supporting documentation\n\n3)    Mentoring and capacity building: as an experienced finance professional, I am able to impact knowledge to colleagues whether in respect of new developments in, and application of, relevant financial standards or financial procedures.\n\n4)  Regulatory and Organizational Compliance: I am to follow organizational procedures in an orderly manner and ensure prompt compliance with relevant regulations.\n\n7)    IT Proficiency: I am a proficient user of Microsoft Dynamics Navision, SAP, CXO BI and Sage Pastel accounting softwares for financial management. As well as proficiency in Microsoft Office tools (Word, Excel, PowerPoint), SharePoint, Office365, Google Suite tools among others.\n\n8)    I have versed experience in Inventory / Asset management\n\n9)    I possess strong communication skills with an excellent ability in written and spoken English, as well as analytical and problem solving\n\nYou will surely find me an added value to the finance team because I have enjoyed a reputation as an efficient, highly organized worker.\n\nThank you for taking the time to review my resume. I look forward to hearing from you.\n\nSincerely yours,\n\nAdeoye Adeyeye,",.,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726520342321_Adeoye_Adeyeye_CV_LJOYH__PHD424 (2).pdf,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-16T20:59:04.975Z,2024-09-16T20:59:04.975Z,,,,,,,,,
