66e953c2434416cd1bd17bd2,Damilola Ogundiran,+2347068439445,damilolaogundiran92@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a solution-driven Finance and Accounts professional with over seven years of experience in industries including Real Estate, Retail, Hospitality, Manufacturing, ICT, Management Consulting, Capital Markets, and FinTech. My goal is to help organisations develop efficient accounting systems that provide transparent and reliable financial data, enabling them to minimise costs, reduce risks, and maximise profits.\n\nI have a solid track record of delivering value in areas such as Accounting Operations, Cash Flow Management, Budgeting & Forecasting, Financial Reporting & Analysis, and Taxation. My expertise extends to Financial Modelling, Performance and Trend Analysis, Internal Controls, and ensuring compliance with IFRS and other regulatory frameworks.\n\nAdditionally, I am passionate about Business Intelligence and Data Analytics, with strong proficiency in Microsoft Office and Accounting ERPs like QuickBooks, Sage50, and NAV. I bring strong communication, analytical skills, and a commitment to fostering sustainable business growth and financial gains. I am eager to contribute to a team and continuously learn in a dynamic environment.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/damilola-ogundiran-aca-fmva%C2%AE-mba-in-view-2b63a8a7/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726567359996_Damilola Ogundiran_Finance Manager_Sept. 2024_CV.pdf,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-17T10:02:42.253Z,2024-09-17T10:02:42.253Z,,,,,,,,,
