66eaad21434416cd1bd17f79,Chizoba Ani ,+23407038798654,chizobaagbomma@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nI am a highly skilled accounting consultant.\n\nWith more than thirteen years’ experience as an accounting and tax consultant, I am skillful in business analysis, program implementation, monitoring and evaluation process. Relevant to this position, I would like to stress that I have a solid understanding of GAAP and good knowledge of IFRS.\n\nI am known as a versatile contributor with experience in auditing, accounting and taxation, quality and risk review deliverable in concurrence with risk and reputation standards, problem-solving skills, and ability to make difficult decisions.\n\nIn addition to my experience and personal qualities, I have a solid educational foundation and a passion for business process improvements. I am extremely enthusiastic about the company’s focus in managing optimal financial reporting and would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your success through increased account stewardship, accurate accounting, documentations, stronger client relationships, and best practices improvement. ",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726655774570_CV - Chizoba Ani (1).pdf,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-18T10:36:17.619Z,2024-09-18T10:36:17.619Z,,,,,,,,,
66eaafa5434416cd1bd17f86,Ifeoluwa Olowoloba,+23407034752908,kemi.olowoloba@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an accounting graduate and an associate member of the Institute of Chartered Accountants of Nigeria (ICAN), a qualified chartered management accountant of CIMA and currently at the professional level of my Association of Chartered Certified Accountant (ACCA) study, with competencies in Accountancy and Financial Reporting in line with IFRS and IPSAS, Auditing and Assurance Services and Tax advisory. I am proficient in using Accounting Software such as Microsoft Dynamics 365 Navision and Business Central, Sage, Quick Books, and Sun System (Oracle). I am proficient in Microsoft Office applications, especially Excel.\n\nI have over eight years of cognitive on-the-job experience which has exposed me to wide arrays of decision dynamics, standard operating procedures, and impactful technical know-how for effective planning and coordination for efficient service deliveries. I am more suitable for this position considering my adaptability to different roles. I have worked as an Audit Trainee and finance Associate, and Currently with Garden Ventures Limited as a Finance Lead.  A role in which I have been delivering excellent performances such as assessing and identifying potential risks in internal control, fashioning effective risk mitigation strategies in areas of financial reporting, adherence to entity policies, ethics, and values, segregation of enhancing enhanced operational (inventory and assets management) efficiency, compliance to laws and regulations. I have in the past and even presently been involved in financial reporting, involved in conducting statutory audits, assurance engagements, verification exercises, and investigations. \n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726656418849_Olowoloba Ifeoluwa.pdf,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-18T10:47:01.510Z,2024-09-18T10:47:01.510Z,,,,,,,,,
66eab129434416cd1bd17f8d,Razaq Adejare Uthman,+2348062477776,hareef001@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"Dear Sir/Madam,    \n\nAPPLICATION FOR THE POST OF FINANCE MANAGER.\n\nWith reference to your recent advertisement, I hereby apply for the vacant post of  Finance Manager in your client’s reputable organization.\n\nI am an astute finance and accounts professional with hands-on experience in finance and accounts and I obtained Bachelor of Science (B.Sc) degree in Accounting from Olabisi Onabanjo University, Ago Iwoye. Ogun State, after obtaining Higher National Diploma (HND) Certificate in Accounting from Federal Polytechnic Offa, Kwara State in 2002, I also bagged a Master Degree certificate in Business Administration with bias for finance (MBA Finance) from Obafemi Awolowo University Ile-Ife in 2012  and I am a Fellow member of the Institute of Chartered Accountants of Nigeria (ICAN), Fellow member of Chartered Institute of Taxation of Nigeria (CITN) and the Portfolio Management Institute (PMI), I am also an ICAN International Financial Reporting Standard (IFRS) certified.\nI have been working as a skilled finance and Accounts person since 2003 conveniently handling  the preparation and monitoring of budget with variance analysis, preparation of financial statement and review of same, computation of cost of production of finished goods and work in progress (WIP) for the determination of selling price, processing of form M, fund negotiation with financial/credit providers, setting up and implementation of  workable internal system, warehouse management and inventory control, fixed Asset and capital expenditure (CAPEX),  and so on. I am goal getter, a good communicator and coach. I presently work as Chief Accountant with IPI PowerTech Nigeria Limited – a telecom infrastructure company. \nI am skilled in working with Dynamics Navision 5.0 ERP, SAP and other accounting software.\n\nI shall be grateful if I can be given the opportunity to contribute my quota to the growth and development of the organization.\nSir/Madam, my detailed resume is as attached for your kind perusal.\n\nI shall be looking forward to hearing from you very soon.\n\nYours faithfully,\n\nUthman Razaq Adejare (FCA).    \n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726656806944_RAZAQ ADEJARE UTHMAN CV.docx,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-18T10:53:29.577Z,2024-09-18T10:53:29.577Z,,,,,,,,,
