66ead628434416cd1bd180b0,Joseph Majiyagbe,+23408034060166,j_majiyagbe@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"Cover Letter\n\nI am a Chartered Accountant (ACA) and a Fellow of the Institute of Chartered Accountants of Nigeria (FCA) with over 40 years of experience, including 30 years in Charity and international development organizations. I hold a BSc in Economics from the University of Ife, an MBA in Strategic Management from Ogun State University, and I am currently pursuing a PhD in Management at Texila American University. My professional journey began with Deloitte Haskins and Sells, where I honed my skills in auditing, tax consulting, and financial advisory.\n\nThroughout my career, I have demonstrated strong leadership in the charity and international development sector, particularly with organizations such as The World Bank, Centre for Development and Population Activities (CEDPA), and Association for Reproductive and Family Health (ARFH). As Director of Finance and Administration, I successfully managed grants funded by prominent donors including USAID, The Global Fund, DFID, and the Bill & Melinda Gates Foundation. My expertise includes grant proposal design, budgeting, financial management, and ensuring compliance with donor regulations.\n\nIn addition to my financial management capabilities, I have extensive experience in strategic planning, human resources management, and procurement processes. My leadership has consistently supported effective grant implementation, ensuring transparency, accountability, and budget adherence.\n\nI retired from ARFH in March 2023 to focus on completing my PhD. With my thesis nearing completion, I am eager to apply my extensive experience and knowledge to a new role where I can continue to contribute to impactful projects. \n\nThank you for considering my application. I'm looking forward to contributing to your team.\n\nSincerely, \n 	\nJoseph Majiyagbe\n+234 – 8034060166\n",j_majiyagbe@yahoo.com,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726666278289_CV - Joseph B. MAJIYAGBE - July - 2024.doc,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-18T13:31:20.252Z,2024-09-18T13:31:20.252Z,,,,,,,,,
