66ead7c9434416cd1bd180cf,Abimbola Lawal,+23408034286100,lawal.abimbola52@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As an accomplished and seasoned professional, I was compelled to contact you with my interest in Finance Manager opportunities with your company. I bring an extensive background of experience in this field, along with qualifications which are required to make an indelible impact in this role.\n \nI offer a combination of unique skills and competencies which I have developed through a lengthy and rewarding career. I have honed financial reporting, financial management skills and coordinating skills while being proficient in communication, in my previous roles, I have contributed to organization in collaborative team efforts, and attainment of key business targets.\n \nAs my attached resume indicates I offer interpersonal, team building and budget analysis capabilities that are required for a Finance Manager role. I am eager to discuss possibilities of joining your team. Please feel free to contact me for additional career details and qualifications. I look forward to hearing from you at your early convenience. Thank you for your time and consideration of my candidacy\n\n",www.linkedin.com/in/abimbola-lawal-aca-358836b3,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726666694474_Abimbola Idris _ SFM.pdf,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-18T13:38:17.189Z,2024-09-18T13:38:17.189Z,,,,,,,,,
66ead9f5434416cd1bd180f3,Sadiq Omolewa Olasunkanmi,+2348029540975,lewafaniyi@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"My name is Sadiq Omolewa. I am a chartered accountant with more than 14 years of experience in Finance and accounting roles and a proven track record of driving financial performance, \n\nIn my previous role, I successfully led a team in Audit and Finance to manage all aspects of the company's financial operations. My key accomplishments include:\n\n ·         Strengthening financial controls and ensuring accuracy and compliance with accounting standards (IFRS).\n\n·         Developing and implementing strategic financial plans that supported company growth and profitability.\n\n·         Leading the budgeting and forecasting process, ensuring alignment with business objectives.\n\n·         Providing insightful financial analysis to support informed decision-making by senior management.\n\n·         Optimizing financial processes to improve efficiency and cost savings.\n\n I possess strong analytical and problem-solving skills, allowing me to identify and address financial challenges effectively. I am also a skilled communicator and leader, adept at motivating and mentoring my team to achieve peak performance. My experience in budgeting, forecasting, financial reporting, and risk management makes me well-equipped to navigate the complexities of this role.\n\n I have relevant certifications.\n\n I am a highly motivated and results-oriented individual with a passion for driving financial excellence. I am confident that my leadership skills, financial expertise, and proven track record make me a perfect fit for this position.\n\n",https://www.linkedin.com/in/omolewa-olasunkanmi-sadiq-msc-aca-b5b352134/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726667250956_Sadiq Omolewa Olasunkanm1 MSC (2).pdf,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-18T13:47:33.231Z,2024-09-18T13:47:33.231Z,,,,,,,,,
66eadbbb434416cd1bd18111,Olajide Taiwo,+2348068481560,remijidetai730@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As an ACA with over seven years of professional experience, I have built a robust career in various financial capacities, currently thriving as a Financial Analyst. My expertise spans financial reporting, analysis, and strategic planning, all of which have contributed to the growth and success of the organizations I have worked with. I am rounding off my M.Sc. in Accounting, further strengthening my knowledge and capabilities in the field.\n\nI approach my work with diligence and a passion for finance, always striving for excellence and precision in every task. My career has been driven by a commitment to continuous learning and delivering meaningful insights that enhance decision-making and drive financial success.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726667705005_OLAJIDE TAIWO OLUWAREMILEKUN lag.pdf,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-18T13:55:07.495Z,2024-09-18T13:55:07.495Z,,,,,,,,,
66eadbdf434416cd1bd18117,Adesina Funmilayo Deborah ,+2348063529849,adesinaimoleayo@gmail.com,Nigeria,"A highly motivated and result driven professional with over seven years of valuable hands-on\nexperience in numerous Financial reporting, audit, reconciliation, receivable and payable, budgeting, taxation, transfer pricing just to mention a few. Currently am exploring opportunities to contribute to\nbusiness development initiatives and increase profitability by helping Companies to build sustainable\nfinancial management practices.\n",https://www.linkedin.com/in/funmilayo-adesina-aca-52a162135?utm_source=share&utm_campaign=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=ios_app,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726667740520_Adesina Funmilayo Deborah Resume v24 2.pdf,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-18T13:55:43.706Z,2024-09-18T13:55:43.706Z,,,,,,,,,
66eae0cc434416cd1bd1814b,Ini Onyia ,+2348037828534,inicoffie@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a finance professional with over 6 years experience in financial planning and management, analyzing financial data and providing senior management necessary recommendations.\n\nA graduate of finance and banking with a masters degree in project management and certified as an associate chartered accountant from the institute of chartered accountants in Nigeria. In addition to this, I am a certified financial modeling and valuation analyst from the Corporate Finance Institute.\n\nIn my professional journey, I have gained valuable experience in setting up a finance and account department from scratch, designing SOPS and oversight of its implementations. Furthermore, I ensure strict compliance with set regulations and policies thereby reducing our risk of fraud, error or having tax assessment other than we are liable. \n\nHaving worked with a number of finance systems, I have great expertise in analyzing a business requirement and recommending the best financial system that is both cost effective and valuable in terms of its solution to business requirements.\n\nLeveraging on my financial analysis skills, I have proven success in developing strategic financial plan. For example at the end of 2023, I worked closely with the operations lead in developing 2024 financial plan with tools like forecasts and budgets for the year. This was presented to investors and approved alongside the financial goal for the year 2024.\n\nAs a professional accountant my organization has profited from my project management expertise that I have leaned to in ensuring operational success in different project delivery. As a great communicator, I collaborate easily with different teams in executing strategies to achieve goal.\n\nWith keen attention to details, I have saved my organization millions of naira that would have otherwise been spent double paying vendors invoices\n\nI am a committed professional that prides herself in solving problems. I uphold the greatest level of professionalism in my work and employ my ability to critically think in making decisions.\n\nI believe I am a great fit for this role as the role aligns closely with my professional experience, skills and training.\n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726669001298_Ini Onyia CV.-9.pdf,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-18T14:16:44.147Z,2024-09-18T14:16:44.147Z,,,,,,,,,
66eae152434416cd1bd18154,Chukwuemeka Kingsley Uche,+2348160530610,uchekingsley5@gmail.com,Nigeria,"This role perfectly aligns with my career aspirations, presenting an exceptional opportunity to leverage my over 8-year tenure within the finance sector, cutting across diverse industries such as FMCG, Financial Services, Banking, Financial Technology (FinTech), Renewable Energy, and Hospitality.\nThroughout my career, I have demonstrated proficiency in developing robust financial processes and implementing end-to-end financial systems for various organizations. I have spearheaded the establishment of finance and treasury departments, instituted essential controls for cash handling units, and crafted standardized reporting templates and reports, ensuring compliance with International Financial Reporting Standards (IFRS). \nOne of my notable achievements includes automating reporting processes using advanced Excel functions, effectively mitigating the risk of human error and optimizing time management by reducing man-hours spent on report generation. The insights gained from these reports have empowered management teams to make informed decisions, driving strategic initiatives and fostering organizational growth.\nFurthermore, I have provided invaluable guidance to management across a spectrum of areas, including investment strategies, staff recruitment, budgetary analysis, treasury management, and facilitating successful new product launches and mergers and acquisitions. This advisory role has been instrumental in shaping strategic direction and driving both short-term successes and long-term sustainable growth.\nMy proven track record of delivering tangible value and a relentless commitment to continuous improvement is attributed to my ability to adapt to evolving work environments, commitment for learning new technologies, and collaborative approach to teamwork. I am eager to bring my wealth of experience and technical expertise to this role, further enhancing its value proposition. I am enthusiastic about the opportunity to develop and grow within your esteemed organization.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/chukwuemeka-uche-7074b7127/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726669136027_CHUKWUEMEKA UCHE _ CV.pdf,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-18T14:18:58.828Z,2024-09-18T14:18:58.828Z,,,,,,,,,
