66eaee25434416cd1bd1825d,Ihuoma Prisca Nnaka,+2348131188799,i_nnaka@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"I am a partially qualified Accountant with over 9 years accounting experience. Currently at the skills level of ICAN qualification and I am hoping to qualify by next year. Regardless, I believe I will be instrumental in helping to shape the course of your organizational financial operations to greater levels because of the numerous skills and experience I will bring to the table. My knowledge base is proficient and I am able to efficiently apply them in solving finance challenges head-on.\n\nIn 9 years of my experience as an accountant, I have worked majorly with start-ups and have been instrumental in helping my previous organization in setting-up a functional accounting systems and resolving tax compliance issues, policy compliance issues and improving the internal control system.\n \nMy dedication and the ability to be proactive in adhering to standards, putting measures and policies in place to ensure standards are followed in inline with accounting and legislative standards, have proven in many occasions that I am result driven and deadline oriented, risk evasive. My tenacity and ability to face on any issues around my job and resolve them within deadline had been well appreciated and commended by my previous employers. \n\nI look forward to an opportunity to discuss further on how my numerous skills and experience will be harnessed to contribute to the growth of Tobam Group.\n\n\nKind regards,\nIhuoma Prisca Nnaka.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/ihuoma-nnaka-22285a4b/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726672418598_Ihuoma Nnaka_CV 19-08-2024.pdf,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-18T15:13:41.905Z,2024-09-18T15:13:41.905Z,,,,,,,,,
66eaeef0434416cd1bd18263,Owolabi Gbenga Seun,+2348066876449,owogbenga@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My Name is Owolabi Gbenga Seun ( ACA ). I am a graduate of Finance and Banking from The Federal Polytechnic, Ado Ekiti and  Bachelor of Science Degree in Business Administration and Management from The University of Abuja. I am an Associate Chartered Accountant of the Institute of Chartered Accountants of Nigeria.\n \n\nI am a Professional  Accountant, Finance officer, Tax Manager, Auditor with more than 10 years of experience covering the Financial Advisory, Manufacturing, Banking, Renewable energy sector of the economy, FMCG, but to mention a few.\n\n\n\nI am experienced in IFRSs,IASs,GAAP and other accounting standards as well as tax related matters. I also handle payroll and other staff related matters as they arise professionally.\n\n\n\nI also handle NSITF,ITF,PENCOM and other regulatory issues that have/may arise in different capacities  so far in the course of my professional life.\n\n \n\nI currently work in PAS Solar Nigeria Limited as the Finance & Account Manager.\n\n \n\nI am applying for the post to take my career to the next level and to gain a wider enhanced experience in a larger firm with opportunities for professional training and development that working with your firm would bring. In addition to my skills and experience as an audit staff as well professional qualification, I would bring to the post a proven ability to deal successfully and tactfully with clients and other stakeholders of the firm.\n\n \n\nI am available for an interview anytime and I look forward to hearing from you.\n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726672621632_Gbenga Owolabi Seun CV.pdf,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-18T15:17:04.224Z,2024-09-18T15:17:04.224Z,,,,,,,,,
