66eb3ca7434416cd1bd184fe,Ndubuisi Umunna,+23408063310339,nduumu@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"I have extensive experience in financial management, investment, accounting, and budgeting, as well as my strong leadership skills.\n\nAs a financial controller with over 15 years of experience in managing finance operations , I have developed a deep understanding of financial management, procurement,  budgeting, analysis and accounting. I have also gained valuable experience in  close-out activities, coordinating financial transactions, and ensuring adherence to regulatory requirements.\n\nIn my current role, I have led the preparation and submission of annual work plan budgets, overseen the development of financial forecasts throughout the year, and managed weekly and monthly cash flow forecasts and appraised over 1billion dollars worth of CAPEX investment. I have also ensured the tracking of actual spending against the annual budget, and I am well-versed in reporting requirements, having prepared monthly financial reports and presentations to senior management teams.\n\nFurthermore, I am adept at ensuring financial compliance with regulatory requirements, managing audit and internal control operations, and maintaining complete and accurate accounting records for all  transactions. I have also managed banking operations, including setting up accounts, updating mandates/signatories, making payments, and reconciling accounts.\n\nAs a leader, I have mentored and managed finance teams, built the capacity of the finance teams and guided finance teams responsible for each implementation strategy in achieving budgetary targets. I possess strong analytical and problem-solving skills, an analytical mind with a strategic ability, and excellent written and verbal communication skills.\n\nI hold a Bachelor's and Masters degree in Accounting and possess an ACA accounting certification. I am also proficient in modern accounting software such as SAGE, QuickBooks, Peachtree, Oracle and possess excellent knowledge of Microsoft Office Suite, particularly Excel.\n\nI am excited about the opportunity to join your organization and contribute to the success of your organisation. \nRegards,",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726692516757_Ndubuisi_Umunna_CV_ Brit.pdf,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-18T20:48:39.286Z,2024-09-18T20:48:39.286Z,,,,,,,,,
