66eb7da4434416cd1bd1855d,TIMOTHY OKPARA ABI,+23407035543585,abitimothy4real@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is \nAbi Timothy Okpara,\nAs a highly skilled and experienced accountant,\nI possess a comprehensive range of skills and expertise that enable me to provide exceptional financial management and advisory services.\n\n\nProfessional Summary: Institution of Chartered Accountants of Nigeria ACCA in view  with 8+ years of experience in financial accounting, auditing, and taxation.\n\nProven track record of ensuring accuracy, compliance, and efficiency in financial operations.\n\nSkilled in financial analysis, budgeting, forecasting, and financial modeling.\n\n\nTechnical Skills.\n\nFinancial accounting and reporting (GAAP, IFRS).\n\nAuditing and assurance services (financial statement audits, internal controls)- Taxation (corporate, individual, payroll).\n\nFinancial planning and analysis (budgeting, forecasting).\n\nFinancial modeling and valuation.\n\nAccounting software (QuickBooks, Wave, ERP, SAP)\nMicrosoft Office (Excel, Word, PowerPoint).\n\n\nProfessional Experience.\n\nSenior Accountant at Centrelead Advisory Ltd Fertilizer Manufacturing Company (2019-Present).\n\nManage financial statement preparation and review for clients.\n\nConduct financial audits and ensure compliance with regulations.\n\nProvide tax planning and preparation services.\n\nDevelop and implement financial processes and controls.\n\nPrepared and reviewed financial statements.\n\nAssisted with financial audits and internal control evaluations.\n\nManaged accounts payable and accounts receivable.\n\nDeveloped financial reports and analyses.\n\nEducation.\nBachelor of Science Degree in Accountancy at Rivers State University of Science and Technology obtained in 2014.\n\nKey Strengths\n\nAttention to detail and accuracy.\n\nStrong analytical and problem-solving skills.\n\nExcellent communication and interpersonal skills.\n\nAbility to work under pressure and meet deadlines\n\nCareer Goals.\n\nContinue to provide exceptional accounting and advisory services.\n\nExpand expertise in financial planning and analysis.\n\nPursue leadership roles in accounting and finance.\n\nAs a seasoned accountant, I remain committed to staying up-to-date with industry developments and best practices, ensuring the highest quality services for clients and organizations.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1726709154751_ABI TIMOTHY CV NEW.pdf,66e3fe18acb6dc9af303e69f,Financial Manager,2024-09-19T01:25:56.864Z,2024-09-19T01:25:56.864Z,,,,,,,,,
