66f52edc434416cd1bd18eb7,Praise Owoyemi,+2349022207252,owoyemipraise2016@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello, I’m Praise and I like to believe that there is a lot of interconnectedness in life which is what adds the extra spice to it. There is really nothing that we do that is completely a stand alone and totally whole in and of itself. I’ll relate this to what I do in Social Media Management. After a few years working in this field, I’ve come to learn that growth is always the center. Either more followers, more engagement, more bookings or more reach in general which can translate to more customers, more eyes on the business and possibly a strong community rallying for your brand and what you represent.\nLet me come back to a bit about myself, i love to write and I love creating content which I do for my YouTube channel and oh, it’s been a fun ride. I have been learning and unlearning and I have been sharpening both my editing skills, content idea generation and Public speaking. This brings me back to the “interconnectedness” thing. This hobbies and interest outside of work help with my eye and attention to detail as a Social Media Manager as well. \nIn my spare time, I enjoy baking and trying new recipes. I’ve come to learn that I enjoy using my creative muscle and experimenting with new things, trends and ideas as much as I can. ",https://mainstack.me/praiseowoyemi,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727344345299_Praise Owoyemi Cv.pdf-1.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-26T09:52:28.246Z,2024-09-26T09:52:28.246Z,,,,,,,,,
