66f52f66434416cd1bd18ec1,Ejiro Edafiadjebre,+2347081290419,laurabenson001@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello, I'm Ejiro, a creative and a social media manager who helps grow a brands online presence and also create contents that resonates with a brands audience. I've been a social media manager for 4 years and I've been able to increase brand engagement with over 40% in the first quater of the year, I've created successful lead ad campaigns and managed communities. I'm smart, proactive and professional.\n\nLooking forward to hearing from you!",https://ejiro-the-marketing-babe.my.canva.site/smm-portfolio,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727344483251_Ejiro sm cv.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-26T09:54:46.511Z,2024-09-26T09:54:46.511Z,,,,,,,,,
66f53015434416cd1bd18ec6,Aremu Opeyemi Esther,+2348035556844,Aremuopeyemiesther55@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Opeyemi, a social media manager with over 3 years of experience. I love creating engaging content and connecting brands with their audiences.\n\nMy background includes developing strategies that boost online presence and tell unique brand stories. When I’m not working, I enjoy finding inspiration in everyday life and sharing it with others.\n\n I believe every brand has a story waiting to be told, and I’m here to help them share it in a way that resonates. Excited to turn the page with your team!",https://aremu-opeyemi-esther-portfolio.my.canva.site/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727344658694_Opeyemi Aremu CV.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-26T09:57:41.462Z,2024-09-26T09:57:41.462Z,,,,,,,,,
