66f5319a434416cd1bd18ed2,Erica Ogbebor,+2349068897245,ericaduware@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Erica Ogbebor, a digital marketer, skilled at social media management, social media platform optimization. \n\nI am familiar with social media tools and excellent at strategy formulation. Able to draw up social media strategies specific to your brand and analyze performance of strategies drawn up, adjusting them if need be. \nI am also excellent at content creation and graphics design. \n\nI have basic knowledge of social media platforms and I can run ad campaigns as well. \nI am an active listener, a pro-active person and I am empathetic. This will come in handy when its time to respond to messages or comments on the brand's behalf as I will do so in a respectful and professional manner. \n\nI can work remotely and with a team. I have done this in the past as team lead for a tech project. My team's task was to build a social tech product from scratch within a timeline of less than 3 weeks. \nMy team emerged the best! ",https://shorturl.at/XWYJr,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727345047960_Emailing Meet Erica Ogbebor -Digital Ad Resume .pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-26T10:04:10.521Z,2024-09-26T10:04:10.521Z,,,,,,,,,
66f533b8434416cd1bd18ee1,Okagbare oghenetega Isaiah ,+23408082939969,okagbareoghenetega01@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Okagbare Oghenetega Isaiah. I'm currently a Social Media Manager and Digital Content Creator at Uvest NG, a real estate company. I've always been passionate about social media and its power to connect with audiences and build brands.\n\nIn my current role, I've had success in boosting brand awareness and engagement. I increased our following by 60% and page engagement by 70% through strategic social media campaigns and engaging content creation. I also spearheaded the Uvest Tribe community development, leading to impressive growth and stronger brand connections.\n\nPrior to this, I held the position of Head of Marketing at Univelcity, a tech school. Here, I led the marketing team in developing strategies that increased lead generation by 30% and optimized CTAs for a 15% conversion rate.\n\nLooking at Tobams Group's social media presence, I'm particularly interested in [mention something specific about their brand or platform]. My passion for social media, combined with my experience in strategy, content creation, and campaign execution, makes me confident I can contribute significantly to your team.\n",https://www.canva.com/design/DAGEo0LC5tQ/ypFnsB7l-IroZdwigLakGg/edit,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727345589114_ Okagbare oghenetega pdf cv.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-26T10:13:12.722Z,2024-09-26T10:13:12.722Z,,,,,,,,,
