66f53850434416cd1bd18f24,Blessing Igbi ,+23409065631479,blessingigbi16@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Blessing Igbi, a creative and detail-oriented Social Media Manager and Digital Marketer with a proven track record in managing diverse social media accounts across industries such as real estate, telecommunications, digital marketing agencies, and corporate NGOs. My passion lies in crafting engaging, tailored content that not only builds brand presence but also drives meaningful engagement and growth.\n\nI’ve had the privilege of leading teams and managing projects, including content strategy, video editing, hashtag research, and running paid campaigns, which have resulted in increased followers, community engagement, and overall brand visibility. I excel at developing unique strategies that align with a brand’s vision, and I always aim to create authentic connections between brands and their audiences.\n\nWhat sets me apart is my ability to think critically and creatively, ensuring that every piece of content not only resonates with the target audience but also contributes to the long-term growth of the brand. I’m passionate about helping businesses achieve their full potential and always look for innovative ways to amplify a brand’s story.\n",https://blessingigbiportfolio.my.canva.site/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727346766261_CV.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-26T10:32:48.746Z,2024-09-26T10:32:48.746Z,,,,,,,,,
