66f53b7b434416cd1bd18f5b,Michelle Oluwaseyi FAYEUN,+23408144377985,michellefayeun@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Meta-Certified Digital Marketing Associate and Social Media Manager with close to 3 years of experience in Research, Content Marketing, and Marketing Strategy. I have an assemblage of soft and technical skills which has successfully helped me scale through my career.\n\nI also have leadership and volunteer experience gained through active participation in a corporate leadership organization, Junior Chamber International (JCI) where I served as President of the Collegiate organization (JCIN UNIBEN) and didn't fail to put my skills in building the organization’s visibility on social media. I am overly excited to start a practical use of the knowledge I have gained, both technical and soft, in a friendly workspace that would help build my career as I give it my time and deliver exceptional results in my workplace.\n\nI am passionate about learning, and value creativity. My love for personal development has led me to start my podcast and blog with the mission of growing in emotional intelligence. I value consistency and being an African has taught me to improvise and be a problem solver. I have come to accept challenges as a means of growth and this has helped me in my relationship with people. My long-term goal is to be an expert in my field, sharing the knowledge I have gained with the world through seminars and content creation.\n\nIn my previous roles, I have contributed collaboration and motivation to team efforts with a progressive mindset, and I believe that I will be a great addition to your organization, putting everything I have learned and every knowledge I have gained in my quest for advancement into your organization. I greatly appreciate this opportunity and look forward to hearing from you. Thank you for your time.",https://docs.google.com/document/d/1tUWnlx0CIR0Riy6bJd2y9aS734OD91T13-mDrVWdh04/edit?usp=drivesdk,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-no