66f53eaa434416cd1bd18f6a,Beatrice Richard,+2348132179898,beatriceugochirichard@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi! \nI'm Beatrice and a social media manager with 4 years of experience in both online and offline marketing. I specialize in creating engaging and impactful content for hospitality, real estate, and educational firms. Whether it's crafting campaigns that drive bookings for luxury stays, promoting real estate investment opportunities, or building educational communities, I love bringing brands to life. My approach is all about strategy, creativity, and understanding my audience. Plus, I'm super fun to work with – let's create something amazing together!",https://docs.google.com/file/d/1FzUs8DN1EHy1LxqBooVVo1VUf4irr9ZR/edit?usp=docslist_api&filetype=msword,"https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727348392117_RICHARD, Beatrice Ugochinyere Resume-3.pdf",66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-26T10:59:54.946Z,2024-09-26T10:59:54.946Z,,,,,,,,,
