66f54282434416cd1bd18f88,Temiloluwa Adegbuji,+2348165273283,temadefemi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Equipped With almost a Decade of experience and a strong passion for creating engaging, informative, and authentic content; I am confident that I would add significant value to your team and help drive the company’s success.\nIf you’ve seen my resume, you know that I am qualified for the position. I have understood the role and I am uniquely positioned to impress you as your newest employee. Look no further, I’m right here.\nI have worked with over 200 clients around the world helping them to manage and grow their business digitally. I have grown several businesses accounts by thousands of followers, created dedicated TikTok audiences, and ran Facebook ads with 200% ROI in the last year alone and I am excited to beat those stats with your company.\nIn my past and current roles; freelancing in Media; Content Creation, Digital marketing and management, Communications, With certification from several eMarketing Institutes and LinkedIn, I have been able to create digital content for several blogs, websites, and social media channels in different industries. I bring a unique perspective to each project I tackle, whether it is developing a multimedia campaign or writing in-depth articles on complex topics.\nI am excited about the opportunity to utilize my creativity and storytelling abilities to help bring your brand to life and connect with your audience in compelling ways. I am a detail-oriented team player and I never miss deadlines. Working with me is really straight forward and stress-free and I believe I can blend into any team.", https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1UJxcAqT4BFZlug-EYLH4ZAaqnlZwfBwP,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727349376382_Temiloluwa Digital cv pdf.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-26T11:16:18.859Z,2024-09-26T11:16:18.859Z,,,,,,,,,
