66f54437434416cd1bd18f99,Alaba Damilare Samuel,+23408039258972,ibdamy@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello,\n\nI am Damilare Alaba, a full-stack digital marketing and communications professional with over 6 years of cognate experience navigating the digital landscapes of diverse industries, I've become a chameleon of content, a maestro of engagement, and a virtuoso of viral marketing.\n\nI specialize in crafting strategies that drive engagement, boost brand visibility, and generate results. I’ve helped clients—from startups to established enterprises—build their online presence, grow their audiences, and achieve their marketing goals. \n\nI am very skilled in content creation with Capcut, ClipChamp, Animaker and Canva. In social media marketing, I excel at using Meta Ad Manager, LinkedIn Campaign Manager and Google Ad Manager to run several successful campaigns, driving engagement, lead generation and conversion that improve a brand's online presence. \n\nFinally, I am very organized and proficient in remote project management and social media management tools such as Slack, Trello, Jira, Wrike, Google Business Suite, Metricool, Hootsuite, and Sprout Social amongst others.",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bJorbXd3Izc5Rij8F8jC5X1gOdmuxaLV/view?usp=drive_link,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727349812925_Alaba_Damilare_Samuel_CV_ (Ibadan).pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-26T11:23:35.155Z,2024-09-26T11:23:35.155Z,,,,,,,,,
