66f545c3434416cd1bd18faa,Ogundana Oluwatobiloba Ayomide ,+2348072932712,Tobeyfiz51@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As a skilled graphic designer and social media manager, I bring a unique blend of artistic creativity and digital marketing expertise to the table. With a strong background in visual design, I create compelling graphics and branding materials that effectively communicate messages and engage audiences. My proficiency in Adobe Creative Suite and other design tools ensures high-quality deliverables tailored to client needs.\nIn my role as a social media manager, I develop and execute strategic social media campaigns that drive brand awareness and audience engagement. I leverage analytics and insights to optimize content and performance across various platforms, including Facebook, Instagram, and LinkedIn. My ability to integrate visually striking content with targeted social media strategies helps businesses grow their online presence and achieve their marketing goals.\nCombining design aesthetics with strategic social media management, I deliver cohesive and impactful digital experiences that resonate with audiences and enhance brand identity.",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1INv8HgQ3oQi5ReswIZmrLUPrUWGheLeU,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727350207730_resume .pdf.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-26T11:30:11.073Z,2024-09-26T11:30:11.073Z,,,,,,,,,
66f5466c434416cd1bd18faf,Daramola Ayoola,+23408137727898,daramolaayoola98@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nAs a passionate creative Social Media Digital Marketing Associate, UI/UX Product Designer and Sales Associate. I am excited to apply for Social Media Manager role. With over 3 years of experience, I bring a robust blend of skills and expertise in social media marketing, content creation, data-driven campaign management, and UI/UX product design in creating intuitive digital user experience. With a strong foundation in utilizing Meta's suite of tools and platforms, leveraging analytics to optimize campaigns, ensuring they are both cost-effective, impactful and creating intuitive digital product design. I am adept at creating and executing marketing strategies that drive engagement, enhance brand visibility, and achieve measurable business results across various social media platforms, including Facebook, Instagram, WhatsApp, X, LinkedIn and TikTok. \n\nIn my last role as a Social Media Manager at Awareness Lounge, I grew the brands awareness  on social media platforms. I helped create a comprehensive marketing campaign alongside copywriters, and SEO specialists. I designed marketing content with graphic design skills and managed social media channels, including Instagram, X, Facebook, TikTok, and LinkedIn and during my three-month, I helped increase 30% in sales. I developed great communication skills in collaborating with team members, and I have the necessary experience and proven success to help develop creative campaigns.\n\nI am dedicated to constantly improving my craft, and I have Meta Social Media Marketing Professional Certificate. I admire emphasis on a client-centric approach and strategic solutions—two things that I also highly value. In my previous work as the Digital Marketing Manager for Padimi, I worked with clients and colleagues to develop innovative marketing ideas.\n\nThank you for your time in considering me for the Social Media Manager role. I would love to talk to you more about my skills, as well as the ideas I have to help you continue to grow. I have attached my resume, and you are welcome to contact me by phone or email.\n\nSincerely,\nDaramola Ayoola",https://www.credly.com/users/daramola-ayoola,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727350378773_Resume-Daramola-Ayoola New (1).pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-26T11:33:00.922Z,2024-09-26T11:33:00.922Z,,,,,,,,,
