66f57378434416cd1bd19083,Chuks Amadi,+2348137107685,chukzykelvieamadi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am thrilled to submit my application for the Digital Marketing position at your company. With over 6 years of experience in the digital marketing space, I am confident in my ability to contribute to the success of your company and help achieve its marketing goals.\n\nThroughout my career, I have gained extensive experience in creating and executing comprehensive digital marketing strategies that align with business objectives. My skills in search engine optimization, pay-per-click advertising, content marketing, social media marketing, email marketing, and website optimization will help your company achieve greater online visibility, generate leads, and increase sales.\n\nI have a proven track record of driving traffic, generating leads, and increasing conversions for my clients. I have experience working with clients across a wide range of industries, including healthcare, education, finance, and technology. I am highly skilled in analyzing data and using insights to optimize campaigns and improve performance.\n\nMy portfolio showcases a wide range of digital marketing projects that I have worked on in the past, including search engine optimization, social media campaigns, email marketing campaigns, and website redesigns. I am confident that my experience and expertise will enable me to contribute to your company's success and help you achieve your marketing goals.\n\nI am excited about the opportunity to join your team and help drive the success of your digital marketing initiatives. Thank you for considering my application. \n\nPlease find my attached resume and  portfolio link below for your perusal: https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/mobile/folders/1kny_VfiLFCIsnusqfPO0hNtpRWvIKKOZ?usp=sharing&sort=13&direction=a).\n\nLooking forward to your positive feedback on my application.\n\nWarm regards,\nChuks Amadi.",https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/mobile/folders/1kny_VfiLFCIsnusqfPO0hNtpRWvIKKOZ?usp=sharing&sort=13&direction=a,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727361910172_Chuks Amadi - Resume.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-26T14:45:12.810Z,2024-09-26T14:45:12.810Z,,,,,,,,,
