66f57b5a434416cd1bd190ae,Joy Samson,+23408155803878,ifesinachijoy34@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nI bring over 2 years of experience in developing and executing innovative online strategies that drive engagement, boost brand awareness, and foster meaningful connections with diverse audiences.\n\n\nProfessionally, I've developed strong skills in:\n\n\n- Social media strategy and planning\n- Content creation (visual and written)\n- Campaign management (paid and organic)\n- Community engagement and moderation\n- Analytics and reporting (Facebook Insights, Twitter Analytics)\n- Influencer partnerships and collaborations\n\n\nSome of my notable achievements include:\n\n\n- Growing followers by 10% on Instagram within 3 months\n- Increasing engagement rates by 25% through targeted campaigns\n- Creating engaging content that reached 10,000+ impressions\n\n\nI hold certifications in:\n\n\n- Social Media Management, Hubspot Academy\n- Facebook Meta Business Blueprint\n- Twitter Video Ads Specialist badge\n- Advanced Email Marketing, Simplilearn\n- Digital Marketing Tools, Simplilearn\n\n\nOn a personal level, I'm passionate about staying up-to-date with the latest social media trends and best practices. I'm excited to leverage my skills and expertise to elevate your brand's online presence.\n\n\nAs a Social Media Manager, my strengths include:\n\n\n- Content creation and curation\n- Community building and engagement\n- Campaign analysis and optimization\n- Social media advertising (Facebook, Instagram, Twitter)\n- Collaboration with influencers and content creators.\n\n\nI'm looking forward to discussing how my experience and skills align with your social media goals and objectives.\n\n\n\n\n",https://aboutjoysamson.my.canva.site/brown-and-white-minimal-professional-portfolio-presentation,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727363928335_atsdgtlmktncv (1).pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-26T15:18:50.695Z,2024-09-26T15