66f586ea434416cd1bd190f5,Edidiong Sunday Udoh,+23408084083576,edidiong.udoh@yahoo.com,Niue,"I am a creative social media manager with 3+ years of experience in B2C Social Media Marketing and a trained Linkedin Expert.\n\nI help companies and personal brands to build, grow and solidify their social media presence with the overall aim of achieving their social media marketing goals.\n\nI also help working-class professionals in optimizing their LinkedIn profiles to showcase their professional experience and expertise.\n\nI organize specialized LinkedIn Optimization training for the following categories:\n\n◼ Students and Undergraduates\n\n◼ Graduates and Job Seekers.\n\n◼Entrepreneurs and Start-ups\n\n◼Linkedin Marketing for Corporate Organization.\n\n◼ Professional Linkedin training for Corporate Staff.\n\nI utilize the following strategies;\n\n🔹Content Marketing (blogging, article writing, SEO )\n\n🔹Paid Advertising (Facebook, Instagram, Google, and Linkedin)\n\n🔹WhatsApp Marketing\n\n🔹Copywriting and Sales Funnel \n\n🔹Content Creations (graphics design, Video editing, Memes, etc)\n\n🔹Linkedin Optimization and Page Management \n",https://docs.google.com/document/d/1O-TeJTU3glV7Az6D9qXUXn5h9mTexEok/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=106370941086278228414&rtpof=true&sd=true,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727366888718_EDIDIONG SUNDAY UDOH CV.Social Media Manager.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-26T16:08:10.913Z,2024-09-26T16:08:10.913Z,,,,,,,,,
