66f58aea434416cd1bd19112,Janet Adeola Bashorun,+2348162589153,adeolajanet579@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a seasoned professional with over 4 years of experience in digital marketing, specializing in social media management and marketing. My career journey has been enriched by working across diverse sectors such as real estate, facility management, cybersecurity, beauty, and fashion, where I have honed my skills and expertise in crafting impactful digital strategies.\n\nIn my previous roles, I have successfully led social media campaigns that have driven engagement, increased brand visibility, and fostered meaningful connections with target audiences. Through a combination of creative content creation, data-driven insights, and strategic planning, I have achieved measurable results in enhancing brand presence across various social media platforms.\n\nMy proficiency in graphics design and video editing has been instrumental in creating visually compelling content that resonates with audiences and reinforces brand identity. I am adept at leveraging analytical tools to track performance metrics, optimize campaigns, and adapt strategies for continuous improvement.\n\nLooking ahead, I am excited about the opportunity to bring my strategic vision, creativity, and expertise in social media marketing to the role of a Social Media Marketing Manager. I am eager to contribute my skills towards developing engaging content, building brand loyalty, and fostering a strong online community that reflects the values and aspirations of Tobams Group.",http://surl.li/renuaq,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727367912302_Resume for SMM JANET ADEOLA BASHORUN.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-26T16:25:14.932Z,2024-09-26T16:25:14.932Z,,,,,,,,,
66f59270434416cd1bd1912c,Hephzibah Igbinosa ,+2349130104637,hephzibahsazy@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Hephzibah Igbinosa, and I am a Social Media Manager, Graphics Designer, and Content Creator with a background in Microbiology from the University of Port Harcourt. I am highly dedicated and motivated, with excellent problem-solving and communication skills.\n\nI have extensive experience in managing social media accounts, content development, and running successful social media campaigns. I am proficient in using tools like Google Workspace, Microsoft Office (Excel, PowerPoint, Outlook, Word), as well as industry-specific platforms such as Hootsuite, Buffer, Airtable, and Google Trends. My core skills include content creation, task prioritization, time management, and customer communication.\n\nIn my previous role as a Social Media/Stakeholder Experience professional, I was responsible for content development, writing, managing stakeholders, and marketing. This experience has honed my ability to craft engaging content, implement social media strategies, and foster strong relationships with followers and clients. Additionally, I am skilled in social media analytics, which allows me to optimize campaigns and ensure they align with the organization’s goals.\n",https://lnk.bio/HephzibahIgbinosa,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727369837578_HEPHZIBAH IGBINOSAâS CV.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-26T16:57:20.147Z,2024-09-26T16:57:20.147Z,,,,,,,,,
