66f5abe7434416cd1bd19182,Josline Chepkemoi,+254750826672,joslinechepkirui@gmail.com,Kenya,"\n\nI am writing to express my interest in the Social Media Manager and Marketer position at Tobams group, as advertised. With a solid foundation in digital marketing and a proven track record of successfully managing social media campaigns, I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to your team. My experience as a Digital Marketing & Design Specialist at Tech Care for All Africa, coupled with my recent volunteer role at Angel Maa Organization, has equipped me with the necessary skills to enhance brand awareness and drive engagement through effective social media strategies.\n\nIn my previous positions, I have demonstrated my ability to develop and implement data-driven social media marketing strategies that resonate with target audiences. Notably, I achieved a remarkable 287% increase in LinkedIn followers and a 14% engagement rate within a year at Friendly Marketer. My proficiency in creating engaging content, monitoring social media trends, and utilizing analytics tools ensures that I can continually optimize campaigns for maximum impact. Additionally, my strong communication skills and collaborative spirit allow me to work effectively with marketing and creative teams to deliver compelling content that aligns with brand values.\n\nI am passionate about staying up-to-date with the latest trends and technologies in social media marketing, and I am eager to bring my expertise to your company's name. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how my background, skills, and enthusiasm can contribute to the success of your social media initiatives. Thank you for considering my application.  \n\nSincerely,  \nJosline Chepkemoi  ",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727376356729_Josline Chepkemoi_Resume.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-26T18:45:59.630Z,2024-09-26T18:45:59.630Z,,,,,,,,,
