66facb3d83dff6a484f45849,Esther Tosin Natufe,+2347031895012,esthernatufe@outlook.com,Nigeria,"I am Esther Tosin Natufe, a skilled social media manager with extensive experience in managing digital campaigns, content creation, and brand development. I hold a distinction in Computer Engineering and currently serve as an IT support staff while running my own children’s thrift store and volunteering with an NGO, CYNBI. I excel in creating engaging content, driving brand visibility, and using social media analytics to improve strategies. Passionate about leveraging digital tools to grow brands, I stay updated with the latest trends in social media marketing.",https://shorturl.at/81HM0,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727712058942_Esther Tosin Natufe resume September 2024.pdf.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-09-30T16:01:01.292Z,2024-09-30T16:01:01.292Z,,,,,,,,,
66fbc8bfb870f7844d260494,Oladehinde Olamilekan Lateef,+2348104581050,legendlekzy@gmail.com,Nigeria,"With over 5 years of experience in the digital marketing and growth marketing industry, I am confident in my ability to make a valuable contribution to your team.\nThroughout my career, I have gained a thorough understanding of all aspects of digital marketing, including SEO, PPC, social media, email marketing, and analytics. My expertise in creating and executing comprehensive digital marketing strategies has helped drive significant growth for my previous clients and employers. I am a results-driven individual who is passionate about using data to drive decisions and measure the impact of marketing campaigns.",https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/mobile/my-drive,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727776956239_Ola cv 2.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T10:02:39.545Z,2024-10-01T10:02:39.545Z,,,,,,,,,
