66fbca26b870f7844d2604b4,Ozoigbo Chibunwa,+2348081541450,theophyll95@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hey there!\n\nI'm Chibunwa Ozoigbo, a social media and digital marketing specialist with over six years of experience, and I’ve got a bit of a knack for making brands come alive online. It’s funny to think that my journey started in a simple way—just trying to help small businesses in my community get the word out. Fast forward to today, and I've had the privilege of working with brands across different industries, from restaurants to retail, helping them build their digital footprint.\n\nI love a good story, and I think every brand has one. I've spent my career telling those stories in a way that resonates, drives engagement, and turns casual viewers into dedicated followers. Take the time I worked with BGLH-Leryhago, for example—one campaign led to a 64% growth in followers, a 9,032% increase in website clicks, and over N41M in revenue. Or when I helped a client see a reach increase of 5500% in just one week. There’s something so rewarding about creating content that really connects.\n\nI’ve also had my hands in pretty much every pot of digital marketing, from social media strategy and SEO to email campaigns and content calendars. I think the secret is in the details—understanding what the audience wants, and how to deliver it in a way that feels authentic and impactful. Whether it’s through engaging captions, thoughtful visuals, or just knowing how to spark a good two-way conversation, I’m all in on creating moments that matter for people online.\n\nOh, and asides being a marketing content creator for Popmenu (Contracted by GO2), I also worked on the sales side of things at GO2, where I made over 100 calls a day—definitely not for the faint of heart, but it taught me a ton about how to engage people and really listen to their needs.\n\nAt the end of the day, I'm all about blending creativity, empathy, and strategy to create digital experiences that people actually want to be part of. That’s what keeps me excited about what I do every day.",https://socialbutterflyng.com/portfolio/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727777316575_CHIBUNWA OZOIGBO - Social Media Marketing Specialist CV.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T10:08:38.988Z,2024-10-01T10:08:38.988Z,,,,,,,,,
66fbca8db870f7844d2604bd,Daniel Ajayi ,+23407047576538,Ajayidanielolu@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am excited to apply for the Social Media Manager and Marketer position at Tobams Group. With my proven experience in digital marketing and social media management, I am confident in my ability to contribute to your team by driving engagement, increasing brand awareness, and implementing strategies that align with your brand goals.\n\nDuring my time at Teleperformance, Lagos, I worked as a Meta Marketing Pro, assisting over 1,200 small businesses in Sub-Saharan Africa. I helped them enhance their digital presence and optimize their social media campaigns across platforms such as Facebook, Instagram, and LinkedIn. Through tailored digital marketing strategies, I increased client engagement by 25% and contributed to a 30% boost in sales for SMBs. This experience has sharpened my ability to create, curate, and publish engaging content while analyzing campaign performance to make data-driven improvements.\n\nI am adept at using social media analytics and reporting tools to track key metrics, interpret data, and optimize campaigns for success. My passion for staying on top of emerging trends and technologies allows me to recommend and implement innovative solutions that elevate brand presence and keep the brand competitive.\n\nAdditionally, I have a strong commitment to ensuring customer satisfaction by responding promptly to inquiries and fostering positive engagement on social media platforms. My organizational skills, combined with my ability to collaborate across teams, allow me to deliver cohesive social media campaigns aligned with overall business objectives.\n\nI am enthusiastic about the opportunity to bring my expertise to Tobams Group and contribute to the success of your social media initiatives.\n\n I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experiences can benefit your team.\n\nWarm Regards! \n\nDaniel Ajayi. ",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727777419744_Daniel_ajayi CV.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T10:10:21.895Z,2024-10-01T10:10:21.895Z,,,,,,,,,
66fbcaa8b870f7844d2604c4,Jeffrey Ejezie,+2348083782793,jeffrey.ejezie1994@gmail.com,Nigeria,I bring to the table 6 years of sales and marketing experience from Media to Financial sales. I currently head the B2B and B2C sales at Lexar Business Support LTD as well as the social media campaigns.\n\nKindly give me the opportunity to add my quota to the growth of your organization.,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727777445940_Jeffrey_Ejezie_-_Data__Sales_Analyst.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T10:10:48.244Z,2024-10-01T10:10:48.244Z,,,,,,,,,
66fbcb09b870f7844d2604cb,Chia Jennifer Sedoo,+2348115111519,jennifersedoo@gmail.com,Nigeria," \n     With one month of hands-on experience in managing social media accounts, I have quickly developed a strong understanding of how to engage audiences and grow brand presence online. I am skilled in using key tools such as Hootsuite and Buffer for scheduling content efficiently and also using google calendar to create events and ensure that reminders are being sent 30 minutes to 1 hour before an event. I can also use Trello and Asana to create a to-do list to make sure that events are handled appropriately and according to how important they may be, also  a consistent posting rhythm. \n   I can use canva to design visually appealing posts that align with the brand's messaging, ensuring that each piece not only looks great but also captures the attention of followers. Additionally, I’ve learned how to interpret performance data using analytics features within these platforms, allowing me to adjust strategies based on insights like engagement rates and audience demographics. This ability to make necessary changes and optimize has helped me understand the value of adapting to what works in real-time.\n   Although my experience is fresh, I am passionate, driven, and eager to continue learning. I am confident that my understanding of social media tools, combined with my dedication to staying on top of industry trends, will allow me to make an immediate impact on your team. I look forward to the opportunity to grow with your company and help elevate its online presence even further. I look forward to hearing from you.\n",https://jennifer-sedoo-portfolio.my.canva.site/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727777542364_SOCIAL MEDIA MANAGER CV.docx,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T10:12:25.471Z,2024-10-01T10:12:25.471Z,,,,,,,,,
