66fbccffb870f7844d2604de,Maryann Afomachi Ugwuanyi ,+2347067382836,maryannugwuanyi2@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello,\nI'm Maryann Ugwuanyi, a social media professional with a passion for driving engagement and results, and always looking for room to grow and be the best. I'm excited to apply for the Social Media Manager role\nAs a highly motivated social media professional, I am confident that my skills and passion for social media make me an ideal candidate for this role. \nWith a passion for digital marketing and a proven track record of creating engaging content across various social media platforms, I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to your team. \nIn my current role, I have successfully developed and implemented social media strategies that have significantly increased brand awareness and engagement. \nI am confident that my skills in content creation, community management, and social media analytics make me a strong candidate for this position. \nI am eager to bring my creativity, strategic thinking, and dedication to achieving social media goals to your organization.\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team. \n",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rbtmoY2cP_ofBEadhjK-1phkQeDakVzT/view?usp=drivesdk,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727778043129_Maryann~A~U.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T10:20:47.160Z,2024-10-01T10:20:47.160Z,,,,,,,,,
