66fbce33b870f7844d2604f4,Treasure Abaa,+2348140189938,treasureabaa@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a passionate and results-driven social media manager with 3+ years of experience in creating and executing successful campaigns. I have a strong understanding of various social media platforms and a proven track record of driving engagement, increasing brand awareness, and generating leads. I'm skilled in content creation, community management, data analysis, and utilizing tools like CapCut, Canva and Meta business suite. My background in data analysis allows me to make data-driven decisions and optimize campaigns for maximum impact.\n\nMy passion for social media stems from my love for connecting with people and sharing compelling stories. I enjoy staying up-to-date with the latest trends and using data-driven insights to optimize my strategies. I'm excited to leverage my skills to help businesses achieve their goals and make a positive impact.\n",https://treasureabaa.my.canva.site/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727778353377_Tee VA 2024.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T10:25:55.681Z,2024-10-01T10:25:55.681Z,,,,,,,,,
66fbd217b870f7844d260509,Oguntade Paul Iyinoluwa ,+2347037353513,oguntade.paul@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"Oguntade Paul iyinoluwa \n\nTobams Group\n4, KOLA IBIROGBA STR, AGO 40 ABORU\nLagos State \n\nDear Sir/Ma\n\nI'm thrilled to apply for the Social Media Manager position at Tobams Group .With 5years of experience in crafting compelling online stories, driving engagement, and growing brand presence, I'm confident in my ability to elevate your social media strategy.\n\nAs a seasoned social media professional, I've developed and implemented successful online campaigns for palux impressions\nMy expertise includes:\n\n•⁠  ⁠Social media strategy and planning\n•⁠  ⁠Content creation (written, visual, video)\n•⁠  ⁠Community management and engagement\n•⁠  ⁠Paid social media advertising (Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn)\n•⁠  ⁠Analytics \n\n•⁠  ⁠Managed social media presence across Platforms\n•⁠  ⁠Increased followers by 60% and engagement by 60%\n•⁠  ⁠Collaborated with cross-functional teams to launch Successful Campaigns\n\nI'm drawn to Tobams Group because of its I will love to contribute and I'm excited to leverage my skills to contribute to the company's mission and vision.\n\nCertifications/Skills:\n\n•⁠  ⁠Hootsuite Social Media Marketing Certification\n•⁠  ⁠Facebook Blueprint Certification\n•⁠  ⁠Proficient in [Software/Tools], e.g., Adobe Creative Cloud, Sprout Social\n\nThank you for considering my application. I'd love to discuss how my expertise can benefit [Company Name]. Please find my resume attached.\n\nBest regards,\nOguntade Paul iyinoluwa \nOguntade.paul@yahoo.com\n",https://www.linkedin.com/in/paul-oguntade-18291a31b?trk=contact-info,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727779348963_Paul Oguntade - CV.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T10:42:31.757Z,2024-10-01T10:42:31.757Z,,,,,,,,,
