66fbd48bb870f7844d260530,Maryam Tajudeen,+2348091159471,tajudeendemi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am writing to express my interest in Digital Marketing Manager position at your company. With three years of experience in social media management , product management and a strong background in graphics and video editing, I believe I would be an asset to your team.\n\nIn my current role as a Digital Marketing ExecutiveI have successfully developed and executed social media strategies that increased engagement and drove traffic to our website. I have also managed multiple social media accounts across various platforms, including Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, and LinkedIn. Through my experience, I have developed a keen understanding of user research , market strategies,social media analytics and how to use data to optimize campaigns.\n\nI am confident that my experience and skills make me a strong candidate for this position. I am excited about the opportunity to bring my expertise to your company and contribute to its continued success.\n\nKindly find my CV below for more information on my skills and experience.Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss my qualifications further.\n\nSincerely,\n\nMaryam Tajudeen",https://maryamtajudeen.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727779977517_Maryam Tajudeen Digital Marketing Resume (CV).pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T10:52:59.911Z,2024-10-01T10:52:59.911Z,,,,,,,,,
