66fbe373b870f7844d2605aa,Obinna Kelechi Eni,+23409049668713,benjienibee@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI'm thrilled to apply for the Social Media Manager role at Tobams Group, where I can leverage my expertise to elevate your brand's online presence. With 5 years of experience in social media marketing, I excel in creating engaging campaigns, growing brand awareness, and driving meaningful interactions.\n\nKey Strengths:\n\n- Proven track record of successful social media campaigns across various platforms (Facebook, Instagram, Twitter, LinkedIn)\n- Expertise in content creation, curation, and calendar management\n- Skilled in social media advertising (paid social), analytics, and performance optimization\n- SEO expertise: keyword research, on-page optimization, and content optimization\n- Self-motivated and disciplined, with excellent remote work experience (requiring minimal supervision)\n- Collaborative mindset, with experience working closely with marketing and creative teams\n\nProfessional Summary:\n\nAs a seasoned social media professional and SEO expert, I offer:\n\n- Strategic social media planning and execution\n- Content creation (graphic design, writing, video editing)\n- Community management and engagement\n- Campaign analysis and reporting\n- Team collaboration and support\n\nCertifications/Tools:\n\n- [Relevant certifications in Google Analytics]\n- Familiarity with graphic design software (Canva, Adobe Creative Cloud)\n\nWhy Tobams Group?\n\nI'm drawn to Tobams Group's innovative approach and commitment to excellence. I'm excited to contribute my skills to elevate your brand's online presence and engage your audience.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to discussing how my expertise aligns with your vision.\n\nBest regards,\nEni Kelechi Obinna ",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1defK48nrCZmw0utHyYDdD0dNZds2T0gw/view?usp=drive_link,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727783792895_Eni Obinna Kelechi_CV (ORIGINAL) (2).pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T11:56:35.759Z,2024-10-01T11:56:35.759Z,,,,,,,,,
