66fc004eb870f7844d260614,Isaac Onanuga,+2349095196931,onasisaac@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a dedicated and innovative Social Media Manager with 5 years of experience creating and executing digital campaigns that amplify brand presence and engage communities. Throughout my career, I’ve spearheaded strategies across platforms like Instagram, Twitter, Facebook, and TikTok, achieving follower growth of over 150% and increasing overall engagement rates by 75% within the past year.\n\nMy approach combines creative content creation with data-driven insights, ensuring each campaign is tailored to audience preferences and delivers measurable results. I’ve managed social media budgets and successfully boosted return on ad spend (ROAS) by 30% through targeted paid campaigns. Additionally, I have developed influencer partnerships that drove a 25% increase in organic reach and contributed to revenue growth.\n\nI enjoy collaborating across teams to align social strategies with broader marketing objectives. I am excited to bring my expertise to Tobams Group and contribute to building a strong and engaged online community.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/isaac-onanuga/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727791179665_Isaac Onanuga Marketing Manager.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T13:59:42.471Z,2024-10-01T13:59:42.471Z,,,,,,,,,
