66fc07a8b870f7844d26064a,Orji Amarachi Esther ,+2348168995594,oamarachi290@gmail.con,Nigeria,"My name is Orji Amarachi Esther. I studied Mass Communication at Ogun State Institute of Technology and Moshood Abiola Polytechnic, graduating with an Upper Credit. I have over 10 years of experience in different roles like Sales Representative, Office Manager, Personal Assistant, Executive Assistant, Administrative Officer, Digital Marketer, Presenter, Proofreader, and Admission Manager.\n\nFor the past 3 years, I’ve focused on social media management, branding, and graphic design. I manage social media accounts by creating engaging content, running campaigns, and growing online communities. I also use analytics to track success and adjust strategies. My experience in branding and design helps me create content that aligns with the brand’s identity, making sure it stands out online.",https://www.instagram.com/officialitrendymedia?igsh=cTRteG9lemNuczZs&utm_source=qr,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727793061215_Share Orji Amarachi Esther 2023 CV 02.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T14:31:04.638Z,2024-10-01T14:31:04.638Z,,,,,,,,,
