66fc0e3fb870f7844d260661,David Kolo,+2348108789380,kolodavid4@gmail.com,Nigeria,"A Creative Sparkplug: Fueling Brands with Passion, Dedication, and Measurable Results.\n\nI am a dynamic and results-driven digital marketing enthusiast with a flair for storytelling and a passion for driving impact. For me, success isn't just about the numbers; it's about making real connections with people and elevating the brands I work with.\n\nWhether I'm crafting social media campaigns that captivate audiences, creating eye-catching designs, or orchestrating finely-tuned digital strategies, I infuse every project with a unique blend of hard work, ingenuity, and sheer love for what I do.\n",   Portfolio link : http://surl.li/sglsu   LinkedIn:  https://www.linkedin.com/in/david-kolo-46b29127b  Portfolio link (video): http://surl.li/sxlvq    Managed pages   From Feb 2022 to May 2023 https://www.instagram.com/sealteampaintball_ng?igsh=Ympob3o1aGloN2hl  https://www.instagram.com/ambrosiacocktails?igsh=b3B2M2JsengzaThm  From Sep 2023 to May 24 https://www.instagram.com/wealthlands_green_estate?igsh=MTF0Z2UxaTUyY2prNg==  From May 24 till date  https://www.instagram.com/_coolrealestate?igsh=MTM1MDlxbDBiajhheQ==   https://www.instagram.com/coolfinancials?igsh=aXM3enU0N3M4ajhw  https://www.instagram.com/bathshua_bdc?igsh=Z3oxNG5lOXNob21w ,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727794749078_Cv(David Kolo).pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T14:59:11.563Z,2024-10-01T14:59:11.563Z,,,,,,,,,
66fc1338b870f7844d26066a,Olajide Mariam Oluwatobiloba,+2348160472565,olajidemariam791@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am confident in accepting challenges, resourceful, knowledgeable, pro-active, energetic and disciplined individual, seeking to utilize and develop my skills and experience to contribute in your organization’s growth. I am committed and enthusiastic in solving complex problems with creative thinking. I am also passionate and enjoy Social Media management with a big interest in graphic designing  which help in the creation of high quality social media designs Contents.\n\nResult oriented Social media Manager with the ability to drive brand awareness and revenue growth using proven digital marketing strategies, tactics and tools to target your precise customer target to drive quality traffic to your business.\n\nAlso, I am focused on mastering latest updates on all social media platforms and across all the digital space for personal development and growth of your organization.",https://www.canva.com/design/DAGQeZWXFHQ/HM0AQ82o6Y-dq1En4IhH4g/edit?utm_content=DAGQeZWXFHQ&utm_campaign=designshare&utm_medium=link2&utm_source=sharebutton,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727796022124_OLAJIDE MARIAM RESUME (2).pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T15:20:24.631Z,2024-10-01T15:20:24.631Z,,,,,,,,,
66fc138eb870f7844d26066f,Emmanuel jacob,+23408063437325,jackiemm503@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a versatile digital marketer who thrives on wearing many hats. With experience spanning social media strategy, content creation, and campaign management, I have honed my skills in amplifying online presence, particularly for small businesses. \n\nMy approach combines creativity with data-driven decision-making to craft campaigns that truly engage audiences. My toolkit includes Google Analytics and various social media platforms, enabling me to track performance and optimize strategies effectively and I'm always open to learning and improving in the area that I'm lacking. \n\nWith over five years of experience in the digital space, I have encountered many failures, and one key lesson I’ve learned is the value of the insights gained from those experiences. This understanding has helped me become one of the best digital marketers in the field. However, talent means little without the opportunity to showcase it, which is why I am so excited about the chance to apply to Tobams Group for the role of Social Media Marketing Manager. I sincerely hope to be considered for the position. Thank you.",https://bit.ly/3MSEgnG,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727796108021_my CV.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T15:21:50.595Z,2024-10-01T15:21:50.595Z,,,,,,,,,
