66fc1b88b870f7844d26068c,Hephzibah Igbinosa,+2349130104637,hephzibahsazy@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m someone who thrives on creativity and connection. I’ve always enjoyed bringing ideas to life and finding unique ways to tell stories that resonate with people. This passion led me to a career in social media management, where I get to blend creativity, strategy, and engagement every day.\n\nIn my professional journey, I’ve developed a strong ownership mindset—I treat every project as if it’s my own, ensuring that it not only meets expectations but exceeds them. My communication skills help me create meaningful connections with audiences and collaborate effectively with team members and stakeholders.\n\nWhen it comes to work, I’m known for my organizational skills, allowing me to manage multiple campaigns, stay on top of trends, and deliver results even in fast-paced environments. My top-notch creativity shines through in the content I create, whether it’s designing graphics, writing compelling copy, or crafting engaging videos that capture attention.\n\nThese strengths, combined with my proficiency in social media management tools like Hootsuite, Buffer, and design platforms such as Canva and CapCut, empower me to create strategies that drive engagement and grow brands.",https://lnk.bio/HephzibahIgbinosa,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727798149229_HEPHZIBAH IGBINOSAâS CV.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T15:55:52.105Z,2024-10-01T15:55:52.105Z,,,,,,,,,
66fc1ba6b870f7844d260692,KUTI Felix,+23409024134803,merks4053@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Kuti Felix, I am a social media manager.\nI am creative minded and very proactive, also always ready to learn and improve to achieve set out goals.  I love helping individuals and company(s) to manage their social media accounts, i find this skill very useful because it makes one very creative, proactive, full of insights etc.\nI am also a lover of sporting activities, love adventure, travelling and other fun activities. I also like communicating with people who are creative minded like I am either foreign or local individuals.",www.linkedin.com/in/kuti-felix-8aa637291,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727798180567_OLUSEGUN CV.docx,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T15:56:22.310Z,2024-10-01T15:56:22.310Z,,,,,,,,,
66fc2a69b870f7844d2606a9,Sylvia Okoye ,+2348149936103,sylviaokoye20@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a dedicated and experienced social media manager with over three years of hands-on experience managing platforms like Facebook, Instagram, Twitter, TikTok, and LinkedIn. My expertise spans content creation, strategic planning, community management, and driving engagement through effective DM management and sponsored ads. In my previous roles, I have successfully increased social media presence and engagement by over 60% through impactful strategies and attention-grabbing content.\n\nFor instance, while working with Star Planet Logistics, I boosted their online presence by 50% and significantly increased their ROI by over 60%. Similarly, with a travel agency, my strategic initiatives led to a 30% increase in both social media engagement and sales.\n\nMy ability to analyze social media trends, develop compelling content, and collaborate with marketing and creative teams aligns with your company’s need for someone who can help grow your brand, enhance engagement, and drive meaningful results. I am passionate about leveraging data-driven insights and creativity to shape social media campaigns that align with business goals and have a proven track record of success in delivering high-impact strategies.\n",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1GnsTg2VWj8TvrBfmjRNfcJymja61MA2d/view?usp=drivesdk,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727801959271_Okoye Sylvia_CV.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T16:59:21.601Z,2024-10-01T16:59:21.601Z,,,,,,,,,
66fc2a73b870f7844d2606ae,Nora Elegha,+2348151570057,contactnoraelegha@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an experienced Social Media Manager with over 2 years of expertise in developing and executing innovative social media strategies. With a proven track record of boosting brand awareness, engagement, and follower growth across platforms like Instagram, Twitter, and LinkedIn, I excels at creating compelling content, managing online communities, and utilizing SEO to enhance visibility. My passion for staying updated on industry trends helps me consistently delivers data-driven results, helping businesses elevate their online presence and achieve key marketing goals. I am also adept at working with cross-functional teams to ensure cohesive brand messaging.",https://noraelegha.my.canva.site/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727801968869_Elegha Nora(Resume).pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T16:59:31.613Z,2024-10-01T16:59:31.613Z,,,,,,,,,
66fc2c3db870f7844d2606b4,Jeffrey Ndekolo ,+2348118878326,Jeffdalegitkiing@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Thank you for the opportunity. My name is Jeffrey Ndekolo, and I have over 3 years of experience as a Social Media Manager. I’m fluent in both French and English, which helps me work well with different clients and audiences.\n\nI have skills in content creation (graphic design, video editing, and animation), SEO, social media strategies, and website management. I’ve managed campaigns on Facebook, Instagram, Twitter, LinkedIn, and TikTok to boost brand engagement.\n\nI’m passionate about helping brands grow and building strong customer relationships, and I’m confident my skills can add value to your team.\n\n",https://docs.google.com/document/d/1N6JcUt1BOYPItSepXaRZ2crt1C41pxLcXvJ1Zzcj5L8/edit?usp=drivesdk,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727802426766_Resume_09_09_2024_03_38_37_pm.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T17:07:09.326Z,2024-10-01T17:07:09.326Z,,,,,,,,,
