66fc36ccb870f7844d2606c8,Raheem Elijah Babatunde,+2348078674683,elijah.raheem@tobamsgroup.com,Nigeria,"I am a seasoned digital marketer and social media manager with a strong foundation in sales and marketing. Over the past two years, I’ve focused on driving business growth and enhancing customer engagement through innovative marketing strategies. Currently, I work as a digital marketer and content creator, blending my creative approach with data-driven insights to produce impactful results.\n\nAs a chemical engineering, my analytical background allows me to approach challenges with precision and structure. However, my passion for marketing and sales inspired a career shift, and I’ve since successfully integrated my technical expertise with creative strategies to fuel brand development.\n\nKnown for my resilience and attention to detail, I am also a proven leader. My leadership qualities were further refined during my time as a Corper's Liaison Officer, where I managed key responsibilities and honed my ability to lead with clarity and purpose.\n\n",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_CPsxoMNjcdHW77vEoROGvkOri4srgGK?usp=drive_link,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727805130151_Raheem.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-01T17:52:12.449Z,2024-10-01T17:52:12.449Z,,,,,,,,,
