66fcdedfb870f7844d260881,Marie Tebe-Ebiere Egenisuobai ,+23408024491894,tebesebi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’ve been in the social media game for about 3 years now, and during my time at Words on Us (a content development agency) I’ve had the chance to manage not just small business owners' pages but also some really cool brands, like a tech  school. It’s been a mix of creative content, strategy, and a whole lot of engagement.\n\nI’m all about creating content that’s not just eye-catching but also meaningful. Plus, I’ve got graphic design skills to make sure every post looks just right. I’m really into crafting content that not only attract but also connect with the audience on a deeper level.\n\nI’d love to chat more about how we can work together to take your social media to the next level. ",https://www.canva.com/design/DAGQoboadjo/hVEPU17CjYmyyiC_MBSxVw/view?utm_content=DAGQoboadjo&utm_campaign=designshare&utm_medium=link&utm_source=editor,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727848157357_TEBE-EBIERE'S CV.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-02T05:49:19.496Z,2024-10-02T05:49:19.496Z,,,,,,,,,
