66fd1759b870f7844d26098d,Dooyum Kingsley Abaa ,+23408068418255,drakareabaa@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Abaa Kingsley from Benue state, Nigeria and based in lagos, Nigeria.\nI am a dynamic and results-driven Social Media Manager with a passion for crafting engaging, high-impact digital campaigns that elevate brand presence and drive customer engagement. With [3] years of experience managing social media platforms across various industries, I have honed my ability to develop strategic content that resonates with target audiences, grows followings, and fosters brand loyalty.\n\nI excel in content creation, analytics, and community management, having successfully implemented data-driven strategies that increased engagement rates and led to measurable growth in follower count and conversions. My expertise spans across multiple platforms, including Instagram, Twitter, Facebook, LinkedIn, and TikTok, where I’ve managed both organic and paid campaigns to maximize reach and ROI.\n\nKnown for my creative flair and eye for detail, I am adept at creating compelling visual and written content tailored to specific brand identities. I’m skilled in leveraging trends, influencer partnerships, and audience insights to stay ahead of the curve in the ever-evolving digital landscape.\n\nCollaborative by nature, I work seamlessly with cross-functional teams to ensure that social media strategies align with broader marketing goals. With a solid background in social media analytics, I consistently track and report on campaign performance, using insights to optimize content and engagement strategies for continuous improvement.\n\nI am excited to bring my expertise, creativity, and passion for social media to your team, helping your brand thrive in the digital world while building meaningful connections with your audience. ",https://docs.google.com/document/d/1qTC_0L9PhAKqGYN9IwPhqQ6q7SaUCi-T/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=101311162576597862355&rtpof=true&sd=true,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north