66fd6441b870f7844d260ac6,Victor Ogedi,+23409017793213,ogedivictor.e@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Ogedi Victor, a passionate and results-driven digital marketer with several years of experience in developing and implementing successful digital marketing strategies across various industries. I hold a Higher National Diploma in Marketing from Yaba College of Technology, and I have completed several certifications in digital marketing, including Google Ads, Meta Social Media Management, and SEO practices.\n\nThroughout my career, I have had the opportunity to lead marketing teams and work with diverse brands to increase visibility, generate leads, and improve engagement through innovative content strategies. In my most recent role as Digital Marketing Manager at AAJ Express Logistics, I developed and executed digital campaigns that increased social media followers by over 7,000 in just 30 days, improved brand awareness by 30-38%, and led multi-channel marketing strategies, including both traditional and digital marketing efforts.\n\nI’m particularly skilled in content creation, SEO optimization, social media management, and analytics, always using data to drive decisions and optimize campaign performance. I enjoy collaborating with teams to brainstorm new ideas and implement effective marketing strategies that align with organizational goals. My experience also spans managing website content, running email marketing campaigns, and employing organic strategies like user-generated content (UGC) and affiliate marketing.\n\nWith a strong focus on achieving tangible results, I’m excited about the opportunity to bring my expertise in digital marketing to your team and contribute to your company’s continued success.",https://sites.google.com/view/ogedivictorportfolio/home,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727882303612_Ogedi victor cv 2024 september.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-02T15:18:25.810Z,2024-10-02T15:1