66fd6919b870f7844d260ae9,Josephine OluChris-Ikulghan,+23407068109871,josephineoluchris@outlook.com,Nigeria,"My name is Josephine OluChris. I'm originally from Rivers State, but I currently reside in Lagos, Nigeria. I recently just concluded my BSc in Biotechnology from a reputable university in Cotonou, Benin Republic.\n\nI am someone who can be described in one word as eccentric, and although I may not be easy to understand, I am very good at reading people.\n\nSocial media is one of those things that came easy to me. I got into social media management as a way to make ends meet and a means to sponsor my way through the university but it soon became something I grew to love and enjoy. I have been working as a freelance social media manager for well over 4 years, and in the course of time, I've had the opportunity to work with several brands and helped them build a strong online presence and grow their businesses.\n\nI believe in the uniqueness of each brand. I try to identify each brand's unique selling point and highlight it. This has always worked in helping meet up with the brand's goals and targets.\n\nI love a good challenge and I appreciate every opportunity to learn and improve, hence my interest in this position.  ",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727883543162_Josephine's Resume PDF.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-02T15:39:05.908Z,2024-10-02T15:39:05.908Z,,,,,,,,,
