66fd6cdcb870f7844d260afb,Francisca Chioma Obi,+2349015312931,franciscaobi12@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"I have over 8 years of experience as digital marketing strategist with solid foundation in SEO - search engine optimization, SEM- search engine marketing, content marketing  making use of CMS (Content Management System) like Wordpress to publish educated blog or Articles to promote the use or latest information of the products or services and CRM (Customer Relationship Management) like Zoho and Hubspot to convert prospect to sales funnels and sale convert the leads to paying customers, Email and SMS marketing, PPC (paid advertising) using meta ads and google ads, social media management, automation using zapier or Pabbly connect reduce manually repeated tasks, PR(Guest posting), Influencers marketing and also combining ATL and BTL marketing i.e doing physical marketing activation, Newspapers publication and radio & TV advertising channels, print ads, outdoor billboards to increase online or offline brand visibility and boost sales.\n\nWe I have a proven track record of successfully managing different industries projects while collaborating with sales, customer care and operations departments and working with IT teams demonstrated by my ability to increase revenue and streamline marketing branding in my previous and present roles.\n\nI’m a self-motivated individual who aims for excellence, taking on a high level of ownership and accountability. I have a strong strategic thinking and data analytical mindset. \n\nI’m confident I can contribute value to the success of the company by boosting marketing awareness, online visibility, maintaining online brand consistency etc\nMy strong problem solving skills, coupled with my experience in digital marketing strategy, make me an ideal candidate to drive the company goals and objectives forward.",https://portfolio.francesblog.com/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727884506158_CHIOMA DM CV Festac.pdf,6