66fd72dbb870f7844d260b19,Glory Essah,+2348058257832,gloryessah@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As a passionate and results-driven social media marketing professional, I have over 7 years of experience in creating and executing effective social media strategies that drive engagement, brand awareness, and conversions. My expertise spans across multiple platforms, including Facebook, Instagram, Twitter, LinkedIn, and TikTok, where I’ve led campaigns that successfully grew audiences and increased ROI.\n\nIn 2021, I fully transitioned into digital marketing, focusing on social media management, content creation, and influencer partnerships. My strengths lie in building strong online communities, leveraging data analytics to refine strategies, and using creative storytelling to connect brands with their target audiences. I’m particularly proud of my ability to stay up-to-date with trends and continuously adapt to new tools and algorithms, ensuring that my clients stay ahead in the competitive digital landscape.\n\nIn addition to my hands-on experience, I’ve also developed leadership skills through managing teams and coordinating cross-functional collaborations. I thrive in fast-paced environments and am always looking for innovative ways to enhance brand presence and engagement on social media platforms.",https://gloryessah.my.canva.site/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727886037500_Digital Marketing CV- Glory Essah .docx (1).pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-02T16:20:43.469Z,2024-10-02T16:20:43.469Z,,,,,,,,,
