66fd8076b870f7844d260b34,Enoch Neequaye,+23408130063161,neequayeenoch4@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a dynamic Digital Communication Expert specializing in graphic design, video editing, and social media management, with a proven track record in leading impactful marketing campaigns. I have successfully boosted followership and optimized engagement across multiple platforms, demonstrating a strong grasp of strategic content creation and digital branding.\n\nIn my role as Digital Media and Marketing Specialist at Agroye, I crafted a brand identity from scratch, developed a comprehensive brand guide, and led a marketing campaign that drove over 400 registrations for monthly training events, exceeding targets. I also grew the social media presence rapidly, with significant increases in followers, likes, and views. My work at ProcureProcess and Restoration House further honed my skills in content creation, event management, and audience engagement, while my time at House Femxi allowed me to increase brand awareness and sales through targeted advertising.\n\nWith a Bachelor’s in Business Administration (E-commerce) and certifications in Digital Marketing, I bring a well-rounded perspective to digital communication, combining technical expertise with strategic thinking. I am passionate about contributing creativity and insight to help brands grow and connect with their audiences in meaningful ways​",https://www.behance.net/gallery/190669991/Data-Communication-Expert-Portfolio,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727889524024_Enocg Neequaye Digital Com Expert CV.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-02T17:18:46.361Z,2024-10-02T17:18:46.361Z,,,,,,,,,
