66fd88f3b870f7844d260b4b,Victor Ademola Ogunmoyewa ,+2348066941158,mrademolavictor@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Recruiting Manager,\n\nI am writing to express my interest in the Social Media Marketing Manager position at Tobams Group, as advertised. With over four years of hands-on experience in digital marketing, I have successfully crafted and executed strategies that have driven significant growth for different brands.\n\nAt Dexmo Global Enterprises, I spearheaded social media campaigns that increased engagement by 21% and leveraged Meta Business Suite Ads to achieve a 20% rise in Instagram traffic. By analysing data insights, I optimised lead generation by 15% and improved conversion rates by 20%. My ability to collaborate effectively with influencers resulted in a notable 30% increase in product sales.\n\nPreviously at TrilliConsult and Solutions, I excelled as a content strategist, overseeing content calendars that boosted efficiency by 75% and enhanced organic search traffic by 22% through SEO tactics. These experiences have developed my skills in SEO, SEM, content creation, and social media management across various platforms.\n\nI am eager to bring my track record in improving digital engagement and my passion for innovative marketing solutions to Tobams Group. I am confident that my strategic approach, combined with my dedication to delivering impactful results, aligns well with your company's goals.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how my skills and experiences can contribute to the continued success of Tobams Group.\n\nWarm regards,\n\nVictor Ademola Ogunmoyewa.",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cYr3dlbiMK1CKJPpMw4c1nA7dDBlsBoS/view,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727891696928_Victor's cv.jpg,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-02T17:54:59.899Z,2024-10-02T17:54:59.899Z,,,,,,,,,
