66fd8b72b870f7844d260b58,Arthur Ukaga,+2349049049408,justinukaga@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi, I’m Arthur Ukaga, Graduate of Mass Communication from the University of Nigeria Nsukka. \nI’m a Digital Marketer and Social Media Manager having worked in the creative field for up to 5 years now. I began my Digital Marketing journey while working for a US based company as a Virtual Assistant. In this role, I was tasked with design, video editing, SEO and web analysis as well as formulating social media strategies. I took a course in Digital marketing while with the company and was able to help them achieve their short and medium term goals.\nMoving on from here i worked with STK Biotech were i put my knowledge to use and was able to create and strategically plan content to build a social media presence and maintain consistency across all brand pages. I was in charge of their account profiles till i had to leave to serve my nation. \nMy most recent Job found me at Knowtixed Media Services, a digital marketing agency, where I was tasked with handling multiple brands at once in an organized team. I used all my expertise to acquire a process that has proven to work with goals based on brand visibility or profit. \nI believe in my skill to achieve my goals as long as I am backed by the company. I don’t need to be micromanaged and can handle the Implementation with little or no supervision. \nThank you for your time",https://www.instagram.com/jecehospital?igsh=Y284MnJncWhxcGU4&utm_source=qr,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727892334349_ARTHURâs PROFILE .pdf.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-02T18:05:38.514Z,2024-10-02T18:05:38.514Z,,,,,,,,,
