66fda5d6b870f7844d260ba1,Oke Wunmi,+2348110942995,okewhumie@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"My name is Oke Wunmi and I’m a fresh graduate of the University of Lagos. I’ve been working as a social media manager for over four years now and it’s been amazing. My interest for social media management grew during the lockdown and I decided to take it up as a career and I’ve never looked back since then. The journey has been awesome as I’ve been able to build an online presence for multiple brands on various platforms. During my free time I like to explore new places, food and create contents.",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1oCQ3f3Aok3Yh5rl9MDRu9abOclxh6VpM/view?usp=drivesdk,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727899092112_Wunmi's CV.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-02T19:58:14.485Z,2024-10-02T19:58:14.485Z,,,,,,,,,
66fda8adb870f7844d260bac,Emmanuella Sajin Ayeni,+23407064683905,semmanuella4@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a seasoned social media marketing specialist with over five years of experience driving growth for brands across various industries. My passion lies in crafting compelling social media strategies, designing impactful content, and using data-driven insights to boost engagement and conversions. I’ve worked with companies like GFoods Sarfix (GMealshub), where I spearheaded a surge in app users and grew Facebook followers with strategic paid advertising. I thrive on aligning marketing efforts with business goals and delivering real results.\n\nBeyond my full-time roles, I’ve successfully managed multiple social media accounts as side projects, adding versatility to my skills. I’m proficient in tools like Canva, Meta Ads Manager, and Google Analytics, ensuring that every campaign is both visually engaging and strategically sound.\n\nWhether it’s building brand visibility, creating engaging content, or turning leads into loyal customers, I’m always excited to bring creativity and strategy to the table.",https://www.canva.com/design/DAGPZAUfD7Q/4ovNrRCGf0ql3vU--hFa3w/edit?utm_content=DAGPZAUfD7Q&utm_campaign=designshare&utm_medium=link2&utm_source=sharebutton,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727899818195_Ayeni Sajin Emmanuella CV.docx,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-02T20:10:21.200Z,2024-10-02T20:10:21.200Z,,,,,,,,,
66fda98cb870f7844d260bb1,Temidayo Oladapo ,+2348106170811,temidayoladapo@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Temidayo Oladapo, an economics graduate from Osun state University. I ventured into Social media management in the year 2021 and I have skills in Social media management, Video Editing, Instagram Ads, Facebook Ads, Email Marketing etc. I'm a great team player, I love meeting people and getting to learn new things. \n\nI believe I'm the best fit for this role as it aligns with my career goals. \n\nYours Sincerely.\nTemidayo Oladapo.\n",https://www.linkedin.com/in/temidayo-oladapo-a93b89202?,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727900042406_TEMIDAYO OLADAPO- CV.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-02T20:14:04.832Z,2024-10-02T20:14:04.832Z,,,,,,,,,
66fda9b8b870f7844d260bb6,SAMUEL Olusesan OGUNMILUA,+23408137508176,ogunmiluasamuel30@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As a social media manager, I would focus on developing tailored strategies to increase brand visibility, engagement, and customer acquisition. Key responsibilities would include:\n\nStrategy Development: Crafting social media plans aligned with business goals, selecting the right platforms, content types, and setting measurable KPIs.\n\nContent Creation and Curation: Overseeing content production to maintain a cohesive brand image, ensuring it resonates with the target audience.\n\nEngagement and Community Building: Actively engaging with followers, responding to messages, and building brand loyalty through consistent interaction.\n\nData Analysis and Reporting: Regularly analyzing performance using analytics tools and refining strategies based on insights to maximize ROI.\n\nCampaign and Ads Management: Designing and optimizing paid ad campaigns to target key demographics and drive conversions.\n\nTrendspotting: Staying up to date with social media trends and platform changes to ensure the brand remains innovative and relevant.\n\n",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/13zpvBK2VGXSdkZjk8shAR20NB6DGjurQ?usp=sharing,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727900086266_Social media resume.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-02T20:14:48.722Z,2024-10-02T20:14:48.722Z,,,,,,,,,
66fda9efb870f7844d260bbc,RILWAN ALLI ,+2348163524104,allirilwanb@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nI am a Results-Driven marketing executive and Social Media/ community Manager.\n\nI am applying to those role as a Social Media Manager to leverage my proven ability to drive engagement, grow online communities, and achieve tangible business outcomes. With a strong foundation in virtual assistance, community management, and social media strategy, I excel in:Project Coordination,Community Building, Analytics-Driven Decision Making.\n\nMy exceptional organizational skills and problem-solving abilities allow me to navigate complex challenges and deliver exceptional results. As a proactive team player with excellent communication skills, I thrive in collaborative environments and build strong relationships with clients and stakeholders.\nI am eager to contribute my skills and passion to a dynamic organization that values innovation and results-oriented social media management.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727900140021_ALLI_CV social media and community manager upg.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-02T20:15:43.325Z,2024-10-02T20:15:43.325Z,,,,,,,,,
66fdcc67b870f7844d260bcb,Gbemi Ipaye,+2347046791890,gbemiipaye@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I have five years of experience in marketing, where I've developed a strong proficiency in both offline and online campaigns. My skill set includes social media management, web content creation, SEO, and email marketing, utilizing platforms like MailChimp, WordPress, Instagram, Facebook, and Twitter. I have a solid background in B2C e-commerce marketing, which has allowed me to effectively analyze data and optimize marketing strategies through tools such as Google Analytics and Hootsuite.\n\nIn my previous roles, I've successfully managed multiple projects and teams in fast-paced environments, ensuring that marketing initiatives are executed from inception to completion. My collaborative approach with cross-functional teams has helped drive brand awareness and engagement through innovative campaigns.\n\nAdditionally, I have a knack for creative direction and marketing design, which I truly enjoy. My experience includes securing partnerships and collaborating with media planning and buying agencies to enhance brand visibility across various industries. I’m excited about the opportunity to leverage my skills and experience to contribute to your team.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727908965061_Gbemi Ipaye CV - Digital Marketing Manager.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-02T22:42:47.175Z,2024-10-02T22:42:47.175Z,,,,,,,,,
66fdd32eb870f7844d260bd1,Ayomide oluwalowo,+2347055194892,oluwalowoayomide589@gmail.com,Nigeria,"A highly motivated professional Emotional in CV writing, content writing,\nsocial media marketing, and sales & marketing. With a proven track\nrecord of delivering engaging content, managing and increasing brand\nvisibility, I possess excellent communication skills and a passion for\ndriving growth through strategic marketing efforts. Seeking a\nchallenging position where my expertise can be leveraged to contribute\nto an organization's success and further develop my professional skills",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727910699862_MY CV.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-02T23:11:42.126Z,2024-10-02T23:11:42.126Z,,,,,,,,,
66fdd40fb870f7844d260bda,Dolapo Oladipo,+23408122232642,Dolapo.foladipo@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI am excited to apply for the Social Media Manager and Marketer Position. I believe I am a good fit for this role as I have a strong background in marketing, communications, and social media management, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team and help enhance your brand’s presence and engagement.\n\nIn my previous role as a Marketing and Communications Specialist at TSL Logistics Limited, I spearheaded the development and execution of comprehensive media strategies and engagement plans. This resulted in significant media coverage for key events and business initiatives. By designing and launching annual communication strategies, I successfully improved brand awareness and alignment with company goals. My efforts in supervising content creation and updates for the company’s website and social media pages led to a 35% boost in online engagement. Additionally, I managed social media advertising campaigns that achieved a 40% increase in ad reach, further solidifying our online presence.\n\nAs a certified Social Media Management and Advertising Specialist, I have developed and curated engaging content for the company's social media platforms and ran adverts which helped in increasing follower engagement by 25%. I coordinated with the Public Relations Agency to secure a 20% increase in media coverage and implemented social media campaigns that resulted in a 30% boost in online visibility and brand awareness. My ability to monitor and analyze social media metrics allowed me to optimize content performance and engagement effectively. \n\nI am motivated by the success of the projects I manage and responsibilities assigned to me. I am eager to bring my expertise in content creation, campaign management, and strategic communication to your team. I am confident that my proactive and results-driven approach will contribute to your company’s continued success.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experiences align with the needs of your organization.\n \nWarm regards,\nDolapo Faidat Oladipo\n",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1W82jsZVDTQom90MlRUaqkmvLlE9Q66RP,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1727910925338_DolapoFaidat_Oladipo_CV.pdf,66f43d8d434416cd1bd18d3e,Social Media Manager And Marketer,2024-10-02T23:15:27.200Z,2024-10-02T23:15:27.200Z,,,,,,,,,
