6712493dcb112788c38cae8f,Duniya Nehemiah Banhwa,+2347038234937,dbanhwa@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nI am Nehemiah Banhwa Duniya, a finance enthusiast with a Master’s in Financial Economics and a Bachelor’s in Economics from Ahmadu Bello University. My academic background has equipped me with strong analytical and strategic thinking skills, and I am committed to continuous learning, as evidenced by my Diploma in Innovation and Entrepreneur Finance and various relevant certifications. This strong foundation positions me to contribute effectively to a dynamic financial team.\nCurrently, I serve as a Financial Analyst with Ratio Consulting, where I develop financial models and engage in strategic planning across sectors such as Oil and Gas, Energy, Real Estate, and Agriculture. My prior roles, including positions at New Frontier Developments and NFD Kaduna, have further strengthened my expertise in financial management and operations. However, I recognize that an internship would provide me with invaluable hands-on experience and exposure to different financial environments, allowing me to refine my skills in a real-world setting.\nI am eager to enhance my professional development through this internship opportunity, where I can apply my meticulous attention to detail and understanding of financial regulations. I am passionate about contributing to organizational success and sustainable growth in financial planning and analysis. This internship would not only advance my career but also enable me to bring my analytical skills and innovative \n",www.linkedin.com/in/ nehemiah-duniya-bsc-mfe-msc-fmva-in-view-8a8827111,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729251643370_Nehemiah Banhwa Duniya CV.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-18T11:40:45.799Z,2024-10-18T11:40:45.799Z,,,,,,,,,
