6712526ecb112788c38caee2,Kafilat Ololade,+23408083061495,akoduololade95@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Kafilat Ololade Akodu, a detail-oriented and results-driven Finance Analyst based in Oshodi, Lagos. With a strong foundation in financial reporting and data analysis, I have developed a proven track record in optimizing financial processes and supporting strategic decision-making within dynamic team environments.\n\nCurrently, I work at Nigerian Breweries Plc, where I collaborate with cross-functional teams to analyze business performance and ensure adherence to financial plans. My responsibilities include conducting in-depth financial analyses, preparing comprehensive reports for senior management, and supporting the development of annual operating plans. Previously, as a Junior Financial Analyst at Landmark Corporate Realty Ltd, I gained valuable experience in financial statement preparation, budget variance analysis, and stakeholder engagement.\n\nI hold a B.Sc. in Accounting and am pursuing my professional qualification with the Institute of Chartered Accountants (ICAN). My skills include advanced financial analysis, budgeting and forecasting, compliance, and proficiency in ERP systems such as SAP. I am passionate about leveraging my analytical skills and financial acumen to drive organizational growth and success.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729253996971_MGT Trainee.docx,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-18T12:19:58.681Z,2024-10-18T12:19:58.681Z,,,,,,,,,
