6712643ccb112788c38caf22,Adeoye Adebayo Rasheed,+2348081172460,adebayoadeoye4eva@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"I'm an experienced accounting professional with over six years in the field, currently working as a Senior Account Officer at Dangote Industries Limited. In this role, I manage the accounting and financial operations specifically account payable operations for our manufacturing division, which is one of Africa's largest and most diverse.\nMy educational background includes a B.Sc. in Accounting and Finance from Lagos State University, along with several certifications from the Corporate Finance Institute. This solid academic foundation, combined with my hands-on experience, has allowed me to develop expertise in financial accounting, account reconciliation, and manufacturing process improvement.\nThroughout my career, I've had the opportunity to contribute to the financial growth of various Nigerian companies. Before joining Dangote, I worked with FAE Limited and Ocean Lord Limited, where I handled tasks ranging from book-keeping and payroll analysis to financial reporting and accounts reconciliation.\nIn my current position, I use SAP software to ensure compliance, accuracy, and efficiency in our accounting systems. I'm responsible for performing AP operations, taxes and producing comprehensive reports.\nMy professional goal is to continue delivering strategic financial solutions and fostering fiscal excellence for businesses. I'm passionate about using my skills to drive financial success and efficiency, and I'm always eager to take on new challenges in the dynamic field of finance and accounting.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729258554276_Adebayo_Adeoye_CV[1].docx,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-18T13:35:56.161Z,2024-10-18T13:35:56.161Z,,,,,,,,,
67126445cb112788c38caf27,Oyeshola Similoluwa,+2347085117457,mosimioyeshola@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a finance professional with a background in transaction advisory, currently working as a Corporate Finance and Transaction Advisory Analyst at CFG AFRICA. I have experience in preparing management reports, conducting profitability analyses, and collaborating with auditors. Additionally, I served as an external CFO for a client, where I improved their accounting practices and financial structuring.\n\nI am passionate about financial modeling and valuation, which I am actively pursuing through additional coursework. I value continuous learning and knowledge sharing, and I am committed to making a positive impact through my work.\n\nWhen I am not working, I love to volunteer.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/oyesholasimiloluwa,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729258562822_Oyeshola Similoluwa CV.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-18T13:36:05.140Z,2024-10-18T13:36:05.140Z,,,,,,,,,
67126635cb112788c38caf36,Oluwayomi Gbenga Joshua,+2348069220016,oluwayomigbenga22@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I graduated with a degree in Economics and here I developed a strong foundation in Financial analysis & Economic theory.\nAfter my Graduation I worked in an Audit firm which gave me more knowledge while working on Clients SOFP & SOPL this made me dig deeper, analyze & make comparism on the present year data and previous year data. For instance after analyzing thier present year account n previous year account and I notice the expenses incurred last year is lower than the one I cured this year, I ask myself what may be the reason for this, may economic reasons or lapses in internal control then we recommend possible solutions to elimante the trend discovered.\nI’m excited about this opportunity because these roles align with my goal to build expertise in finance while contributing my knowledge in economic analysis to support strategic decisions ",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729259059416_OLUWAYOMI GBENGA 2.doc,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-18T13:44:21.539Z,2024-10-18T13:44:21.539Z,,,,,,,,,
67126a47cb112788c38caf49,Adetayo Taiwo sophiat ,+2349076301587,sophietaas@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nMy name is Adetayo-Adekola Taiwo Sophiat, and I'm an undergraduate student in my final year at the University of Lagos, studying Accounting. With a strong foundation in financial principles, I possess skills in:\n\n- Financial analysis and modeling\n- Budgeting and forecasting\n- Financial reporting and statement analysis\n- Excel proficiency (financial formulas, data visualization, and pivot tables)\n- Research and data analysis\n\nOutside of academics, I enjoy:\n\n- Reading (finance, economics, and self-development books)\n- Studying trends (market analysis, industry insights, and emerging technologies)\n- Analyzing financial news and market updates\n- Networking with professionals in the finance industry\n- Continuous learning and professional development\n\nI'm detail-oriented, analytical, and passionate about applying financial concepts to drive business growth. I'm eager to bring my skills and knowledge to a dynamic organization like yours, contributing to informed financial decision-making.\n\nThroughout my academic journey, I've developed strong problem-solving, communication, and teamwork skills, ensuring effective collaboration with colleagues and stakeholders.\n\nI'm excited about the opportunity to join your team as a Finance Analyst Intern, applying my skills and knowledge to drive financial excellence.\n\nI would be grateful if my application could be considered, and I look forward to the opportunity to contribute to your team.\n",https://www.linkedin.com/in/taiwo-adetayo-adekola-96babb238,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729260098037_ADETAYOTAIWO cv.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-18T14:01:43.950Z,2024-10-18T14:01:43.950Z,,,,,,,,,
67126baecb112788c38caf58,Monsuru Bakare Ishola,+2349033360375,monsurubakare813@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an aspiring, organized, technology-savvy Accountant (Settlement, Reconciliation,    Revenue, and Receivables Specialist) with over 3 years of experience in the FinTech industry. Team player with empathy, optimistic attitude, great analytical and investigative skills, leveraging on existing Data Analytics skills. Detailed-oriented with a strong independent work ethic, customer-centric, and a motivated problem solver with a passion for building relationships and contributing to the organizational structure at large.\n\nI have various data analytical skills,  managing cash inflows, preparing invoices, documenting transactions, payment collections, cash application, dispute resolution, client billing issues, account reconciliation, deductions, and credit risk. and experiences that uniquely qualify me for this position; Well-versed in performing necessary Data computation, analyzing working capital cycle, and interpersonal relationships, etc, also skilled in using a variety of office software such as Microsoft Word, Excel, and PowerPoint.\n\nI have trong ability to follow instructions, learn new tasks and computer applications with confidence and easiness perfect attention to detail and a proven ability to accomplish designated tasks speedily\n ",https://www.linkedin.com/in/monsuru-bakare-070704200/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729260460491_MONSURU BAKARE ISHOLA.docx,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-18T14:07:42.434Z,2024-10-18T14:07:42.434Z,,,,,,,,,
