67128530cb112788c38cafd5,Egenti Kenechukwu ,+2347069094404,kene.egenti@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"I am Egenti Kenechukwu  a data analyst with experience in driving business growth through data-driven insights. With a strong background in Economics and data visualization, I have developed expertise in tools like Excel, Power BI and SQL. My experience in data analysis has equipped me to work with large datasets, identify trends, and create actionable recommendations. I am excited about this role because it aligns with my passion for using data to inform business decisions. My goal is to continue growing as a data analyst and contribute to the company's success.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729266989442_KENECHUKWU EGENTI.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-18T15:56:32.741Z,2024-10-18T15:56:32.741Z,,,,,,,,,
