671289cccb112788c38cafff,Ezegwu Christopher Chibueze,+2349063799244,christopherchibueze2017@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a finance and accounting professional with a strong foundation in financial management, treasury operations, and accounting principles, holding a Bachelor of Science in Accounting from Obafemi Awolowo University. My expertise has been further enhanced through practical experience as a Finance Intern at Hydrogen Payment Service Company Limited, where I gained hands-on exposure to cash flow management, financial reporting, and reconciliation. Additionally, my role as a Bookkeeper provided me with the ability to manage daily financial operations with precision and accuracy.\n\nCurrently, I am expanding my knowledge and skills by pursuing further education at the School of Finance, where I am deepening my expertise in advanced finance and treasury management. This ongoing professional development complements my industry experience, equipping me with the skills to excel in fast-paced, dynamic environments.\n\nMy passion lies in leveraging my accounting and financial knowledge to contribute to innovative financial strategies, particularly in treasury management. With experience in both traditional finance and the fintech sector, I am excited to bring my expertise to forward-thinking organizations that prioritize financial efficiency and growth.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/christ opher-ezegwu-aca-in-view-8a4a002 69/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729268170338_EZEGWU CHRISTOPHER CHIBUEZE.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-18T16:16:12.676Z,2024-10-18T16:16:12.676Z,,,,,,,,,
