671291a4cb112788c38cb02c,Adeyemi Adekunle,+2348051805608,oyelayo43@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Adeyemi Adekunle, A graduate of Tai Solarin University of Education. I transitioned into data analysis in march this year. Since then, I have worked on several projects which have improved my skills in Excel, SQL and Power BI. Currently, I serve as a Data Analysis Teaching Assistant at Incubator Hub, where I support students in understanding data concepts and tools. I also completed a data entry internship at Joblagos, where I was responsible for extracting client CV data from Gmail and accurately inputting it into the company’s website. I'm passionate about transforming raw data into meaningful insights that drive better decisions.",https://github.com/Adeyemi012,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729270177650_Adeyemi's Resume.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-18T16:49:40.476Z,2024-10-18T16:49:40.476Z,,,,,,,,,
67129262cb112788c38cb033,Miracle Cole,+23409074312267,colemiracle57@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Cole Miracle, a recent Accounting graduate from Obafemi Awolowo University with a Second Class Upper degree. I’ve gained hands-on experience through an audit trainee role, which gave me a solid foundation in auditing processes and enhanced my attention to detail. Additionally, my advanced diploma in forensic accounting and fraud investigation strengthened my analytical thinking and problem-solving skills.\n\nI’ve also had leadership experience as a project class representative, coordinating group efforts and fostering teamwork. These roles taught me how to manage people, stay organized, and communicate effectively under pressure.\n\nRight now, I’m looking to apply my skills in a professional environment where I can grow and contribute meaningfully—whether in auditing, accounting, or a finance  role. I’m excited to join an organization where I can build practical experience, collaborate with others, and take on new challenges.",http://linkedin.com/in/cole-miracle,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729270368666_Miracle cole's CV.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-18T16:52:50.923Z,2024-10-18T16:52:50.923Z,,,,,,,,,
