67129ce8cb112788c38cb0a3,Agbaje Shola ,+2349056749800,agbajeshooa1010@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Agbaje Shola Sherif, and I'm excited to apply for Financial Analyst Intern role at Tobams Group. With a strong educational background in finance and relevant courses such as Corporate Finance, Investment Banking, and International Finance, I've developed a solid foundation in financial analysis and decision-making.\n\nAs a graduate of Finance with experience in financial management, accounting, and analysis. I've honed my skills in financial data analysis, budgeting, and financial reporting. \n\nMy experience as a Financial Secretary at Glee Store Ltd and Junior Account Officer at Johnny Ventures has given me hands-on experience in managing financial records, reconciling bank statements, and providing financial guidance to management and team members.\n\nAs a leader, I've had the opportunity to work with diverse groups, build consensus, and achieve common goals as the President of the Banking and Finance Students' Association of Nigeria, OOU Chapter.\n\nI'm proficient in Microsoft Office, particularly Excel, and enjoy analyzing financial data, creating reports, and presentations. I'm a critical thinker, a team player, and always eager to learn and grow.\n\nI'm excited about the opportunity to join Tobams Group and contribute my skills and experience to the team. Thank you again for having me.\n",https://www.linkedin.com/in/shola-agbaje-102538214,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729273061696_Agbaje Shola Sherif CV.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-18T17:37:44.056Z,2024-10-18T17:37:44.056Z,,,,,,,,,
