6712a129cb112788c38cb0ba,Adedoyin Ogunlana,+23407069211015,hawahuolaide@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am writing to express my interest in the position of a Financial Analyst Intern, as advertised on Linkeldn. My name is Adedoyin Ogunlana, and I am an experienced auditor with a proven track record in financial analysis, internal controls, and risk assessment.\n\nOver the years, I have gained substantial experience in auditing processes and have developed proficiency in areas such as financial analysis, financial reporting, and regulatory compliance. During my tenure as an Audit Associate at Goldwyns Chartered Accountants, I contributed to key audit projects, identifying internal control issues and providing recommendations to mitigate associated risks. My role involved analyzing clients' financial statements, conducting thorough audits to ensure proper accounting, and contributing to research and data analysis within tight deadlines and standards. These experiences have given me valuable insights into maintaining accuracy and efficiency in financial systems.\n\nAdditionally, I have enrolled in various online courses such as ,Introduction and Fundamental of Fianace – Coursera, Micromaster in Finance - edx, has further reinforced my ability to understand and implement complex accounting principles. My hands-on experience with tools like Microsoft Excel and financial auditing software, coupled with strong problem-solving skills, has enabled me to ensure the accuracy and integrity of financial data and reporting.\n\nI am confident that my attention to detail, strong analytical abilities, and ability to work collaboratively within teams make me an ideal fit for the position of a Financial Analyst Intern at Tobams Group. I am excited about the prospect of contributing to your organization and supporting its financial control functions.\n\nPlease find my CV attached for your review. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experiences align with your team's needs. I am available for an interview at your convenience.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to your response.\nYours sincerely,\nAdedoyin Ogunlana",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729274151522_Adedoyin Ogunlana__CV.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-18T17:55:53.950Z,2024-10-18T17:55:53.950Z,,,,,,,,,
