6712d5c8cb112788c38cb1b5,Opeyemi Bolanle Folarin ,+2347035056990,bolanledeborah2023@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Sir/Ma,\n\nI am applying for the post of an Financial Analyst intern in your highly reputable organization.\n\nI am especially thrilled to work in your company because it aligns with my long term goal and my expertise on financial model,financial analysis,budgeting would be put to great use in this role.\n\nI am a graduate of Ekiti State University, Ado-Ekiti with B.Sc. in Accounting, a member of the Institute of Chartered Accountant of Nigeria(ICAN),ACA  and also have Certification in Tax Practice. I am currently working in the health industry, have  experience in Real Estate Company as the Internal Auditor, and also worked with key distributors to P&G, Chi, and other FMCG industries. I have a background experience in Auditing, Finance and Accounting. I am proficient in the usage of Sage ERP, Microsoft office Suite (Microsoft Excel spreadsheet, word processing), knowledge of IFRS based financial statements and preparation of budgets,financial models  and analysis.\n\nI am interested in your post as it would expose me to more experience in work, and ability to wider consequences of financial decisions. My strong attention to details will be brought to the post as a proven ability to deal successfully and tactfully with clients, colleagues and stakeholders in order to achieve lasting positive impacts.\n\nI sincerely hope we have the opportunity to speak further so that I can share more about myself and the unique strengths I would bring to this role.\n\nFind attached my cv for your use.\n\nRegards,\n\nOpeyemi Bolanle Folarin\n\n",https://www.linkedin.com/in/opeyemifolarin?utm_source=share&utm_campaign=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=android_app,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729287621416_opeyemi cv-03.jpg.jpg,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-18T21:40:24.387Z,2024-10-18T21:40:24.387Z,,,,,,,,,
6712d664cb112788c38cb1c1,Doris Ogunbor,+23408038480958,chiogunbor@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello, I'm Doris Ogunbor, a driven and detail-oriented Chartered Accountant(ACA)and a bachelor's degree in Economics with over 2  years of experience in accounting, data analysis, budgeting, financial modeling, and auditing. With a strong foundation in financial principles, I've developed a passion for analyzing data to inform business decisions.\n\nThroughout my career, I've honed skills in:\n\n- Financial statement preparation and analysis\n- Budgeting and forecasting\n- Financial modeling and scenario planning\n- Data analysis and visualization using [software/tools, e.g., Excel, Tableau]\n- Auditing and internal control assessments\n\nI'm excited to leverage my technical expertise and analytical mindset as a Financial Analyst Intern. I'm eager to learn from experienced professionals, contribute to innovative projects, and grow with a dynamic organization.\n\nI'm confident that my strong work ethic, attention to detail, and ability to work effectively in teams will make me a valuable asset to your organization. Thank you for considering my application.""",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nLa4YQDsUiZ0Ch7V7Yu6xkVyg82vpP0y/view,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729287777893_Doris financial Analyst cv 1.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-18T21:43:00.874Z,2024-10-18T21:43:00.874Z,,,,,,,,,
