6712ed67cb112788c38cb215,Erem Faith Oluomachukwu,+2348158309956,eremfaith@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an accountant with a strong foundation in financial analysis and reporting, currently taking a course on leadership and management in global health. I have developed strong analytical skills, with a focus on interpreting financial data, making projections, and providing insights to drive decision-making. My strengths in communication, emotional intelligence, and adaptability allow me to work effectively in team settings and manage diverse tasks. I am eager to apply my skills in a financial analyst intern role at Tobams Group, contributing to its success in a remote environment.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/faith-erem-97a7422a8?utm_source=share&utm_campaign=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=ios_app,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729293668827_EREM FAITH OLUOMACHUKWU CV 1.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-18T23:21:11.591Z,2024-10-18T23:21:11.591Z,,,,,,,,,
6712ee86cb112788c38cb21a,Oluwadamilola Awosanya ,+2347044129697,damilolaawosanya1307@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Oluwadamilola. I am a recent graduate of accounting from the University of Lagos and I am excited to apply for the financial analyst intern position at Tobams group. \nAlthough I do not have direct experience in financial analysis, my academic background in accounting has equipped me with strong analytical and problem-solving skills, along with a solid foundation in financial principles. I also have the understanding of accounting software like QuickBooks. I also have an interest in forensic accounting and auditing, which has sharpened my attention to detail. I am eager to apply these skills while learning more about financial analysis and contributing to your team.\nI am happy about this opportunity and look forward to learning from experienced professionals in your organization.\n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729293953375_Oluwadamilola Awosanya Cv.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-18T23:25:58.124Z,2024-10-18T23:25:58.124Z,,,,,,,,,
6712fbb5cb112788c38cb22a,Michael Ndubuisi,+23408154097171,michaelndubuisi81@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a dedicated law graduate currently awaiting law school enrollment to pass the bar exam and obtain my practicing license. While I’m not yet licensed, I’ve gained valuable knowledge and practical skills during my legal studies, including legal research, drafting, and analysis, which I believe are well-suited for this role. I am particularly drawn to this opportunity because it allows me to leverage my skills in a remote setting while contributing to your team.\n\nI am committed to continuous learning and development, and I’m confident that my strong work ethic, attention to detail, and eagerness to take on challenging tasks will enable me to add value to your organization. Moreover, I am highly motivated to secure a permanent position with growth potential and am fully prepared to meet the demands of a remote legal role, even as I complete the process of obtaining my license.",https://1drv.ms/w/c/fc8896e3a36fa821/EXP2imUbcjpDiO-4gO4GX7MBmxaRs_Ipo6agdDFffjBkKQ?e=sBSFTu,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729297332190_MICHAEL NDUBUISI-CV edited 2-2.docx,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-19T00:22:13.971Z,2024-10-19T00:22:13.971Z,,,,,,,,,
