6712ffb8cb112788c38cb243,EWA GOODNESS UGOMMA,+23409131974519,ewagoodness6@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I Ewa Goodness Ugomma a native of Afikpo North in Ebonyi State is a Graduate in Accounting profession at akanu ibiam Federal polytechnic Unwana afikpo\nI graduated on 2021 and did my NYSC at Moonlight Schools in Ifo Local Government Ogun State\nI have worked on several positions with a reputable firms, one of which is my experience with Alibert Furnitures where I worked as an Account and Admin Officer \nI demonstrated resilience to my duty and delivered on a timely basis\nHaving demonstrated  financial recording skill, time management and the rest, gave me a foot hold in the organization.\nI believe I will be an asset to organizations like tobams Group with my acquired basic and academic skills.\nThank you.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729298358409_EWA GOODNESS.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-19T00:39:20.427Z,2024-10-19T00:39:20.427Z,,,,,,,,,
