67132234cb112788c38cb2a9,AKINOLA Precious ,+2349030964887,preciousakinola01@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am writing to express my interest in the Data Analyst Internship role  at Tobams group  where I believe my expertise in data analysis and visualization will be a valuable asset. My tenure as a Data Analytics Intern at The Data Immersed solidified my capability to transform complex data into insightful, strategic tools for business decision-making. During my internship at TDI, I was tasked with analyzing voluminous datasets using SQL, Excel, and PowerBI. My efforts led to the identification of pivotal trends and patterns that boosted data-driven decision-making. Additionally, I developed and presented intricate data visualizations using PowerBI, which significantly enhanced stakeholders' comprehension of multifaceted datasets. This experience is a testament to my analytical acumen and my ability to convey information effectively. I am eager to bring my skills to your team and to further the goals of your organization through meticulous data analysis. My ambition extends beyond just fulfilling the job requirements; I aim to deliver results that exceed your expectations and to grow within the field of data analytics. It would be a privilege to discuss how my background, skills, and certifications align with the needs of your department. I am looking forward to the opportunity to explore how I can contribute to your team and am available at your earliest convenience for an interview. \nSincerely, \nAKINOLA Precious\n",GitHub.com/preciousakinola,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729307185935_Precious Akinola Resume-DA.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-19T03:06:28.724Z,2024-10-19T03:06:28.724Z,,,,,,,,,
67132832cb112788c38cb2b8,Chioma Onwunyirigbo,+23408122858518,chiomaadigbo29@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a motivated individual with a passion for data analysis and finance. I enjoy working with numbers, identifying trends, and turning data into actionable insights. With experience in tools like Excel and Power BI, I’m always eager to learn new things, collaborate with teams, and grow professionally. I’m adaptable, detail-oriented, and driven by a curiosity to solve problems and make informed decisions.",datascienceportfol.io/ChiomaAdigbo,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729308719731_Chioma_Onwunyirigbo_Data_Analyst_Resume.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-19T03:32:02.236Z,2024-10-19T03:32:02.236Z,,,,,,,,,
