67132d71cb112788c38cb2d2,Shemilore Gideon Oladepo ,+2349037255026,shaymilshaw@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Banking and Finance graduate with Upper Credit, passionate about contributing to the financial sector. My academic background, combined with hands-on experience in financial reporting, budgeting, and financial analysis, has equipped me with the practical skills necessary to excel in finance.\n\nIn my previous role, I had the privilege of working closely with the Chief Financial Officer (CFO), which gave me invaluable exposure to high-level financial strategies and decision-making processes. This experience ignited my passion for continuous learning and professional growth, driving me to enroll in Business Analysis to further enhance my skills.\n\nThrough this added qualification, I developed a sharper ability to gather, interpret, and present financial data, helping organizations make more data-driven decisions. I’ve successfully applied these insights in my prior job, streamlining reporting processes, cost control, waste management and contributing to budgeting efficiency.\n\nI am excited about the opportunity to join your team as a Financial Intern, where I can leverage my experience, grow my skill set, and contribute meaningfully to the organization’s financial operations. My proactive approach, strong work ethic, and eagerness to learn make me confident in my ability to add value in this role.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729310063064_Shemilore Oladepo CV.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-19T03:54:25.666Z,2024-10-19T03:54:25.666Z,,,,,,,,,
