671330fecb112788c38cb2e9,Junaid Abdullateef,+2348119145980,junaidabdullateef@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Junaid Abdullateef, an experienced accounting and financial analysis professional with a strong background in financial reporting, auditing, budgeting, and data analysis. I have extensive experience using advanced tools like Excel, SQL, and Power BI to support data-driven decision-making and improve operational efficiency. I am passionate about continuous professional development, and I’ve applied my skills across various industries, including working as a Power BI Analyst at PwC and a Financial Accountant at Movig Hotel & Suites. I’m committed to leveraging data and analytics to support financial strategies and optimize business performance.\n\nIn addition to my technical expertise, I excel in communication, problem-solving, and leadership, whether mentoring students in data analysis or presenting insights to senior management. I am always looking for opportunities to apply innovative financial strategies and further develop my skills in accounting and analysis.",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1UGyWGCq6SukUfhQBJHnNfku5upMJcQS8?usp=sharing,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729310971878_Junaid Abdullateef CV .pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-19T04:09:34.514Z,2024-10-19T04:09:34.514Z,,,,,,,,,
