671341b0cb112788c38cb35f,Temitope Monyeh,+2348066266797,temi.monyeh@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nDear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am writing to express my interest in the financial analyst intern position at your company as advertised on LinkedIn. With a Master’s degree in Financial Analysis and a diverse background that includes two years as a research assistant and five years in monitoring and evaluation (M&E), I am eager to transition into a finance role where I can leverage my analytical skills and experience.\n\nThroughout my career, I have developed a strong foundation in data analysis and problem-solving. As a research assistant, I collaborated on various projects that required rigorous data collection and interpretation. This role enhanced my ability to work with quantitative data and provided me with valuable experience in presenting findings to stakeholders. My five years in M&E have further deepened my understanding of performance metrics and program evaluation, skills that I believe are transferable to the finance sector.\n\nAlthough I have not held a formal position in financial analysis, my academic training has equipped me with essential knowledge in financial principles. I have a keen interest in applying mu knowledge within a practical finance environment. My analytical mindset, combined with a commitment to continuous learning, positions me well for a successful transition into finance.\n\nI am eager to contribute my unique background to your team while further developing my financial acumen.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experiences align with the needs of your team. I am available for an interview at your convenience.\n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729315245294_TEMITOPE MONYEH CVD.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-19T05:20:48.084Z,2024-10-19T05:20:48.084Z,,,,,,,,,
