671344cfcb112788c38cb37b,Mamman Patience ,+2348163855886,patiencemamman98@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a detail-oriented and analytical-minded individual with a strong foundation in data analysis, financial modeling, and quantitative problem-solving. I recently graduated with a BSc in Microbiology from Kwara State University, and during my studies, I developed a passion for working with numbers and analyzing data to uncover meaningful insights. My exposure to data analysis through internships and self-directed learning in tools such as MS Excel, SQL, Python, and Power BI has equipped me with practical skills that I am eager to apply in the financial analysis field.\n\nIn my recent role as a Data Analyst Intern at Thels Impact Consult, I gained hands-on experience collecting, analyzing, and visualizing data to improve decision-making processes. I also developed dashboards that streamlined reporting and improved data accessibility for stakeholders. This experience honed my ability to manage and interpret complex datasets, making me confident in applying these skills to financial analysis.\n\nI am highly motivated to continue learning and developing my analytical skills in a financial context. I am particularly interested in utilizing my data manipulation skills to evaluate financial performance, identify trends, and contribute to strategic business decisions. I am excited about the opportunity to work as a Financial Analyst Intern, where I can contribute to meaningful projects and learn from industry professionals.",https://github.com/Peepearl,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729316044784_MAMMAN PATIENCE..CURRICULUM VITAE.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-19T05:34:07.007Z,2024-10-19T05:34:07.007Z,,,,,,,,,
