6713900acb112788c38cb5d3,ADEWALE ADESOLA KAYODE ,+2348034112669,tosman08@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Recruiter,\n\nSequel to your recently placed job advert, I hereby humbly apply to your reputable organisation for the post of Financial Analyst and I hope my application will be favourably considered.\n\nLooking at the responsibilities for this job position,I believe that I possess the requisite knowledge, skills, work experience and temperament suitable for the responsibilIties. I have over 13 years experience that cut across Auditing,Accounting,Finance,Internal Control and Administration. I recently completed some  certification training at the reputable OGE Business School under the tutelage of the renowned Professor Oyedokun Godwin Emmanuel in Advanced Diploma in Forensic Accounting and Investigation(Distinction) and also Advanced Diploma in Taxation and Fiscal Policy(Distinction).I also have a Proficiency certificate in Data-entry from Accounting Hub Data-Entry Academy. \n\nI pledge to exercise best care and skills, integrity, attention-to-details, hard work and smart work if my application is favourably considered and granted.\n\nPlease find attached, copies of my resume,cover letter and other professional certifications for your perusal.\n\nThank you.\n\nYours faithfully,\n\n \n\nADEWALE ADESOLA KAYODE\n\n          08034112669",https://www.linkedin.com/in/adewale-adesola-3a8a3b313,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729335303522_ADEWALE ADESOLA CV.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-19T10:55:06.578Z,2024-10-19T10:55:06.578Z,,,,,,,,,
