67139283cb112788c38cb5e4,Temilade Adeyemi,+23409019296074,temiladeadeyemi111@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am Temilade, an accounting graduate from Obafemi Awolowo University. I am excited with the opportunity to join the finance team at Tobams Group as a Financial Analyst Intern. This will allow me to pursue my strong interest in financial analysis while also contributing to crucial decision-making. \n\nWith less than a year of experience as a financial analyst intern, I have gained a solid practical understanding of how detailed financial planning and analysis are critical to operations, as well as how clear insights generated by in-depth financial analysis can help to make good decisions such as identifying cost-cutting opportunities and increasing company profitability. This experience has fueled my desire to become a world-class financial analyst. \n\nFurthermore, during my internship, I helped my teammates in understanding how their actions will impact the company's financial situation, as well as how the current economic landscape affects our business operations and financial status. I produce a weekly report that includes insights on our previous transactions and alternative ways to achieve our goals at optimal costs.\n\nIn addition, I contributed significantly to the establishment of the company's account reconciliation process, money cash budgets, revenue projections, variance analysis, cashflow optimization, and pricing strategies through research and analysis. I was in charge of overseeing the company's transition from traditional bookkeeping to Zoho, a software application for financial management. My accounting knowledge and eagerness to learn helped me succeed in this role. \n\nI have strong analytical skills, a keen attention to detail, financial modeling and analysis skills, solid communication and presentation skills, creative design principles, and a strong desire to learn. \n\nI am certain that I have the required skills to succeed as an intern Tobams Group and will have the opportunity to learn from an experienced team of finance professionals. I am looking forward to the opportunity to discuss my qualifications further.\n\nYours sincerely,\nTemilade Adeyemi",https://www.linkedin.com/in/temiladeadeyemi,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729335937306_Temilade Adeyemi CV.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-19T11:05:39.289Z,2024-10-19T11:05:39.289Z,,,,,,,,,
