67139665cb112788c38cb603,Semilore Musa,+23408160443343,Semiloremusa@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a motivated professional with skills and experience in technology and research. I’m focused and eager to learn more, always looking to make a positive impact on those around me.\n\nCurrently, I work as a Senior Growth Associate at Utiva. In this role, I develop strategies to increase revenue while keeping expenses in check. I use my analytical skills and financial tools to create plans that help us grow.\n\nBefore this, I was an Administrative Manager at RCCG Tower of David, where I handled all financial analysis. I have a solid understanding of financial statements, which helps me assess performance and find ways to improve. I'm skilled in Microsoft Excel, which I use to manage financial data and create reports.\n\nI adapt well to new situations and enjoy learning. Teamwork is important to me, and I love collaborating with others to achieve our goals. I'm good at analyzing financial data to uncover insights that can drive growth. \n\nI believe I would be a valuable addition to your team",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729336930765_Musa Semilore .A..pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-19T11:22:13.533Z,2024-10-19T11:22:13.533Z,,,,,,,,,
