a.\nasemaameena@gmail.com\n07068252343",https://www.linkedin.com/in/aminat-asema-098872182,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729337161204_Aminat Asema CV.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-19T11:26:03.600Z,2024-10-19T11:26:03.600Z,,,,,,,,,
