6714af6fcb112788c38cb99c,Blessing inyang,+23408144185914,blessinginyang655@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi I’m inyang blessing. A recent graduate in higher national diploma (HND) in computer Science from Lagos city polytechnic. I have background skills in data analysis and virtual analysis. I have experience as an assistant teacher and also as an intern in calerose ventures. My skills set includes proficiency in Microsoft office suits, power bi, sql and google workspace, along with the ability to manage administrative tasks, handle data entry and provide executive supports. I am passionate about contributing to efficient decision-making processes and driving operations improvements. 1 am looking to explore new opportunities in finance analysis and entry-level data role ",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729408877280_blessing inyang .pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-20T07:21:19.982Z,2024-10-20T07:21:19.982Z,,,,,,,,,
6714af9fcb112788c38cb9a1,Opemipo,+2347052541532,opemipo428@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm currently a recent graduate who pursued a Bachelor’s degree in Finance at the University of Lagos, where I've developed a solid foundation in financial concepts like business finance, econometrics, and accounting. Beyond academics, I've had hands-on experience managing financial operations as the Head of Finance at the Selfless Hearts Foundation, where I was responsible for cash management, budgeting, and building strong relationships with investors. These experiences taught me how to manage financial processes in real-world settings.\nI am a detailed-oriented and analytical person with strong interest in finance, I have developed skills in financial modeling, data analysis and market research where I was a member of a team who won a data analysis Hackathon. I’m excited to join TOBAMS GROUP and contribute to innovative financial solutions. My goal is to learn from experienced professionals and gain valuable insights.\nOutside of academics and my profession, I enjoy staying active through reading or playing football, I’m also passionate about financial literacy and volunteering as I helped drive financially literacy on my campus as the co-lead at Cowrywise for the unilag ambassadors community.",www.linkedin.com/in/opemipo-williams,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729408924654_WILLIAMS OPEMIPO CV.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-20T07:22:07.231Z,2024-10-20T07:22:07.231Z,,,,,,,,,
