6714c3c1cb112788c38cb9ea,Chika Benita Njokuji,+2349055604771,chikabenita71@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am a Chartered Accountant with a progressive experience in accounting, auditing and finance operations, I am writing to express my strong interest in the Finance Analyst Intern position at Tobams Group. Your company's dedication to client success and process improvement aligns perfectly with my passion for utilizing financial expertise to drive strategic growth.\n\nDuring my internship at a consumer goods firm, Cic Integrated Services, I honed my analytical skills by tackling a significant challenge. The company faced discrepancies and unaccounted fund losses, prompting me to conduct an internal audit. Identified weaknesses in control procedures across Purchasing, Inventory, IT, and Accounting led me to develop and propose robust improvements. My recommendations, when implemented, led to an impressive 80% improvement in both accounts receivable and payable performance. This success ignited my passion for proactively identifying and resolving financial issues, ultimately leading me to pursue my Chartered Accountant qualification.\n\nBeyond my audit expertise, I possess a comprehensive understanding of accounting standards and procedures, adept at risk assessment, strategic planning, and clear reporting. My goal-oriented approach, coupled with meticulous attention to detail, ensures accuracy and efficiency in every task I undertake. My dedication to continuous learning ensures I remain at the forefront of the accounting landscape, ready to address your clients' evolving needs.\n\nI am confident that my proven track record of driving financial improvement, combined with my commitment to excellence and adherence to the highest ethical standards, makes me a valuable asset to your team. I am eager to leverage my skills and experience to contribute significantly to Tobams Group’s continued success.\nFor your consideration, I have attached my resume, which further details my qualifications and accomplishments. Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss my qualifications further in an interview.\n\nSincerely,\n\nNjokuji Chika, ACA\n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729414078723_NJOKUJI CHIKA BENITA _ CV (PDF).pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-20T08:48:01.079Z,2024-10-20T08:48:01.079Z,,,,,,,,,
6714c576cb112788c38cb9ef,Ofon-asaha Malachy Udowo,+23409035804954,asahamalachy@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Ofon-asaha Malachy, a Passionate Nigerian finance analyst who have a strong interest in investment valuations, financial modellings, etc. I am a qualified chartered accountant with the institute of chartered accountant of Nigeria and also have a masters in Business administration and have worked as an accountant for the past years which due to my habit of always introducing series of analysis in my financial reports my role was changed to that of a financial analysts thereby I don't only analyze financials but new investment ideas to test their viability using their provided expected cash flows factoring in inflation and other elements required in preparing a solid and reliable model.\n\nI am seeking an internship with a challenging environment like your establishment that will not only improve my skills but i will in turn contribute to the growth of your esteemed business. Thank you for your consideration.",www.linkedin.com/in/malachyofon,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729414516642_Ofon Malachy CV.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-20T08:55:18.764Z,2024-10-20T08:55:18.764Z,,,,,,,,,
