67152898cb112788c38cbaf2,Godspower Johnson ,+2347018984930,johnsongodspower52@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"I am currently pursuing an MSc in Finance at the University of Lagos, where I have developed a solid understanding of financial analysis, financial statements, and key financial ratios. With hands-on experience gained from my roles as a Payment Analyst and Data Analyst, I have honed my skills in analyzing large datasets, identifying trends, and producing accurate reports. I am highly proficient in Microsoft Excel and have a growing familiarity with financial modeling tools.\n\nIn addition to my academic and professional background, I am driven by an eagerness to learn and adapt to new environments. I thrive in collaborative settings and enjoy working on process improvement projects. During my time at Crystal Gaming (Betano), I was involved in optimizing payment processes and improving data accuracy, which aligns with your focus on system and process improvement.\n\nMy attention to detail and ability to derive actionable insights from data make me confident in contributing to financial reporting, budgeting, and forecasting. I am excited about the opportunity to expand my skills and grow with Tobams Group, and I look forward to contributing to the team’s success.\n\n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729439893555_JOHNSON INUMEHAGE GODSPOWER 3- Copy.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-20T15:58:16.257Z,2024-10-20T15:58:16.257Z,,,,,,,,,
