671602b3cb112788c38cbbfe,Eniola Olugbemi,+23408128908971,eniolaolugbemi60@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Eniola Olugbemi, and I am a graduate with a second class upper degree in Accounting and Education from Lagos State University. I am enthusiastic to apply my academic knowledge and skills in a dynamic environment as an intern.\n\nDuring my studies, I completed internship at Lance Trends Limited, where I gained practical experience in financial analysis and Budgeting.\n\nI possess strong analytical skills, effective communication abilities, and a collaborative mindset. I am proficient in Microsoft suite and have a keen interest in financial and data analysis.\n\nI am passionate about the finance and investment market as well as business analysis. I believe in continuous learning and am excited about the opportunity to contribute to Tobams Group while developing my professional skills.\n\nI look forward to bringing my passion for the finance industry to your team and contributing to impactful projects.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729495729698_Eniola Olugbemi CV.docx,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-21T07:28:51.511Z,2024-10-21T07:28:51.511Z,,,,,,,,,
