67160f53cb112788c38cbc16,Okikioluwa Karunwi,+2347059140097,karunwiokikioluwa@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Sure! So, I’m Okikioluwa Karunwi, but you can call me Kiki! I’ve spent the past five years diving deep into the world of data analysis—playing with numbers, building predictive models, and turning data into stories that help companies make smarter decisions. You could say I’m the kind of person who gets a little too excited about Excel spreadsheets and Tableau dashboards.\n\nFrom helping companies boost customer acquisition by 20% to improving financial reporting accuracy by 15%, I've had some pretty exciting wins. I'm always up for a challenge and love finding patterns in chaos (data, in this case!).\n\nOutside of work, I’m big on continuous learning and constantly experimenting with new tools to level up my game. I’m also a huge fan of tech, coffee, and football!\n",https://kikitheanalyst.github.io/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729498960926_Karunwi Okikioluwa DATA ANALYST RESUME CV.pdf,67113e3ecb112788c38cad6a,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-21T08:22:43.174Z,2024-10-21T08:22:43.174Z,,,,,,,,,
