6717ba7add7522120ce4872d,Orru Temisan Osesuwa,+2348165391290,misanorru@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Orru Temisan, a dedicated and passionate Product Designer with a strong background in UI/UX design, user research, and creating seamless digital experiences. Over the past few years, I’ve worked on diverse projects across industries, focusing on building user-friendly, intuitive products that solve real-world problems.\n\nIn my current role as a UI/UX Designer at Africa Exchange, I’ve had the opportunity to work on end-to-end product design processes. From conducting user research to developing wireframes and high-fidelity prototypes, I strive to ensure that the user remains at the heart of every design decision. My hands-on experience with tools like Figma, Adobe XD, and Framer has allowed me to bring creative ideas to life, while my attention to detail ensures that these ideas translate into functional, high-quality user experiences.\n\nI have also contributed to the design of mobile and web applications like the Invio E-Commerce App and HRS App, where I collaborated with cross-functional teams to implement impactful design solutions that address user pain points. My goal is always to make the user journey as simple and enjoyable as possible while ensuring the product meets business objectives.\n\nIn terms of personal traits, I’m known for my adaptability and problem-solving mindset, particularly in fast-paced environments. I’m always eager to learn and grow, whether it's exploring new design trends, collaborating with teams, or incorporating feedback to improve designs.\n\nIn my next role, I’m looking to bring my creativity, user-centric approach, and technical skills to a team where I can contribute to creating meaningful, innovative products while continuing to grow professionally.",https://victorious-shares-452097.framer.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729608312677_resume_orru_temisan.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) 