6717bb50dd7522120ce48765,Anene Emmanuel Ebube ,+2348134708425,bubez18@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an experienced UI/UX Designer who has worked in building a product from scratch, occupying leadership roles in this journey, and also have experience working with a cross-functional team. Over the years, I have fused my knowledge in philosophy and design to enhance customer satisfaction in business.\nI am a passionate, self-driven individual who lives by Kaizen, Feng Shui, Existentialism, and Care Ethics philosophy.\nI am interested in customer satisfaction as a model for business development which can be seen in the products I have developed, enhanced, and my Long Essay.\nMy career goals include working and developing a product that solves humanity's problems.\n",https://www.behance.net/aneneemmanuel1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729608525721_Emmanuel Anene Resume.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-22T14:48:48.936Z,2024-10-22T14:48:48.936Z,,,,,,,,,
