6717bd20dd7522120ce487b5,Patricia Adonduwa ,+23408107421670,idikwu2patricia@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Patricia Adonduwa, a UX designer with over three years of experience. As a computer science graduate, I initially focused on software development. However, my passion for understanding user needs led me to pursue UX design. Through dedicated coursework and internships, I've developed my skills in creating effective and user-friendly systems.\nI believe that successful design requires a balance between functionality and value. \n\nWhen I'm not designing, I enjoy exploring culinary arts, finding parallels between the creative processes of design and cooking.",https://www.behance.net/patriciaidikwu_i3cia,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729608989961_Patricia Adonduwa Resume.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-22T14:56:32.917Z,2024-10-22T14:56:32.917Z,,,,,,,,,
