6717bdaadd7522120ce487d9,Damilola Theresa,+2348022512536,damilolalove45@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a UI/UX and graphic designer with a strong foundation in creating intuitive and visually appealing designs. I hold a degree in English and Psychology from the University of Lagos and gained my design skills through the Google UX Design course. My experience includes leading the design for Gidillo, a real estate platform, where I successfully improved the user experience and interface. I’m proficient in tools like Figma and Photoshop and keep up with design trends through podcasts and communities. I’m passionate about crafting modern, user-friendly designs that tell a story.",https://www.behance.net/damilolakinwan1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729609127988_Akinwande Damilola's Cv (1).pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-22T14:58:50.423Z,2024-10-22T14:58:50.423Z,,,,,,,,,
