6717bdf5dd7522120ce487f5,Oyindamola Ogunsola,+2348033782241,ogunsola.irene@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a UX with a background in Frontend development and operations management. I currently hold two Design certifications in UX design and HCD from Google and Acumen Academy, a degree in Computer science .\n\nIn my current role as a Freelance UX Designer, I have acquired hands-on experience in planning, conducting, and analyzing user research and usability testing. By gathering insights directly from users, I have informed design decisions and improved the overall user experience of various products such as Tradapay , Strim, Techfleet Project, and iaNigeria to highlight a few.\n\nYou will find attached my resume  and portfolio at \nhttps://oyindamolaogunsola.netlify.app/ . \nYou can also explore more of my profile and design on LinkedIn \nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/oyindamola-ogunsola",https://oyindamolaogunsola.netlify.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729609201695_oyindamola-ogunolaCV.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-22T15:00:05.310Z,2024-10-22T15:00:05.310Z,,,,,,,,,
6717be49dd7522120ce487fb,Moses Jacob,+23408129263881,mosesalika@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Moses Jacob and I have more than five years of experience in the design of software products and thus am certain that I would be a valuable addition to your organization by implementing the right product vision and driving it to success.\n\nMy current position at Faramove has enabled me to refine my skills in the process of collaboration with all members of the team including Product Managers, Engineers, Researchers etc., to define both long-term strategies and immediate steps for a variety of product solutions. I am skilled at getting things off the ground and conducting thought-provoking sessions or workshops that make sure everyone is on the same page with product direction; therefore, the final product is coherent and workable.\n\nMy background includes creating design prototypes and wireframes with, whereas, multi-channel interactions were considered in the product development process. I overlook as well as help with execution of concepts and usability testing of which are used to confirm designs, and I do not just remain passive to such events, but rather I am also present in design reviews as I regularly expose my work to the design team and the managers of the business.\n\nI adopt a user-focused approach towards my work and have a solid grasp of business requirements. I am capable of executing broadly defined, airy conceptions as well as strictly defined, tactical deliverables. My ability to come up with collaborative, practical decisions is based on a complete understanding of our products, services, and the latest software and OS standards.\n\nMy skills also include planning at the level of the entire system or suite of products, thus ensuring that the design decisions are drawn with the full context in mind. I am fluent in the latest Figma version and leading by example with clear, accessible design principles. Additionally, I have expertise in Agile and other common project management models, as well as some exposure to Developer workflows and tools.\n\nThroughout my past jobs, I have been in tight connection with the Design and Development Teams, engaged in the process of producing standard UI components, the design of screens, and exposing the experience. Along with that, I managed to support getting the Design Principals that we defined and refined properly across our product suite, and also I collaborated with the Design System team to alter existing components and add new ones.\n\nThe opportunity to apply my skills and gain more experience at your company highly excites me. I am confident that my software product design experience, user-centered approach, and preferred working style are among the traits that shall certainly affect your team’s performance and hence the company’s product line up.",behance.net/mosesalika,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729609286831_Moses Jacob Resume.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-22T15:01:29.159Z,2024-10-22T15:01:29.159Z,,,,,,,,,
6717be52dd7522120ce48800,Kafayat Azeez,+2348102538047,kaffyzeez@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a motivated virtual assistant and content creator with a focus on social media management. I have recently completed a course on virtual assistance, where I learned valuable skills like content creation, data entry, and project management. I have hands-on experience in video editing and managing social media accounts. I’m passionate about helping brands grow their online presence and engage with their audience. I’m excited about the opportunity to learn and contribute as a Social Media Manager Intern.",https://kaffyzeez.my.canva.site/design-branding-portfolio-website-in-white-grey-black-light-classic-minimal-style,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729609295782_Kafayat Azeez Resume.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-22T15:01:38.641Z,2024-10-22T15:01:38.641Z,,,,,,,,,
