6717c704dd7522120ce488e3,Busayo Popoola ,+23407062713735,popoolabusayo2009@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I currently cannot record videos \nHi, my name is Oluwabusayo Popoola, and I'm excited to share a little bit about myself with you. I’m a social media manager, content creator, with a basic graphic designing skill and writing scenarios skills and  a strong passion for building impactful digital experiences. I have been managing social media accounts for brands like Rahapay Technology LTD, Beejoy Couture, and Studit Designs, helping them grow their online presence.\nMy soft skills are :\nAdaptability \nEffective communication \nTeam work\nGoal planning \nStrategic thinking \nTime management \n\nIn my recent role, I’ve been responsible for content strategy development, social media analytics, and creating engaging content for platforms like Instagram, TikTok, and Facebook. I’ve used tools like Metricool for analytics, Canva for graphic design, and Adobe Premiere Pro for video editing. My experience also includes creating detailed content calendars, planning campaigns, and engaging directly with communities across different platforms.\n\nI believe I’m a great fit for this role because I have a combination of creative design skills, social media management experience, and a deep understanding of how to engage and grow audiences online. I am committed to improving my skills continuously, and I’m confident that my passion for digital marketing, alongside my hands-on experience, would bring valuable contributions to your team.",https://eu.docworkspace.com/d/sIOab2_78AcH43bgG,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729611521329_Busayo Popoola Resume.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-22T15:38:44.043Z,2024-10-22T15:38:44.043Z,,,,,,,,,
