6717c78add7522120ce488f9,Onyinye Anene Michelle,+2347046490653,onyinyemitchelle@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Anene Onyinye. I am a graduate of Covenant University with a degree in managemnt Information system. I am a product designer and I have a strong passion for creating aesthetically pleasing designs, solving user problems, creating a user friendly and seamless Interface for users.\nIn my previous role, I successfully worked on the mobile application for an E-Commerce website which yielded satisfaction while working alongside with the developers. I am proficient in Figma and I believe I have what it takes to design and deliver functional user interfaces that meet the requirements of the project.",https://www.behance.net/onyinyeanene,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729611655635_Onyinye Anene's CV.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-22T15:40:58.053Z,2024-10-22T15:40:58.053Z,,,,,,,,,
6717c7b6dd7522120ce488ff,Mba Ugochi Blessing Chisom ,+23408159117433,ugochisom.mba@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Chisom Mba, a Nigerian based writer.\n\nNaturally driven to write, I am passionate about helping people gain knowledge about various topics, serving as a middle man between the people and their desired knowledge and also helping them express themselves to gain business opportunities. Since I was little, I had always loved creative writing and I decided to go into creative writing as a job.\n\nNevertheless, I've also taken courses on content writing and gone into freelance writing.\n\nWriting to help businesses and help people express themselves has been my passion. I have been able to equip myself with the necessary skills needed to be a content writer.\nAs a teenager, I've already been privileged to have experiences in working as a content writer and social media manager for various firms to help them grow their businesses.\n\nMost of my write ups were aimed at helping businesses grow and get better and I was excited to see your job offer as it is what I have experience in.\n\nOf course, I'm open to learning and corrections.\n\nMy ability to work well in a team and my willingness to learn helped me greatly in my previous experiences.\n\n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729611699774_RESUME -2.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-22T15:41:42.587Z,2024-10-22T15:41:42.587Z,,,,,,,,,
