6717d77fdd7522120ce48af7,Glory Dominic ,+23409121245097,glorydominic.va@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a social media manager with five years of experience, and I absolutely love creating content that resonates with people. My passion lies in helping brands connect authentically with their audiences and using creativity to drive growth. I enjoy the challenge of blending storytelling with analytics to craft posts that not only look good but also get results.\n\nWhen I'm not working, you can usually find me with a good book, watching movies, playing games or exploring exploring new places. I also love trying out new recipes in the kitchen sometimes they turn out great, and other times... well, let's just say it's a work in progress. Spending quality time with my family is really important to me, too. I believe that every day is an opportunity to learn something new, and I try to bring that curiosity and enthusiasm into my work.",https://thelakesideretreats.com/glory-dominic-portfolio-,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729615740808_Glory Dominic SOCIAL MEDIA MANAGER .pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-22T16:49:03.464Z,2024-10-22T16:49:03.464Z,,,,,,,,,
