6717db4ddd7522120ce48bdb,Obianuju Rosejoy Eze,+23408104958497,ezerosejoy@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI'm currently working with Sokloz Travels as an Administrative Assistant.\nI have worked with The Hebrews Shelters Real Estate and Construction Company Limited as a Customer Service Representative and Human Resource Personnel, while I freelance as a graphics and UX Designer.\nI worked with Landlords Agents Limited as a Clerk, where we manage client properties,\nI have been creating content for two years now.\nI concluded my NYSC program in 2021 at Vision FM, Katsina State, Nigeria.\nI was an active member of the academic project [Automatic Display Board] and have gained practical knowledge during the project tenure. I also attended an Industrial Training program at Aso Radio and Television Abuja Nigeria, where I learned about Editing using Adobe Audition, and Adobe Lightroom, I have other skills like Creating Animations (text, video, whiteboard, and cartoon), all kinds of Graphics designing using Canva, making video ads, social media management.\n\nI am a very fast learner, organized, I am a go-getter, I pay Strong Attention to details, I am Organized, a Team Player, compassionate, Empathetic, Dedicated, Resilient, Exceptional Communication skills, Punctual, and an excellent work ethic, reading, writing and a great thinker.\n\nThis offers an excellent opportunity that aligns greatly with my career goals and aspirations.\n\nBelow is the link to my LinkedIn URL:\n\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/obianuju-rosejoy-b1988024a\n\nAnd attached below is my CV for your perusal, as I look forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest Regards,\nezerosejoy@gmail.com\nObianuju Rosejoy Eze.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729616713524_My Updated CV.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-22T17:05:17.308Z,2024-10-22T17:05:17.308Z,,,,,,,,,
