6717e1eadd7522120ce48ec5,Dada Korede Samuel,+2347017155943,korededada2000@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Dada Korede Samuel, a recent graduate with a strong foundation in political science. However, I am an ACCA affiliate with experience in financial analysis, having worked on tasks such as conducting horizontal analysis, creating automated Excel models, and providing insights on company performance. My background includes an internship in audit at KPMG, where I gained valuable exposure to financial reporting and analysis. I am highly proficient in Excel and enjoy using data to solve complex problems and provide actionable insights.\n\nI am particularly excited about the Financial Analyst internship at Tobams Group because it aligns with my skills and desire to contribute to impactful projects. I’m eager to apply my analytical skills and learn from industry professionals while contributing to the team’s success.\n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729618408809_DADA KOREDE SAMUEL CV 10-09-24.pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T17:33:30.169Z,2024-10-22T17:33:30.169Z,,,,,,,,,
6717e207dd7522120ce48ecf,Daniel Adeshina,+2349132367622,danielxiah@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Thank you for the opportunity to introduce myself. I recently graduated with a First-Class degree in Economics from the University of Lagos, where I developed a deep understanding of financial markets, economic theory, and quantitative analysis. During my time at university, I was actively involved in extracurricular competitions and achieved several notable accomplishments, such as being the First Runner-Up in the 2023 ARM Young Talent Program Competition and a Top 5 global performer in the AmplifyME M&A Simulation. These experiences enhanced my teamwork and analytical skills, providing me with exposure to real-world financial scenarios.\n\nIn addition to my academic background, I have gained valuable practical experience through internships with leading firms such as ARM Holding Co. Limited, where I worked as an Investment Banking Summer Analyst. I was involved in financial modeling, due diligence, and market research, which helped sharpen my financial analytical skills. My role in a $1.3 million M&A deal at Sthenic Finance and Advisory was particularly rewarding, as I had the opportunity to contribute to the successful execution of a major telecommunication transaction. These experiences have strengthened my proficiency in analyzing financial statements, building valuation models, and conducting market and competitive analysis.\n\nMoreover, I have earned certifications such as the Financial Modelling and Valuation Analyst (FMVA) and Bloomberg Market Concept (BMC), which have equipped me with advanced technical skills in financial analysis, data interpretation, and market forecasting. I am highly proficient with Excel and Bloomberg, both of which are essential tools for a Financial Analyst role.\n\nWhat drives me is my passion for understanding the intricacies of financial markets and helping companies make data-driven decisions. I am particularly interested in Tobams Group because of its strong commitment to innovative asset management strategies and its focus on delivering long-term value to clients. I believe my skills in financial analysis, along with my dedication to ethical and effective financial practices, align well with Tobams Group’s mission.\n\nIn the long term, I see myself contributing to the firm by leveraging my analytical expertise and strategic thinking to help make informed investment decisions that benefit both clients and the firm. I’m excited about the opportunity to be part of a dynamic team where I can continue to grow and make a meaningful impact.",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1rdRgF-BRsDcgjCD-_63OphCTv0vEhWZX?usp=sharing,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729618436556_Resume Daniel FS.pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T17:33:59.000Z,2024-10-22T17:33:59.000Z,,,,,,,,,
6717e215dd7522120ce48ed6,Charles Okoh,+23409020348908,charlesokoh25@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an accounting graduate with first class honors with skills in financial analysis, reconciliation of accounts\nMy core values are integrity, eager to learn , a fast learner e.t.c\nI also have experience in accounting software like sage one accounting also can use Microsoft excel like pivot table and vlookup in summarizing large a.kung of datas",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729618450955_CHARLES OKOH CV .pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T17:34:13.407Z,2024-10-22T17:34:13.407Z,,,,,,,,,
6717e220dd7522120ce48edb,inma kokpa,+2348143542775,kokpainma@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an experienced accountant with a B.Sc. in Accounting from the University of Port Harcourt and over five years of diverse experience across various sectors, including interior design, retail, and academia. In my current role as an Internal Audit Officer at Babriscom Global Ventures, I manage daily audits, confirm transaction accuracy, and ensure compliance with organizational policies.\n\nPreviously, I worked as an accountant for EMO Design, an interior decor company, where I handled project budgeting, vendor payments, cash flow management, and financial reporting. My experience at EMO Design honed my skills in managing project finances, client billing, and inventory valuation, all of which are critical in the design industry.\n\nI am highly skilled in the use of QuickBooks, Sage50, and Microsoft Excel for tasks such as bookkeeping, report generation, and financial analysis. Additionally, I am an Associate Accounting Technician certified by the Association of Accounting Technicians West Africa, with my ICAN certification currently in view.\n\nI am a detail-oriented professional with a passion for accuracy and excellence, and I thrive in roles where I can contribute to financial planning and decision-making to drive organizational success.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/inma-kokpa-bsc-aat-6b2116226?utm_source=share&utm_campaign=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=android_app,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729618462608_KOKPA INMA SAM CV.docx,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T17:34:24.942Z,2024-10-22T17:34:24.942Z,,,,,,,,,
