6717e7b0dd7522120ce490a1,Eneghetaziba Anita Eze,+23408187581714,ezeanitae@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a highly motivated, results-driven, forward-thinking accountant with a strong focus on delivering value through innovative, tech-savvy solutions. With my educational background in accounting, finance, and commercial training, combined with my proactive working style, proficiency in Excel, and strong communication skills, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to the team.\n\nPassionate about learning and growing in the finance field, I seek to gain hands-on experience in financial analysis, reporting, modeling, budgeting, forecasting, and data management while contributing to a dynamic start-up environment.\n\nI have a foundation in accounting principles and practices. I am particularly adept at using various remote working and IT systems, including Excel, Google Spreadsheet, etc., which I understand is advantageous for this role. My independent and proactive working style ensures that I can take initiative and work effectively without constant supervision\n\nFurthermore, I possess excellent communication skills, both written and verbal, which enable me to interact effectively with colleagues and external stakeholders. My expert attention to detail skills allows me to articulate complex information clearly and concisely, ensuring smooth communication across all levels of the organization.\n\nI thrive in collaborative environments and quickly adapt to challenging situations. I am seeking a role where I can utilize my skills to plan, manage, and execute complex projects as part of a dynamic team. With excellent presentation abilities, I bring a proactive approach to problem-solving and analytical thinking. I approach challenges with enthusiasm, persistence, resilience, and determination, consistently driving results.\n\nI want to develop my potential in an organization dedicated to nurturing talent and providing ample opportunities for career advancement and extraordinary development possibilities to be a specialist in solving real-world financial analysis tasks, collaborating with experienced professionals, and growing my expertise in a supportive and engaging environment. I want to work with a goal-getting company with corporate work ethics in a multicultural environment and moral principles that impact life-changing values. \n\nI am excited about the opportunity to bring my skills and enthusiasm to Tobams Group as a Financial Analyst Intern. I am confident that my eagerness to learn and diligence for excellent performance will make me a valuable asset to your team.\n\nThank you.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729619885351_E. Anita Eze - CV.pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T17:58:08.039Z,2024-10-22T17:58:08.039Z,,,,,,,,,
6717e7b2dd7522120ce490a6,IyinOluwa Favour Badejo,+23409023428792,iyinoluwa8@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a detail-oriented data analyst with a strong foundation in accounting, audit, and risk control. With a first-class honors degree in Accounting from Christopher University, I have worked on ensuring the accuracy of financial statements, performing tax audits, and conducting risk assessments to maintain compliance with regulatory standards. My experience also includes working as an Accounting and Administrative Intern, where I assisted with audits and the preparation of financial statements for multiple companies. \n\nIn addition to my audit and risk control expertise, I have developed strong data analysis skills, creating interactive dashboards and leveraging tools like Power BI, Excel, SQL, and Python to extract actionable insights. I am passionate about using data to drive decision-making and have applied my skills to projects across the financial and sports sectors. I am eager to contribute to solutions that combine risk management and data-driven strategies.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729619888276_BADEJO IYINOLUWA CV...pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T17:58:10.538Z,2024-10-22T17:58:10.538Z,,,,,,,,,
