6717eb82dd7522120ce4914e,ADEBAYO ADEOYE,+23408081172460,adebayoadeoye4eva@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"As a Senior Account Officer at Dangote Industries Limited, I manage the accounting and financial operations of the manufacturing division, one of the largest and most diversified in Africa. I ensure compliance, accuracy, and efficiency in all aspects of accounting systems and records, using SAP software to perform audits, analysis, and reporting on financial data.\n\nWith a B.Sc. in Accounting and Finance from Lagos State University and several certifications from the Corporate Finance Institute, I have a strong academic foundation and a rich 6+ years of experience in the accounting and finance field. I have contributed to the financial performance and growth of various companies in Nigeria, such as FAE Limited and Ocean Lord Limited, where I handled book-keeping, payroll analysis, financial reporting, and accounts reconciliation. I am proficient in a range of accounting skills, such as financial accounting, account reconciliation, and manufacturing process improvement. My goal is to deliver strategic financial solutions and foster fiscal excellence for businesses.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729620864543_Adebayo_Adeoye_CV[1].docx,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T18:14:26.512Z,2024-10-22T18:14:26.512Z,,,,,,,,,
