6717edf1dd7522120ce49187,Oloyede Ganiyu,+2348083374198,oloyegan98@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Ganiyu, I recently graduated with a bachelor's degree in economics, where I gained a strong foundation in financial analysis, economic modelling, and data interpretation. In addition, I have earned certifications in Financial Modelling & Valuation (FMVA) and Business Intelligence & Data Analytics (BIDA), which have further sharpened my technical and analytical skills.\nI recently work as an Assistant Accountant at a firm specializing in generator engine repairs and sales. In this role, I handle a variety of financial responsibilities, including managing financial records and analyzing financial statements. This position has enhanced my attention to detail and problem-solving capabilities, both of which are critical in finance.\nI am proficient in financial analysis tools such as Excel, EViews, and SPSS, which I have applied in both my academic and professional work. My long-term goal is to apply my analytical skills to help businesses make data-driven financial decisions. I am particularly drawn to this Financial Analyst Intern role because it aligns with my aspirations to grow in the finance sector while leveraging my economics background to contribute to meaningful financial evaluations and strategies.",www.linkedin.com/in/ganiyu-oloyede-40780b221,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729621487332_my resume.pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T18:24:49.340Z,2024-10-22T18:24:49.340Z,,,,,,,,,
