6717eec2dd7522120ce491a3,Muti-Onikoyi Semiat ,+2348124453929,ajileonikoyi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m currently a graduate with a degree in Business Administration, and I have a strong interest in financial analysis. Over the course of my studies, I developed a solid foundation in financial management, accounting, and data analysis. I’ve also worked on projects that involved using tools like Excel and SQL to analyze data and generate insights. I’m eager to apply my analytical skills, attention to detail, and passion for finance in a hands-on environment through this internship, where I can contribute to the team while continuing to grow and learn.",https://github.com/Yourmaskguy,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729621696440_semiat resume.pdf.pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T18:28:18.448Z,2024-10-22T18:28:18.448Z,,,,,,,,,
