6717f062dd7522120ce491b5,Fowosere Sunkanmi Afis,+2348067851773,fowoplay4real@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an ambitious, confident and creative individual. I hold a bachelor's degree in Economics and a professional master's degree in business administration and management (MBA) from the University of Ilorin, Nigeria. I am also an Accounting Technician of the Institute of chartered accountants of Nigeria.\n\nI have some years of experience as a project supervisor at the Oyo state security trust fund and have assisted SMEs in finding solutions to their business and accounting challenges virtually. During these periods, I have learned how use financial statements and manage budgets for my organisation and clients. I can fairly state that I have a good knowledge of business operations, financial reporting standards such as IFRS and the interplay of business, finance and accounting within the framework of an economy. \n\n I am a highly committed individual who loves to boost the efficiency and effectiveness of an organization through team collaboration and shared responsibilities. And with my skills, as well as my knowledge in finance, I am certain I am ready to take up this internship role and offer value in return.\n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729622112281_FOWOSERE CV - TOBAMS.pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T18:35:14.440Z,2024-10-22T18:35:14.440Z,,,,,,,,,
6717f0aadd7522120ce491ba,Bako Al-Mustapha Muhammad,+2349078451012,almustymbako54@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Bako Al-Mustafa Muhammad, a Chartered Accountant, graduating with First Class Honors in Accounting from Al-Hikmah University. With a strong foundation in financial analysis, reporting and strategic planning, I have developed key skills that enable me to contribute effectively in dynamic environments. My leadership experience as President of the Nigerian University Accounting Students Association (NUASA) has honed my ability to manage teams, manage finances and engage them\n\nI am particularly drawn to Tobams Group’s mission of empowering African tech talent and driving sustainable growth through innovation. My research on the effect of audit quality on tax aggressiveness in Nigeria’s financial sector strengthened my analytical capabilities and attention to detail, both of which I am eager to apply to real-world challenges at Tobams Group. I believe my adaptability, problem-solving mindset, and strategic approach make me a great fit for this role.",www.linkedin.com/in/al-mustapha-muhammad-bako-aat-aca-937b73289,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729622184433_BAKO ALMUSTAPHA MUHAMMAD  CV copy.docx,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T18:36:26.624Z,2024-10-22T18:36:26.624Z,,,,,,,,,
6717f15add7522120ce491ce,Fawaz Kazeem ,+2348129538302,kazeemfawaz2207@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Fawaz Kazeem, a dedicated finance enthusiast with a strong academic background. I hold an Advanced Diploma in Taxation and Fiscal Policy which has equipped me with specialized expertise in tax management and planning. Additionally, I'm a first-class graduate of economics, showing my analytical skills and understanding of economic and financial principles. I am not only an Associate Accounting Technician (AAT), but I'm also currently pursuing the ACA qualification to further enhance my proficiency in accounting and financial reporting. My achievements include being an Institute of Chartered Accountants of Nigeria (ICAN) prize winner for emerging as the overall best student in quantitative analysis and Lagos State University (LASU) academic scholar. Beyond academics, I've taken part in several job simulations including the New York Job CEO Council financial analyst job simulation as well as a Campus Ambassador for Cowrywise, promoting financial literacy among my peers which reflects my commitment to fostering financial awareness. ",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729622360118_RESUME.pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T18:39:22.511Z,2024-10-22T18:39:22.511Z,,,,,,,,,
6717f268dd7522120ce491e2,Friday Isioma Lauren,+2349032434994,fridaylauren16@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Lauren. I hold a bachelor’s degree in Accounting from the university of Lagos and I have spent the past few months equipping myself by taking relevant training courses online. I have good problem solving skills which I demonstrated in a recently concluded school project with the ability to also work collaboratively with cross-functional team. I am also a fast learner and a good communicator. Outside of work and academics, I’m passionate about volunteering for foundations where I volunteer to empower young minds. In the long run, I am looking for new opportunities to expand on my skill set particularly in finance hence why this role in Tobams Group appeals to me.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729622630314_Lauren Friday_CV.pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T18:43:52.624Z,2024-10-22T18:43:52.624Z,,,,,,,,,
6717f2e1dd7522120ce491f5,Goodluck Chibunna Anosike,+2347031676051,goodluckanosike31@gmail.com,Nigeria,"With a Bachelor's degree in Finance and Banking from the University of Port Harcourt, I am passionate about building a strong foundation in financial analysis and modeling. I bring hands-on experience from my work as a research analyst and my active role as president of the Finance and Investment Club, where I analyzed financial trends, developed reports, and led discussions on investment strategies. My adaptability and collaborative mindset align well with dynamic environments like Tobams Group, and I am eager to contribute my strong analytical skills, proficiency in Microsoft Excel, and keen attention to detail to the Financial Analyst Intern role.\nThroughout my academic and extracurricular engagements, I have honed my understanding of financial statements, key ratios, and data management. I have a track record of leadership and teamwork, where I collaborated on projects and continuously sought opportunities for process improvements. While I have some background in financial analysis, I am excited about the opportunity to deepen my knowledge through hands-on experience in budgeting, forecasting, and financial modeling at Tobams Group.\nI am eager to contribute to the finance team’s success while learning from experienced professionals and growing in the field.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729622750416_Goodluck resume.pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T18:45:53.198Z,2024-10-22T18:45:53.198Z,,,,,,,,,
