6717f46ddd7522120ce4920f,Shehu Abdurrafiu Audu,+23408136147900,creativedarah@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Good evening. My name is Shehu; an enthusiastic product designer, who is passionate about creating user-centered solutions that balance functionality and aesthetics. I roundup acquiring more knowledge about Product [UI/UX] design which has helped me develop skills in sketching, prototyping, and user research. Also, I am highly aspiring to further more about the knowledge and expertise in this field.\n\nI'm particularly interested in collaborating with cross-functional teams to understand the needs of users and contribute to meaningful products. My experience includes using design software such as Sketch and Figma, as well as conducting usability tests to gather feedback and iterate on designs. \n\nI'm excited to learn from experienced designers, tackle real-world challenges, and add a fresh perspective to the projects I'm involved in. Overall, I aim to enhance both user experience and product excellence.",https://connectwithme.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729623146819_MyRÃ©sumÃ©_2.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-22T18:52:29.314Z,2024-10-22T18:52:29.314Z,,,,,,,,,
