6717f63fdd7522120ce4922f,Opeyemi Bolanle Folarin ,+2347035056990,bolanledeborah2023@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Head (Human Resources Division),\n\n\n\nDear Sir/Ma,\n\nI am applying for the post of a Financial Analyst(Intern) in your highly reputable organization.\n\nI am especially thrilled to work in your company because I am proficient in preparation of budgets,financial models and analysis.It seems these skills would be put to great use in this role.\n\nI am a graduate of Ekiti State University, Ado-Ekiti with B.Sc. in Accounting, a member of the Institute of Chartered Accountant of Nigeria(ICAN),ACA  and also have Certification in Tax Practice. I am currently working in the health industry, have  experience in Real Estate Company as the Internal Auditor, and also worked with key distributors to P&G, Chi, and other FMCG industries. I have a background experience in Auditing, Finance and Accounting. I am proficient in the usage of Sage ERP, Microsoft office Suite (Microsoft Excel spreadsheet, word processing), knowledge of IFRS based financial statements and preparation of budgets,financial models  and analysis.\n\nI am interested in your post as it would expose me to more experience in work, and ability to wider consequences of financial decisions. My strong attention to details will be brought to the post as a proven ability to deal successfully and tactfully with clients, colleagues and stakeholders in order to achieve lasting positive impacts.\n\nI sincerely hope we have the opportunity to speak further so that I can share more about myself and the unique strengths I would bring to this role.\n\nFind attached my resume for your use.\n\nRegards,\n\nOpeyemi Bolanle Folarin",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729623612425_opeyemi cv.pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T19:00:15.579Z,2024-10-22T19:00:15.579Z,,,,,,,,,
