6717fb8bdd7522120ce49271,Patience Lami Mamman,+2348163855886,patiencemamman98@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a detail-oriented data analyst with hands-on experience in data collection, analysis, and visualization. In my current role as a Data Analyst intern at Thels Impact Consult, I’ve worked extensively with SQL, Microsoft Excel, and Tableau to deliver actionable insights. One of my key achievements has been creating dashboards that simplify complex data, such as university tuition fees, making it more accessible for users.\n\nI’ve also completed several data science and analytics training programs, including courses with Webfala Initiative and Cybersafe Foundation, where I developed expertise in data cleaning, interpretation, and visualization. My ability to analyze data from various sources and present clear, concise insights has been instrumental in improving decision-making processes.\n\nThrough these experiences, I’ve built strong analytical and problem-solving skills, which I am eager to apply in a financial context. I’m particularly excited about this Financial Analyst internship at Tobams Group because it will allow me to leverage my data skills while learning more about financial modeling, forecasting, and investment strategies. I’m confident that my attention to detail and passion for analyzing financial data will make me a valuable addition to your team.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/mamman-patience-792644189,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729624969036_Mamman Patience Resumeâ¦.pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T19:22:51.846Z,2024-10-22T19:22:51.846Z,,,,,,,,,
