67180582dd7522120ce49320,Kofoworola ADETONA,+2348022431383,adetonakofoworola@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Kofoworola Adetona, a penultimate student of university of Lagos, majoring in finance. I’m passionate about pursuing a career as a finance advisor, a tech expert and I also advocate for a seamless cross-border payments. I recently completed a one-month internship at a transportation company as a finance intern in Lagos where i developed my skills in analyzing financial data and also assisted in preparing financial statements. Beyond the four walls of the university, I dedicated time to personal development by enrolling in an analyst program where i have learnt different finance skills like Budgeting, Forecasting, investment and data analytics. My experience has enhanced my ability to work in a professional setting and also built my communication skills, teamwork and interpersonal relationships. I believe the opportunity to be part of this internship will further enhance my skills and prepare me for a greater role in finance and as well contribute positively to the team.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729627519970_Kofoworola Adetona F.A Resume.pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T20:05:22.179Z,2024-10-22T20:05:22.179Z,,,,,,,,,
