67180c74dd7522120ce49397,Fawole Toyosi Florence ,+2348184625915,fawoletoyosi09@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Throughout my academic and professional journey, I've developed strong communication, problem-solving, and adaptability skills. I'm confident that my enthusiasm, willingness to learn, and transferable skills make me an ideal candidate for this internship.\n\nPreviously, I worked as a Client Service Officer and Social Media Manager at Oasis & Oaks Educational Training Consult, where I managed social media platforms, created content, and engaged with clients. This experience has sparked my interest in social media management, and I'm excited to explore this field further.\n\nI'm particularly drawn to Tobams Group innovative approach to social media management and its commitment to excellence. I'm eager to learn from your team, contribute to exciting projects, and grow professionally.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I'm looking forward to discussing how my enthusiasm and eagerness to learn can contribute to your team's success.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729629296696_Fawole_Toyosi_PORTFOLIO_030214.pptx,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-22T20:35:00.322Z,2024-10-22T20:35:00.322Z,,,,,,,,,
