67182986dd7522120ce49472,Sonia Alexander Mshelbwala ,+23408033204366,soniamshelbwala@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Over the past few months, I’ve been on an exciting journey toward becoming a financial data analyst. I’m passionate about this field and have been actively building my skills\n\nI am writing to express my enthusiasm for the financial data analyst intern position. Let me tell you, there couldn't be a better candidate for this role than me. A few months ago, I made a deliberate decision to embark on the journey of becoming a financial data analyst, and ever since, I have been actively building the skills and knowledge to succeed in this field. I’ve attached a link to my first post about starting this journey, and I hope it highlights how committed I’ve been from day one.\n\nIn these past few months, I’ve completed courses in Excel, and still ongoing courses in Google Data Analytics, Power BI, gaining hands-on experience in data analysis, visualization, and financial modeling. While I may not have years of experience, my drive, dedication, and the solid foundation I’ve built make me confident that I’m the best fit for this role. Who else better to take on this challenge than someone who has already set themselves on this path and is eager to contribute?\n\nThis opportunity feels like the perfect next step for me to put my knowledge into action and continue growing in this field. I am excited about the possibility of joining your team and further honing my skills as I work towards becoming a top financial data analyst. This role would not only allow me to gain real-world experience but also provide me with the chance to make meaningful contributions to your organization.\n\nI’m incredibly excited about this opportunity and would deeply appreciate the chance to prove myself. Thank you for considering my application—I look forward to the possibility of working with you.\n\nSincerely,\nSonia Alexander Mshelbwala \n\n\nThe link to my first post regarding financial data analysis; \n\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/posts/sonia-mshelbwala-1bb278328_financialdata-dataanalytics-careergrowth-activity-7239702923478257664-SsjJ?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_android",https://spice-hubcap-e08.notion.site/Financial-Data-Analyst-Portfolio-1277a85d167b80078e2ec45a50e9ba67?pvs=4,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729636739745_My Resume.pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T22:39:02.313Z,2024-10-22T22:39:02.313Z,,,,,,,,,
67182b8cdd7522120ce4948c,Nsisong Benjamin Etuk,+2347039058595,nsisongetuk@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"I am a standards-driven, motivated, and hardworking Chartered Accountant with meticulous attention to detail skills, the ability to work accurately at pace, and a strong passion for helping the organization I work for achieve its financial and commercial objectives. \n\nAlso, I have about 6 years of work experience in Internal audit, internal control, risk management, cash management, and transaction services.\n\nHowever, I believe in continuous learning and development and I am passionate about learning and growing in the finance field specifically as a Financial Analyst.\n\nGiven the opportunity, I will apply myself with enthusiasm to all tasks, ensuring that I get the job done accurately and efficiently.\n\nI am excited about the prospects of working in this renowned establishment for career development and mutual benefits.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729637257415_CV OF NSISONG ETUK.JPG,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T22:47:40.160Z,2024-10-22T22:47:40.160Z,,,,,,,,,
67182c22dd7522120ce49492,Adelodun Oluwadamisi ,+2348067664734,dtinu72@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As a driven and ambitious professional with a Postgraduate Diploma in Management from University of Ibadan, School of Business, I am excited to apply for the financial internship at Tobams group. With a strong foundation in business principles, my diploma has equipped me with advanced knowledge of financial management, strategic planning and leadership.\n\nThroughout my academic journey, I developed robust analytical skills, a keen eye for detail and proficiency in financial analysis tools. My studies emphasized financial modeling, accounting,investment strategies and data-driven decision-making.\n\nI am eager to bring my skills and knowledge to a dynamic team like yours, contributing to financial planning, budgeting and performance analysis. This internship offers the ideal platform to hone my skills, expand professional networks and drive business growth.\n\nI am confident that my academic credentials, coupled with enthusiasm and a strong work ethic, make me an ideal candidate. I look forward to discussing how my expertise aligns with your organization's financial objectives.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729637407870_Damisi's Resume.docx.pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-22T22:50:10.298Z,2024-10-22T22:50:10.298Z,,,,,,,,,
