67189bdadd7522120ce4964e,Emmanuel Akos ,+2347011696211,akosemmanuel45@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Emmanuel Akos– Social Media Manager\n\nAs an experienced social media manager, I am passionate about leveraging digital platforms to build brand awareness, engage audiences, and drive business growth. I have a proven ability to develop and execute strategic social media campaigns across various platforms, including Instagram, Twitter (X), Facebook, LinkedIn, TikTok, and YouTube.\n\nWith a blend of creativity, data analysis, and community management, I specialize in curating compelling content that resonates with diverse audiences. My expertise extends to content planning, copywriting, graphic design collaboration, and social media scheduling using tools such as Hootsuite, Buffer, or Meta Business Suite. I stay current with the latest trends and platform algorithms, ensuring every campaign aligns with both brand goals and evolving user behaviors.\n\nAdditionally, I am highly skilled in tracking performance metrics and generating reports that provide actionable insights. I analyze key performance indicators (KPIs) such as engagement rates, follower growth, impressions, and conversions to optimize strategies. Working with cross-functional teams, I ensure campaigns align with broader business objectives, contributing to overall marketing efforts.\n\nThroughout my career, I’ve maintained a strong focus on fostering meaningful interactions within communities, providing excellent customer service, and building brand loyalty through authentic communication. Whether it’s managing influencer collaborations, running targeted ad campaigns, or engaging with audiences in real-time, I bring a proactive, solutions-oriented approach to social media management.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/emmanuel-akos-63a1a2307,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729666008036_CV_202405021048064-5.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-23T06:46:50.663Z,2