6718a427dd7522120ce496df,Adedamola Bamigboye,+2347062770716,Bamigboyedee@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Bamigboye Adedamola, a passionate Digital Product Designer and No-Code Developer with over two years of hands-on experience creating user-friendly digital solutions. My journey in design began in 2020, where I first explored graphic design, but I quickly transitioned into product design in 2021 after an enriching internship with Sidehustle. Since then, I’ve had the opportunity to work with Aspirelabs and Buni Consult, a Dublin-based design agency, where I designed and collaborated on various digital products that solve real-world problems.\nIn my current role as a freelance Digital Product Designer, I focus on delivering simple yet compelling user experiences that not only delight users but also drive tangible business outcomes. I’m particularly drawn to projects that challenge me to simplify complex workflows and advocate for UX and accessibility, making products as inclusive as possible.\nWhat sets me apart is my combination of design and no-code development skills. This allows me to prototype quickly and iterate designs with a deep understanding of what’s feasible technically. I believe that great products come from seamless collaboration between designers and engineers, and my technical proficiency helps bridge that gap.\nOutside of work, I’m deeply inspired by a wide range of creative interests—whether it's through my love for photography, African fiction, fashion, or even combat sports like boxing and MMA. These interests fuel my creativity and give me a unique perspective on design challenges.\nI’m always eager to learn and grow, and I’m excited about the opportunity to contribute my skills, passion, and creativity to a dynamic team focused on building impactful digital products.",https://www.notion.so/mrbamigboye/Adedamola-Bamigboye-115b8d875b8a80968627c2a4f19dc412,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729668132798_MrBamigboye'sCV.pdf,6