6718bcb2dd7522120ce4980f,Godwin Ndukwe,+2348185026136,gndukwepicture@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Godwin Ndukwe, I’m based in Lagos (Nigeria ). After my graduation from the university, I waited for my school to approve my result to enable me to for a compulsory 1 year National Youth Service required of every graduate in my country. It felt like it was taking a lot of time so I decided not to stay idle and ventured into learning How to make clothes and considering the fact that it’s hard to get jobs this days in Nigeria. So I needed a means of survival and I learnt and was making some money for myself and family. I eventually went for the Service in August 2023 and finished August 2024. I haven’t really done a remote job before but while at the fashion school. I took some other job roles which included (social media manager for the company, became the production Assistant manager). I even did some work for other brands (Sales Representative, Content/Social media Manager) while doing this I garnered some major life skills (Attention to details, Accountability, Writing, Marketing strategy , content marketing, organization and time management skill, problem solving, Good Customer care service , Negotiating skills and a list of other)\n\nI know I’ve not really done a remote job but I believe that life is built in phases and I think this is time for me to transition and also gain more experience in life that is why I want to be part of your company. I believe I’m teachable and with the skills I have I would bring a lot to your company and much more. I have a good laptop and access to good network. \n\nI hope I’m selected for this job role. I promise to give it my all \n\nThank you so much",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729674415697_Godwin SOCIAL MEDIA CV.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-23T09:06:58.170Z,2024-10-23T09:06:58.170Z,,,,,,,,,
6718bd48dd7522120ce4981b,"Yusuf, Suliyah Abiodun ",+2348130068177,suliat301@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello, I am Suliyah Yusuf a Social Media Manager with a strong background in content management, and customer support. With a Higher Diploma, in Mass Communication, I have spent the last five years offering content marketing, customer service support services and managing social media accounts for busy business owners.  \n\nWorking with different industries over the years has sharpened my skills as a versatile individual. My expertise lies in crafting engaging content, solving problems, time management, reliability among other things. \n\nI look forward to the possibility of joining your amazing team and helping to reach your business goals.",https://onaridewithsisi.my.canva.site/my-portfolio,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729674565733_Yusuf Suliyah CS Resume.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-23T09:09:28.304Z,2024-10-23T09:09:28.304Z,,,,,,,,,
6718be62dd7522120ce4982e,Ganiyu Adekunle Saheed,+23407057213360,ade_saheed02@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"Am an independent Social Media Manager/Community Manager and a Graphic Design Specialist. I'm available for Freelance or Full time opportunities. Specializing in Identity/ Brand development for start-ups and established businesses.\n\nExperienced Senior Graphic Designer skilled in Business Planning, Operations Management, Graphics, Planning, and Management. Strong arts and design professional with a Bachelor's degree focused in Accounting from University of Benin. ",www.linkedin.com/in/adekunle-saheed-7b4b7a212,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729674848636_CV Ganiyu Adekunle Saheed.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-23T09:14:10.928Z,2024-10-23T09:14:10.928Z,,,,,,,,,
6718bf5bdd7522120ce49843,katlego matlala,+270721560654,katlegohlabathi@gmail.com,South Africa,"\n\nI have a strong interest in data analytics and administration, with experience in customer service. I'm currently looking for internships in South Africa or Remote, particularly in roles that involve back-end development and data analytics. I hold a skills certificate in data analytics, which has equipped me with proficiency in tools like Excel, Google Sheets, SQL, and Power BI for data visualization.\n\nRecently, I've been applying for positions such as the Consumer Insights Data Analytics Externship, where I hope to leverage my analytical skills to derive meaningful insights and support business decisions. I'm passionate about learning and continuously improving my skills to stay updated with the latest trends and technologies in the field.\n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729675097647_Resume Katlego Matlala.pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-23T09:18:19.729Z,2024-10-23T09:18:19.729Z,,,,,,,,,
6718bf6cdd7522120ce4984e,Madueke Ijeoma Mary,+2348116699483,maduekemary23@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Ijeoma, \nThank you for the opportunity of applying for this role.\nI have previously interned at Automatic Pallet, A digital marketing agency where I was assigned roles like; Attending to customer enquiries and providing customer support, scripting and hosting our podcast sessions and managing documents on Google drive.\n\nI have also worked remotely as a voice over artist for a YouTube channel.\n\nI am a fast learner and if I am giving the opportunity to intern with your organization, I am sure I will learn and adapt fast to bring value to the organization.\n\nThank you.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729675112633_Madueke Ijeoma Cv. Updated.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-23T09:18:36.115Z,2024-10-23T09:18:36.115Z,,,,,,,,,
6718bfbfdd7522120ce49857,"Popoola, Joshua Timileyin",+2348164388553,popoolajoshua7@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I enjoy everything about social media and I’m passionate about using it to build brand visibility and engagement. I am currently managing social media for a tech startup, called nobsAfrica, launching a food delivery service called ChopNow, where I create content, grow followers, and help shape the brand’s online presence.\n\nI have also freelanced on platforms like Fiverr, writing articles, LinkedIn posts, and YouTube scripts, which have honed my ability to engage diverse audiences. This experience has allowed me to understand content creation from different angles and craft messages that resonate with each audience.\n\nI’m constantly following social media trends and am eager to learn new strategies. I’m excited about the opportunity to contribute to your team, grow professionally, and apply my skills in a fast-paced environment.",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1CbTDmoetWyI-bsyYtjCx1gIExWXl15f8,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729675196972_Joshua Popoola. Social Media Manager CV..docx,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-23T09:19:59.043Z,2024-10-23T09:19:59.043Z,,,,,,,,,
