6718cbb0dd7522120ce49949,Ikenna Paschal Okonkwo,+23407032616044,Ikennaokonkwo44@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a graphic designer with a strong foundation in digital marketing and content creation, and I’m now focused on deepening my skills in UI/UX design. Over the past few years, I have worked on projects that range from designing social media ads and marketing strategies to creating user interfaces for mobile applications and websites. My experience includes roles where I’ve led creative teams remotely, managed social media platforms, and boosted brand engagement through thoughtful and strategic design.\n\nWhat excites me most now is diving into the UI/UX space, where I can combine my design skills with user-centered thinking to create intuitive, engaging digital experiences. I am passionate about creating designs that are not only visually appealing but also functional and easy to navigate, ensuring users have easy interactions with the products. This field aligns with my strengths in problem-solving and my desire to continue learning and growing as a designer.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729678254314_IKENNA PASCHAL OKONKWO CV 2024.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-23T10:10:56.253Z,2024-10-23T10:10:56.253Z,,,,,,,,,
