6718ceeddd7522120ce49977,GONOH CHRISTIAN ,+23407032408067,writergonoh@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nChris Gonoh is an enterprising and creative enigma, a fact which is further strengthen by dint of the multifaceted prizes the young mind has attracted in his teenage years. Few to mention is his first place win in the Association of Nigeria Authors/ Ikeogu Oke literary prize for Nigeria secondary school students, a literary award which had Dr. Obari Gomba (Winner of the Nigeria Prize for Literature 2023) as the chief panelist. He was the third place winner in the 2021 Applied Worldwide international Essay Competition organized by the Applied Worldwide Limited Liability company domiciled at the United States. He. clinched the third prize for the Chima Ugokwe National Essay Competition 2021 with his exceptional work centered on 'covid -19 and humaneness'. He is a shortlistee of the Chief Dr Gabriel Igbinedion essay competition 2021 among other prizes, mentions and special recognitions too numerous to mention. His works have been published on magazines, anthologies and journals, and in local newspapers, too.\n\nIndeed, Chris Gonoh is passionate about using his craft in addressing organizational issues and this he believe, can only be achievable when provided the opportunity.",https://tribuneonlineng.com/advocating-nigerias-economic-growth-through-culture-and-arts/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729679082327_CURRICULUM.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-23T10:24:45.169Z,2024-10-23T10:24:45.169Z,,,,,,,,,
