6718d084dd7522120ce49988,Ilesanmi Adedoyin Gideon,+23408139703420,donygideon57@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a Singer-songwriter, UI/UX designer, Social psychologist and I learnt HTML and CSS for web development. \n\nI reside in Lagos, Nigeria. I love and care for my family and take all my relationships seriously. I'm committed to Christ and I use all the Christian principles to live and be a proper example to the world; trustworthiness, honesty, efficiency, consistency and so on.\n\nI'm a very organised person and I love seeing things neatly and structurally done, that's why all my UI/UX design project are and will always be attractive.\n\nI'm currently supporting remotely as a programming tutor for the newly developing Coding Institute for Kids, CODE GARDEN taking: Frontend, Scratch3 and Roblox studio.\n\nI worked one time at Rosebud Schools, Nigeria. Withheld the posts: Maths and ICT teacher.\n\nAnd I'm a member of Mark walmsley Arts and culture network with a music business certification for 8 weeks course via zoom held by Dr. Greta pope: Music Business Secret(MBS), I think she stays in California. \n\nI'm a Certified UI/UX designer + Certification for the professional google course on Coursera in a month.\n\nOne more thing is that I really love my nickname so much with is ""Dony G"" it's very possible you encounter it once in a while as we continue on this journey, my actual name is the one I put here and in my resume. ",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729679490816_Dony's Resume.docx,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-23T10:31:32.883Z,2024-10-23T10:31:32.883Z,,,,,,,,,
