6719032baa636ae4bac982bf,Faith Oyeniyi,+2348062527593,faithoyeniyi21@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager, \n\nMy name is Faith Oyeniyi and I am a UX designer. I am writing this letter to emphasize my excitement at the prospect of joining Tobams Group  as a  UX/UI Designer at your company.\n\nOver the course of two (2) years in UX Design, I have attained significant experience working on a variety of production websites and apps, designing primarily in Figma and Adobe Illustrator, working directly with corporate leadership and clients, and helping the software development teams. I believe I would be an excellent addition to the team.\n\nAs a UX/UI Designer, I have consistently delivered on expectations, assisted several teams, designed numerous sites and apps to production, and collaborated with other engineers, designers, product managers and other members of my teams with tools such as Figma, Adobe Creative cloud, Miro, Balsamiq mockups and so on. In my previous jobs as a UX designer, I have been responsible for designing wireframes as well as promotional materials.\n\nI also have experience working both synchronously and asynchronously in fully remote settings across different time zones. This is evident in my collaboration and leading of a few cross-functional teams across the globe.\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how my experience aligns with your goals and needs in more detail.\n\nFeel free to contact me on LinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/faith-oyeniyi-18aa07b8/\n or have a look at my portfolio: behance.net/faithoyeniyi21\n\nKind regards,\nOyeniyi Faith.\n",https://behance.net/faithoyeniyi21,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729692457487_Oyeniyi Faith's UX.docx.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-23T14:07:39.626Z,2024-10-23T14:07:39.626Z,,,,,,,,,
