6719155faa636ae4bac98387,Victory Esther Aduroja ,+2348138314029,victoryaduroja@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a social media manager with hands on experience in creating compelling and human related centered content, developing effective strategies and leveraging analytics to drive brand growth. I am proficient in content creation for various audience and platforms. I am also skilled at facilitating community growth through customer focused approach.\nI have adequately managed brand page using compelling content and copies and a well crafted strategy. I have crafted and executed content that increased brand awareness, reach and content that interaction by over 200% across various platforms.\n\nI have established content calendar and strategy leading to 50% in website traffic from all social media channels in one month. \n\nConsistently monitored page analytics providing working strategies to improve brand content direction.\nI would appreciate the opportunity to connect and discuss this further. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.\n\n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729697114263_ADUROJA VICTORY ESTHER C.V (2).docx,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-23T15:25:19.123Z,2024-10-23T15:25:19.123Z,,,,,,,,,
6719156daa636ae4bac9838c,Oluwaseun Bahrahkat Oluwatoyin,+23408086684283,oluwatoyinoluwaseun605@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Bahrahkat Oluwaseun with over two years of hands-on experience in managing social media platforms and digital marketing, I am confident in my ability to help elevate your brand’s online presence and engagement. My strong background in content creation, social media strategy, and digital marketing tools, coupled with my passion for innovation, makes me an excellent fit for your team.In my freelance role as a Social Media Manager, I have successfully developed and implemented social media strategies that led to significant growth in engagement and brand visibility for various clients. By creating compelling content, analyzing key metrics, and executing targeted campaigns, I increased followers by 30% and improved engagement rates by 15% for several brands. My ability to harness the power of platforms like Instagram, Facebook, and Twitter, along with my proficiency in tools such as Canva, Hootsuite, and Google Analytics, enables me to craft tailored campaigns that resonate with target audiences.Additionally, my experience as a Virtual Assistant has honed my organizational skills and attention to detail. I have a proven track record in managing multiple tasks efficiently, from content scheduling to customer inquiries and administrative support. This versatility allows me to manage both the creative and operational aspects of social media management seamlessly.I am excited about the opportunity to contribute my expertise to your team. I am confident that my strategic approach, combined with my strong problem-solving and teamwork skills, will help deliver tangible results for your company.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729697130646_Resume original.,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-23T15:25:33.101Z,2024-10-23T15:25:33.101Z,,,,,,,,,
67191576aa636ae4bac98392,ADEYEMI OLAMIDE CHRISTIANA,+23407063632871,olamideadeyemi27@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a graduate in Political Science and Education, I have more than three years of experience simplifying complex information for high school students. Through this journey, I've learned how to craft interesting stories that capture the attention of young minds. \n\nBuilding on my experience as an academic tutor, I have leveraged my expertise in research, communication, and education to transition into a successful writing career.\n\nI specialize in creating content that bridges the gap between businesses and their customers, focusing on human-centered narratives. My approach is rooted in understanding the audience. \n\nI use empathy to connect and analytics to ensure the content performs well. Success for me is when a piece not only ranks well in search engines but also sparks conversations and conversions. I strongly believe in making valuable information accessible to everyone.\n\nIn my last role as a social media manager, I increased the LinkedIn page followers for my client by up to 40% through engaging content. I was involved in every step of the content creation process, aligning with their brand voice and strategic goals.\n\nI believe in the power of continuous learning and actively seek out the latest trends in content writing and SEO. I enjoy collaborating with other creatives and sharing insights through writing workshops and online content communities.\n\nI've obtained certification as a content writer through HubSpot Academy and Alison, where I learned about storytelling, SEO writing, repurposing content, content editing, creating content calendars, and social media metrics.\n",https://olamideadeyemi.journoportfolio.com/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729697140797_CV.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-23T15:25:42.910Z,2024-10-23T15:25:42.910Z,,,,,,,,,
671916f5aa636ae4bac9839c,Amarachukwu Nwachukwu ,+2348143717229,amarachijane27@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Amarachukwu Nwachukwu, and I am a graduate of chemistry with a passion for both science and the arts. Over the years, I’ve developed a diverse skill set through my experiences in customer service, project management, and as a virtual assistant. In these roles, I’ve handled tasks such as social media management, scheduling, email and calendar management, research, and transcription, among others. \n\nI’m also keen on expanding my technical skills, which is why I’ve been enhancing my Excel proficiency for administrative and secretarial tasks.\n\nBeyond work, I enjoy drawing, arts, and sports like badminton and swimming. I believe these creative and physical outlets help keep me balanced and focused, which translates well into my professional life.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729697523512_Nwachukwu Amarachukwu J.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-23T15:32:05.911Z,2024-10-23T15:32:05.911Z,,,,,,,,,
