67191bb3aa636ae4bac983c1,Asiodu Emmanuella Onyinye,+2348054266825,siodu2018@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello and thank you for taking time to read through. From my application and cv, I hope you’d be a bit familiar with my background and so I wouldn’t want to dwell on that particularly because you’d have more than a handful of applicants. \nSocial media has clearly become our everyday means of living whether for entertainment, education, information, etc and as a mass communication graduate my focus has been on that, after school I have been able to pick up some online courses to help widen my knowledge on social media management. I have also made efforts to learn a bit on content creation using CapCut, Lightroom and canva. \nI have also expatiated my writing skill and explored the world of marketing through content writing. In my portfolio you’d note that through my hardwork, resilience and a bit of luck (lol) I was able to appear of the first page on SERPs. I hope with these few points, I have been able to stand out from a few of your applicants. I’m looking for to working with TOBAMS. Thank you and have a wonderful day! ",https://asioduemmanuella.my.canva.site/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729698737130_Updated CV.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-23T15:52:19.339Z,2024-10-23T15:52:19.339Z,,,,,,,,,
