671921c1aa636ae4bac983e0,Olawale Abolade ,+2348137496280,abolademukaila@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Olawale Abolade, a passionate and detail-oriented Product Designer with a background in Mass Communication, which has equipped me with strong communication and storytelling skills. This allows me to create user-centered designs that are both visually appealing and intuitive. I’ve worked on a variety of projects, from building branding identity for apps to designing innovative solutions for accessibility challenges.\n\nI am proficient in tools like Figma and Adobe XD, and I have hands-on experience in wireframing, prototyping, and user research. I’m currently enhancing my skills by taking the AI Career Essentials course, where I’m exploring how AI can enhance the design process. I’m eager to apply my skills to real-world projects, collaborate with a team, and further develop my expertise in product design.",https://bit.ly/AboladeOlawaleUXDesignPortfolio,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729700287114_OACV. Olawale Abolade.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-23T16:18:09.474Z,2024-10-23T16:18:09.474Z,,,,,,,,,
