67193e8caa636ae4bac984a5,Salem Abraham,+2348186295595,Salemcrtr@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hey there! I’m a creative chameleon—part content creator, part digital marketer, and full-time storyteller. Whether I'm crafting catchy taglines, singing my heart out as a singer-songwriter, or embodying characters on stage as a thespian, I’m all about making connections that resonate. \nAs a multifaceted professional, I seamlessly blend my skills in digital marketing, content creation, and social media management with my artistic talents as a singer, songwriter, voice-over artist, and model.\nI’ve worked with dynamic brands like The Guys and Kavod Studios, managing creative campaigns and content strategies that amplify their digital presence.\nI thrive on turning ideas into experiences, driven by a passion for storytelling and a love for connecting with audiences through creative expression.\nI strongly believe I would be a good fit and a valuable addition to Tobams group. I look forward to hearing from you and ultimately working with you. ",WPS Office: Complete office suite with PDF editor  Here's the link to the file: https://eu.docworkspace.com/d/cILLolsLIAeD85LgG?sa=S3&st=0  Get WPS Office for Mac&PC: https://www.wps.com/d/?from=ios,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729707658121_ABRAHAM SALEM'S CV3.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-23T18:21:00.137Z,2024-10-23T18:21:00.137Z,,,,,,,,,
