6719403daa636ae4bac984b9,Misturat Dolapo Abdulkareem,+23409066723033,anikejikareem@gmail.com,Nigeria,"With over two years of expertise in UI/UX design, I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to Tobams groups. Your commitment to delivering exceptional results in the talent acquisition space resonates with me. \n\nIn one of my previous role at a software design and development agency, I have consistently demonstrated my ability to craft visually appealing and user-centric designs using industry-standard tools like Figma. \n\nMy portfolio and work experience reflects my creativity and problem-solving skills, showcasing various projects that have enhanced user experiences and driven successful business outcomes.\n\nI am confident that my experience in UI/UX design will complement your team’s skills and help deliver outstanding results that exceed client expectations.\n\nCollaboration and communication are at the core of my work ethic. I thrive in dynamic environments where I can contribute to cross-functional teams, ensuring seamless integration of design elements and aligning them with overall project goals.\n\nMy ability to listen to clients' needs, coupled with my attention to detail, allows me to create designs that are not only aesthetically pleasing but also highly functional and user-friendly.",https://www.behance.net/abdulkadolapo,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1729708091045_my resume - 2024-02-08 19_09_32 (5) (2) (1).pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-23T18:28:13.018Z,2024-10-23T18:28:13.018Z,,,,,,,,,
