671de224aa636ae4bac98d84,Victoria Umeh,+2349036254990,umeh4victoria@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Victoria Umeh, and I'm a social media manager, content strategist, content creator, and video editor. My journey into social media began in 2022, when I was inspired by my then business, where I wanted to produce remarkable results and gain visibility in the Social Media Space. \nThis passion for content creation and digital storytelling quickly grew into freelance and contract work, where I’ve had the chance to help other brands shape their online presence.\n\nI’ve always enjoyed experimenting with different strategies, testing out new ideas, and seeing what resonates with people. This has led me to start my own brand on Instagram and TikTok, where I now create content that reflects my interests, experiment with ideas, test strategies, and engage with my audience.\n\nOutside of social media, I’m passionate about healthy living and enjoy cooking nutritious meals. Creativity is at the heart of everything I do. I love trying new things, experimenting, and seeing what works. \nSocial media isn’t just a job for me; it’s a space where I get to bring fresh ideas to life, share what I love, inspire others along the way and connect with people in meaningful ways.",https://victoria-chinyere-umeh.my.canva.site/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730011681968_Victoria Chinyere Umeh.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-27T06:48:04.163Z,2024-10-27T06:48:04.163Z,,,,,,,,,
671e04d6aa636ae4bac98da7,Segun Akinsanya,+23409096960632,segunakinsanya75@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Tobams Group,\n\nI am writing to express my interest in the Financial Analyst Intern position at Tobams Group, as advertised. With over two years of experience as an auditor, I have developed a strong foundation in financial analysis, risk assessment, and data interpretation. My professional background, combined with my ongoing coursework at 365 Financial Analyst, has equipped me with the skills and knowledge necessary to contribute effectively to your team.\n\nDuring my tenure as an auditor, I honed my analytical skills by evaluating financial statements, identifying discrepancies, and ensuring compliance with regulatory standards. This experience has not only enhanced my attention to detail but has also provided me with a comprehensive understanding of financial operations and the importance of accurate reporting. I have developed a keen interest in transitioning to a financial analyst role, where I can leverage my auditing experience to provide valuable insights and support strategic decision-making.\n\nI am particularly drawn to Tobams Group as an innovative consultancy firm committed to shaping the future of tech talent development in Africa. I am eager to contribute to your team by applying my analytical skills and my passion for finance. My coursework at 365 Financial Analyst has further deepened my understanding of financial modeling, forecasting, and investment analysis, which I believe will be beneficial in this internship role. I have attached a link to some of the projects i worked on.\n\nI am excited about the opportunity to work with a dynamic team at Tobams Group and to learn from experienced professionals in the field. I am confident that my background in auditing, combined with my commitment to becoming a proficient financial analyst, will allow me to make a meaningful contribution to your organization.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experiences align with the needs of your team.",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1RtC_BrQX3FlXUQa1Aihigbeyq_Mwz7XL?usp=sharing,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730020563245_SEGUN AKINSANYA_CV.pdf,6717cc6cdd7522120ce48975,Financial Analyst Intern,2024-10-27T09:16:06.165Z,2024-10-27T09:16:06.165Z,,,,,,,,,
671e392eaa636ae4bac98dfc,Momoh Halima Abdullahi ,+2348146129281,momohhalima42@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Halima, and I am an aspiring UI/UX designer with a passion for creating intuitive, user-friendly digital experiences. I am currently completing a one-year product design learning program through the Womentechster Fellowship, where I have developed strong skills in design tools such as Figma, Adobe XD, and prototyping tools. This journey has equipped me with the knowledge and ability to transform complex problems into simple, elegant design solutions.\n\nMy approach to design is rooted in empathy and user-centered principles. I enjoy conducting user research, creating wireframes, and iterating on designs based on feedback. Additionally, my background in project management helps me stay organized and ensures that I meet deadlines while collaborating effectively with teams.\n\nI thrive in environments where I can learn, grow, and contribute creatively. I am eager to apply my skills in a real-world setting through an internship, where I can further refine my abilities and contribute to meaningful projects.\n\nI’m confident that my technical expertise, problem-solving mindset, and collaborative nature make me a strong candidate for this internship. I am excited about the opportunity to join your team and contribute to designing impactful user experiences.",https://www.behance.net/halimamomoh1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730033963601_Momoh . Halima - Resume.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-27T12:59:26.006Z,2024-10-27T12:59:26.006Z,,,,,,,,,
