671fbceeaa636ae4bac99326,Ugwuja Miracle Chidiebere,+234810400467,miracleugwuja52@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Tobamsgroup Team,\n\nI’m thrilled to apply for the Social Media Manager Intern position. I’m a certified digital marketing and social media management professional with valuable experience in customer service, where I’ve honed my skills in understanding and responding to customer needs. Previously, I managed the Instagram account of a local restaurant, using insights to drive engagement and customer interaction. My background in customer service has enhanced my ability to connect with audiences, build brand loyalty, and create content that resonates with followers. With a passion for strategic content creation, audience growth, and analytics, I’m excited to bring these skills to Tobamsgroup and contribute to its digital presence.\n\nThank you for considering my application.\n\nWarm regards,\nUgwuja Miracle Chidiebere","Ugwuja Miracle Chidiebere  08104000467 ugwujamiracle52@gmail.com LinkedIn Profile  Portfolio Overview  A passionate digital marketing and social media management professional with a strong foundation in customer service. I leverage my skills to create engaging content and foster brand loyalty across various platforms.  1. Social Media Management Experience  Instagram Management for Zaddy’s Place  	•	Role: Social Media Manager 	•	Duration: August 2023 – Present 	•	Responsibilities: 	•	Developed and executed content strategies to enhance brand visibility. 	•	Managed daily posts, stories, and audience interactions. 	•	Analyzed Instagram Insights to track performance and optimize engagement. 	•	Created visually appealing graphics and promotional content.  Achievements:  	•	Increased followers by 30% over 4 months. 	•	Improved engagement rate by 25% through targeted campaigns.  2. Customer Service Experience  Customer Service Representative at CWAY Food and Beverages Company  	•	Role: Customer Service Manager 	•	Duration: May 2023 – Present 	•	Responsibilities: 	•	Led a team in providing exceptional customer service. 	•	Handled customer inquiries and resolved issues efficiently. 	•	Trained new staff on customer service protocols and best practices.  Achievements:  	•	Received recognition for outstanding customer service. 	•	Implemented feedback systems that improved customer satisfaction by 20% over 6 months.  3. Certifications  	•	Digital Marketing Certification – Google Digital Garage 	•	Social Media Management Certification – HubSpot Academy 	•	Project Management Certification – Alison  4. Skills  	•	Social Media Platforms: Instagram, Facebook, Twitter, LinkedIn 	•	Content Creation Tools: Canva, Hootsuite, Buffer 	•	Analytics: Google Analytics, Instagram Insights 	•	Customer Relationship Management: Zendesk, Freshdesk  5. Additional Information  	•	Interests: 	•	Digital marketing trends 	•	Brand storytelling 	•	Community engagement strategies 	•	Goals: 	•	To develop my skills further in digital marketing and social media management while contributing to impactful campaigns.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730133228040_UGWUJA MIRACLE CHIDIEBERE CV.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-28T16:33:50.107Z,2024-10-28T16:33:50.107Z,,,,,,,,,
