671fbd33aa636ae4bac99336,Glory Essah,+2348058257832,gloryessah@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nDear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am excited to apply for the Social Media Management Intern position at Tobams Group. With extensive experience in social media marketing, digital marketing, and content management, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team. I am enthusiastic about the opportunity to bring my passion for content creation and digital engagement to a dynamic company like Tobams Group, where I can further develop my skills in a collaborative and creative environment.\n\nMy background as a Digital Marketer and Social Media Specialist has equipped me with a comprehensive understanding of social media strategy and the ability to create content that resonates with target audiences. At Render FX, Skilled-Up Life, and as the former Content Manager at Contour Post, I’ve developed, executed, and optimized social media campaigns tailored to meet brand goals and drive engagement. \n\nMy hands-on experience with platforms such as Facebook, Instagram, Twitter, and LinkedIn has allowed me to sharpen my skills in creating high-quality content, managing social media calendars, and analyzing metrics to track performance.\n\nI have also gained a strong foundation in using social media management tools like Hootsuite and Buffer, which allows me to ensure consistent and timely posting across multiple channels. Moreover, I have consistently leveraged data insights to refine strategies and maximize brand visibility and engagement. \n\nBeyond technical expertise, I bring a creative mindset and a commitment to crafting impactful and meaningful content that aligns with brand identity, as well as the adaptability needed to work collaboratively in a fast-paced environment.\n\nAt Tobams Group, I am eager to bring my experience and creativity to contribute to your social media objectives while learning from your team of experienced professionals. I am confident that my enthusiasm, adaptability, and commitment to staying updated on industry trends make me an ideal fit for this internship, and I look forward to the opportunity to support Tobams Group’s continued growth and success.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I am looking forward to the possibility of discussing how my background and skills align with the goals of Tobams Group.\n\n",https://gloryessah.my.canva.site/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730133296585_Digital Writing_Marketing CV- Glory Essah .docx.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-28T16:34:59.199Z,2024-10-28T16:34:59.199Z,,,,,,,,,
