671fbe8caa636ae4bac993e5,Ifunanya Juliet Ottih,+2348136029669,ottihjuliet375@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Ifunanya Juliet Ottih, a Writer and enthusiastic Communications Specialist. Throughout my career, I have successfully developed and executed comprehensive digital media campaigns for various organizations, resulting in increased brand visibility, engagement, and revenue growth. I am adept at leveraging data-driven insights to optimize content performance and drive meaningful audience interactions. Furthermore, my expertise in utilizing emerging digital media trends and technologies has consistently positioned me at the forefront of the organization.\n\nIn my previous role as project Manager, I successfully implemented a comprehensive social media strategy that resulted in a 30% increase in brand awareness and a 20% growth in audience engagement. By collaborating closely with cross-functional teams, I was able to align social media efforts with overall marketing objectives and deliver impactful results. I am confident that my ability to develop and execute data-driven strategies, combined with my strong leadership skills, would enable me to make a significant impact in your organisation. \n\nThank you for considering my application. I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to your team for continued success and would welcome the chance to discuss how my skills and experience align with your needs in more detail. Please find my attached resume for your review.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/ifunanya-juliet-ottih-55b012188?utm_source=share&utm_campaign=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=android_app,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730133642243_Ifunanya OTTIH - CV24 (1).pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-28T16:40:44.804Z,2024-10-28T16:40:44.804Z,,,,,,,,,
