671fbefdaa636ae4bac993fe,Ummi-Salma Raji,+2348133777852,izevisuals@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Ummi-Salma Raji, a creative and detail-driven product designer with a knack for crafting intuitive and user-friendly interfaces.\n\nI love bringing fresh and innovative ideas to the table. I am detail-oriented, a great communicator, and thrive in collaborative environments where problem-solving is key.\n\nI bring a positive, adaptable attitude to every project and enjoy gathering user feedback to make sure my designs hit the mark.\n\nI’m always eager to learn, adapt, and create impactful user experiences.",https://www.behance.net/izevisuals,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730133755370_Ummi-Salma Raji_CV.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T16:42:37.699Z,2024-10-28T16:42:37.699Z,,,,,,,,,
