671fbf8baa636ae4bac99424,Abdulrasheed Soliu,+23408188594369,Soliurasheed01@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Sir/Ma\nA pleasant day to you. I am Soliu Abdulrasheed Adeshina a graduate of geology and Mineral Sciences from Kwara State University also recently completed my ALX Executive/virtual assistant course. I want to convey my desire and intentions to be part of your Organization. I would like to apply for the position of a Social media manager intern. I know and believe I have the qualifications to meet the demand of the said position.\nI bring a lot to the table in terms of skill and ability.  I'm always ready to face new challenges and develop more on my abilities, skills and knowledge in order to contribute value to the growth of the company. During my previous role, I have learnt to be a team player.\nAdditionally, I always play by the rulebooks and follow company guidelines, so you can be confident that I will always be acting in the best interest of the business.\nAll these factors combined I'm confident that I will be a valuable asset to your team. ",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730133897075_SOLIU ABDULRASHEED ADESHINA.va.docx,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-28T16:44:59.629Z,2024-10-28T16:44:59.629Z,,,,,,,,,
671fc077aa636ae4bac9943e,Kingsley Donatus,+23407064727686,donatuschisomk@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a versatile professional with a proven track record in financial management, operations, and customer service. Currently serving as an Accountant at the Ministry of Finance since 2021, where I am responsible for:\n - Payroll Processing: Accurately and timely processing payroll for a large number of employees, ensuring compliance with all relevant regulations.\n - Budgetary Planning: Developing and managing budgets, forecasting expenditures, and monitoring financial performance to optimize resource allocation.\nPrior to my current role, I gained valuable experience as an Admin and Chief Operating Officer at a delivery company in 2020. My responsibilities included:\n - Customer Relations: Building and maintaining strong relationships with clients, addressing inquiries, and resolving issues promptly.\n - Operational Efficiency: Streamlining delivery processes, optimizing routes, and implementing strategies to improve overall efficiency.\n - Team Leadership: Leading and motivating a team of delivery personnel, ensuring timely and accurate package delivery.\nEarlier in my career, I worked as a Third Choice Accountant at an accounting firm, where I honed my skills in:\n - Fraud Detection: Identifying and investigating potential fraudulent activities, safeguarding the company's assets.\n - Government Payment Scheduling: Ensuring timely and accurate payments to government agencies, adhering to strict compliance standards.\nI am a highly motivated and adaptable individual with a strong work ethic and a passion for continuous learning. I thrive in fast-paced environments and am committed to delivering exceptional results. I am a team player and believe in the power of collaboration to achieve shared goals.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730134133372_DKC_CV[1].docx,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-28T16:48:55.958Z,2