671fc1e3aa636ae4bac994b6,Ukamaka Progress Uchenwa ,+2349068811245,progressuchenwa@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Ukamaka Progress Uchenwa, a highly motivated individual with a strong interest in social media. While I haven't had the opportunity to hone my skills professionally, I've been actively engaged in managing personal social media accounts, such as my personal accounts and my VA social media account on TikTok and LinkedIn. \nThrough these experiences, I've developed a strong foundation in understanding social media platforms, engaging with audiences, and following industry trends.\nI'm eager to apply my passion and creativity to a professional setting. \nI'm particularly interested in content creation and social media analysis. I believe my strong attention to detail, ability to think critically, and enthusiasm for learning will make me a valuable asset to your team.\nI'm excited about the opportunity to contribute to Tobam’s Group  social media strategy and help achieve your goals. Thank you for considering my application.\n",https://www.canva.com/design/DAGOnHrKob8/C5uyaqqdhwrZXMyFYuE3ug/edit,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730134496477_UKAMAKA PROGRESS UCHENWA VA.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-28T16:54:59.792Z,2024-10-28T16:54:59.792Z,,,,,,,,,
671fc21baa636ae4bac994dc,Marvellous Chukwuma,+23407066233947,marvel17yag@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an enthusiastic media aspiring professional with no less than 3 years in the field. I have obtained HND in Mass communication. I also have experience with the skills required for the role of a social media manager, I am proficient in using tools like Canva, Capcut, as well as familiar with the use of Social media platforms like facebook, instagram, titkok etc. \n\nI also am very proficient with the use of other workplace tools like google suite etc. And i am willing to contribute, learn and grow.",https://www.canva.com/design/DAGU4PVQbgA/faOl2B5o1vCzBwmVlt9FGg/edit?utm_content=DAGU4PVQbgA&utm_campaign=designshare&utm_medium=link2&utm_source=sharebutton,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730134552096_MARVELLOUS CHUKWUMA INTERN RESUME.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-28T16:55:55.230Z,2024-10-28T16:55:55.230Z,,,,,,,,,
671fc2deaa636ae4bac994fa,Anuoluwapo Afolabi,+2349056804329,haandu18@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello, I'm Anuoluwapo Afolabi, and I'm excited to apply for the Social Media Management Intern role at Tobams Group. \n\nWith a passion for digital marketing and social media, I believe I'd thrive in this position.\n\nAs a creative and enthusiastic individual, I've developed strong social media management skills through my experience at Morainbow Down Syndrome Foundation and Kopahouses.\n I successfully grew followers, increased engagement, and enhanced brand visibility through strategic content calendars and viral video content.\n\nIn addition to my hands-on experience, I've also earned a certification from the Digital Marketing Specialist Institute (DMSI), which has equipped me with advanced knowledge of social media marketing strategies and best practices.\n\nI'm confident in my ability to:\n- Develop and implement engaging social media strategies\n- Create high-quality content that resonates with target audiences\n- Analyze social media metrics to optimize performance\n- Collaborate with teams to support marketing initiatives\n\nMy skills align with the job requirements:\n\n- Proficient in social media platforms (Facebook, Instagram, Twitter, LinkedIn) and management tools (Hootsuite, Buffer)\n- Basic knowledge of social media analytics and metrics\n- Excellent written and verbal communication skills\n- Ability to work independently and collaboratively\n\nI'm eager to learn from experienced professionals, expand my skills, and contribute to Tobams Group's online presence. \n\nThank you for considering my application. ",https://sites.google.com/d/1yq8p_GIlboawq0XXXplh6QWKdjueBkFx/edit?ouid=111006943024901538456,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730134747230_ANU's Resume 2024.docx.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-28T16:59:10.106Z,2024-10-28T16:59:10.106Z,,,,,,,,,
671fc34aaa636ae4bac994ff,Ehimigbai Godwin Ehimigbai,+23409130302714,ehimigbaigodwin@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am with a strong background in Agricultural Education and years of experience in teaching, research, extension services, content creation, and bid tendering, I am confident in my ability to drive impact.\nAs a dedicated Agricultural Education professional, I hold a Bachelor's degree from Ambrose Ali University (2022). My expertise spans:\n- Teaching agricultural science to secondary school students, developing engaging lesson plans and assessing student performance\n- Conducting research on sustainable agricultural practices and crop yield optimization\n- Providing extension services to farming communities\n- Creating engaging content for various platforms\n- Bid tendering and project management\nAdditionally, I have diversified experience in content creation, having previously worked as an actor for MandE Family and maintaining an active presence on TikTok with over 7,000 followers.\nMy unique blend of agricultural expertise, teaching acumen, and content creation skills enables me to effectively communicate and empower individuals and communities through sustainable agricultural practices.\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to discussing how my skills align with your organization's goals.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/ehimigbai-godwin-201000250?utm_source=share&utm_campaign=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=android_app,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730134856010_Ehimigbai Godwin's CV - .pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-28T17:00:58.716Z,2024-10-28T17:00:58.716Z,,,,,,,,,
671fc3aeaa636ae4bac99520,Olamide Christiana Adeyemi,+2347063632871,olamideadeyemi27@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am writing to express my strong interest in the Social Media Intern position at Tobams Group. I've got a passion for social media and a deep understanding of its power to connect and engage audiences. I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to your team and help drive the company’s online presence.\nThroughout my journey, I’ve honed my skills in social media management, using Canva to create design and content creation. I’ve successfully completed courses on content marketing and social media management where I was taught how to develop and implement social media campaigns, analyze data to optimize performance, and engage with online communities. These courses have not only equipped me with a solid foundation in social media best practices but have also instilled in me a strong sense of creativity and adaptability.\nWhat truly sets me apart is my ability to understand and connect with diverse target audiences. I have a keen eye for identifying trends and insights that can be leveraged to create compelling and relevant content by staying up-to-date with the latest industry developments and emerging platforms. I am confident in my ability to drive engagement and foster meaningful connections between Tobams Group and it’s audience.\nI am particularly drawn to Tobams Group because of its innovative approach to social media marketing. Your commitment to delivering unique and authentic experiences aligns perfectly with mine. I am eager to contribute my fresh perspective and creative ideas to help Tobams Group stand out in the digital landscape.\nIn closing, I want to express my sincere gratitude for considering my application. I am confident that my passion for social media, combined with my strong skills and dedication, make me an ideal candidate for the Social Media Intern at Tobams Group. I am open to new ideas in your organization; I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team further. Thank you for your time and consideration.\n\n",https://olamideadeyemi.journoportfolio.com/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730134954155_CV.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-28T17:02:38.406Z,2024-10-28T17:02:38.406Z,,,,,,,,,
