671fc405aa636ae4bac9953f,Temiloluwa Oyewo,+2348096524829,mosunmolaoyewo@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\n\nDear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am writing to apply for the Social Media Manager Intern position at Tobams Group. With experience in social media management, content creation, basic Canva design, content calendar development, and content marketing. \nI am enthusiastic about contributing to your mission of reshaping tech talent development across Africa.\n\nIn my recent role as a Social Media Manager, I managed Facebook,  Instagram, \nLinkedIn and Tiktok , creating engaging content aligned with brand goals and audience needs. My skills in Canva allowed me to design eye-catching visuals, while my experience in content planning and basic video editing helped bring ideas to life, increasing brand engagement. I am confident that my blend of creative and strategic skills aligns well with the innovative approach at Tobams Group.\n\nI look forward to the opportunity to support Tobams Group in building a global platform for African talent. \n\nThank you.\n\nWarm regards,  \nTemiloluwa Oyewo. ",https://mainstack.me/temiloluwa_,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730135041743_Temiloluwa Oyewo Digital Marketing Content Writer 2  2024.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-28T17:04:05.343Z,2024-10-28T17:04:05.343Z,,,,,,,,,
671fc454aa636ae4bac9955a,Raymond Chukwujioke Oriaku ,+23408167023025,raymondoriaku7@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Raymond C. Oriaku by name, I’m a curious and driven individual with a keen interest in a wide range of topics. I’m  always eager to learn and improve, and I'm not afraid to take on new challenges. I have a strong work ethic and I’m passionate about success, but i also know how to have fun and enjoy life. I’m a multi-faceted person with a lot to offer, and I'm sure I’ll continue to achieve great things!",https://www.linkedin.com/in/raymond-oriaku-8baa70308?utm_source=share&utm_campaign=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=ios_app,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730135121293_Ray Europa CV2â.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-28T17:05:24.155Z,2024-10-28T17:05:24.155Z,,,,,,,,,
671fc455aa636ae4bac9955e,Oluwafemi Yusuf ,+2347061714027,Femimos16@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\r\nMy name is Oluwafemi Yusuf and i am a recent graduate of Godfrey Okoye University where i studied mass communication. I have had a bit of work experience as I interned at a radio station during my school days and also worked at my University Radio station for a year before my graduation, I also worked for a traffic ad agency as a copywriter while in school and also was the editorial head of my University Press team. \n\nI found out about product design close to the end of my University education and had deep interst in it, I used any available spare time I had to gain knowledge in UI/UX design by watching YouTube videos and practicing which enabled me to be able to create a few designs which are in my portfolio. \n\nI am interested in this internship because I believe it will give me the practical knowledge I need and hands on experience to become a better designer, I am currently still learning as I have registered for a course on Coursera on UI/UX and I also received a scholarship which is aimed at educating me more in UI/UX design. \n\r\nI look forward to the opportunity of getting the role in this intership and learning.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nOluwafemi Yusuf\r",https://www.behance.net/femimoses3,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730135123693_OLUWAFEMI YUSUF.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T17:05:25.356Z,2024-10-28T17:05:25.356Z,,,,,,,,,
671fc4b4aa636ae4bac99569,Damilola Elizabeth Adewunmi,+2348138596615,bethadewunmi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi, I am Damilola Adewunmi, a final-year student at the University of Ibadan, studying Communication and Language Arts, majoring in Public Relations and Advertising. I have a certification in social media management. I am a diligent, hardworking, and adaptable employee, passionate about bringing brands to the limelight.\n\nI am proficient in using various social media platforms and tools, and I am always ready to learn new trends and techniques. I am a strong communicator, both written and verbal, and I enjoy collaborating with others to achieve shared goals.  Also, I am confident in my ability to create high-quality content, manage social media campaigns, and analyze performance metrics.\n\nHaving researched Tobam Group, I am impressed by its focus and goals. I believe I am equipped with the skills to improve Tobam Group's social media presence and help achieve its social media goals. \n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730135218154_Updated C-Vitae.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-28T17:07:00.752Z,2024-10-28T17:07:00.752Z,,,,,,,,,
