671fd26eaa636ae4bac99830,John Ogundipe,+2349026319597,ogundipejohn2017@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is John Ogundipe,23 years of age, I am a recent graduate of electrical and electronics engineering and I have about three years of experience in the UI UX design field. My design process solely majors on potential end users and what problem I am trying to proffer solutions to. I am attentive to details and always ready to improve my skills all round. My key design tools are Figma,Adobe XD and sometimes Photoshop.\nOutside of the design and engineering world, I love to read books and play chess, I can in fact say I'm one of the top rated chess players in the state.",https://linktr.ee/Johntoluwanimi,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730138732176_UI UX Resume John T .pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:05:34.665Z,2024-10-28T18:05:34.665Z,,,,,,,,,
