671fd27daa636ae4bac9983e,Jidechi Dimunah ,+2348069068163,Jidechidim@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi, \n\nMy name is Jidechi Dimunah, I'm a Product UX designer with experience in building products that scale using user-centered design. \n\nI am writing to express my interest in the Product UX Designer contract role as advertised. With 3 years experience in UI/UX design and proficiency in tools like Figma, Adobe Illustrator and XD, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team. \n\nIn my previous role, I was responsible for gathering and evaluating user requirements, designing graphic elements, and building navigation components. I have a strong portfolio that showcases my expertise in creating intuitive and visually appealing interfaces for both web and mobile applications. \n\nI am particularly drawn to this opportunity because of the opportunity to work on a new project that would meaningfully impact the lives of your users. I am excited about the possibility of contributing to your team and helping to create functional and appealing features that address your user needs. \n\nAttached is my resume for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experiences align with the needs of your team further. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your project. \n\nMy regards,\nJidechi Dimunah",https://www.behance.net/jidechidimunah ,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730138746734_Jidechi Dimunah - UIUX Designer.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:05:49.130Z,2024-10-28T18:05:49.130Z,,,,,,,,,
