671fd393aa636ae4bac998da,Falade Abisola Elizabeth,+2348134483879,abisolafalade@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I love reading books, especially fictions. I could spend the whole day reading. I’m a UI/UX designer with one year experience. Over the past year, I’ve worked on projects ranging from website redesigns to mobile app interfaces, focusing on intuitive, user-centered solutions. A highlight for me was designing a learning platform (Learned) that rewards students, where I learned to balance aesthetics with usability.\n I have foundational  knowledge in HTML, CSS and Adobe illustrator which helps me work closely with developers. I work well in teams, and my communication skills help me collaborate effectively. I’m always open to feedback and excited to learn from those around me. I’d love the opportunity to contribute to and grow with the Tobams Group team as a UI/UX Design Intern.",https://www.behance.net/BibiFalade,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730139025029_Bibi's CV.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:10:27.580Z,2024-10-28T18:10:27.580Z,,,,,,,,,
671fd394aa636ae4bac998de,Rotimi Amurawaiye,+2348108318352,adeoluwarotimi3@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Rotimi, and I'm a 19-year-old UI/UX designer from Nigeria. I kicked off my design journey in September 2021, initially just as a fun summer project. You know, something to pass the time. But somewhere between figuring out auto layout and aligning buttons, I realized I was hooked. What started as a summer fling quickly turned into a full-time passion, and now, it’s a skill I not only love but also use to earn a living. \n\nI’m in my fourth year of college, studying law. Yes, law! But before you wonder how I juggle legal cases with design sprints, let me assure you, I've mastered the art of management. Law has taught me discipline, attention to detail, and how to argue with myself when a design doesn't look right. (Just joking). But seriously, balancing school and design has only made me more efficient, and I'm ready to give 100% to this role.",https://www.behance.net/rotimijnr4,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730139025637_MY OFFICIAL DESIGN RESUME.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:10:28.803Z,2024-10-28T18:10:28.803Z,,,,,,,,,
