671fd3a0aa636ae4bac998ee,Peter Ayodele Fadare,+2348060098452,peterfadare686@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Peter, a graphic designer. I have been in the industry for over 3 years and I would like to explore other niche in design. I have learnt some things about Product design some months ago and would like to apply my knowledge and also learn from expert from your organization and also add value to your projects. Thanks ",https://www.figma.com/design/Pfd39kEJTnbn4jXwbZ04wb/HNG-DESIGN-STAGE-1-TASK?t=KeZqoXsW86avRBnj-0,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730139039063_Curriculum Vitae (Peter Ayodele FADARE)1.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:10:41.000Z,2024-10-28T18:10:41.000Z,,,,,,,,,
671fd3bfaa636ae4bac998fb,Emmanuel Anene,+2348134708425,bubez18@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an experienced UI/UX Designer who has worked in building a product from scratch, occupying leadership roles in this journey, and also have experience working with a cross-functional team. Over the years, I have fused my knowledge in philosophy and design to enhance customer satisfaction in business.\nI am a passionate, self-driven individual who lives by Kaizen, Feng Shui, Existentialism, and Care Ethics philosophy.\nI am interested in customer satisfaction as a model for business development which can be seen in the products I have developed, enhanced, and my Long Essay.\nMy career goals include working and developing a product that solves humanity's problems.\nHighlight of my work experience:\nI have actively participated in UX Research, Empathizing with Users, Wireframing, Designing, Prototyping, and pitching Deck, for product development.\nCollaborated with a cross-functional team that comprises;\nFront-end and Back-end developers, Mobile App Developers, Product Managers, Graphic Designers, Social Media Marketers, Video Animators, and Project Managers.\nI make use of tools like; Figma, Notion, Whimsical, Miro, Canva, Microsoft Chat, Cooler, and Adobe XD.",https://www.behance.net/aneneemmanuel1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730139068511_Anene Emmanuel Resume.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:11:11.693Z,2024-10-28T18:11:11.693Z,,,,,,,,,
