671fd485aa636ae4bac99941,Patricia Adonduwa,+2348107421670,idikwu2patricia@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Patricia Adonduwa, a UX designer with over three years of experience. As a computer science graduate, I initially focused on software development. However, my passion for understanding user needs led me to pursue UX design. Through dedicated coursework and internships, I've developed my skills in creating effective and user-friendly systems.\nI believe that successful design requires a balance between functionality and value. When I'm not designing, I enjoy exploring culinary arts, finding parallels between the creative processes of design and cooking.",https://www.behance.net/patriciaidikwu_i3cia,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730139267185_Patricia Adonduwa Resume.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:14:29.424Z,2024-10-28T18:14:29.424Z,,,,,,,,,
671fd4c8aa636ae4bac9994e,Israel Adejumo,+2348168827930,mistateedigitals@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a recent graduate with a degree in UI/UX Design, and I'm incredibly excited to begin my career as a UI/UX designer. Throughout my studies, I developed a strong foundation in user-centered design principles, information architecture, and visual design. I'm proficient in industry-standard tools like Figma, Figjam, Micro and Canva, and I'm eager to apply my skills in a practical setting.\nI believe my enthusiasm for user-centered design and my willingness to learn make me a strong candidate for this junior designer role.",https://www.behance.net/israeladejumo,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730139329302_Israel Adejumo CV.PDF,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:15:36.058Z,2024-10-28T18:15:36.058Z,,,,,,,,,
671fd4cfaa636ae4bac99954,Inneh Godswill,+2349159505844,ichuks38@gmail.com,Nigeria,"**Bio for Godswill Inneh**\n\nI’m Godswill Inneh, an aspiring product designer with a solid foundation in photography and a big passion for creating meaningful designs. I’m currently pursuing a design diploma at SQI College of ICT in Ibadan, where I’m diving into everything from UI/UX fundamentals to hands-on skills like wireframing, prototyping, and user research. I work with tools like Figma and Adobe XD, making me comfortable with the tech side of things while keeping a creative edge.\n\nI’m highly motivated, and I’d love the chance to bring my skills to Tobams Group as a design intern. I’m driven to start applying what I know to real-world projects, and I’m eager to learn from experienced designers on the job. My goal is to build designs that make an impact and keep improving as I go. I’m ready to roll up my sleeves, add a fresh perspective, and grow within the team!",https://www.behance.net/innehgodswill,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730139339977_Godswill Inneh 09159505844 UIUX Design .pdf (1).pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:15:43.057Z,2024-10-28T18:15:43.057Z,,,,,,,,,
