671fd500aa636ae4bac9996c,Aduloju Iyanuoluwa Victoria,+2347062574137,adulojuiyanuoluwa@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Iyanuoluwa, an intending ui/ux designer who is passionate about designing, technology and problem solving. I love surfing the net, cooking and reading when time permits me to. I have strong problem-solving skills and a knack for organizing projects. These qualities have helped me manage teams effectively during my undergraduate and where I did my PPA ( place of primary assignment) as a youth corps. My goal is to be a very good product designer and to help lead a development team and contribute to projects that makes difference. I also believe in long time learning and also excited about how technology is shaping the world currently and much more it has to do in the future. P.s: Tho it’s been a long while I got to design due to where I got posted to for my youth service but I’m willing to intern and learn much more with the few things I know about product design. ",https://www.behance.net/dhermilade,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730139390075_Aduloju iyanuoluwa resume.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:16:32.326Z,2024-10-28T18:16:32.326Z,,,,,,,,,
