671fd911aa636ae4bac99a02,Oluwatosin Fasehun,+2348118596457,anneoluwatosin@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello,\n\nMy name is Oluwatosin. I am a finance graduate who began a product marketing internship in January 2024. During the internship, I became interested in pursuing Product Design. Since then, I have learned and mastered the basic concepts of Design and UX Research.\n\nI was opportune to be a member of a UX Boot Camp. This platform has helped me create two independent design projects, a collaborative project with a product manager, and currently, working on a website project. My skill tools are Figma, Figjam Notion, and Milanote.\n\nAs an individual equipped with several relevant skills, I am pleased to contribute these skills not only to create accessible and usable products that can improve your users' experiences but also to other areas where I can add value to the organization. \n\nI am excited about my possible contribution to the company and having the opportunity to create more accessible and usable products.\n\nI am assured that I will be a valuable addition to the team.\n\nThank you.\n",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1A9aJzh2KEAkRbZqoKP9jeU9aGlJ1kEH8/view?usp=drive_link,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730140431498_Tosin Fasehun's CV.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:33:53.909Z,2024-10-28T18:33:53.909Z,,,,,,,,,
671fd957aa636ae4bac99a09,GRACE EKIMIETE,+2349056097249,graceekimiete@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Good day Sir/Ma,\n\nI am Grace Ekimiete, a Product (UI UX) Designer with basic knowledge in Frontend Development. I am passionate about my skill-set and want to be part of your team solving any user frustrations as well as increase visibility and functionality level of your design projects.\n\nI have gained some experiences in creating stunning and functional user interfaces and user experience designs, having a solid graphic design background and working on various industries projects ranging from healthcare, fashion, educational to agro-tech projects. However, I desire to grow further on this field. To this, I am passionate about seeing that my designs are brought to life, with the aid of HTML, CSS and Bootstrap tools. Having possessed this strong creative direction and passion, I am a good team player who has mastered the Adobe Creative Suites - Photoshop and Illustrator, as well as being efficient in Figma – establishing design systems, style guides, UI components, Wire Framing, Mock-ups, Prototyping and User Testing.\n\nI would be readily available remotely to carry out required tasks assigned me. To verify me on LInkedIn, please use the link https://www.linkedin.com/in/grace-ekimiete-2352ab40, Also, here's my first hand experience with Web Development, endeavoring to give life to my simple designs-https://gracedes5.github.io/GraceEkimieteResume/\n\nSummarily, I am eager to learn more and take on responsibilities readily. Thus, I look forward to being considered for this design role, so I can start expressing my prowess in your Product Design projects.",https://www.behance.net/graceekimiete,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730140497848_GRACE EKIMIETE-UIUX Designer.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:35:03.111Z,2024-10-28T18:35:03.111Z,,,,,,,,,
671fd992aa636ae4bac99a0e,Olawale Abolade ,+2348137496280,abolademukaila@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a seasoned product designer with a strong foundation in user experience and visual communication. My expertise spans UI/UX design, where I excel in creating user-centric solutions through tools like Figma, Miro, InVision, and FigJam. With hands-on experience in wireframing, user research, and prototyping, I bring an innovative approach to each project. My background in Mass Communication and extensive experience as a social media manager further enable me to bridge digital marketing with design, ensuring cohesive user experiences. Additionally, I'm actively exploring how AI can drive new design methodologies.",https://bit.ly/AboladeOlawaleUXDesignPortfolio,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730140559889_OACV. Olawale Abolade.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:36:02.765Z,2024-10-28T18:36:02.765Z,,,,,,,,,
671fd99caa636ae4bac99a13,Shehu Audu Abdurrafiu,+23408136147900,creativedarah@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a pioneering, humble, enthusiastic, and diligent Designer, passionate about providing solutions to issues within the Technology Sector; helps Brands and Companies convey their distinctive stories to connect with potential clientele by crafting beautiful, functional Designs and strategies that tackle human problems. This expertise is fortified by my 4-year stint as a Creative Professional in the field. You can know more about me through the attached link.\nhttps://connectwithme.framer.website/",https://bit.ly/MynewPortfolio,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730140569161_MyRÃ©sumÃ©_2.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:36:12.148Z,2024-10-28T18:36:12.148Z,,,,,,,,,
671fd9cbaa636ae4bac99a22,Ibukun Afolayan ,+2347065046549,ibkfola429@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am writing to apply for the open position of a Product Design Intern  at  your prestigious organization. I have always admired user friendly and innovative products, placing priority on user interaction and experience. As a UX enthusiast, I'm excited about the opportunity to work on diverse projects, ranging from mobile apps to desktop software.\n\nCurrently, I am undergoing training at Incubator Hub which commenced in August, 2024 on product design where I am being trained comprehensively on product design fundamentals in Figma, how to solve problems with intuitive and thoughtful product design. Although I am still learning, I am confident in my ability to conduct users research, and translate user feedback into a productive design that would enhance the users experience.\n\nAttached is the link to basic designs I have been able to work on with Figma, while I am committed to creating other designs. I look forward to collaborating with talented teams to create intuitive and user-friendly designs. \n\nThank you for considering my application. \n\nWarm regards,\nIbukun Afolayan\n\n\n",https://www.figma.com/design/ZnsdRQquKfgCh0vqpU9gZf/Ibukun_Afolayan_Mobile-app-login-screen?node-id=51-2&t=kxBbVpq6ECfNpRsI-1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730140617231_Ibukun_Afolayan_uxdesignCV.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:36:59.247Z,2024-10-28T18:36:59.247Z,,,,,,,,,
