671fda21aa636ae4bac99a2d,Sharon Daniel,+23409025736081,danielsharon004@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Sharon Daniel, I'm a product designer living in Nigeria. I have been a product designer for 1 year, I am proficient in design tools like figma and canva. My strengths lie in conducting user research for my designs, user interface design and design thinking. My approach to design is user-centered. I believe inating products that are not only visually appealing but also highly functional and user friendly. ",https://www.behance.net/danielssharon,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730140703878_Daniel Sharon Oghenofego resume.docx,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:38:25.980Z,2024-10-28T18:38:25.980Z,,,,,,,,,
671fdc27aa636ae4bac99a62,ALI ABDUL-QUADIR,+2349081147466,aliolatunbosun04@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Ali Abdul-Quadir. I have over two (2) years of experience in the UI/UX (User Interface and User Experience) design industry. I have learned, built on my skills and professional knowledge, and worked on a variety of projects that have honed my skills in user research, wire-framing, prototyping, and usability testing. My portfolio includes intuitive and excellent case studies that aim to improve user satisfaction and engagement.\n\nI excel at identifying user pain points and developing innovative solutions. My problem-solving abilities ensure I can create designs that meet and exceed user expectations and needs. Additionally, I possess strong technical skills in the relevant design industry software particularly FIGMA. I also have a solid understanding of product management, product marketing, and technical hands-off processes for the development team.\nI look forward to working with the team, building the firm, and developing its aims and objectives.",Behance link: https://www.behance.net/alidesignportfolio or Figma file: https://www.figma.com/design/MFkmflbFBw5vu8QsjnUaLl/My-Prtfolio-file?node-id=570-394&t=HSHUFL2qi34e2IwF-1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730141218747_My Resume (Ali Abdul-Quadir) (3).pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:47:03.308Z,2024-10-28T18:47:03.308Z,,,,,,,,,
671fddfeaa636ae4bac99a7e,Daniel Makinde,+23407080015505,dnlmakinde@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a product designer with a passion for creating meaningful, user-centered experiences. I started my journey in design with a background in graphic design but early on, I found myself intrigued by how people interact with product and how design can solve problems. I have spent the past few years refining my skill in user research, prototyping and visual design. One of my strengths is my understanding of users needs, I love digging into user feedback, data and research to get to the heart of what people are looking for in a product. Outside of work, I am big ion continuous learning. I often attend design workshops and stay updated on new tools and methods to bring fresh perspective to my work.",https://www.behance.net/danielmakinde1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730141691222_Daniel Makindeâs CV.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:54:54.007Z,2024-10-28T18:54:54.007Z,,,,,,,,,
671fde23aa636ae4bac99a84,Isaac E. ADEBAYO,+2349053316733,isaacadebayoe@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Managers,\n\nI'm a Computer Engineering Student at Obafemi Awolowo University. I believe I am a good fit for this position because of my ability to thrive in a team and work closely with team members to achieve a common, productive goal is what sets me apart.\n\nI am passionate about creating designs and I am someone who thinks critically to provide creative solutions to problems. My hobbies include, playing video games in my spare time, watching Youtube videos on tech products, watching movies, among others.\n\n",www.behance.net/theisaacadebayo,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730141729033_Resume for Isaac ADEBAYO.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:55:31.618Z,2024-10-28T18:55:31.618Z,,,,,,,,,
671fde35aa636ae4bac99a89,Obade Adaobi,+23408124371940,nahommy1997@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I anm a graduate of Yaba College of Technology with a strong background in Office Technology and Management, earning an upper credit. As a certified product designer, I am passionate about crafting designs that are not only functional but also visually appealing. My skill set blends technical proficiency with an eye for aesthetic detail, making my work both practical and engaging.",https://www.behance.net/adaobinnabuife,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730141746869_UPDATED OBADE ADAOBI CV .pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T18:55:49.430Z,2024-10-28T18:55:49.430Z,,,,,,,,,
671fdf91aa636ae4bac99aa2,Damilola Adesina ,+2349033802005,damilolaadeola54@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Damilola, and I recently graduated with a degree in mass communication. During breaks while in school I picked up design as a hobby, soon enough it became a focus to create digital solutions. I’ve already had the opportunity to intern as a product designer, where I worked on creating user-centric designs and collaborating with teams to refine concepts. That experience really deepened my love for the design process, especially solving problems that improve the user experience. I'm excited about the chance to bring my skills here, expand them, and contribute to projects that help users and drive the product forward.",https://www.behance.net/gallery/153941213/TODo-App-project-presentation-inspired-from-youtube,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730142094407_Damilola Adesina Resume.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T19:01:37.411Z,2024-10-28T19:01:37.411Z,,,,,,,,,
671fe03caa636ae4bac99abc,Victoria Acheneje,+23409130747231,achenejevictoria84@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a product designer (UI/UX Designer) with over 1 year of experience. I am proficient with different design tools like Figma, Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, and sketch.\n\nPreviously, I have worked on several design projects like web designs, mobile app designs, wireframes, prototyping and logo designs. These has really helped in expanding my ideas on the basics of designs and it's trends.\n\nI have a good communication skills which makes it easier for me to collaborate faster with team members and adapt quickly in a new environment. ",https://www.behance.net/achenejvictori,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730142266409_Acheneje Victoria UIUX Design Internship Resume.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T19:04:28.925Z,2024-10-28T19:04:28.925Z,,,,,,,,,
671fe0bfaa636ae4bac99ac3,Christabel Etok,+2349122179421,christabeletok@gmail.com,Nigeria,"    I am passionate about product design and have always been fascinated by how thoughtful design can improve user experiences. I have worked on several projects where I focused on creating intuitive and user-friendly designs. I am particularly interested in how design can solve real-world problems and make everyday tasks easier for people.\n   I recently attended a finance fair themed ""Becoming the Bag,"" where I learned valuable lessons about adding value and investing in oneself. This experience has further fueled my desire to contribute positively through design and to continuously improve my skills.\n    I am excited about the opportunity to learn and grow in this internship role and to bring my creativity and dedication to the team.\nThank you for considering my application.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730142397158_Etok Christabel Cv.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T19:06:39.518Z,2024-10-28T19:06:39.518Z,,,,,,,,,
671fe1f4aa636ae4bac99ae6,Olusokun Shukroh Temitope ,+2348169008978,Shukroholusokun@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As an aspiring product designer with a passion for creating user-centered digital experiences, I am eager to apply my skills in problem-solving and design thinking to a dynamic team. My recent experience includes a 30-day design challenge, where I honed my skills in critical thinking, wireframing, and prototyping. \n\nAdditionally, I worked on a HiFi design for Afribites, a food delivery website I developed, which has deepened my understanding of real-world design needs.\n\nI am enthusiastic about the opportunity to grow through hands-on learning, collaborate with experienced professionals, and contribute my creativity to impactful projects. I am confident that my dedication to learning, coupled with a strong foundation in design principles, will make me a valuable addition to your team.\n\nI am presently working  on my portfolio. \n\nBelow  are some links to my recent projects;\n\n(1) Afribites food delivery website:\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/0rHFwKF88a1n1CNOVXHb4e/Afribites-Website?node-id=0-1&node-type=canvas&t=2Su1kpfKhIfqvTcQ-0\n\n(2) 30-Days Design Challenge:\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/uEsOwUBopGctbnZmFJTWrs\n\n(3) Afribites food delivery website  Case Study:\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/NjHLbcLJOWpvPl26GtEbkV/AfriBites-Food-Delivery-Website-Case-study?node-id=0-1&node-type=canvas&t=kqjysHRCZXBk51CB-0\n\n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730142706679_OLUSOKUN SHUKROH TEMITOPE .pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T19:11:48.706Z,2024-10-28T19:11:48.706Z,,,,,,,,,
671fe2c2aa636ae4bac99aed,Onojomofia stanley omoefe,+2348167662268,onojomofiastanley@gmail.com,Nigeria," I’ve gained hands-on knowledge in creating user-centered designs that balance functionality and aesthetics. My experience spans user research, wireframing, prototyping, usability testing and product management. I’ve worked on cross-functional teams to design intuitive interfaces, streamline user flows, and solve real-world problems, ensuring optimal user experiences across web and mobile platforms",https://www.behance.net/gallery/207172735/NestNext-saving-App,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730142911737_Stanley Ab.png,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T19:15:14.414Z,2024-10-28T19:15:14.414Z,,,,,,,,,
671fe36aaa636ae4bac99afc,ADEPOJU SAMUEL OLUWAFEMI,+2347064422483,soadepoju2021@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Product Designer with a focus on creating user-centered and innovative digital experiences. I have experience in designing applications across diverse sectors, from EdTech to e-commerce, where I created intuitive interfaces and worked closely with teams to align design with strategic business goals. I love developing creative solutions to enhance user engagement and usability, and I bring strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail to every project. I’m particularly skilled in tools like Figma, Framer, Illustrator, and constantly learning new techniques to expand my design approach. I’m passionate about collaborating in creative environments, and I enjoy contributing to meaningful products that improve user interactions and satisfaction.",www.behance.net/samueladepoju,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730143080506_SAMUEL O ADEPOJU - Internship.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T19:18:02.730Z,2024-10-28T19:18:02.730Z,,,,,,,,,
671fe514aa636ae4bac99b14,Ogbu promise,+2348167667862,ogbupromise40@gmail.com,NG,"My name is ogbu promise, I’m a graduate with a second class upper in economics, I went into product design in 2022 because of my love for colors and aesthetics, I was also curious to know how websites and mobile apps are being formed. I’m still a learner and I learn new things everyday, I’m a critical thinker and a fast learner, I’ve gone through training programs and I’m equipped enough with the right skill set and I hope to create more appealing designs.",https://www.behance.net/promiseogbu04,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730143502361_Ui_ux cv 2.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T19:25:08.165Z,2024-10-28T19:25:08.165Z,,,,,,,,,
