671fe710aa636ae4bac99b2d,Crystal Bolarinwa ,+2348064877760,bolarinwacrystal@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Bolarinwa Crystal, a multifaceted and detail-driven professional with a passion for media and delivering exceptional customer experiences. With a degree in History and International Relations from Ekiti State University, I've developed strong communication and problem-solving skills that fuel my entrepreneurial spirit.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/crystal-bolarinwa?utm_source=share&utm_campaign=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=android_app,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730144013923_BOLARINWA CRYSTAL'S RESUME.docx,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-28T19:33:36.048Z,2024-10-28T19:33:36.048Z,,,,,,,,,
671fe731aa636ae4bac99b32,ADEYINKA ADEGBOLAHAN ODUWOLE,+2348166085575,adeyinkaadegbolahan@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Adeyinka Oduwole, and I’m a UI/UX Designer with over five years of experience in Visual Design across various industries, including Healthcare, Education, Fashion, and Real Estate. I started in visual design, crafting brand identities and interactive design elements, which developed my eye for detail and user-centered design.\n\nTransitioning into UI/UX, I’ve had the opportunity to work on some impactful projects. For instance, I designed Trakkit, a budgeting app tailored to meet the financial needs of Nigerians. I handled every stage of the project, from user research to prototyping, and successfully created an intuitive interface that addresses real financial challenges. Additionally, I collaborated on the YouTube Summariser project, where I focused on creating a seamless user flow to help users access summaries for various content formats.\n\nI’m passionate about creating intuitive and accessible digital experiences, and I’m excited about this internship opportunity to grow further and make meaningful contributions to your team.",https://www.behance.net/adeyinkaadegbolahan,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730144046718_ADEYINKA ODUWOLE_PD_00.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T19:34:09.499Z,2024-10-28T19:34:09.499Z,,,,,,,,,
