671ff2eaaa636ae4bac99b84,Kingsley Ime ,+23407064416211,kingsleyime.ng@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Kingsley Ime, a product designer. My interests range from technology to innovative design.\n\nWith a passion for crafting impactful and visually compelling experiences. I am known for seamless creativity, transformative ideas, growth mindset, and functionality. With years of industry experience, I have consistently delivered innovative design solutions that resonate with users and drive results.\n\nCombining an intuitive understanding of user-centered design principles with a keen eye for aesthetics, product functionality, and business acumen with a success rate of bringing numerous projects to life across a wide range of industries. Moving product from 10 percent onboarding rates to 60 percent growth in less than 4 months. \n\nMy expertise spans from conceptualization and wireframing to prototyping and final execution. My holistic approach to design incorporates thorough research, iterative feedback, and a deep understanding of market trends, ensuring that each design decision is informed by both strategic insight and creative flair. \n\nI consider myself a valuable assets to organisations who is looking to hire great talents in Product Design (UIUX) role. ",https://linktr.ee/Ukingsleyime  https://bit.ly/4e6CNWR   https://bit.ly/4gDJwJF,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730147047514_U. KINGSLEY IME'S RESUME - PRODUCT DESIGNER 2024.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T20:24:10.813Z,2024-10-28T20:24:10.813Z,,,,,,,,,
