671ff820aa636ae4bac99b9f,Uchenna Imoh,+23407038615772,ebuchenna1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Uchenna Imoh, a digital marketer at TWIF Media. I've been able to generate sales worth 3 million, for a low ticket product, in the space of 3 months via running ads and setting up converting marketing systems.\nPreviously, I worked in the bank as an Internal control officer where I was awarded The Beyond Excellence award for innovation and risk management.\nAs a creative, I've always fancied digital marketing since I became aware of it, especially the UI/UX and automation space. I am looking for opportunities that would enable me harness my skills in the aforementioned areas and also achieve organizational goals.",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1PA-U0TaNcxLH4_JKT1UfJEDDnezcPBSN/view?usp=drive_link,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730148381928_Resume Imoh 4 DM.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-28T20:46:24.293Z,2024-10-28T20:46:24.293Z,,,,,,,,,
671ff866aa636ae4bac99ba4,Fawole Toyosi Florence ,+2348184625915,fawoletoyosi09@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am excited to apply for the Social Media Manager Intern role at Tobams Group. With a year of experience managing social media accounts, I possess a creative mindset, excellent communication skills and proficiency in leveraging platforms like Facebook, Instagram, Twitter and LinkedIn to craft engaging content and drive brand awareness. Additionally, I'm knowledgeable about utilizing SEO keywords to optimize content, enhance search engine rankings and expand online reach. I'm eager to bring my skills, enthusiasm and willingness to learn to contribute to Tobams Group's online success.\n\nThank you for considering my application. ",https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1UQD_ktqU3IeyhKlOb282UFOquYEtWNqD/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=112067080491121779768&rtpof=true&sd=true,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730148451957_Fawole_Toyosi_Florence_Updated CV_093149.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-28T20:47:34.531Z,2024-10-28T20:47:34.531Z,,,,,,,,,
