671fffbfaa636ae4bac99bba,Akosile Nurudeen Olalekan ,+2349067145816,nakosile@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Akosile Nurudeen OlAkoalekan, a product designer with a background in Electrical/Electronics Engineering and specialized training in UI/UX. My passion for design led me to the Nerdzfactory, Innkeeper Academy, 3MTT program, where I honed my skills in user-centered design and worked on impactful projects—like creating a mobile app: emergency (hospital, police and fire safety), website: Betterlife Hub (SDG 1: No Poverty) and more. This experience taught me the value of combining functionality with creativity to solve real-world problems. I’m excited about the opportunity to contribute these skills at Tobams Group and grow within an innovative team that aligns with my career ambitions.",https://www.behance.net/akosilenurudeen,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730150333842_Nurudeen Akosile resume.pdf,6717598e301a84ab876896e0,Product (UI/UX) Designer Intern,2024-10-28T21:18:55.850Z,2024-10-28T21:18:55.850Z,,,,,,,,,
