67200299aa636ae4bac99bd8,Rahmah Ibrahim,+2348029963079,ibrahimrahmah2004@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello! I'm Rahmah, a self-motivated and organized creative who thrives on fresh, out-of-the-box ideas to develop content that resonates with target audiences. \nWith three years of experience in social media management and driving engagement across Meta, TikTok, LinkedIn, and X, I’ve cultivated strategies that create genuine connections and inspire action.\nMy goals align closely with Dr. Ona Newton, CEO/Founder of Tobams Group, especially in empowering and transforming the lives of young tech talents. \nPersonally, I was once part of Tobams Group’s target audience—I came from a place of need, pursuing front-end development with limited resources. \nI reached out to individuals and organizations for help, but responses were either nonexistent or discouraging. \nI wish I’d had the kind of support Tobams Group offers for tech talents. Since I couldn’t access the resources I needed to grow, I made a vow: once I succeed, I’ll help the younger generation access opportunities I didn’t have\nJoining Tobams Group brings me one-step closer to fulfilling that promise. \nI am committed to amplifying the campaign and expanding its reach, using my social media expertise to maximize impact. I believe my journey and passion make me a strong advocate and a valuable asset to Tobams Group's mission.\n",https://rahmahibrahim.my.canva.site/rahmah-ibrahim-s-portfolio,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730151063859_Rahmah's Resume _20241024_154559_0000-1.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-28T21:31:05.869Z,2024-10-28T21:31:05.869Z,,,,,,,,,
