672082b8aa636ae4bac99cb9,Joy Oghoghosa Ogbebor ,+27687597230,ayoj8814@gmail.com,South Africa,"My journey into social media management began with a passion for creating meaningful connections and sharing compelling stories. From the start, I was drawn to the power of social media to engage audiences and build brands, especially after I began managing accounts for Joy's Kitchen and AIM Revolution. I chose to focus on TikTok and Instagram, platforms that are not only user-friendly and visually engaging but also ideal for reaching a broad audience with impactful content.\n\nEquipped with skills in Canva and a keen sense for design, I love creating visually striking posts that reflect the latest trends. My approach is deeply research-driven—I believe staying on top of social media trends and audience preferences is essential to creating content that resonates. Working with these brands has been both challenging and rewarding, helping me develop my style and sharpen my skills.\n\nI’m excited to bring this dedication and experience to a new team, where I can contribute creatively and continue to grow in this dynamic field. I see this internship as a unique opportunity to deepen my skills, learn from industry professionals, and make an impactful contribution.""",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730183861679_Joy-Oghoghosa-Ogbebor--Resume--.pdf,67175c7b301a84ab876896e6,Social Media Management Intern,2024-10-29T06:37:44.309Z,2024-10-29T06:37:44.309Z,,,,,,,,,
