67266bb2560537e0ed8daa2c,Adedeji Balogun,+23408039883534,tayobalogunofficial@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I design high-quality graphics and digital products that improve brand presence and perceived value. This ultimately contributes to a brand's bottom line, enhancing results from marketing and other presale activities.\n\nI provide expert design services, such as Brand Identity, Package design, Label design, Physical/Web banner design, Social Media Graphics, Print Design, Point of Sale Material Design, Illustration, 2D animation and Video Editing for businesses that invest in effective branding and great customer experience.\n\nBusinesses typically attract hundreds, if not thousands, of leads each month. However, poor visual representation can cause up to 38% of potential customers to disengage, losing trust in the brand before making a single purchase. This means if your business generates a thousand (1,000) leads, you could lose three hundred and eighty (380) simply due to poor design. A single moment of doubt can severely impact your sales and revenue.\n\nBut this doesn’t have to be the case, That’s where I come in. By working with me we can elevate your brand’s look and ensure you create a credible and lasting impression. I can help your businesses look the part and turn lost leads and current clients into loyal customers!",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1eI3q8tx4RqN1HMngHiJZjSWGgVnqLxQ1/view?usp=sharing,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730571183653_Resume.pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-02T18:13:06.794Z,2024-11-02T18:13:06.794Z,,,,,,,,,
