67267700560537e0ed8daa59,Emmanuel Bassey,+23407035655075,qraftbassey@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\n\nHi! I'm Bassey Emmanuel, a passionate graphic artist with over a decade of experience in crafting captivating visual stories. With a keen eye for detail and a flair for creativity, I've helped numerous brands shine through innovative designs.\n\nMy expertise spans:\n\n- Branding: Logos, identities, guidelines, and more\n- Motion Design: Animations, basic 3D text building, and dynamic visuals\n- Video Editing: Compelling narratives, seamless transitions, and polished finishes\n\nThroughout my career, I've worked with diverse and established corporations and clients: Jumia Nigeria, Stanbic IBTC,  Axendit, Bullet Nigeria, Beyond Dreams etc. My goal is always to understand their unique needs and deliver bespoke solutions that exceed expectations.\n\nSome of my key strengths include:\n\n- Proficiency in Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign, Premiere Pro, After Effects)\n- Strong understanding of color theory, typography, and composition\n- Excellent communication and project management skills\n- Ability to work under tight deadlines and adapt to changing briefs\n\nWhen I'm not designing, you can find me exploring new design trends, attending industry events, or experimenting with fresh techniques.",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1fSpP-x6AsvGzo_h7tvz1aSCQgtBb-UJm?usp=drive_link,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730574078702_DOC-20240416-WA0017..pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-02T19:01:20.892Z,2024-11-02T19:01:20.892Z,,,,,,,,,
