6726813c560537e0ed8daa6f,Oyedele Felix,+2348138249715,oyedelefelix@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As a graphics designer, my style is rooted in clarity and aesthetics, combining both strategic thinking and artistic vision. I aim to create visuals that not only look appealing but also communicate the message effectively. Also I focus on understanding the audience and purpose of each design, ensuring it serves a function—whether it’s to inspire, inform, or connect emotionally.\n\nIn terms of skills, I’m proficient with Adobe Creative Suite, particularly Photoshop, Illustrator, and InDesign, which allows me to work on diverse projects from digital media to print. I love experimenting with typography and color theory, as I find they can transform a simple layout into something memorable. Whether designing logos, flyers, or full branding kits, I value feedback and iteration to make sure the final design feels right for the client. Pls feel free to explore my portfolio ",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pw2FnEoVySS9duUttKC249HRONsyaOfG/view?usp=drivesdk,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730576697811_OYEDELE Felix 2.docx,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-02T19:45:00.376Z,2024-11-02T19:45:00.376Z,,,,,,,,,
