67287f04560537e0ed8dacb1,Adio AbdulAzeez Olatayo,+23407031684515,adioolatayo29@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As an innovative solution-focused Graphics and Product Designer with a history of education and mentorship from lead designers, I am excited to submit my application for the role of Graphics designer with your company.\n\nOver the last Seven (7) years, I have attended some seminars and training with intensive mentorship. Currently, as a Graphics and designer I can effectively Create high quality designs, develop design content and layouts in line with company's guidelines, Edit images when needed, make a survey on user research, deliver innovative concepts, wireframes, low fidelity and high-fidelity prototypes and engage user experiences. I have eight years experience in Graphics design with a proficient usage of Design software such as Adobe Photoshop, Adobe Illustrator, among others.\n\nI have worked on several projects such as, Proptech Limited, Imperial Mortgage bank, iVantage, Pixelgum, Pitchdeck.design, PMP Payment Project and many other projects.\n\nI am eager to chat more about my qualifications and skills. Please feel free to visit my portfolio Behnace and review my attached Graphics design resume. Feel free to contact me for an interview at any time.",https://www.behance.net/adioolatayo29,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730707202462_Adio Olatayo - Graphics Designer.pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:00:04.119Z,2024-11-04T08:00:04.119Z,,,,,,,,,
