67287f85560537e0ed8dacd1,Favour West,+23408078882868,favourwest29@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm an experienced graphic designer with over 5 years in the field, specializing in Adobe Creative Suite with a strong focus on Adobe InDesign. My expertise lies in creating visually engaging books and magazines, both for digital platforms like Amazon Kindle Direct Publishing (KDP) and for print. I've worked on multiple high-quality projects that emphasize not only aesthetic appeal but also readability and alignment with brand guidelines. I’m passionate about using design to enhance the user experience and make content resonate with its audience. I thrive in collaborative environments, enjoy working with authors and editors to bring their vision to life, and am skilled at managing projects from inception to completion, even under tight deadlines. Staying updated with design trends and continuously refining my technical skills is a priority for me, as I believe it’s crucial to delivering fresh and impactful designs. Joining Tobams Group would be an exciting opportunity for me to leverage my skills in a dynamic, forward-thinking team and contribute to the growth of clients' brands through high-quality design.",https://dev-designwit.pantheonsite.io/west/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730707330748_Resume.pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:02:13.357Z,2024-11-04T08:02:13.357Z,,,,,,,,,
67287f92560537e0ed8dacd8,Ifeanyi Martin Okechukwu,+23408086794673,ifymartin15@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Ifeanyi Martin, a seasoned graphic designer with over seven years of hands-on experience creating impactful visual content for digital platforms. Throughout my career, I've honed my skills in the Adobe Creative Suite, particularly Adobe InDesign, which I use extensively for designing books, magazines, and diverse print materials. I’ve worked with various clients, from media firms to independent authors, ensuring each project meets high design standards while aligning with the brand’s message and goals.\n\nIn my previous roles, I've led branding initiatives, managed end-to-end design processes, and developed creative strategies that resonate with audiences and amplify brand identities. I enjoy collaborating closely with authors, editors, and cross-functional teams to bring stories and ideas to life visually. My passion for staying ahead of design trends and mastering new tools has allowed me to continuously deliver fresh, compelling work that engages readers and enhances the reading experience.\n\nI am particularly drawn to this opportunity at Tobams Group because of the creative scope it offers within digital publishing—a field I am genuinely passionate about and experienced in. I am excited to contribute to your team, bringing both my technical expertise and my enthusiasm for creating outstanding book and magazine designs for Amazon and beyond.",https://bit.ly/IFYMARTINPORT,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730707344555_IFEANYI MARTIN- GRAPHIC DESIGN.pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:02:26.366Z,2024-11-04T08:02:26.366Z,,,,,,,,,
