67287fd7560537e0ed8dacea,Asemota Yemi Osaretin,+23408072661376,asemota.y.osaretin@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a creative professional with six years of experience in graphics design, 3D artistry, and animation. While I have a degree in microbiology, my passion has always been in visual storytelling and design. Currently, I’m working on earning my certification as a 3D artist, and I’m excited to start a YouTube channel to share my Blender 3D knowledge through tutorials. My goal is to focus on modeling iconic structures from Lagos and across Africa, aiming to connect with a broader audience through my work.\n\nI have big plans for the future, including launching my own advertising agency, Microfilms Media, and supporting local brands like Temidun Stitches with their business development. Based in Lagos, I’m always looking for new ways to expand my skills and grow in this industry. Besides my professional pursuits, I’m a big fan of Christian Eriksen and follow football closely, especially recent changes at Manchester United. For me, this journey is all about growth, resilience, and pushing myself to reach new heights creatively and personally.\n\n",https://www.behance.net/gallery/206177763/SOCIAL-MEDIA-FLYER,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730707412801_Asemota Yemi's CV.pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:03:35.660Z,2024-11-04T08:03:35.660Z,,,,,,,,,
