6728848d560537e0ed8dadc3,ADEBAYO ISAAC AREJIOGBE,+2349166815522,adetalker365@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Adebayo Isaac Arejiogbe, I am skilled and experienced in Photoshop, Illustrator, After Effect, Premier Pro, Indesign & Corel Draw.\n\nAs a Graphics Designer for brands such as Transsion Holdings, Globacom Limited, Speedaf Express, Wifi Combat, Open Heavens Int'l Center and many more. I have been responsible for the crafting, designing and representation of copies, brand products and services etc. These opportunities have enabled me to develop skills and experiences I believe will enable me to be an asset to your team.\n",https://dribbble.com/isaacbayo,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730708618677_ADEBAYO-ISAAC-C.png,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:23:41.392Z,2024-11-04T08:23:41.392Z,,,,,,,,,
672884ab560537e0ed8dadca,Ayodele Ayomidotun,+23408065690839,ayodeleayomidotun@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I have seven years of experience as a graphic designer, during which I’ve developed a strong portfolio across various industries, focusing on bringing creative ideas to life in a way that resonates with the audience. I’m passionate about going the extra mile in my work, which is a core aspect of what makes my designs unique. I believe that design isn’t just about aesthetics but about creating meaningful connections. I’m also highly committed to continuous learning, focusing on practical skills that allow me to adapt quickly to new challenges. Outside of work, I enjoy working on personal projects and continually experimenting with new design trends to keep my creativity fresh.",https://www.behance.net/ayodeleayomidodesign,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730708649187_New updated cv.docx,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:24:11.361Z,2024-11-04T08:24:11.361Z,,,,,,,,,
672884ac560537e0ed8dadce,Izuchukwu Chinedum Igwe,+2347030477981,izuigwe39@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi, I'm a creative designer with a high level of versatility. I have worked well with different brands to create standard and functional logos and brand guidelines, posters for Ads, and print designs. I have also worked with different brands on UI/UX Design. \nI'm quite simple, and straightforward. All I do is establish what my client's goals are, and just put all necessary elements of design together to make sure those goals are achieved. \n\nI also play table tennis, or video games for fun in my free hours.",https://www.behance.net/izuchukwuigwe1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730708649932_IZUCHUKWU RESUME 2024.pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:24:12.643Z,2024-11-04T08:24:12.643Z,,,,,,,,,
6728852b560537e0ed8dade1,Soyemi Tomiwa,+23408105961361,soyetomiwa099@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a 300lvl student of the university of Lagos, majoring in the department of Civil Engineering. \nAlthough I study civil Engineering, I have actively honed my skill in graphic designing, product designing, branding and UI/UX design. With the 3 years of experience I have after learning this skill in 2021 and obtained a certificate of completion at the mastermind Academy, I believe I can create visually appealing designs that meet the taste of my clients.\nWith all these said, my proficiency in Figma, Adobe photoshop, adobe creative suits, Corel draw and Canva makes me an exceptional worksman for any job curated. Thank you.",https://shorturl.at/3aSSZ,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730708777346_GRAPHIC DESIGN CV.pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:26:19.917Z,2024-11-04T08:26:19.917Z,,,,,,,,,
6728875e560537e0ed8dae0b,Meroyi Paul,+2349061872075,Lexgraphics124@gmail.com,Nigeria,"l\nI'm Paul, and I'm excited about the Graphic Designer position, With over 5 years of experience in creating awesome designs using Photoshop, Illustrator, UIUX (Web and Mobile) and InDesign, I'm confident I can bring a fresh perspective to your team.\n\nI've worked on everything from brochures to social media graphics, always making sure my designs stand out and stick to brand guidelines. I love collaborating with teams and have a knack for managing multiple projects and tight deadlines.\n\nI’m really looking forward to bringing my creativity to your projects.\n",https://paulmeroyi.framer.website/. ,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730709340422_Main Paul Cv.pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:35:42.601Z,2024-11-04T08:35:42.601Z,,,,,,,,,
67288791560537e0ed8dae16,Mohammed Amir Tijjani,+23408160886010,muhammadamirazare@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nMemory updated\nHere's how you might introduce yourself for this Graphic Designer position:\n\nI am a dedicated and skilled Graphic Designer with over four years of experience, specializing in Adobe InDesign for book and magazine design tailored for Amazon Kindle Direct Publishing (KDP) and print. I hold a strong foundation in typography, color theory, and layout design, which allows me to create visually compelling layouts that align with the unique needs of each project.\n\nThroughout my career, I've successfully designed and printed magazines for organizations such as the Nigerian Society of Petroleum Engineers, Youth Empowerment and Social Support Operations, and Integral Magazine. My expertise in Adobe Creative Suite, including InDesign, Photoshop, Illustrator and Corel Draw, has allowed me to deliver consistent, high-quality results that meet both digital and print standards.\nI am well-versed in Amazon KDP guidelines and print-on-demand requirements, ensuring my designs are optimized for various publishing formats. I thrive in both independent and collaborative environments, and my strong communication skills help me work seamlessly with authors, editors, and project managers. Additionally, I stay up-to-date with the latest design trends and industry best practices, which I believe would make a valuable addition to Tobams Group’s creative team.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730709390350_Mohammed Amir Tijjani cv_n.pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:36:33.131Z,2024-11-04T08:36:33.131Z,,,,,,,,,
672887d0560537e0ed8dae22,Morgan Ayodele Opeyemi,+2348108435541,opeyemimorgan3@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As an experienced graphic designer, I have developed a keen eye for detail and a deep understanding of visual storytelling. My proficiency in design software and tools allows me to create compelling visuals that resonate with diverse audiences. I’m skilled in various areas, including branding, print design, and digital media, enabling me to tackle a wide range of projects. My creativity is matched by my ability to work collaboratively with clients and teams, translating ideas into effective design solutions. I stay current with industry trends, continually seeking inspiration and knowledge to refine your craft. My passion for design drives me to push boundaries and innovate, making me a valuable asset in any creative environment.",www.behance.net/morganopeyemi,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730709455121_Morgan GD.pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:37:36.960Z,2024-11-04T08:37:36.960Z,,,,,,,,,
