672889aa560537e0ed8dae5f,Ebom Laura Awele ,+2347032877807,awelelaurai2018@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello, I'm Laura, a creative and innovative graphic designer with a passion for crafting visually stunning and effective visual communications. With over 2 years of experience in graphic design, I possess a unique blend of artistic talent, innovative and technical skills, and attention to detail.\n\nMy expertise spans various design disciplines, including:\n\n- Branding and identity design\n- Print and digital advertising\n- UI/UX design\n- Motion graphics\n- Web design\n\nProficient in industry-standard design software such as Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, and others), Inkscape, Figma, Canva, Pixellab, PicsArt, CapCut, etc. I stay up-to-date with the latest design trends and technologies.\n\nMy design philosophy revolves around creating engaging, user-centered designs that capture audiences' attention and drive results, I thus hone my skills and knowledge to this effect. I thrive in collaborative environments, working closely with clients and teams to understand project goals and deliver tailored solutions.\n\nSome highlights of my work include:\n\n- Developing brand identities for startups and established companies\n- Designing marketing materials for product launches and campaigns\n- Creating interactive experiences for web and mobile applications\n\nI'm excited to bring my creative energy, technical expertise, and passion for design to Tobams Group, contributing to innovative projects and helping drive visual excellence.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to discussing how my skills align with your design needs.",https://docs.google.com/document/d/1hbjQaDhoObVCF-xCy-a_Uel2whHhODfyq143J-78oOo/edit?usp=drivesdk,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730709928044_3_20241104_094225_0002.png,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:45:30.505Z,2024-11-04T08:45:30.505Z,,,,,,,,,
672889be560537e0ed8dae66,Ademola Sulaimon,+2349161618354,adex.dms@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a graphic designer with over 10 years of experience, specializing in impactful visuals and cohesive brand identities. With recent training in Total Brand Experience and UI/UX design, I focus on creating intuitive and engaging user experiences. My approach combines creativity with strategy, ensuring every project is thoughtful and effective.",https://www.behance.net/gallery/204011181/My-Portfolio,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730709948040_ADEMOLA SULAIMON Resume.pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:45:50.904Z,2024-11-04T08:45:50.904Z,,,,,,,,,
672889e0560537e0ed8dae6d,Abdulazeem Omotoyosi Adebiyi,+2349064224976,harbdulharzym@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Thank you for this opportunity. I'm someone with a passion for innovative design, strong technical proficiency, and a solid record of delivering creative solutions, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to teams.\n\nDuring my academic career, I actively engaged in freelance graphic design and volunteered with organizations to broaden my experience. Through these roles, I developed expertise in design principles, typography, color theory, and layout composition. My proficiency spans industry-standard software, including Adobe Photoshop, CorelDraw, Adobe After Effects, CapCut, and Figma, where I have applied my knowledge of current design trends and best practices.\n\nIn my previous roles as a Graphic Designer at Unveiling Africa and AgriccoNG, I collaborated with content creators and digital marketing teams to deliver impactful visual solutions. These projects ranged from print to digital media, encompassing eye-catching flyers, branding, and marketing collateral. My work has consistently demonstrated a keen eye for detail and a strong aesthetic sense, ensuring that the final products align with brand guidelines and resonate with target audiences.\n\nI thrive in collaborative environments and enjoy the challenge of working in fast-paced, deadline-driven settings. Additionally, I am committed to continuous learning and eagerly embrace new techniques and tools to enhance my craft.",www.behance.net/adebiyiemin,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730709982269_Abdulazeem Adebiyi CV (2).pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:46:24.802Z,2024-11-04T08:46:24.802Z,,,,,,,,,
67288a13560537e0ed8dae73,Achime,+2347056081440,lotexxxdesigns@gmail.com,Nigeria,"**Work Experience Cover Statement**\n\nAs a graphic designer with four years of experience and currently pursuing a degree in Computer Science at Crawford University, I have developed strong skills in design and proficiency in Adobe Creative Suite. My work at Softcom PLC involved diverse projects, including branding and digital marketing, where I effectively collaborated with clients to deliver compelling visual content.\n\nMy academic studies keep me updated on industry trends and innovative techniques, enhancing my ability to create impactful designs. I am eager to apply my experience and education to new challenges in the graphic design field.",https://www.behance.net/lotexxxdesigns,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730710033569_My Resume (Achime).pdf.pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:47:15.730Z,2024-11-04T08:47:15.730Z,,,,,,,,,
67288a1a560537e0ed8dae78,Orkanyichukwu Onah,+23409035495916,dongoodchild@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Natural.\nStudied Physics in UNN. I have a plethora of experiences in Print Production. Currently a freelance brand Artist. Some of my Magazine gigs involve Productions for Rotaract Club of Nsukka, NMBG 2021, 2022 etc. Several micro standalone event brochures and lots more.\n\nI love colour and type.. But what i love the most is a personal time to expand my knowledge and see what others are doing and try to do better each time. I research arts and origins, same with Branding and Branding theories ",https://pin.it/ActgolRez,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730710039813_Personal CV Phanta-3.pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:47:22.376Z,2024-11-04T08:47:22.376Z,,,,,,,,,
