67288c79560537e0ed8daebb,Samuel Oluwatosin Adesanya,+2347037334371,me@samueloadesanya.com.ng,Nigeria,"Hello, I’m Samuel Oluwatosin Adesanya, a Web Developer and IT Solutions Specialist with a focus on building impactful digital platforms. I founded Naija Flames Tech Services, through which I’ve launched innovative projects like ISABI STORE, an online store builder similar to Shopify; ISABI MARKET, an ecommerce website aimed at transforming Nigeria's online marketplace; and ISABI U, a social media platform.\n\nWith a strong foundation in full-stack development, UI/UX design, and digital marketing, I bring a range of skills to the table. I’m also a professional graphic designer, combining my tech expertise with a creative edge. My goal is to leverage technology to support businesses in achieving growth and efficiency through seamless, user-friendly solutions.",https://linkedin.com/in/prince-adesanya,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730710647631_SAMUEL OLUWATOSIN ADESANYA CURRICULUM VITAE.pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:57:29.939Z,2024-11-04T08:57:29.939Z,,,,,,,,,
67288d0d560537e0ed8daec5,Olalekan Olabisi,+2348114780007,olalekanolabisi455125@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a person with a deep appreciation for visual storytelling and a passion for translating ideas into impactful designs. My journey in design began with a keen interest in the arts, which has since evolved into a robust skill set in areas like branding, digital illustration, and social media assets design, etc. I’ve honed my abilities with industry-standard tools like Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, and InDesign, using them to create visuals that are both engaging and purpose-driven.\n\nMy design philosophy centers on creating solutions that are not only visually appealing but also strategically aligned with the client’s goals and target audience. I approach each project by thoroughly understanding the target audience and the brand’s unique voice, which enables me to craft designs that genuinely resonate and inspire. For me, it's not about beauty alone; it's about the ability inspire target audiences and convince them to take decisions after seeing my designs.\n\nWhether I’m working on a brand identity or designing digital interfaces, I prioritize a balance between creativity and functionality to produce results that make a real impact.\n\nI thrive in collaborative environments where creativity is encouraged, and I value the insights that come from teamwork. I’m inspired by the idea of continuous learning and look forward to contributing my skills while gaining new perspectives within your organization. I’m excited about the opportunity to bring fresh ideas, a strong design foundation, and a commitment to quality to your team.",behance.net/olalekanolabisi,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730710794970_Graphic Designer Olalekan Olabisi Resume-4 (1).pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T08:59:57.630Z,2024-11-04T08:59:57.630Z,,,,,,,,,
