672932b4560537e0ed8db40b,Gerald nnaji ,+2348030549959,geraldnnaji55@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As a graphic designer, I bring creativity and precision to every project, specializing in both UI/UX design and brand identity. With two years of experience, I have crafted visually compelling, user-friendly interfaces for web and mobile apps, like his recent project with a logistics tech company, Ontreep. My background in brand identity design ensures that his work not only looks good but also resonates with target audiences and strengthens brand recognition.\n\nBeyond aesthetics, I focus on usability, refining every detail to create a seamless and engaging user experience. Whether it's designing clean, modern interfaces or creating strong, memorable brand visuals, my skills ensure a polished, professional result every time. I also invested in my, currently exploring pictorial illustrations and expanding my software fluency with tools like Adobe Illustrator, making me versatile and adaptable to any project.",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1k7RBNWQt7zq3rAvKYFURKJUi1lR6uI2l,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730753202639_gerald resume.pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T20:46:44.796Z,2024-11-04T20:46:44.796Z,,,,,,,,,
