67293bd2560537e0ed8db434,Olatunji Tobi Joseph,+2348113520237,tobyjoseph02@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Tobi Joseph, a graphic designer woth over 4 years of experience. Being a graphic designer, I have experience in Adobe Creative Suites (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign, etc), Figma, and Canva.\nI specialize in brand identity designs yet I also design and edit book covers and book interiors for self-publishers that align with publishing platforms such as Amazon KDP. I have received positive reviews on my works for most of my clients. I have full knowledge of the publishing process and guidelines (both book cover, manuscript) on Amazon KDP because I, personally, also have my books published on the platform.\n\nPS: I don't ever post clients I have published their books on any of my portfolio site or profile pages. But I do put them in my CV.\n\nRegards",https://www.instagram.com/troydesignsofficial?igsh=MzZ0azdmcXpoc2Zy,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730755536321_Toby's CV.pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-04T21:25:38.562Z,2024-11-04T21:25:38.562Z,,,,,,,,,
