6729c122560537e0ed8db513,Eugene Osariemen Ogbeide,+23408108602983,osariemen.ogb@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a seasoned Motion and Graphic Designer with over 4 years of experience, specializing in delivering clean, communicative designs that reflect my clients' unique brand identities and industry standards. My focus is on creating memorable, modern, and visually compelling designs that establish thought leadership while maintaining simplicity and clarity.\n\nThis is what I keep in mind when I create graphic and motion designs;\n\n1. Communicates the message clearly attaching a memorable experience to the minds of anyone who takes a look. - MEMORABILITY \n\n2. The Use of Visual elements based on the current standard or trend in your industry to make your brand stand out as being a thought leader. - THOUGHT LEADERSHIP\n\n3. The Use of negative space, concise copy, relatable elements and graphic clarity which gives the visual relaxing feel and the audience is able to feel comfortable about the message sent. - SIMPLICITY \n\nHere are my areas of expertise;\n- Logo design\n- Flyers\n- Posters\n- Slide presentations\n- Logo animations\n- 2D explainer motion graphics \n- Event visual identity \n- Brand identity development \n- Brochure document design\n- Social media designs\n- YouTube thumbnail designs\n\nThis is what I will ensure you get if you hire me;\n- Modern style design\n- Submission of tasks before deadlines.\n- AI application to design when necessary.\n- Swift implementation to design revisions. \n- Strict brand adherence.\n- Timely feedback on tasks.\n\nIf you are looking for a highly skilled motion and graphic designer who can bring out the best of your ideas to life, you just found yourself one. \n",https://behance.net/eugeneeogbeide,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730789664039_CV_Eugene Ogbeide 2024.docx (1).pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-05T06:54:26.218Z,2024-11-05T06:54:26.218Z,,,,,,,,,
