672a0af3560537e0ed8db5a0,Wojuola Olamide,+23408130879825,wojuolaolamide22@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nI'm Wojuola Olamide Peter, a creative Graphics Designer with over 7 years of experience in the field. I specialize in using Adobe software including Photoshop, XD, and InDesign to create innovative visual designs. My experience spans across print media, websites, video, and advertising.\n\nI have a Bachelor's degree in Political Science from Federal University Oye Ekiti, and I've worked with several notable companies including Dafem Paint Company, Brandcery Company, and Beam Global Service. In my previous roles, I've successfully designed product labels, managed client projects, and developed website prototypes. One of my proudest achievements was increasing client referral rates by 20% at Brandcery Company through delivering high-quality projects.\n\nI'm proficient in various design tools including Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, After Effects, XD) and Microsoft Office. I also have expertise in UI/UX design, website management, and photography. My approach combines strong attention to detail with a commitment to meeting client objectives while staying within budget constraints.\n\nI've also contributed my skills to various volunteer projects, including work with Hacey Health Initiative and Honneith Media, showing my commitment to using my design expertise for community benefit.",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/14LmAGf1ecC5EY6cIj9C2cwsDnG943zL2,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1730808561551_OLAMIDE CV.pdf,6723b680738fc60aa9aa96b4,Graphic Designer,2024-11-05T12:09:23.882Z,2024-11-05T12:09:23.882Z,,,,,,,,,
