6731b7af862b0900d0d7e3e8,Otuyemi Emmanuel,+23408101544135,Emmanuelola92@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Otuyemi Emmanuel Olaoluwa, and I am a professional with over 3 years of experience in the field of Web Development. I am excited about the opportunity to bring my expertise and skills to your team.\nAs a Web Developer, I have gained invaluable experience in various aspects of the job that have prepared me to take on any new challenges. Firstly, I have honed my skills in creating visually appealing and user-friendly websites for a wide range of clients, with specific knowledge in TailwindCss, Javascript and Typescript. Secondly, I have worked with multiple design teams and have an understanding of how to translate high-fidelity designs and ideas into usable products. Lastly, my expertise in responsive design, accessibility, and optimized web performance are strong suits that I bring to any collaborative project.\nFurthermore, my strengths in collaboration, teamwork, and innovation have helped me excel in the fast-paced environment of a Web Developer. I strive to work collaboratively with design, development, and management teams, creating a smooth and productive work environment. My commitment to teamwork allows me to receive feedback, improve on my skills, and create innovative solutions that drive results.\nIn addition, I possess excellent leadership skills, which I have honed through working with cross-functional teams. I have the ability to manage multiple projects and deadlines effectively and ensure that work is completed to the highest standards.\n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1731311532268_0TUYEMI EMMANUEL.pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2024-11-11T07:52:15.273Z,2024-11-11T07:52:15.273Z,,,,,,,,,
6731b7b6862b0900d0d7e3ef,David Bassey,+23408114740790,davidosky1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an experienced software engineer specializing in JavaScript, Ruby, NodeJS, React, Redux, Ruby on Rails, AWS, and Docker. I currently work at TheSkillGarage and Turing.com, focusing on full-stack development and remote projects. I excels in integrating front-end and back-end technologies, enhancing application performance, and ensuring high code quality through extensive code reviews. I hold a Mastery Certificate in Software Engineering and Fullstack Web Development from Microverse and is pursuing a Bachelor of Science in Computer Science at IU International University of Applied Sciences.\n\nI have extensive experience as a full-stack developer, having worked with TheSkillGarage, Turing.com, and other projects as a self-employed developer. At TheSkillGarage, I spearheaded end-to-end web app development, integrated various technologies, and optimized app performance. At Turing.com, i contributed as a remote software engineer. I also served as a part-time and senior code reviewer at Microverse, performing over 300 code reviews, advising junior developers, and improving the code review process. I worked as a full-stack developer at Food Markies and as a student mentor at WAAW Foundation, where I provided technical support and mentorship.\n\nI am passionate about learning new technologies, contributing to the tech community, and have published an article on polymorphic associations in Ruby on Rails. I am actively seeking new full-stack developer opportunities where I can apply my skills, collaborate with a dynamic team, and grow professionally. You can explore my projects on GitHub and contact me at davidosky1@gmail.com.",https://dev-david-bassey.vercel.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1731311539595_David-CV.pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2024-11-11T07:52:22.610Z,2024-11-11T07:52:22.610Z,,,,,,,,,
