6731cbf6862b0900d0d7e6d9,Jaachimike Okafor,+2347060486584,okaforjaachi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Good day, my name is Okafor Jaachimike, and I'm a front-end developer passionate about creating intuitive, engaging user experiences. I have a solid foundation in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, and I’m proficient in frameworks like React.js and libraries such as Tailwind CSS. I’ve worked on various projects that involved building responsive web applications, focusing on clean and accessible code\n\nIn addition to technical skills, I’m a quick learner and enjoy tackling challenges, which has driven me to constantly improve my skills through personal projects. I’m excited about the opportunity to contribute to Tobams Group, where I can bring my front-end knowledge and grow by learning from experienced developers and I would love to be part of a team that shares my enthusiasm for impactful digital experiences.",https://jaachi-portfolio.netlify.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1731316724384_Jaachimike Resume.pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2024-11-11T09:18:46.886Z,2024-11-11T09:18:46.886Z,,,,,,,,,
