6733134d862b0900d0d7ee09,Uloka Ngozi Gift,+23408067048257,ulokangozi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a passionate frontend developer with a strong foundation in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, and a growing proficiency in modern frameworks like React. My interest in frontend development started when I created a personal website to showcase some small projects, and I was captivated by the process of bringing ideas to life through code. Since then, I've been committed to honing my skills, learning about user experience, and ensuring that my projects are not only functional but also visually engaging.\n\nI recently completed a bootcamp program with TIIDELab and ALX Africa, where I worked on projects that allowed me to build responsive, user-friendly interfaces and collaborate in a team setting. This experience taught me the importance of clean, modular code and the value of feedback in achieving a polished final product. I’m also familiar with using version control systems like Git and enjoy leveraging tools like Figma for design collaboration.\n\nI’m drawn to the opportunity at Tobams Group because of your commitment to innovation and the quality of products you deliver. I believe that an internship here would be the perfect environment for me to deepen my skills, learn from experienced developers, and contribute to projects that make a meaningful impact. I’m excited to bring my attention to detail, creativity, and enthusiasm to your team and to grow as a frontend developer under your guidance.",https://uloka-ngozi-portfolio.netlify.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1731400521791_UlokaNgoziFE.pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2024-11-12T08:35:25.413Z,2024-11-12T08:35:25.413Z,,,,,,,,,
