67362fc95cfc5403be6ac57d,AFUSSAT AFOLABI OMOBOLANLE,+2348136013863,afolabi.afussat@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As a former customer service officer in a bank, I spent my time assisting customers with various banking needs, from opening accounts to resolving issues with transactions. My role required a strong understanding of bank processes, attention to detail, and a focus on providing excellent service, which helped me develop strong communication and problem-solving skills. I enjoyed engaging with customers and ensuring their satisfaction, but I was also driven by a desire to create solutions on the technical side.\n\nThis motivation led me to transition into frontend development. I completed a four-month training program focused on frontend development, where I gained hands-on experience in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, with little React as am still learning more, I earned a beginner’s certificate. Now, I’m working on building a functional e-commerce website, incorporating features like product categories, a search bar, cart functionality, and various forms, which allow me to apply what I've learned and further develop my skills. It’s an exciting journey combining my customer service insights with technical abilities to create intuitive, user-friendly interfaces.",https://github.com/Hafsof1912,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1731604421941_AFUSSAT OMOBOLANLE_AFOLABI_Resume.docx,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2024-11-14T17:13:45.083Z,2024-11-14T17:13:45.083Z,,,,,,,,,
