673640c65cfc5403be6ac5d5,Nnamdi Raymond Nnadi,+2348063290848,nnamdi.raymondoct@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a seasoned Front-end Developer with a passion for crafting seamless user experiences. With a strong foundation in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, I bring creativity and precision to web development. My expertise extends to React for building dynamic interfaces and Node.js with Express for robust server-side applications. I also have hands-on experience with MongoDB, ensuring efficient data management.\n\nThroughout my career, I have successfully translated design concepts into responsive and interactive websites, emphasizing clean and maintainable code. I am highly adaptable, detail-oriented, and thrive in collaborative environments, always keeping up with the latest industry trends. My commitment to delivering high-quality, user-centric solutions has been a driving force in my journey as a front-end developer. I am also open to learning new skills to further expand my expertise.",https://nnamdi-portfolio.vercel.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1731608770926_Nnamdi_CV_resume_latest.pdf (1).pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2024-11-14T18:26:14.369Z,2024-11-14T18:26:14.369Z,,,,,,,,,
