6756a76426f3c2567eb4632a,Orimolade Eniola,+2347069774330,orimoladeeniola65@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear hiring manager, \n\nI am writing to apply for the UI/UX Designer position at Tobams Group, as advertised on LinkedIn, I have 4 years of experience in designing intuitive and engaging user interfaces, I am confident that my skills in user research, wire-framing, prototyping, and collaboration would be an asset to your team. \n\nAt my Previous Company, (YangaPlug) I led a redesign of our mobile app version 2, resulting in a 60% increase in user engagement. I am proficient with design tools like Figma and I have experience working closely with developers to ensure seamless implementation of designs.\n\nI’ve attached my resume and portfolio for your review and would love the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Tobams Group.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration. \n\nBest regards,\nOrimolade Eniola\n",https://www.behance.net/eniolaorimolade,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733732193206_My_CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:16:36.288Z,2024-12-09T08:16:36.288Z,,,,,,,,,
