6756a83426f3c2567eb4639a,Mary Ogu ,+2347056100273,marypreciousogu@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello, I'm Mary, I am passionate about using technology to improve people's lives. Through out my career, I have achieved amazing and transforming results as a Product Designer. These accomplishments have been possible due to my strong technically skills such as: User Research, User Flows, A/B testing, Prototype, Wireframes etc.\nAs I have grown in my career, I have transitioned into more leadership roles where I get to use my skills to mentor others. I am excited about the opportunity and look forward to hearing from you soon.",https://www.behance.net/ogumary-precious,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733732402275_Mary's Resume (1).pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:20:04.470Z,2024-12-09T08:20:04.470Z,,,,,,,,,
