6756a84e26f3c2567eb463b0,Benjamin Osagie,+23407012987031,Benjaminosagie24@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am interested in the UX/UI Designer position. With a robust background in product design and a proven track record of delivering impactful solutions, I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to your esteemed organization.\n\nThroughout my 3+ years of experience in product design, I have had the privilege to work on diverse projects that spanned across industries, allowing me to develop a versatile skill set. From conceptualizing ideas to refining designs and collaborating closely with cross-functional teams, I have consistently focused on delivering elegant and effective design solutions that cater to user needs and business goals. Notable achievements include:\n\nPioneering the design of innovative features for a Fintech product (Switch by Sterling) such as flight booking, international airtime and data plans, and currency swap functionalities, resulting in substantial increases in user retention, conversion rates, and payment processing efficiency.\nOverseeing the development of in-app notifications and secure card tokenization, contributing to heightened user satisfaction and data security.\nCollaborated with other designers on an Edutech Platform with diverse features ranging from a Website to a Learning Management System that brought about an increase in user retention by 20%\nMy proficiency in design tools such as Figma and my understanding of design thinking principles have enabled me to craft visually appealing and functional designs. Additionally, my experience collaborating with product managers, developers, and other stakeholders has taught me the importance of effective communication and teamwork in achieving successful project outcomes.\n\nI am genuinely impressed by the firm's commitment to pushing the boundaries of innovation and creating products that resonate with users.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I am excited about the opportunity to contribute my expertise to your team and help the firm continue to create remarkable products. I'm looking forward to talking with you about how my qualifications align with your needs.\n\nBelow is my portfolio for your perusal\n\nVisual design highlights: www.dribbble.com/benosas\nBehance: www.behance.net/benosas\nLive Projects: https://iseschool.co/\n\nSincerely,\nBenjamin",https://www.dribbble.com/benosas,"https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733732428500_Benjamin Osagie,.Resume.pdf",67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:20:30.647Z,2024-12-09T08:20:30.647Z,,,,,,,,,
6756a85b26f3c2567eb463b8,Toheeb Giwa,+23409024314198,toheebgiwa75@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Giwa Toheeb, a creative UI/UX designer passionate about transforming user problems into intuitive, impactful design solutions. With expertise in crafting web and mobile applications, I focus on aligning user needs with business goals, ensuring exceptional experiences.",https://www.behance.net/toheebgiwa,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733732438507_TOHEEB-GIWA-Resume-1.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:20:43.142Z,2024-12-09T08:20:43.142Z,,,,,,,,,
6756a86c26f3c2567eb463c1,Darlington Echez Umeh,+23408061691165,umeh.echez@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a creative and resourceful UI/UX Designer with over two years of experience designing intuitive and user-friendly digital products. I specialize in creating contemporary design solutions that enhance user engagement and improve business outcomes.\n\nIn my most recent role as Founding Product Designer at MeditechHealth, I led the design of healthcare modules that optimized workflows, improved patient care, and reduced registration time by 15%. Prior to that, I contributed to the success of Techtimal by launching four on-time and budget-friendly projects, improving user experience through research-driven strategies. My journey began at SideHustle.ng, where I honed my skills in wireframing, usability testing, and collaboration.\n\nEquipped with technical proficiency in tools like Figma, Protopie, and Hotjar, I combine a user-centered approach with a keen eye for detail to deliver designs that solve real-world problems.\n\nI thrive in dynamic environments and am passionate about using design to create seamless and impactful user experiences.",https://www.behance.net/chezz_,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733732457603_RESUME_ DARLINGTON ECHEZ UMEH.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:21:00.639Z,2024-12-09T08:21:00.639Z,,,,,,,,,
6756a88026f3c2567eb463ce,Gibson Ikenna,+2349079895981,ikennagibson@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Product Designer with 4 years of experience creating easy-to-use, visually appealing digital products. I focus on solving real problems through thoughtful design. For example, at Indicina, I worked on a platform that helped businesses analyze bank statements quickly, which made the process smoother and boosted adoption.\n\nRight now, I’m at Custodian Investment PLC, where I’m redesigning their mobile app to help users access financial services more easily, catering to both older and younger customers. I enjoy designing products that make a real impact—whether that’s making things simpler for users or helping businesses achieve their goals.\n\nOutside of work, I like exploring new design ideas and watching contents on wildlife experiences leveraging Youtube platform.",https://craftedbygibbie.notion.site/Gibson-Ikenna-1dd40fd2fbd646c2a47b4762229e060c,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733732477888_Gibson Ikenna's Resume.docx.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:21:20.401Z,2024-12-09T08:21:20.401Z,,,,,,,,,
6756a8a426f3c2567eb463e0,Okechi Emezue ,+23409033941977,davecole006@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a motivated designer with 4 years of experience working with remote teams and scaling digital products from ideation to launch. As a creative I use design as a tool to solve business issues by crafting beautiful and user-friendly interfaces, and also bring them to life using no-code development tools.\n\nI am proficient in Figma, design systems, prototyping, no code web development, ",https://okechi.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733732512712_CV 24.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:21:56.640Z,2024-12-09T08:21:56.640Z,,,,,,,,,
6756a8c626f3c2567eb463ec,Tochukwu Ubah,+23407044284237,ubahtobah@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Tochukwu Ubah. I studied Computer Science at the Federal University of Petroleum Resources, Effurun, and I have over 3 years of experience as a UI/UX designer. Throughout my career, I have worked on numerous projects, both organizational and freelance, helping companies grow and establish themselves in the digital market space.\n\nI specialize in creating intuitive and impactful designs, with a strong portfolio that includes revamping websites, developing social media platforms, and building innovative products from scratch. My passion lies in designing solutions that not only solve problems but also enhance user experiences on a global scale.\n\nMy ultimate goal is to contribute to building something truly innovative that will serve the next—or current—billion users.",https://toochi.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733732547420_Tochukwu Ubah-Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:22:30.014Z,2024-12-09T08:22:30.014Z,,,,,,,,,
