6756ac0e26f3c2567eb464cf,Adebowale Olusunmade,+2348137267695,ayursunmade@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a results-driven UI/UX Designer with extensive experience crafting user-centered digital solutions that align business goals with user needs. I specialize in creating intuitive, visually engaging, and seamless digital experiences across industries such as marketing, fitness, shipping, and technology.\nMy notable roles include UI/UX Designer at Solve, Strata Marketing Nigeria, and Findme LLC, as well as Lead Product Designer at Steveraton Group Incorporated. With a focus on simplifying complex processes, I excel at guiding projects through the entire design lifecycle—from research and concept development to prototyping, user testing, and implementation.",https://uxdebo.netlify.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733733387671_ADEBOWALE OLUSUNMADE CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:36:30.529Z,2024-12-09T08:36:30.529Z,,,,,,,,,
