6756acbd26f3c2567eb464fd,Khafilat Akinpelu ,+2348051850450,akinpelukhafilat@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Khafilat Akinpelu a self-driven designer who is passionate about excellence.\n\nMy design career started with graphic designing, but it got a point when I wanted more that is what led me to Product Designing.\nMy design process combine user needs and business goals to bring to live a product that satisfy the needs of the user and business goals of the company.\n\nI am passionate about turning users problems into opportunities.",https://www.behance.net/akinpelkhafila,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733733562692_ Resume - Khafilat Akinpelu.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:39:25.246Z,2024-12-09T08:39:25.246Z,,,,,,,,,
6756acd726f3c2567eb46505,Elizabeth Ajayi,+23408141163863,ajayimorounfayo2019@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello Hiring Manager, \n\nI hope this message finds you well.\n\nMy name is Elizabeth Ajayi, and I am reaching out to express my strong interest in joining your team as a UI/UX Designer. \n\n\nI'm passionate about crafting intuitive, user-centred digital experiences that look beautiful and solve real problems. With 4years+ of experience working across various industries, l specialize in prototyping, wireframing, and design systems, ensuring that every product I design is optimized for user and business goals.\n\nI thrive on creating seamless user journeys by understanding the needs, pain points, and motivations of end-users. My approach combines creativity and research to bring ideas to life while focusing on delivering practical solutions that enhance user experience.\n\n\nMy key expertise includes:\n\n-   Prototyping & Wireframing: Building and testing interactive prototypes that streamline the design process and ensure user satisfaction.\n\n-   User Research and Design Thinking involves deep-diving into user behaviours and applying design thinking methodologies to create functional and innovative solutions.\n\n-   Figma & Design Systems: Leveraging tools like Figma to create scalable design systems and efficient team collaboration.\n\n-   Continuous Learning: I'm always exploring new trends, tools, and techniques in the UX/Ul landscape, ensuring that my work stays relevant in an ever-evolving industry.\n\nI am passionate about purposeful design and enjoy working closely with clients and development teams to bring designs from concept to reality.\n\n\nWhen not designing, I explore new UX/UI design trends, share insights with my network, and contribute to the design community through articles and discussions. \n\nI would greatly appreciate the chance to discuss potential opportunities further and learn more about your team’s goals and vision.\n\n\nPlease let me know if there is a convenient time for a call.\n\nThank you for considering my application.\n\n\nI look forward to the possibility of working together and contributing to the team's continued success.\n\n \n\nSincerely,\n\nElizabeth Ajayi,\n\najayimorounfayo2019@gmail.com\n\n( Portfolio: https://www.behance.net/elizabethajayi21)\n\nSoft Skills: \n\nCreativity \n\nCommunication\n\nTime Management \n\nTeamwork \n\nProblem Solving \n\nStrong Work Ethic \n\nConflict Resolution",https://www.behance.net/elizabethajayi21,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733733588348_ELIZABETH AJAYI CV_UX.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:39:51.777Z,2024-12-09T08:39:51.777Z,,,,,,,,,
6756ad8826f3c2567eb4652e,Favour Hayes,+2347069508156,favourhayes47@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a passionate Product Designer with a focus on user-centric design. I have experience in web, mobile design as well as graphic and am proficient in Figma, Photoshop, Illustrator. I'm excited about the opportunity to contribute to the company and create exceptional user experiences.\n",https://www.behance.net/favourhayes,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733733765671_favour hayes CV 24.docx,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:42:48.325Z,2024-12-09T08:42:48.325Z,,,,,,,,,
6756adde26f3c2567eb46540,Joshua Okonkwo,+2348105894695,okonkwojoshua3@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Joshua and I've been designing for just under 2 years. Over the years I have built expertise in Ui/Ux Design and also the knack for successfully delivering projects. \n\nA little about my experience - I have been involved in the design of websites, dashboards and mobile applications across various sectors, including ecommerce, fintech, entertainment, and property management systems amongst others. \n\nMy interest includes user research, ideation, visual designs and usability studies.  I have also picked interest in illustration designs and low code development. \n",https://joshui.vzy.io/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733733851622_Joshua Okonkwo Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:44:14.965Z,2024-12-09T08:44:14.965Z,,,,,,,,,
6756ae5026f3c2567eb4654e,Adeyinka Akinyemi,+23408157336527,akinyemiadeyinka25@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a highly creative and driven product designer with a passion for using design to improve people's lives. My background in industrial design and human-centered design principles has equipped me with a strong understanding of how to turn ideas into tangible products. I have a knack for creating visually appealing and intuitive products that meet the needs of users. Whether working in a team or leading a project, I am committed to delivering high-quality designs that not only look great, but also solve real-world problems. With my design skills, technical expertise, and passion for making a difference, I am eager to bring value to any organization.",https://www.behance.net/akinyemadeyink,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733733963600_Sample 1.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:46:08.500Z,2024-12-09T08:46:08.500Z,,,,,,,,,
6756ae5626f3c2567eb46556,Promise Adamu ,+2348154421482,adamupromise0@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Promise Adamu, a junior product designer passionate about creating user-centered solutions that are both functional and visually appealing. I have experience designing digital products like CleanHub, a waste management app, and collaborating with teams at TrustSpace and DongMi technologies to improve user experiences. I enjoy taking ideas from concept to execution, focusing on simplicity and impact. Outside of work, I’m always exploring ways to grow, whether it’s learning new design tools or refining my approach to solving problems creatively or watching Personal/lifestyle Vlogs on YouTube when I need to breath. ",https://www.behance.net/gallery/208198253/CleanHub-Waste-Management-App-Case-Study,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733733971708_Adamu Promise (Product Design Resume).pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:46:14.773Z,2024-12-09T08:46:14.773Z,,,,,,,,,
6756ae7b26f3c2567eb46566,Ajose Damilare,+23409059428941,ajosedare4u@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an experienced designer with over five years of expertise, specializing in creating user-centric designs with a strategic focus on market size and business growth. Currently, I work at Konga, where I played a pivotal role in achieving our best Black Friday sales record through high-converting marketing campaign landing pages and innovative user acquisition strategies. Despite challenging economic conditions in Nigeria, my efforts contributed to our record monthly sales performance.\n\nI have had the privilege of working with globally recognized brands such as L'Oréal, Starlink, Huawei, and Samsung, designing impactful campaigns that drive measurable results. My approach combines creative design with a deep understanding of user behavior and business objectives, ensuring not only a superior user experience but also sustainable growth for the company.\n\nI thrive in dynamic environments and look forward to bringing my expertise and proven track record of success to drive impactful results for your organization.",https://www.ajosedamilare.com/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733734008843_Ajose Damilare Official Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:46:51.280Z,2024-12-09T08:46:51.280Z,,,,,,,,,
6756aebf26f3c2567eb46573,Bukunola Olorunda,+2348100132860,debbee96@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a passionate Product Designer with over four years of experience creating user-centered designs that balance functionality and aesthetics. My academic foundation in Information Technology and further studies in Information Systems, along with hands-on expertise in tools like Figma, enable me to deliver intuitive, accessible, and visually compelling digital products.\n\nIn my previous roles, I’ve collaborated closely with product owners/managers, engineers, and researchers to ideate, prototype, and refine solutions that align with business goals and user needs. My portfolio includes designing fintech dashboards, social support platforms, and mobile-first interfaces, showcasing a strong command of design systems, responsive design, and usability testing.\n\nI am deeply committed to accessibility and inclusivity, ensuring my designs cater to diverse user needs. Staying updated on emerging trends and technologies, I continuously strive to innovate and bring fresh perspectives to my projects. Joining your team excites me because of your dedication to enhancing user experiences and crafting impactful solutions, and I look forward to contributing to your mission.",https://www.behance.net/bukunolaolorunda,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733734074922_UX_CV_2024.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:47:59.037Z,2024-12-09T08:47:59.037Z,,,,,,,,,
6756aecc26f3c2567eb4657b,Faderera Alade-dauda,+23408067946524,aladedauda2@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi, I’m Faderera, a product designer with a little over three years of experience. I enjoy creating designs that not only look good but also make things easier for people to use. I’ve worked mostly in the finance and fintech space, where I’ve learned how to simplify complex ideas and make them accessible to everyday users.\n\nI love working with teams, bouncing ideas off others and figuring out how to turn them into real solutions. I’m also really interested in how design systems help keep everything consistent and easy to use. Lately, I’ve been exploring ways to use AI in my work, which has been both fun and eye-opening.\n\nWhat I’m most excited about is the chance to make products that actually help people and leave them with a great experience. I’m adaptable and always eager to learn something new, which I think would be a great fit for this role.",https://designsbyrera.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733734089073_Faderera CV_Oct_2024_.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:48:12.967Z,2024-12-09T08:48:12.967Z,,,,,,,,,
6756aede26f3c2567eb46582,Chiamaka Okeke,+2348135624147,chiamakaokeke2905@gmail.com,Nigeria,"A results-driven UI/UX Designer with demonstrated success in creating user-centric digital solutions across fintech, healthcare, and e-commerce platforms. Proven track record of increasing product adoption by 40% through innovative design solutions and training 100+ aspiring designers. Combines strong user research capabilities with practical implementation to deliver intuitive interfaces that drive business growth. Seeking to leverage design expertise and collaborative skills to create impactful digital experiences in a challenging product design role.    ",https://chiamaka-okeke.super.site/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733734107341_Chiamaka Priscaline Okeke - Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:48:30.026Z,2024-12-09T08:48:30.026Z,,,,,,,,,
6756b05f26f3c2567eb46592,ese tuoyo,+23409133351898,tuoyoese07@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a product designer with 4 years of experience creating user-centered solutions across digital marketing,fintech,blockchain and health industry. My expertise lies in user research, usability study,wireframing, prototyping, and visual design and I solve complex problems by designing intuitive and  accessible experiences that also aligns with the company goals and objectives.\n\nFor example, in my previous role at VerifyCopy, I led the design  of a feature which is uploading multiple documents at once after carrying out a usability study, which resulted in 12% increase in user satisfaction. I enjoy\ncollaboration, working closely with cross-functional teams to align design strategies with business goals.\n\nOutside of work, I enjoy staying up to date on design with my well curated social media pages and some design websites, experimenting with new tools, which helps me stay inspired and bring fresh perspectives to my projects.",https://www.behance.net/esetuoyo,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733734492542_ESE_ CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:54:55.172Z,2024-12-09T08:54:55.172Z,,,,,,,,,
6756b07426f3c2567eb4659b,Ololade Olatunji,+23408107570178,ololade0507@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Greetings ma/sir,\n\nI am thrilled to apply for the Product Designer position, With 3 years of experience in UI/UX designing and an additional 2 years of frontend development expertise, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team and help create intuitive, user-centered designs that enhance both usability and aesthetic appeal.\n\nI am passionate about solving real user problems through design and creating products that are both functional and visually appealing. I stay up-to-date with the latest design trends and tools such as Figma, Sketch, and Adobe XD, and I'm always exploring new ways to push the boundaries of user experience.\n\nI would love the opportunity to bring my design expertise and frontend development knowledge, in creating visually appealing designs I am excited about the potential to contribute to your projects and work alongside a talented team.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my experience and skills can be of value to the company.\n\nportfolio Link",https://www.behance.net/Lolade_olatunji,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733734513184_Design CV 3.0 (updated).pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T08:55:16.660Z,2024-12-09T08:55:16.660Z,,,,,,,,,
6756b1b626f3c2567eb465ac,Paul Bassey ,+2349049656101,paulbassey255@gmail.com,Nigeria,"In a world where anyone can design products, standing out is crucial to attract potential customers. I specialize in assisting individuals and businesses in establishing their digital presence from scratch. My approach extends beyond aesthetics—I create compelling designs that not only capture attention, but also convert visitors into engaged customers. \n\nI offer a profound understanding of effective strategies to attract customers and my methods are based on unique insights that distinguish your brand.\n\nMy aim is to create digital experiences that extend beyond aesthetics, and I strive to inspire immediate actions, guaranteeing that your audience not only notices your brand but also engages with it.\n",https://mixed-address-ef0.notion.site/Paul-Bassey-s-Product-Design-Portfolio-c685f277f915499c8d1bd2b57281e209,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733734834915_NEW RESUME (PRODUCT DESIGN).pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T09:00:38.199Z,2024-12-09T09:00:38.199Z,,,,,,,,,
6756b1bd26f3c2567eb465b3,Akintunde Caulcrick,+2349073651020,caulcrickakintunde@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a dynamic and results-oriented Product Designer with 4+ years of experience crafting user-centric digital products. Skilled in all phases of the design process, from user research and ideation to\nprototyping and launch. Proven ability to collaborate effectively with cross-functional teams to\ndeliver high-impact solutions that increase user engagement and drive business growth.",https://bit.ly/akintunde_caulcrick_portfolio,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733734843313_Akintunde-Caulcrick-3.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T09:00:45.927Z,2024-12-09T09:00:45.927Z,,,,,,,,,
6756b1f026f3c2567eb465bf,James David,+2348135982305,james.designer19@gmail.com,Nigeria,"A User-centered product designer with 4+ years of crafting intuitive, impactful experiences across platforms, helping startups and enterprises like banks bring ideas to life. Adept at transforming complex design challenges into clear, user-friendly solutions.\n\nI’m not just a designer, I collaborate with developers, product managers to build from design to production and marketers post-production.",https://www.behance.net/jamesdavid9,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733734892208_James David - Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T09:01:36.089Z,2024-12-09T09:01:36.089Z,,,,,,,,,
6756b1fd26f3c2567eb465c7,Marcus Ajayi ,+2348157421267,marcusajayi1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a passionate and results driven Ui/UX Designer and Webflow developer with a proven ability of creating visually stunning and high-performing websites. With a keen eye for design aesthetics and a commitment to user-centric experiences, I specialize in leveraging the full potential of Webflow's powerful capabilities.\n\nMy journey in the digital space is one of seamlessly blending creativity with technical expertise.  I excel in responsive web design, ensuring that every website I create not only adapts flawlessly to various devices but also delivers an exceptional User experience. From concept to implementation, I am committed to transforming ideas into reality, offering clients unique projects.\n\nCollaboration lies at the heart of my approach. By understanding the unique needs and goals of my clients, I craft my designs to reflect their brand identity and vision. Whether you're a startup looking to make a bold online debut or an established business aiming to revamp your digital presence, To work with me is to elevate your web experience. Let’s Create Together",marcusajayi.webflow.io,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733734905353_Marcus Ajayi_Design_CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T09:01:49.298Z,2024-12-09T09:01:49.298Z,,,,,,,,,
6756b21b26f3c2567eb465d3,Momodu success Mohammed ,+2347067255677,momodumohammedsuccess@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Momodu Success Mohammed by name, with over 3 years of working experience designing products for fintech, digital banking, and the Nigerian military. In the last 3 years, I have helped to build a fintech product that has made a turnover of N9 billion transactions in the last year. As a product designer, my core aim is building products that connect with the final user, which in return increases the ROI of the business owner. ",https://linktr.ee/momodusuccess,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733734936526_Momodu product design cv.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T09:02:19.218Z,2024-12-09T09:02:19.218Z,,,,,,,,,
6756b27a26f3c2567eb465e6,Nkemdilim Ugwu,+23409023033558,dnkem114@gmail.com,Nigeria,"A versatile Product Designer with a strong foundation in user-centered design, UX/UI, and visual design. Proven ability to deliver innovative, user-centric products. Interested in mentoring young designers and creating impactful experiences. With a background in psychology and human behavior,I possess a unique ability to understand user motivations and create products that resonate deeply. I am skilled in understanding user needs and crafting solutions that drive results. I am excited to leverage my skills and passion to contribute to innovative projects and make a lasting impact.",https://bit.ly/3XxxvwB,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733735031616_Nkemdilim P. Ugwu - Product Designer.docx.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T09:03:54.642Z,2024-12-09T09:03:54.642Z,,,,,,,,,
