6756b35c26f3c2567eb46604,Olumayokun Ogunmuyiwa,+23408132182983,ogunmuyiwamayokun@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a versatile creative professional with a background in Product (UI/UX) Design, Graphics Design, Brand Identity Design, UX Instruction and Research, and Business Analysis. With over four years of experience in product design and development and six years in the broader design industry, I bring a wealth of experience and creativity to my work.\n\nSince 2015, I have collaborated with a wide range of brands and held various roles in the creative field. I currently serve as the Senior Product Designer at 9 Payment Service Bank (9PSB), where I collaborate with the product, marketing, IT and customer experience teams to develop clear roadmaps and strategies for expanding our customer base. My contributions have been instrumental in achieving over 50% growth, supporting the goal of banking the unbanked and driving sales.\n\nI am an experienced designer with a proven track record of leading creative teams. My core strengths include identifying market opportunities, mentoring designers, and implementing effective management strategies. I am passionate about innovation, driven to solve problems, and eager to take on new challenges in a dynamic environment. I am currently seeking opportunities to leverage my skills and experience for continued professional growth.\n\nI am motivated to pursue the Product Designer position at Tobams Group due to the company’s commitment to innovation and solutions centred around users. The significant influence of Tobams Group in various sectors resonates with my enthusiasm for designing intuitive and captivating solutions that address actual challenges. With a solid background in user experience and a dedication to creating visually appealing and practical products, I am excited to apply my skills to enhance meaningful user engagements and improve Tobams Group’s online presence.\n\nMy enthusiasm, persistence, and strong work ethic enable me to consistently strive for excellence and overcome setbacks. I believe that my attention to detail, ability to generate unique concepts, and leadership skills would make me a valuable asset to Tobams Group. I welcome the opportunity to discuss in greater detail how my skills can contribute to the company's success.\n\n\n\n",tinyurl.com/ykuh4jxk,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733735256330_Ogunmuyiwa Mayokun's Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T09:07:40.425Z,2024-12-09T09:07:40.425Z,,,,,,,,,
6756b41126f3c2567eb4661f,Tomiwa Akinwande,+2348077785742,wande.thompson@hotmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi I'm Tomiwa, a UI/UX designer passionate about helping clients bring their ideas to life and grow their businesses. I create tailored design solutions for various digital products across different industries. By deeply immersing myself in each project, I strive to craft unique user experiences that drive success and elevate your business.",https://dribbble.com/wandethompson,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733735436871_My CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T09:10:41.862Z,2024-12-09T09:10:41.862Z,,,,,,,,,
6756b6b826f3c2567eb4664b,Emmanuel Odey,+23408187927370,odeymannuel@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Creative UI/UX Designer, Framer Developer, and Graphic Designer with over 3+ years of experience in designing engaging and intuitive interfaces for web and mobile applications. Skilled in translating complex requirements into visually appealing, user-centered solutions, I combine expertise in UI/UX, interactive Framer development, and graphic design to deliver cohesive digital experiences. Proficient in Figma, Adobe XD, Photoshop, and Framer, I am committed to enhancing user engagement and aligning design strategies with business objectives.",https://www.behance.net/designnee,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733736116532_EMMANUEL ODEY (desNee) RESUME 2024.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T09:22:00.251Z,2024-12-09T09:22:00.251Z,,,,,,,,,
