6756b8c226f3c2567eb46668,Bakare Waliyilahi Adeyanju,+2349064747300,waliyilahibakare@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Bakare Waliyilahi Adeyanju, and I am a product designer with three years of experience dedicated to creating intuitive, human-centered solutions. I excel in understanding user pain points through extensive research and translating these insights into effective designs that align with business objectives. \n\nMy specialties include mobile-first design, accessibility, and interactive prototyping, demonstrated by my leadership in designing a crypto and gift card trading application, which significantly boosted user retention and streamlined onboarding. I thrive in collaborative environments, working closely with developers and stakeholders to deliver timely solutions. I am particularly drawn to your company’s commitment to leveraging digital technologies for growth and innovation, as this resonates with my passion for making a meaningful impact through design. I am enthusiastic about the opportunity to contribute my skills and user-first approach to your team.",https://www.behance.net/waliyilbakare,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733736638601_Bakare-CV 1.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T09:30:42.713Z,2024-12-09T09:30:42.713Z,,,,,,,,,
6756ba8b26f3c2567eb4667f,Emmanuel Israel,+2348108736784,emmanuel.e.israel@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello Tobams Group Hiring Team,\n\nI am a Product Designer with 4+ years of experience crafting user-centered and visually appealing designs. I'm NOT your usual product designer. I'm also NOT your typical website, web app, software, and mobile app designer. I do NOT take inspiration from existing designs (whether or not I designed them) and give you a derived copy; I create different masterpieces and solutions every time. I do NOT create ambiguous designs. I do NOT create mediocre designs. I do NOT make excuses, or prolong or postpone projects.\n\nSo who AM I?\nI'm a gentle breeze that will fan your inner flames, nurturing your inner brilliance. I'm a strategic, creative designer, and a restless explorer. I produce business strategies and impeccable digital designs. I am reliable; I stand for excellence and integrity.\n\nMy background includes working as a product designer at Growth and Development Asset Management Limited (GDL) where I have recently and successfully designed and launched the company’s 2 flagship products leading to 85% user and stakeholders’ satisfaction, 2k+ (1k and 1k) downloads in 3 weeks, 3.7 and 4.1-star ratings on Play Store and App Store respectively in 2 weeks, and a $30.3k increase in investment within 3 weeks of launch; also a lead designer at the United States of Africa, where I successfully led a team in designing and redesigning the user interface of our flagship product. This initiative resulted in a 30% decrease in design-related issues.\n \nIn addition, my proficiency in user research methodologies has allowed me to identify pain points and design solutions that enhance the overall user experience. I am well-versed in using tools such as Figma, Adobe Creative Suite, and Sketch to create prototypes that effectively communicate design concepts to cross-functional teams.\n \nMOST RECENT SUCCESS STORIES\n \nhttps://www.gdl.com.ng\nhttps://www.app.gdl.com.ng\nGDL Plus on the App Store (with Version 2 coming soon)\nGDL Plus on the Google Play Store (with Version 2 coming soon)\nhttps://www.housemoni.ng\nhttps://www.vendyz.com\nhttps://www.app.vendyz.com\n\nGDL CMS (Will be shared during an interview)\nGDL Admin (Will be shared during interview)\nDocument Management System (Will be shared during an interview)\nService Marketplace (Will be shared during an interview)\nVendyz (An escrow platform to be shared during an interview)\n \nI am intrigued by the possibility of being a part of a forward-thinking team and contributing to the organization's design initiatives.\n \nBest regard,\nEmmanuel Israel",https://sites.google.com/view/emmanuelisrael,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733737096322_Emmanuel-Israel_RÃ©sumÃ©.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T09:38:19.778Z,2024-12-09T09:38:19.778Z,,,,,,,,,
