6756bbb9b42680749337c3a2,Paul Shotolu,+23408185654614,paulshotolu@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi, I’m Paul and I design experiences and products that people love and trust, My process entails collaborating cross-functionally with the engineering, product management teams, and all stakeholders to iteratively take products from concept to launch, and growth across the global market. With 5 years of experience, I’ve worked on digital products across several industries like B2B products, Financial technology, Consumer Tech, Automobile Industries, and Emerging Technologies, I have a unique talent of seeing the big picture potential in a product or brand and then bringing it to life.\nI have some experience designing for Augmented & Virtual reality (AR/VR), designing for accessibility (WCAG) and designing for diversity \nI also have some skills in front-end web development using HTML, CSS, Javascript",https://bit.ly/paul-folio,"https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733737399377_Shotolu, PAUL Ocv.pdf",67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T09:43:21.996Z,2024-12-09T09:43:21.996Z,,,,,,,,,
6756bcc7b42680749337c3aa,Blessing Bello,+23408037511096,oritselayemi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Blessing Bello, and I’m a Product Designer with over three years of experience building SaaS products across industries like E-commerce, Sports, Fintech, and Edtech. Beyond design, I enjoy mentoring and supporting individuals transitioning into Product Design, helping them navigate their journey into the field.",bit.ly/bobello ,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733737669333_Copy of Blessing Bello's CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T09:47:51.898Z,2024-12-09T09:47:51.898Z,,,,,,,,,
6756befcb42680749337c3b9,Joshua Bamigboye,+23409138017411,Joshuapromise20@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a product designer with over 4years experience, I've worked with many development teams and on diverse project in different industry.  I have good problem solving skills, I'm committed to working and meeting up with my deadlines, and I'm sure I will be a great addition to your team, I look forward to discussing more about myself. Thank you",https://bamigboyejoshuapromise.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733738232871_Bamigboye Joshua Promise CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T09:57:16.371Z,2024-12-09T09:57:16.371Z,,,,,,,,,
6756c028b42680749337c3c3,Oyindamola Ogunsola ,+2348033782241,ogunsola.irene@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a curious and determined individual who thrives on creating meaningful, user-centered solutions. My approach to design is grounded in empathy, collaboration, and a commitment to delivering exceptional user experiences. I draw inspiration from everyday interactions and challenges, finding ways to translate them into intuitive, impactful designs. Beyond design, I’m passionate about  community, Fashion and sustainability, which often reflects in the projects I choose and the problems I aim to solve.\n\nIn my design career, I’ve had the privilege of working on diverse and impactful projects some of which are:  \n\n- Traffic Offense Management System: I led a team of three designers to build a scalable solution for managing traffic violations. I introduced a design system to ensure consistency, developed sitemaps, reviewed designs, and presented solutions to stakeholders, resulting in a successful handoff to developers.  \n- MovieLovers App: A ticketing platform designed to make group and individual cinema reservations seamless. I conducted user research, usability testing, and prototyping to address key pain points like long queues and seating arrangements.  \n- Ceremony Finance: Designed an event management platform that allows users to share invites, receive gifts, and manage event donations effortlessly.  \n- PlanEats: Developed an e-commerce feature for vendor listings, connecting users with supermarkets and food vendors to simplify grocery shopping.  \n-Tradapay App: Created a sleek landing page and dashboard for a financial platform, focusing on accessibility and ease of use.  \n- Rally Trade Dashboards: Revamped specific dashboards for a trading platform, ensuring clarity and a seamless user experience for financial analysis.  \n-iaNigeria: designed and developed the company’s website, optimized it for search engines, and monitored analytics to improve user engagement.  \n\nCurrently, I’m developing a platform to support tailors in sourcing materials and connecting with global clients, a project inspired by my passion for fashion and sustainability. It includes features for managing inventory, facilitating orders, and resolving disputes, with a focus on enhancing accessibility and usability.  \n\nEach of these experiences has shaped me as a designer, reinforcing my belief in the power of design to solve real-world problems and create impactful digital experiences.",https://oyindamolaogunsola.netlify.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733738533192_OYINDAMOLA-OGUNSOLA-resume24.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T10:02:16.428Z,2024-12-09T10:02:16.428Z,,,,,,,,,
6756c127b42680749337c3cc,Ovie igere osmund ,+23407080262206,ovieigere@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a product designer who loves creating simple and useful designs. I’ve worked in a startup and also with a design agency where I got to work and build different live projects such as dashboards, mobile apps, and websites, focusing on making them easy to use. I enjoy solving problems through design and working with others to bring ideas to life.",https://oveey.github.io/portfolio/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733738787853_my resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T10:06:31.242Z,2024-12-09T10:06:31.242Z,,,,,,,,,
6756c2a2b42680749337c3db,Gabriel Nwabudike,+23408060587922,nwabudikegabriel@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a product designer based in Lagos, Nigeria, with over 5 years of experience delivering impactful designs for industries like e-commerce, fintech, EdTech, SaaS products etc. \nI've collaborated with both local and global clients, building user-centric solutions that blend functionality with simplicity. \n\nMy approach to design is grounded in a deep understanding of technology and a strong focus on solving real-world problems. I’m passionate about creating products that are not just visually appealing but also intuitive and practical, ensuring a seamless user experience. \nMy diverse experience allows me to adapt quickly to different challenges, and I thrive in collaborative environments where ideas are turned into meaningful solutions.",https://www.notion.so/gabrielnwabudike/Gabriel-s-Portfolio-10ea374888b380e6acc8debd05038127?pvs=4,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733739167784_Gabriel_Nwabudike_Designer_CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T10:12:50.441Z,2024-12-09T10:12:50.441Z,,,,,,,,,
6756c2abb42680749337c3e2,Somtochukwu Mbamal,+2348160705766,somtosandra@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a product designer with over two (2) years of experience crafting intuitive solutions that generate user conversions. I am growing interested in sustainable solutions at the intersection of emerging technologies and design.\nIn my current role, I work as a UI/UX Designer at Bitmama, managing the end-to-end design of its subsidiary fintech products through data-driven insights. I specialise in creating mobile and web experiences for B2B and B2C SaaS products. I am open to new roles which will expose me to new industries and allow me to explore creatively.\n\nI am open to discussing my expertise and possible contributions to your team.",https://www.notion.so/somtombamalu/Somtochukwu-Mbamalu-72d9e4106c424337a539eb2c3728a73a?pvs=4,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733739175817_SMS_PD_Resume.docx,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T10:12:59.322Z,2024-12-09T10:12:59.322Z,,,,,,,,,
6756c2bbb42680749337c3e9,"AKOBUNDU, Praise ",+2349061616292,akobundupraise66@gmail.com,Nigeria,"With a BSc in Computer Science from Babcock University and multiple certifications in product design, soft skills, and app design, I have the knowledge and skills to create functional and user-friendly products. \n\nAs a Frontend Developer and Product Designer at ActivEdge Technologies Limited, I collaborate with the team to brainstorm and create new products using React, TypeScript, Redux, and SCSS. I also design the user interface for the mobile and dashboard consulting page using Figma, applying UI/UX principles and best practices.\n\nI am passionate about learning new technologies and skills that can enhance my development and design capabilities. I have built several React components from scratch and prototyped and wireframed various app ideas. My goal is to work on products that can solve real-world problems and create positive impact.",https://linktr.ee/dtechguyx,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733739192527_Akobundu Praise's CV 2.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T10:13:15.628Z,2024-12-09T10:13:15.628Z,,,,,,,,,
6756c687b42680749337c406,David Nnebedum,+23408100996194,davidm.nnebedum@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a graphic and UI/UX designer with more than 8 years of experience making designs that look good and are easy to use. I studied to be a system analyst at the Logon Institute of Technology. After my studies I went into designs. I know a lot about branding and how to make websites and apps work better for users.\nI pay attention to how things look and make sure they follow good design rules. I use programs like Adobe Creative Suite and Figma to make my designs.\nOne of my best skills is solving problems. For example, I worked on the Salescloud mobile app. It was hard for people to use because it was clustered and didn't look nice. I made it simpler and more organized, so important features were easy to find. I also added charts to help users see sales numbers quickly.\nAfter the changes, people liked the app more and found it easier to use. We saw 30% more people using the app every day, and sales productivity improved.",https://www.figma.com/design/DFNcRkCDnJ28OUoHI17Xxa/Salescloud?node-id=872-70&t=VZi191qDYuS5Drsv-1  https://www.figma.com/design/ME8EIvHJCVM0LaC0vkXPYf/VSC?node-id=450-2&t=5eYQLs8N8CjmUONv-1  https://www.figma.com/design/6UXZGMZmJtZGMYUVvixWsB/Havoinvest?node-id=409-382&t=5rOfxMsPfXBEGDRH-1  https://www.figma.com/design/lgDFKKnd1ZCo86yWkllHfi/Havopay?node-id=2652-2&t=R4nzy7tZVxvN7lqY-1  https://www.figma.com/design/ERZonrotGYPfQFxfXaO3Ph/Msspace?node-id=2168-5358&t=3f3ce9N6dmUfLqiB-1  https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/113KyaCLiTXnz3Yfnpp3k-B4x7ycyF8FA?usp=sharing,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733740163955_Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T10:29:27.570Z,2024-12-09T10:29:27.570Z,,,,,,,,,
6756c778b42680749337c40e,Emmanuel Brendan Edeminam,+2348166930436,elebrendan@gmail.com,Nigeria,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733740405468_EMMANUEL BRENDAN EDEMINAM.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T10:33:28.989Z,2024-12-09T10:33:28.989Z,,,,,,,,,
6756c7fdb42680749337c417,Ajiboye oluwatobi ,+2349011803155,tobiajiboye21@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a product designer with a bachelor’s degree in psychology. I enjoy crafting intuitive interfaces that are user centric. I believe that the secret to product revenue are products that are useful to users, elicit immediate gut reactions from users which involves having an aesthetic look and feel, but it doesn’t end there. The product must be usable and functional. I am a strong advocate that products that drive revenue are those that are able to evoke emotions that result in positive user experiences. I am passionate about psychology and design.",https://oluwatobiajiboyeportfolio.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733740538011_Oluwatobi Ajiboye Resume final.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T10:35:41.135Z,2024-12-09T10:35:41.135Z,,,,,,,,,
6756cb37b42680749337c424,Awoderu Dolapo Eniola,+2349081045237,awoderudolapo@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a passionate UI/UX designer with a background in computer science with years of hands-on experience creating and implementing unique design solutions. My design journey began with a curiosity about how technology can simplify people's lives, which has since evolved into a career dedicated to crafting user-centered digital experiences.\n\nOver the years, I've worked on various projects, including developing mobile and web applications, creating interactive prototypes, and designing intuitive interfaces that align with user needs and business goals. Notable projects include ExploreMate, a personalized travel companion app, and Urgent Tukay, a loan and expense tracking application inspired by everyday financial challenges.\n\nI recently completed my NYSC program, which was a fantastic opportunity to engage with diverse communities and learn about different cultures, further enhancing my ability to empathize with users. I also value continuous growth, regularly practicing my skills, keeping up with design trends, and reading insightful books like Show Your Work by Austin Kleon.\n\nI am excited to apply my skills in a collaborative environment where I can contribute meaningfully, learn from experienced professionals, and grow as a designer. I am particularly motivated by opportunities to work on impactful, real-world projects that challenge me to think critically and creatively.",https://awoderu-dolapo.notion.site/Dolapo-s-Portfolio-2b025869373e48e7bd00fe90ffe0e189,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733741365136_Awoderu Dolapo Eniola Resume (2).pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T10:49:27.752Z,2024-12-09T10:49:27.752Z,,,,,,,,,
6756cb84b42680749337c42b,Okoye Chibuike Christian,+23409131886211,chibuikeokoye2@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Okoye Chibuike Christian and I'm a Google certified generalist UI/UX designer with over 3 years of hands on experience, and I’m excited to help take your project to the next level.\n\nYou might be wondering, 'What makes me different?' Well, I’m not just your average designer. I’m a generalist, which means my expertise extends beyond just UI/UX. I’m also skilled in graphic design, motion design, and web design. This unique blend allows me to apply solid design principles and create attention-grabbing, user-focused solutions that truly stand out.\n\nI'm proficient in using industry standard softwares such as Figma, Adobe XD, Adobe Photoshop, illustrator, premiere pro, after effects.",https://www.chrisdesigns.site,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733741441533_Chibuike Christian Okoye.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T10:50:44.679Z,2024-12-09T10:50:44.679Z,,,,,,,,,
