6756cc4eb42680749337c43e,Bukola Adedayo,+2348161806344,oluwabukolaope@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI'm excited to apply for the Product Designer role. With 3 years of experience in crafting intuitive designs from wireframes to high-fidelity mockups, I believe I can significantly contribute to your team.\n\nAt Tiqwa and Anola Enterprise, I designed user-friendly, accessible digital products, collaborating closely with cross-functional teams. My proficiency in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript enables me to create designs with development in mind.\n\nI've attached my resume for your review and would love to discuss how my skills can benefit your company.\n\nLink to my Portfolio: \nhttps://polar-slug-3e0.notion.site/Hey-I-m-Bukola-97fc164ee32b4e2d8e09f87f571afd24\n\nWarm regards,\nBukola Adedayo.",https://polar-slug-3e0.notion.site/Hey-I-m-Bukola-97fc164ee32b4e2d8e09f87f571afd24,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733741642022_Bukola Adedayo Resume___Product-Designer.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T10:54:06.264Z,2024-12-09T10:54:06.264Z,,,,,,,,,
6756ccecb42680749337c446,Samuel Okiemute UTIOME,+2348138288791,osamuel2010@gmail.com,Nigeria,I’m a Nigerian and a UIUX designer also uses the adobe photoshop and other graphic designing software. I can work with little or no supervision and under pressure. I love meeting targets and love researching for new innovations . ,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733741802052_CV - UTIOME SAMUEL OKIEMUTE.gdoc,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T10:56:44.957Z,2024-12-09T10:56:44.957Z,,,,,,,,,
6756cde8b42680749337c44e,Marcus Aken,+2349024426659,marcusaken@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an experienced Product Designer focused on creating user-friendly and visually appealing designs. I collaborate with cross-functional teams to translate user needs into wireframes, mockups, and prototypes, ensuring alignment with product goals.\n\nSkilled in maintaining design systems for consistency, I thrive in agile environments, delivering designs on time. I also prioritize usability testing and iteration to enhance product performance.\n\nProficient in Figma and responsive design, I ensure accessibility and inclusivity. My collaborative approach and attention to detail drive me to create impactful, innovative products that meet user needs.",https://www.behance.net/marcusaken,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733742051910_Aken Marcus Updated UI Portfolio - converted (1).pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T11:00:56.037Z,2024-12-09T11:00:56.037Z,,,,,,,,,
6756d0f0b42680749337c461,Oluwatosin Oladejo,+2348188879068,tosindafidi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi there, I’m a product designer with more than 3years of experience working across fintech, SaaS, logistics and hospitality products. I believe that digital products should be easy to use and that’s why my designs are user centered.\nIn my free hours, I mentor young/new entries into the design industry, teaching them the fundamentals of design ",https://tosindavid.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733742829340_Oluwatosin David CV (6) (1).pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T11:13:52.234Z,2024-12-09T11:13:52.234Z,,,,,,,,,
6756d151b42680749337c46d,Samuel Ekwenze,+23409064122943,kachi1547@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a passionate and results-driven Product/Brand designer. Over the last two years, I have designed and contributed my design skills to build projects that has over 10,000+ active users in various sectors. I create designs that solve problems and bring innovative solutions to life. My work communicates ideas, emotions, and visions beyond words.\nI am dedicated in developing design solutions that are simple, useful, and visually appealing. I've helped brands to create an identity that brings engagements and give them a unique feel.\nProficient in utilizing design tools like Figma, Adobe Creative Suite. Here are a few examples of what I’ve achieved:\nAt DLES, I designed an event management portal, leading to a 30% increase in task completion and 98% user satisfaction with over 10,000+ active users currently. With LagProperties, I developed a mobile app UI for a real estate platform that boosted user engagement by 40% within the first month.\nFor Hotels.NG, I created a design system alongside some other designer that sped up the design process by 50%, helping the team get projects done faster. This was in partial fulfilment in completing my internship with the company. I’ve attached a few work samples to show my design style and approach. I’m really excited about the possibility of joining your organization and helping to build great user experiences for your team.",https://www.behance.net/psalmuhel,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733742925347_SAMUEL EKWENZE UI.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T11:15:29.734Z,2024-12-09T11:15:29.734Z,,,,,,,,,
6756d215b42680749337c477,Jessam Koti Akpang ,+2349050033638,jhessamcohtie6@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a product designer with 3 years plus of experience. I love creating user centric products that are aesthetically pleasing and easy to use. Products that help users solve real life problems, there by making their lives easier.",https://www.figma.com/design/%0AmwGwEMwyHoitDHpbFOMSg2/%0ALuxury-Hailing-App?node-id=1-19&t=KCXexdxqBeS3f5%7Cp-0,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733743122316_JESSAM KOTI'S - RESUME 25.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T11:18:45.770Z,2024-12-09T11:18:45.770Z,,,,,,,,,
6756d3c8b42680749337c47f,Favour Ezenwa,+23408149975497,favourezenwa944@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a passionate Product Designer with a strong background in crafting user-centered designs that balance functionality and aesthetics. My journey began with a degree in Electrical and Electronics Engineering, which gave me a solid foundation in problem-solving and analytical thinking. Transitioning into design, I’ve gained hands-on experience creating intuitive digital experiences across web and mobile platforms.\n\nIn my current role at AnyApp Technologies, I’ve led the design of a mobile and web-based hair styling platform, where I collaborated with cross-functional teams to develop user-friendly interfaces, establish a cohesive design system, and prioritize accessibility. I’m particularly skilled in using tools like Figma to create wireframes, prototypes, and visually compelling designs that align with both user needs and brand goals.\n\nWhat excites me most about product design is the opportunity to create solutions that truly enhance people’s lives. I stay updated on industry trends and continuously refine my skills to bring fresh perspectives to my work. I thrive in collaborative environments and enjoy working with product managers, engineers, and researchers to deliver exceptional user experiences.\n\nI’m eager to bring my creativity, technical expertise, and user-focused approach to a team that values innovation and impactful design.",https://www.behance.net/favourezenwa,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733743557750_FAVOUR_EZENWA_RESUME.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T11:26:00.262Z,2024-12-09T11:26:00.262Z,,,,,,,,,
6756d4d9b42680749337c488,osaro ero ,+23408085716223,erobrahma12@gmail.com,Nigeria,"An accomplished designer with expertise in interface performance analysis, project modelling, and mapping. Skilled in analysing, documenting, and reporting challenges affecting interface output. Critical thinker with a strong analytical background. Highly organised and dependable, capable of managing multiple priorities with tenacity and a willingness to take on added responsibilities to achieve team goals, ensuring a positive impact on the overall growth of the company. Emerging UX designer with solid training and education, equipped to support UX projects effectively. Excels in lean environments that prioritise thought-sharing and innovation.",https://www.behance.net/erobrahma_12,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733743830026_Ero Osaro Daniel CV new.docx,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T11:30:33.049Z,2024-12-09T11:30:33.049Z,,,,,,,,,
6756d506b42680749337c491,Agbaje Israel Oluwasegunfunmi,+2348140082953,isrealitycreations@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Israel and I am a designer with experience in designing mobile and web \rapplications through the use of wireframes, high fidelity prototypes, integrating usercentered design, technologies and business strategy. \n\n\r\nI am driven towards using design to solve and improve real human and business \rproblems. I value collaboration with other stakeholders in a team like the developers, \rproduct managers etc and I am committed to the success of each project I am given the \ropportunity to work on.",https://agbajeisrael.vercel.app,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733743875049_AGBAJE ISRAEL OFFICIAL CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T11:31:18.107Z,2024-12-09T11:31:18.107Z,,,,,,,,,
6756d64cb42680749337c4a1,Courage Eze,+2349034437022,couragecharly1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Courage Eze and I am a product (UI/UX) Designer With over 2 years of experience,  I have had the privilege of working on diverse range of design projects with web and mobile applications.Including EcoTrack (a sustainability app), Synergy Book Club (community platform), a dating app, and e-commerce solutions to name a few. \n\nIn my roles as both an in-house designer and a freelancer, I have honed my skills in user research, prototyping, and visual design, allowing me to deliver compelling solutions that meet both user needs and business objectives. \n\nIn addition to my technical skills and experience, I coach aspiring designers, further enhancing my leadership and communication skills. I am a highly collaborative team player with excellent communication and interpersonal skills. I thrive in fast-paced environments and I am accustomed to managing multiple projects simultaneously while maintaining a keen attention to detail. \n\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to an opportunity to discuss how my skills and aligns with the company’s goals.",https://couragecharles.vzy.io/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733744201913_Courage Eze Product Design Cv (1)(1) (1).pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T11:36:44.957Z,2024-12-09T11:36:44.957Z,,,,,,,,,
6756d6f4b42680749337c4a9,Reuben Kihiu,+254740147010,reubeenkihiu@gmail.com,Kenya,"I'm a passionate UX Designer with over 6 years of experience creating user-centered digital experiences that make a real impact. Throughout my career, I’ve worked across various sectors, including fintech, commerce, and social impact, where I've designed products, led teams and worked to ensure users are always at the heart of the design process. I’m also deeply passionate about innovation, community, and knowledge-sharing, and I enjoy inspiring others in the tech space. Outside of work, I’m always looking for opportunities to grow and contribute to projects that positively impact society.",https://reubenkihiu.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733744369462_Reuben Kihiu - Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T11:39:32.081Z,2024-12-09T11:39:32.081Z,,,,,,,,,
