6756d95ab42680749337c4c8,Taiwo John Kehinde,+2348120130534,godminstrels@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As a Product Designer with 4 years of experience, I have developed a deep understanding of the design process, from research and concept development to prototyping and implementation. \n\nThroughout my career, I have successfully collaborated with cross-functional teams to deliver exceptional user experiences that align with business goals. My ability to empathize with users and identify their needs has allowed me to create intuitive and visually compelling designs that have received positive feedback and increased user engagement.\n\nOver the years, I have had the opportunity to lead design projects for both web and mobile applications for B2B, B2C and B2B2C in various industries ranging from Fintech, Logistics, Edutech, Proptech and Saas generally which not only satisfied users but drove business revenue by millions of naira.\nI have also had the experience working with IT consultancy and software development companies to build software solutions for different clients to help increase their business efficiency and productivity.\n\nBy conducting thorough user research and leveraging industry best practices, I consistently delivered innovative and user-friendly interfaces. I am skilled in utilizing design tools such as Figma and some Adobe Creative Suite softwares, enabling me to efficiently iterate and refine designs to meet project requirements. I am confident that my skills, experience, and passion for user-centered design make me an excellent fit for the Product Designer Role. I am excited about the opportunity to join the team and contribute to its ongoing success.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I have attached my resume and portfolio for your review. I am available for an interview at your convenience and look forward to discussing how my skills can contribute to the company’s vision.\n\nSincerely, Taiwo John",bit.ly/John_The_UXer,https://dev-talent-form-te