6756e348b42680749337c529,Oluwatobi Ololade,+2347055806908,oluwatobiololade@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Oluwatobi Ololade is a seasoned Designer from Lagos, Nigeria, with over 9 years of expertise in creating user-centered digital experiences across fintech, blockchain, ed-tech, and e-commerce sectors. With a passion for simplicity and functionality across branding and UX, Oluwatobi helps businesses design seamless and impactful product experiences that enhance usability and drive results.\n\nNotable achievements include leading the design for the largest IPO web project in the Middle East, raising $2.5B at launch, and spearheading the MVP design for MVX, securing $1M for rapid African expansion. Oluwatobi’s work is defined by a user-first approach, leveraging a robust skill set in UX design, interaction design, visual branding, and motion graphics.\n\nCollaborating with global clients like ADNOC, Abu Dhabi Government, and Jeddah Central Development, Oluwatobi has consistently delivered exceptional results, fostering strong relationships and driving business goals. Whether refining a blockchain app for wine label verification or enhancing usability for a global talent recruiting platform, Oluwatobi ensures intuitive, scalable solutions.",Www.oluwatobiololade.com,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733747526013_Oluwatobi Ololade My Resume.pdf.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T12:32:08.992Z,2024-12-09T12:32:08.992Z,,,,,,,,,
