6756eaf4b42680749337c578,Oladayo Awe,+23407038933626,mistudee12@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a passionate and versatile Product Designer with a strong foundation in creating user-centered designs that seamlessly blend aesthetics with functionality. With a professional journey spanning over five years, I have honed my skills in UX research, UI/UX design, and prototyping across industries like fintech, mobility, and bespoke software solutions.\n\nAt Essential Software, I specialize in crafting detailed user personas and journey maps, developing intuitive prototypes, and collaborating with developers to deliver pixel-perfect designs. Previously at DriveMe, I spearheaded the redesign of their platform website and developed interactive systems that streamlined logistics and mobility services across Africa. My work at DEUCE introduced a seamless payment system for sellers, where I led the UI/UX design of a customer application and management system.\n\nBeyond design, I excel in fostering cross-functional collaboration, conducting usability testing, and creating structured design frameworks. I am proficient in tools like Figma, Adobe XD, and Draw.io, coupled with experience in project management platforms such as Trello and Jira.\n\nDriven by a commitment to innovation and user satisfaction, I continuously strive to create designs that not only solve problems but also leave a lasting impression.",https://www.behance.net/dayomatthew/projects,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733749489538_Oladayo Matthew Awe Product(UIUX) Designer (3).pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T13:04:52.046Z,2024-12-09T13:04:52.046Z,,,,,,,,,
6756ebd6b42680749337c584,Abdullahi Suleiman,+2347067538138,mayorsuleimankhan1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Abdullahi Suleiman, a UI/UX designer and UX writer with over three years of experience creating intuitive designs for mobile, web, and wearable platforms. I have a background in Information and Media Technology from the Federal University of Technology, Minna, and a track record of designing impactful solutions for industries like fintech, e-commerce, and health tech.\n\nMy work focuses on user-centered design, ensuring seamless and engaging experiences. I’ve successfully led and managed multiple design projects, such as Afruna and Lifesync, and recently contributed to developing a power utility bill payment system. Beyond design, I’m passionate about mentoring young talent and have served as a product design team lead in community initiatives.\n\nWhen I’m not designing, I enjoy unwinding by playing COD Mobile and experimenting in the kitchen, cooking up new dishes. Driven by innovation and problem-solving, I’m always excited to craft solutions that simplify lives and empower users.",https://www.behance.net/sulbyee,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733749716061_Suleiman Abdullahi resume new.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T13:08:38.933Z,2024-12-09T13:08:38.933Z,,,,,,,,,
