6756eeb0b42680749337c59d,Kosin Emmanuel Okiemute ,+2348165119227,Kosinemmanuel9@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a product designer passionate about creating intuitive and user-centered designs that solve real-world problems. With experience designing mobile apps, websites, and SaaS platforms, I focus on crafting solutions that enhance user experience while aligning with business goals. I’ve had the opportunity to work on impactful projects like the Saving Box fintech app, a digital savings platform, and the Spotlight podcast website, which I designed independently. I enjoy collaborating with teams, iterating based on feedback, and using tools like Figma to bring ideas to life. Beyond design, I’m always exploring trends in tech and how they can influence user behavior.",https://www.behance.net/kosinemmanuelo,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733750444066_Kosin Emmanuel Okiemute CV-1_241030_073208.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T13:20:48.235Z,2024-12-09T13:20:48.235Z,,,,,,,,,
6756ef0bb42680749337c5a5,AbdulMalik Oladeji,+2348162011646,abdulmalikoluwafemi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I have a background in psychology and social sciences that provides me with a unique perspective that I believe makes me an ideal product designer.\n\nThrough my studies, I have developed a deep understanding of human behavior, motivation, and decision-making processes. This knowledge allows me to approach product design with a user-centric mindset, focusing on creating intuitive and meaningful experiences that resonate with people on a fundamental level.\n\nFurthermore, my background in social sciences has honed my research and analytical skills, enabling me to gather and interpret user insights effectively. This data…\n‎Read more\n\nIn my free time, I enjoy playing basketball, which not only helps me stay fit, it also teaches me the importance of teamwork, communication, and perseverance. I believe my passion for both product design and basketball has helped me develop a well-rounded perspective, which I bring to all aspects of my life.\n",abdulmalikoladeji.com,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733750536953_AbdulMalik Oladeji CV_.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T13:22:19.705Z,2024-12-09T13:22:19.705Z,,,,,,,,,
6756ef0fb42680749337c5ad,Chimnonso Ibidun,+23408103366464,nonsoibidun@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Chimnonso Ibidun, and I bring a wealth of experience in product design with a focus on creating exceptional user experiences. Over the years, I have worked across diverse industries, including e-commerce, fintech, and B2B applications, consistently delivering designs that align with business goals while meeting user needs.\n\nI am passionate about user-centric design, and my approach involves conducting in-depth user research, testing, and iterative processes to develop innovative and functional solutions. My technical expertise includes proficiency in tools like Figma and Protopie, as well as an understanding of front-end development, which allows me to collaborate seamlessly with developers.\n\nI thrive in collaborative environments and value teamwork, open communication, and diverse perspectives. My foundation in design thinking empowers me to empathize with users, define problems effectively, and prototype and test creative solutions.\n\nI am excited about opportunities that allow me to combine my skills and passion to contribute meaningfully to the success of a team or product, just as I hope to do in the role of UI/UX Designer at TOBAMS GROUP. ",https://www.figma.com/proto/Lq07IDYkcYTxRD4uFB8FK8/Chimnonso-Portfolio?page-id=0%3A1&node-id=1-7012&node-type=frame&viewport=73%2C158%2C0.05&t=syu380sUMFuQzzSP-1&scaling=min-zoom&content-scaling=fixed&starting-point-node-id=1%3A7012,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733750541309_Chimnonso resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T13:22:23.430Z,2024-12-09T13:22:23.430Z,,,,,,,,,
6756ef36b42680749337c5b8,Chinonso Henry Ogoke,+2349033284643,chinonsohenry23@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I recently completed a 30-day UI design challenge, which gave me hands-on experience in creating a variety of user interfaces for mobile apps and websites. Throughout the challenge, I developed a solid understanding of key design principles such as typography, color theory, layout, and hierarchy. I worked extensively with tools like Figma and Canva to create wireframes, high-fidelity mockups, and interactive prototypes.\n\nIn addition to technical skills, I focused on designing intuitive, user-centered experiences, learning how to prioritize usability while maintaining visually appealing designs. I also practiced applying responsive design techniques to ensure that my interfaces worked well across different screen sizes.\n\nThough I’m still early in my career, I’ve built a strong foundation in UI design and am eager to apply my skills and continue growing in a professional setting.",https://www.behance.net/chinonsoogoke,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733750578947_Chinonso Ogoke_CV ui.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T13:23:02.073Z,2024-12-09T13:23:02.073Z,,,,,,,,,
