6756f08eb42680749337c5f1,Juliet ahiante,+2348141693423,julietahiante@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"Hi, I'm Juliet Ahiante Akhere, a freelance product designer passionate about crafting intuitive and impactful user experiences. I’ve worked on projects such as a real estate website, providing a complete property showcase with clear call-to-actions, intuitive menus, and logical navigation.\n\nCurrently, I’m a product designer at Vatebra Tech Hub, collaborating closely with other designers to optimize the user experience and interface for various apps. My work involves designing interface, user research building prototypes, wireframes, designing how users interact with a product, including animations and transitions and  supporting the design of visual elements like layouts, typography, and color schemes.\n\nIn addition to my professional experience, I’ve undertaken personal projects such as the Julvest app and a client website, further developing my skills in UI/UX design, user research, visual design, interaction design, and usability testing.\n\nMy goal is to create excellent product experiences that leave a lasting impression. Let’s connect and explore opportunities to collaborate on innovative projects. Feel free to reach out!",https://www.behance.net/julietahiante,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733750923488_Juliet Ahiante Resume 2.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T13:28:46.928Z,2024-12-09T13:28:46.928Z,,,,,,,,,
