67570651b42680749337c701,Olamide Omilana,+23409080413637,olamideomilana@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\nI would like to express my interest in the UI/UX Designer position\nAs I have seen, I am keen on solving user problems and have experienced how design influenced and revived\na dying product as it does to live products. I would love to work to support this shared vision in an\nenergizing and inspiring way which will be the least I will ever do as a UI/UX Designer.\nI am aware your organization wants to engage exceptional talents who are passionate about the\ncompany’s goal and ready to assist in Product Design and people-centered design approach will add\nvalue to your organization.\nThe role I am applying for appears to be a perfect match as I am product-driven and process-driven. My previous roles as a UI/UX Designer have given me proven experiences in designing the end-to-end process of multiple products while ensuring the most viable and feasible design standards are being adopted. I have sufficient knowledge of how to design and craft an entire UX Research process.\nI can hit the ground running in this role as soon as I am deemed fit. Thank you for considering my application. I would love the opportunity to further discuss my experience\nand achievements in detail in an interview.",https://www.behance.net/Mide,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733756495018_Olamide _Omilana_CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T15:01:37.490Z,2024-12-09T15:01:37.490Z,,,,,,,,,
6757068db42680749337c70c,Temiloluwa Olanipekun,+23408082007387,temi.pekun@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I started Product Design about 5 years ago with simple designs using Adobe XD. As time went by, the quantity of designs I was handling led to an increase in the quality of my work. Over the years, I've worked both as an individual and in teams spanning different industries which has given me so much insight into areas of knowledge I didn't realise I needed. This exposure has built me into the designer that I am today; having different projects from different clients from different industries.",https://kuldekui.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733756553842_Temiloluwa's CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T15:02:37.069Z,2024-12-09T15:02:37.069Z,,,,,,,,,
675708b9b42680749337c720,Dera Godwin,+2348082796071,deragodwin17@gmail.com,Nigeria,I'm a highly motivated and detail-oriented design enthusiast with a strong foundation in UI/UX principles proficient in design tools and eager to craft digital solutions that delight users and drive business results for companies all over the globe.,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733757109091_Port. Design..jpg,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T15:11:53.394Z,2024-12-09T15:11:53.394Z,,,,,,,,,
675708f7b42680749337c728,Olaoluwa Agiri,+23408125023151,olaoluwaagiri15@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nAs a highly motivated and empathetic designer with about 3years of design experience, I have a history for creating engaging and intuitive user experiences which is why I strongly believe I would be an excellent addition to your team. \n\nWhy Should you hire me for this position?\nI am passionate about designing for usability\nI thrive in fast paced startups, i am able to deliver well thought out designs that does not reduce in quality\nI am a strong collaborator and I am also able to work independently this is due to my ""taking ownership mindset""\n I have experience in User research, Information Architecture, User flow, User Journey, Building of Persona, Wireframing, Prototyping, Usability testing\nTools I use are Figma, Photoshop, Illustrator, Protopie, Zeplin, Google Workspaces, Notion, Jira, ClickUp, and Miro.\n\nI look forward to sharing how i can bring value to the team\n\nSincerely\nOlaoluwa Agiri",https://dribbble.com/hashiramaofdesign,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733757171699_Olaoluwa Agiri's Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T15:12:55.357Z,2024-12-09T15:12:55.357Z,,,,,,,,,
