675709fbb42680749337c73f,Lawal Abdul Azeez Adepegba ,+23408153620476,lightened95@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager\n\nI am excited to apply for the Architect position at Company  , as advertised. With a strong background in Project Architecture, Site Supervision, and Functionality Design, I am confident in my ability to make a valuable contribution to your team.\n\nAs a seasoned architect with experience in delivering exceptional architectural solutions, I possess a unique blend of practical and theoretical knowledge. My expertise includes designing and developing architectural plans, conducting site visits, collaborating with clients and stakeholders, and utilizing industry-leading software such as AutoCAD, and Archicad \n\nIn my previous role at R3 Lawal Project Limited, I successfully designed and delivered multiple projects, including residential and commercial buildings, and developed innovative design solutions that exceeded client expectations. I also built strong relationships with clients and stakeholders, resulting in repeat business and referrals.\n\nIn addition to my technical skills, I possess excellent communication and project management skills, with a proven track record of leading diverse teams and ensuring adherence to quality standards, timelines, and budget constraints.\n\nMy experience at the State Ministry of Housing in Asaba, Delta State, Nigeria, during my National Youth Service Corps (NYSC), further honed my skills in project management, site supervision, and collaboration. I also demonstrated adaptability, accountability, and effective collaboration with cross-functional teams during my industrial training at Jolaosho and Associate in Abeokuta, Nigeria.\n\nI hold a Bachelor of Science in Architecture from Crescent University, Abeokuta, Ogun State, and a diploma in Arabic & Islamic Studies from Al-hikmah Learning and Professional Development. I have also obtained professional certifications in Project Management (PMP), Human Resources Management (HRM), and Health Safety and Environment (HSE 1 & 2).\n\nAs a proactive and results-oriented professional, I am equipped with strong problem-solving skills and a deep understanding of architectural principles. My graduate membership in the Nigeria Institute of Architecture (NIA) underscore my commitment to continuous learning and professional development.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I am eager to contribute my skills and passion for architecture to your company and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experiences and qualifications align with the needs of your firm . Please find my resume attached for your reference. I am available at your earliest convenience for an interview and can be reached via email at [lightened95@yahoo.com] or by phone at [08153620476].\n\nThank you once again for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of joining your esteemed team and contributing to the success of your firm .\n\nSincerely,\n\nLAWAL ABDUL-AZEEZ ADEPEGBA ",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733757432722_adepegba akanni  government  cv.docx,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T15:17:15.612Z,2024-12-09T15:17:15.612Z,,,,,,,,,
67570cc8b42680749337c74c,Hassan Olaolu Daniel,+2347065277647,hollahdaniel@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a product designer focused on creating user-centered digital experiences. My work involves understanding user needs, solving problems with intuitive designs, and collaborating with teams to build functional, visually appealing products. I use tools like Figma, Sketch, and Adobe XD to design interfaces, ensuring they are accessible, user-friendly, and aligned with business goals. My goal is to make products that are not only usable but enjoyable for the people who interact with them.",https://brassy-supply-8f3.notion.site/Olaoluwa-Daniel-cba4f7ac1af74633af1fb430046c2f4f,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733758149554_Olaoluwa-.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T15:29:12.934Z,2024-12-09T15:29:12.934Z,,,,,,,,,
67570ce8b42680749337c757,Asema Suleiman,+2348148043575,asemasuleiman@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Innovative and result-driven UI/UX Designer with a multidisciplinary background in design, computer science, and business. Skilled in blending creativity with technical expertise to craft intuitive, user-centered experiences. Proficient in code and design software (VS Code, Figma, Adobe Creative Suite) with understanding of HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript. Experienced in prototyping and wireframing to solve real-world challenges effectively. Familiar with agile methodologies and collaborative workflows, ensuring alignment with business and user needs. Actively pursuing new opportunities to tackle complex design problems, foster inclusivity, and contribute to the development of future technologies.",https://www.behance.net/asemasuleiman1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733758181172_My New Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T15:29:44.884Z,2024-12-09T15:29:44.884Z,,,,,,,,,
67570db6b42680749337c761,Williams Okoronkwo,+23408012682678,okoronkwo.williams@outlook.com,Nigeria,"As a product designer and bubble developer, I bring not just technical expertise but also leadership, collaboration, and a user-centered mindset. I am passionate about fostering creative environments where teams can thrive and delivering products that exceed user expectations. With my blend of design mastery and technical fluency, I am confident in my ability to lead your design initiatives and drive innovation within your organization.\n\nMy primary UX tools, Figma and FigJam, enable me to design collaboratively with teams, stakeholders, and developers, ensuring alignment and clarity throughout the design process. Beyond traditional design, I have honed my skills in no-code and low-code platforms like Bubble and Toddle, empowering me to bridge design and development. This capability allows me to prototype and implement solutions with speed and precision, transforming concepts into fully functional applications.\n\nI have successfully led and contributed to projects across various industries, including healthcare, software services, finance, and entertainment, giving me a broad perspective on tailoring experiences to diverse audiences. My unique ability to manage both design and no-code development ensures a streamlined workflow, reducing bottlenecks and expediting delivery timelines without compromising quality.",www.dribbble.com/noCode_Lad,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733758386756_My CV-  Oct 2024.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T15:33:10.592Z,2024-12-09T15:33:10.592Z,,,,,,,,,
6757103eb42680749337c785,Jerome Opara,+2349169140952,jheromeopara@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello I’m Jerome, I’m a product designer with 2 years of experience, who loves creating simple and beautiful designs that make life easier for people. I work closely with teams to turn ideas into real products that are easy to use and solve everyday problems.",https://jeromeopara.notion.site/Hi-I-m-Jerome-b6ee42c2b0074241bfe4855f66c1951b?pvs=4,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733759034806_Jerome Official Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T15:43:58.704Z,2024-12-09T15:43:58.704Z,,,,,,,,,
675710b2b42680749337c78c,Segun Bankole,+23407044148334,smithabbey13@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Google Certified UI/UX Designer over two years of experience. I have a proven track record of leadership within startups and I am also an expert in user interface and user experience design. \n\nI have led design teams in two startups and helped develop design systems that ensure consistency and user-friendliness across mobile and desktop applications and websites. My approach to design is rooted in the principles of design thinking and user-centered design. I have used this approach to create solutions that resonate with users, improving user satisfaction and engagement. \n\nI am passionate about solving complex design challenges and crafting aesthetically pleasing interfaces. I am eager to leverage my skills to help your firm create exceptional digital experiences using cutting-edge technologies and design methodologies. \n\nI have attached my resume for further details about my professional background and accomplishments. I welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to the continued success of your design team. Thank you for considering my application.",https://www.behance.net/abbeybankole,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733759151015_Segun_Bankole_Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T15:45:54.520Z,2024-12-09T15:45:54.520Z,,,,,,,,,
