67571e8ab42680749337c7f6,Oludare Paul Sunday ,+2348029209952,oludarepaulsunday@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello! My name is Paul; and I am a UI \n/UX Designer.  As a UI/UX designer, my job is to deploy a balance between Aesthetics and Functionality. With my keen eye for design and delicate understanding of User Behaviour; I've been able to craft templates that are not only visually appealing but also easy to navigate..",https://www.behance.net/P_Hub,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733762696177_My CV.docx,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T16:44:58.689Z,2024-12-09T16:44:58.689Z,,,,,,,,,
675720c1b42680749337c804,Okolo Victor,+2349158409592,Okolovictor307@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Okolo Victor, and I am a passionate graphic designer with a strong background in creating visually appealing content and managing social media for brands. I am currently in my second year studying Computer Science at Ambrose Alli University, which has equipped me with technical and problem-solving skills that complement my creative expertise.  \n\nI specialize in digital designs, including social media content, branding, and UI/UX design, and I also have experience in video editing and motion animation. My work with a company offering services like SEO, website design, and social media management has given me valuable insights into crafting designs that drive engagement and business results. Additionally, I've designed for innovative projects, including a fintech app ('PaySphere') and a coder-friendly tool ('Line 99').  \n\nI'm excited about the opportunity to contribute to your team. My goal is to leverage my design skills and creative thinking to add value to your projects and grow as a professional in the process.  \n\nThank you for considering my application. I would be happy to share more about my experiences",https://dribbble.com/vickcomic,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733763261674_Okolo Victor Portfolio..pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T16:54:25.392Z,2024-12-09T16:54:25.392Z,,,,,,,,,
67572113b42680749337c80b,Goodness Ogueri,+23409041607002,goodnessogueri25@gmail.com,Niger,"Hi there, My name is Goodness Ogueri, and I'm a skilled and passionate Product Designer with 3 years in the game. My design philosophy is user-centric, visually beautiful, grounded in research and forever evolving. I support the development of profitable digital products that enthrall consumers and provide noticeable outcomes. My superpower is my ability to pay close attention to detail and go above and beyond to make sure the digital goods I designed are unique and long-lasting.\n\nI have a strong and profound understanding of design principles, and my quest to know more and be the best drives me every day to make progress.",behance.net/goodnessdavid,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733763344201_GOODNESS OGUERI resume - tobams.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T16:55:47.030Z,2024-12-09T16:55:47.030Z,,,,,,,,,
67572294b42680749337c813,Stephanie Ojo,+2348104521033,stephanieojouyomi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a creative product designer with over 3years of experience. I am well equipped with user experience knowledge as I have worked with various companies both on-site and remotely. \n\nI have worked with various companies on different product needs like Saas products, e-commerce products, fintech products, B2B products. \n\nMy magical power is literally open communication as I’ve found out while working as a product designer over the years that you can’t make a good product that doesn’t make a statement. \n\nTo me, being a great product designer isn’t just about aesthetics, it’s about making the user experience it in a better way and without stress.\n\nJust like whoever would be reading this now. I bet you wouldn’t have gotten to this part of the writeup if it was all clumped up.\n\nThat’s what product design is all about. The experience!.",https://www.behance.net/gallery/213752469/STEPHANIE-OJO-UIUX-DESIGNER-PORTFOLIO,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733763729119_Resume.pdf.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T17:02:12.096Z,2024-12-09T17:02:12.096Z,,,,,,,,,
675723afb42680749337c824,Samuel,+2348107225703,adetulaowolabi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Recipient,\n\nI want express my strong interest in this role at your company, as advertised. Over the past 5 years of my career, I have honed my skills in the complete life cycle of user experience design which includes user experience copy writing while working on diverse projects in various industries such as Fintech, E-commerce, Logistics, EduTech(LMS) and Real Estate.\n\nTo be more precised, I have had years experience in designing Fintech product ranging from B2C product such as Swwipe which is used by business owners to receive payment through payment gateway or in-store with Swwipe mobile app and POS devices, as well as P2P product such as Parkway wallet which is used to send and receive money between peers. I also design a management system for these apps which covers transactions, terminals, merchant etc. Noted that these products are available on your mobile app stores (Google Play store and Apple App store).\n\nMy experience includes collaborating closely with cross-functional teams, conducting user research, ux copy writing, creating wireframes, prototypes, and delivering polished user-centric product.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experiences align with the company's goals in more detail.\n\nHope to hear from you soon.",https://www.figma.com/proto/jmicKMtbKflJbS9i7WL90K/Design-Mixologist?node-id=1235-9491&node-type=frame&t=W37mFCQy8AiHLsnO-0&scaling=scale-down-width&content-scaling=fixed&page-id=0%3A1&starting-point-node-id=1235%3A9491,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733764012763_Resume (Samuel Adetula)).pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T17:06:55.888Z,2024-12-09T17:06:55.888Z,,,,,,,,,
675723ecb42680749337c831,Similoluwa Ilesanmi Oladayo,+2348164155954,oladayoilesanmi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an experienced UI/UX designer with 4 years experience in designing Human Centered Designs, User Experience design and I make simplistic designs with beautiful aesthetics. I am currently a freelancer and have worked on so many projects, my Resume has some details about some of the places and experiences I have worked on. ",behance.net/oladayoilesanmi,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733764073019_Similoluwa Ilesanmi resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T17:07:56.007Z,2024-12-09T17:07:56.007Z,,,,,,,,,
67572e72b42680749337c86b,Obosi Rejoice Chibundom ni,+2347031398741,obosirejoice1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a passionate Product Designer with a strong foundation in user experience (UX) and user interface (UI) design. I have hands-on experience through internships and freelance projects, where I collaborated with cross-functional teams to create user-centered designs. My recent role at The Bulb Africa and other projects, like a game streaming platform, honed my ability to design intuitive, visually engaging, and functional digital experiences. I’m driven by a curiosity for problem-solving and a commitment to continuous improvement. I’m excited about the opportunity to contribute my creativity, attention to detail, and technical skills to the innovative projects at Tobams Group.",https://www.figma.com/proto/1gZtAhaJeybNAn1rKMlTuA,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733766767180_1733126016446_CV - Rejoice Obosi.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T17:52:50.243Z,2024-12-09T17:52:50.243Z,,,,,,,,,
