6757362ab42680749337c8a0,Favour Adeyemo ,+2347082785200,favouradeyemo59@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Favour Adeyemo, a recent graduate of Computer Science from Babcock University. I recently completed my mandatory National Youth Service Corps (NYSC) and am currently looking for a job placement to help kickstart my career in product design.\n\nI have hands-on experience in product design, including UI/UX design, and I’ve worked on several impactful projects. For example, I co-led the creation of a web app at Grazac to streamline user onboarding for lectures and designed a declutter app that connects users to buy and sell home items they no longer need. These experiences have allowed me to refine my skills in user research, prototyping, and design thinking.\n\nWhile I am open to full-time roles, I am also willing to take on internship opportunities to further deepen my skills and contribute meaningfully to a team. I look forward to the opportunity to bring value to your organization.\n",https://www.behance.net/favouradeyemo,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733768743331_FAVOUR ADEYEMO RESUME.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T18:25:46.158Z,2024-12-09T18:25:46.158Z,,,,,,,,,
67573d9bb42680749337c8b8,Excellent Makanju,+23408068790294,muidemakz@gmail.com,Nigeria,"“As a passionate and experienced Product Designer, I excel at creating user-centric designs that balance functionality and aesthetics to enhance customer satisfaction and drive business goals. With over 5 years of expertise in designing for diverse industries, I bring a deep understanding of user-centered design principles, interaction design, and information architecture to every project. My portfolio demonstrates a strong proficiency in tools like Figma and showcases a keen eye for detail and a commitment to accessibility and inclusivity.\n\nIn previous roles, I’ve successfully collaborated with cross-functional teams to develop and maintain design systems, create wireframes and prototypes, and iterate based on user research and usability testing. I thrive in agile environments, where I can contribute to a culture of innovation, continuous learning, and collaborative problem-solving.\n\nI’m particularly drawn to this role because of the opportunity to design visually stunning products that impact millions of users worldwide. I’m excited to bring my skills, creativity, and passion to your team, shaping exceptional user experiences that align with your mission and values.”",https://mainstack.me/muidemakz,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733770648390_My CV_Resume.docx.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T18:57:31.745Z,2024-12-09T18:57:31.745Z,,,,,,,,,
67574057b42680749337c8cb,Eyene Ekere Uwak,+2349012321575,judeekere@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Product Designer with 4+ Years experience in product designer.\ndriving solutions in fintech, protect, Healthcare , Consumer tech and more.\n\nCross team experience engineering and design",https://eyn.framer.website,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733771348558_Eyene Ekere-Uwak CV  - Sept II.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T19:09:11.435Z,2024-12-09T19:09:11.435Z,,,,,,,,,
6757407eb42680749337c8d3,Enyi Lawrence ,+2348034753962,enyilawrenceukpa@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As a UI/UX and Product Designer with over 5 years of experience, I aim to align business goals with user needs by creating intuitive designs for web, mobile apps, and digital products. I specialize in user research, wireframing, prototyping, and high-fidelity design. I collaborate with cross-functional teams, including stakeholders to deliver impactful designs that boost user engagement and client satisfaction.",https://enyilawrence.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733771387120_Enyi Lawrence (Resume).pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T19:09:50.290Z,2024-12-09T19:09:50.290Z,,,,,,,,,
67574229b42680749337c8de,Ovwighose Malcom,+2347036775388,Ovwighosemalcom@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"Hi, I’m Malcom,  a Product Designer skilled in delivering seamless digital experiences to solve complex human problems through creativity and design. With 4 years of experience designing landing pages and end-to-end usable products for mobile and web, I am passionate about delivering simple digital solutions that improve people's lives. I have collaborated cross-functionally with engineers and stakeholders throughout the entire product development process, from ideation to launch and testing. I am also dedicated to sharing my knowledge and mentoring new designers. In my free time, I enjoy reading and taking walks in parks to refresh and inspire my creativity.",https://www.behance.net/rukevweovwigho,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733771813334_Ovwighose Malcom RESUME.Abj1.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T19:16:57.364Z,2024-12-09T19:16:57.364Z,,,,,,,,,
675742adb42680749337c8e5,Aishat Oyeleke ,+23408162676650,oyelekeaishat2018@gmail.com,Nigeria,"With a unique blend of customer-facing experience and design skills, I'm confident in my ability to craft user-centered designs that drive engagement and revenue growth. \n\n With my previous experience in Customer success, I understand the importance of empathy, user centricity and advocacy and I've carried this mindset into my product design work, where I've spent nearly two years delivering high-quality designs for web and mobile applications. \n\nCurrently, I'm sharing my knowledge and expertise with the next generation of designers as an assistant product design instructor. My passion is to create products that truly help users, and I'm drawn to Tobams because of its commitment to enable and provide solutions to the problems of her users while ensuring satisfaction at every step of the way.\n\nI have attached my CV and portfolio for your perusal and I'm excited to bring my skills and experience to a team dedicated to making a meaningful impact. Thank you for considering my application. ",https://www.behance.net/oyelekemariam,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733771947164_Oyeleke Aishatâs ResumÃ¨.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T19:19:09.993Z,2024-12-09T19:19:09.993Z,,,,,,,,,
6757453eb42680749337c8f2,Vitalis Omeike,+23407031594437,vitalischinedu03@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Omeike Vitalis, a passionate Brand Designer and UI/UX Designer with over three years of combined experience. I specialize in creating impactful designs that connect businesses with their audiences. Beyond design, I’m a musician, playing the piano, which nurtures my creativity. I'm also building my own agency, DevianniesStudio, with the goal of scaling it in the next five years. My approach is problem-solving through design, and I’m committed to personal and professional growth in every opportunity I undertake",https://www.behance.net/Veetalis,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733772602105_Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T19:30:06.543Z,2024-12-09T19:30:06.543Z,,,,,,,,,
