67574f1db42680749337c90a,Ayodeji Moyin Olure,+23409032372401,Olureayodeji15@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I started my tech career as a graphic designer and then I transitioned into UI/UX and Product design in 2022. I like to say that there is a great difference between Graphics design and UI/UX, as UI/UX design focuses on creating seamless user-centered digital experiences. It has helped me to understand human problems and how to empathize with them in bringing a live solution. Since transitioning, I have been opportuned to work on projects like Primart, pokea, Andtrac and many more.\n\nI've grown a UI/UX and product designer working with startups in making complex concepts and easy to use and accessible products. When I work with clients, I make sure to integrate to their team to fast track design practices and achieve product goals. \n\nIn the future, I'm looking for a place to call home, grow and can take my skill to a greater level.",https://www.figma.com/design/UkhGQeCj8AUEU7aU4GLE0b/Ayodeji-UI%2FUX-page?node-id=243-464&t=kC53U5soBpsHBM4K-1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733775130206_AYODEJI OLURE RESUME[1].pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T20:12:13.119Z,2024-12-09T20:12:13.119Z,,,,,,,,,
67575130b42680749337c913,Izuchukwu Chinedum Igwe,+2347030477981,izuigwe39@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Izuchukwu. I also go by the name Izuthecreator. I'm a very versatile designer who's currently looking for where to add and receive value, and that's why I am filling this form.\nI understand and constantly implement what it takes to produce functional, visually appealing, and correct designs. I also know Motion design which serves as a plus in creating very unique User interfaces. And I know HTML, CSS and Javascript, enabling me to design better and collaborate well with developers. I'm also a very jovial person and I like working in, and with teams.",https://www.behance.net/izuchukwuigwe1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733775660714_IZUCHUKWU UX.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T20:21:04.043Z,2024-12-09T20:21:04.043Z,,,,,,,,,
67575724b42680749337c920,Olasupo Omolola ,+2347075501055,Olasupo50@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"I am a product designer with about 2 years experience. I have designed multiple products which includes websites, web apps and mobile apps across a number of industries like the Healthcare, NEMT, IT, and Culture and Tourism industries. I also design pitch decks for companies.\nI am a continuous learner and like to stay up to date with design trends. I enjoy working closely with cross-functional teams—whether brainstorming with product managers, refining designs with developers, or incorporating feedback from stakeholders.\nUltimately my goal as a product designer is to create the best design experiences for users.",https://www.behance.net/olasupoisrael,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733777184963_Olasupo Omolola Resume-1.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T20:46:28.300Z,2024-12-09T20:46:28.300Z,,,,,,,,,
6757581fb42680749337c927,Opeyemi Olagunju,+2348182254926,Olagunjutioluwalope@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Opeyemi and I’m a very passionate UIUX designer with a drive to create not only user centered designs but scalable designs too.\n\nI used to work in finance. Infact, I worked in finance for a couple of years before transitioning fully into UIUX design.\n\nOver the years, I’ve been able to work on different projects ranging from mobile apps to web app to websites while honing my skills in user research, wireframing, prototyping, user testing, etc.\nAs a UIUX designer, I believe in putting users at the forefront of my design process. I follow a human-centered design approach, using tools like user interviews, wireframing, and usability testing to create intuitive and engaging experiences.\n\nEverything design interests me. Seeing products designed being tested and eventually being used by actual people makes me very happy.\n\nIf I’m not designing, you’ll find me reading books or babysitting.\n",https://olagunjuopeyemi.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733777436056_Opeyemi Tolulope Olagunju.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T20:50:39.169Z,2024-12-09T20:50:39.169Z,,,,,,,,,
67575c2cb42680749337c935,Uche Aso,+23408168608607,ucheaso45@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As a product designer, I combine creativity, user-centric thinking, and technical skills to craft compelling digital experiences. My work focuses on understanding user needs, solving problems, and delivering intuitive, functional, and aesthetically pleasing designs.",https://www.figma.com/design/SAfFmH0imYPDVcXrht9v0O/PORTFOLIO---FREELANCE-PROJECTS?node-id=0-1&node-type=canvas&t=tb7pLNDREB6G3clW-0,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733778473523_Uche Aso.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T21:07:56.395Z,2024-12-09T21:07:56.395Z,,,,,,,,,
67576702b42680749337c941,Daniel Ori,+2348122860226,oridaniel97@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Daniel Ori. I’m a User Experience Designer with over five years of experience creating solutions that not only look great but solve real problems. My strength lies in blending creativity with strategy to design user-friendly interfaces and systems that drive results.\n\nWhat makes me stand out is my ability to deeply understand user needs and translate them into functional, impactful designs. I thrive on solving challenges, simplifying complexity, and delivering work that balances innovation with practicality.\n\nI’m passionate about creating meaningful experiences that improve lives, and I believe great design is about connecting people, businesses, and ideas seamlessly. I’m confident I’d bring value, focus, and fresh perspectives to any team I join.",https://typical-caravel-f74.notion.site/Ori-UX-Portfolio-19bda195bed94631889165e6b2ebc73b,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733781247942_My Resume - Daniel.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T21:54:10.914Z,2024-12-09T21:54:10.914Z,,,,,,,,,
67576abab42680749337c959,Joy Ifeoluwa Orukpe,+2348161543730,creatorsspace01@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello! I am Joy, a UI/UX designer dedicated to crafting intuitive digital experiences. I conduct user research, create wireframes, and develop prototypes to ensure my designs are both user friendly and effective. Outside of design, I enjoy photography, traveling, and cooking, which inspire my creativity. I’m committed to staying updated on trends and collaborating with others to deliver innovative, user-centered solutions that enhance user satisfaction and engagement in every project I undertake.",https://www.behance.net/joyOrukpe,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733782199580_Joy Ifeoluwa CV (UI UX ).pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T22:10:02.929Z,2024-12-09T22:10:02.929Z,,,,,,,,,
67576c9fb42680749337c977,Fasemore Tolulope Victor ,+2348131088242,Bensonton1987@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Fasemore Tolulope Victor a UIUX Designer, graphic designer, design thinking expert, with a wealth of experience in building scalable digital experiences. I have experience working as an intern at UX Foundry, where I have been reshaping digital interfaces and contributed to designing intuitive platforms that enhance user engagement and satisfaction. My proficiency in Figma and Canva has enabled me to create visually appealing and functional designs. \n\nI have a solid educational foundation in Computer Science from The Polytechnic, Ibadan, which helps me bridge technological know-how with creative design solutions. My roles at Programmiers and Metroview ltd further honed my skills in UI/UX and graphic design.\n\nI am a problem solver, with a collaboration skill, passionate for innovative design that brings valuable addition to a team or an organization.\n\nThank you.",https://www.behance.net/fasemoretolulopeUIUX#,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733782684311_Tolulope Victor-CV 2024.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T22:18:07.811Z,2024-12-09T22:18:07.811Z,,,,,,,,,
67576d1ab42680749337c989,Damilare Olukoya,+23409035860474,olukoyadamilare30@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a curious and creative digital product designer with a passion for storytelling, touring and the arts. With over five years of experience in designing intuitive, user-centered, research driven solutions, I've helped drive financial inclusion for millions of Nigerians as a Senior Product Designer at 3Line. I'm excited to leverage my skills to contribute to your company's mission to shaping the future of tech talent development in Africa and beyond.",https://bit.ly/olukoyadamilare_portfolio,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733782807414_OLUKOYA DAMILARE Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T22:20:10.721Z,2024-12-09T22:20:10.721Z,,,,,,,,,
67576d80b42680749337c990,Ikporo Begusa,+23408147289407,ikporo.begusa@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a dedicated UI/UX designer with a strong foundation in crafting user-centered and visually appealing designs. My experience includes completing the UI/UX PDU Bootcamp, where I developed skills in user research, prototyping, and usability testing. I excel in using tools like Figma, Adobe XD, and InVision to create accessible and data-driven designs that ensure inclusivity and user satisfaction. With a proactive learning mindset, I’m passionate about solving complex challenges and contributing to impactful products.",https://www.behance.net/gallery/205919487/Ui-and-Web-Design,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733782908413_Ikporo Begusa Olalekan. Design CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T22:21:52.248Z,2024-12-09T22:21:52.248Z,,,,,,,,,
6757706cb42680749337c9a4,Deborah Balogun,+2349065318126,debbalogun2020@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a UX Designer/Researcher with over three years of experience in crafting user-centric solutions across financial, health, and social impact sectors. I am skilled in user research, interaction design, and prototyping, with a good record of enhancing engagement, improving task success rates, and boosting ROI. I am proficient in tools like Figma, Miro, and Google suite, and passionate about transforming insights into solutions that align with business needs.","Here is a link to my portfolio- https://www.behance.net/debbbalogun  It shows a glimpse of my work, though I acknowledge it is still a work in progress. It highlights some of my projects, but I am certain that my CV and cover letter, provide a fuller picture of my capabilities. I would be happy to discuss other projects or insights during an interview.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733783656205_DEBB BALOGUN PD (DEC) CV._page-0001.jpg,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T22:34:20.269Z,2024-12-09T22:34:20.269Z,,,,,,,,,
675771ffb42680749337c9b5,GloneTech Solutions,+2348066998374,glonetechsolutions@gmail.com,Nigeria,"We are excited to introduce Glonetech Solutions—a creative studio where \ndesign, innovation, and client goals converge to bring extraordinary visions to \nlife. Our team of experienced professionals specializes in web design, product \ndesign, animation, motion graphics, video editing, graphic design, and \neverything in between. With each project, we strive to deliver captivating \nexperiences and outstanding results. \nIn today's landscape, we understand the importance of standing out. Our \nteam has a deep background in crafting tailored solutions that not only meet \nclient specifications but also exceed expectations. Our recent projects \ndemonstrate our ability to align design and functionality with brand identity, \nleading to impactful results. \nOur approach is founded on collaboration, transparency, and innovation. We \nwould love to explore how we can support your company’s projects with our \ndiverse creative services. Please feel free to reach out if you’d like to discuss \nthis in more detail or view our full portfolio. \nThank you for considering us. We look forward to the opportunity to work \ntogether. \nWarm regards, \nOladipupo Saka \nCo-Founder \nGlonetech Solutions",glonetech-solutions.vercel.app,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733784060681_CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T22:41:03.287Z,2024-12-09T22:41:03.287Z,,,,,,,,,
675772c3b42680749337c9c1,Emmanuel Amaechi,+23409153497876,emmanuelamaechi000@gmail.com,Nigeria,"A designer with extensive experience in crafting modern, user-centric designs? Look no further! With over 4 years of experience as a UI/UX designer, I've had the privilege of collaborating with a UK-based startups, fintech, Logistics and healthcare companies to create impactful designs that deliver results.\n\nWhy Work With Me?\nAs a UX/UI Designer, I specialize in turning ideas into engaging, user-friendly designs. My focus is on creating digital experiences that are not just visually appealing but also functional and easy to navigate. I’m driven by a deep understanding of user needs, ensuring that every design decision enhances the overall experience. From collaborating with teams to refining the smallest details, I’m committed to making product accessible and enjoyable for all users\n\nHow I Can Help You:\n✅ UI/UX Design for Mobile & Web Apps\n✅ Landing Page Design\n✅ Prototyping & Wireframing\n✅ Branding\n✅ Design Systems & Style Guides\n✅ UI/UX Design for Logistics, EdTech, SaaS, Healthcare, B2B, Fintech e.t.c\n\nWhat Sets Me Apart:\nI have a keen eye for detail, a creative mindset, and excellent communication skills. I use industry-standard tools like Figma, Jira, Adobe, and Discord. Additionally, I have a foundational understanding of HTML and CSS, I’m currently expanding my skills by learning Webflow a no code tools",https://www.behance.net/emmanuelamaechi001,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733784255616_CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T22:44:19.153Z,2024-12-09T22:44:19.153Z,,,,,,,,,
67577368b42680749337c9ca,Momoh Halima Abdullahi ,+2348146129281,momohhalima42@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Halima Momoh, a dedicated UI/UX Designer with 1 year of experience creating intuitive and visually appealing digital products. I'm passionate about crafting user-centric designs that not only look great but also provide seamless and enjoyable experiences.\nMy journey in UI/UX began while studying Chemical Engineering at the federal university of technology Owerri. I've honed my skills in user research, wireframing, prototyping, visual design through my one year intensive training in product design at Tech4Dev.\nI'm particularly drawn to Tobams Group's commitment to redefine Africa's tech landscape on the global stage by empowering 10 million Tech Talents by 2030. I'm excited about the opportunity to contribute to and leverage my skills to create impactful designs that align with your brand's vision.\nBeyond my professional pursuits, I enjoy exploring new design trends, karaoke even when I sing terribly, and spending time with family. These hobbies fuel my creativity and provide a fresh perspective on problem-solving.\nI'm eager to learn and collaborate with talented individuals. I'm confident in my ability to deliver exceptional designs that exceed expectations.\n",https://www.behance.net/halimamomoh1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733784421641_Momoh . Halima - Resume (1).png,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T22:47:04.977Z,2024-12-09T22:47:04.977Z,,,,,,,,,
675775bbb42680749337c9d3,David Manasseh,+23408065923649,dmanasseh11@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is David Manasseh, and I am a passionate Product Designer with a strong background in creating user-centered designs that balance functionality and visual appeal. I have hands-on experience in designing intuitive and accessible products, including Xploremall, a mall navigation app that enhances user engagement through seamless interactions and detailed usability research.\n\nIn my career, I’ve maintained design systems for startups like Finmate, ensuring consistency across platforms while aligning with brand guidelines. I excel at collaborating with cross-functional teams, translating complex ideas into user-friendly interfaces, and iteratively improving designs through user feedback.\n\nWith proficiency in tools like Figma and a solid understanding of user-centered design principles, I thrive in agile environments where creativity and problem-solving are key. I’m excited about the opportunity to contribute to your team’s mission of delivering exceptional user experiences and impactful products.",dvmdesigns.com.ng,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733785016616_DAVID MANASSEH UIUX RESUME.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-09T22:56:59.554Z,2024-12-09T22:56:59.554Z,,,,,,,,,
675785c2b42680749337c9e6,Harrison Udechukwu ,+2349160563105,harryudechukwu@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Harrison Udechukwu, An adept product designer with strong expertise in UI/UX design, focused on creating user-friendly and intuitive mobile apps and websites. With over 3 years of experience in design, I’ve worked on multiple projects where I helped improve user engagement by designing thoughtful interfaces, I've developed and harnessed my skills to problems and create value with my design swiftly. Moving forward, I’m excited about tackling leadership roles and taking on more strategic design challenges.",https://read.cv/harryude/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733789119445_Harrison Udechukwu's R'me.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T00:05:22.269Z,2024-12-10T00:05:22.269Z,,,,,,,,,
67579c52b42680749337c9ee,Stefano Maugeri,+2330549150378,maulicante@gmail.com,Ghana,"My name is Stefano Maugeri, I am a graphic designer artist. My experience is varied and this presentation\nincludes graphic works of various artistic and technical types.\nMainly my best expression is the graphic one made with black ink on paper.\nI have won national and foreign competitions. Among the technical images, the drawings created manually at that time for Ferrari spa automobiles in Maranello (Modena) stand out.\nThe image with strong communicative added value can be seen in the creations of landscapes and fantastic machines, performed manually without the use of pencil, eraser, ruler and templates. I have always been fascinated by the wonderful genius of Leonardo da Vinci... from whom I took inspiration for my fantastic machines made up of a harmonious succession of pulleys, gears, tubes, tanks, thermionic valves. The contrast between shadow and light is constantly reported in every creation. I hereby would like to open a market through your organization and gain mutual benefits. I cordially greet you and wish you a good continuation.",https://sites.google.com/d/1j7XJq6NfiG-sreQsvFOIkkaMLWKZRnlK/p/1bObKmOL604QfC5ThgOMu9XBq-usc_CNw/edit,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733794894697_Presentazione TECNICA 02 STEFANO_ITA_ENG-compressed.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T01:41:38.050Z,2024-12-10T01:41:38.050Z,,,,,,,,,
6757a398b42680749337c9f6,Edith Udeagha,+23408164532240,edithude04@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a passionate UI/UX Designer with over two years of experience creating intuitive and user-centered digital solutions for web and mobile platforms. My design journey is rooted in a background in customer service, which taught me the importance of empathy and understanding user needs.\n\nI specialize in user research, wireframing, and prototyping, and I have worked on diverse projects, including a school dashboard and a fashion app. I enjoy solving problems creatively and collaborating with teams to design experiences that are both functional and visually engaging.\n\nI am driven by a desire to create meaningful designs that improve lives and align with business goals.",https://www.behance.net/edithudeaghaa,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733796757268_Product Designer CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T02:12:40.614Z,2024-12-10T02:12:40.614Z,,,,,,,,,
6757b43eb42680749337ca0a,Damilola Ibikunle,+2347048865915,damilolaibikunle878@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a product designer with over six months of experience, integrating my customer service background into user-centered design. I’ve worked on a fitness and diet app, focusing on usability and engaging interfaces, and a car control app, enhancing safety. My customer service experience gives me a strong sense of empathy and active listening, allowing me to design solutions that solve real user problems. I collaborate with cross-functional teams to deliver impactful, functional user solutions.",https://www.behance.net/Damilolaibikunle,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733801019288_Damilola Ibikunle Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T03:23:42.037Z,2024-12-10T03:23:42.037Z,,,,,,,,,
