6757e0b0b42680749337ca87,Inya Eneotse Rhoda,+2347034500288,inyarhodaa@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Product designer with basic knowledge of HTML & CSS with six( 6 ) months hands on experience building intuitive, user centered, aesthetically pleasing designs using tools like Figma, Figjam, Miro, Balsamiq. I am skilled in problem spotting, problem solving, user research, prototyping, wireframing, visual design, design handoff, design system etc.\nIn my current role , I was tasked to build a design system from scratch which I delivered 80% of the job which resulted in having consistency, better collaboration and speed across the team.\nI am open to feedback from superiors and team members always, I have the ability to work as as a team and as an individual when needed, I manage my time effectively.\nI am open to joining a dynamic team to collaborate successfully in building solutions for a better user experience and also drive revenue for the company.",https://www.behance.net/inyarhoda1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733812397842_Rhoda Inya CV 1.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T06:33:20.736Z,2024-12-10T06:33:20.736Z,,,,,,,,,
