6757ea16b42680749337caab,Odewumi Christiana Omolara ,+23409165577616,odewumichristiana22@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Odewumi Christiana. I am\nA product designer,designing for over 3years now. I am passionate about creating visually appealing user interface to meet of the intended user and to improve user experience.\nI believe the best designs are the ones that make it easy for users to accomplish their goal without even realizing it.",https://www.behance.net/odewumiomolara,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733814802348_Odewumi Christiana Omolara Cv.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T07:13:26.222Z,2024-12-10T07:13:26.222Z,,,,,,,,,
