6757efa1b42680749337cad6,Ebunoluwa Ige,+2348131172185,ebunigedesigns@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi, I'm Ebunoluwa, a product designer with a passion for creating user-centered designs. With a background in Human Physiology, I bring empathy into my work, understanding user behavior and designing with purpose. I believe great designs result from great teamwork and enjoy collaborating with others to develop innovative solutions. When I'm not designing, you can find me reading, watching movies, or walking my puppy. I'm excited to join Tobamsgroup team where innovation and collaboration thrive.",https://tinyurl.com/EbunoluwaIge,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733816223021_Ebunoluwa Ige Resume .pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T07:37:05.600Z,2024-12-10T07:37:05.600Z,,,,,,,,,
6757f346b42680749337cae2,Aboaba Olateju,+2348146046708,aboabaolateju@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI hope this message finds you well. I am writing to express my interest in the Product designer role. With my background in product design, a strong passion for creating user-centric designs, and experience in improving user experiences through both design and research, I am confident that I would be a great fit for your team.\n\nAt Vendease, I had the opportunity to lead the design of several web and mobile applications, where I focused on enhancing user interfaces and optimizing usability. I collaborated closely with cross-functional teams, including product managers, developers, and researchers, to create intuitive and visually appealing designs that resulted in measurable improvements in user engagement and satisfaction. Some of my key skills include:\n\n• User-Centered Design: Conducting user research, creating personas, wireframes, and prototypes, and ensuring design solutions align with user needs.\n\n• Prototyping & Interaction Design: Using tools like Sketch, Figma, Adobe XD, and InVision to develop interactive prototypes.\n\n• Collaborative Design: Working within Agile frameworks, and iterating on designs based on feedback from stakeholders and users.\n\n• Design Systems: Implementing and maintaining design systems to ensure consistency across multiple products.\n\nI believe my skills in designing intuitive user interfaces and my ability to solve complex problems with creative solutions would allow me to contribute meaningfully to your team.\n\nI have attached my resume and portfolio for your review. I would be thrilled to discuss how my experiences align with the goals of the company and the Product Designer role. Please feel free to reach out to schedule a conversation at your convenience.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to speak with you.\n\nBest regards,\n\nOlateju Aboaba.",bit.ly/3VIKFYm,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733817155077_ABOABA OLATTEJU.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T07:52:38.763Z,2024-12-10T07:52:38.763Z,,,,,,,,,
6757f5bbb42680749337caea,Segun Shogo Oyedun,+2348101750784,foyedun@gmail.com,Nigeria,"A highly skilled and versatile professional with over 4 years\nof experience in UI/UX design, graphic design, and product\nManagement, combined with strong technical skills in Java and\nReact. Additionally, 6 months of experience in technical support,\ndemonstrating a broad understanding of both the technical and\ncreative aspects of software development and user experience.\nKnown for innovative problem-solving, exceptional communication\nskills, and the ability to manage complex projects from conception to\ncompletion.",https://docs.google.com/document/d/1jI1nw0oYWjVuqKMTpIa0KC8QtPXVCLF_/edit?usp=drive_link&ouid=104774329596354340823&rtpof=true&sd=true,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733817784546_shogo resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T08:03:07.040Z,2024-12-10T08:03:07.040Z,,,,,,,,,
6757f7a2b42680749337cb04,Adebambo Kafilat Teniola,+2349058232023,adebamboteniola@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"My name is Teni, I'm an experienced UI/UX Designer, I believe in user centric design by having the users in mind for a product that is user-friendly and intuitive to use (conducting research to know their pain point and what they want). I have worked on different projects creating good aesthetic and functioning user interface. I have skills in user research, user experience, user interface, wireframing, usability testing, prototyping.\niI am a good communication and also good at collaboration working with development team. I would love to add value to Tobams Group by designing solutions that are easy to use, improve customer satisfaction and drive business success.",https://www.behance.net/adebamboteniola,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733818271033_ADEBAMBO KAFILAT TENIOLA resume (1).pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T08:11:14.404Z,2024-12-10T08:11:14.404Z,,,,,,,,,
6757f7e1b42680749337cb0b,Jehosheba Abu,+2347026474466,jehoshebaj@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello, my name is Jehosheba Abahigocho Abu. I am a product designer specializing in creating stunning user interfaces (UI) and inclusive user experience (UX) designs. My design philosophy centers on inclusiveness and accessibility, ensuring that every user feels valued and engaged.\nMy Journey\nI started my career with a mission to transform digital interactions into delightful experiences. Over the years, I’ve honed my skills in various design disciplines, from wireframing and prototyping to user research and usability testing. My approach is always user-centric, driven by empathy and a keen understanding of user needs.\nBeyond Design\nIn addition to my expertise in design, I am also a Writer, fashion innovator and entrepreneur. I love pushing the boundaries of creativity, not only in the digital realm but also in the world of fashion. My entrepreneurial ventures have allowed me to blend my design skills with business acumen, bringing unique and innovative products to life.",https://www.behance.net/jehoshebajae,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733818334105_JEHOSHEBA A ABU UI_UX CV .pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T08:12:17.008Z,2024-12-10T08:12:17.008Z,,,,,,,,,
6757faf4b42680749337cb23,Kalu Ugochukwu Perfect ,+2348053621992,kalu.perfect.231828@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a driven individual who can easily adapt to new challenges. I have a good background in Pure and Industrial Chemistry. I also have experience in design and content creation.   Chemistry and design are two areas I really love. I've worked on several projects. For example, I’ve built admin dashboards, designed websites, and created user interfaces for apps. I enjoy coming up with new ideas and solving problems. ",https://www.behance.net/Perffectto,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733819120477_Kalu Ugochukwu Perfect.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T08:25:24.097Z,2024-12-10T08:25:24.097Z,,,,,,,,,
6757fc42b42680749337cb39,Seun Alakanse,+2348065813564,seun_93@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Senior Product Designer with over five years of experience creating user-centered digital products for B2B and B2C businesses. My passion lies in combining creativity and data-driven insights to solve real user problems, enhance engagement, and deliver exceptional experiences. Currently, I lead the design and user experience for the Performance Module at SeamlessHR, a B2B SaaS company, where I’ve driven significant improvements, such as increasing user engagement by 84.7% and reducing churn rates to 7%.\n\nWith expertise in user research, interaction design, and prototyping, I thrive in collaborative environments, working closely with developers, product managers, and stakeholders to bring innovative ideas to life. Beyond my professional work, I’m passionate about mentoring emerging designers, helping them refine their craft and succeed in the design field. I’m always eager to learn, grow, and contribute to meaningful projects that positively impact users and businesses alike.",https://seunalakanse.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733819455129_Seun Alakanse Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T08:30:58.011Z,2024-12-10T08:30:58.011Z,,,,,,,,,
6757fcd0b42680749337cb4a,Kenneth Idiaghe,+2347062345568,crosskenti@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a Product Designer based in Lagos, Nigeria.\nI have 3+ years of relevant experience spanning user experience design and research, working as a freelancer and within organizations. My work experience cuts across industries; Marketplace/e-commerce, retail, fintech, and education.  In my role, I have collaborated with cross-functional teams to build a better experience for the customers. I am passionate about designing daily interactions, improving user satisfaction at different touch points, and building loyalty with customers. \nMy hobbies include playing football, video games, table tennis, and snooker. \nI also enjoy watching and creating animations in my spare time.\n",https://kenneth-idiaghe.webflow.io/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733819592960_Idiaghe Kenneth Resume updated.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T08:33:20.216Z,2024-12-10T08:33:20.216Z,,,,,,,,,
6757fe3bb42680749337cb5c,Hilary Peters,+23408137017602,hilarypeters94@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Hilary Peters. I am a Product Designer with 3 years of hands-on experience in various industries, such as SAAS, Protech, E-Commerce, Agrotech, Edutech, and Fintech. \n\nMy journey as a Product Designer started in Graphic and Web design, where I collaborated with various teams on web design projects and marketing campaigns. However, my fascination with how design could influence human behaviour led me to Product Design.\n\nIn over 3 years I have been able to hone my skills in creating iterative designs that are backed by user insights, helping me to design data-driven products that meet user needs. I have also had the opportunity to lead and collaborate with teams, which has greatly improved my collaborative communication skills.",https://designsbyhilary.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733819960327_HILARY_PETERS_RESUME.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T08:39:23.812Z,2024-12-10T08:39:23.812Z,,,,,,,,,
