67580a09b42680749337cb9d,Emmanuel Ogunmoroti,+23409071494674,emmanuelogunmoroti@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm an amazing and relentless individual who enjoys design beyond my career. I have always had a desire for design from childhood but I made it professional during my BSc in Computer science at the University of Lagos, Nigeria. My designs have a minimal style to it and I always aim at making complex actions and interfaces easier for user. I'm very resourceful and a good team player with amazing reviews from those I have worked alongside with. ",https://emmanuelogunmoroti.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733822982695_Resume-Emmanuel-Ogunmoroti.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T09:29:45.515Z,2024-12-10T09:29:45.515Z,,,,,,,,,
