67580eb1b42680749337cbac,Debprah Olusola,+23408111813324,joycedeborah24@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a UI/UX designer with about two years of experience in creating user-centered designs for websites and mobile apps. I’m proficient in Figma, wireframing, and creating user personas to ensure a smooth user experience. \n\nIn my role as a designer, I've led the redesign of the landing pages of some web applications which improved user retention by 15%, as well as the design of a complete website for a customer (if you have links, please add). \n\nI’ve also worked with cross-functional teams to create wireframes and prototypes, ensuring the final product meets both the needs of users and business goals. I hope to get this position so I can bring my creativity into the team and help you hit your business target.",https://www.figma.com/proto/CxREXPyQmjbxYcz26vCAmq/iBROKA?node-id=9992-5230&t=lh4e71aRxFXEmPMj-1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733824174453_Deborah's Resume (1).pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T09:49:37.481Z,2024-12-10T09:49:37.481Z,,,,,,,,,
675811a7b42680749337cbb7,Majoroh Otaraghogho ,+2348106493729,majorohotas@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a self-taught product designer with over 3 years of experience, specializing in user-centered design and problem-solving. With a project management certification, I bring a unique blend of design expertise and leadership skills, allowing me to effectively manage design teams and projects. I’m proficient in Figma, Webflow, and Adobe XD, and thrive in fast-paced environments where collaboration and innovation are key. My goal is to deliver impactful, aesthetically pleasing designs while continuously advancing my skills and contributing to meaningful, user-focused solutions.",https://www.figma.com/file/yT2yuMJc1uJufeBeFY92ka?locale=en&type=design,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733824931803_Majorohâs Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T10:02:15.400Z,2024-12-10T10:02:15.400Z,,,,,,,,,
675811f1b42680749337cbbe,Feyisayo Adebayo,+2348164951354,Oluwafeyisayoadebayo@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Feyisayo Adebayo a Ui/Ux designer with 4 years of experience, I noticed you need a designer for your Motomtech and I would love to work with you.\n\nI have excellent research and creative design skills and I deliver 90% performance with close to two years of experience in User interface and Experience design.\n\nI know I'm not the perfect fit(not enough designer skills), but I also know no other freelancer you hire would work hard enough deliver as I would. I'm 100% confident in my design skills would be sufficient to hit the ground running .\n\nI look forward to hearing from you.\nAdebayo Feyisayo \n08164951354",https://www.behance.net/feyisayoadebayo1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733825005137_AdebayoÂ OluwafeyisayoÂ CV updated.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T10:03:29.663Z,2024-12-10T10:03:29.663Z,,,,,,,,,
675815ceb42680749337cbd3,Ojumola Faith Oluwadamilola ,+23408140703604,oojumola@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an entry-level Product Designer with a strong foundation in user-centered design, research, and prototyping. My experience includes working on impactful projects like developing design solutions for fintech apps and leading design initiatives as a volunteer. I enjoy solving problems, creating intuitive user experiences, and collaborating with teams to bring ideas to life. I’m passionate about continuous learning, innovation, and contributing to projects that make a meaningful impact in people’s lives.",https://www.behance.net/oojumola,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733825994020_Ojumola FO.jpg,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T10:19:58.316Z,2024-12-10T10:19:58.316Z,,,,,,,,,
675817a2b42680749337cbdc,Victor mawuli Nkwocha,+2347046154365,victor.mawuli99@gmail.com,Nigeria,"So I’m a designer with four years of experience, I prioritize user-centered design. I focus on meeting users' needs, preferences, and desires. And I do that by utilizing psychological concepts and researching user frustrations. This greatly impacts my work.\n\nMy approach to designing products revolves around considering the needs, preferences, and desires of the users. I balance creativity with practicality and stay up-to-date with design trends. My ability to blend aesthetics with user needs is evident in my track record of turning ideas into visually appealing and user-friendly designs, guided by established design laws and principles.\n",https://mawuli.notion.site/mawuli/Victor-Mawuli-Nkwocha-4e5a31eaa9424c529120caddec7139d1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733826463268_Interactive Designer.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T10:27:46.654Z,2024-12-10T10:27:46.654Z,,,,,,,,,
675818fbb42680749337cbe3,Makinde Oyindamola,+2348102317333,moyindamola46@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Oyindamola Makinde, a passionate product designer dedicated to creating user-centered designs that tackle real-world challenges. My journey into design has taught me that it’s not just about aesthetics; it’s about understanding the needs of users and crafting solutions that genuinely improve their experiences.\n\nI have  a background in Linguistics, and I am currently pursuing a Master’s degree in Communication and Language Arts at the University of Ibadan. Throughout my journey, I’ve had the opportunity to work on diverse projects, including mobile applications, web designs, and designs specifically tailored for the deaf and blind. \n\nI am always eager to learn and grow, whether through workshops, engaging with design communities, or exploring new tools and techniques to enhance my skills. \n\nOutside of work, I find joy in reading and sleeping, both of which keep me inspired and balanced. I’m excited about the opportunity to bring my skills and passion to Tobams Group and contribute to innovative solutions that enhance user experiences.\n\nThank you for considering my application!",https://oyindamolamakindeportfolio.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733826807600_OYINDAMOLA MAKINDE'S RESUME.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T10:33:31.237Z,2024-12-10T10:33:31.237Z,,,,,,,,,
67581c2ab42680749337cbed,Enyinnaya Chimela Brain,+23408134542130,bryanenyinnaya.be@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Enyinnaya Chimela Brain, a Product Designer with over four years of experience crafting intuitive and impactful digital solutions across fintech, e-commerce, food tech, and more. My expertise spans UI/UX design, interaction design, and user research, with a strong foundation in tools like Figma and Adobe Creative Suite.\n\nI thrive on turning complex problems into seamless user experiences, as seen in my work with brands like DineQR and P&G, where I designed scalable systems and refined brand strategies. Collaboration is my superpower—I enjoy partnering with engineers, product teams, and users to create innovative, user-centered designs that drive engagement and satisfaction.\n\nWhat excites me most about this role is the opportunity to shape products that genuinely enhance users' lives, combining thoughtful design with emerging technologies to make a real impact.",https://bryanenyinnaya.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733827622936_Mela's Resume Doc.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T10:47:06.046Z,2024-12-10T10:47:06.046Z,,,,,,,,,
67581e63b42680749337cbf7,Mabel Faustina Okoro,+2348119484840,mabel.faustina.okoro@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a recent graduate in Archaeology and Tourism from a small community in Enugu, Nigeria. While my academic background may seem unconventional, it has instilled in me a keen eye for detail, a strong work ethic, and a passion for storytelling. I've been exploring the world of design, and I'm excited about the opportunity to apply my design principles to create innovative and engaging user experiences. I've also gained practical experience through personal projects, which have allowed me to hone my skills and develop a portfolio of my work.\n\nI hope to hear from the team.",https://www.behance.net/mabelfokoro,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733828191579_Mabe faustina Okoro Product designer CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T10:56:35.164Z,2024-12-10T10:56:35.164Z,,,,,,,,,
67581e7eb42680749337cbfe,Marvelous Sodeke,+2349023617643,sodekemarvelous08@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a passionate and creative designer with experience in Product Design, Graphic Design, and Brand Identity Development. I’ve worked with startups like KGNL, Feed Globals and Magel Fabrics, designing logos, promotional materials, business cards and other brand assets that align with their vision.  \n\nI’ve also freelanced on platforms like Fiver, collaborating with brands like NPress Beauty to build cohesive business identities. My volunteer work with The Vanguard Africa allowed me to create impactful designs for a nonprofit dedicated to transformational leadership in Africa.  \n\nI thrive on translating ideas into visually compelling solutions and enjoy crafting designs that leave a lasting impression. My approach blends creativity, technical skills, and a deep understanding of brand storytelling to deliver exceptional results.",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-GHJDLJUIkRXUk8Pa5ameT13VG-wB1l8,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733828219838_Product:Graphic Design ResumÃ©.pdf.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T10:57:02.920Z,2024-12-10T10:57:02.920Z,,,,,,,,,
