6758203bb42680749337cc1a,Chiamaka Emmanuel,+2349078065944,emmanuelgoodness516@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello Hiring Manager, \n\nI'm Chiamaka Emmanuel, a Product designer with 2 years of experience helping web2/web3 companies design data-informed products using research and gamification strategies. I have designed solutions for different products.\n\nValue\n\nI've domain expertise in building quest and reputation systems, design systems, and I can transfer this knowledge to solve the underlying problem of user experience and high customer acquisition cost in the space.\n\nConclusion\n\nI've attached my resume and portfolio for your perusal, and please let me know if you'd like to know more; happy to set up some time to chat.\n",https://dribbble.com/amaka_ux,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733828665420_Chiamaka Emmanuel - CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T11:04:27.996Z,2024-12-10T11:04:27.996Z,,,,,,,,,
6758218bb42680749337cc29,SIMEON IFEANYI DOMINIC,+23408128265925,ifeanyidominic524@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am versatile and skilled professional with expertise in UX/UI design, graphic design, and computer operations. I also engaged in freelance projects, often working on platforms like Upwork, where I showcase My creative abilities by designing functional and visually appealing user interfaces.\n\nBeyond design, I’ve shown interest in roles involving virtual and personal assistance, demonstrating strong organizational and multitasking skills. I enjoy participating in challenges, such as the DAILYUI challenge, where I’ve worked on unique tasks like creating purchase receipts and analytic charts, which also double as portfolio pieces.\n\nI also exploring ways to improve My craft, ways to improve my designs to finding opportunities to enhance my skill set. ",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733829000301_MY CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T11:10:03.643Z,2024-12-10T11:10:03.643Z,,,,,,,,,
675837cfb42680749337cc7b,Temiloluwa Adeosun,+23408109219694,temiloluwabenjamin@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello! I'm Temi, a dedicated Brand and Product (UI/UX) Designer passionate about creating outstanding designs and user experiences. I thrive on crafting visually appealing and highly functional interfaces that enhance user engagement and satisfaction.\n\nOver the years, I've worked with diverse brands and startups, helping them establish a strong visual identity and improve their digital presence. My expertise spans various domains including nightlife, education, fashion, and finance. I love the challenge of transforming complex ideas into intuitive and aesthetically pleasing designs.\n\nI believe in the power of design to make a difference and am constantly seeking opportunities to learn and grow in my field. Whether it's through optimizing SEO for my Upwork profile, drafting proposals for tech startups, or creating engaging social media content, I'm committed to delivering excellence in every project I undertake.\n\nIn my free time, I enjoy exploring new design trends, working on personal projects, and staying active in the design community. Feel free to reach out if you'd like to collaborate or learn more about my work!",https://www.behance.net/temilolbenjami,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733834700126_TEMILOLUWA ADEOSUN.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T12:45:03.478Z,2024-12-10T12:45:03.478Z,,,,,,,,,
6758383bb42680749337cc82,Ifeanyichukwu David Nwankwo,+2348100937338,interculateddavid@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Ifeanyichukwu David Nwankwo, a graduate of Chemical Engineering and a seasoned product designer with three years of experience delivering design-led solutions that drive business success. In my previous role at a tech company, I focused on enhancing user experiences for websites, achieving measurable results, including a 25% reduction in bounce rates and a 20% increase in user retention by streamlining the onboarding process. Additionally, I have led the design of several mobile applications, including a payment solution app that enables seamless transactions and enhances user payment experiences.  \nWhat sets me apart as a designer is my ability to merge creativity with a deep understanding of both user needs and business objectives. I bring a solid foundation in design principles and proficiency in tools such as Figma, Adobe XD, Illustrator, and WordPress. My collaborative approach has been instrumental in projects like the Havopay and Zeecrest Mobile Apps, where I worked closely with developers and cross-functional teams to deliver intuitive interfaces that improved digital transactions and real estate management.  \nBeyond my technical expertise, I excel as a communicator and mentor. I actively foster open dialogue among stakeholders to ensure alignment on project goals, and I take pride in guiding newer designers to successfully navigate projects that have launched their careers. My resilience allows me to adapt to challenges and consistently deliver high-quality designs that meet and exceed expectations.  \nI am eager to bring this expertise and passion to your organization, contributing to its growth by creating user-focused products that align seamlessly with your vision and values.",https://www.behance.net/davidifeanyi,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733834808234_IFEANYICHUKWU DAVID NWANKWO CV..pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T12:46:51.559Z,2024-12-10T12:46:51.559Z,,,,,,,,,
67583b59b42680749337cc8f,Brandon Mbaka,+2348122736691,brandonsabbastine@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Brandon Mbaka Sabbastine \nA teenage boy based in Lagos with the skill and knowledge of Product Designing\nI create UI/UX Designs, Mock-ups, illustration's, Logos and more. ",https://www.behance.net/brandonsabbastine,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733835606287_Brandon Sabbastine Resume .pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T13:00:09.281Z,2024-12-10T13:00:09.281Z,,,,,,,,,
675844e9b42680749337cca7,Marious King Ndubueze,+23408118130114,mariousking07@gmail.com,Nigeria,"""Hello, my name is Marious King, and I have a degree in computer science from Ajayi crowther university. After spending three years in user centered design, where I honed my skills in user research and digital content creation, I made the transition to UX design. At Premiumtrust bank Company, I led a team project that redesigned our mobile app, resulting in a 30% increase in user engagement. I'm passionate about using design to enhance user experiences and am excited about this opportunity because I admire your company's commitment to innovation. I'm eager to contribute my expertise in user-centered design to your team.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/marious-king-a73ba11b2/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733838055247_marious cv.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T13:40:57.704Z,2024-12-10T13:40:57.704Z,,,,,,,,,
67584b3eb42680749337ccbd,Danyl Utuan Isaac,+2349034925576,danylisaac89@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a dedicated and detail-oriented product designer with a strong passion for creating user-centered solutions that not only meet but exceed business objectives. My role as a product designer entails crafting intuitive, visually compelling designs and user experiences that align seamlessly with both user needs and company goals. From wireframing to prototyping and user testing, I ensure every design decision is purposeful and impactful.\n\nI pride myself on my tenacity and strong work ethic, approaching each project with focus, determination, and a commitment to delivering exceptional results. I am proactive and thrive in dynamic environments, always ready to take ownership of challenges and turn them into opportunities.\n\nIf given the opportunity to join your team, I am prepared to hit the ground running. Leveraging my design expertise, I’ll dive into the role with enthusiasm and a clear strategy to create solutions that drive measurable business returns. Whether it’s enhancing user engagement, streamlining workflows, or creating designs that elevate brand presence, I’m confident in my ability to contribute meaningfully and help your business achieve its goals.",https://danylisaac.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733839675945_Danyl Isaac Product Designer Resume.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T14:07:58.557Z,2024-12-10T14:07:58.557Z,,,,,,,,,
67584e23b42680749337cccd,Otobong Morgan,+2348114117819,otobimorgan12@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Otobong Morgan, a seasoned product designer with 2+ years of practical experience and I am able to create digital solutions that will be enjoyable by  your users while aligning with your organizational and business goals.\n\nI am passionate about creating intuitive and visually appealing user experiences. My expertise in design tools like Figma, coupled with a deep understanding of user-centered design principles, enables me to deliver innovative solutions that meet user needs and your business objectives.\n\nWith prior experience of effective collaboration with cross functional team of Product managers, developers, etc., and an impeccable communication skills, I am able to work effectively in a team as well as on an individual basis depending on the demands of the project.\n\nOwing to the reasons above, I am open to giving you more depth into my professional background. I look forward to a favorable response.\n\nThank you.",https://otobongmorgan.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733840416832_Otobong Morgan - Product Designer 2024 (1).pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T14:20:19.636Z,2024-12-10T14:20:19.636Z,,,,,,,,,
67585065b42680749337ccdd,Chudi Ozokafor,+2348163013078,ozokaforchudi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello, my name is Chudi Ozokafor, a product designer who over the past 6 years has had the privilege of working with companies in different industries, crafting digital products that offer value to users and businesses. I am motivated to create moving and delightful experiences by employing a user-centered approach and leveraging Design Thinking frameworks, tools like Figma, Photoshop, Principle and a little magic.\n\nMy first introduction into UI/UX design was at MAX NG, a mobility and transport startup, as the product design lead working closely with the product manager and development team to introduce the first motorcycle ride-hailing service in Lagos. Since then I have built a career helping teams build valuable products across industries in fintech/banking, lifestyle, e-commerce and others. My work has given me the opportunity to help create design systems, conduct user research, lead design projects and contribute to marketing strategy.\n\nMy last engagement at FirstBank, I was a Senior UI Analyst wearing different hats; I was tasked with designing and reviewing customer-facing interfaces and internal applications for different departments in the bank. I also played the role of project manager where I interfaced with local and international vendors to oversee the development and deployment of applications to users.\n\nMy vast experience has shaped me into a specialist capable of solving problems across media and technology and I am confident my expertise, drive and desire to learn in a new environment would be of value to your company. Looking forward to having the opportunity to speak with you further about how I can be an asset to your team.\n",ozokafor.com,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733840994462_CHUDI OZOKAFOR_CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T14:29:57.359Z,2024-12-10T14:29:57.359Z,,,,,,,,,
67585079b42680749337cce4,Enyesiobi Golibe Faith,+2347062462468,enyesiobigolibe@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a product designer with one year plus of experience. I thrive on solving problems through innovative and visually compelling designs. I’m passionate about continuous learning, effective communication, and collaboration with cross-functional teams to bring ideas to life.  I also thrive in team environment where I can contribute fresh ideas and work towards user-focused solutions.\n\nOutside of work, I enjoy working on personal animation projects, and staying inspired by design trends.",behance.net/golyxfaith,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733841014513_Enyesiobi Golibe Faith RESUME.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T14:30:17.812Z,2024-12-10T14:30:17.812Z,,,,,,,,,
67585840b42680749337ccfd,Adeshola Bello ,+2348032003048,shola.bello@outlook.com,Nigeria,"Hello👋 I’m Adeshola, a versatile product designer with expertise in user experience design, graphics design, and products design, coupled with over 5 years of experience in software product management. I thrive on merging design skills with product delivery expertise, collaborating with cross-functional teams to create visually appealing, meaningful, and well-crafted experiences that align business goals with user needs.\nAchievements & Highlights:\n- Lead Product Designer for ProjectInfo.io (https://projectinfo.io/) - an IT Field Management SAAS web application (Web/Mobile).\n- Lead Product Designer for a B2B/B2C software development/consulting company, working collaboratively with distributed product teams, helping to craft user & data driven, visually engaging designs.\n\nThroughout my career, I have successfully collaborated with cross-functional teams to deliver user-centric designs ranging from simple informational websites, mobile apps to complex SAAS solutions for companies and business enterprises that balance aesthetics with functionality. My background in product management has equipped me with a deep understanding of aligning design solutions with business goals and user needs, while my experience in UX design allows me to create interfaces that are not only visually appealing but also highly usable.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss on how my skills and experience can aid the Tobams Group team in creating intuitive, impactful designs that serve both users and organizational goals.\n",https://adesholabello.vzy.io/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733843005157_Adeshola Bello Resume 2024 (Updated1).pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T15:03:28.032Z,2024-12-10T15:03:28.032Z,,,,,,,,,
