6758619fb42680749337cd1f,Owoade Adekola Adeleke,+2348114142209,owoadekola95@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dynamic Product Designer with over 4 years of experience orchestrating user-centered digital solutions that seamlessly \r\nblend functionality and aesthetic appeal. Recognized for cultivating collaborative partnerships with clients to unveil their \r\nunique visions, delivering innovative design solutions that consistently surpass expectations. A strategic UI/UX Product \r\nOwner with a proven ability to spearhead design projects from ideation to execution, contributing to the evolution of \r\ndesign systems. Committed to crafting intuitive user experiences that amplify customer acquisition and retention, while \r\nremaining attuned to the latest industry trends and best practices. Eager to leverage expertise to ignite innovation and \r\nelevate user satisfaction within a fast-paced, collaborative environment.",https://zaap.bio/Adekolaleke,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733845403582_Screenshot_20241210_164029.jpg,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T15:43:27.983Z,2024-12-10T15:43:27.983Z,,,,,,,,,
67586939b42680749337cd29,Ikechi Anwar Ibiam,+2349071666241,ianwaribiam@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a passionate designer dedicated to building engaging digital experiences that seamlessly blend aesthetics with functionality.\nWith over 4 years experience in UI/UX design, branding, creative design and website design, I transform ideas into visually impactful and user-centric solutions that leave a lasting impression. My journey cuts across diverse industries, from real estate and fintech to e-commerce and the creative arts, showcasing my ability to adapt and deliver exceptional results.",https://read.cv/anwaribiam,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733847350695_Anwar CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T16:15:53.516Z,2024-12-10T16:15:53.516Z,,,,,,,,,
675875e9b42680749337cd41,Rabiat Ejura Ojotu,+2347039183488,rabiatojotu@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a passionate UI/UX designer with a strong focus on creating user-centered designs that solve real-world problems. Over the past few years, I’ve developed expertise in designing intuitive interfaces and improving user experiences for digital products. My journey began with a keen interest in understanding user behaviors, which I’ve honed through designing fintech applications, including savings and investment platforms.\n\nIn addition to my technical skills, I thrive on collaborating with cross-functional teams to translate ideas into meaningful designs. I’m proficient in tools like Figma and Adobe XD and have a solid grasp of design principles, wireframing, and prototyping.\n\nBeyond my professional skills, I enjoy exploring how design can drive innovation and accessibility. My ultimate goal is to create designs that resonate with users and meet business objectives. I am excited about contributing to projects that challenge me to grow and make a difference.",https://be.net/ojoturabiat,"https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733850598552_Rabiat's New UI_UX Design, HTML CSS CV.pdf",67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T17:10:01.287Z,2024-12-10T17:10:01.287Z,,,,,,,,,
67587bfcb42680749337cd4f,Adeka Solomon,+23407031090243,adex9000@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello, My name is Adeka Solomon, and I want to be part of your company's future.\n\nI am a dynamic, results-driven senior executive with over 10 years of broad-based, progressive experience in Marketing, Sales, and Branding. Effective combination of creative and analytical leadership skills that drive revenue, and increase profit margins and shareholder value. Adept at developing and maintaining strategic partnerships to advance brand awareness, product acquisition, and customer loyalty. The results-oriented and well-rounded leader with creative approaches to resolving complex issues.\n\nSpecialties: Strategy, Brand Building, Event Activations, Advertising Campaign Development, Product/Project Management.\n-\nHelping brands speak to the world through big ideas to captivate big audiences.\n\nI would love to schedule a meeting where I intend to share how my skills can improve and better your company in the future.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733852153344_CV Adeka Solomon.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T17:35:56.174Z,2024-12-10T17:35:56.174Z,,,,,,,,,
675880b0b42680749337cd5d,David Olanrewaju,+23407038155651,davidolanrewaju001@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a versatile user interface designer who prioritizes user pain and frustration to create user-friendly and responsive designs. I understand the importance of research, wireframes, and a design system for every proposed design. I have engaged in two projects, ""Plan-plus"" and ""Artisans hub."" The idea behind this project emanated from empathy for the working class and artisans.","www.behance.net/ultimate001,  https://www.figma.com/design/AehQcrN1GRHdzT3EtuG1l9/MY-PROJECT?node-id=704-4&t=oH25eVZCarWnkQKA-1,  https://www.figma.com/design/NVXpKPTLmFfU0Rj9pF42Fc/Arrhubs?node-id=0-1&t=xbcuymoqgVvdckjJ-1",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733853357852_AKIN-OLANREWAJU00-DESIGNdocx.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T17:56:00.714Z,2024-12-10T17:56:00.714Z,,,,,,,,,
675883e4b42680749337cd66,Rihanat Sulaiman,+23409169225344,Sulaimanrihanat77@gmail.com,Nigeria,"highly skilled Product Designer with 18 months of experience creating user-centric products that seamlessly align with business objectives. Adept at turning innovative ideas into functional, impactful solutions, looking forward to partnering extensively with startups to design MVPs and bring visionary concepts to life.\n\nMy design process is deeply rooted in user research, wireframing, and iterative prototyping, ensuring every product delivers measurable results. Proficient in tools like Figma and Adobe Creative Suite.\n\nWith a passion for crafting designs that not only solve problems but also elevate user experiences, I thrive on creating innovative interfaces that leave a lasting impression. I am constantly exploring emerging trends to push the boundaries of design and deliver transformative results for both users and businesses.",https://www.behance.net/rihanat,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733854177859_Resume .pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T18:09:40.383Z,2024-12-10T18:09:40.383Z,,,,,,,,,
