675888ffb42680749337cd87,Oluwasijibomi Olaifa,+2347012645748,therealsiji@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Oluwasijibomi is a product designer with over 3 years of experience in crafting\nintuitive and engaging experiences across fintech, e-commerce, Saas, edtech and\naggrotech industry for B2B and B2C users. I leverage on user research, design\nthinking, and strong ux skills to translate complex ideas into user friendly solutions\nthat drive business growth.\nWith a strong focus on user-centered design, I strive to bridge the gap between\nbusiness goals and user needs, delivering products that drive user engagement and\nbusiness growth.",https://therealsiji.framer.website/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733855484945_Oluwasijibomi's CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T18:31:27.842Z,2024-12-10T18:31:27.842Z,,,,,,,,,
67588ae1b42680749337cd8f,Onugu Lilian Chidera,+2348148151697,onugulilian@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Onugu Lilian Chidera, a product designer with a background in Banking and Finance and a passion for creating user-centered solutions. My journey into product design stems from my desire to merge analytical problem-solving with creativity to improve user experiences.\n\nOver the past two years, I’ve honed my design skills by working on diverse projects, collaboration is at the heart of my approach. I thrive in cross-functional teams, working closely with developers and stakeholders to translate complex requirements into functional, visually appealing designs. My proficiency with tools like Figma and my dedication to understanding user needs enable me to deliver impactful solutions that align with business goals.\n\nWhat drives me is the ability to solve real-life problems through design. I am excited about the opportunity to bring my creativity, attention to detail, and user-first mindset to your team, contributing to projects that make a difference.\n\n",https://www.behance.net/onugulilian,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733855966027_Onugu Lilian Resume current 2.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T18:39:29.474Z,2024-12-10T18:39:29.474Z,,,,,,,,,
67589728b42680749337cd98,Samuel Oyegun,+2348066794499,sam.oyegun@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a passionate product designer and aspiring product manager with over 1.5 years of experience crafting user-centered digital solutions. My career is rooted in a solid foundation in design principles, honed through practical experience and specialized learning. Courses like the Fintech Innovations Specialization by the University of Michigan and AI for Designers by the Interaction Design Foundation have significantly influenced my approach to solving complex problems with innovative, human-centered solutions. This unique blend of disciplines fuels my ability to design with both creativity and strategy.\n\nMy expertise spans designing government platforms like treasury single account systems for financial transparency, content management systems for dynamic blogs, and e-commerce solutions for startups. I thrive in cross-functional teams, where I contribute to building intuitive dashboards, revamping user experiences, and creating administrative tools that empower users.\n\nBeyond my technical skills, I excel at collaboration and communication, which I leverage to foster synergy across teams. Currently, I am spearheading initiatives to improve team culture and processes, drawing insights from seasoned leaders with decades of industry experience.\n\nI am also deeply passionate about mentorship and education. I aspire to teach UX design to young learners, making it accessible and inspiring for the next generation of designers.\n\nThrough my work, I strive to create solutions that are not only functional and secure but also innovative and impactful.\n\n",https://even-star-820.notion.site/Samuel-Oluwatamilore-Oyegun-121685a0b6578093a9c1faadc92e63c0,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1733859109986_Samuel Oyegun CV.pdf,67532398bec98bc52ebb81d7,Product Designer,2024-12-10T19:31:52.589Z,2024-12-10T19:31:52.589Z,,,,,,,,,
