676fedddfcb7634fce7f47fc,Mkpuma Jonathan Onyekachi,+23409166750338,jonathanmkpuma4@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\n\nI am a passionate and dedicated front-end developer specializing in ReactJS, TailwindCSS, and JavaScript. Over the past few months, I have successfully worked on several projects, building dynamic and responsive web applications that balance functionality with elegant design. My hands-on experience includes creating user-centric interfaces and ensuring a seamless user experience.\n\nRecently, I completed a freelance gig where I had the opportunity to apply my skills in a professional setting, delivering a project that met the client’s expectations. This experience helped me strengthen my problem-solving abilities and taught me the importance of meeting deadlines in a fast-paced environment.\n\nOne of my key strengths is effective communication with teammates. I enjoy collaborating in a team, ensuring that ideas are clearly expressed and that everyone is aligned toward a common goal. I thrive in environments where feedback and collaboration are encouraged, as I believe they are essential for continuous growth.\n\nI am eager to bring my technical skills, creativity, and collaborative mindset to this internship and contribute meaningfully to the team.",https://my-portfolio-pink-ten-66.vercel.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1735388634387_My Resume Final.pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2024-12-28T12:23:57.133Z,2024-12-28T12:23:57.133Z,,,,,,,,,
