677a654e76e2ceead6592ad7,Tolulope I Ajayi,+23408168218169,ajayitolu2019@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an accomplished HR and Learning & Development professional with over eight years of experience in human capital management, training, and operations. Currently serving as a Learning & Development Coordinator at Wragby Business Solutions, I have excelled in optimizing training programs, enhancing employee performance, and implementing efficient systems such as LMS and ERP.\n\nI hold a BA in History and International Relations, am pursuing an MSc in Industrial/Managerial Psychology, and have certifications in performance management, SAP, and critical thinking. Known for strategic planning, policy formulation, and fostering inclusive workplace cultures, I combine creativity with tactical execution to drive organizational success.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736074572023_Tolulope Ajayi Cv (L&D Updated Dec-24).pdf,6779024e76e2ceead659295a,Career Development Consultant,2025-01-05T10:56:14.980Z,2025-01-05T10:56:14.980Z,,,,,,,,,
