677a7a9876e2ceead6592b0b,Ruth Toyo Akan ,+2349122955107,topeakan@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Ruth Toyo Akan. I am a graduate of Zoology and Environmental Biology. I am a team player, pay attention to details, possess good communication, interpersonal and organizational skills. \nI love to write, travel and meet new people.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736080021598_Ruth's CV.docx,6779024e76e2ceead659295a,Career Development Consultant,2025-01-05T12:27:04.078Z,2025-01-05T12:27:04.078Z,,,,,,,,,
677a7b5b76e2ceead6592b1c,Nicole,+27786907200,nicolerenetiawilliams@gmail.com,South Africa,"With a passion for creative design and a strong commitment to driving positive change in the creative space, I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to your team and help communicate your impactful messages to the world.\n\nThroughout my career, I have been driven by the belief that design can be a powerful catalyst for change. As a graphic designer with over 9 years of experience, I have honed my skills in creating visually compelling and effective designs for a diverse range of clients and projects. From branding and marketing materials to digital media and social campaigns, my work has consistently aimed to inspire, engage, and drive action.\n\nAt previous companies that I've worked at such as Cape Union Mart, I had the opportunity to work on several campaigns that focused on sustainability.  These projects not only allowed me to develop my design skills but also reinforced my belief in the power of design to influence positive change. I am confident that my experience in retail and graphic design, combined with my dedication to meaningful work, make me a strong fit for this role.",https://www.behance.net/NickyBee,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736080216828_Nicole Williams Resume.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-05T12:30:19.882Z,2025-01-05T12:30:19.882Z,,,,,,,,,
