677a7c3076e2ceead6592b2e,Ekene Joseph Njemanze ,+2348147342822,romanze.en@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Joseph, a graphic designer with 5 years of experience in creating visual concepts for both digital and print media. My expertise includes working with industry-standard tools like Photoshop, CorelDraw, Illustrator, and Canva. Over the years, I’ve had the opportunity to work on a variety of projects ranging from branding, marketing materials, and social media graphics to complex illustrations and photo manipulations.",https://www.behance.net/romanjosephh,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736080429741_Roman Resume Revamp.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-05T12:33:52.548Z,2025-01-05T12:33:52.548Z,,,,,,,,,
677a7c8476e2ceead6592b36,DUNKWU WILLIAMS,+2349137536460,dunkwuwilliams@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I like to think of myself as a visual storyteller who uses design to transform abstract ideas into tangible experiences. My journey in graphic design started not with software, but with a curiosity about how visuals influence emotions, decisions, and even culture. Over the years, I’ve honed my ability to take a blank canvas and turn it into a masterpiece that communicates, inspires, and connects.\n\nFrom crafting minimalist logos that speak volumes to designing immersive event posters with a retro flair, I thrive on creating pieces that linger in the mind long after they’re seen. My approach is part art, part strategy—I believe great design isn’t just about how it looks but how it works.\n\nWhen I’m not at my desk experimenting with typography or color palettes, you might find me drawing inspiration from unlikely sources—an old movie, street graffiti, or even the rhythm of a song. I’m drawn to challenges, especially when they involve bringing unconventional ideas to life.\n\nGraphic design, for me, is more than a career. It’s how I make sense of the world and how I contribute to it. I’m here because I want to create more—more impact, more beauty, and more stories that leave an impression. I look forward to the chance to bring that energy to your team.",https://www.instagram.com/rivegraphics?igsh=cXAxYjFleHV3MzJh,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736080513470_Dunkwu Williams Resume.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-05T12:35:16.023Z,2025-01-05T12:35:16.023Z,,,,,,,,,
677a7c9a76e2ceead6592b3e,Stowe Rapheal,+23409061539995,stoweadebayo@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I've worked as a creative in the marketing field for more than a decade. My resume includes photography and graphic design work for local, national and international companies in several industries. My experience as a Graphic Designer has helped me develop my communication skills, learn how to cater my work to different clients \n\n I'm looking to collaborate with a team of other creatives in an established agency setting. I have experience working with the Adobe Creative Cloud Suite, managing ongoing creative campaigns for multiple brands and developing comprehensive brand guidelines. Throughout my career as a Graphic Designer, I've demonstrated my capabilities in each of these areas by:\n\nMaintaining my Adobe Certified Associate in Graphic Design and Illustration credential for the last eight years\n\nWorking on an average of seven client campaigns at a time as a freelance Graphic Designer\n\nCreating holistic branding guidelines and marketing campaigns for clients in the healthcare, entertainment, food and consumer goods industries\n\nAs you can tell from these accomplishments, I'm passionate about developing my creative skill set and providing my clients with a wonderful experience. I also pride myself on maintaining a professional demeanour and responding to clients in a timely manner. Thank you for taking the time to review my application materials. I am excited to hear from you and learn more about this opportunity.",https://heyzine.com/flip-book/248c0a2d42.html,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736080534801_Stowe Resume.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-05T12:35:38.279Z,2025-01-05T12:35:38.279Z,,,,,,,,,
677a7cae76e2ceead6592b46,Samuel Umoh George ,+2349034401340,Samuelgeorge967@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"“I’m a graphic designer with over five years of experience specializing in branding, packaging, motion graphics, and video editing. I’ve worked with major companies like Jubilee Syringes Manufacturing Company and CrowdPharm, delivering impactful designs that drive brand visibility and growth.\n\nAt Jubilee Syringes, I created branding materials that strengthened their market presence and improved customer recognition. For CrowdPharm, I contributed to global marketing campaigns by developing visuals that effectively connected with diverse audiences. My work consistently focuses on creating compelling designs that resonate with target markets and achieve measurable results.”",https://samgeo.netlify.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736080555203_Creative Designer - Samuel George .pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-05T12:35:58.361Z,2025-01-05T12:35:58.361Z,,,,,,,,,
677a7d7876e2ceead6592b55,David Omotayo ,+2347069684494,Davidmotayo01@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\n\nHi, I’m David.\nA designer who loves turning ideas into visuals that connect and inspire. \nWith a knack for detail and a passion for creative storytelling.\n\nI specialize in crafting designs that are not just eye-catching but meaningful. Whether it’s branding, digital design, or problem-solving through visuals, I’m all about making ideas stand out. I’d love to bring this energy to your team!\n\n",https://bit.ly/Davidcityport,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736080756670_MY CV NEW.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-05T12:39:20.210Z,2025-01-05T12:39:20.210Z,,,,,,,,,
