677a7eab76e2ceead6592b70,Isah lawal,+2348029890662,isahlawal030@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As a graphic and web designer, I specialize in creating visually appealing and user-friendly designs tailored to meet client needs. My expertise includes crafting unique graphics for branding, logos, and marketing materials, as well as designing and developing responsive and functional websites. I use tools like Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, XD) and WordPress to bring concepts to life.\n\nWith a strong focus on UX/UI design, I ensure that my work not only looks great but also delivers an exceptional user experience. My passion lies in blending creativity with technology to help businesses establish a strong digital presence. Additionally, I provide support for social media graphics, e-commerce websites, and other digital marketing solutions.\n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736081063756_MYRESUME_NEW 2.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-05T12:44:27.780Z,2025-01-05T12:44:27.780Z,,,,,,,,,
