677a825076e2ceead6592bb5,Armstrong Nomamiukor,+23409052550532,armstrongnomamiukor@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an ambitious, hardworking and responsible creative. As my journey continues, there is room to continue adding to my already existing chunk of knowledge in creative design. \n\nMy journey started really tough as a graphic designer trying to deliver, trying to impress and yet understand how design can be a problem solver. Gradually I shaped myself into not just a great creative but one with good moral ethics and discipline. One who leads team members by example. \n\nMy responsibilities for most part demanded the need for proper research, collaborating with different departments to come up with amazing ideas from which visuals are created. \n\nI have successfully worked on and co-managed numerous global brands and local brands as well. Some includes Coca-Cola, Chivita, Google, Betking, Colgate, AXE, Amstel, Maltina, Fayrouz, Budweiser, Sterling Bank, Dove, Nivea and many more.",https://www.behance.net/armienorman,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736081997159_Armstron Nomamiukor CV_24.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-05T13:00:00.106Z,2025-01-05T13:00:00.106Z,,,,,,,,,
677a827a76e2ceead6592bbd,Owele Oreoluwa Oluwasegun,+2348105797401,segunowele@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring manager\n\nMy name is Oreoluwa Segun Owele. I am a Graphic designer with a strong background in Typography, and visualization. I have proficiency with the use of Adobe creative suites, Coreldraw, Generative Ai and video editing softwares.\n\nI have had experience with social media design, Amazon KDP works, book cover designs and promotional media designs. My experience spans nearly a decade.\n\nI had my education in Web Design Development in 2009, furthermore, I bagged a Diploma in Graphic Design in 2010. In 2024, I was awarded a certification in Project Management Essentials at Howard University, UK.\n\nWith these strong skills, education and years of experience, I am confident I am a great fit for this role. \n\nKindly find attached to this application my CV and portfolio. I look forward to hearing from you.\n\nBest regards,\nOreoluwa\n",https://www.instagram.com/manifestearnest?igsh=aDFmZWFuYmgxYmds&utm_source=qr,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736082038943_Graphic Design CV OWELE.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-05T13:00:42.154Z,2025-01-05T13:00:42.154Z,,,,,,,,,
