677a94c376e2ceead6592c8d,Israel Olamide Adebayo,+23409060124177,adebayoisraelolamide@gmail.com,Nigeria,"With over six years of experience in graphic design and a strong passion for visual storytelling, I bring a unique blend of creativity and technical expertise to every project I undertake.\nDuring my career, I have successfully worked on over 5,000 different projects and collaborated with diverse teams to deliver high-quality designs that align with client objectives. My proficiency in tools such as Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator and Premiere Pro) combined with my ability to conceptualize and execute innovative designs, has enabled me to consistently exceed expectations.\nMore recently, I had the opportunity to steer the creative direction of an emerging tech startup from branding up until launch. I also had the opportunity to master taking initiative for myself, thinking on my feet and ultimately, working with a team. \nThroughout my career, I have developed expertise in a wide range of design areas, including branding, digital marketing assets, print media and many more. I have demonstrated this expertise through serving individuals, small businesses and corporate institutions both within Nigeria and outside Nigeria. All of my experiences have honed my ability to translate complex ideas into compelling visuals while managing deadlines.\n",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1U0ZBvqwNujz_6tyRENXVu0AcZFig1oUJ/view?usp=drive_link,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736086689207_ISRAEL ADEBAYO CV.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-05T14:18:43.006Z,2025-01-05T14:18:43.006Z,,,,,,,,,
