677a9f0076e2ceead6592cf4,Solomon Yomi,+233598697229,thewisek.gh@gmail.com,Ghana,"With over 13 years of experience as a Graphics Designer, Social Media Manager, Website Designer, and IT Expert, I bring a wealth of knowledge and skills to this role. \n\nMy approach centers on staying up to date with industry trends to deliver high-quality, innovative designs that resonate with both the audience and the brand’s identity. I take pride in understanding my clients’ visions and objectives, translating them into creative, practical designs that not only look great but also effectively meet their goals.\n\nMy expertise spans across various software and technologies, which I have used to create impressive designs, manage social media platforms, and build responsive websites. \n\nMy technical proficiency includes:\nAdobe Photoshop\nAdobe Illustrator\nAdobe InDesign\nFigma\nCanva\nCorelDraw\nAdobe XD (UX/UI Design)\nCapCut (Video Editing Software)\nHTML5 and CSS3\nBootStrap5\nAdobe Dreamweaver\nWordPress\n\nThese tools have enabled me to develop engaging graphics and content for social media, banners, flyers, and other designs, as well as design and maintain both static and dynamic websites.",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1T2AFvQUSaK_LZl-gu69bd7NaG1CXQHsn/view?usp=drivesdk,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736089341711_Resume Yomi Solomon_20241120_074121_0000_compressed-compressed-compressed.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-05T15:02:24.481Z,2025-01-05T15:02:24.481Z,,,,,,,,,
677aa0b876e2ceead6592d06,Isaac Adejuwon,+2348108806808,ioadejuwon@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Iam a creative designer, I work well with both static and motion design. I am also a video editor. \n\nI  am a dynamic designer and branding enthusiast, I am passionate about showcasing the transformative power of design.\n\nOver the past six years, I’ve delivered impactful design solutions across freelance, part-time, and full-time roles.\n\nI am known for my excellent communication, rapid learning, and time management skills, I bring a strategic mindset to every project. I’m driven by a commitment to quality, always focusing on the bigger picture while navigating the details. A natural leader and team player, I am dedicated to fostering environments where collaboration, creativity, and growth can thrive.",https://zurnergymedia.notion.site,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736089780591_Adejuwon Isaac - Curriculum Vitae.pdf.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-05T15:09:44.778Z,2025-01-05T15:09:44.778Z,,,,,,,,,
677aa14c76e2ceead6592d0e,Emeka Offor,+23408180661107,Emeofor@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nI am a corporate leader with a focus on providing sustainable solutions to business and development challenges and achieving targeted results by optimising human and material resources. I have a Bachelors Degree with First Class Honours and postgraduate degrees in Business Administration MBA , an  M.Sc in Corporate Governance from Leeds Beckett University United Kingdom., and a  Doctorate Degree in Business Administration (DBA). I am a full member of the Chartered institute of Personnel Management,  a Licensed Human Resource Practitioner, and a trainer licensed by the National Council of Management Development, Nigeria.. I also hold other professional qualifications including being  a Fellow of the Society of Project Management and Development Professionals International, as well as a Fellow of National Institute of Credit Administration. I am an alumni of National Institute for Policy and Strategic Studies, as well as an alumni of the United Nation's Multilateral Trade Negotiation Programme, and the World Bank's Financing For Development Programme.  Those academic and professional qualifications have prepared and equipped me with required knowledge and competences to excel in this role.\nMy practice and experience in both the private and public sectors spanning over 28 years have also equipped me with the capacity and skills to achieve leadership goals and managerial efficiency on a sustainable basis. These include leadership roles in Nigeria in Investment promotion, Facilitation and Bilateral and Multilateral Investment treaties negotiation, African Continental Free Trade Agreement, Social Insurance initiatives, banking and finance. I led, represented and signed treaties on behalf of Nigeria and participated at some IISD events. I am conversant with IISD and United Nations/World Bank structures.\nAs a director of Strategic Communications, Investment Promotion, Incentives Administration, Facilitation and Policy Advocacy, at various times, I  contributed immensely to national development.  I coordinated the Direct Investors Summit Nigeria as well as several other high  level events in several locations accross the globe. Some of these events were attended by Presidents of countries. I led the team that developed the National Policy on Incentivizing the healthcare sector in Nigeria, and was a member of the technical working group that articulated Nigeria's National Development Plan 2021-2025. I was also a member of the National Action Committee on the implementation of the African Continental Free Trade Agreement (AFCFTA) and member of the Nigerian Presidential Committee on Fiscal Policy and Tax Reforms. \nIn view of the above. I am happy to forward my application for this position with every sense of responsibility. I am available to discuss further on how I can be among those to lead the team in your organisation to achieve its goals and objectives.\n\nDr. Emeka R. Offor",http://www.linkedin.com/in/EmekaOffor,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736089929273_DR EMEKA R OFFOR - CV.pdf.pdf,6779024e76e2ceead659295a,Career Development Consultant,2025-01-05T15:12:12.908Z,2025-01-05T15:12:12.908Z,,,,,,,,,
