677aa43d76e2ceead6592d2a,Michael Jack ,+2348108786294,jackmicheal75@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a passionate Graphics and UI/UX Designer who loves creating eye-catching and user-friendly designs! With experience in tools like Adobe Creative Suite, Figma, and Anima, I focus on crafting smooth digital experiences that meet both user needs and business goals. I have a solid grounding in design principles and I enjoy collaborating with others to produce work that's not just creative, but truly makes a difference. My aim is to help brands connect with their audiences through engaging and meaningful visuals that resonate!",https://www.behance.net/jackmicheal2,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736090682486_Michael J. resume GD.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-05T15:24:45.496Z,2025-01-05T15:24:45.496Z,,,,,,,,,
