677adf1576e2ceead6592efa,Ibrahim Waziri Abubakar,+2348144433700,ibrahimwaziriqbubakar@outlook.com,Nigeria,"I am a highly creative and detail-oriented graphic designer with 5 years of experience in the industry. I am proficient in Adobe Creative Suite, including Photoshop, Illustrator, and video editing. Throughout my career, I have collaborated with clients to develop and execute design concepts for various projects. I have created visual designs for websites, social media campaigns, and print materials, and have consistently met project deadlines while ensuring the highest quality of work. With excellent communication and teamwork skills, I am able to work effectively with cross-functional teams to deliver successful projects that meet the needs of the client.",https://www.behance.net/ibrahimwaziri1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736105743912_Ibrahim_Waziri_Abubakar_Resume.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-05T19:35:49.034Z,2025-01-05T19:35:49.034Z,,,,,,,,,
677ae2e876e2ceead6592f11,Victor Adetona,+23409027452317,adetona937@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Victor Adetona and I am a Brand Designer that help brands scale in a competitive market through Design and Strategy. I am a passionate designer who loves creating unique, meaningful, and visually striking designs. I believe great design tells a story, connects people, and makes a lasting impact and that’s what I strive for in every project I take on. Whether it’s working on branding, graphic design, editorials, presentation, communication designs or awareness campaigns, I enjoy blending creativity with strategy to deliver work that feels both beautiful and purposeful.\n\nBeyond design, I’m someone who’s always learning and looking for new ways to grow, both personally and professionally. I have experience in aviation revenue systems, where I’ve learned how design and data-driven solutions can make a difference. For me, design is not just a job; it’s how I connect, inspire, and create positive experiences in the world around me.\n\nWhen I’m not working, I value spending time with people I care about and drawing inspiration from everyday moments. I love watching movies and Animes, Reading mangas, Playing games and  travelling\n\n",https://bit.ly/Victoradetona,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736106726139_Resume of Victor Adetona 2024.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-05T19:52:08.734Z,2025-01-05T19:52:08.734Z,,,,,,,,,
