677b750976e2ceead6593132,Habeeb Mohammed ,+2348133185587,habeebmohammed9988@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Team,\n\nI am writing to express my interest in the Graphics Designer position at your organization as advertised. With a solid background in graphic design and a proven track record of delivering creative and innovative solutions, I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to your team.\n\nCurrently, I am serving as the Regional Graphics Designer at the International Forestry Student Association in Germany. In this role, I have successfully created numerous designs for coffee hour meetings and IFSA events.  Also created 350+ graphics, logo and brand identity designs for various brands and organizations. My dedication to excellence and innovation in design has been recognized through several accolades during my university days, including:\n\nMost Creative Male Student (IFSA)\nMost Innovative Male (NAAS Graduands Class’21)\nMale Entrepreneur of the Year (NAAS Graduands Class ’21)\nI am proficient in various graphic design tools and techniques, and my specific skill set aligns perfectly with the requirements of the role at your company. I am confident that my experience, creativity, and passion for graphic design will enable me to make a significant contribution to your team.\n\nI have attached my CV and the link to my portfolio below for your review. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my background, skills, and certifications can be in line with the needs and goals of your team. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nYours sincerely,\n\nHabeeb Mohammed.",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-YA0VXqi8OGLDz5foAIdZQqYn4eYkeZK,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736144133855_HABEEB MOHAMMED Graphics CV.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-06T06:15:37.352Z,2025-01-06T06:15:37.352Z,,,,,,,,,
