677b7f9ce24b51d0d429fa98,Jahwin James James ,+2349132562700,jamesjahwin@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello from across the screen. \nI am Jahwin James, a graphic designer with an experience spanning almost two years. I am skilled in three aspects of designs at the moment, and will expand to more, which are: Social media designs, Poster designing and Web3 design. To assist my creation of designs, I am well versed in tools like Adobe Photoshop, Figma and Illustrator, Illustrator being a weak point I will turn into a strength. As the area of soft skills go, I believe myself to be an avid communicator, team collaborator, a stickler to deadlines, a problem solver (which I believe is the main aim of any design, really), creative and flexible in my approach, all skills that have helped me in my journey.\nI have served in various capacities especially of note, E-vast Marketing agency.  Why this is especially of note is the fact that during my time under E-Vast, we have undertaken several projects such as Polystar Ogba (Electronics Industry), Vast Place (Electronics Industry), Csika (E-commerce Industry), QubicBox (Tech Industry) of which I have had the honour to be the lead designer and complete these projects alongside the team. It highlights the variety of my experience and expertise and those soft skills I listed as these projects demand and demanded them and shows that I know what designs can market a brand and I hope I can do that with Tobams Group. \nOne of the aims of Tobams Group is to show other brands that it is the go to place for tech talents through its training and development programmes and to show this effectively, it needs standout designs that speak that. Through my knowledge of typography, layouts, marketing and industry standard tools like Adobe Photoshop and Figma (through my time at Bloquest), I believe I am the man for the job and I hope to hear back from you.\nThank you for reading this and for going through my application.",https://www.behance.net/jahwinjames,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736146841228_Jahwin's Resume_094105.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-06T07:00:44.102Z,2025-01-06T07:00:44.102Z,,,,,,,,,
