677b887d6aeecc1b06bd9174,Ayanboye Miracle ,+2347070659452,ayanboyeoluwadarasimi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Ayanboye Miracle, a passionate and experienced creative professional specializing in graphic design and video content creation. With over 5 years of experience in logo design, company profile design, brochure design, and social media designs, I have developed a strong ability to create visually compelling and impactful content.\n\nI also have more than 4 years of specialized experience in video content creation and editing. My skills in advanced editing, dynamic motion graphics, and seamless post-production help me produce captivating, high-quality video content that elevates brand presence and boosts viewer engagement.\n\nProficient in tools like Photoshop, After Effects, and Adobe Illustrator, I take pride in delivering designs that resonate with audiences. My work spans across various projects, including designing logos, T-shirts, menus, and more for diverse brands and companies. I'm committed to meeting tight deadlines and collaborating effectively with teams to bring creative visions to life.\n\n",https://www.behance.net/wellswhelzy,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736149114137_Resume.2.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-06T07:38:37.072Z,2025-01-06T07:38:37.072Z,,,,,,,,,
