677b8e5b6aeecc1b06bd91b5,Daemyong Makengo,+23408120819708,daemyongubc@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a passionate and versatile graphic designer with a keen eye for detail and a love for storytelling through visuals. My design philosophy is simple: every project should evoke emotion, communicate a message clearly, and leave a lasting impression.  \n\nI specialize in creating compelling designs that connect with diverse audiences, whether it’s through branding, social media graphics, packaging, or digital illustrations. Over the years, I’ve honed my skills in tools like Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign) and have embraced emerging technologies like AI-assisted design.  \n\nWhat sets me apart is my ability to combine creativity with strategy. I believe design is more than just making things look beautiful; it’s about solving problems and helping businesses achieve their goals. I’ve worked with startups, established brands, and entrepreneurs, crafting designs that stand out in a crowded market.  \n\nWhen I’m not designing, I love staying inspired by exploring art, keeping up with design trends, and learning about different cultures to bring a fresh perspective to my work. I’m always up for a creative challenge and thrive on collaborating with clients to bring their visions to life.  \n\nLet’s create something extraordinary together!",www.behance.net/daemyongprince,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736150616432_My Clean Professional CV Resume.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-06T08:03:39.369Z,2025-01-06T08:03:39.369Z,,,,,,,,,
