677b9a646aeecc1b06bd9268,OKEKE CHIDUBEM EMMANUEL ,+2347064553680,chidubememmanuelokeke04@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager at Tobams Group,\n\nI'm honored to introduce myself as Okeke Chidubem Emmanuel, a dedicated and passionate graphic designer with a strong foundation in visual communication. Born on November 4th, 1995, in Nigeria, I've grown to become a creative problem-solver with a keen eye for detail.\n\nAcademically, I hold a Higher National Diploma (HND) in Insurance with an Upper Credit result. Although my formal education was in Insurance, my true passion lies in graphic design, which I've pursued with enthusiasm and dedication.\n\nProfessionally, I've accumulated 5 years of experience in graphic design, working with various clients in the restaurant and shopping mall industries. My expertise spans logo design, branding, print materials and digital graphics. I'm proficient in Canva.\n\nIn addition to my graphic design experience, I've also had the opportunity to explore video editing, with a few months of experience under my belt. I'm excited to continue learning and growing in this area.\n\nAs a creative individual, I'm driven by a passion for innovation, simplicity, and effectiveness. I believe that good design should communicate a message clearly, evoke emotions, and inspire action.\n\nI'm thrilled about the opportunity to join Tobams Group as a Graphic Designer and contribute my skills and experience to the team. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to discussing my qualifications further.\n\nSincerely,\nOkeke Chidubem Emmanuel",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736153697150_OKEKE CHIDUBEM EMMANUEL RESUME....pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-06T08:55:00.203Z,2025-01-06T08:55:00.203Z,,,,,,,,,
