677b9d8f6aeecc1b06bd929a,Alaba Owolabi Lawal,+23408037551847,artdotgraphix@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Alaba Owolabi Lawal, and I am a professional graphic designer working as a freelancer. \n\nI began my graphic design journey at Zemano Press, where I worked as a graphic designer and page layout specialist. After that, I moved on to Business, Strategy & Communications (BSC). Initially, I was hired as a graphic designer, where I played a significant role in several advertising campaigns for LG Electronics, a press campaign for Champagne Home Theater, and branding and promotions for Suppy Seasonings, including outdoor advertising. & Promotionally\n\nI was later promoted to the position of Assistant Manager in the Creative Department. I held this role until I left the company to establish my creative studio, think24graphix now rebranded to ArtDot Graphix ",https://www.behance.net/think24graphix,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736154509130_my resume.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-06T09:08:31.998Z,2025-01-06T09:08:31.998Z,,,,,,,,,
