677bae6f6aeecc1b06bd9383,NATHANIEL OMAMOGHO,+23408022171457,namaniel@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a Nigerian citizen and a graduate of the University of Lagos, specializing in Art & Design. Over the past decade, I've developed a distinctive skill set as a Creative Director in both advertising and digital agencies, focusing on the intersection of brand strategy, creativity, and technology.\n\nMy approach combines strategic thinking with creative campaign execution and a deep understanding of systems to effectively tackle brand and business challenges. I am passionate about crafting culturally impactful and commercially successful brand experiences in today's digital age. I thrive on infusing innovation and data-driven insights into storytelling, imagining agencies and brands functioning with the agility typical of tech startups.\n\nThroughout my career, I've excelled in leadership positions within diverse teams, bridging the gap between digital and traditional creative disciplines. Whether leading integrated campaigns or fostering cross-functional collaboration, I prioritize nurturing a culture of curiosity, collaboration, and excellence.\n\nCurrently, I hold the role of Creative Director at Eat N Go, where I oversee creative initiatives spanning integrated, PR, and social projects for Domino's Pizza, Coldstone Creamery, and Pinkberry. Previously, I've contributed as a freelance Creative Director, managing key accounts, shaping strategies for integrated pitches and brand campaigns, and guiding teams through mobile app and innovation ventures.",https://namaniel.wixsite.com/my-site-4/portfolio,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736158829033_Nath Resume updated.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-06T10:20:31.928Z,2025-01-06T10:20:31.928Z,,,,,,,,,
