677bba2b6aeecc1b06bd9422,Emmanuel Olusola Adebisi,+23408100395178,princeniblemen@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Emmanuel Adebisi is a creative brand designer and UI/UX professional with over 7 years of experience in designing effective branding and marketing materials. He is skilled in collaborating with cross-functional teams, both onsite and remotely. As a freelancer, he has worked with 10 different brands, creating logos, color schemes, brand guidelines, flyers, banners, and mockups for visual representation, ensuring consistency across all marketing and branding materials.\nIn addition to his branding expertise, Emmanuel specializes in UI/UX design, focusing on user needs to create visually appealing and functional designs. He is experienced in crafting design solutions from low-fidelity wireframes to high-fidelity prototypes, ensuring intuitive and engaging user experiences. Emmanuel looks forward to contributing to business growth by leveraging his skills in both branding and user-centric design.\n",https://www.behance.net/emmanuelolusola,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736161831907_Emmanuel Adebisi O CV.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-06T11:10:35.671Z,2025-01-06T11:10:35.671Z,,,,,,,,,
