677bc75b6aeecc1b06bd9483,Augustine Evbokpiagharu ,+2347039262326,augustineevbokpiagharu@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am writing to express my interest in the Career Development Consultant position at Tobams Group. As a seasoned career development professional with over 7 years of experience, I am confident in my ability to design and deliver effective career development training programs for Nigerian university students.\n\nMy expertise lies in creating personalized career coaching experiences, developing strategic job search plans, and conducting interview preparation sessions. I have a deep understanding of the Nigerian labor market and have developed a keen insight into the career development needs of university students.\n\nAs a facilitator and trainer, I have designed and delivered numerous workshops and training programs focused on career development, employability skills, and personal branding. Notable examples include:\n\n- The 360 Degree Student Conference, which provided career development, entrepreneurship, and financial management training to over 300 students.\n- The Upgrade Workshop, a career development program that equipped over 150 undergraduate students with practical skills in resume building, job search strategies, and interview preparation.\n\nI am drawn to this role at Tobams Group because of the organization's commitment to empowering Nigerian university students with the skills and knowledge necessary to succeed in the workforce. I am excited about the prospect of collaborating with your team to design and deliver high-impact career development training programs.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss this position further and explore how my skills and experience align with the needs of Tobams Group.\n\nSincerely,\n\nAugustine Evbokpiagharu",https://bit.ly/CareerServicesWritingSamples,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736165208192_Augustine Evbokp