677c05546aeecc1b06bd9664,GODWIN OLOCHE ONDOMA,+2348036881500,gondoma87@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Professional Summary\nOndoma, Godwin Oloche is a very experienced graphic designer. He has worked in many organizations both local and international. He was the brain behind the famous Heart-to-Heart campaign (designs) of the Global HIV/AIDS Initiative Nigeria (GHAIN) – a project funded by the USAID and managed by FHI 360. He was the only Graphic Designer with FHI 360 Nigeria from 2005 to 2010. Most of the organization’s publications were done by him. This earned him the award of “Greatest Communications Outputs in Contribution to HIV/AIDS Services in Nigeria” in 2009. He is also an enthusiastic photographer. He covered many of FHI 360 events during the period. Mr. Ondoma is very vast in print and electronic productions. In the area of commercial printing and publishing, his expertise cuts across newspaper, magazine and book designs and production. While working with The Guardian newspapers, he was a very reliable member of the production team of The Guardian newspaper and Tthe Guardian Express (a daily and afternoon newspaper). Godwin Ondoma is also a Graphic Design Consultant to many international organizations namely, FHI360(SIDHAS; MAPS, C-Change) all funded by USAID; Research Triangle Institute (RTI) - Reading and Access Research Activity (RARA) project, funded by USAID; Mott McDonald Limited (ESSPIN): Teacher Development Programme (TDP) funded by UKaid; Achieving Health Initiative (AHNi) – RANA project; Mamaye!; Creative Associates International (NEIPLUS project), funded by USAID. He has also volunteered for the United Nations as a Graphic Designer Without Borders. He is a print vendor to many organizations too. He is the founder of GODDON Precise Concepts, Abuja, Nigeria; a professional branding, design and production outfit.",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GNN-uPumRuQHZdRTPNhmJrSV2jUwR_kA?usp=drive_link,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/u