677c09076aeecc1b06bd9684,Nnamdi Seedgreen Ihii,+23408103600482,doleeseedgreen@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello,\n\nI am Nnamdi Seedgreen Ihii and I saw your job ad on LinkedIn, and I am interested in the role.\n\nI am in the profession that aids you and your business to stand out in your industry. I ensure that your company's unique services and impact are clearly communicated and I do this through design. I have over half a decade's experience in graphic and brand identity design, working with brands in the Fintech Industry, Renewable energy, Marketing and Advertising, Hospitality and Real Estate.\n\nWith professional use of Adobe creative suites such as Photoshop, Illustrator, After Effects, and Figma, I contribute directly and indirectly to your company's conversions and dominance in her field of industry and effectively communicate the company's vision through visual storytelling.\n\nAttached are copies of my resume and portfolio for your review. Looking forward to your feedback.\n\nWarm regards, \nSeedgreen Ihii",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1i5Fs7-Vue2OI1gmqR5XNjMtcjQXKBu4J/view?usp=drive_link,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736182021069_Seedgreen Ihii CV new copy (1)_064858-0.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-06T16:47:03.554Z,2025-01-06T16:47:03.554Z,,,,,,,,,
677c0d086aeecc1b06bd9694,Ibim Victor Boma,+2348145748797,ibimi.v@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a passionate graphics and product designer specializing in creating intuitive and visually engaging designs for web applications and solution-driven platforms. With years of experience in international projects, I bring a unique perspective and a strong focus on design excellence. I’m a Top Rated Plus freelancer on Upwork, recognized for being in the top 3% of professionals in my field.\n\nI excel at crafting designs that merge functionality with aesthetic appeal, using tools like Figma and Adobe Creative Suite. My expertise spans wireframing, prototyping, creating user flows, and developing high-converting web designs. Recently, I’ve worked on emerging AI products and materials that drive product design growth.\n\nCollaboration and client satisfaction are at the core of my work. I pride myself on my ability to align with client needs while delivering innovative solutions. I look forward to bringing my skills to your team and contributing to impactful design projects.",https://www.behance.net/IbimVictor,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736183044980_CV.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-06T17:04:08.344Z,2025-01-06T17:04:08.344Z,,,,,,,,,
