677c4e9d6aeecc1b06bd979a,Praise Adekola ,+23408169982874,praisegraphics001@gmail.com,Nigeria,"**I make brands visually unforgettable""*\n \n**Adekola Ahmed - Graphic Designer**\n\nWith over 3 years of experience in graphic design, I am a passionate creative specializing in branding, illustration, sign-making, and mockups. My mission is to prioritize creativity and client collaboration, utilizing innovative ideas to develop captivating content that effectively connects with target audiences.\n\nThroughout my career, I have managed notable projects including the MTN Telecommunications Project, served as Brand Manager for logo and content creation at Guide Printers in Asaba, Delta State, and worked as a Graphics UI/UX Illustrator at CEAN Printing Press. These experiences have honed my ability to deliver high-impact visual solutions that drive business objectives.\n\nIn addition to my professional endeavors, I have a keen interest in content creation, brand management, and graphics analytics. I thrive on the excitement of playing soccer, enjoy singing, and love traveling to discover new cultures and perspectives.\n\nKnown for my dedicated work ethic, I am a goal-getter who values teamwork and embraces a fast-learning mindset. I am adaptable and focused on achieving tasks in the shortest possible time, delivering exceptional results with every project.",https://wa.me/c/2347037758646,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736199833847_ADEKOLA GRAPHICS C.V.....pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-06T21:43:57.214Z,2025-01-06T21:43:57.214Z,,,,,,,,,
