677c72c76aeecc1b06bd9817,INNOCENT OKOLO ONAH,+23408064850058,innocentokolo19@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Design is a powerful tool for communication, and I am passionate about using it to create meaningful connections between brands and their audiences. With a focus on innovation and quality, I deliver creative solutions that make a lasting impact.\n\nWhat I Bring to the Table:\nCreative Excellence: I blend creativity with precision to produce designs that are not only visually stunning but also effective in conveying your brand’s message. My approach is rooted in understanding your unique needs and translating them into compelling visual narratives.\n\nDiverse Design Capabilities: My skill set covers a broad range of design services, allowing me to provide comprehensive solutions for your business:\n\nBranding & Identity Design\nPrint & Digital Advertising Materials\nVector tracing \nCharacter illustration \nPackaging & Product Design\nIllustration design\nMockup design\nCertificate design\nLogos design \nCartoon illustration \nIndustry-Spanning Experience: I have had the privilege of working with clients across various industries, from startups to established enterprises. This experience has equipped me with the versatility to adapt to different markets and create designs that resonate with diverse audiences.\n\nClient-Centered Service: Your vision is at the heart of everything I do. I offer personalized service, working closely with you to understand your goals and deliver designs that exceed your expectations. I’m not satisfied until you are.\n\nInnovation Meets Efficiency: I am committed to staying ahead of design trends while ensuring that my work is grounded in timeless principles. I deliver innovative solutions that are both modern and enduring, all within your desired timeline.\n\nWhy Choose Me?\nInnovative Solutions: I bring fresh, creative ideas to every project, ensuring your brand stands out in the marketplace.\nOn-Time Delivery: I understand the importance of deadlines and am dedicated to delivering high-quality designs on schedule.\nProfessional Expertise: With years of experience, I provide a level of professionalism and skill that guarantees exceptional results.\nLet’s work together to create designs\n that not only capture attention but also drive real results for your business. Whether you need a complete brand overhaul or a specific design project, I’m ready to deliver exceptional quality and creativity......",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736209093268_innocent_Graphic_cv.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-07T00:18:15.939Z,2025-01-07T00:18:15.939Z,,,,,,,,,
677c8b066aeecc1b06bd9844,OLUOKUN SAMUEL TIMILEHIN,+2347061959765,oluokuntimilehinsamuel19@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As a graphic designer with 5 years of experience, I’m enthusiastic to apply for the creative graphic designer job posting. My collaboration experience, creative-thinking mindset, and graphic design skills align with your requirements perfectly.\n\nMy graphic design expertise will be your best ally to discover the best approach to represent ideas and concepts to work with marketing strategies. More works and design processes are included in the portfolio. Please don’t hesitate to take a look and reach out to discuss more design details.\n\nThank you for your time, and please review the attached resume for further details on my previous working experience. I would welcome an interview to elaborate on how I can work with your team to be a supportive member and valuable resource for your company.\n\n",https://www.linkedin.com/in/samuel-oluokun-772505236/overlay/1635527543177/single-media-viewer?type=DOCUMENT&profileId=ACoAADrOwgYBm_JhUSopFfACybz2H_L_i6PV0Ho&lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Ad_flagship3_profile_view_base%3BzAOaDEQmSRy9fJXP9yRs4A%3D%3D,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736215298682_my cv newww.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-07T02:01:42.238Z,2025-01-07T02:01:42.238Z,,,,,,,,,
677c8e366aeecc1b06bd984c,Joy Mumen,+23408079182902,joymumengraphic@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As a seasoned graphic designer with 4 years of experience, I've had the privilege of working remotely with social media agencies, tech startups, and collaborating with talented individuals to create innovative digital products. Notably, I volunteered my expertise in the rebranding of the Nigerian Army Drug Manufacturing Company, contributing to their successful repackaging of drug production. This experience not only honed my design skills but also deepened my understanding of brand transformation I'm a naturally curious and quietly confident designer, always looking to improve my skills one design problem at a time. I'm passionate about delivering high-quality designs that exceed expectations.",https://joymumenportfolio.vercel.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736216116228_Joy MUMEN RESUME (2).pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-07T02:15:18.931Z,2025-01-07T02:15:18.931Z,,,,,,,,,
677c90b06aeecc1b06bd9858,Jinadu boluwatife abdulgafar ,+2347052430774,jinaduboluhpf@gmail.com,Nigeria,"It is with passion and enthusiasm that I apply for the Graphic Designer position where I can leverage my creative expertise and passion for visual storytelling through images and designs to captivate audiences.\n\nAs a dedicated graphic designer with a drive for excellence, my years of experience in the field has culminated into a unique blend of artistic talent and technical proficiency to deliver impactful designs. With a strong foundation in graphic design principles, I am well-versed in Adobe Creative Suite, and digital design tools. My expertise includes logo design, image manipulation, social media content creation, branding, and visual design.\n\nOver the years of my career, I have amassed my skills in:\n\n- The psychology of consumer product development (Tai Solarin University of Education)\n- Logo design and branding (Akin Noble Ventures)\n- Image editing and manipulation (using Adobe Creative Suite)\n- Social media content creation (Markay Health Consult)\n- Visual design and creative solutions (Akin Noble Ventures) amongst a host of other valuable graphic design skills.\n\nMy collaborative team playing spirit with excellent communication skills have helped me to successfully work with multidisciplinary teams, meeting tight deadlines and exceeding client expectations. My experience in mentoring and guiding junior designers has refined my leadership and problem-solving abilities.\n\nAt Markay Health Consult, I developed carousel designs, promotional flyers, and digital displays, ensuring compliance with brand guidelines. At Akin Noble Ventures, I designed print materials, coordinated with vendors, and mentored junior designers.\n\nI am excited to bring my skills and passion to creating engaging visual content that resonates with audiences and delivering exceptional clients engagement aligned with the organisation's branding. \n\nThank you for considering my application. It will be a pleasure to hear from you soon as I look forward to being a part of the organisation.",https://drive.google.com/file/d/15ZH92Er8HZsg_vj2CM8tBDp2zxYHjuCa/view?usp=drivesdk,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736216750008_Boluwatife resume.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-07T02:25:52.581Z,2025-01-07T02:25:52.581Z,,,,,,,,,
677ca7ac6aeecc1b06bd9865,Emmanuel Ogbu,+2349075749768,emmanuelogbu251@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Emmanuel Ogbu, a creative graphic designer, sound engineer and a video editor with over 10 years of work experience. I'm a team player with a strong ability to work under pressure I hold a degree in Chemistry but with vast knowledge on computer and communications.",https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100070065707333&mibextid=ZbWKwL,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736222633500_CV designed.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-07T04:03:56.077Z,2025-01-07T04:03:56.077Z,,,,,,,,,
677ca8b76aeecc1b06bd986d,Ndukwe Victor ,+2349013959503,Ndukwevictorkelechi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a graphic designer with a keen eye for details, a dedication to perfection and ability to create visually compelling contents for you. With a passion for bold, modern, and minimalist design, I specialize in branding, captivating flyers and posters, logos, and print design for social media brands and digital startups. Over the past five years, I've had the privilege of working with over 40 brands and small-scale businesses, delivering high-impact designs that resonate with their target audiences.\n\nFrom crafting memorable logos and book covers that drive sales, to designing T-shirts for Talstrike and Stanfits Studios, my work combines creativity with precision. I take pride in offering top value for money and delivering results that satisfy my clients 99% of the time. Whether you're looking to elevate your brand or create visually compelling content, I bring a keen eye for detail and a dedication to perfection.\n\nLet’s create something exceptional together.\n\n",https://creativkc.my.canva.site/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736222900770_Ndukwe Victor CV New.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-07T04:08:23.297Z,2025-01-07T04:08:23.297Z,,,,,,,,,
