677cc8406aeecc1b06bd98a0,Abdul-Martin Faloye ,+2349153824049,abdulmartinfaloye@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a dedicated graphic designer with a passion for creating unique and memorable brand identities. My main focus has been on logo design, where I enjoy crafting visuals that capture the essence of a brand. I love working with startups and small businesses, helping them establish a strong visual presence through thoughtful and creative design.\n\nThroughout my journey, I’ve worked on various projects, including logos, marketing materials, and social media content. My design approach is grounded in simplicity and clarity, ensuring that each piece not only looks great but also communicates effectively.\n\nI’m always eager to learn and grow, constantly exploring new design trends and techniques to enhance my skills. I’m excited about the opportunity to bring my creativity, attention to detail, and enthusiasm to your team, contributing to impactful design solutions.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736230973392_Abdul-Martin Faloye .pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-07T06:22:56.772Z,2025-01-07T06:22:56.772Z,,,,,,,,,
677cd0ff6aeecc1b06bd98b8,Rotimi John,+23409023271400,oluwabigjhonz@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Good day, my name is John Rotimi, and I'm a seasoned graphic designer with almost a decade of experience in creating visually stunning and effective designs. \n\nThroughout my career, I've had the opportunity to work with various clients and companies, delivering high-impact designs that drive results. My expertise spans branding, UI/UX, print, and digital media, with a strong proficiency in Adobe Software, specifically Photoshop and Illustrator, as well as video editing softwares\n\nIn my previous roles, I've successfully led design teams, developed brand identities, and created engaging designs for social media, websites, and marketing campaigns. I'm passionate about staying up-to-date with the latest design trends and technologies, and I'm excited to leverage my skills and experience to drive success in this role. I'm looking forward to discussing my qualifications further and exploring how I can contribute to the team.",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1eSL2LlqmZiM7Jl7nrSciMzKmpWTOcwlT,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736233210001_John Rotimi CV24.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-07T07:00:15.794Z,2025-01-07T07:00:15.794Z,,,,,,,,,
677cd10c6aeecc1b06bd98c0,Emmanuel Moses,+23408136289595,immallexxaka@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Emmanuel Moses, I am a multidisciplinary Graphic Designer. \n\nWith over 9 years of experience as a Graphic Designer, working for some companies and freelancing, I have gathered staunch knowledge to confidently say I can take on any challenge regarding the Role.\n\nI possess valuable skill sets aside from graphic design, such as video editing, VFX, motion graphics, etc. That being said, I believe I will play a crucial role in implementing your design initiatives and make valuable contributions to your Company.\n\nThe following are highlights of my skills and accomplishments:\n\n• Facilitated Graphic Design for an N.G.O\n• Worked for a company on contract to Design Birthday Materials for Bola Ahmed Tinubu \n• Time Management Skills: Manage up to 5 projects or tasks at a given time while under pressure to meet strict weekly deadlines and more.\n\nIn addition to my personality; I am extremely enthusiastic about being distinctive in what I do, problem-solving ability, out-of-the-box thinking, and meticulous execution. I am flexible and I will go out of my way to learn new things if necessary and required to take the company forward. Lastly, I am also very efficient at working remotely\n",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gMagXwyBLGi73Ar8UNJjnXwtdkrMWeRN?usp=drive_link,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736233225193_Emmanuel Moses CV-1.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-07T07:00:28.057Z,2025-01-07T07:00:28.057Z,,,,,,,,,
677cd2d06aeecc1b06bd98cc,Lukman Yusuf Oluwadamilare,+23408062151407,lukmanyusuf2000@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a young adult who is passionate about creativity and design. I am also a recent Architecture graduate, which gives me a perspective on blending structures with aesthetics.\nOutside of work, I enjoy staying active and focusing on my fitness goals. I also spend time watching movies and am a big fan of football. \nOverall, I like to balance my productivity with fun and personal growth.",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1IKiVfbeZTbutMvJuLxZ9S08mG4O7mqPj?usp=drive_link,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736233677379_MY DESIGN RESUME.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-07T07:08:00.273Z,2025-01-07T07:08:00.273Z,,,,,,,,,
677cda246aeecc1b06bd98f4,Daniel Igbinedion,+2348086686417,danieligbinedion2@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello, my name is Daniel Igbinedion; I am a student of the Doctor of Pharmacy at the University of Benin, class of 2027. Alongside this academic pursuit, I have developed an interest in graphic design academically and professionally. I have designed for various entities including the National Association of Political Science Students' Election, the Pharmaceutical Association of Nigeria, and the Foursquare Gospel Church, among others. I have won numerous awards, among them my invaluable contributions toward Roqqu community engagement and dedication at the Creative Conference.\n\nI am a designer who thrives on the challenge of mixing creative input with functionality for compelling campaigns or brand identity; the connection it creates with the audience is very meaningful. With my background in pharmacy, design took on special relevance and enabled unique consideration for user experiences, particularly educational and health contexts. Indeed, I wish to bring aboard a multitasker, imaginative and passionate over visual communication, hence being part of projects at your company truly counts.",https://docs.google.com/document/d/1YpeGY5tzx832Bt11bFs5L8Hh0D00RcEpv-lCBlRnWcU/edit?usp=drivesdk,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736235551798_Graphic design CV _ resume.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-07T07:39:16.066Z,2025-01-07T07:39:16.066Z,,,,,,,,,
