677ce7896aeecc1b06bd9914, Olunlade Emmanuel Oluwatoniloba ,+2348174860420,olunladetoni44@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Thank you for asking me to share more about myself! My name is Toni, but I am also fondly known as Loba. I consider myself a multi-talented individual with a strong background in both technology and media.\n\nOn the tech side, I have hands-on hardware skills that have allowed me to explore innovative solutions and projects. Additionally, I am passionate about creative media, including graphic design and video editing. My journey in graphic design began during the COVID-19 lockdown, and since then, I have significantly evolved.\n\nSome of my proudest achievements include winning second place in the Covenant University Student Talent Competition and garnering an impressive audience on social media platforms like TikTok, where my video edits have attracted substantial views and engagement.\n\nI am passionate about combining my technical expertise with my creative abilities to drive innovation and excellence in any environment I am part of.\n\nThank you once again for this opportunity. Please let me know if you'd like me to elaborate on any of these areas further!",https://pin.it/37s1WQNam,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736238982770_Updated_OLUNLADE_EMMANUEL_CV.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-07T08:36:25.665Z,2025-01-07T08:36:25.665Z,,,,,,,,,
