677cffb26aeecc1b06bd997f,Okulaja Adetomiwa,+23408108461575,adetomiwatolulope@gmail.com,Nigeria,"A self driven and dedicated professional with strong passion for executing daily tasks with excellence. Skilled in communication and social engagements, eager to contribute to team success. Quick to learn new skills and adapt to changing needs and policies.\n\nMY HIGHLIGHTS: \nI am an Experienced Graphic designer   with a proven track record of over two years in the industry. As a skilled communicator, I excel in delivering prompt results without compromising quality. My primary objective as a designer is to craft a final product and resonates with your vision, ensuring it not only meets but exceeds your expectations. \n\nI am thrilled about opportunities and challenges that allow me to utilize my skills (e.g. Photoshop, Adobe illustrator Figma, Canvas and Corel Draw ).\n\nMY INTERESTS:\nBeing a visual artist has provided me with countless of opportunities to solve problems creatively and think critically. Through drawing, I have developed a unique ability to observe and deliver impactful solutions. \nMy artistic endeavors have not only shaped my skills but also earned recognition such as winning the Creative of the year award at the University of Ibadan. Additionally, I had the privilege of participating in prestigious platforms organized by SAYPHIN and UNICEF MindScape Awards.",https://goto.now/Xm0wN,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736245167734_Design Resume.pdf,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-07T10:19:30.828Z,2025-01-07T10:19:30.828Z,,,,,,,,,
