677d0c456aeecc1b06bd99a0,Abbas Abayomi Kazeem,+2347073324054,bayojohn77@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Am by name Abbas Abayomi Kazeem, am a Graphic Designer, and am ready to play a key role in creating visually appealing and impactful designs that effectively communicate your brand message.\nI pay full attention to detail, and i also have the ability to think creatively to contribute to the success of your marketing and visual communication efforts.",https://www.behance.net/abayomijohn,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736248387216_ABBAS ABAYOMI KAZEEM-CV25.docx,67794d8455e80fecb1db68e1,Graphic Designer,2025-01-07T11:13:09.826Z,2025-01-07T11:13:09.826Z,,,,,,,,,
