6786640542ba92331072d976,Emmaunuel Yanum,+2349017979618,emmanuelyanum@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an experienced software engineer with more than nine years of expertise in designing scalable, secure, and user-focused applications. My skills include frontend development using Next.js, React.js, and Redux, along with advanced knowledge of TypeScript and JavaScript. I have successfully delivered top-notch web applications across various sectors, including fintech, blockchain, logistics, healthcare, and agritech.\n\nCurrently, at BitBarter, I’ve contributed to a range of projects, such as creating a subscription-based crypto airdrop platform and a real-time dispute resolution system. I’ve also played a key role in scaling a peer-to-peer crypto marketplace and maintaining essential microservices.\n\nIn my previous roles, I refined my ability to work collaboratively with cross-functional teams, effectively translating complex UI/UX designs into efficient and high-performing applications. My expertise lies in optimizing applications for performance, SEO, and scalability, as well as integrating third-party tools for analytics, monitoring, and user engagement.\n\nI thrive in Agile development environments and prioritize staying current with industry trends by continuously learning and adopting new technologies. My focus is on delivering innovative solutions and crafting seamless user experiences for every project I undertake.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736860674292_EMMANUEL_RESUME_V2025.pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-14T13:17:57.210Z,2025-01-14T13:17:57.210Z,,,,,,,,,
6786655b42ba92331072d980,Rainer Nsa,+2349031390437,reyonsa@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"     Seasoned Full Stack and Frontend Developer with over 7 years of experience in software engineering. My expertise lies in building responsive, scalable, and user-centric web and mobile applications using technologies like React.js, Next.js, React Native, and Tailwind CSS.\n   Throughout my career, I’ve worked on innovative projects. I also recently developed MedEquip, a Next.js-based admin dashboard for managing medical equipment, and Dryve, a ride-hailing application targeting multiple Nigerian states.\n   I’m passionate about crafting seamless user experiences, optimizing performance, and collaborating with teams to deliver impactful solutions. In addition to my technical expertise, I take pride in my leadership skills, having mentored junior developers and led teams to successfully execute complex projects.\n   When I’m not coding, I’m either working on my media company, Northside Inc., or pursuing personal goals like continuous learning, self-improvement, and giving back to my community.",https://rainer.vercel.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736861016347_RainerNsa.pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-14T13:23:39.302Z,2025-01-14T13:23:39.302Z,,,,,,,,,
678665de42ba92331072d992,Bukunmi Odugbesan,+23408162443236,bukunmiodugbesans@gmail.com,Nigeria,"As a front-end engineer, I have more than 4 years of experience working in teams to help build marketing applications used to send targeted ads to thousands of customers on different devices using different browsers, building admin platforms, and e-commerce applications.  I work with React and Angular but I also have experience building with Vue. Tailwind, Bootstrap, Material UI, and Angular Material are some of the CSS libraries I have used in completing projects. Typescript is also a tool I use for large projects, along with React Unit Testing and Cypress",bukunmi-odugbesan.vercel.app,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736861148040_Bukunmi Odugbesan.pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-14T13:25:50.630Z,2025-01-14T13:25:50.630Z,,,,,,,,,
