6786666842ba92331072d9a4,Tunde akinola,+23408034574154,tundephilps@gmail.com,Nigeria,"The Hiring Manager,\n\nDear Sir /Ma\n\nIn my pursuit of new creative endeavours I was excited to find the React Developer opportunity with your company. As a progressive professional with Frontend design experience, I believe that I can bring valuable contributions to your team.\n\nLearning how to Code have changed my way of viewing life and it gave me the tools I needed to make a difference in my community. This is what has driven my passion for Web development from my first venture in the field of coding courses. I realized it has presented me with a method to solve complex problems through recognizing patterns of data, afterwards I saw that it could be a powerful tool to make future generations engage more with the world around them as well as spark there interest in logic n critical thinking and I believe that this job as a web designer / front end developer will give me the Platform to be able to apply my skills to build real world applications and create an impact. I am applying to your company to further advance my career in the ever growing tech industry.\n\nI have always had a passion for tech and I also have some previous training from a 6months intensive coding boot-camp, coupled with some self-learning through FreecodeCamp and Udemy Courses. According to what I have researched, your company has amazing potential for growth and being a trailblazer in the world today I already have a vast knowledge in HTML, CSS, Java Script and React JS,Next.js and React Native. Through this career opportunity as Web designer/FrontEnd Developer. I hope to be able to contribute to the massive growth of your company. Not only will I help you solve problems, I can also lead and supervise other developers in the team to achieve organisational objectives at the shortest possible time without compromising on quality.\nFor a greater presentation of my background and qualifications, please review my attached resume which contains links to my Projects and Portfolio. I am eager to speak with you and greatly appreciate your consideration.\n\nSincerely,\n\nAkinola Tunde\n\n\n",https://tundephilps-portfolio.vercel.app/portfolio,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736861285254_Frontend CV1.pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2025-01-14T13:28:08.187Z,2025-01-14T13:28:08.187Z,,,,,,,,,
