678667aa42ba92331072d9b5,Fatokun Oreoluwa ,+2348022965020,fatokunore@gmail.com,Nigeria,I am a Nigerian student currently studying software engineering with a passion and driven to keep learning new technologies and skills ,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736861607823_Oreoluwa Fatokun  cv_085522.docx,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2025-01-14T13:33:30.150Z,2025-01-14T13:33:30.150Z,,,,,,,,,
6786692c42ba92331072d9bf,Victor Essien,+2347075327804,essienedidiong1000@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi, I’m Victor, a Full Stack Developer with 4 years of experience building scalable, user-centric solutions for startups. I have with various teams in building innovative products. I have specialization in developing high-performance applications using modern tools and frameworks such as React.js, React Native, Next.js, Node.js, Go, and TypeScript. \n\nI see that your team is looking for a frontend developer and I think I will be the best fit for this role. I geninuely think I will be the best fit for the role due to I have the ability to write code that are easily maintainable and in turn can scale. I have made use of typescript type system to manage large codebases where we had over thousands of types to ensure consistency in prop passing and state management. I had also implemented modern state management techniques like Redux and RTK Query.  Your team needs a developer who can communicate effectively in terms of idea and work well with cross-functional team. I think I am the developer who possesses this charisma. I have worked with cross-functional teams in analyzing figma prototypes layout, color tonality and ways in which we could reduced bounce rate of our products and in turn improve the user experience. I have had the privilege of implementing cool stuffs like caching of frequently accessed data which can significantly reduce the amount of load your end-users exert on your API, To implementing advanced features on the frontend like polling. In all of this, your team need a developer who is experienced, can communicate, can write good and maintainable code and I think I will be the best fit for this role.",https://eddyportfolio.vercel.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736861993017_Victor_Essien_CV_2025.pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-14T13:39:56.545Z,2025-01-14T13:39:56.545Z,,,,,,,,,
