6786753e42ba92331072dab2,kehinde Salaudeen,+2348056499531,kehindesalaudeen222@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Kehinde, a Fullstack software Developer with 5 years  experience in both frontend and backend development including web and mobile\nI have used technologies like Firebase, AWS, Google cloud, MongoDB etc over the years\nI have been able to contribute to the development of several startups like UrbanEatsApp and ReachAfrika both involved in web and mobile app platforms with over 15,000 users in each\nIn these companies i built highly scalable and maintainable code which has improved the speed of delivery of other developers\nI recently work on a project at am Oil and Gas Industry (New Cross) where i create from scratch a fully functional Web application that helps them manage day to day activities at the refinery including test of reservoirs and volume inflow and outflow which incredibly reduce the need a manual processes and allow visualization of data on the dashboard the management team\nIn my current role at UrbanEatsApp, I’ve developed dynamic, high-performance UIs using React Native for the Mobile Application and Vuejs for the Admin Web, integrated APIs, and optimized for performance across devices. I am skilled in state management (Redux, Zustand Vuex), testing (Jest, Cypress), and building scalable, maintainable code. I also work closely with backend teams to ensure smooth integration and deliver projects on time using agile methodologies.\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.\nSincerely,\nKehinde Salaudeen\n",https://khenny-portfolio.netlify.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736865084304_KehindeSalaudeen.pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-14T14:31:26.961Z,2025-01-14T14:31:26.961Z,,,,,,,,,
