678694ec42ba92331072dbc7,Olanrewaju AbdulAzeez Olamide ,+23409036340011,oabdulazeez70@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello! My name is Olanrewaju AbdulAzeez Olamide and I am a front-end developer with a strong passion for creating modern, interactive web experiences using React and Vue.\n\nWith 7 years of experience in the industry, I have honed my skills in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript(and Typescript), and have a strong understanding of responsive design principles. In addition to my front-end skills, I have extensive experience with React, including creating reusable components, managing state, and optimizing performance.\n\nIn my previous roles, I have had the opportunity to work on a wide range of projects, from small websites to large, complex web applications built with React and Vue. I thrive in collaborative environments and enjoy working with cross-functional teams to bring ideas to life.\n\nIn my free time, you can find me tinkering with new technologies or participating in hackathons and coding challenges. I am excited to bring my skills and enthusiasm to your team and help create amazing user experiences with React and Vue.\n\nYou can check one of my latest projects: \n\nGitRoast \nhttps://git-roast.vercel.app/",https://github.com/I-am-abdulazeez,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736873193074_Abdul'Azeez CV.pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-14T16:46:36.759Z,2025-01-14T16:46:36.759Z,,,,,,,,,
