6786b59842ba92331072dd07,Toluwani Babawale,+2348133742668,babawalev5@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Toluwani Babawale – Software Project Manager & Full-Stack Developer\n\nDear Hiring Team,\n\nI am excited to apply to your organization. With over four years of experience as a Software Project Manager and Full-Stack Developer, I bring a unique blend of technical expertise and project leadership that positions me to deliver impactful solutions and drive results.\n\nAs a Software Project Manager, I have successfully led diverse teams to deliver complex software projects on time and within budget. My ability to align technical deliverables with business goals ensures that every project not only meets expectations but also adds measurable value to the organization.\n\nIn addition to my project management experience, my technical skills as a Full-Stack Developer include:\n✅ Frontend Development: Proficiency in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, and Bootstrap for creating intuitive and responsive user interfaces.\n✅ Backend Development: Expertise in Python, Django, and Wagtail for building scalable and efficient backend systems.\n✅ Database Management: Skilled in SQL for effective data handling and integration.\n✅ Version Control: Advanced knowledge of Git for seamless team collaboration.\n✅ DevOps Practices: Hands-on experience with Docker and command-line tools to streamline deployments and environment setups.\n\nMy unique ability to bridge the gap between technical and non-technical teams ensures clear communication, efficient execution, and delivery of solutions that align with organizational objectives. I thrive in dynamic environments, tackling challenges with creativity and a commitment to excellence.\n\nI am eager to bring my skills, experience, and passion for innovative solutions to your team. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your organization’s success.\n\nSincerely,\nToluwani Babawale\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/toluwani-babawale-5962ba160?utm_source=share&utm_campaign=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=ios_app",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736881557278_My CV and Portfolio.pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2025-01-14T19:06:00.431Z,2025-01-14T19:06:00.431Z,,,,,,,,,
