6786b82442ba92331072dd25,Emmanuel Onuiteshi,+23408180303700,emmanuelonuiteshi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a software engineer with over six years of experience in building scalable web and mobile applications. My work spans various industries, including healthcare and financial services. I specialize in using technologies like React, React Native, Laravel, and Spring Boot to develop efficient solutions tailored to client needs.\n\nOne of my notable achievements was developing a staffing and management application that increased nurses' and caregivers' access to healthcare facilities by over 70%. I have also built accounting and time-management applications that streamline payroll processing and administrative tasks.\n\nI pride myself on my ability to communicate technical concepts effectively, work collaboratively in cross-functional teams, and manage multiple projects with attention to detail. In addition to my technical expertise, I have a strong foundation in tools like Docker, AWS, and Git, which I use to ensure the delivery of high-quality products.\n\nOutside of work, I enjoy learning about new technologies and contributing to open-source projects. I’m passionate about solving complex problems and delivering impactful solutions that improve users' lives.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736882209616_Onuiteshi_Emmanuel_Resume .pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-14T19:16:52.284Z,2025-01-14T19:16:52.284Z,,,,,,,,,
