678741c242ba92331072e04d,Luke Emmanuel,+23409032520207,emmaranking07@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nDear Team,\n\nI am writing to express my interest in the Fullstack Developer intern positions, as advertised. With a diverse skill set that spans both web and mobile development, coupled with strong IT and technical troubleshooting abilities, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.\n\nMy proficiency in front-end technologies such as React, Nextjs, React Native, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript allows me to create dynamic, responsive applications. On the back-end, I have hands-on experience with Node.js, Express.js, and database management using MongoDB and MySQL, which has enabled me to develop complete applications from conception to deployment. I also possess a range of IT skills, including network administration, system maintenance, and technical troubleshooting, which provide a holistic approach to problem-solving and system optimization.\n\nAdditionally, I have experience with Continuous Deployment/Continuous Integration (CD/CI) pipelines, ensuring smooth and automated deployment processes. I also utilize Jest for testing, enabling robust and reliable code, which enhances both the development workflow and product quality.\n\nSome key highlights of my background include:\n\nDeveloping and maintaining responsive web applications that enhance user experience across platforms.\nBuilding scalable mobile applications using React Native.\nIntegrating APIs and optimizing web performance to deliver efficient solutions.\nImplementing CD/CI pipelines for seamless deployment and testing processes.\nWriting unit tests with Jest to ensure code quality and reduce bugs.\nI would welcome the opportunity to further discuss how my skills and experiences align with your needs. I am excited about the possibility of contributing to your organization and helping drive innovation in your web and mobile development projects.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to speak with you.\n\nSincerely,\nLuke Emmanuel.\n\n",https://ranking-topnotch.github.io/Luke-Emmanuel-Portfolio/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736917436563_LUKE EMMANUEL F (1).pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2025-01-15T05:04:02.412Z,2025-01-15T05:04:02.412Z,,,,,,,,,
6787427442ba92331072e056,Emmanuel Chukwudum,+23409032520207,clemmanuel07@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nDear Team,\n\nI am writing to express my interest in the Fullstack Developer positions, as advertised. With a diverse skill set that spans both web and mobile development, coupled with strong IT and technical troubleshooting abilities, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.\n\nMy proficiency in front-end technologies such as React, Nextjs, React Native, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript allows me to create dynamic, responsive applications. On the back-end, I have hands-on experience with Node.js, Express.js, and database management using MongoDB and MySQL, which has enabled me to develop complete applications from conception to deployment. I also possess a range of IT skills, including network administration, system maintenance, and technical troubleshooting, which provide a holistic approach to problem-solving and system optimization.\n\nAdditionally, I have experience with Continuous Deployment/Continuous Integration (CD/CI) pipelines, ensuring smooth and automated deployment processes. I also utilize Jest for testing, enabling robust and reliable code, which enhances both the development workflow and product quality.\n\nSome key highlights of my background include:\n\nDeveloping and maintaining responsive web applications that enhance user experience across platforms.\nBuilding scalable mobile applications using React Native.\nIntegrating APIs and optimizing web performance to deliver efficient solutions.\nImplementing CD/CI pipelines for seamless deployment and testing processes.\nWriting unit tests with Jest to ensure code quality and reduce bugs.\nI currently developing this real estate application where users can upload their space for others to buy or rent \n\nLink: find-your-space.vercel.app\nI would welcome the opportunity to further discuss how my skills and experiences align with your needs. I am excited about the possibility of contributin