67877ce642ba92331072e265,Abiola Fadipe,+2349068306836,abiolafadipe88@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Abiola Fadipe, a skilled software engineer with extensive experience in building web and mobile applications. I specialize in full-stack development, focusing on technologies like Angular, React, Node.js, and React Native. Currently, I’m working at Fidelity Bank, where I’ve contributed to innovative banking solutions.\n\nOver the years, I’ve developed expertise in handling projects from concept to completion, including building telemedical applications, fintech products, and educational platforms. I’m passionate about problem-solving, especially in areas requiring complex logic and mathematics.\n\nIn addition to coding, I’ve taken on leadership roles like mentoring developers in a community called I2I and participating in projects that enhance team collaboration. I love creating impactful solutions and thrive on challenges, always looking to learn and grow.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736932579567_Abiola Fadipe Resume.pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-15T09:16:22.591Z,2025-01-15T09:16:22.591Z,,,,,,,,,
67877cf042ba92331072e26c,John Osifo,+23407057388158,osifojohntec@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a skilled Software Engineer with over 3 years of experience building and maintaining robust, scalable, and user-centric web applications. Currently, I lead technical implementations at Devheit, working on Paydeet, a centralized banking identity platform, and its merchant web app. My expertise spans modern technologies like React.js, TypeScript, Next.js, and Tailwind CSS, which I leverage to deliver efficient and visually appealing solutions.\n\nPreviously, I revamped the frontend for WiredAssurance, achieving a 40% improvement in performance and scalability by modernizing the codebase and integrating tools like Redux and RTK Query. Additionally, I’ve honed my problem-solving skills through freelance work and a solid foundation in Data Structures and Algorithms.\n\nI thrive in collaborative environments, enjoy tackling complex technical challenges, and am passionate about building products that make a meaningful impact on users' lives.",https://osifojohn.netlify.app,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736932589522_osifo_john_resume.pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-15T09:16:32.252Z,2025-01-15T09:16:32.252Z,,,,,,,,,
