6787c86a42ba92331072e4c2,Tunde Elesho,+2347067088193,gemtunde@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Sir,\n\nI am excited to apply for the Frontend Developer position\n\nWith over 5 years of experience in building responsive, user-centric web applications and a strong passion for leveraging the latest technologies, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team and help elevate the user experience for your customers.\n\n My hands-on experience with modern JavaScript frameworks, including React and Next-js, has equipped me with a deep understanding of component-based architecture and state management solutions, ensuring scalable and maintainable code.\n\nHere are a few highlights of the apps i worked on:\n\n https://dashboard.vahlid.com/auth/login\nhttps://www.katsumfb.com/\nhttps://dashboard.hydrogenpay.com/login\n\nI am excited about the possibility of bringing my unique talents to your team. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background, skills, and enthusiasm align with the goals of your organization. \n\nAttached is my resume.\n\n I look forward to the opportunity to speak with you.\n\nWarm regards,\n\nTunde Elesho",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736951911331_Senior_Frontend_Developer.pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-15T14:38:34.404Z,2025-01-15T14:38:34.404Z,,,,,,,,,
