6787d40542ba92331072e4e2,Jude Uzo,+2348136190549,judeuzo7@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a mid-level React and React Native developer with over 3 years of experience building user-friendly web and mobile applications. I specialize in creating dynamic, responsive interfaces and delivering seamless user experiences. My expertise includes working with modern JavaScript frameworks and integrating APIs to develop scalable and efficient solutions. I enjoy problem-solving, staying updated with the latest trends in front-end development, and collaborating with teams to bring creative ideas to life.",https://judeuzo.tiiny.site/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736954881816_FRONT END DEVELOPER CV.pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2025-01-15T15:28:05.663Z,2025-01-15T15:28:05.663Z,,,,,,,,,
6787d4fc42ba92331072e4f8,Joseph Azumara,+23408133948394,azumarajoseph@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an experienced Frontend Developer skilled in building responsive, user-friendly web applications using Angular, ReactJS, and TypeScript. I have successfully worked on projects like JossyCollections, where I implemented scalable designs, state management with NgRx, and seamless API integrations. My expertise in tools like Bootstrap and Angular Material, combined with problem-solving abilities and a passion for clean, optimized code, makes me a strong candidate for this role. I excel at collaborating with teams to deliver high-quality, intuitive user experiences",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736955129183_Azumara Joseph CV.pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2025-01-15T15:32:12.127Z,2025-01-15T15:32:12.127Z,,,,,,,,,
