6787dbb042ba92331072e51d,Chibuzo J. Okenwa,+23409066167293,chibuzo.okenwa@gmail.com,Nigeria,"To Hiring Manager,\n\nI am excited to apply for the Frontend Developer (React /React Native) position, bringing over 6 years of expertise in full-stack web and mobile development. Below are highlights of my most impactful projects, showcasing my technical acumen and commitment to delivering scalable solutions.\n\nPaysofter: Developed a custom payment gateway with escrow functionality for Paysofter (paysofter.s3-website-us-east-1.amazonaws.com) with DRF (backend), ReactJS (web), and React Native (test.paysofter.com/apps), blending features of Paystack and Escrow. I created npm packages (react-paysofter and react-native-paysofter) with QR code-enabled payment links (e.g. test.paysofter.com/link?ref=jonbullion&pk=1, test.paysofter.com/link?ref=jonbullion&pk=2). Comprehensive API documentation (test.paysofter.com/docs) ensured seamless developer integration.\n\nSellangle: Built Sellangle (sellangle.s3-website-us-east-1.amazonaws.com), a global marketplace similar to Jiji NG, with DRF (backend), ReactJS (web), and React Native (test.sellangle.com/apps). Key features include real-time chat (Django Channels, Daphne), Redis-powered task scheduling, advanced filtering, and unique seller storefronts (test.sellangle.com/shopfront/jonbullion). Example ads:\n\nbackend.sellangle.com/api/get-all-paid-ad/\n\nSellangleELB-395880424.us-east-1.elb.amazonaws.com/api/get-all-free-ad/\n\nMcDofShop: Delivered McDofShop.com, an e-commerce app for McDof Global Resources Ltd, using DRF, ReactJS, and React Native. Deployed with AWS (EC2, S3, CloudFront) and CI/CD pipelines via GitHub Actions and CodePipeline.\n\nMachine Learning & Other Contributions: Deployed trained ML models like an image classifier (github.com/syntaxland/classifier-tensorflow-django). Built projects in Docker (docker pull jondebosco/django-api), Kubernetes (github.com/syntaxland/MERN-Kubernetes), FastAPI (github.com/syntaxland/farm-stack-crud), Flask (github.com/syntaxland/flask-intro-app1), and data visualizations in Django (github.com/syntaxland/django-data-viz-pd-plt-sns).\n\nMy portfolio (softglobal.s3-website-us-east-1.amazonaws.com) includes examples of 3D animations built with React and Three.js (test.softglobal.org/meet-jb).\n\nFor closed testing of my react native apps (invitation links):\n\nPaysofter: play.google.com/apps/testing/com.jondebosco.paysofter\n\nSellangle: play.google.com/apps/testing/com.jondebosco.sellangle\n\nI am eager to bring my technical expertise and passion for innovation to your team. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nSincerely,\nJohnbosco",test.softglobal.org/meet-jb,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736956845206_fullstack-jb.pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-15T16:00:48.348Z,2025-01-15T16:00:48.348Z,,,,,,,,,
6787dd9d42ba92331072e529,Barakat Bamidele ,+2348123952458,bamideleaduke@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nMy name is Bamidele Barakat. I am a software engineer with strong interest in working on diverse and challenging projects.\n\nMy journey in frontend development has been driven by a passion for technology and a commitment to continuous learning and improvement. In my current role, I have played a pivotal part in optimizing operations and technology, contributing to the success of various projects. Leveraging my expertise in frontend technologies, I have contributed dynamically to impactful projects, demonstrating a commitment to enhancing user interactions and driving operational efficiency.\n\nI pride myself on being a fast learner and am confident in my ability to quickly adapt to any tools or technologies used in-house to work efficiently. I am excited about the prospect of joining your team to continue honing my skills and gaining exposure to new technologies and best practices. I have experience working effectively remotely.\nCv: Attached to this mail is my cv\nMy portfolio : https://about-barakat.netlify.app/\nGithub: https://github.com/Bamideleaduke\n\nThank you for considering my application. I am eager for the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.",https://about-barakat.netlify.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736957338038_Barakat_Bamidele_generated_Resume.docx.pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2025-01-15T16:09:01.872Z,2025-01-15T16:09:01.872Z,,,,,,,,,
6787e15a42ba92331072e541,Jah'swill Uchechi Emmanuel,+23409016510703,jahswill4jahs@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Jah'swill Uchechi Emmanuel, a passionate and detail-oriented Front-End Engineering graduate with a strong foundation in coding and problem-solving. Proficient in JavaScript and React, I excel at designing and developing scalable, user-friendly web applications. With a deep understanding of algorithms and modern web technologies, I am eager to contribute innovative full-stack solutions that drive growth, enhance user experiences, and bring value to organizations. My goal is to leverage my expertise in creating efficient, high-quality applications while continuously learning and growing in the ever-evolving tech landscape.",https://jahswill-portfolio.netlify.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736958295334_Jah'swill's Resume.pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2025-01-15T16:24:58.443Z,2025-01-15T16:24:58.443Z,,,,,,,,,
6787e18242ba92331072e548,Victor Akhihiero,+23408122663538,victorakhihiero@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi, my name is Victor Akhihiero. I’m a self-taught front-end developer with nearly four years of industry experience. I’ve strengthened my skills through continuous learning and taking specialised courses in web development. I excel at building responsive pages, reusable components, and scalable web applications, primarily using React with TypeScript. My work often involves creating interactive dashboards, integrating APIs, and ensuring great user experiences. Additionally, I have a foundational knowledge of back-end technologies like Python, MongoDB, and MySQL, which helps me collaborate effectively across teams.",https://vehktaur.vercel.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736958335548_VICTOR AKHIHIERO - Dev.pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-15T16:25:38.708Z,2025-01-15T16:25:38.708Z,,,,,,,,,
