6788129042ba92331072e606,OLOLADE OWOLABI BABATUNDE,+2349024519805,babatundeololade50@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a Software Engineer with over 4 years of experience specializing in frontend development. I've worked extensively with modern JavaScript frameworks, particularly React and Angular, building high-performance web applications. At EchoCCS, I led the migration of a widely-used chat SDK from jQuery to Angular 18, which serves over a million monthly users. Previously, at companies like Hajonsoft and Qpien, I developed complex user interfaces and implemented AI integrations to enhance user experiences. I'm proficient in TypeScript and have a strong foundation in creating responsive, user-friendly web interfaces while maintaining high code quality through testing and best practices.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736970892870__tunde_ola_resume.pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-15T19:54:56.037Z,2025-01-15T19:54:56.037Z,,,,,,,,,
