678841b142ba92331072e675,Adanna Nnajiofor ,+23408160507179,adanna.nnajiofor@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Adanna Nnajiofor, and I am a passionate frontend developer with a strong background in architecture, which has sharpened my eye for design and attention to detail.  \n\nI transitioned into tech to pursue my interest in creating visually appealing and user-friendly interfaces, and I have since honed my skills in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, ReactJS, and Next.js. My experiences have allowed me to create dynamic web applications, ensuring seamless user experiences across various devices.  \n\nI thrive on learning and solving problems, and I am eager to contribute my creativity and technical skills to the company. I am also enthusiastic about growing in an environment that values innovation and collaboration.  \n\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team and learn from this role.  \n\nSincerely,  \nAdanna Nnajiofor  ",https://adanna-website-portfolio.vercel.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736982957736_Adanna-Nnajiofor-CV.pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2025-01-15T23:16:01.410Z,2025-01-15T23:16:01.410Z,,,,,,,,,
6788449f42ba92331072e67f,Simi Dickson,+2348024370107,hillarydickson97@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Simi Dickson, a frontend developer with experience building web and mobile applications using ReactJS, React Native, and TailwindCSS. I’m like creating user-friendly and functional applications that solve real-world problems.\n\nI’ve worked on projects like PowHER, a safety app that allows users to share location safety updates and view a map with safety status pins (red, yellow, green).\n\nI’m constantly looking for new challenges that allow me to combine creativity, problem-solving, and collaboration to deliver impactful solutions.",http://simidickson.com,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736983708468_Simi Dickson (Software Developer).pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-15T23:28:31.625Z,2025-01-15T23:28:31.625Z,,,,,,,,,
6788454442ba92331072e686,Oluchi,+2349044739674,peace8282bern@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi, I’m Oluchi Peace Okeke, and my journey into front-end development began after university, where I first discovered my passion for technology. Although my formal education wasn’t in software engineering, I knew I wanted to build a career in tech. That’s when I decided to pursue certification programs like the ALX Software Engineering program and the Learnable Front-End program. These experiences gave me a solid foundation in web development, and I’ve continued my learning through self-paced courses to keep up with the ever-changing tech landscape.\n\nI’ve worked on various personal and collaborative projects, which I’ve showcased in my portfolio. Through these projects, I’ve honed my skills in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and React. Whether working on my own or collaborating with peers, I’ve learned the value of clear communication and problem-solving in building user-friendly, functional websites.\n\nI’m excited about the opportunity to intern with your organization, and I’m eager to bring my skills and passion for front-end development to your team. This internship is the perfect next step in my journey as I continue to grow and contribute to meaningful projects.\n\nThank you for considering my application—I’m looking forward to the possibility of learning from and contributing to your team!\n",https://peace-personal-portfolio.vercel.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736983873231_Okeke_Oluchi_CV_ms4.pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2025-01-15T23:31:16.882Z,2025-01-15T23:31:16.882Z,,,,,,,,,
67884f3042ba92331072e6a2,Emmanuel Ingwe,+23408139320656,ingwemmanuel@gmail.com,Niue," Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nBRINGING DESIGNS TO LIFE: 3+ YEARS OF FRONT-END EXPERTISE\n\nAs a passionate Front-End Developer with over three years of experience at Rui Creative and also MYAZA fintech, I am excited to apply for the Front-End Developer position. My expertise in cutting-edge technologies and commitment to creating exceptional user experiences make me an ideal candidate for your team.\n\nKEY SKILLS & TECHNOLOGIES:\n- HTML5 • CSS3 • JavaScript • React.js • Next.js\n- TypeScript • Tailwind CSS • Mobile & Responsive Design\n\nCORE STRENGTHS:\n- Transforming UX wireframes into fully functional, visually appealing interfaces\n- Collaborating seamlessly with Back-End Developers and UX Designers\n- Developing and implementing project scopes and timelines\n- Rigorous testing and debugging to ensure optimal user experience\n\nNOTABLE ACHIEVEMENTS:\n✓ Crafted diverse website features using modern front-end technologies\n✓ Consistently delivered projects on time through efficient design-develop-deploy processes\n✓ Fostered coherence between design and development teams, enhancing project outcomes\n\nWHAT SETS ME APART:\nMy meticulous attention to detail(pixle perfect) and unwavering dedication to problem-solving and continous learning are the cornerstones of my work. I don't just meet requirements – I exceed them, turning complex designs into seamless, user-friendly interfaces.\n\nI am eager to bring my skills and passion to your team and contribute to your innovative projects. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience aligns with your needs in an interview.\n\nThank you for your consideration. I look forward to the possibility of joining your esteemed team.\n\nSincerely,\nEmmanuel Ingwe \n\n+2348139320656\ningwemmanuel@gmail.com","elingwe,vercel.app",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736986413980_emmanuelingweresume.docx,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2025-01-16T00:13:36.416Z,2025-01-16T00:13:36.416Z,,,,,,,,,
67885b8b42ba92331072e6ae,Emmanuel Ebuka Ugoh,+23408139536456,emmajoel6456@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Emmanuel Ugoh, a frontend developer with over 3 years of experience. I am a part of the Sekure team building the online business platform for virtual card purchases allowing clients to purchase virtual cards for making online purchases with ease.\n\nI have also worked with the Tech64 team on a project called Vanbook. This is an online school management platform for managing academic financial records. \n\n I also have experience in building landing pages for businesses and i have crafted some slick modern designs for some companies in the real estate space.",https://manny-dev.vercel.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1736989576139_Curriculum Vitae.pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2025-01-16T01:06:19.456Z,2025-01-16T01:06:19.456Z,,,,,,,,,
