6788a5d142ba92331072e725,Akinlolu Odeku,+2348025752281,odekuakinlolu@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am frontend Engineer with my 5+ years of experience in developing and implementing user-centered web applications, I am confident I possess the skills and dedication to excel in a dynamic and challenging environment like yours.\n\nThroughout my career, I have consistently demonstrated a strong command of frontend technologies, including HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and popular frameworks such as React, and Vue.js. I am proficient in writing clean, efficient, and well-documented code, ensuring optimal performance and a seamless user experience.\n\nIn my previous role as Senior Frontend Engineer at Alpha Africa Advisory, I was instrumental in the starting and development for koppoh(https://koppoh.ng). This involved picking the right frontend framework and code structure for scalability and performance. My contributions resulted in fast development for an MVP product for both the business and user.\n\nI am eager to contribute my expertise to a forward-thinking organization and I am a highly motivated and results-oriented individual with a strong work ethic and a passion for creating exceptional digital experiences.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration. ",https://koppoh.ng,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1737008590562_Akinlolu Odeku - Resume.pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-16T06:23:13.646Z,2025-01-16T06:23:13.646Z,,,,,,,,,
