6788b4a242ba92331072e744,OBINNA OKPALA,+23409015287784,obinnaokpala@live.com,Nigeria,"I’m Obinna Okpala, a passionate web and mobile developer with a strong focus on creating efficient, scalable, and user-friendly applications using React and React Native. Over the past 7 years, I’ve honed my skills by working on diverse projects, ranging from responsive web applications to cross-platform mobile solutions that prioritize performance and seamless user experiences.\n\nMy journey in development started with building websites, but my curiosity and drive for innovation led me to specialize in React because of its flexibility and robust ecosystem. I enjoy turning ideas into functional applications and thrive in environments where collaboration and creativity come together to solve real-world problems.\n\nIn addition to my technical expertise, I’m a strong communicator and a proactive team player who enjoys working in remote and diverse settings. I’m excited about the opportunity to join your team, contribute my skills, and continue growing as a React/React Native developer.\n\n",https://okpalaobinna.wordpress.com/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1737012382823_CV - OKPALA K OBINNA.pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-16T07:26:26.883Z,2025-01-16T07:26:26.883Z,,,,,,,,,
