6788c13d42ba92331072e77a,Adejoke Ogunyinka,+23409069974056,ogunyinkajoke@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a passionate Frontend Engineer with a strong background in building scalable and user-friendly web applications. I have over two years of experience working with modern technologies like React.js, Next.js, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS, helping companies create intuitive digital products that enhance user experiences and drive business growth.\n\nCurrently, at ENYATA, I develop SaaS, B2B, and B2C applications, ensuring high performance and scalability. I also conduct bi-weekly code reviews to maintain quality standards and implement robust testing strategies, achieving over 70% test coverage. Prior to this, I worked at Mainstack, where I was on a team that worked on a major redesign of the web platform and built seamless payment integrations with Paystack and Stripe, improving the checkout experience for both local and international users.\n\nMy journey into frontend development started during my Bachelor's in Computer Science at the University of Ibadan, where I cultivated my problem-solving skills and passion for building digital solutions. Over time, I’ve honed my expertise not only in coding but also in collaboration, ownership, and continuous learning.\n\nI thrive in dynamic environments where I can contribute to impactful projects and collaborate with cross-functional teams. I’m excited about opportunities where I can leverage my technical expertise and creativity to build innovative web experiences.",https://adejoke-ogunyinka.netlify.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1737015610297_01-Adejoke Ogunyinka's resume.pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2025-01-16T08:20:13.332Z,2025-01-16T08:20:13.332Z,,,,,,,,,
