6788ea8a42ba92331072e822,Glory Uka,+23409072166300,techglory.swe@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m excited to apply for the Frontend Developer Internship role.\n As a 200-level Software Engineering student at Admiralty University of Nigeria, I’d love to apply my academic knowledge and growing technical skills to your team and gain more experience.\nIn my studies I have learned the basics of programming languages and frameworks, HTML JavaScript , HTML, CSS, JavaScript and CSS frameworks such as (React.js and TailwindCSS respectively). \nYou focus on user centric solutions which is in line with my passion for building applications that matter. I am really excited to build and maintain applications and work with experienced developers and be part of the entire application life cycle.\nIn my academic and personal projects I have developed the ability to write clean, modular and testable code. I am also familiar with RESTful APIs and I want to deepen my knowledge in these areas. My proactive approach, strong problem solving skills and love to learn makes me a good fit for this role.\nI would like to join your team and contribute to real world projects and grow as a developer in a good environment. I am interested to work with experienced developers and work on innovative and challenging projects.\nThanks for considering my application. I would love to discuss how my skills, background and enthusiasm fits Sophia ERP. I am available for an interview at your earliest convenience and looking forward to be part of your team.\n",https://techglory-swe.vercel.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1737026179989_resume.docx,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2025-01-16T11:16:26.133Z,2025-01-16T11:16:26.133Z,,,,,,,,,
6788ef8b42ba92331072e832,Moses Echela,+23408102344203,echelamoses@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a results-oriented Frontend Developer with over 3 years of experience, specializing in Next.js and React. I take pride in delivering high-performance, user-centric web applications that not only meet but exceed expectations. My approach is deeply rooted in understanding the user's needs, optimizing performance, and continuously improving the codebase to ensure scalability.\n\nThroughout my career, I’ve consistently focused on building reusable components, optimizing front-end performance, and ensuring seamless integration with back-end systems. I’ve successfully driven projects from concept to delivery, achieving significant improvements in speed, responsiveness, and user experience. For instance, in my most recent role, I led performance optimization efforts that resulted in a 30% reduction in load times across multiple web applications.\n\nI am driven by the challenge of taking on complex problems and finding innovative solutions, always keeping the end-user in mind. I’m constantly learning, staying ahead of industry trends, and adopting new technologies that push the boundaries of what’s possible. My goal is to contribute to a team where I can not only apply my skills but also grow alongside talented professionals to make a lasting impact on the company’s success. I am confident that my passion for excellence and commitment to continuous improvement will make me an asset to your team.",https://portfolio-app-xrqj.vercel.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1737027463510_CV..Moses.pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-16T11:37:47.205Z,2025-01-16T11:37:47.205Z,,,,,,,,,
