67895f3442ba92331072e993,Stephen Mgbeojikwe,+23409150962419,mgbeojikwestephen@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Team,\nI am excited about the opportunity to apply for the React Native Senior role. With a strong background in React Native development and a passion for delivering high-quality mobile applications, I believe I am well-suited to contribute effectively to your team. Here's why:\n* Extensive React Native Experience: I have over 5 years of hands-on experience working with React Native, developing and shipping robust mobile applications for both iOS and Android platforms. My expertise includes building scalable and performant applications that adhere to best practices and industry standards.\n* Proven Track Record: Throughout my career, I have successfully led React Native projects from conception to deployment. I have a solid understanding of the React Native ecosystem, including third-party libraries, tools, and frameworks, allowing me to optimize development processes and enhance user experiences.\n* Strong Technical Skills: I am proficient in JavaScript, ES6/ES7, TypeScript, Redux, Redux tool kit and other essential technologies for React Native development. Additionally, I have experience integrating native modules and Rest APIs, ensuring seamless functionality and compatibility across different platforms.\n* Problem-solving Abilities: As a Senior React Native Developer, I excel in troubleshooting complex issues and implementing effective solutions. I am accustomed to working in fast-paced environments, adapting to new challenges, and collaborating with cross-functional teams to achieve project objectives.\n* Continuous Learning and Growth: I am committed to staying updated with the latest trends and advancements in mobile development. I actively participate in online communities, attend tech meetups, and explore emerging technologies to enhance my skills and knowledge.\n* Team Collaboration and Leadership: I thrive in environments where collaboration and teamwork are valued. I am adept at communicating technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders, mentoring junior developers, and fostering a positive and inclusive work culture.\nIn summary, I am confident that my combination of technical expertise, leadership abilities, and dedication to excellence make me the ideal candidate for the React Native Senior role. I am excited about the opportunity to bring my skills and experience to your team and contribute to the continued success of your projects.\nThank you for considering my application.\n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1737056050197_Stephen-Mgbeojikwe.pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-16T19:34:12.700Z,2025-01-16T19:34:12.700Z,,,,,,,,,
67895f8a42ba92331072e99b,Ejembi Thomas,+2347062883672,ejembithomas61@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a software developer with 4+ years of experience building software (Web and Mobile) solutions, solving complex problems with Javascript, React, Typescript, React native, Kotlin. \nI have built solutions ranging from contactless payment system, employee productivity platforms, e-commerce platforms, grocery delivery platforms amongst others. I have built solutions for users from different regions and countries. My focus is building solutions regardless of the techstack required. \nI have a good leadingship skills since I have led 3 teams to build solutions for client in East Asia and in the US. I have co founded two failed startups and still building more. \n",https://ejembithomas.netlify.app,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1737056134471_THOMAS EJEMBI CV.pdf,678627a442ba92331072d7b6,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-01-16T19:35:38.424Z,2025-01-16T19:35:38.424Z,,,,,,,,,
