6793cc31d3b815f599f64d8d,OLUWAYEMISI TESLEEMAH OLADOSU,+23408029958684,oladosuoluwayemisi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am writing to express my interest in joining your organization as a Software Engineer. With a strong foundation in full-stack web development, specializing in both frontend and backend technologies, I am confident in my ability to add value to your team and contribute to the success of your projects.\n\nIn my recent role as a Software Engineer at Goufer PLC, I have gained hands-on experience building dynamic, user-focused web applications using React.js and Django. I collaborated closely with cross-functional teams to design scalable architectures and was involved in every stage of the development lifecycle, from initiation to deployment. One of my key achievements was creating an event dashboard that streamlined the scheduling and management of events, enhancing efficiency and user engagement. I also utilized GitHub for version control and maintained a live Google Cloud environment for testing and continuous integration.\n\nAt Pure Works/Marzwell Schools, I further honed my skills in monitoring and enhancing application performance. I worked closely with developers and stakeholders to align technical implementations with business objectives, consistently delivering high-quality solutions. My approach is to stay updated on industry trends to ensure the delivery of technically sound and innovative solutions.\n\nMy experience in frontend development using React.js and Tailwind CSS has equipped me with the ability to create intuitive and aesthetically pleasing interfaces. I am passionate about delivering seamless user experiences that are both functional and visually engaging.\n\nWhat excites me about your organization is its commitment to innovation and excellence in technology. I am eager to bring my expertise in full-stack development, API integration, and cloud-based environments to support your team’s goals and contribute to ongoing success.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experience align with your needs. I am available for an interview at your convenience and can be reached at +234 802 995 8684 or via email at oladosuoluwayemisi@gmail.com.\n\nMy portfolio can also be reached at:\n https://oluwayemisi-oladosu-portfolio.netlify.app\n\nBest regards,\nOluwayemisi Oladosu",https://oluwayemisi-oladosu-portfolio.netlify.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1737739309483_1_SE-OLUWAYEMISI_OLADOSU.pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2025-01-24T17:21:53.605Z,2025-01-24T17:21:53.605Z,,,,,,,,,
