6793cd84d3b815f599f64e70,Wonders Victor,+2348113359915,wondersprince1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"After completing an intensive Software Engineering program at ALX Africa, I have honed my skills in full-stack web development, algorithm optimization, and collaborative project execution. My technical proficiency includes expertise in Python, JavaScript, Typescript, and C, alongside frameworks like React.js, Next.js, and backend frameworks like NestJs and Flask, and databases like MySQL and MongoDB. Additionally, my experience with version control systems such as Git and GitHub has equipped me to thrive in team-oriented environments.\n\nIn two of my recent projects:\nNest Store: Using NestJS, I built a robust backend application designed for efficient and scalable e-commerce operations. I implemented comprehensive API documentation using Postman, and end-to-end testing using Jest ensuring ease of use for developers and stakeholders. \nWorld Explore: Leveraging ReactJs, Next.js and TypeScript, I created an interactive platform to explore country data, demonstrating my skills in frontend development and API integration.\n\nBeyond technical expertise, I bring strong problem-solving abilities cultivated during my academic journey as a Mechanical Engineering graduate, where I ranked second best in my class with a CGPA of 4.12/5. Collaborating on projects like designing and fabricating a cowpea dehulling machine has ingrained in me a methodical approach to tackling challenges—a quality I carry into software development.\n\nThank you for considering my application. I welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experiences and skills align with your needs. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to Tobams Group's success and would be honored to be part of your innovative team.",https://wondahs.vercel.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1737739649457_Wonders Victor Frontend Developer.pdf,672dfb22862b0900d0d7e03d,Frontend Developer Intern,2025-01-24T17:27:32.949Z,2025-01-24T17:27:32.949Z,,,,,,,,,
