67aca53c32dcb314ee6dd6e4,Osegie INEGBENOSE,+23408080407836,ojayis@yahoo.co.uk,Nigeria,"Hello! I’m Osegie Inegbenose, a web developer with a strong background in Computer Science. Here are some key points about me:\n• Background: I hold a Bachelor of Science degree in Computer Science from Babcock University, where I gained practical experience through internships and hands-on projects.\n• Coding Enthusiast: I’ve spent over eight years honing my skills in various programming languages, including Java, Python, and front-end development languages (HTML, CSS, JavaScript). Solving complex problems and creating elegant solutions is my passion.\n• Web Design Expertise: As a web developer, I’ve customized WordPress themes, optimized websites for speed and SEO, and collaborated with designers on successful projects like the Adjuvare Laws Website and the Kuddy Cosmetics E-commerce Website.\n• Continuous Learning: I believe in lifelong learning. Whether it’s staying updated on the latest web development frameworks or mastering content management systems like WordPress and Shopify, I’m always eager to expand my knowledge.\n• Team Player: Collaboration and teamwork are essential to me. I’ve worked with diverse teams, from marketing to IT, and thrive in an environment where ideas flow freely.\n• Driving Force: Excellence drives me. I aim to create user-friendly, visually appealing websites that leave a lasting impression. I’m also passionate about SEO and digital marketing.\n• Outside the Code: When I’m not coding, you’ll find me blogging on my website (sejaypages.wordpress.com) or connecting with professionals on LinkedIn (www.linkedin.com/in/ose-jay). I’m also an avid driver with over ten years of experience and a valid driver’s license.\nFeel free to reach out to me at ojayis@yahoo.co.uk if you’d like to discuss web development, collaborate on projects, or simply chat about technology. Let’s connect!\n","osegie.com.ng, https://sejaysportfolio.framer.website/, https://sejay.webflow.io",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1739367735530_PDF of My Updated Resume.pdf,67a4a9801cbc13cfa96200dc,Wordpress Developer Intern,2025-02-12T13:42:20.253Z,2025-02-12T13:42:20.253Z,,,,,,,,,
