67af7e9ccd5ffcbe9f475101,Destiny Adebayo,+23407044882138,kingdeeyfx@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a problem-solver who builds digital tools for humans, not just screens. For five years, I’ve worked behind the scenes to turn clunky processes into smooth experiences—like helping busy teams save hours on tasks they used to dread, or making sure a small business owner in Lagos can manage their work without tech headaches.\n\nMy story started here in Nigeria, where I taught myself to code by trial, error, and endless curiosity. Now, I collaborate with teams across the globe, but my focus stays the same: creating things that make life easier, not more complicated.\n\nWhat drives me? The “aha” moments. Like when a client says, “Wait, this actually works?” or a teammate high-fives me because we finally cracked a stubborn challenge. I thrive on those tiny wins.\n\nOutside of work, I’m the friend who’ll drag you into a debate about the future of tech in Africa—not with jargon, but with stories. Because to me, technology isn’t about code; it’s about people.\n\nWhy Tobams? Because I want to grow roots in a team that believes Africa’s talent isn’t just “rising”—it’s already here, ready to shine. Let’s build tools that matter, together.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1739554456557_Destiny Adebayo (2).pdf,67a4a9801cbc13cfa96200dc,Wordpress Developer Intern,2025-02-14T17:34:20.419Z,2025-02-14T17:34:20.419Z,,,,,,,,,
