67af7f9acd5ffcbe9f475134,Emeka Ugoala,+2348085788743,ugoalaemekaprince@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a passionate WordPress developer with experience in designing and building responsive websites. I have a background in frontend development, and I specialize in customizing WordPress themes, developing plugins, and optimizing website performance. My experience includes working with page builders like Elementor and Gutenberg, as well as custom coding in PHP, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. I am eager to apply my skills in a professional setting and learn from the experienced team at Tobams Group\nTobams Group caught my attention because of its commitment to digital innovation and WordPress development. I want to be part of a team that builds impactful websites and applications. This internship presents a great opportunity for me to sharpen my skills, gain hands-on experience, and contribute meaningfully to real-world projects\nI have worked on several WordPress projects, including personal blogs, business websites, and e-commerce platforms. For example, I built a portfolio website using Elementor, customized a WooCommerce store for a local business, and created a custom plugin that adds a user review system to a website. These projects helped me improve my skills in theme customization, plugin development, and website optimization",https://ugoalaemekaportfolio.netlify.app/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1739554710811_Emeka Ugoala Software Developer Graphics Designer_20250124_132534_0000-1-1.pdf,67a4a9801cbc13cfa96200dc,Wordpress Developer Intern,2025-02-14T17:38:34.637Z,2025-02-14T17:38:34.637Z,,,,,,,,,
67af8005cd5ffcbe9f475145,Oragwa Nnaemeka Collins,+2349031396331,Nnaemekaoragwa@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a dedicated and results-oriented WordPress developer with 3 years of experience in building dynamic and user-friendly websites. I specialize in developing customized themes, plugins, and solutions tailored to clients' specific needs. My expertise spans front-end and back-end development, which allows me to create seamless, responsive websites with optimized performance.\nI have extensive experience working with the WordPress ecosystem, including themes, plugins, and various page builders, to help businesses build a strong online presence. I’m also well-versed in coding languages such as PHP, JavaScript, HTML, and CSS, and I always strive to follow best practices to ensure clean and maintainable code.\nBeyond technical skills, I have a passion for user experience (UX) and strive to create websites that are intuitive, visually appealing, and easy to navigate. I’m a firm believer in the importance of collaboration and communication, which is why I enjoy working closely with clients to understand their goals and deliver solutions that meet and exceed their expectations.\nI’m constantly exploring new tools and technologies in the WordPress ecosystem to stay up to date with industry trends and improve the websites I develop. Whether I’m building a simple blog or a complex e-commerce site, my goal is always to deliver high-quality, scalable websites that contribute to the success of the businesses I work with.",https://linen-clam-349449.hostingersite.com/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1739554818563_Oragwa Collins Nnaemeka CV.docx,67a4a9801cbc13cfa96200dc,Wordpress Developer Intern,2025-02-14T17:40:21.776Z,2025-02-14T17:40:21.776Z,,,,,,,,,
