67af83e7cd5ffcbe9f475175,Oladotun Olagunju,+23409024643403,olagunjudotunjosh@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Oladotun Olagunju, a conversion-focused web designer on a mission to transform your online presence into a powerful revenue generator — in just two weeks.\n\nMy Expertise:\n🔹 Custom, high-converting website design\n🔹 E-commerce and LMS development\n🔹 Optimized landing page design\n🔹 SEO-optimized web solutions\n\nWhat Sets Me Apart:\n• Results-Driven Approach: My designs don't just look good — they perform. I focus on transforming clicks into customers, directly boosting your bottom line.\n\n• Experience Creation: I don't just build websites; I craft digital experiences that tell your brand's story and resonate with your audience.\n\n• Rapid Turnaround: In today's fast-paced digital world, time is money. I deliver high-quality, conversion-focused websites in just 14 days.\n\n• Tailored Solutions: Whether you're a local business, a tech startup, or a digital course creator, I create web experiences that cater to your specific audience and business goals.\n\nSuccess Story: Recently, I helped a small bakery increase their online orders by 40% in just three months. By creating a user-friendly WordPress site with intuitive navigation and visually appealing design, we transformed their online presence and boosted their bottom line.\n\nClient Testimonial:\n""My bakery's new website has been a game-changer! Within three months, we saw a 40% increase in online orders. The site beautifully showcases our products and makes ordering a breeze for our customers. I couldn't be happier with the results!"" - Satisfied Bakery Owner\n\nMy passion lies in helping small businesses grow by enhancing their online presence. Every website I create is aimed at driving real business results for you.\n\nMy Clients Typically See:\n• 40-150% increase in conversion rates\n• Significant boost in online visibility\n• Enhanced user engagement and satisfaction",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-nort