67b48451797571ab1a6488c8,Ojehomon David ,+2348026452969,davidbusinesscontact10@gmail.com,Nigeria,Soft Skills\n\n1. Emotional intelligence: Empathizing with customers.\n2. Active listening: Understanding customer needs.\n3. Resilience: Handling rejection and bouncing back.\n4. Teamwork: Collaborating with colleagues.\n5. Continuous learning: Staying updated on industry trends.\n," CV  Here are the key highlights for a sales agent's experience, skills, and area of expertise:  *Experience*  1. *Proven sales track record*: Consistently meeting or exceeding sales targets. 2. *Sales industry experience*: Familiarity with industries such as retail, B2B, or e-commerce. 3. *Account management*: Experience managing existing customer relationships. 4. *Sales team leadership*: Leading or mentoring sales teams. 5. *Customer service*: Providing exceptional customer support. 6. *Tech enthusiast *: I know my way around most social media networks and I can manage them very well.   *Skills*  1. *Communication*: Excellent verbal and written communication. 2. *Persuasion*: Ability to negotiate and close deals. 3. *Product knowledge*: In-depth understanding of products/services. 4. *Time management*: Effective prioritization and organization. 5. *Problem-solving*: Resolving customer complaints and objections. 6. *Adaptability*: Flexibility in a fast-paced sales environment. 7. *Technical skills*: Proficiency in CRM software, sales analytics tools. 8. *Data analysis*: Interpreting sales data to inform strategies. 9. *Social media expert*: I know how to use social media to drive more customer awareness and acquisition with the right tools.  *Areas of Expertise*  1. *Sales strategy*: Developing effective sales plans. 2. *Customer relationship building*: Fostering strong customer relationships. 3. *Needs assessment*: Identifying customer needs and tailoring solutions. 4. *Product demonstrations*: Showcasing products/features. 5. *Objection handling*: Addressing customer concerns. 6. *Closing deals*: Negotiating and finalizing sales. 7. *Sales forecasting*: Predicting sales trends and performance. 8. *Competitor analysis*: Understanding market competition.  Soft Skills  1. Emotional intelligence: Empathizing with customers. 2. Active listening: Understanding customer needs. 3. Resilience: Handling rejection and bouncing back. 4. Teamwork: Collaborating with colleagues. 5. Continuous learning: Staying updated on industry trends.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1739883598250_DavidOjehomon.pdf,67af2ae8cd5ffcbe9f474fad,Social Media Management Intern,2025-02-18T13:00:01.359Z,2025-02-18T13:00:01.359Z,,,,,,,,,
