67b48ca7b17f5b01182ffe23,Sharon-rose u. okoro,+2348162341538,sharonokoro14@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Sharon-rose Okoro. However I preferred to be called Ari-Ala.\nI am a passionate Business Development Manager with a strong background in driving growth and profitability through strategic partnerships and innovative sales strategies.\n\nI hold a B.Sc. in Computer and Information Sciences from Covenant University, along with certifications in freelancing, leadership development, and grant writing. \n\nOver the past few years, I have co-founded a recycling company, 4Tees Limited, where I successfully sourced financial capital and led marketing efforts to create partnerships with various stakeholders. This experience has honed my abilities in market research, client management, and relationship building, which I believe are essential for any business development role. \nPreviously, I served as the Head of Marketing and Liaison at Zetabrent Education Limited, where I was able to increase the client base significantly and drive revenue growth through effective marketing strategies. \nI have also worked as a Business Development Manager, collaborating closely with executives to develop business plans and enhance company operations. \n I pride myself on being results-oriented and adaptable, with a keen interest in sustainability and impactful projects. I thrive in dynamic environments and enjoy taking on challenges that allow me to leverage my skills and experience to contribute to a team’s success. \n In my spare time, I enjoy travelling, hiking, dancing and reading. I am excited about the possibility of bringing my background in business development to your organization and contributing to its growth.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1739885730657_Sharonâs CV.pdf,67b35613797571ab1a647f1c,Business Development & Marketing Manager,2025-02-18T13:35:35.082Z,2025-02-18T13:35:35.082Z,,,,,,,,,
