67b4ac1cb17f5b01182fff08,Christiantus Akubuiro,+23407036795523,christiantusm21@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am excited to apply for the position of Business Development Manager with over 10 years of experience in the financial Services/Fintech/FMCG business, I am confident that I have the necessary skills and expertise to excel in this role.\n\nAs a skilled sales professional with a fine eye for customer relationships, I am well-positioned to drive the business of Financial Services/Fintech/FMCG. I have a proven track record of developing and deploying strategies that increase sales revenue and hit target quotas for set KPIs such as sales value, volume, and revenue.\n\nI possess excellent communication and interpersonal skills, which enable me to engage with a portfolio of Financial Services/Fintech/FMCG, introduce them to our products, onboard and retain them, and nurture those key relationships over time. I am customer-oriented and possess the ability to adapt and respond to different characters. I am also capable of helping the customers/staffs resolve issues or complaints on the spot or escalate to customer support when necessary.\n\nIn addition to the above, I have a good understanding of the business's products or services and can advise others about them. I am well-versed in monitoring market trends and providing regular competitor feedback.\n\nI am excited about the prospect of joining your organization, and I look forward to contributing to the company's growth and success. Thank you for considering my application.\n\nSincerely, \nChristiantus Akubuiro",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1739893785365_Christiantus Tochukwu Akubuiro Updated CV.docx,67b35613797571ab1a647f1c,Business Development & Marketing Manager,2025-02-18T15:49:48.928Z,2025-02-18T15:49:48.928Z,,,,,,,,,
