ager in the Debt Recovery unit we’ve been to handle the following:\n1. Handled inbound and outbound calls, recovering past payments while providing excellent customer service and engagements.\n2. Negotiated payment arrangements resulting in a substantial increase in debt recovery.\n3. Door to door customer engagement.\n \nI look forward to hearing from you to discuss this opportunity. I’d like to thank you for taking the time to consider my application.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1739918975638_Usman Datti Sabo CV 25'.pdf,67b35613797571ab1a647f1c,Business Development & Marketing Manager,2025-02-18T22:49:41.149Z,2025-02-18T22:49:41.149Z,,,,,,,,,
