67dda92052704580cd9c28f6,John Audu,+23407059528745,finishingwest@gmail.com,Nigeria,"For the past 8 years, I’ve been working as a SharePoint consultant and Business Process Automation at Oceanic Health and Wragby Business Solutions.\nThroughout my career, have always been involve in Enterprise solutions and digital transformation in organizations. \nFor example, when I was working at Wragby business solutions I play a major in digital transformation program of her clients through migration of file from fileshare to SharePoint online and also automate some of their processes. I was also the lead developer that automate all manual processes in Oceanic and build her Intranet SharePoint Site. \n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1742579997717_John Audu Resumes.pdf,67dc0e0ed6fad895d144e2f1,Senior SharePoint Consultant - Developer - Architect,2025-03-21T18:00:00.367Z,2025-03-21T18:00:00.367Z,,,,,,,,,
67e501f9ff314f20375ebee3,Oluchukwu Lilian Okorie,+23407069007845,lilianoly888@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a seasoned international student advisor with track record of results and success. I believe my experience in Edtech, education counseling and student recruitment will be a great fit for this role.",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743061490134_OLUCHUKWU LILIAN. International Student Counsellor - CV.pdf,67e29d10aa2e0899f4399080,Gamification Specialist – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-27T07:44:57.676Z,2025-03-27T07:44:57.676Z,"I believe that gamification can transform children's learning because, children learn easily when it's fun and engaging. I believe with gamification they will be engaged, have fun while actively learning. This is going to broaden and expose them to quality education while enjoying the fun.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743061494943_OLUCHUKWU LILIAN. International Student Counsellor - CV.pdf,,,,,,,
67e517f4ff314f20375ebf1e,Oluwasanmi Olukolatimi ,+2348100862860,elijaholukolatimi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a passionate 3D Animator, Motion Graphics Designer, with extensive experience in the EdTech industry and media technology. Over the years, I have worked with leading EdTech companies such as Teesas Educational and DigitalNest, where I created engaging animated content designed to make learning more interactive and enjoyable for kids.\n\nAt Emmerx, a media tech startup, where I develop high-quality animations, VFX, and immersive media solutions. My expertise spans across animation, storytelling, and creative direction as I am also a lead of a small team, with a strong focus on educational and engaging content.",https://shorturl.at/vCiM3,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743067119346_Olukolatimi's CV(3D Animator).pdf,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-27T09:18:44.511Z,2025-03-27T09:18:44.511Z,"Animation is a powerful tool that transforms learning into an exciting adventure for kids. My experience working with EdTech companies like Teesas Educational and DigitalNest has shown me firsthand how animation can break down complex concepts into engaging, visually interactive experiences. By blending storytelling, character-driven learning, and immersive visuals, I strive to create content that not only educates but also sparks creativity and imagination. My goal is to make learning fun, memorable, and accessible for children, ensuring that every lesson feels like an adventure rather than a task.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743067121888_Oluwasanmi Olukolatimi Cover Letter(Tobams Group).png,,,,,,,
67e526deff314f20375ebf5c,Nwankwo Emeka Emmanuel,+2347033931603,megrij2@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an animator/video editor/ motion graphics designer with a creative mind and a strong visual imagination for creating good animation videos. The ability to draw, digital skills, and use of computer graphics software for creating eye-catching 2d and 3d animations and motion graphics videos. ",https://www.behance.net/emmanuelnwankwo2,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743070939077_Nwankwo Emeka .E. Resume.pdf.pdf,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-27T10:22:22.476Z,2025-03-27T10:22:22.476Z,"Over the years, I have worked in an Edu Tech firm, and with my experience, I have seen the need for digital learning using animation to teach. And how it has helped students in both rural and urban areas to improve in their studies. And also as a father, animated educational videos make it easy for my kids to learn fast. These have made me more passionate about animation when it comes to learning.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743070940594_Application for Animator Position.docx,,,,,,,
