67e52d1aff314f20375ebf9a,Mona Mohamed hassan ,+201066136789,mona_mohamed89@hotmail.com,Egypt,"\nIm a 3d animator with 6 years of experience ,worked on vfx films , games and stylized cartoons , these are samples of my work\n\nhttps://vimeo.com/878665635\nvfx animation work\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/s/1er156a9nz8iykq/vfx%20showreel%20mona%202.mp4?dl=0\n\n",https://vimeo.com/878665635,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743072535099_c.v-2024.doc,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-27T10:48:58.244Z,2025-03-27T10:48:58.244Z,"I love animation since a very young age , i love creating fun and creative content for children . ",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743072536209_cover letter.docx,,,,,,,
67e53054ff314f20375ebfa9,Saviour Ukobong,+23408069107294,sgukobong@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an Instructional Designer, Learning Strategist, and Gamification Specialist with a passion for transforming traditional learning into engaging, interactive, and impactful experiences. With expertise in LMS management, curriculum development, and game-based learning, I have worked on multiple digital learning projects, integrating gamification strategies to enhance learner motivation and retention.\n\nMy background includes designing learning experiences for children and adults, leveraging AI, analytics, and interactive storytelling to create engaging content. I have experience with various LMS platforms, e-learning tools, and game mechanics, ensuring that learning is not only effective but also fun and rewarding.",https://saviourukobong.my.canva.site/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743073361184_SaviourUkobong_LearningSpecialist.pdf,67e29d10aa2e0899f4399080,Gamification Specialist – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-27T11:02:44.255Z,2025-03-27T11:02:44.255Z,"Gamification in learning is the process of adding elements like rewards, challenges, and achievements to education without making it feel like a traditional game. It is a powerful tool that makes learning more interactive and enjoyable, keeping children engaged while they absorb important knowledge and skills.\nOne of the biggest advantages of gamification is that it taps into children's natural curiosity and enthusiasm for play. When learning feels like an adventure, students are more likely to stay motivated and eager to participate. Simple features like earning badges, unlocking new levels, and receiving rewards provide instant feedback, encouraging students to continue learning.\nBeyond motivation, gamification also helps children remember what they learn. Interactive and engaging activities make information stick better than just reading or listening. Additionally, incorporating challenges and problem-solving tasks allows children to develop critical thinking skills, helping them approach learning with creativity and confidence.\nAnother benefit of gamification is that it can be adapted to suit each child’s individual learning pace. Some students may need extra time to grasp a concept, while others may be ready for more advanced challenges. A gamified learning system can adjust to these differences, ensuring that every child progresses in a way that suits them best.\nI believe that making learning more engaging and rewarding not only makes studying fun but also helps children develop essential life skills, preparing them for success in the future.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743073362436_saviour ukobong - tobams cover letter.docx,,,,,,,
67e53bdcff314f20375ebfd0,Ikechukwu Nwanah Daniel,+23409057578804,diykenwanah25@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Ikechukwu Nwanah is my name, with an educational background in HND Computer science at the Yaba College of Technology. I specialize in both 2d/3d animation. I've have worked remotely for an edutech startup as an animator. I have over three years of experience doing animated videos for edutech.\nI have mastery in most adobe applications as demanded from my craft in animation. Thank you.",INSTAGRAM: @ diykemotion,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743076312760_NWANAH-IKECHUKWU-DANIEL-FlowCV-Resume.pdf,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-27T11:51:56.346Z,2025-03-27T11:51:56.346Z,"I am passionate about using animation to make learning fun for kids because most kids wouldn't like to learn but would like to watch animated stories, so as a lover of knowledgeable kids and an animator, I I see my skill as an animator as a veritable tool to immersing kids to learning great learning experience that goes with lots of fun.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743076314463_COVER LETTER.pdf,,,,,,,
67e53c31ff314f20375ebfd7,Soromidayo Bello,+2348161549613,soromidayobello@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Soromidayo Bello, a passionate illustrator and animator with over 5 years of experience and I’ve always believed that learning should feel like an adventure. Animation has the power to make knowledge feel less like memorization and more like discovery, and that’s exactly the kind of magic I love to create.\n\nWith a background in 2D and 3D animation, I specialize in bringing stories and concepts to life in a way that captivates young minds. Whether it’s crafting engaging characters, designing immersive worlds, or ensuring seamless motion that enhances storytelling, I focus on making every frame an experience. Beyond animation, my skills in illustration and UI/UX design allow me to approach projects with both creativity and strategic thinking, ensuring that visual storytelling is both exciting and effective.\n\nI would love the opportunity to bring my passion and skills to your team and collaborate on projects that inspire and educate kids in unforgettable ways. I have attached my portfolio for your review, and I look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\n",https://soromidayobello.notion.site/Hi-I-m-Soromidayo-94600f27a79f4ae79497bb6775bcf5e0?pvs=4,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743076395508_Soromidayo Bello's Resume.jpg,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-27T11:53:21.118Z,2025-03-27T11:53:21.118Z,"When I was a kid, I didn’t just watch cartoons—I lived in them. I’d imagine I was in each scene, i did the same when i read books, stories felt real to me, and that’s the magic I want to create for kids today. I want learning to feel like an adventure not a chore. And animation can do just that. With animation I can make a talking sponge the most exciting thing in the world. It would be my dream to be able to this for children because little me wishes she had that experience.\n",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743076398251_Cover letter- Soromidayo Bello.jpg,,,,,,,
67e568a26bc12bf3abac26b5,Okoigun Oselumense,+2349059577343,osesokoigun@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a 3d Animator with 3 years experience at Reinansiance Innovator Lab, RESQ as a 3d Designer, and EhizuaHub as a 3d Character Animator Instructor. ",https://youtube.com/@imagineoses8224?si=Pes7eL1BkxDeQGTW,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743087769615_OKOIGUN OSELUMENSE NEHEMIAH CV 3D.docx (2).pdf,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-27T15:02:58.575Z,2025-03-27T15:02:58.575Z,"I am passionate to use animation make learning for kids because, it makes learning faster for them, and as a kid learning based on our traditional methods was difficult for me, I had learned faster whenever I was opportuned to watch Barney, teletubies e.t.c. It made my drive to learn animation ",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743087775066_OKOIGUN OSELUMENSE NEHEMIAH CV 3D.docx (2).pdf,,,,,,,
