67e5c41b6bc12bf3abac270a,Gramso Anthony Madwatte,+2348023778346,gramsoanthony@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Gramso Anthony Madwatte, an animator and graphic designer based in Abuja, Nigeria with a background in computer science. I started animation in 2019 after years of being a freelance graphic designer. I am experienced in motion graphics, game character and asset design, and character animation. ",Behance.net/gramso,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743111190548_CV.pdf,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-27T21:33:15.558Z,2025-03-27T21:33:15.558Z,"I grew up watching a lot of cartoons on TV and those cartoons have been ingrained in my brain for years. A few years ago, I watched a YouTube video essay on the effects of coco melon on kids based on its repetitive nature, catchy music and art style. The video stated the negative effects of such animations on kids and since then I have been trying to find the perfect way to make animations for kids especially to teach kids their local languages through animation without the negative effects stated in the video. ",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743111192621_Cover Letter.pdf,,,,,,,
