67e637f36bc12bf3abac273b,Gustavo Oliveira de Carvalho,+5511945303782,gumegasonic@gmail.com,Brazil,"Hello, my name is Gustavo Oliveira de Carvalho.\n\nI hold a bachelor's degree in Game Design from University Anhembi Morumbi, am living in São Paulo, SP, Brazil, and focus on remote work.\n\nI specialize in 2D animation for games and know how to implement them in a game engine, make them have a good feel in game and produce pseudo-3D effects. I also create VFX.\n\nThe Game Design course was 4 years long, helped me learn how to collaborate with development teams and taught me in many game development areas, like Animation, Game Design, Art, Programming, SFX, Music and Level Design, after the course ended, I continued further studying animation.\n\nI have worked at Sideverse XP for about 2 and a half years, preparing Photoshop files, creating performance optimized character animations on Spine, implementing them in Unity, creating VFX with Shaders and Particle System, animating UI windows and elements and working with avatars in Blender and the Playcanvas game engine as well.",https://gumegasonic.wixsite.com/animation-portfolio,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743140847892_Resume Animation - Gustavo Oliveira.pdf,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-28T05:47:31.505Z,2025-03-28T05:47:31.505Z,"It started when I was working at Sideverse XP, on a project called Educaverso.\n\nEducaverso is meant for schools’ use, to help students create bonds, have fun and reward them for all they have to do for school, the project is not only PC and mobile based, but it also includes VR.\n\nI created all the character animations and some VFX and I was directly involved in the brainstorming, pitches and decisions for Educaverso.\n\nEducaverso was the project from the company that I most enjoyed working with, I remember how it was for me in school and I want to create an amazing environment for children and teenagers to develop in and enjoy.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743140849612_Cover Letter - Gustavo Oliveira - Animator.pdf,,,,,,,
67e67abb6bc12bf3abac27ec,STEPHEN Winifred Ogochukwu,+2349020429374,stephenwinifred3@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an educator. I studied French/English language in the College of Education.(Teacher's Training College). I went further to study French language in the University of Lagos. I bagged BA Hons degree.\nI have been working with French international School, and still work there as an Education Assistant.\nI have worked their for 14 years n ow.\nI will be glad to work with your company if my application is considered, and I will be open to training in the course of job.","Facebook (Ulasi Winifred Ogochukwu) ,tiktok(stephenwinifred1)",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743157933014_WINIFRED EUROPE CV.pdf,67e29d10aa2e0899f4399080,Gamification Specialist – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-28T10:32:27.172Z,2025-03-28T10:32:27.172Z,"I believe strongly that gamification can transform this generation easily because we are in internet age and approaching AI age,  it will go a long way in impacting knowledge to these generations easily.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743157942750_IMG_20240222_093751_745.jpg,,,,,,,
67e6afe06bc12bf3abac282e,Emmanuel Oluwasijibomi BABAFEMI,+23408020851587,emmanuelbabs1103@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I have always been passionate about the intersection of education and technology, and my experience in E-learning design and development has allowed me to explore this passion further. Over the past seven years, I have honed my skills in creating engaging and interactive E-learning experiences that cater to diverse learning styles and objectives across all levels of education.",https://360.articulate.com/review/content/1a762f25-6fd6-4afc-a060-a3e47e1dcf32/review,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743171548455_Emmanuel Babafemi - Resume.pdf,67e29d10aa2e0899f4399080,Gamification Specialist – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-28T14:19:12.211Z,2025-03-28T14:19:12.211Z,"Based on my research in 2014 - 2016, Gamified learning brought about increased engagement and achievement.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743171550413_Cover Letter (E-learning Designer and developer).docx,,,,,,,
67e6b78d6bc12bf3abac283f,Enose Emmanuel Ukhun,+23409034299651,enoseukhun@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an ambitious and passionate animation professional dedicated to transforming education through engaging media. With a Bachelor of Arts in Fine and Applied Arts (Graphic Design) from the University of Benin, I have cultivated expertise in 2D and 3D animation, illustration, character design, and compositing. My experience includes serving as an Animation Director at Animation Apostles, where I led projects that brought complex concepts to life for diverse audiences. Additionally, I contributed as an Animator at Afrilearn, focusing on creating educational content tailored for young learners. Beyond these roles, I have worked as a freelance artist on platforms like Fiverr, delivering a range of creative projects to clients worldwide. My commitment to excellence was recognized when I was named one of the ""Top 25 Emerging Visual Artists"" at the Gaming and Animation Confex presented by Digitalconfex. I am a fast learner, innovative thinker, and effective leader, eager to contribute to initiatives that make learning a magical experience for children.",https://bit.ly/enoseani,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743173513727_Enose Emmanuel Ukhun CV Graphic 2023.PDF,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-28T14:51:57.610Z,2025-03-28T14:51:57.610Z,"I believe animation has the unique ability to transform abstract concepts into vivid, engaging narratives that resonate with children, making complex ideas more accessible and enjoyable. By incorporating storytelling, vibrant visuals, and dynamic characters, animation captivates young learners' imaginations, fostering creativity and a deeper understanding of educational content. This approach not only enhances comprehension but also instills a lifelong love for learning by turning education into an exciting and magical experience.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743173515753_Cover letter Enose Ukhun .docx,,,,,,,
67e6bacf6bc12bf3abac284b,Abdullahi Omowumi Ibraheem ,+2348106286657,abdullahiibraheem1996@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a 3d/2d generalist. I have infinite possibilities even under pressure, Creativity is my strong tuff. ",https://www.instagram.com/mojictech?igsh=ZDF5c2doOXZjanNo,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743174346156_OMOWUMI 3D CV.docx,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-28T15:05:51.349Z,2025-03-28T15:05:51.349Z,I have been a teacher for almost 10 years now and I love the way animation has paved the way for fun and easy engaging learning with really no physical attachment. I want to be among a team who is also as passionate as me.,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743174348833_Screenshot_20250328-160426_Samsung Notes.jpg,,,,,,,
67e6d3f26bc12bf3abac286a,Charles Ikechukwu Ilo ,+23408106832108,charlesdevelops01@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Charles Ikechukwu Ilo, a frontend developer based in Lagos, Nigeria, with four years of experience building modern web applications. I specialize in React, Vue, Next.js, TypeScript, and Tailwind, creating scalable and efficient user interfaces.  \n\nI have a BSc in Computer Science from Coal City University and hold certifications from Udacity and AltSchool School of Engineering. My experience includes working with tools like Mintlify, React Query, and Vercel, and I have a strong understanding of state management using Redux, Context API, and Recoil.  \n\nPassionate about clean code, performance optimization, and intuitive UI/UX, I enjoy collaborating with cross-functional teams to deliver high-quality products. I'm always eager to learn new technologies and contribute to impactful projects.",https://medium.com/@cha,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743180783429_Charles Ikechukwu Ilo - Frontend Developer - 2025.pdf,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-28T16:53:06.834Z,2025-03-28T16:53:06.834Z,"well ,I’m passionate about using animation to make learning magical for kids because it brings stories and concepts to life in a way that’s engaging, fun, and memorable. Animation transforms complex ideas into simple, visually appealing experiences that spark curiosity and creativity. It encourages exploration, making education feel like an adventure rather than a task. Seeing kids light up with excitement while learning through animation is what drives me to create content that inspires, educates, and entertains.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743180784973_charles cover letter.docx,,,,,,,
67e6d6806bc12bf3abac2876,Francis Chukwuemeka Morah ,+23408166246387,francismorah@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"My name is Francis, I am an illustrator and animator. I started with drawing comic books then I went on to teach myself how to animate in 2D. I later went on to study 3D animation and post production. At the heart of it, I love illustrating/ drawing, it's a great way for me to bring my ideas to life and animation is a great icing on that cake for me.",https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/f2ujz2lu1lseg7rr6ytbw/francis-morah-reel-1_1.mp4?rlkey=tb8vsum21krisfoo1l1712sre&st=tzhew2t8&dl=0,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743181436787_MORAH  FRANCIS   CV  for Animation.docx,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-28T17:04:00.337Z,2025-03-28T17:04:00.337Z,"As a kid , animation made learning fun for me. There's a way that colorful characters, who become likable, explain a topic to kids that just makes it stick. To me it's that extra that an ordinary classroom just doesn't add...yes I think of it as magic!  I would love this magic I felt watching some of these animated educational shows as a kid, experienced by the kids around me now through the animated educational shows I would be privileged to create.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743181438035_Francis Morah Cover letter for animator .doc,,,,,,,
67e6d82a6bc12bf3abac287f,FRANCIS ONUZULIKE,+2348134741237,Inspiration_divine2005@yahoo.com,Nigeria,\nI am a film maker and passionate story teller with deep love for animation. I currently work in my studio which I created to serve clients needing animated and motion design jobs and content. I love reading it helps me in storytelling. I work really hard to make my work excellent. I am married and I have two beautiful girls. I look forward to working for you because I know I will be a great asset to your company. I look forward to hearing from you soon.\n,https://youtu.be/72_PJCkM538?si=pobHuWMuPPcWPNgp,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743181863162_C.V FRANCIS ONUZULIKE-2.pdf,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-28T17:11:06.823Z,2025-03-28T17:11:06.823Z,Impacting Children has always been a dream I have carried for a long time. Since these days we don't have very healthy. Educative Children's content like we use to while growing up in the 80s. I also seek to create contents that Children of Africa can relate with like bringing them up to speed with the African Culture. And we know that Children connect well with animation.,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743181864920_MY COVER LETTER.docx,,,,,,,
67e795326bc12bf3abac28e4,Kalu Obinna ,+2349074625518,okalu88@gmail.com,Nigeria,"A passionate and creative photographer with a keen eye for detail and storytelling, combined with a strong background in teaching. Experienced in capturing stunning visuals, editing, and mentoring students in photography and visual arts. Committed to inspiring others through both education and art.\n",,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743230252777_Screenshot_20250329-072537_1.png,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-29T06:37:38.538Z,2025-03-29T06:37:38.538Z,"I love teaching and I love it better when it's made easy. It's easy and fulfilling when the students understand every bit of what I'm trying to say and from my experience, they grasp ideas faster when they watch a well documented video tailored for specific lessons. \nWith my skills, I hope to help many other teachers with creative videos that can break down complex subjects and  topics for their students.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743230256082_Screenshot_20250329-072537_1.png,,,,,,,
67e7d7e56bc12bf3abac290a,Oluwasemilore Ademo,+23407059935116,pelumiademo@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Oluwasemilore Ademo, a passionate game developer, educator, and climate advocate with experience in designing engaging and meaningful gameplay experiences. As the Founder and CEO of PelzStudiolabs, I create games that entertain, educate, and inspire change, blending fun with subtle learning elements.\n\nMy expertise lies in game design, educational content integration, and player engagement strategies. I’ve worked on projects that incorporate interactive storytelling, physics-based mechanics, and behavioral psychology principles to enhance user learning experiences.\n\nBeyond game development, I’m also an educator and mentor, actively volunteering at the Community Innovation Hub, where I teach young people game development, UI/UX, and 3D modeling. My background in education and passion for interactive learning have driven me to explore gamification in children’s education—transforming traditional learning into immersive, engaging experiences that encourage curiosity, problem-solving, and creativity.\n\nI’m excited about opportunities to apply my skills in game mechanics, motivation theory, and digital learning environments to create impactful educational experiences for children.",www.linkedin.com/in/oluwasemilore-ademo-6812051aa,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743247328588_Oluwasemilore Ademo CV.pdf,67e29d10aa2e0899f4399080,Gamification Specialist – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-29T11:22:13.481Z,2025-03-29T11:22:13.481Z,"Gamification has the power to transform children’s learning by making education more engaging, interactive, and effective. By integrating game mechanics like rewards, challenges, and progression systems, learning becomes an exciting journey rather than a task. Gamification taps into children’s natural curiosity and motivation, encouraging problem-solving, creativity, and critical thinking.\n\nMoreover, it enhances retention by turning abstract concepts into hands-on experiences, making learning feel more intuitive and enjoyable. Whether through storytelling, interactive simulations, or adaptive challenges, gamification fosters active participation and a growth mindset—helping children develop skills in a way that feels fun and rewarding.\n\nWhen designed thoughtfully, gamification doesn’t just entertain—it inspires lifelong learning and empowers children to take charge of their education.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743247330647_Oluwasemilore Cover letter.pdf,,,,,,,
67e7eaa76bc12bf3abac2919,Edokpolor Samuel ,+2348162550139,edokpolorsamuel@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a skilled 3D generalist with five years of experience in modeling, animation, and rigging. Proficient in Maya, Photoshop, and Adobe Premiere, you specialize in creating high-quality assets and animations for various industries. My expertise spans from character and environment modeling to rigging and animating fluid, lifelike movements. With a keen eye for detail and a strong sense of storytelling, you bring concepts to life with precision and creativity. Whether it's crafting realistic renders or stylized animations, iI love using animation to make learning exciting and immersive for kids. By blending storytelling with movement and color, I can turn difficult concepts into fun, engaging experiences. Whether it's illustrating history or breaking down science, animation brings ideas to life in a way that captures curiosity and makes lessons stick. The joy of seeing kids truly connect with what they’re learning keeps me inspired to create more.\n ensure top-tier visuals tailored to client needs.\n",https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61573207984586,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743252110863_Blue Simple Professional CV Resume_20250216_104725_0000.pdf,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-29T12:42:15.545Z,2025-03-29T12:42:15.545Z,"I love using animation to make learning exciting and immersive for kids. By blending storytelling with movement and color, I can turn difficult concepts into fun, engaging experiences. Whether it's illustrating history or breaking down science, animation brings ideas to life in a way that captures curiosity and makes lessons stick. The joy of seeing kids truly connect with what they’re learning keeps me inspired to create more.\n",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743252118320_White Simple Job Application Documen A4_20250329_133613_0000.png,,,,,,,
67e8138c6bc12bf3abac2934,Amadi Chijindu Donpaul ,+2348121178162,donpaulamadi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Amadi Donpaul, a dedicated 3D modeler and animator with more than four years of experience crafting compelling visuals. My expertise extends to both 3D and 2D realms, allowing me to provide comprehensive visual solutions. In 3D, I excel in creating high-quality assets and animations using MAYA, ZBrush, and Blender, ensuring efficient project delivery. In 2D, I'm proficient with industry-standard tools like Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, and Clip Studio Paint, enabling me to produce stunning illustrations, textures, and concept art. My focus is on understanding and translating your unique vision into stunning visual realities, whether in 2D or 3D. ",https://jnd_theglitch.artstation.com/,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743262600530_(FREE COPY) Amadi Donpaul Resume.pdf,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-29T15:36:44.825Z,2025-03-29T15:36:44.825Z,"Animation makes learning easy because it's like watching a fun cartoon! When kids see colorful characters and things moving, it grabs their attention and makes them want to learn more. Animation can also tell stories that make learning exciting and help kids remember what they learned. It's like magic, turning boring stuff into something super cool and easy to get!",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743262602248_text.txt,,,,,,,
67e831d06bc12bf3abac294a,Titilope Caroline Oyinade,+23408063028947,carolineoyinade@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Dr Titilope Caroline Oyinade, and I am an education entrepreneur passionate about transforming learning experiences for children. As the founder of Discovery International Academy, I have integrated digital solutions, including TV-based learning for nursery students, to enhance early childhood education. I am also a content creator. My expertise in operations management, combined with my dedication to innovative teaching methods, drives me to explore gamification as a powerful tool to make learning more engaging and impactful. I believe that game-based learning can bridge the gap between traditional education and the digital world, fostering creativity, curiosity, and critical thinking in young learners.",Titilope Caroline Oyinade,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743270348562_Titilope_Caroline Oyinade_CV.pdf,67e29d10aa2e0899f4399080,Gamification Specialist – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-29T17:45:52.672Z,2025-03-29T17:45:52.672Z,"Gamification has the power to revolutionise children's learning by making education interactive, engaging, and fun. By incorporating game elements like rewards, challenges, and storytelling, children become active participants rather than passive learners. This approach enhances motivation, improves retention, and fosters critical thinking skills. Gamification also supports personalised learning, allowing children to progress at their own pace while developing problem-solving abilities. In today’s digital age, integrating play with education bridges the gap between traditional teaching and modern learning needs, ultimately creating a more effective and enjoyable educational experience.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743270350451_Gami Specialist.pdf,,,,,,,
67e878dc6bc12bf3abac2986,Ogbe Itoya,+2348169262216,itoyaunusual@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Ogbe Itoya (Itoyaunusual)\nI’m a 3D generalist, a cinematographer and a non-linear editor. ",http://www.youtube.com/@itoya3062,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743288535060_OGBE_ITOYA.pdf,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-29T22:49:00.382Z,2025-03-29T22:49:00.382Z,"I love 3D animation because of it fascinating way of bringing character to life and make them do what you want them to do. \nI’m passionate about using animation to make learning magical for kids because it’s the easiest and fun way to make them learn and at the same time remember everything they’ve learnt. \nAs a 3D animator and having the power to make character do what I want them to do, it allows me put smiles on the faces of kids. ",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743288537516_3D Animator.pdf,,,,,,,
67e87b3c6bc12bf3abac2993,Charles Ikechukwu Ilo ,+23408106832108,charlesdevelops01@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Charles Ikechukwu Ilo, a frontend developer based in Lagos, Nigeria, with four years of experience in building scalable and user-friendly web applications. I hold a BSc in Computer Science from Coal City University and have earned certifications from Udacity and AltSchool School of Engineering. My expertise includes JavaScript, TypeScript, React, Vue, Next.js, Redux, Tailwind, and Chakra UI. I am passionate about crafting seamless digital experiences, optimizing performance, and collaborating with teams to deliver high-quality products. Outside of work, I enjoy exploring new technologies and continuously improving my skills.",https://medium.com/@cha,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743289144138_Charles Ikechukwu Ilo - Frontend Developer - 2025.pdf,67e29d10aa2e0899f4399080,Gamification Specialist – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-29T22:59:08.183Z,2025-03-29T22:59:08.183Z,"from my understanding, Gamification can transform children's learning by making education more engaging, interactive, and enjoyable. By incorporating game elements like rewards, challenges, and progress tracking, children stay motivated and develop problem-solving skills. It encourages active participation, boosts retention, and fosters a love for learning, making complex subjects easier to understand in a fun and immersive way.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743289145811_charles cover letter.docx,,,,,,,
67e9080bc2324c0dfcf550ee,Sunday Ogbah ,+23408164800447,sonnyogbahferjiro@gmail.com,Nigeria,I'm fascinating 3d character illustration and modeling artist.,https://drive.google.com/file/d/1c0q3_1UKZtm0e5yGplkd_srfgohUQ88k/view?usp=drivesdk,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743325190074_Sunny_ferjiro_ogbah_Portfolio.pdf,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-30T08:59:55.769Z,2025-03-30T08:59:55.769Z,I'm I'm passionate creating stylize character illustration and models.,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743325193509_17433249839694338609819849449201.jpg,,,,,,,
67e92e5ac2324c0dfcf55105,Babale Kume,+23409039061432,kumejnr2@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an exceptional UI/UX Designer with vast knowledge of both App and Web platforms who has worked in various fields, including Fintech, Real Estate, Taxation, Forestry, AI editor platforms, and much more",www.behance.net/kumebabale,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743334992736_Babale Kume.pdf,67e29d10aa2e0899f4399080,Gamification Specialist – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-30T11:43:22.855Z,2025-03-30T11:43:22.855Z,"The idea of games has been a long-time platform that helps sharpen the minds of players. Being a gamer since childhood has reshaped how I tend to think fast and provide solutions. Even in the traditional African way, games are tools our forefathers used to train the minds of children, so I believe when it's been introduced to all learning platforms, they will greatly help build the minds of the next generation. ",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743334999605_Babale Kume.pdf,,,,,,,
67e93b9dc2324c0dfcf5510f,EJIKEME OBI,+23409019534964,obibling@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Throughout my career, I have honed my skills in 3d/2d animations and Designs, ensuring that every task I undertake is completed with meticulous attention to detail and a focus on meeting deadlines. ",https://mega.nz/file/WExDlLJD#vnLnesC57pC8tk1BBdEV_FeyqPAxGpBlFUBm1Rlcd9g,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743338390935_b.s port.pdf,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-30T12:39:57.284Z,2025-03-30T12:39:57.284Z,"As a kid graphical content always amazed me, which inspired me to very creative in my design believing that everything is possible.\n\nI'd like to pass that to the kids.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743338394613_b.s port.pdf,,,,,,,
67e9965cc2324c0dfcf55135,Fagbule Adeola ,+2348139429492,adeolafagbule@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm AdeolaWealth. A passionate video Creator, content creator and video editor. I enjoy editing and creating new video is like bringing imagination to live. So, it makes me feel great and fulfilling. I've been editing and creating for the past 4 years using CapCut, Adobe Premiere Pro, Canva and some other editing apps.",https://youtu.be/xN-yWs-0hLI?si=Hw64mqLvfTsGR34D,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743361623255_Brown Creative Personal Assistant Resume On Resume Template_20240629_122718_20250317_150143_0000-14.pdf,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-30T19:07:08.560Z,2025-03-30T19:07:08.560Z,I'm so passionate about using animation to make learning magical for kids because children love animations. It catches their attention very fast. ,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743361625825_Brown Creative Personal Assistant Resume On Resume Template_20240629_122718_20250317_150143_0000-14.pdf,,,,,,,
67e99a5ec2324c0dfcf55143,Valentine Okoro ,+23407019845539,okorovalentine2014.ov@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Born February 12, 1998, I possess a unique blend of skills, stemming from my Sociology degree at Imo State University, where I also gained graphic design experience. Professionally, I've developed expertise in both animation, showcasing my creative and technical abilities, and data annotation, demonstrating my analytical precision. This diverse background allows me to bridge creative and analytical domains effectively.",https://www.tiktok.com/@pornalia?_t=ZM-8v5tgVa9apr&_r=1,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743362623524_Valentine's CV 25.pdf,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-30T19:24:14.213Z,2025-03-30T19:24:14.213Z,"Animation, for me, is more than just moving images; it’s a powerful medium for storytelling and artistic expression. I'm deeply passionate about the ability to craft narratives that resonate on an emotional level, bringing characters and worlds to life with vibrant visuals and dynamic movement. The art of animation allows me to explore the limitless possibilities of imagination, to convey complex emotions and ideas through a unique and engaging language. The process of building a story, designing characters, and seeing it all come to life on screen is incredibly fulfilling, and I’m driven by the desire to continually push the boundaries of what animation can achieve. Concurrently, Seeing the joy and wonder it brings to children fuels my desire to craft stories and characters that inspire, uplift, and leave a lasting, positive impact. I'm driven by the potential to contribute to their formative years by creating content that sparks curiosity and encourages them to dream big.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743362649927_lv_0_20250324230428.mp4,,,,,,,
