67ead580c2324c0dfcf551e9,Ibrahim Mohammed Shola,+2347036071782,mohammedshola@gmail.com,Nigeria,"*Profile: Mohammed Shola Ibrahim*\n\nMohammed Shola Ibrahim is a visionary leader in the animation industry, serving as the Lead Animator and Chief Executive Officer of Yio Concept Artworks, a company he founded in 2015. With a robust academic background, Shola graduated from the prestigious Federal University of Technology Minna, where he earned his degree in Computer Engineering.\n\nShola’s journey in animation and design is marked by a passion for creativity and education. Initially focused on creating animations, he has since redirected his efforts towards empowering the next generation of animators, offering training programs for youths interested in computer animation. His YouTube channel, which boasts thousands of followers, serves as a testament to his influence and dedication to the craft.\n\nBeyond animation, Shola’s expertise extends to graphic design, motion graphics, and architectural design. His diverse skill set has earned him the opportunity to collaborate with notable organizations, including the Kwara State Internal Revenue Service, Niger State Internal Revenue Service, German Incorporated Service, and the Central Bank of Nigeria. \n\nOne of Shola’s most significant accomplishments is his work on ""The Legend of the Cocoa King,"" a project that gained international recognition, making its way to the American IMDb movie rating and the United States Movie Box.\n\nWith nearly a decade of experience in the industry, Mohammed Shola Ibrahim continues to push the boundaries of what’s possible in animation, inspiring others to follow in his footsteps.",https://youtube.com/@yioconceptartworks?si=NT-_HQfxF3xGLcWw,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743443323141_FULL DETAILED CV MOHAMMED SHOLA IBRAHIM.pdf,67e29f17aa2e0899f439908c,2d and 3d Animator – Educational Interactive Learning,2025-03-31T17:48:48.363Z,2025-03-31T17:48:48.363Z,"I am passionate about using animation to make learning magical for kids because it transforms complex ideas into engaging, visually rich experiences that spark curiosity and imagination. Animation brings stories to life, making education more interactive and enjoyable, especially for young minds. By blending creativity with storytelling, I aim to create content that not only educates but also inspires children to explore, question, and dream beyond the classroom.",https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743443325469_2D and 3D Animator Tobams group.pdf,,,,,,,
67f0c9eec2324c0dfcf55645,Oluwatobi Ilawole,+2340811676967,ilawoletobos@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Oluwatobi Ilawole; I am a dedicated product designer and a proficient framer expert with a BSc background in microbiology. My journey as a product designer started with a deep, profound interest in problem-solving and curiosity concerning how technology influences human interaction. Throughout my career, I have collaborated with various clients and teams, refining my ability to understand user needs and transform them into exceptional designs. I have dedicated numerous years to creating digital experiences that are not only aesthetically pleasing but also functional and intuitive. My design approach emphasizes understanding user needs and addressing complex challenges with creative, user-centric solutions.\n\nWhat excites me most about product design is the opportunity to create meaningful interactions that enhance the way people engage with technology. \n\nWhat distinguishes me as a designer is my ability to seamlessly integrate creativity, analytical thinking, technical proficiency, and leadership experience. As a designer, I don't just design beautiful interfaces; I develop solutions that address real-world challenges while providing outstanding user experiences. My experience with no-code tools like Framer allows me to bring concepts to life faster, making the development process efficient and collaborative. My ability to collaborate effectively and my commitment to continuous learning make me a valuable asset to any team.\n",ilawoletobo.framer.com,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743833572757_Oluwatobi Ilawole main CV 1.pdf,67b35613797571ab1a647f1c,Business Development & Marketing Manager,2025-04-05T06:13:02.830Z,2025-04-05T06:13:02.830Z,Product design role,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1743833578955_Oluwatobi Ilawole main CV 1.pdf,,,,,,,
