68495a8b5ee040e9864c8169,Ayodeji Sontan,+2348144112352,ayodejisontan@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a detail-oriented operations and project support professional with 3+ years of experience coordinating cross-functional teams, managing documentation, and supporting strategic initiatives. I currently work as a Project Coordinator at Hugo, where I've led efforts to improve project quality, streamline processes, and support international product delivery within the AI space.\n\nI started my journey at the ground level. I worked my way up through quality, training, and leadership roles, which has given me a solid understanding of business operations from multiple angles. I’m proficient with tools like Google Workspace, Trello, and Excel, and I enjoy using systems and data to keep projects aligned with business goals.\n\nI’m passionate about growth for organizations and the people within them, and I’m excited about the opportunity at Tobams Group to contribute to your international expansion and operational effectiveness.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/ayodeji-sontan/,,6837261ac04303ad82747d7b,Junior Business Operations Manager,2025-06-11T10:29:31.967Z,2025-06-11T10:29:31.967Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1749637767797_Ayodeji Sontan CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,
