684960e35ee040e9864c821c,John Peter,+23409067870102,johnforpeter9@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello, I’m John Mauwhenu PETER, and I’d say I’m someone who naturally leans toward structure and efficiency. I enjoy organizing chaos, spotting what’s not working, and finding better ways to make things run smoother. My background is in Employment Relations and Human Resources Management, and over time I’ve built hands-on experience through internships in operations and support, from coordinating internal processes to keeping track of day-to-day deliverables.\n\nSome of my core strengths include task management, communication, using tools like Notion, Trello, or Excel, and making sure things don’t fall through the cracks. I’ve also worked on things like team coordination, documentation, and reporting, so I’m comfortable juggling multiple moving parts.\n\nRight now, I’m looking for a role where I can keep growing, contribute to real business impact, and support a team in delivering results efficiently. I’m very execution-driven, I ask questions when needed, and I like taking initiative, especially when there’s room to improve how things are done.",,,6837261ac04303ad82747d7b,Junior Business Operations Manager,2025-06-11T10:56:35.223Z,2025-06-11T10:56:35.223Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1749639392258_Peter John Mauwhenu MAIN RESUME.pdf,Applied,,,,,
