684972b95ee040e9864c83c8,Moromoluwa Olusanjo ,+2349020641562,moromoluwa.olusanjo@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nIn my previous role as a Product Officer and Customer Support Lead at Access Holdings, one of Nigeria's largest financial institutions, I was responsible for coordinating internal product updates and ensuring smooth operations across multiple teams.\n\nI was tasked with improving customer experience while also streamlining product processes and documentation—especially during the rollout of a new digital banking platform. We needed to reduce negative feedback and improve CSAT scores significantly.\n\nI collaborated with cross-functional teams—product, IT, operations, and customer service—to revamp internal SOPs, develop user-friendly training documentation, and manage support tickets to identify recurring issues. I also coordinated the internal communication of updates to ensure seamless adoption of the new system across branches.\n\nAs a result, we reduced negative customer feedback by over 40% within the first quarter post-launch, improved our Customer Satisfaction (CSAT) score to 93% year-to-date, and streamlined internal operations for faster ticket resolution. This experience sharpened my ability to manage operations, coordinate with stakeholders, and drive measurable outcomes—skills I am excited to bring to Tobams Group as you scale your international expansion and launch strategic projects like Recycled Learning.",,,6837261ac04303ad82747d7b,Junior Business Operations Manager,2025-06-11T12:12:41.622Z,2025-06-11T12:12:41.622Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1749643958755_Product Moromoluwa Olusanjo CV-1.pdf,Applied,,,,,
