684992be8562ff36006db9c1,Aderogbin Abiola,+23408061137970,agunbiadeabiola93@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Abiola Aderogbin. A graduate of Obafemi Awolowo University and an expert in improving customer experiences to improve the overall business process\n\nMy background is in business operations and customer service, and in my current role as an Operations Lead at a law firm, I manage daily operations, support cross-functional teams, and help streamline processes to ensure smooth delivery of services.\n\nOne thing that has always driven me is my natural ability to organize, simplify tasks, and create structure where things may seem overwhelming. I enjoy solving day-to-day challenges and finding practical ways to make things work better , whether it's coordinating teams, managing client requests, or improving internal workflows.\n\nOutside of work, I’m someone who enjoys continuous learning . I’ve recently started reading more widely and exploring topics that help me develop both professionally and personally. I see this as part of my broader goal to grow into a stronger operations professional, improve my strategic thinking, and ultimately contribute to organizations in a more meaningful way.",,,6837261ac04303ad82747d7b,Junior Business Operations Manager,2025-06-11T14:29:18.292Z,2025-06-11T14:29:18.292Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1749652155523_ADEROGBIN_Abiola_Resume_May2025.docx,Applied,,,,,
684992e38562ff36006db9cb,Mercy Alemenzohu,+2348089853701,alemenzohumercy@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a customer service and operations professional with over four years of hands-on experience across logistics, transport, and virtual support. I started my career managing face-to-face customer relations in the transport and logistics space, where I handled high-volume inquiries, resolved client issues, and supported business operations.\nOver time, I grew into roles that also involved business development, dispatch coordination, and marketing support which helped to sharpen my communication, problem-solving, and multitasking skills.\n\nMost recently, I’ve worked remotely as a Virtual Assistant, supporting clients with admin tasks, project coordination, social media management, and CRM tools like HubSpot, Zoho CRM and Trello. This has made me highly comfortable working in digital environments and delivering consistent, high-quality support without direct supervision.",,,6837261ac04303ad82747d7b,Junior Business Operations Manager,2025-06-11T14:29:55.107Z,2025-06-11T14:29:55.107Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1749652191482_Mercy Alemenzohu CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,
