684993948562ff36006db9ec,Erowo Joseph-Ogeh,+447424106179,erowoogeh@gmail.com,Nigeria,"A career goal of mine has always been to produce impactful work, making a difference through technology, innovation and influencing society for the better. Also, I am passionate about tackling real world problems through technology and strategy. \n\nI am a results-oriented professional with a solid foundation in strategy, technology, operations and data-driven decision-making. I have a bachelors degree in real estate and a masters in management. Also, I have a proven track record of delivering impactful solutions through cross-functional collaboration, innovation, research, and data analysis in venture capital, business consulting and business development. Furthermore, I am passionate about operations and technology with a strong interest in leveraging generative AI, technical expertise and strategic thinking to produce meaningful outcomes.     ",,,6837261ac04303ad82747d7b,Junior Business Operations Manager,2025-06-11T14:32:52.858Z,2025-06-11T14:32:52.858Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1749652370115_ErowoJosephOgehCV_(TG).pdf,Applied,,,,,
