6849961e8562ff36006dba42,Kelechi Nwokeohuru,+2348166660111,nwokeohurukelechi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m an experienced operations and support professional with a strong background in driving efficiency, streamlining workflows, and leading cross-functional initiatives. Over the years, I’ve held roles that span customer support, operations analysis, and team coordination across diverse industries and international markets.\n\nMost recently, as a Customer Support Shift Manager at Deel, I’ve managed a team of over 50 specialists across 10 countries, optimizing staffing with workforce management, reducing average response times by 20%, and improving customer satisfaction by 35% through data-informed process improvements. My experience also includes designing automation workflows, collaborating with cross-functional teams, and using tools like Power BI, Notion, Zendesk, and Jira to generate insights that support key business decisions.\n\nBefore joining Deel, I worked as an Operations Analyst at Helium Health, where I led the creation and implementation of multiple operational projects, enhanced compliance monitoring through the use of dashboards, and presented workflow analysis reports that directly informed executive decisions.\n\nAcross all my roles from Bolt Technologies to Data-Link Survey Services, I’ve consistently focused on solving operational bottlenecks, improving team performance, and using data to drive strategic initiatives. I’m passionate about creating scalable systems and contributing to continuous improvement efforts, which is why I’m excited about stepping into a Junior Operations Manager role.\n\n",,,6837261ac04303ad82747d7b,Junior Business Operations Manager,2025-06-11T14:43:42.353Z,2025-06-11T14:43:42.353Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1749653019670_Nwokeohuru-Resume (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,
