684996778562ff36006dba56,Omolori Onaolapo Chidera,+2349071030525,onaola.omolori@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Thank you for the opportunity to apply for the Junior Operations Manager role at your company. I’m Omolori Onaolapo Chidera, an operations focused professional with a strong foundation in IT project management and software engineering. Currently, I work at the intersection of product engineering and operations helping teams stay aligned, projects run smoothly, and business goals translate into execution.\n\nInterestingly, my journey into tech started from a completely different path. I studied Microbiology during my undergraduate years, but over time, I developed a deep interest in how technology solves real-life problems. That curiosity led me to start taking online courses, and eventually, I enrolled at GomyCode, where I built strong foundational skills in software development and product thinking.\n\nSince then, I’ve grown through roles like Product Intern, Product Analyst, and most recently, Product Associate. In my last role, I successfully led the development and launch of an event management system. I began by identifying users' pain points, collaborated closely with engineers and stakeholders, and ensured the final product was aligned with business goals and operational needs.\n\nToday, I thrive in cross-functional environments where I can turn complex business needs into practical, efficient solutions especially in regulated and fast-moving spaces. I’m looking for a role where I can continue to make operations smoother, drive impact through collaboration, and grow alongside a forward-thinking team.\n\n",,,6837261ac04303ad82747d7b,Junior Business Operations Manager,2025-06-11T14:45:11.795Z,2025-06-11T14:45:11.795Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1749653108711_Omolori Onaolapo Bussiness operation manager.pdf,Applied,,,,,
