6849cfa28562ff36006dbe67,Miracle Nebo,+2347033820966,nebomiraculous@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Miracle Nebo, a Project Manager and Operations Analyst. I have over three years work experience across Civil Engineering, Mobility Management and a strong foundation in Telecommunications. \n\nI have picked up skills in Microsoft 365 administration, Microsoft excel, Google suite, SQL, data cleaning/visualization, pattern recognition, customer relation and project management over time. I am able to draw accurate conclusions, manage a team and make good recommendations. I completed the Google Data Analytics certificate, a hands-on training for effective data analysis.\n\nI interned at Bolt as Operations intern and was trained on the day-to-day workings of Bolt company with the use of excel and google suite for product projection, data analysis and to push operations. My graduate internship as a Junior Civil Engineer was at Ove Arup and Partners Nigeria Limited, where I did structural design, analysis and project management of commercial, residential, institutional, and industrial projects . I worked as a Network Surveillance Specialist (NOC) with IPT Powertech Group and currently working as Operations Engineer with IHS Towers. I am actively involved in the management of six maintenance teams, resolution of power outages in over 120 telecom sites, asset management, supply chain support in diesel and asset logistics and documentation, landlord/customer relations, fault escalation and resolution. I am certain that my strengths make me an excellent fit for consideration and I am confident that it would be a great opportunity for me to further grow both personally and professionally.\n* I am a proactive, self-motivated and fast learning manager\n* Able to state a business task clearly\n* Able to import data from a real dataset\n* Skilled in delivering quality and quality control \n* Experienced in analyzing data and creating clear business tasks\n* Ability to summarize key findings from analysis\n* Skilled in documenting conclusions and recommendations\n* Able to resort to innovative techniques to achieve goals .\n* Efficient in connecting people, products, processes, partnerships, and performance\n* Excellent analytical and quantitative skills.\n* Passion for technology, startups, and impact-driven investing.\n* Strong communication skills with customer-facing experience",http://linkedin.com/in/miracle-nebo-3b9447113,,6837261ac04303ad82747d7b,Junior Business Operations Manager,2025-06-11T18:49:06.527Z,2025-06-11T18:49:06.527Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1749667743711_Miracle Nebo - Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
