684a29bc8562ff36006dbf77,Busayo Timileyin Akomolede,+23408148588600,akomoledebusayotimi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"""I'm a graduate of the University of Lagos with 3 years experience in administrative, I'm a results-driven and organized professional with experience in operations management also. I've successfully managed teams, streamlined processes, and improved efficiency in my previous roles. I'm excited about the opportunity to bring my skills and expertise to this position and contribute to the company's success. I'm a strong communicator, problem-solver, and team player, and I'm confident that I would be a valuable asset to your team",,,6837261ac04303ad82747d7b,Junior Business Operations Manager,2025-06-12T01:13:32.259Z,2025-06-12T01:13:32.259Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1749690809396_Busayo Timileyin AKOMOLEDE admin.pdf,Applied,,,,,
684a33598562ff36006dbf82,Maureen Anayo ,+2347035184670,maureenanthony95@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Maureen Anayo, and I’m a dedicated administrative professional with over five years of experience in office management, customer service, and executive support. Throughout my career, I’ve been intentional about creating order, building trust, and making sure that internal operations flow smoothly—because I believe that excellence behind the scenes empowers every part of a business to thrive.\n\nCurrently, I serve as a Branch Manager and Administrative Officer, where I lead day-to-day operations, oversee team coordination, and ensure that clients receive timely and effective service. One of the things I’m most proud of is how my work has directly contributed to improved customer satisfaction and staff performance, which speaks to my deep commitment to both people and process.\n\nWhat drives me is the opportunity to be a dependable pillar in any organization—someone who not only handles tasks efficiently but also supports a culture of excellence, care, and professionalism. That’s exactly why I’m excited about the possibility of joining Tobams Group. I’m drawn to your company’s reputation for integrity and innovation, and I believe my skills and values align strongly with your vision.\n\nI’m eager to bring my administrative expertise, problem-solving ability, and team-first mindset to your organization—contributing meaningfully to your goals and continuing to grow in a space where purpose and performance go hand in hand.",,,6837261ac04303ad82747d7b,Junior Business Operations Manager,2025-06-12T01:54:33.462Z,2025-06-12T01:54:33.462Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1749693270419_MAUREEN ANAYO ADMINISTRATION AND CUSTOMER SERVICE CV.docx,Applied,,,,,
684a529f8562ff36006dbfa6,Hasir Saidalavi Koya,+97470248134,hasirsk96@gmail.com,Qatar,"I am a business operations professional with a Master's in Management specializing in Business Consulting. I am driven by a passion for optimizing processes and contributing to impactful business performance, which is why I am so drawn to Tobams Group and its mission to bridge educational gaps with the ""Recycled Learning"" initiative.\nMy experience aligns well with the operational and strategic needs of this role. As a consultant for a B2B SaaS startup, I led the development of a full business plan and conducted extensive market research to establish a strong brand position for their European launch. This has given me direct experience in supporting product expansion, a key aspect of this position. More recently, I led a comprehensive feasibility study for a large-scale energy project, where I was responsible for everything from site identification and financial analysis to developing the project implementation and expansion strategies.\nOn the operational side, I have a proven track record of improving efficiency and reducing costs. At UPL Limited, I optimized supply chain procedures and, after a detailed review, managed a logistics contract transfer that cut costs by 19%. At a previous role with RAWA Trading & Contracting, my focus on optimizing operations and analyzing market trends contributed to a 28% cost reduction and a 125% increase in revenue. I am proficient in creating detailed reports, managing documentation, and using tools like SAP and Microsoft 360 to support these efforts.\nI am confident that my blend of experience in strategic planning, international market analysis, and hands-on operational management makes me a strong candidate to support your team. I am eager to help drive the growth of initiatives like ""Recycled Learning"" and contribute to the success of Tobams Group.",,,6837261ac04303ad82747d7b,Junior Business Operations Manager,2025-06-12T04:07:59.048Z,2