687927bc96f7feb4a66cc11a,Kehinde Samuel,+23408056042341,saheyikehinde12@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a versatile digital professional with proven experience as a social media manager, graphic designer, and WordPress website developer. Over the years, I’ve worked with brands across different industries, from healthcare to fashion and digital art, helping them build their online presence, engage audiences, and drive measurable results.\nAs a social media manager, I’ve successfully planned and executed content strategies for organizations like Celltek Healthcare Medical Center, Cosmoblackk, and Light and Shade Art Academy. I specialize in organic growth, result-driven advertising, and multi-platform management, creating engaging content tailored to Facebook, Instagram, and LinkedIn. I’m proficient in Meta Business Suite, content scheduling tools, and analytics, all of which I use to optimize campaigns and increase brand visibility.\nMy background as a graphic designer allows me to produce visually compelling assets, including carousels, flyers, reels, and short-form videos. I’m skilled with design tools like Canva and Adobe tools, and I understand how to align visual content with a brand’s identity and message to create a lasting impression.\nOn the technical side, I’m also a WordPress website developer with hands-on experience building and managing websites, troubleshooting backend issues, and improving site security and performance. I’ve resolved SSL (Secure Socket Layer) errors, improved site responsiveness, and implemented SEO basics. ensuring that a brand's website supports its social presence seamlessly.\nI’m passionate about creating a strong digital footprint for the brands I work with, combining creativity, strategy, and tech know-how to deliver results. I’m excited about bringing my all-in-one digital expertise to your team and contributing to your growth.",https://www.canva.com/design/DAGjMOA0lok/URLOhwBq_uO75o9dKXLdFg/view?utm_content=DAGjMOA0lok&utm_campaign=des