68a724667d811edda3bfa063,Sunday Samuel Buraimoh,+23408164454289,Sambrymoh20@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Buraimoh Samuel Sunday, a business management and analysis professional with a background in chemical engineering. Over the past few years, I’ve built expertise in process automation, trade finance, treasury operations, and reconciliation, working at First Bank Nigeria and now Union Systems Limited. I’ve had the privilege of leading impactful projects, such as co-developing Kachasi, Nigeria’s first indigenous trade finance solution, and implementing a centralized reconciliation system at First Bank that improved transparency and efficiency. I’m recognized for my ability to merge technical insight with business needs—designing solutions that drive cost savings, compliance, and operational excellence. Beyond work, I enjoy volunteering, language learning, and writing, which keep me grounded and curious. At my core, I’m passionate about solving problems that make systems run better and people’s work easier.",,,68a6eadb7d811edda3bf9ecc,Business Analyst Associate,2025-08-21T13:51:34.100Z,2025-08-21T13:51:34.100Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1755784290521_Buraimoh Samuel Sunday Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
