68a729e77d811edda3bfa0aa,Michael Otu,+23408160384039,mcotu08@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Data Scientist with 2+years of experience as a Data Professional, where I have developed expertise in utilizing data to drive business solutions for success through insights.\nIn my most recent role at Infinion, I have developed several data-driven solutions such as a Transaction categorization engine which was implemented into Wema ALAT mobile banking app, built forecasting models for sales and price projection with over 90% accuracy, portfolio optimization using statistical modelling to maximize returns and minimize risk, and created interactive Power BI dashboards for real-time visualization and supporting executive decision-making. My work has directly improved operational efficiency, enhanced financial insight delivery, and enabled more informed strategic planning for fintech and banking clients. Additionally, my academic background, culminating in an M.Sc. in Executive Data Science Management, has equipped me with a strong understanding of business information systems, big data management, and business intelligence tools, aligning closely with the core skills sought in this program.\nI am proficient in Python programming, Machine learning and Statistical modelling, and several Microsoft tools such as MS Office, advanced experience in Azure, Microsoft SQL Server, Power BI, Tableau and Microsoft Fabrics. Alongside my technical expertise, I combine strong soft skills like stakeholder engagement, effective communication, collaboration, adaptability, and analytical thinking to name a few, qualities I believe will add value beyond the requirements of the position.\n",,,68a6eadb7d811edda3bf9ecc,Business Analyst Associate,2025-08-21T14:15:03.342Z,2025-08-21T14:15:03.342Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1755785700222_Otu Michael Chizaram CV (2).docx,Applied,,,,,
