68a72cab7d811edda3bfa0d1,Ndulue Obinna Uzodinma,+23408114568889,ndulue.uzodinma@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I started my career as a product designer, where I focused on understanding user needs, mapping customer journeys, and turning insights into intuitive product experiences. Over time, I became more involved in defining requirements, analyzing customer data, and working closely with cross-functional teams to prioritize features—which naturally transitioned me into a product management role. In that role, my work was very much aligned with business analysis: gathering and documenting requirements, conducting market and competitor analysis, evaluating technical feasibility with engineering, and ensuring every initiative tied back to measurable business outcomes. This mix of design thinking and analytical product experience allows me to bridge user needs with business goals and deliver solutions that are both customer-centric and commercially viable.",https://obinnadotcom.framer.website/,,68a6eadb7d811edda3bf9ecc,Business Analyst Associate,2025-08-21T14:26:51.786Z,2025-08-21T14:26:51.786Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1755786408484_Ndulue Obinna Product Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
68a72df97d811edda3bfa0ed,Blessing Achimugu,+23408063692922,blessingachimugu29@gmail.com,Nigeria,"With over six years of experience across customer service, data analysis, and administrative roles, including a solid foundation in financial operations from my time at Sterling Bank Plc, I bring a unique combination of analytical rigor and frontline banking insight to support data-driven decision-making.\nSince transitioning into data analytics, I have expanded my technical capabilities through hands-on roles and formal training. As a Data Analyst Associate at Datafied Technologies, I performed data cleaning, exploratory analysis, and dashboard creation using Python, SQL, Tableau, and Excel. I collaborated with cross-functional teams to translate complex data into actionable insights, a critical asset I believe will be beneficial in assessing creditworthiness and supporting loan portfolio analysis. At my present role, I also conduct research on different topics to provide our clients with relevant information that is useful to their business.\n",,,68a6eadb7d811edda3bf9ecc,Business Analyst Associate,2025-08-21T14:32:25.787Z,2025-08-21T14:32:25.787Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1755786743016_Blessing_Achimugu_Data_Analyst_CV.docx (1) (1) (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,
