68a780547d811edda3bfa333,Sinmiloluwa Afeniki Ayoola,+2347040310152,ayoola.sinmiloluwa@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Thank you for the opportunity to talk a bit about myself. I’m Sinmiloluwa Afeniki Ayoola, a graduate of landmark university with a bachelors degree in Computer Science. \n\nI currently work as a Data Analyst and Digital Marketer at Luday, a SaaS company. In this role, I conduct competitor analysis to help shape products like our ongoing Trello-like product, comparing product features, analyzing customer satisfaction, and identifying competitor pain points to define our unique selling proposition. I also analyze our online presence through SEO and social media data, which led to a data-driven strategy that grew our LinkedIn page by 74%. In less than a year.\n\nPrior to that I was opportune to carryout my service year at Norrenberger Pensions where I worked with different departments. I worked with the ICT, Archive and Operations department. In the Operations department which was my last place of duty, I worked with the data entry and reconciliation team. I made use of financial application called Fund Fusion and along sound Excel, where I made use of functions like VLOOKUP, Conditional Functions like IFs, Sum…etc. Together with the team I worked with, we achieved a 50% reduction in the reconciliation account and alongside a 30% increase in pension data entry and successful registrations.\n\nI am a dedicated learner, passionate about self development and committed to making positive contributions wherever I work.\n\nIn the next 5 years, I aim to  advance to an expert level in data science and artificial intelligence, building world changing models to simplify lots of complex processes.",https://afeniki.github.io/My_latest_portfolio/,,68a6eadb7d811edda3bf9ecc,Business Analyst Associate,2025-08-21T20:23:48.120Z,2025-08-21T20:23:48.120Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1755807825112_Updates Resume- Ayoola Sinmiloluwa .pdf,Applied,,,,,
