68aa15597d811edda3bfa640,Jeffrey Irukeh,+23407031184549,jirukeh@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Ajiri, a frontend developer with over three years of experience building user-friendly and scalable applications. Most of my work has been with React and Next.js, where I’ve delivered projects like MenuSwift, a restaurant service app for ordering menus, and JacinthForge LMS, where I implemented authentication flows and built the instructor dashboard. Along the way, I’ve gained strong experience with state management, API integrations, and performance optimization, and I’ve also explored backend tools like Express and NestJS to better understand full-stack workflows.\n\nWhat drives me is creating products that are not only functional but also engaging—whether that’s through clean interfaces, interactive features, or even gamification. Right now, I’m excited about opportunities where I can grow with advanced tools like React Native, Three.js, and AI-driven experiences, while contributing to a team that values collaboration and innovation.”",https://my-portfolio-eight-ochre-81.vercel.app/,,68a8d3fa7d811edda3bfa505,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-08-23T19:24:09.515Z,2025-08-23T19:24:09.515Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1755977046500_JeffreyIrukehResume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
