68ac46a57d811edda3bfabf7,Adebayo Akerele,+2348106453311,webdevbybayo@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Akerele Adebayo, and I am a self-driven and goal-oriented individual with a deep passion for tech and everything related to it. I take pride in providing innovative solutions for businesses.\nI’m based in Lagos and have over 4years of professional experience as a front-end developer. My expertise includes working with React.js, Next.js, TailwindCSS, Git, TanStack Query, Playwright, and Shadcn to build web applications. I have worked on projects spanning fintech, the health sector, and e-commerce.\nTo share a bit about how I transitioned from geology to tech: after graduating from Kwara State University with a BSc in Geology and Mineral Sciences, I was posted to Lagos for my National Youth Service Program to gain real-life experience as a geology graduate. Unfortunately, due to a lack of connections and fewer job opportunities, I struggled to get recruited. This led me to undergo a period of self-discovery where I worked on better understanding my authentic self. Through this process, I redefined my beliefs, purpose, passion, circle of friends, and core values.\nI realized that my purpose is to make a positive impact on people's lives, whether at school, home, or work. I conducted thorough research on what skills to learn outside my field of study, and I concluded that tech was the next big thing. Not only did it offer me freedom, but it also gave me the ability to build solutions that can improve individuals' and businesses' lives.\nMy core values include empathy, daring, resilience, active listening, and humility.",https://github.com/Jubrilake,,68a8d3fa7d811edda3bfa505,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-08-25T11:19:01.772Z,2025-08-25T11:19:01.772Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1756120738677_Akerele_Adebayo_Frontend_Engineer_Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
68ac484c7d811edda3bfac09,David Sampson ,+2347046026964,davidsampson.ud@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a backend-focused developer with experience building scalable applications using Node.js, Express, and MongoDB, and I also work comfortably across the full stack with React and TypeScript. Over the past 5years, I’ve developed APIs, integrated third-party services, and implemented responsive UIs. I’m passionate about writing clean, maintainable code and creating solutions that improve user experience and system performance.",,,68a8d1237d811edda3bfa4ff,Associate Backend Developer,2025-08-25T11:26:04.254Z,2025-08-25T11:26:04.254Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1756121158277_SAMPSON DAVID RESUME Main.pdf,Applied,,,,,
68ac4d167d811edda3bfac21,OMOZEMOJE AUGUSTINE OISASOJE,+2349031821590,omozemojeau@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am writing to inform you that I am interested in the Web Developer position in your company as advertised. With a solid foundation in the latest web development frameworks, a strong front-end and back-end development background, and a proven track record of delivering high-quality web applications, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.\n\n\nI hold a Bachelor's Degree in Quantity Surveying from the University of Benin, Benin City, and I have over 4 years of experience in the field of web development. My proficiency in modern web frameworks such as React, and Next Js, coupled with my expertise in server-side technologies like Node.js allows me to create dynamic and responsive web applications. Additionally, I am well-versed in utilizing RESTful APIs, and various database systems, including MongoDB and MYSQL, to develop scalable and efficient solutions.\n\n\nIn my previous role, I spearheaded the development of several key projects, Like a company's Website. These projects not only enhanced user experience but also improved overall performance and scalability. My collaborative approach ensured seamless integration with cross-functional teams, resulting in successful project deliveries within stipulated timelines.\n\n\nKey highlights of my qualifications include:\n\n- In-depth knowledge of HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (ES6+), and TypeScript, and Javascript library like react, next js\n\n- Strong understanding of responsive design principles and mobile-first development.\n\n- Experience with version control systems like Git and CI/CD pipelines.\n\n- Excellent problem-solving skills and attention to detail.\n\n\nI am particularly drawn to your establishment because of its innovative approach to technology and its commitment to values. I am excited about the opportunity to bring my unique skill set to your esteemed team and to contribute to the development of cutting-edge web solutions that drive business success.\n\n\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how my skills and experiences align with the needs of your team. Please feel free to contact me at \n\n\nSincerely,\n\nOmozemoje Augustine Oisasoje",https://austinosaz.vercel.app/,,68a8d3fa7d811edda3bfa505,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-08-25T11:46:30.308Z,2025-08-25T11:46:30.308Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1756122386256_AUSTINOSAZ DEV CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,
68ac54857d811edda3bfac59,Aaron Adetunmbi,+23408103622796,adetunmbikenny@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a backend engineer with three years of experience building scalable systems using TypeScript, Node.js, and NestJS. I specialize in translating business needs into technical solutions, developing robust APIs, and designing high-performance workflows.\n\nAt Admission Genie, I built a HIPAA-aligned multi-tenant medical data platform with a secure RBAC system and deployed the entire stack on AWS, enabling 12+ clinics to onboard within three months. Previously, at Ubulu Africa, I contributed to the backend development of the Pitch2Win platform and national hackathon systems that processed thousands of submissions with multi-stage evaluation and automated workflows.\n\nI hold a BSc in Computer Science from Kwara State University and bring expertise in TypeScript, Node.js, Docker, and PostgreSQL. I am passionate about designing backend solutions that deliver on performance, security, and business goals.",https://www.aaronadetunmbi.com/,,68a8d1237d811edda3bfa4ff,Associate Backend Developer,2025-08-25T12:18:13.715Z,2025-08-25T12:18:13.715Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1756124290668_Adetunmbi Aaron.pdf,Applied,,,,,
