68ac58f87d811edda3bfacbc,Oghenetega Sukuru,+23408166311548,sukuruoghenetega@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Oghenetega Sukuru, and I’m a Frontend Developer with over 3 years of experience building responsive and user-friendly applications with React, JavaScript, TypeScript, and modern frontend tools. While I have not yet worked professionally with Next.js or React Native, I have a strong foundation in React and web development best practices, which makes me confident in my ability to pick up these frameworks quickly.\n\nI’m particularly interested in roles where I can grow into advanced technologies such as Next.js, React Native, and interactive experiences with Three.js, while also applying my existing skills in performance optimization, clean component design, and collaboration in Agile teams. What excites me most about this role is the opportunity to contribute to innovative projects while also expanding my expertise in areas like AI integration and gamification.",https://oghenetegasukuru.netlify.app/,,68a8d3fa7d811edda3bfa505,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-08-25T12:37:12.921Z,2025-08-25T12:37:12.921Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1756125429879_Oghenetega_Sukuru.pdf,Applied,,,,,
