68ac5f337d811edda3bface3,Daniel Victor Udo,+23409026876052,dannyudo15@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Daniel, a passionate Frontend Developer with experience building responsive and user-friendly interfaces using modern technologies like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, and Next.js. I focus on writing clean, maintainable code and creating applications that deliver excellent user experiences.\n\nI’m also the founder of MyEasySchool, an online learning platform where I developed the entire frontend architecture, integrated payment systems, and optimized performance for scalability. This experience helped me strengthen my problem-solving skills, attention to detail, and ability to handle end-to-end development in real-world projects.\n\nI work well in remote environments, collaborating effectively through Git, GitHub, and project management tools. I’m always eager to learn new technologies and contribute to innovative projects that make an impact.",https://danny-portfolio-lilac.vercel.app/,,68a8d3fa7d811edda3bfa505,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-08-25T13:03:47.520Z,2025-08-25T13:03:47.520Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1756127023743_Resume (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,
68ac5fc77d811edda3bfacec,Elizabeth Toweh,+2347034386460,toweh02@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Backend Engineer with hands-on experience designing and scaling microservices, integrating third-party payment systems, and optimizing backend performance. In my current role at Stackivy, I engineered services that improved scalability by 40%, reduced API response times and integrated payment APIs for over 10,000 daily users. I’ve also led gamification-related features that boosted user engagement significantly. \nMy core skills include Node.js (NestJS, Express), TypeScript, RESTful APIs, SQL/NoSQL databases, and familiar with cloud deployments on AWS. I thrive in cross-functional teams, contributing to code reviews, agile sprints and architecture improvements. \nI’m particularly excited about Tobams Group focus on AI/ML integration and gamification, as I enjoy building backend systems that power engaging, data-driven user experiences.\n",https://github.com/TowehE,,68a8d1237d811edda3bfa4ff,Associate Backend Developer,2025-08-25T13:06:15.545Z,2025-08-25T13:06:15.545Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1756127172736_Elizabeth-Toweh-CV (Backend) .pdf,Applied,,,,,
68ac61897d811edda3bfad03,Nicholas Temidayo Johnson,+2348162072558,nicholasjohnson.njt@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am passion driven with wide ideas yet to be born. I’m someone who values personality and engagement, whether I’m collaborating with a team or interacting with clients. I believe that a bit of playfulness and authenticity can go a long way in building strong working relationships. Living in Abuja has also shaped my perspective. I’ve learned to navigate diverse environments and bring cultural awareness into everything I do.",technick-code.github.io/my-portfolio/,,68a8d3fa7d811edda3bfa505,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-08-25T13:13:45.804Z,2025-08-25T13:13:45.804Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1756127622918_Nicholas Johnson.pdf,Applied,,,,,
