68c1a5f1bbf87b18222458c3,Mbata Blessing Adaoma ,+23408036630578,adaoma2826@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Blessing Mbata, and I am a passionate Frontend Developer with over 3 years of hands-on experience specializing in Next.js, React.js, and TypeScript. I enjoy building scalable, user-friendly, and high-performing applications, and I’m particularly motivated by opportunities to work on innovative projects that blend technology with creativity.\n\nIn my journey so far, I’ve developed responsive dashboards, API-driven applications, and interactive platforms with React, Next.js, TailwindCSS, and Redux, while also exploring advanced integrations like Web3.js, Ethers.js, and AI-powered features. Beyond web apps, I’ve gained exposure to React Native for mobile development and have growing interest in immersive technologies like Three.js and React Fiber for interactive 3D experiences.\n\nWhat excites me most about Tobams Group is your mission to reshape tech talent development in Africa while delivering impactful solutions globally. I see this role as an opportunity not only to apply my frontend expertise but also to expand into areas like gamification, AI/ML integration, and interactive design while contributing to meaningful, forward-thinking projects.\n\nI bring with me strong problem-solving skills, adaptability, and a collaborative mindset qualities that make me eager and ready to join your team to help build innovative digital products.\n","🔗 Portfolio Website: You can view my portfolio here: tiny.cc/MyPort-folio. Please note that it has not been updated recently, so I’ve included additional links to recent and ongoing projects:  Featured Projects:  🧠 https://mental-heathapp-r418.vercel.app/  💳 https://finicalapp.netlify.app/ (Work in Progress)  🎨 https://stunning-animated-na-7zf4.bolt.host/  📘 https://helpful-conkies-3af667.netlify.app/  🌾 https://agronetapp.netlify.app/  🏢 https://hiresholding.netlify.app/  🗳️ https://civic-vote.netlify.app/  ⚡ https://nexaflowapp.netlify.app/",,68bfe4fff06d9137747b1f7c,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-09-10T16:23:13.321Z,2025-09-10T16:23:13.321Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757521390214_CV Blessing _20250910_171701_0000.pdf,Applied,,,,,
68c1a642bbf87b18222458df,Ifeoluwa Jokotola,+2349067502530,jaywebs0@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Ifeoluwa, and I am a frontend developer (web-focused). I have over 5 years of experience building web and mobile applications. I have developed many applications ranging from financial platforms and banking applications to large eCommerce websites, online stores, landing pages, and business websites.\n\nI derive pleasure in building solutions that work and help businesses thrive in the African economy and the global market at large. I use frontend frameworks such as Next.js, Angular, and React to build these solutions. I also use the Ionic Framework and React Native for mobile development.\n\nAside from programming, I have excellent leadership attributes. I led a team of 5 developers, 3 of whom were junior developers to build a revamped banking application. I oversaw pull request approvals and reviews, and I collaborated on shared components that can be reused across different platforms and adapted to suit any project requirements.\n\nI am familiar with tools such as Jira, Azure DevOps, Git, and Bitbucket for project management, code management, and pipeline builds. My Figma-to-code conversion is also very strong.\n\nFor me, coding has grown from just a career into a hobby that I spend most of my free time enjoying.", https://j-ifeoluwa.web.app/,,68bfe4fff06d9137747b1f7c,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-09-10T16:24:34.871Z,2025-09-10T16:24:34.871Z,,,"https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757521471416_Jokotola, Ifeoluwa Richard - Resume TDS.pdf",Applied,,,,,
