68c1a6dabbf87b1822245916,Folahan Mosunmola ,+2348152832520,seunfola1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a software engineer with over 4 years of experience, specializing in Next.js and modern frontend development, but also experienced in backend development with Node.js, Express, and MongoDB. I’ve managed frontend teams, built and deployed full-stack applications, and worked on optimizing products for both performance and scalability.\n\nI enjoy building clean, user-focused applications, but I also like taking a step back to think about architecture, collaboration, and how different parts of a system fit together. Recently, I’ve been exploring AI integrations and gamification, because I believe the next wave of products won’t just be functional they’ll be intelligent and engaging. I’d describe myself as a developer who’s comfortable moving between hands-on coding, team collaboration, and system thinking to deliver impactful solutions.",https://my-portfolio-drab-two-69.vercel.app,,68bfe4fff06d9137747b1f7c,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-09-10T16:27:06.630Z,2025-09-10T16:27:06.630Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757521623614_Folahan OM resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
