68c1a77fbbf87b182224593c,abdubasit abdulwahab,+23407078135314,abdulbasitabdulwahab21@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a self-taught Software Engineer with hands-on experience building real-world applications across multiple stacks. My journey has been shaped by professional roles, freelance projects, and personal initiatives that strengthened my expertise in web development, backend systems, and dashboards.\n\nCurrently, I’m building Edulink, an education platform with a backend powered by Spring Boot https://github.com/bascom241/EdulinkServer\n and a frontend developed in React with Next.js for the landing page https://github.com/bascom241/edulink-ui-new\n I’m also working on Pharmalink, an AI-powered health monitoring system developed with Node.js and Expo https://github.com/bascom241/Ai-Powered-Health-Monitoring-system\n\n\nProfessionally, I’ve contributed as a Software Engineer at:\n\nToshconsult → building tailored software solutions for clients.\n\nKolekto → managing payment systems, building UIs, and resolving TypeScript issues.\n\nThese experiences, combined with my projects, have given me strong skills in:\nBackend Development (Spring Boot, Node.js, Express)\nFrontend Development (React, Next.js, TypeScript)\nMobile Development (Expo/React Native)\nSystem Design & Dashboards\nI am driven by problem-solving, resilience, and the passion to create products that scale.\n📌 Explore more of my professional journey and work experience here:\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/abdulbasit-abdulwahab-144507258/",https://abdulbasit-portfolio-git-main-abdulbasits-projects-70099814.vercel.app/,,68bfe4fff06d9137747b1f7c,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-09-10T16:29:51.548Z,2025-09-10T16:29:51.548Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757521788079_Full Stack Software Engineer Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
68c1a7f3bbf87b182224595c,AbdulAzeez Olanrewaju,+23409036340011,oabdulazeez70@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Frontend Developer with a passion for building efficient and maintainable web applications. With solid expertise in technologies like React, Vue, Next, Nuxt, and Tailwind CSS + Other goodies in the frontend world, I prioritize clean, user-centered designs and performant code.\n\nI’m also the creator of Stunk, a minimalist and reactive state management library for JavaScript and TypeScript, with 100+ stars on GitHub. Stunk—short for ""state"" + ""chunk""- is framework-agnostic and built with a fine-grained, chunk-based architecture that provides automatic updates, async state handling, middleware support, time-travel debugging, and fully typed support via TypeScript. It aims to simplify state handling by breaking data into manageable ""chunks,"" allowing efficient updates and subscriptions while avoiding unnecessary re-renders.\n\nI have some interesting projects that are open sourced\n\nInkCurate: An AI book recommendations app. You enter your thoughts and it analyses it then generate a book that matches your preference. \n\nLink: https://inkcurate.vercel.app/\n\nGitRoast: A fun project that roast users GitHub bio\n\nLink: https://git-roast.vercel.app/\n\nBeyond coding, I enjoy exploring new tech, collaborating across teams, and continuously refining my craft to create seamless digital experiences.",https://github.com/I-am-abdulazeez,,68bfe4fff06d9137747b1f7c,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-09-10T16:31:47.497Z,2025-09-10T16:31:47.497Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757521903980_Abdul'Azeez CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,
