68c1ad27bbf87b1822245a97,EMMANUEL LUKE,+23409032520207,emmaranking07@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nDear Hiring Manager,\n\nI am excited to apply for the Frontend Engineer position. With a proven track record in building secure, scalable, and user-centric web and mobile applications, I bring not only deep expertise in modern frontend technologies but also strong backend development skills that allow me to contribute as a versatile full-stack problem solver.\n\nOver the years, I have specialized in frontend engineering using technologies such as React, Next.js, React Native, and TailwindCSS, with a strong focus on delivering clean, intuitive, and responsive interfaces. My experience includes creating dynamic e-commerce platforms, restaurant ordering systems, and real estate listing websites, all optimized for performance and accessibility. I have also built a SaaS-style SEO recommendation tool that combines a seamless UI with robust data handling.\n\nComplementing my frontend expertise, I am highly skilled in backend development with Node.js, Express.js, and Prisma, and I have implemented secure authentication (including cookie-based sessions and role-based access control), REST APIs, and scalable architectures. My ability to design and optimize database schemas in MySQL and MongoDB ensures that the applications I build are not only engaging but also reliable and efficient under heavy traffic.\n\nI am eager to contribute my technical skills, creative problem-solving, and dedication to building secure, scalable, and user-friendly products that make a meaningful impact.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background and skills can contribute to the success of your engineering team. Thank you for considering my application, and I look forward to the possibility of speaking with you.\n\nSincerely,\nLuke.\n",https://ranking-topnotch.github.io/Luke-Emmanuel-Portfolio/,,68bfe4fff06d9137747b1f7c,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-09-10T16:53:59.925Z,2025-09-10T16:53:59.925Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757523235640_LUKE EMMANUEL C-1-1-1.pdf,Applied,,,,,
