68c1c4debbf87b1822245ccc,Ebenezer Hunsu,+2348138742124,ebenezerhunsu20@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I hold a degree in Accounting Education from Lagos State University, where I built a strong foundation in analytical thinking, attention to detail, and problem-solving. During my studies, I transitioned into the technology field, developing a passion for software quality assurance and automation testing.\n\nOver the past two years, I’ve worked as a QA Engineer in both fintech and consulting environments. At Quales Consulting, I started my journey in software testing, gaining hands-on experience in manual testing and Agile practices. Later, at Xplug Technologies, I contributed to the development of a statistical database management system for the Central Bank, where I created and executed detailed test plans, documented bugs, and ensured the system’s reliability and compliance.\n\nCurrently, I work at Vesti, a fintech company, where I perform both manual and automation testing of daily app releases. I use tools such as Postman for API testing and Cypress for test automation, while also ensuring clear documentation of test cases, bug reports, and regression tests. I also collaborate closely with developers and product managers to deliver high-quality products to users.\n\nWhat motivates me in QA is ensuring that users have seamless and reliable product experiences. I’m now looking forward to expanding my expertise into performance testing and more advanced automation frameworks, while contributing to a team that values quality and continuous improvement.”",,,68bfe4fff06d9137747b1f7c,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-09-10T18:35:10.698Z,2025-09-10T18:35:10.698Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757529307415_Ebenezer Hunsu Resume pdf (2).pdf,Applied,,,,,
