68c53f11bbf87b18222468de,Olaoye Alexander,+23408169142969,olaoyealexander44@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nI’m Olaoye Alexander, I have years of experience in web development, graduate from lautech university when I work as an digital health innovator in health insurance company and have work on different projects including real estate projects in two different companies. I’m currently pursuing my masters in information technology \nChatGPT said:\nGreat, Olaoye! Based on the information you've provided, here's a professional summary you could use for your CV, LinkedIn, portfolio website, or professional bio:\nProfessional Summary\nI am Olaoye Alexander, a dedicated and versatile Web Developer with several years of experience in building innovative, user-centric web applications across various industries, including digital health and real estate. A graduate of Ladoke Akintola University of Technology (LAUTECH), I began my professional journey as a Digital Health Innovator at a health insurance company, where I contributed to the development of technology-driven solutions aimed at improving healthcare access and efficiency.\n\nOver the years, I’ve led and contributed to multiple high-impact projects, including real estate platforms for two different companies, showcasing my ability to translate complex business needs into seamless digital experiences. My skillset spans front-end and back-end development, with a strong emphasis on scalable, secure, and user-friendly design.\n\nCurrently, I am further advancing my expertise by pursuing a Master’s degree in Information Technology, with a focus on leveraging emerging technologies to build smarter, data-driven applications.",,,68bfe4fff06d9137747b1f7c,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-09-13T09:53:21.633Z,2025-09-13T09:53:21.633Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757757198524_Alex.F.END CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,
