68c58064bbf87b18222469a7,Agwu Ezekiel Opeyemi,+23409027230515,irechukwuezekiel@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Frontend/Mobile Engineer with close to 5 years of experience building scalable, user-friendly applications using React, Next.js, and React Native. My background spans fintech, edtech, and healthtech products where I’ve led mobile development, optimized UI/UX from Figma hand-offs, and delivered apps with seamless API integrations, secure authentication, and payment systems. I enjoy solving complex technical problems and turning product ideas into polished digital experiences.",https://agwuezekiel.vercel.app,,68bfe4fff06d9137747b1f7c,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-09-13T14:32:04.050Z,2025-09-13T14:32:04.050Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757773920974_AGWU EZEKIELRESUME.pdf,Applied,,,,,
