68c7a6eebbf87b1822246c29,Tofunmi Paul Okeowo,+23409013123768,tofexzyno@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Tofunmi Paul Okeowo, a passionate web developer who brings ideas to life, pixel by pixel. My expertise lies in front-end technologies like HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, TypeScript, and frameworks like React and Next.js. I'm skilled in building dynamic user interfaces with Tailwind CSS, Sass, and motion libraries like Framer Motion and GSAP.\n\nBeyond the code, I'm a natural team player and a logical thinker who loves solving challenges. My experience includes leading and mentoring other developers and building full-stack applications from the ground up. I'm always eager to learn and grow, constantly adding new technologies to my stack to build more efficient and impactful web solutions.",https://tofunmitranspose.vercel.app/,,68bfe4fff06d9137747b1f7c,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-09-15T05:41:02.714Z,2025-09-15T05:41:02.714Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757914859637_Tofunmi Paul - React_JavaScript Developer Resume 2.pdf,Applied,,,,,
68c7ad3ebbf87b1822246c52,Wesley Chigbu,+23408107344386,wesleychigbu@gmail.com,Nigeria,"From a very young age, I have always loved the idea of programming, the concept of transforming code and cryptic languages to something meaningful to the average person was intriguing to me. This passion led me to earn a bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, and ultimately, to specialize in Web Development. Though I experimented with Python for Data Analytics and Game Development with Unity using C#, these areas did not resonate with me like Frontend Development. Over the past three years, I've honed my skills in various languages, libraries, frameworks, and tools related to Frontend Development. I’ve also collaborated closely with UI Designers and Backend Engineers to create functional, beautiful user interfaces for various companies. \n\n‎I stay current with industry trends and new technologies, continually expanding my knowledge. Also, I adapt quickly, thanks to my diverse experience with various languages and web technologies, and I’m confident in my ability to contribute significantly wherever needed. ",https://westhedev.vercel.app,,68bfe4fff06d9137747b1f7c,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-09-15T06:07:58.236Z,2025-09-15T06:07:58.236Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757916474925_Wesley Chigbu .pdf,Applied,,,,,
68c7c402bbf87b1822246c72,Nnamdi Nnuforole,+23408105621245,nnamdi.nnuforole@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a software developer with a strong focus on frontend development, passionate about building responsive and user-friendly web applications. Over the past few years, I’ve gained hands-on experience through internships and professional roles, where I worked with technologies like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, TypeScript, and React.\n\nMost recently, at FlexiSAF Edusoft Limited, I contributed to developing and maintaining web applications using React, Redux, and Material UI, as well as implementing CRUD operations to improve user interaction and data management. Prior to that, during my internship at Bincom Dev Centre, I helped develop an Emergency Report Application with real-time notifications and authentication, which enhanced user engagement and functionality. At Zealight Innovation Labs, I built a responsive landing page that improved usability and conducted extensive software testing to ensure high-quality product releases.\n\nBeyond technical work, I’ve developed strong collaboration skills, working with design and backend teams, applying Agile methodologies, and using Git for version control. I enjoy solving problems, writing clean, scalable code, and continuously learning new tools to improve my craft.\n\nI hold a Bachelor’s degree in Physics from Michael Okpara University and have completed additional certifications, including React.js Essential Training and job simulations in frontend engineering. My goal is to grow as a frontend developer, contribute to impactful products, and bring value to teams through both technical expertise and collaborative spirit.",https://nnamdinnuforole.netlify.app/,,68bfe4fff06d9137747b1f7c,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-09-15T07:45:06.480Z,2025-09-15T07:45:06.480Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757922302613_Nnamdi_Nnuforole_Resume.pdf(1).pdf,Applied,,,,,
68c7d61bbbf87b1822246c8f,chinedu aguwa,+2348105471046,neduaguwa443@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Front-End Developer with over 5 years of experience building responsive, user-friendly, and scalable web applications. I specialize in React, Next.js, and modern JavaScript/TypeScript, with a strong focus on creating seamless user experiences and clean, maintainable code.\n\nBeyond my technical skills, I have a background in engineering, which gives me a structured approach to problem-solving and attention to detail. I’ve worked on diverse projects ranging from SaaS platforms and mobile applications to dashboards and education-focused solutions. I enjoy collaborating with cross-functional teams, turning complex ideas into intuitive interfaces, and continuously learning new technologies to stay current with industry trends.\n\nI’m excited about opportunities where I can contribute to both the technical growth of a product and the overall user experience.",https://github.com/chi2785443/,,68bfe4fff06d9137747b1f7c,Associate Frontend Developer,2025-09-15T09:02:19.563Z,2025-09-15T09:02:19.563Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757926936262_chindeu aguwa software.pdf,Applied,,,,,
