68c8186cbbf87b1822246d83,Francis Okonkwo,+23407084421497,francisalexander000@gmail.com,Nigeria,"If you'd asked me five years ago, I never imagined I'd be building systems that manage solar energy tokens or powering nationwide e-commerce platforms from scratch.\n\nI'm Francis. A backend-first engineer with a knack for solving high-stakes problems under pressure. I’ve helped reduce billing disputes in the energy sector, scaled APIs to handle thousands of concurrent requests, and led full-cycle development for platforms where downtime isn’t an option.\n\nBut what really drives me isn’t just code, it’s the elegance of systems that just work, the thrill of turning chaos into structure, and the obsession with making performance, security, and developer experience play well together.\n\nI’ve worked across industries which includes automotive, fintech, edtech, energy, across time zones. My stack is TypeScript, NestJS, Postgres, Redis, Docker, AWS, but honestly, tools are just that. What excites me is the architecture, the trade-offs, and building things that matter.\n\nSo, that’s me. A system thinker, a builder, and someone who’s just getting started.",,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-15T13:45:16.219Z,2025-09-15T13:45:16.219Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757943913276_francis_resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
