68c81b96bbf87b1822246e22,Seun  Olukeye,+23408037705238,seunolukeye2000@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a backend developer with experience in designing and building scalable applications. I work mainly with NestJS, Prisma, and PostgreSQL, and I also have hands-on experience with .NET Core, MongoDB, and RabbitMQ for microservices communication. Over the past few years, I’ve worked on projects like market place application, real estate, blood donation application, school management platforms where I implemented features such as real-time notifications, payments integration, and secure file handling.\n\nWhat motivates me is solving real-world problems with clean and efficient code, and I’m always keen on learning new tools that make systems more reliable. I’m excited about this role because it aligns with my experience in backend development, and it also gives me the opportunity to contribute to building scalable solutions while continuing to grow in areas like DevOps and system design.",https://www.mychildsplanner.com/,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-15T13:58:46.210Z,2025-09-15T13:58:46.210Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757944722943_Seun-Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
68c81bb6bbf87b1822246e2e,Ikujebi Abraham Kehinde,+2348137977542,ikujebikehinde@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a software developer with experience building full-stack applications, with a particular interest in backend development. I work with technologies such as Node.js, Express, and databases like MongoDB to build scalable and reliable applications. In one of my recent projects, I developed the backend for a web app that handled user authentication and data management, focusing on clean APIs and performance optimization. I enjoy solving problems, collaborating in teams, and I am eager to grow my expertise in backend systems while contributing to impactful projects at Tobams Group.",https://zuri-portfolio-beta.vercel.app/,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-15T13:59:18.858Z,2025-09-15T13:59:18.858Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757944756063_IkujebiA (1) (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,
