68c81d52bbf87b1822246e7c,Prince Uche Ikechukwu,+23409060538126,ucheprince26@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Backend Software Engineer with over five years of experience designing and developing scalable backend systems, APIs, and cloud-native applications. I have worked across startups and tech-driven organizations, where I led backend development, integrated secure payment systems, and optimized performance for platforms serving thousands of users. My technical expertise spans Node.js (NestJS/Express.js), TypeScript, .NET Core, MongoDB, PostgreSQL, and deployment with Docker, AWS, and GCP. Beyond coding, I am passionate about building intelligent, reliable systems that solve real-world problems. I enjoy collaborating with cross-functional teams and mentoring younger developers.",https://github.com/Purch1,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-15T14:06:10.720Z,2025-09-15T14:06:10.720Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757945167656_Prince Uche Ikechukwu_Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
68c81e92bbf87b1822246ea9,Ebine Arowolo Seyi,+23408024210779,ebisco4ui@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Backend Developer with strong experience building and scaling Node.js applications, designing RESTful APIs, and managing databases like MongoDB, PostgreSQL and MySQL. My focus is on writing clean, efficient, and secure code that powers reliable backend systems.\n\nOver time, I’ve worked on projects ranging from real-time chat systems and event booking platforms to subscription management, analytics dashboards, and payment integrations. I have hands-on experience with frameworks like Express.js and NestJS, and I leverage tools like Sequelize and TypeORM for ORM/database management.\n\nMy Core Skills:\n\nNode.js, Express.js, TypeScript\n\nMongoDB, MySQL, Sequelize, TypeORM\n\nRESTful API design, authentication & authorization (JWT, role-based access)\n\nAsynchronous programming, cron jobs, and real-time features (sockets)\n\nCloud integrations (Cloudinary, ImageKit, Paystack, Firebase, etc.)\n\nCI/CD (GitHub Actions)\n\nI enjoy solving complex backend challenges like concurrency handling, performance optimization, and secure data flows. Beyond coding, I care about system scalability and maintainability, ensuring the backend can grow smoothly with product needs.\n\nMy goal is to keep building impactful, scalable systems that make life easier for both businesses and end-users.",,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-15T14:11:30.786Z,2025-09-15T14:11:30.786Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757945487667_Backend Developer CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,
68c81eb9bbf87b1822246eb6,Joseph Chukwuemeka Ofili,+2347060942709,josephofilii@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a Fullstack Engineer with over three years of professional experience specializing in building and deploying scalable, AI-powered backend systems. My core expertise is in Node.js, TypeScript, and Python, and I have a proven track record of architecting and maintaining robust services on AWS.\nThroughout my career, I've taken end-to-end ownership of complex projects. This includes everything from designing database schemas in PostgreSQL and MongoDB and building secure RESTful APIs, to integrating sophisticated third-party systems. I'm particularly passionate about the intersection of backend engineering and AI, having successfully integrated machine learning models and LLMs to create intelligent, data-driven applications that solve real-world business problems.",https://portfolio.josephofili.live/,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-15T14:12:09.798Z,2025-09-15T14:12:09.798Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757945526863_Joseph C Ofili Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
68c81efbbbf87b1822246ec6,Abraham Jude,+2349055047774,abrahamjude1999@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Backend Engineer with over four (4)  years of experience designing and building scalable backend systems, APIs, and data-driven solutions. What I do centers on developing robust, secure, and maintainable backend services using Node.js, TypeScript, and frameworks like NestJS. I also have hands on experience integrating AI/ML models into production, implementing gamification features such as leaderboards and reward systems, and optimizing SQL/NoSQL databases for performance and reliability.\n\nI do this work because I am passionate about building technology that empowers businesses and end users. I enjoy solving complex engineering challenges, especially those involving scalability, performance, and seamless integration of intelligent systems that make products more engaging and impactful.\n\nI approach my work by combining clean, testable code practices with a collaborative mindset. I work closely with product managers, designers, and AI/ML teams to deliver solutions that align with both technical and business goals. My approach also emphasizes security, cloud native deployments (AWS, Docker, Kubernetes), and CI/CD pipelines to ensure reliable and continuous delivery.",https://devjude.framer.website/,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-15T14:13:15.554Z,2025-09-15T14:13:15.554Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757945592161_Backend Resume .pdf,Applied,,,,,
68c81f05bbf87b1822246ece,george hyargi bongo,+23409069133573,georgebongo567@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Fullstack AI Engineer with over 5 years of experience designing and deploying end-to-end applications that combine modern web stacks with AI/ML systems. I specialize in building scalable platforms using Next.js, Node.js, Python, Prisma, and PostgreSQL, and I’ve integrated AI tools like LangChain, GPT-4, and Pinecone into real-world SaaS, fintech, and healthcare products.\n\nIn past projects, I’ve built a multi-tenant SaaS website builder that reduced launch times from days to minutes, a fintech compliance dashboard that processed thousands of secure transactions monthly, and a virtual medical assistant that automated 65% of patient interactions.\n\nWhat drives me is turning complex business needs into intelligent, production-ready systems — and contributing to teams that are pushing the boundaries of generative AI and fullstack engineering.",,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-15T14:13:25.544Z,2025-09-15T14:13:25.544Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757945602549_George_Hyargi_Bongo_Fullstack_CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,
68c81f4fbbf87b1822246ee3,Samuel Adebayo,+2348147468979,adebayorsamuelas@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a backend developer who enjoys building web applications. I work mostly with Ruby on Rails, Python, and PostgreSQL. I have also used JavaScript and cloud tools like AWS. I started in IT support, which helped me learn how to solve problems and work well with others. I like learning new things and working on projects that help people.",https://officialsammyremi.fly.dev,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-15T14:14:39.124Z,2025-09-15T14:14:39.124Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757945675953_Samuel Adebayo Resume 2025.pdf,Applied,,,,,
