68c81fdbbbf87b1822246f04,Gideon Stephen ,+23407030830947,stephengideon22@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Gideon and I am a backend developer with a B.Sc. degree (2nd class upper) and 4+ years of deep professional experience in using backend technologies like Node.js, Typescript, Express.js, Nestjs, Postgresql, mySql, MongoDb, sequelize, Jest, mocha and chai for testing, Sonarqube for code quality check, AWS (ec2, code deploy, s3, etc), Langchain, pinecone for vectors, winston for logging, redis, etc.\n\nI have worked with several companies ranging from the Financial sector to educational sector and AI sector and i believe I'll be more than able to continue contributing to growth of the company backend systems.\n\nI also have vast experience in working with team members and alone.\n",,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-15T14:16:59.732Z,2025-09-15T14:16:59.732Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757945816201_Gideon STEPHEN - Backend.pdf,Applied,,,,,
