68c823e9bbf87b1822246fc1,Mas'ud Ndatsu,+2348167133592,masudndatsu@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Mas’ud Ndatsu. I’m currently a Backend Developer with strong experience in NestJS, Prisma, and database-driven systems, and I also lead an R&D team at Oaks Intelligence Limited, where we explore new business models, gamification, and blockchain integrations.\nI actually started out with a bachelor's degree in chemistry, but during and after school, i transitioned into software engineering, building backend systems and working on freelance contracts. Along the way, I’ve also gained exposure to smart contracts and tokenomics, which I’m deepening through ongoing blockchain development courses.\nI’m excited to take on senior backend or blockchain engineering roles, where I can contribute not just technically, but also by driving innovation and mentoring teams.",https://github.com/Masud-Ndatsu,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-15T14:34:17.810Z,2025-09-15T14:34:17.810Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757946854517_Ndatsu Mas'ud Backend Engineer .pdf,Applied,,,,,
