68c84910bbf87b1822247273,Ebube Nwadiokwu,+4407724004687,nwadiokwu.ebube@gmail.com,United Kingdom,"My career as a software developer has been driven by a passion for creating technology solutions that make a real difference in people's lives.\n\nI hold a Master’s of Science degree with distinction in computer science. The course involved significant computer programming and software engineering. In addition to my qualifications, I have extensive experience as a software developer, working on full-stack and backend-heavy projects. This combination of theoretical knowledge and practical, real-world experience has enabled me to develop a strong foundation in software development, particularly in building modern, scalable and efficient systems.\n\nI have worked extensively with the JavaScript and TypeScript ecosystem, particularly Node.js, React.js, and related technologies. However, I am not limited to one stack. I am adaptable and capable of working across a variety of programming languages and frameworks depending on project needs. For example, in a previous role I worked with a C#/.NET codebase, during my Master’s program, I developed a mobile application using Java, and I have built machine learning models using Python. Beyond programming languages, I have experience with relational and non-relational databases and am proficient in utilising cloud platforms such as Azure, Google Cloud Platform, and Render. \n\nI understand the importance of good practices in software development, particularly in producing reliable and reproducible software. Throughout my career, I have actively utilised version control with Git, Docker for containerisation, and CI/CD pipelines for streamlined deployment. Additionally, I have hands-on experience with automated testing, consistently achieving at least 90% test coverage in my previous role. These practices are crucial for ensuring that the software I develop is robust, reliable, and maintains a high standard of quality.\n\nThis breadth of technical experience has equipped me with the versatility to adapt quickly to new environments, and i am looking forward to applying my skills to a forward-thinking and collaborative team\n\n",,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-15T17:12:48.774Z,2025-09-15T17:12:48.774Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1757956365512_Ebube_Nwadiokwu_Resume_g2.pdf,Applied,,,,,
