68c950d1bbf87b182224795e,Augustine Agbara,+2348035570164,austinagbara@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a highly skilled Full-Stack Engineer with over 5 years of experience crafting scalable web applications. I've worked with a wide range of technologies, including JavaScript/TypeScript, Node.js, React, React Native, Angular, Python, and various databases like Postgresql, MySql, and MongoDB. When I write code I ask myself if I would want to maintain this code later on, this helps me to write modular and maintainable code. I'm also proficient in Docker containerization and AI-driven solutions, which enables me to drive innovation and enhance user experiences. I can thrive anywhere be it solo or in collaborative environments, working across teams to deliver high-quality software solutions that meet complex requirements. I am adventurous so I always push myself with challenging and complex problems which has helped me always drive innovation whereever I have been.",austyynpowers.vercel.app,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-16T11:58:09.834Z,2025-09-16T11:58:09.834Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1758023884093_Austin's CV 09 2025.jpg,Applied,,,,,
