68c98cddbbf87b1822247ad1,Adewale Adeosun,+23408146875154,adeosunadewale86@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Software Engineer with over 5 years of experience building scalable, user-focused applications, primarily as a Senior Flutter Engineer, and more recently as a Backend Developer. Over the past year, I’ve specialized in designing and maintaining backend services with Node.js, NestJS, and Python, building RESTful APIs, integrating AI/ML models into production systems, and optimizing databases like PostgreSQL and MongoDB.\n\nIn my most recent work, I developed an AI-powered legal document processing platform where I architected secure APIs, implemented LLM-driven workflows, and optimized system performance and costs. I’m comfortable deploying solutions on cloud platforms using Docker and CI/CD pipelines.\n\nI bring a full-stack perspective from my Flutter background, strong collaboration skills, and a passion for building robust, scalable, and innovative platforms that align well with Tobams Group’s vision of delivering AI-powered, gamified digital solutions",,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-16T16:14:21.378Z,2025-09-16T16:14:21.378Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1758039258078_Adeosun Adewale Victor BACKEND Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
