68c9f734bbf87b1822247d03,Anosike ThankGod,+2349077746616,kayceeanosike1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a software developer with a strong focus on backend development. My experience includes building and maintaining APIs, managing databases, and implementing server-side logic to ensure reliability, scalability, and efficiency in applications. I have also contributed to system integrations and optimized data handling processes to support smooth operations. I enjoy solving complex technical challenges, writing clean and maintainable code, and collaborating with teams to deliver impactful software solutions.",https://github.com/anosike-jayson,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-16T23:48:04.672Z,2025-09-16T23:48:04.672Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1758066481686_Anosike ThankGod-Backend Developer.pdf,Applied,,,,,
68ca18a7bbf87b1822247d18,Isicheri Dominion,+2347079449579,disicheri@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello, I’m Dominion Isicheri and I value developing and deploying high-performance and secure web applications.\n\nI focus on Typescript, Node.js (NestJS, Express) and PostgreSQL, and I have hands on experience in full stack projects involving real time communication, user management, and academic platforms. An instance is NounEdu, a SaaS that assists learners in creating academic documents, and offers several resources. I incorporated secure authentication, PDF generation and payment processing.\n\nI enjoy building systems that are efficient, resilient, and simple to maintain. I have core backend service experience, and have worked with Redis, BullMQ, Docker, GitHub Actions and WebSockets.\n\nI enjoy Tobams Group because self motivated, fast environments are my preference. I appreciate how product and design teams work together and how quickly I can adapt to new features like gamification edu. I am especially pleased with the Focus on the AI/ML features.\n\nCurious, self driven and eager to grow are a few words to describe how I feel. I have the opportunity to work with a purpose driven team and that is promising.",https://dominion-usc6.onrender.com/,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-17T02:10:47.286Z,2025-09-17T02:10:47.286Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1758075044063_Cv_Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
