68ca7184bbf87b1822247dbb,Samuel Makinde,+23409064766113,samuelmakinde19@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Backend Developer with solid experience building SaaS platforms and digital products used by thousands of people. My core stack includes Node.js, Express, TypeScript, PostgreSQL, MySQL, and MongoDB. I specialize in designing scalable system architectures, developing secure APIs, and implementing efficient workflows.\n\nIn my previous roles, I’ve led backend teams, structured applications into modular architectures for easy scalability, and built critical features like payment systems, exam/quiz engines, analytics dashboards, and staff onboarding workflows. For example, on EaseReads, an education platform, I designed the backend that powered real-time exams, textbook delivery, and referral-based payment flows, which directly contributed to doubling user retention and revenue.\n\nI enjoy solving complex problems, optimizing systems for performance, and collaborating with cross-functional teams. Right now, I’m looking for opportunities where I can apply my backend expertise to build scalable, high-impact products while continuing to grow in areas like cloud infrastructure and distributed systems.",,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-17T08:29:56.372Z,2025-09-17T08:29:56.372Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1758097793612_samuel_backend_cv.pdf,Applied,,,,,
