68cc8f27bbf87b1822248f63,valentine emmanuel,+23407040206876,ludike23@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Valentine Emmanuel, and I’m a backend developer passionate about building systems that are both reliable and scalable. I work mainly with Node.js, TypeScript, and NestJS, and I’ve built solutions across different domains from sports management platforms for federations here in Nigeria to crypto and fintech applications that needed secure, real-time operations.\n\nI also enjoy creating tools for developers. For example, I built an open-source Node.js package called fast-node, along with a CLI, which brings the simplicity of Python’s FastAPI framework into the Node.js ecosystem. It’s been a great way to contribute to the developer community and sharpen my own skills in API design and developer experience.\n\nBeyond the technical side, I really value collaboration and problem-solving. What excites me about Tobams Group is the chance to apply my skills in AI-driven products and gamification features, areas I find both challenging and inspiring.",,,68c7f7d6df6a1461fb4c9f3f,Associate Backend Developer,2025-09-18T23:00:55.393Z,2025-09-18T23:00:55.393Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1758236452746_developer short cv.pdf,Applied,,,,,
