69048c7c1eeb838da355b2f7,Oluwaferanmi Ijaopo,+2349061266485,feranmiijaopo@gmail.com,Nigeria,"One thing I’ve learned in my four years as a social media manager is that likes and shares don’t pay the bills, strategy does. \n\nCrafting engaging content is great, but what excites me is using data-driven insights to build brand awareness, boost engagement, and convert audiences into loyal communities. \n\nOver the past four years, I’ve helped brands find their voice, grow their following, and turn passive scrollers into active fans. From content creation and trend-spotting to analytics and engagement strategies, I bring a balance of creativity and strategy to the table. ",https://oluwaferanm-ijaopo-s-portfolio.my.canva.site/,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-10-31T10:16:28.804Z,2025-10-31T10:16:28.804Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1761905784792_Oluwafersnmi Ijaopo Cv  2025.pdf,Applied,,,,,
69048cb01eeb838da355b302,Olamiji Mekuleyi,+23408152821800,olamijimekuleyi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’ve always been the girl who could take a simple idea and turn it into a scroll-stopping moment. Curious about how people connect, what makes them stop scrolling, what makes them care, and why certain stories linger long after we’ve seen them.\n\nFrom starting out as the “content girl” for my church to managing social media for brands across fashion, music, health and education, I’ve learned that social media isn’t just about posting, but also it’s about translating emotion into visuals that make people pause, smile, and stay.\n\nThat curiosity spills into everything I do, from how I write to how I experience life. I’m observant, expressive, and maybe a little too passionate about aesthetics.\n\nOutside work, I’m big on growth and balance. I journal, explore new places, attend creative events, and document small, ordinary moments that inspire me. I’m intentional about the people I surround myself with and the energy I bring into spaces. I love meaningful conversations, creative challenges, and anything that stretches how I think. I’d say I’m equal parts visionary and realist.",https://pin.it/7nRfmAbIH,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-10-31T10:17:20.657Z,2025-10-31T10:17:20.657Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1761905837617_MEKULEYI OLAMIJI'S RESUME c.pdf,Applied,,,,,
