69049a8a1eeb838da355b404,George Oluwaseyi Martins,+23408074105613,martinsgeorge1797@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a creative digital storyteller passionate about crafting meaningful brand connections through video, visuals, and written content. Over the years, I’ve developed a strong blend of skills across digital marketing, storytelling, and social media strategy—skills that have helped brands in the EdTech and SaaS space grow their audience and communicate with clarity. \n\nOver the past four years, I’ve worked across EdTech, SaaS, and media—creating videos, visuals, and campaigns that not only tell stories but also drive measurable growth.\n\nAt Dimpified, my campaigns brought over 40 new merchants on board, helped boost resubscriptions by 20%, and opened partnership doors with organizations like the Nigerian Dental Association and Lush Hair School. Before that, at Grazac Technologies, I led digital marketing efforts that grew engagement by 30% and improved student satisfaction by 40%. I’ve also crafted social strategies that turned small online communities into vibrant, engaged audiences.\n\nWhat really drives me as an individual, and one thing I mirror in my career is growth. I love to grow.",https://www.notion.so/George-Martins-25e6714bff2180f786ceff795d060589?source=copy_link,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-10-31T11:16:26.460Z,2025-10-31T11:16:26.460Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1761909382709_George Martins Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
69049b0b1eeb838da355b414,Erica Ogbebor,+23409068897245,ericaduware@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Erica Ogbebor, a lawyer turned digital marketing strategist with a deep passion for brand storytelling and data-driven growth. Over the past few years, I’ve built a career helping businesses strengthen their online presence through social media strategy, email marketing, and content systems that convert.\n\nCurrently, I serve as the Social Media Lead at Don-Clem Technology, where I manage content strategies for UK and Ireland-based startups, ensuring every campaign aligns with clear business goals. Beyond that, I’m expanding my expertise through Aleph’s Digital Marketing and AI program, which is sharpening my understanding of AI-powered advertising, analytics, and creative optimization.\n\nAt my core, I’m someone who thrives where creativity meets strategy, crafting campaigns that not only look good but perform exceptionally well.","1, https://ericaogbebor.journoportfolio.com/      2, https://shorturl.at/d5rpp ",,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-10-31T11:18:35.973Z,2025-10-31T11:18:35.973Z,,,"https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1761909512909_Erica Ogbebor, CV, SMM....pdf",Applied,,,,,
