69049c7f1eeb838da355b435,Godsfavour Umesiobi,+2349123609096,Godsfavourobi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a results-driven Social Media and Digital Marketing Strategist passionate about helping brands grow, engage, and convert online. I’ve managed and scaled campaigns across e-commerce, real estate, and tech, using content strategy, storytelling, and data-driven marketing to drive measurable growth.\n\nWhat started as curiosity about audience building has evolved into expertise in social media strategy, content ideation, paid ads, community building, and creative skills such as branding, design, and video editing. I’ve also led teams and built communities that turn followers into loyal advocates.\n\nI’m looking to join a forward-thinking team to create impactful strategies, boost engagement, and help brands stand out online.",https://godsfavour-dmportfolio.my.canva.site/godsfavour-smm-portfolio,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-10-31T11:24:47.621Z,2025-10-31T11:24:47.621Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1761909884439_Godsfavour SMM CV.docx (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,
69049c891eeb838da355b43d,Joshua Eromonsele Ojemhen,+23408100736365,joshuaojemhen@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear HR Team,\n\nI am writing to express my sincere interest in the job opening at your esteemed company. Your organization’s reputation as a leading brand and its emphasis on collaboration and teamwork greatly appeal to me. With over five years of experience across customer service, IT, education, and telecommunications, I have developed strong skills relevant to this role. I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively and exceed expectations. I have attached my resume for your review and would appreciate the opportunity to discuss my qualifications further.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nRegards,\nJoshua E. Ojemhen",https://www.linkedin.com/in/joshua-eromonsele-ojemhen-9149a4289,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-10-31T11:24:57.736Z,2025-10-31T11:24:57.736Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1761909894542_JOSHUA_E_OJEMHEN_CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,
69049e111eeb838da355b453,Blessing Igbi,+2349065631479,blessingigbi16@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a creative and results-driven Digital Marketing and Social Media Strategist with over three years of experience helping brands grow their digital presence and connect meaningfully with their audiences. I have worked with local and international brands such as Crown TV Africa, Crimmit in Toronto, Divine Homes, Sepham Digital Marketing Agency, and a corporate NGO based in Sacramento, where I managed social media accounts, developed content strategies, and created engaging multimedia campaigns.\n\nMy work spans multiple industries including education, real estate, fashion, health, and lifestyle. I specialize in creating compelling content that blends storytelling, strategy, and creativity to deliver measurable results. I enjoy working in collaborative, fast-paced environments where innovation, strategic thinking, and creativity come together to drive brand success.",https://blessingigbiportfolio.my.canva.site/,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-10-31T11:31:29.785Z,2025-10-31T11:31:29.785Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1761910286375_IGBI BLESSING  CV .pdf,Applied,,,,,
6904a27f1eeb838da355b460,Adekoya Oluwanishola ,+23408162113931,bethaniadekoya15@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Adekoya Oluwanishola. While I am currently completing my degree in Nursing Science at Obafemi Awolowo University, my professional passion and hands-on experience lie in digital marketing and brand building.\n\nI most recently served as the Head Creative Lead and Social Media Manager for Revel n Relish; A plantain and potato chips brand. In this role, I was responsible for developing our complete digital strategy. This involved more than just scheduling posts; I led our brand's storytelling, managed our online community, and was hands-on with all content creation.\n\nI'm proud of the results I achieved, particularly in establishing a cohesive brand voice and strong visual identity, which led to more consistent and engaging designs. I thrive in creative, fast-paced environments where I can build a brand and grow its community, which is why I've been so focused on this career path.",https://www.instagram.com/revel_n_relish?igsh=dTNpZWpsN2Fjd3I=,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-10-31T11:50:23.581Z,2025-10-31T11:50:23.581Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1761911420919_My Resume.docx,Applied,,,,,
