6905058e1eeb838da355b59d,Etim Wisdom ,+2347066218313,etimwisdomime2021@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a social media manager with a deep passion for helping brands tell their stories in ways that connect and inspire. Over the past few years, I’ve managed pages across different industries — from health to tech and personal brands, creating content that not only drives engagement but also builds community.\n\nI love bringing ideas to life through visuals, videos, and storytelling. I’m skilled with tools like Canva, CapCut, and AI-based platforms, and I enjoy experimenting with creative strategies that keep brands ahead of trends. I’d describe myself as curious, intentional, and driven by impact and I love seeing how content can truly move people and grow a brand.",https://bit.ly/Visitmyportfolio,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-10-31T18:53:02.598Z,2025-10-31T18:53:02.598Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1761936779608_ETIM_WISDOM_IME_Updated_CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,
6905098d1eeb838da355b5ae,Faith Kemie,+2348104890186,faithkemie17@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Faith Oluwaseun Kemie — a Social Media Manager and Brand Strategist with a strong mix of creativity, structure, and ambition. I am strategic yet expressive — the kind of person who doesn’t just create content, but builds meaningful digital presence around ideas, people, and brands.\nI have a natural leader’s mindset — not just wanting to do the work, but to build systems, communities, and opportunities that help other creatives thrive.\nI am also a professional with discipline and duality",https://faithkemie.my.canva.site/faithsmmportfolio,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-10-31T19:10:05.543Z,2025-10-31T19:10:05.543Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1761937802278_SMM RESUME! !.pdf,Applied,,,,,
690513401eeb838da355b5ca,SAMUEL Olusesan OGUNMILUA,+23408137508176,ogunmiluasamuel30@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Samuel Ogunmilua\n16 Ojurayo str, Oshogun bus stop,\nKetu, Lagos, 100001\nOgunmiluasamuel30@gmail.com\n\n\nDear Recruiter,\n\nI am writing to express my strong interest in the Social Media Manager position at your brand, as advertised on NigerianJobs.  With a proven track record in social media strategy, content creation, and audience engagement, I am excited about the opportunity to leverage my skills and experience to drive your brand's digital presence to new heights.\n\nProven Social Media Expertise:\n\nThroughout my career, I have successfully developed and executed social media strategies for a diverse range of clients and organizations. My experience spans various industries, including Fintech, Fashion, Real Estate, etc., where I have consistently delivered measurable results. Notably, I led a social media campaign for Opay that resulted in a 40% increase in online engagement and a 25% boost in website traffic within three months.\n\nContent Creation and Management:\n\nI have a strong creative flair and an eye for captivating content. Whether it's crafting compelling social media posts, producing engaging videos, or designing eye-catching graphics, I am adept at curating content that resonates with target audiences. I understand the importance of storytelling and visual aesthetics in today's digital landscape and am committed to creating content that not only drives engagement but also aligns with your brand identity.\n\nData-Driven Decision-Making:\n\nI firmly believe in the power of data-driven insights to inform social media strategy. I am proficient in using analytics tools to monitor campaign performance, track key performance indicators, and make informed adjustments for optimal results. My ability to analyze metrics and adapt strategies in real time has consistently led to the achievement of campaign objectives.\n\nStrategic Thinker and Collaborator:\n\nI approach social media management as a strategic endeavour, always aligning digital efforts with overarching business goals. I am skilled at collaborating cross-functionally, working closely with marketing, content, and design teams to ensure cohesive and effective campaigns. My ability to communicate complex digital concepts to non-technical stakeholders has fostered productive teamwork and project success.\n\nInnovation and Adaptability:\n\nThe digital landscape is ever-evolving, and I thrive on staying at the forefront of industry trends and emerging platforms. I am passionate about exploring new technologies and strategies to keep your brand ahead of the competition. My adaptability ensures that I can pivot and optimize strategies in response to changing algorithms and audience preferences.\n\nCommitment to your brand \n\nWhat truly excites me about Brand is its innovative approach to social media presence Your commitment to pushing boundaries and delivering exceptional value aligns seamlessly with my own passion for social media excellence. I am confident that my skills and enthusiasm will contribute to yourbrand's continued success in the digital realm.\n\nIn conclusion, my decision to pursue thesocial position at your esteemed brand is rooted in my deep-seated passion for social media, my track record of delivering results, and my commitment to excellence. I am eager to bring my expertise to your team and collaborate on driving your brand’s digital presence to new heights. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your ongoing success and am available for an interview at your earliest convenience.\n\nThank you for considering my application. Please feel free to contact me at 08137508176 or via email at ogunmiluasamuel30@gmail.com\n\nSincerely,\n\nSamuel Ogunmilua\n",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/13zpvBK2VGXSdkZjk8shAR20NB6DGjurQ?usp=sharing,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-10-31T19:51:28.045Z,2025-10-31T19:51:28.045Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1761940282164_03A7BB08-44B0-471A-AECB-BB0DD5B9CFDD.JPG,Applied,,,,,
69051c231eeb838da355b5e4,Ilori Olusanya Emmanuel ,+2349054016774,sanyaemmanuel453@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Ilori Olusanya Emmanuel, a results-driven Social Media and E-commerce Manager with over eight years of experience in digital marketing, brand communications, and online business strategy. I have successfully led campaigns that increased engagement, strengthened brand visibility, and boosted revenue across multiple platforms. In addition to my marketing expertise, I am also a certified GRC Cybersecurity expert, which enables me to approach digital growth with a strong focus on data security, compliance, and risk management. I bring a blend of creativity, strategy, and technical awareness that helps businesses grow safely and sustainably in the digital space.",https://emmanuelolusanya.my.canva.site/,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-10-31T20:29:23.444Z,2025-10-31T20:29:23.444Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1761942560183_Olusanya Emmanuel Resume (resized) (pdfresizer.com)-1.pdf,Applied,,,,,
69052d871eeb838da355b5fe,Ifeoma Fehintola Obiamiwe,+23408088867332,ifeoma.fehi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a creative and detail-oriented person who enjoys bringing ideas to life through visuals and social media content. I work with tools like Canva, CorelDRAW, and Adobe Suite, and I love creating designs that not only look good but also connect with people.",https://www.canva.com/design/DAG0LfXz934/QHnWZDR2DPaJ0DiF10kxGQ/edit,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-10-31T21:43:35.674Z,2025-10-31T21:43:35.674Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1761947011567_IfeomaObiamiwe Portfolio Resume GD.pdf,Applied,,,,,
69052ef71eeb838da355b606,Praise Owoyemi,+2349022207252,owoyemipraise2016@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’ll describe myself as a lifelong learner and this has helped me see the interconnectedness in things, eg how different career paths can intersect. Here’s what I mean, because I love to learn about diverse topics, I’ve seen how everything is a story waiting to be told. The similarities in product marketing and digital marketing. How certain principles in design help in video editing. The role artificial intelligence can play in everyday life, marketing, task structuring and so on. That’s how I can describe myself presently and this is what shapes my work and creativity. \n\n",https://praiseowoyemi.my.canva.site/praise-owoyemi-s-creative-portfolio,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-10-31T21:49:43.392Z,2025-10-31T21:49:43.392Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1761947372410_Praise Owoyemi Cv.pdf.pdf,Applied,,,,,
69055edf1eeb838da355b61c,Alaba Damilare Samuel,+23408039258972,ibdamy@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi, I’m Damilare Alaba, a development communications expert, digital marketer, writer, media buyer, and everything in between for mission-driven organisations\n\nNine+ years (and counting!) of helping teams tell their story, reach the right audiences, and hit bold growth targets. What gets me up every morning? Using digital communication to create real social impact, whether that’s helping a nonprofit tell authentic stories that resonate, enrolling more students for courses, a tech company reach new users, or shining a light on development work in rural communities and lots more with world-class content\n\nI’m known for bringing honesty to every conversation and project. If you want sugarcoated marketing, look elsewhere. If you want a creative partner who mixes strategy, heart, and hands-on tools, you’re home. That will be all for now\n",https://dareyalaba.my.canva.site/damilare-creative-portfolio,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-11-01T01:14:07.557Z,2025-11-01T01:14:07.557Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1761959644504_01_Damilare_Alaba_Updated_Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
