690623651eeb838da355b657,Janet Adeola Bashorun,+2348162589153,adeolajanet579@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a creative and data-driven social media professional with over five years of experience managing content, campaigns, and online communities across diverse industries including beauty, tech, and real estate. I’m passionate about creating meaningful digital experiences by combining storytelling with strategy to grow authentic engagement and brand trust.\n\nI enjoy collaborating with teams to turn ideas into campaigns that connect with audiences in real and relatable ways. Outside work, I love exploring new content trends, learning from global brands, and occasionally helping small businesses refine their online presence.\n\nI value creativity, consistency, and purpose in everything I do, and I’m excited about opportunities where I can contribute to building brands that truly resonate with people.",http://surl.li/renuaq,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-11-01T15:12:37.869Z,2025-11-01T15:12:37.869Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1762009954119_pdf Resume-Janet_Bashorun.pdf,Applied,,,,,
