690641401eeb838da355b699,Nora Elegha,+2348151570057,contactnoraelegha@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a social media manager who turns strategy into measurable growth. Over the past 3+ years, I've launched channels from scratch driving 89K views in 90 days, growing reach by 4,700%, and converting that attention into real business outcomes like 35% more leads and 40% more bookings.\n\nI live at the intersection of creativity and data. I’m proficient in editing with CapCut, designing with Canva. and use AI tools to work smarter. I excel at understanding what makes people stop scrolling, engage, and take action. I analyze what's working (platform by platform, format by format), adapt quickly to trends, and build content systems that scale.\n\nI thrive in remote, fast-moving environments where I can own projects end-to-end while collaborating cross-functionally. I'm the person who sees a brand's vision and figures out how to make it resonate across Instagram, TikTok, LinkedIn, and beyond.",https://noraelegha.my.canva.site/portfoli,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-11-01T17:20:00.817Z,2025-11-01T17:20:00.817Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1762017595622_Elegha Nora Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
690671981eeb838da355b6ae,Emmanuel jacob,+23408063437325,jackiemm503@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a digital marketing and sales professional with hands-on experience in growing online presence, running paid ads, and converting leads into real customers. I’ve worked across travel and automotive sectors, managing campaigns, social media, and customer relationships.\n\nOver the years, I’ve learned to blend marketing strategy with sales, using tools like Google Ads, Meta Ads, and Analytics to understand what works and optimize results. For example, I’ve run small-budget campaigns, tested ad creatives, and used data to improve performance.\n\nI enjoy working on projects that let me be both creative and analytical, whether it’s building engagement, improving conversions, or helping a brand grow its online reputation. I’m also open to remote or hybrid roles where I can keep learning and contribute to results-driven marketing work.",,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-11-01T20:46:16.073Z,2025-11-01T20:46:16.073Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1762029973264_Emmanuel_Jacob_Resume vs.pdf,Applied,,,,,
690695811eeb838da355b6e5,Olawumi Oluwasogo,+2349068465417,olawumi.oluwasogo@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Olawumi Oluwasogo, I am a social media specialist with four years of experience helping brands connect to their target audience through compelling storytelling and accurate optimization strategies. I love my job and I am really good at it. I have helped brands run successful campaigns that have contributed immensely to the organization bottom-line. \nI am versatile and skilled in all forms of content creation like video editing, graphic design, social media. Also, I excel in researching trends and analysing data to make informed decisions.\nI relax by playing video games it helps me think and get inspired with compelling ideas.\n",https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1joIBnjmdCbH-bBBxoGbOjo7d7NPa15nQ/edit?slide=id.p1#slide=id.p1,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-11-01T23:19:29.069Z,2025-11-01T23:19:29.069Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1762039165986__OLUWASOGO RESUME.pdf,Applied,,,,,
6906ad851eeb838da355b6f8,Olivia Hope Okereafor,+2348137509850,oliviahopeokereafor@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I became a mom in my early twenties and in my final year.While most of my mates were chasing dreams, I was chasing toddlers  sleepless nights, school runs, and endless responsibilities became my daily routine.\n\nThe first 10 years of my marriage were a mix of joy, tears, growth, and lessons. I birthed 4 amazing kids during those years  and at some point, I thought my dreams had to wait forever.\n\nBut one day, I decided to stop waiting and start becoming.\nI refused to let motherhood limit me.\nI picked up my phone, learned a digital skill, and step by step, I started building a new version of me, one that’s strong, confident, and impactful.\n\nI believe motherhood shouldn't stop my purpose,it shapes it and getting this role will empower me the more.",https://www.canva.com/design/DAGpTcNUvwc/MAU-bdvhPMIbl1vObtNJmA/edit,,68fa11a13901b7b11e3e38d4,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-11-02T01:01:57.215Z,2025-11-02T01:01:57.215Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1762045314342_CV_Okereafor_Olivia_Hope.docx_20251102_015833_0000.pdf,Applied,,,,,
