690a4bc1ea45abf381cde3d4,Emilagba Ibironke,+2347062101682,busolaemilagba@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nMy name is Emilagba Oluwabusolami Ibironke, and I bring a strong foundation in IT and software engineering, complemented by entrepreneurial and technical leadership experience. I founded The Honeymoon Planner, a tech-enabled platform that curates personalised travel experiences, which allowed me to merge creativity with business strategy and digital innovation.\n\nIn addition, I’ve worked with Design Union, a construction and consulting firm, where I led IT infrastructure projects for smart buildings. My role involved integrating IoT, CCTV, VOIP, and ERP systems across commercial developments. I designed scalable networks with 99.8% uptime, enforced cybersecurity protocols, and ensured compliance with NDPR and ISO standards. This experience deepened my expertise in aligning technology with operational efficiency and regulatory frameworks.\n\nI’m passionate about using technology to solve real-world problems, especially where innovation meets impact. I thrive in environments that challenge me to think strategically, build resilient systems, and deliver solutions that make a difference.",,,68fa14683901b7b11e3e38d5,Chief Technology Officer - CTO,2025-11-04T18:53:53.276Z,2025-11-04T18:53:53.276Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1762282430321_CV_Emilagba_Ibironke-.pdf,Applied,,,,,
