691644a2786d845942868929,Indranil Bain,+919547894514,indranilbain14@gmail.com,India,"Dear Whom It May Concern,\n\nMy name is Indranil Bain, and I am a 2024 CS grad from IIEST Shibpur, India. I am currently working as a Data Analyst at EvenFlow AI. \n\nI’ve had the opportunity to work at EvenFlow AI and i3 Digital Health, where I focused on building SLMs, automating data pipelines, scraping FDA databases building RAG based models from it, building AI-powered dashboards handling millions of records, and providing insights and analysis to both the team and clients. These experiences, along with projects like the Handwritten Math Expression Recognition Model, AI Document Chat App, and SkinCurate App, have strengthened my skills in Python, SQL, LangChain, Pyspark, AWS, and Azure.\n\nI am very interested in the opportunity to interview for a role at Tobams GROUP that blends data analytics and machine learning and management. Would you be open to a brief conversation to discuss how I could contribute to your team?\n\nThank you very much for your time and consideration.\n\nBest Regards,\nIndranil Bain\nEmail: indranilbain14@gmail.com\nLinkedIn: indranil-bain\n\nPortfolio: https://not-indro.github.io/Portfolio/\n\n",https://not-indro.github.io/Portfolio/,,69145d3186e2bdfb100d2f55,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-11-13T20:50:42.620Z,2025-11-13T20:50:42.620Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1763067039730_Indranil-Bain_CV_2026.pdf,Applied,,,,,
