691dde04786d845942868e3a,Consolation Ugochi Obazee,+2348146531675,obazeeconsole@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a purpose-driven communicator and community builder with a strong passion for people, clarity, and growth. Over the years, I’ve worked across social media management, content creation, and community leadership  (helping brands and individuals communicate better, engage deeper, and grow with intention).\n\nI’m meticulous and pay attention to people (how they think, how they grow, and what they need) and this reflects in the way I write, manage communities, and create content that teaches, inspires, or simplifies something complex.\n\nI work well in roles that allow me to serve, organize, and lead with empathy. I’m spiritually grounded, structured, and intentional about excellence. When I'm not designing content, managing conversations, I'm either supporting a team, and my focus is always on clarity, consistency, and adding real value.\n\nLastly, I’m someone who loves growth; growth in all spheres of life (personal, spiritual, and professional)  and I bring that same energy into every space I enter.",https://67fd23d92ad8c.site123.me,,69145d3186e2bdfb100d2f55,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-11-19T15:11:00.008Z,2025-11-19T15:11:00.008Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1763565056817_Consolation Obazee_ TobamsGroup-1.pdf,Applied,,,,,
691def07786d845942868e52,Michael Divine Oluwadamilare,+2347017024781,michaeldivinedivs@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an experienced Social Media Content Manager with nearly three years of professional practice in content strategy, digital communication, and community management. \n\nIn my current role, I oversee end-to-end content creation, including copywriting, visual design, and campaign planning, while ensuring brand alignment and measurable audience engagement.\n\nMy background combines strong creative skills with an analytical approach. \nI am proficient in developing structured content workflows, interpreting performance data, and adapting strategies to meet organizational goals. I consistently focus on producing high-quality, value-driven content that strengthens brand presence and fosters meaningful audience interaction.\n\nI am committed to continuous improvement, staying informed about emerging trends, and contributing positively to any team or organization I work with. \n\nMy goal is always to deliver clarity, professionalism, and results across all social media touchpoints.",https://tinyurl.com/MichaelDivinePortfolio,,69145d3186e2bdfb100d2f55,Associate Social Media Manager,2025-11-19T16:23:35.771Z,2025-11-19T16:23:35.771Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1763569412223_Michael Divine's Portfolio.docx.pdf,Applied,,,,,
