6966917ec6a42bcbfbbb8ee8,Emmanuel Odey,+2348113071920,odeymannuel@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m the right fit for this role because I combine real-world experience, speed, and measurable impact.\nI’ve designed and shipped multiple live websites and mobile apps across B2B and B2C products, working end-to-end—from discovery and UX strategy to polished UI and developer-ready handoff. This hands-on experience means I understand what actually ships, not just what looks good in Figma.\nOne example is a B2B and B2C website redesign I led, where the focus was improving clarity, trust, and conversion. By simplifying user flows, refining messaging hierarchy, and modernizing the interface, the brand saw an increase in revenue of approximately 22% within a few months post-launch. That result came directly from design decisions tied to user behavior and business goals.\nI’m also comfortable working in fast-moving, contract-based environments—quickly understanding requirements, collaborating with stakeholders, and delivering high-quality output within tight timelines. I don’t just design screens; I solve problems and think about how design supports growth, adoption, and long-term scalability.\n I bring the experience, execution speed, and product thinking needed to design clear, trustworthy experiences that help users confidently adopt and finance solar solutions.",https://www.behance.net/designnee,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-13T18:39:58.626Z,2026-01-13T18:39:58.626Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768329594986_Emmanuel Odey Resume new-1.pdf,Applied,,,,,
