6966936ac6a42bcbfbbb8faf,Victory Dyouth,+23408057728409,dyouthvictory@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Hollister (0xHollister on X), a passionate Web3 community builder, marketing strategist, and growth specialist based in Nigeria. With a Higher National Diploma (HND) in Computer Science, I've built and scaled communities for multiple NFT and blockchain projects in the Web3 space.\n\nMost notably, as Marketing Lead for Bedtime NFT, I single-handedly grew their X (Twitter) following from ~2k to over 13k and Discord community from 400 to 3000+ members through organic strategies, content planning, events (including high-level mega Spaces), and cross-marketing partnerships. I've also served as Community/Collab Manager for projects like Scribs, Amour X, Solaria, and others handling everything from onboarding, content calendars, KPI monitoring, influencer/PR collaborations, to stepping in as interim project lead during founder transitions.\n\nMy core belief is that ""hype dies eventually, but a strong community lives forever"" which drives my focus on authentic engagement, strategic partnerships (secured 5+ for cross-promotions), and bridging dev/core teams with communities. I'm adaptable, analytical, and thrive under pressure, with strong communication, leadership, and computer skills. Outside Web3, I enjoy gaming (especially Web3 gaming), reading, music, and socializing all of which fuel my community-building passion.\n\nI'm excited to bring my proven growth results and Web3 expertise to contribute to Tobams Group's mission of transforming Africa's tech landscape through talent empowerment and innovative digital solutions.",https://x.com/0xhollister,,6965fdc401bf490134411805,Associate Social Media Manager,2026-01-13T18:48:10.591Z,2026-01-13T18:48:10.591Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768330087525_My Portfolio .pdf,Applied,,,,,
