6967342ec6a42bcbfbbb92a1,Saheed Rasaq,+23408069720886,srasaq00@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Saheed C.R, a designer who cares deeply about clarity, momentum, and making ideas land. My work sits at the intersection of visual design, storytelling, and strategy. I don’t just make things look good. I design to communicate, persuade, and move people to action.\n\nOver the years, I’ve worked across branding, pitch decks, digital products, and visual systems, helping startups, founders, and teams translate complex ideas into clean, compelling visuals. I’m especially drawn to projects where design has a clear purpose. Whether that’s helping a company raise capital, articulate its vision, or present itself with confidence, I focus on outcomes, not decoration.\n\nI approach every project with the belief that good design should feel effortless to the audience, even if it’s anything but behind the scenes. That means obsessing over structure, hierarchy, and flow. I think a lot about how information is consumed, what deserves attention, and what should quietly support the story. The goal is always clarity first, then personality.\n\nAt the end of the day, I’m someone who takes ideas seriously and execution even more so. I care about how work performs in the real world, not just how it looks in a portfolio. If there’s a story to tell, a vision to sharpen, or a message that needs to hit harder, that’s where I do my best work.\n",https://saheedcollins.com,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-14T06:14:06.999Z,2026-01-14T06:14:06.999Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768371243032_Saheed C.R Resumee.pdf,Applied,,,,,
