6967a6115e5dc78bd8d4911f,Dera Godwin ,+2349012167081,deragodwin17@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Dera Godwin, I'm from Enugu State Nigeria and I'm 25 years old, As a graduate from Enugu State University of Science and Technology, my passion for UI/UX design is coupled with a strong grounding in accounting principles and a knack for acquiring knowledge. This unique blend of skills enables me to approach digital solutions with clarity and precision, ensuring that the user experience is not only intuitive but also financially informed.",http://be.net/deragodwin99,,6966006701bf490134411807,Associate Product Designer,2026-01-14T14:20:01.311Z,2026-01-14T14:20:01.311Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768400398033_DeraGodwin Jobber Cv-6.pdf,Applied,,,,,
6967a7365e5dc78bd8d4912d,Oreoluwa Okunade,+2348108620941,oreokunade@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a product designer who came into design by building, not by chasing titles.\n\nOver the years, I’ve worn different hats including designer, builder, and founder. I’ve worked across fintech, productivity, and consumer products, and I’ve seen how good ideas fail when they’re overdesigned or underbuilt. Those experiences shaped how I approach product today.\n\nI care deeply about clarity. Clear problems, clear decisions, and clear tradeoffs. I like getting close to the product, understanding the business context, and designing things engineers can ship and users can trust. I’m comfortable working in messy environments and simplifying complexity until it makes sense.\n\nAlongside client and team work, I’ve spent time building my own products and businesses. That exposure to real constraints like timelines, budgets, and technical limits has made me a more pragmatic designer. I think about impact beyond launch and take ownership of outcomes.\n\nAt this stage of my career, I’m looking to work with thoughtful teams that value honest collaboration and real progress. I’m focused on learning fast, shipping responsibly, and helping build products that genuinely improve how people live or work.",https://oreokunade.framer.website/,,6966006701bf490134411807,Associate Product Designer,2026-01-14T14:24:54.909Z,2026-01-14T14:24:54.909Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768400692057_Ore Okunade Resume. (Product).docx (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,
