6967b5519f11096d75482f37,Faith Oluwadamilola Ojumola,+23408140703604,oojumola@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Product Designer who enjoys thinking through problems before jumping into visuals. I care about how users actually move through a product, not just how the screens look.\n\nI started out learning design on my own and gradually grew into working with startups and teams, where I’ve been involved in user research, wireframing, design systems, and collaborating closely with developers and product managers. I’m especially interested in building products that are clear, usable, and intentional.\n\nLately, I’ve also been expanding my understanding of product strategy and project management, because I believe good design works best when it aligns with business goals and real user needs. I’m curious by nature, open to feedback, and always looking to improve how I design and think about products.",https://www.behance.net/oojumola,,6966006701bf490134411807,Associate Product Designer,2026-01-14T15:25:05.124Z,2026-01-14T15:25:05.124Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768404301563_Faith_Ojumola_CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,
