696823e89f11096d754832f6,Jerome Opara,+2349169140952,jheromeopara@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hey! I’m a Product Designer with 5 years of experience building thoughtful, user-centered digital experiences. I’ve worked with both local and international teams, from scrappy startups to growing companies - helping them design products that are not just visually clean but functionally smart.\n\nMy strength lies in balancing user needs with business goals, and making sure the experience feels seamless from start to finish. I’ve led end-to-end design processes, from user research and wireframing to prototyping and developer handoff.\n\nI’m constantly learning, asking “why?”, and pushing for clarity in every project I touch. Whether it’s refining flows or aligning with cross-functional teams, I’m all about making design work for people, not just look good.",https://bit.ly/4jRHKpF,,6966006701bf490134411807,Associate Product Designer,2026-01-14T23:16:56.005Z,2026-01-14T23:16:56.005Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768432613003_Jerome's CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,
696824569f11096d75483302,Chinedu Eke,+2349035503887,mannynedu@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a multimedia designer with a solid background and over six years of work experience in print and digital advertising campaigns. \nI am familiar with virtually all formats of deliverables and software design applications, including the use of prompts for AI support.",https://bit.ly/3N4ketD,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-14T23:18:46.594Z,2026-01-14T23:18:46.594Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768432723632_Manny-resume-real-est-2025.pdf,Applied,,,,,
6968250e9f11096d7548330a,Joshua Bamigboye,+23409138017411,Joshuapromise20@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nI’m a product designer with a strong focus on creating intuitive, user-centered digital experiences that balance business goals with real user needs. I enjoy working across the full design process, from research and problem definition to wireframing, visual design, and usability testing.\n\nI collaborate closely with product managers, developers, and stakeholders to turn complex ideas into simple, usable solutions. I’m particularly motivated by solving meaningful problems, improving usability through data and feedback, and continuously refining products based on real-world use.\n\nI’m detail-oriented, curious, and always eager to learn, which helps me adapt quickly and deliver thoughtful, scalable design solutions.",http://www.behance.net/joshuabamigboye,,6966006701bf490134411807,Associate Product Designer,2026-01-14T23:21:50.244Z,2026-01-14T23:21:50.244Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768432904945_JOSHUAP Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
696831169f11096d75483325,Tunde Shittu,+23408165602856,tundeshittu88@outlook.com,Nigeria,"I am a creative and detail-oriented Social Media Manager with a strong passion for digital communication, brand growth, and audience engagement. I have experience managing social media platforms, creating and scheduling content, analyzing performance metrics, and maintaining consistent brand messaging across channels. I enjoy turning ideas into engaging content that drives visibility, interaction, and results. I am highly organized, adaptable, and comfortable working independently or with a team, and I am always eager to learn new trends and tools to improve social media performance.",https://dribbble.com/shots/26962653-Recent-Projects?utm_source=Clipboard_Shot&utm_campaign=acemetrixx&utm_content=Recent%20Projects&utm_medium=Social_Share&utm_source=Clipboard_Shot&utm_campaign=acemetrixx&utm_content=Recent%20Projects&utm_medium=Social_Share,,6965fdc401bf490134411805,Associate Social Media Manager,2026-01-15T00:13:10.529Z,2026-01-15T00:13:10.529Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768435987974_Tunde-shittu ResumeSMM.pdf,Applied,,,,,
696849969f11096d75483348,Michael Friday,+23409124910782,fridaymichael1990@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Michael Friday, and I’m a Front-End Developer with a strong background in UI/UX design. I enjoy turning ideas and designs into clean, responsive, and user-friendly web experiences. I work mainly with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, and Tailwind CSS, focusing on performance, accessibility, and intuitive user flows.",lynotech.vercel.app,,6966006701bf490134411807,Associate Product Designer,2026-01-15T01:57:42.037Z,2026-01-15T01:57:42.037Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768442259283_Michael Etim Friday - Resume (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,
696872e59f11096d75483372,Owoade Adekola Adeleke,+23408114142209,owoadekola95@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Product Designer with 5+ years of experience creating scalable digital products for SaaS, B2B, and consumer platforms. I specialize in UX strategy, design systems, and end-to-end product ownership from research and wireframing to prototyping and usability testing. I focus on solving real user problems while driving measurable business impact, like improving engagement, retention, and delivery speed. Outside of work, I enjoy photography, listening to music, and watching movies, which help me stay creative and inspired.”","https://zaap.bio/Adekolaleke, https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.nodescale.buzzmap, https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.zacrac.parrot, https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.tocata.easyspend,  https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.nodescale.buzzmap,   https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.app.hitchpay,  https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.herrands, https://www.azid.ng/",,6966006701bf490134411807,Associate Product Designer,2026-01-15T04:53:57.799Z,2026-01-15T04:53:57.799Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768452834541_ADEKOLA OWOADE PD.pdf,Applied,,,,,
696873979f11096d7548337b,Anwar Ikechi Ibiam,+2349071666241,ianwaribiam@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My experience includes designing seamless and user-friendly interfaces for both mobile/web applications and a focus on consistency, usability and scalability. I have successfully collaborated with product and engineering teams to translate business requirements into intuitive designs and I am well-versed in using Figma, Adobe XD, Framer and Webflow to create responsive designs. I also have a solid understanding of design systems and have contributed to building reusable UI components for efficient product development. Throughout my career, I have built and customized a variety of websites, focusing on user experience, responsive design and performance optimization. I am skilled in web development and have experience with HTML, CSS, Javascript, Next.js, React and PHP. This allows me to translate complex and simple UI/UX designs into visually appealing and user friendly websites. My expertise with websites includes theme and plugin development, customizations, troubleshooting and general maintenance to ensure that websites look great and perform seamlessly.\nI have a strong command of Figma, Lottie, Adobe XD, Framer, WebFlow, Adobe Creative Suite, Canva, Mailchimp, Hubspot and Sketch. I believe my skills and passion for creating impactful products make me a great fit for your team.\n \nDesign Systems I've built:\nI have designed and customized design systems over the years that could scale across the platforms and industries, including beauty and retail, fintech, recruitment, agritech, edtech, healthtech etc Here are some:\nFresh Stayples (stayples.co): Developed reusable sets of components (ex: category cards, filters and item listings), design system used in both web and mobile app designs so there is brand consistency with quicker introduction of new features.\nKDN Plus (kdnplus.com): UX design of streaming platforms engaging with bold gradient styles, coherent interactions and subscription processes to increase the usability.\nGetBlok (getblok.ai): WhatsApp based AI crypto tools. I generated marketing visuals, onboarding flows and UI tokens that scale messaging and conversions.\nOthers include MyVivera (myvivera.com), Anambra State Stakeholders UK, EmpowerMe Recruitment (empowermerecruitment.uk), and Ubah Crops (ubahcrops.com). These projects represent the diverse approach to digital strategies represented in healthcare, edtech, recruitment and agritech built by me\n\nI use typography, spacing, color and component behavior. I also use reusable components: Primary (buttons, cards, forms), as well as foundational building blocks extendable across pages to the app modal. I integrate interactive prototypes built in Figma, sometimes supplemented with Lottie or motion tools to achieve rich interaction. For documentation, I use either via Notion or embed in Figma so that partners could be ramped up as quickly as possible and implementations performed consistently.\n\nHere are some links of live products I've designed which I am proud of:\nhttps://www.kdnplus.com/ \nhttps://www.getblok.ai/\nhttps://www.mycupid.ng/\nhttps://stayples.co/\nhttps://myvivera.com/\nhttps://availableprofessionals.com/\nhttps://straqa.com/\nhttps://empowermerecruitment.uk/\nhttps://ubahcrops.com/\n\nMy LinkedIn profile: https://www.linkedin.com/in/anwaribiam/\n\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.",https://anwaribiam.cv/,,6966006701bf490134411807,Associate Product Designer,2026-01-15T04:56:55.106Z,2026-01-15T04:56:55.106Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768453011346_Anwar Ibiam CV (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,
696887129f11096d754833a5,Helder Pilote,+258846378796,helderpilote150@gmail.com,Mozambique,"I am a passionate illustrator and graphic designer with a strong drive to create visuals that tell stories and evoke emotions. With over 10 years of experience, I take pride in collaborating with various agencies and publishers, bringing characters and concepts to life through vibrant illustrations and innovative designs. I am constantly exploring new techniques and trends to keep my work at the forefront of creativity.\n\n​Inspired by life’s obstacles, experiences, and challenges, I find the realization of my most vivid imaginations through the art of illustration and design. For me, creating is more than just a task; it is an integral part of a creative process where abstract ideas are transformed into visible, communicative realities. This transformation is not just what I do it is my true passion.""\n\n",https://www.linkedin.com/in/h%C3%A9lder-pilote-011a0b1a1?utm_source=share&utm_campaign=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=android_app,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-15T06:20:02.625Z,2026-01-15T06:20:02.625Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768457998021_portifolio_Helder.pdf,Applied,,,,,
696899a89f11096d754833d5,UGWOKE JAMES ,+2347048382020,ugwokejames3@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a creative and detail-oriented individual with a strong interest in social media, digital trends, and online community building. I enjoy creating engaging content, monitoring platform performance, and finding simple but effective ways to connect brands with their audience. I’m comfortable working across platforms like Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, and X, and I pay close attention to what resonates with users. I’m highly organized, open to learning, and I work well both independently and as part of a team. Overall, I’m passionate about using social media to tell stories, drive engagement, and support brand growth.",https://docs.google.com/document/d/14tnOgRFNl4qPGhYQRtxn_YkVr4pUN9bTI3XyLHYjAAk/edit?usp=drivesdk,,6965fdc401bf490134411805,Associate Social Media Manager,2026-01-15T07:39:20.667Z,2026-01-15T07:39:20.667Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768462758018_JAMES UGWOKE UPDATED CV .pdf,Applied,,,,,
69689a9f9f11096d754833e1,ROSEMARY AYODELE,+23408146542401,rozyosanemo@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hr,\nSome designers begin with colour palettes or typography. I begin with intention — the intention to tell stories that stay with people long after the screen goes dark or the page is closed. Over the years, I’ve carried this intention into fintech, entertainment, theatre, and international design teams — creating visuals that do more than look appealing; they work, communicate, and connect.\n\nFrom shaping landing pages and campaign materials at Flex Finance, to crafting branding and theatrical visuals at Kininso Koncepts, to designing UI assets for teams at  Appcake, my work blends storytelling, structure, and strategy.\n\nA few things define my approach:\n- I design with purpose, not guesswork.\n- I think in systems, not isolated elements.\n- I collaborate deeply, because great work is rarely a solo act.\n\nMy mastery of Figma, Adobe Creative Suite, Premiere Pro, and other visual tools supports my ability to execute across digital, print, motion, and product environments. Now in my final semester, studying Product Design at ALT School Africa, I continue refining my understanding of design across board — ensuring every visual and structural decision is intentional.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to bring this blend of creativity, clarity, and disciplined design thinking to your team.\n\nPortfolio: https://www.behance.net/rozymaria\nPhone: 08146542401\nEmail: rozyosanemo@gmail.com\n\nSincerely,\nRosemary O. Ayodele",https://www.behance.net/rozymaria,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-15T07:43:27.500Z,2026-01-15T07:43:27.500Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768463004345_My new CV Rosemary Ayodele -3.pdf,Applied,,,,,
6968a07c9f11096d754833f8,Ololade Olatunji,+23408107570178,ololade0507@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a UI/UX designer focused on creating simple, user centered digital experiences. I enjoy turning complex ideas into clear, intuitive interfaces through research, wireframing, and thoughtful UI design. I’m passionate about solving real user problems and continuously improving products through feedback and iteration",https://olatunjiololade.framer.website/,,6966006701bf490134411807,Associate Product Designer,2026-01-15T08:08:28.556Z,2026-01-15T08:08:28.556Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768464505282_My Design CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,
6968a11a9f11096d754833ff,Ademola Adewale,+23408143449996,ademolaadewale8854@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Ademola is a passionate designer and a self starter, I love solving creative problems. Growing in a rural area in lagos has also helped my creativity, I could remember while growing, I could make paper gun, cars, wooden swords and I so curious about how things are made. Before discovering design, I was an artist, I could draw with pencil and ink. Transitioning to design was the passion I had seen I was young, I am glad I did. With my experience I had been able to lead design teams, worked for startups, businesses, fintech and Saas ",Https://www.behance.net/Sirgappyary,,6966006701bf490134411807,Associate Product Designer,2026-01-15T08:11:06.335Z,2026-01-15T08:11:06.335Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768464663579_Ademola.pdf,Applied,,,,,
6968a28e9f11096d7548340d,Oluwatobi Ololade,+23407055806908,oluwatobiololade@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a senior product designer with over eight years of hands-on experience designing and shipping digital products across fintech, e-commerce, edtech, and media. I have led end-to-end product design for complex web and mobile platforms, from discovery and user research through interaction design, visual systems, and delivery. In my most recent role as Design Lead at a digital banking platform, I managed and mentored designers, partnered closely with product and engineering teams, and influenced product strategy and roadmap decisions. I have delivered high-impact solutions for large-scale initiatives, including contributing to a landmark global IPO project in the Middle East, and I am known for simplifying complexity, building scalable design systems, and creating user experiences that drive both adoption and business results.",www.oluwatobiololade.com,,6966006701bf490134411807,Associate Product Designer,2026-01-15T08:17:18.503Z,2026-01-15T08:17:18.503Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768465034934_Oluwatobi Ololade Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
6968a4919f11096d75483420,Okechi Emezue ,+23409028324500,davecole006@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Design Engineer who bridges the gap between aesthetic UX/UI design and technical frontend implementation. With a background in both Product Design and Software Engineering, I specialize in creating high-fidelity interfaces in Figma and bringing them to life using React, Next.js, and Tailwind CSS.\nI’ve led design and development for diverse platforms, including Osiso Pro and Fragvest, Afretrade etc where I focused on building scalable design systems and improving user flows. My unique advantage is my ability to design with a 'developer’s mindset' ensuring that every pixel I create is technically feasible and optimized for performance.\nI’m now looking to bring this hybrid skillset to a team where I can streamline the handoff between design and code to build more cohesive, user-centric products.",https://okechi.framer.website/,,6966006701bf490134411807,Associate Product Designer,2026-01-15T08:25:53.669Z,2026-01-15T08:25:53.669Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768465550858_okechi CV 25 (2).pdf,Applied,,,,,
