6968ab679f11096d75483464,Joel Osaro-Chikere,+23408108590874,joelosarochikere@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Osaro-Chikere Joel is a seasoned professional with a multifaceted skill set that spans across brand identity design, visual identity design, and graphics design. \n\nAs a graduate of marine engineering discipline, I changed trajectory to a design field in the early days of my university days.\n\nWith 5+ years of experience in the industry, Joel has honed his craft to perfection, consistently delivering innovative and workable design solutions. My passion for creating seamless digital experiences is evident in every project I undertake, as I meticulously combine creativity with functionality to exceed client expectations.",https://osarochikerejoel.mystrikingly.com/,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-15T08:55:03.206Z,2026-01-15T08:55:03.206Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768467299898_Joel Osaro-Chikere RESUME.pdf,Applied,,,,,
