er discuss how my experience can contribute to your organization’s success.\nThank you for your time and consideration.\nKind regards,\nChris Egokiniovo",https://instagram.com/chrisdavox,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-15T14:57:16.091Z,2026-01-15T14:57:16.091Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768489033625_Graphics Designer & Social Media Marketing Officer Resume â Chris Egokiniovo.pdf,Applied,,,,,
