6969de7851a4179fd073e742,Ejenavi Peter,+23408066271699,ejenavipeter2@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a creative graphics designer with 5+ years of experience across Tech, Finance, and Media companies. I approach every project by defining the problem, generating innovative concepts, and shaping them into refined, engaging designs. Whether it’s branding, marketing materials, or digital content, I strive to blend strategy with creativity to deliver work that truly resonates. \n\nMost recently, I worked with Wajusoft (U.S.A., Remote), where I created engaging designs for digital campaign marketing materials.   Previously, at First City Monument Bank, I worked on several digital ad creatives. But two campaigns stood out to me: the Credit Cards Campaign and the Valentine Refer & Win Campaign.  For the credit card rollout, I developed compelling digital advertising and email visuals that simplified complicated financial perks, resulting in a 28.4% increase in card sign-ups.  For the Valentine campaign, I created vivid, themed creatives that increased consumer engagement and resulted in a 47.2% increase in referral leads.  Both initiatives increased brand awareness and highlighted how effective design can affect conversions and engagement. I also designed a responsive landing page for the CSR unit.\n\nIn terms of tools, I have extensive experience with Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign, and After Effects), Figma, and Canva, as well as productivity applications such as Notion, Slack, and Google Workspace.  \n\n",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1piuK0I1YhzwbxY-qLbAKjP4E6l_5UHGK/view?usp=drive_link,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-16T06:45:12.523Z,2026-01-16T06:45:12.523Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768545910126_Ejenavi Peter - Resume.docx,Applied,,,,,
