696a2b84d8ebfb5489f4a0c1,Idorenyin Itoro Michael,+2348026290342,Kelzmanmedia@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a graphic and brand designer with over seven years of experience working across digital and print media. Over the years, I’ve designed brand identities, marketing materials, social media assets, presentations, and print collateral for businesses and professionals across different industries.\n\nI run my own design brand, Kelzmangraphix, where I collaborate closely with clients to translate ideas and business goals into clear, visually compelling designs. I’m highly proficient in Adobe Photoshop, Corel Draw InDesign.\n\nWhat defines my approach is attention to detail, strong design fundamentals, and the ability to adapt quickly to feedback and evolving project needs. I enjoy working in collaborative environments and contributing creatively to projects that have real impact.",https://www.behance.net/mhiztakelzman,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-16T12:13:56.508Z,2026-01-16T12:13:56.508Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768565633424_CV_KELZMAN.pdf,Applied,,,,,
