696a3ec4d8ebfb5489f4aa72,Wisdom Immanuel,+2348026244738,wisdomimmanuel03@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Wisdom Immanuel, and I am a Brand and Graphic Designer based in Lagos, Nigeria, with over three years of practical design experience. \nI am also a graduate of History & Strategic Studies from the University of Lagos. \nI have worked with brands such as OANDGLOBAL, Edustipend, Flatpurse, and SYMBLE, where I handled brand identity systems, social media designs, marketing materials, pitch decks, and print assets. \nI am proficient in industry-standard design tools such as Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign, Canva, Figma, and After Effects, and I also use CapCut for video editing. \nI genuinely love to learn and pick up new skills. That love for learning is what led me into design in the first place, and since then, it has been a continuous journey of growth and improvement. I remain open to new ideas, tools, and techniques that can make my work better.\nBeyond technical skills, I am collaborative and open to learning. In my spare time, I love watching football. I support Chelsea by the way. ",https://www.behance.net/wisdomimmanuel03,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-16T13:36:04.462Z,2026-01-16T13:36:04.462Z,,,"https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768570561300_IMMANUEL, WISDOM CV.pdf",Applied,,,,,
