696a49396b4632601d56dd9b,Damola Adebanji,+23409137900766,damolaadebanji@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a product designer who genuinely enjoys solving problems through thoughtful and intuitive design. I’ve always been interested in understanding how people think and behave, and that curiosity is what led me toward UX and product design. For me, good design is about more than making something look nice, it’s about creating experiences that feel simple, useful, and meaningful to real people.\n\nOver time, I’ve developed experience in user research, wireframing, prototyping, and visual design. I enjoy being involved in the full design process, from understanding user needs to testing and refining ideas. Tools like Figma have become a big part of how I work, but I believe the most important skills are empathy, communication, and the ability to think critically about problems.\n\nI work best in collaborative environments where ideas are shared openly and feedback is encouraged. I’m always eager to learn, improve, and take on new challenges. What motivates me most is knowing that the work I do can have a positive impact on users and make their everyday lives a little easier.",     https://damolaadebanji.vzy.io/,,6966006701bf490134411807,Associate Product Designer,2026-01-16T14:20:41.300Z,2026-01-16T14:20:41.300Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768573238084_ADEBANJI_DAMOLA_G. Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
