696a5db66b4632601d56e6f1,Aastha Duggal,+9109560197638,duggalaastha99@gmail.com,India,"’m EXACTLY who you’re looking for and I’d love to help with your social and creative needs!\n\nA little bit about me,\nHii, I’m Aastha, a Senior Social Media Manager with:\n- 7 years of experience\n- Grown 0 to 150k brands [Instagram, Facebook, Youtube, LinkedIn & X]\n- 30+ niches \n\nPortfolio: https://aastha-duggal-smm-z5h9uqi.gamma.site/\n[You’ll find brands, numbers, screenshots, case studies, graphic designs and video samples — all of it.]\n\nI live and breathe social media, I enjoy it to my core!\nI’m perfectly organised, and I mean it because I can breathe happily when everything is in the right place.\nBut you shouldn’t work with me just because of the results and numbers, but rather:\n\n- I will be personally involved - every step of the way\n- Work will be done on/ before time - you’ll never have to ask\n- I will make it happen - whatever it is you need\n\nSo, I can help with any ONE or ALL of the services you need:\n\n1. Strategy + ideation\n2. Content creation - copy, graphic design, video editing\n3. Social media management\n4. Community engagement & growth\n5. Organic ads [hands-on] & consultation [paid-ads]\n\n\nSo if you’re looking for someone who will actually do the work, and take some load and responsibility off your shoulders,\nInvest in this - I promise to be a team member, and not someone just ticking off tasks!\n\nIf you’re open to a remote position, \nlet’s talk!\n\nThank you so much!\n\nHave a beautiful week ahead!\nBest,\nAastha Duggal\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/aastha-duggal-freelance-social-media-manager-5a46861b5/",https://aastha-duggal-smm-z5h9uqi.gamma.site/,,6965fdc401bf490134411805,Associate Social Media Manager,2026-01-16T15:48:06.625Z,2026-01-16T15:48:06.625Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768578483335_Resume'25.pdf,Applied,,,,,
