696bc4d36b4632601d56ec30,Ayobami Joshua Olorunfemi ,+2348106867506,Olorunfemiayobami26@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Greetings \n\nI am a Product Designer with over four years of experience designing scalable B2B and B2C products across SaaS, fintech, AI-powered platforms, and marketplaces. Below are five reasons why I believe I am a strong fit for this role.\n\n1. End-to-End Product Ownership\n\nI currently work as a Product Designer at Anutio, where I own the full design lifecycle across B2B and B2C products, from research and UX strategy to high-fidelity UI and developer handoff. I design complete systems that support multiple user types, permissions, and complex workflows.\n\n\n\n2. Proven Impact on Growth & Adoption\n\nMy work has contributed to 1000%+ user growth and a 30% reduction in onboarding drop-off by simplifying complex flows and improving clarity across critical user journeys.\n\n\n\n3. Expertise in Complex & Scalable Systems\n\nI specialize in designing SaaS, fintech, AI-powered, and marketplace products, including dashboards, payment flows, and multi-step processes where trust, accuracy, and usability are critical.\n\n\n\n4. Design Systems & Cross-Functional Collaboration\n\nI have built scalable design systems for web and mobile, collaborating closely with product managers and engineers to deliver developer-ready Figma files and clear implementation guidance.\n\n\n5. Speed, Ownership & Delivery\n\nI move fast without sacrificing quality, demonstrated by delivering 300+ screens for Shenandoah University’s complete digital ecosystem in three weeks.\n\n\n\nRegards,\n\nAyobami Joshua Olorunfemi\n\nProduct Designer\n\nPortfolio: ayobamiportfolio.framer.website\n\nLinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/ayobami-olorunfemi",https://ayobamiportfolio.framer.website/,,6966006701bf490134411807,Associate Product Designer,2026-01-17T17:20:19.793Z,2026-01-17T17:20:19.793Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768670416038_Ayobami Joshua Olorunfemi Design Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,
