696bf8716b4632601d56ecef,KOLAWOLE TOBILOBA ,+2348033950901,kolawoletobiloba88@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi team, \n\nI graduated from the University of Ibadan with a BSc in Sociology. I’m an ambivert who enjoys doing meaningful work from my comfort zone, especially work that involves thinking, reporting, and problem-solving. Because my work is mostly immobile, I make time for physical exercise and sports during my leisure time. I enjoy activities like lawn tennis, which help me stay balanced and active outside of work.\n\nProfessionally, I’m a social media strategist who believes that most brands already have something valuable to say, they just need the right strategy to turn those ideas into content people understand and connect with. Over the past three years, I’ve worked across different industries including tech, health, education, entertainment, fashion, and Web3. I’m experienced with remote work and collaboration, using tools like Notion, Meta Business Suite, Metricool, Google Workspace, Canva and CapCut to plan, execute, and manage content effectively. \n\nAt the core of my work, my goal is to help brands communicate clearly, grow sustainably, and build meaningful connections with their audience.\n",https://sociable-pigeon-rdtjh5.mystrikingly.com/,,6965fdc401bf490134411805,Associate Social Media Manager,2026-01-17T21:00:33.824Z,2026-01-17T21:00:33.824Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768683631142_Kolawole Tobiloba Aminat [SMM].pdf,Applied,,,,,
696bf99e6b4632601d56ecfd,David Olanlokun,+23409064648242,bammiecreations@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a Graphic Designer with over four years of experience creating visual work that's bold, intentional, and built to perform. I've collaborated with startups, consumer brands, and marketing teams to develop brand identities, packaging, editorial layouts, and campaign assets that capture attention and communicate clearly.\n\nMy strength lies in making strategic creative decisions. I understand how typography, color, composition, and imagery work together to establish hierarchy, convey tone, and guide the viewer's eye. Whether I'm building a brand system from the ground up, designing print collateral, or producing digital marketing creatives, I focus on work that's visually striking but never sacrifices clarity for style.\n\nI'm highly proficient in Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, and InDesign, and I move fluidly between brand work, print production, and digital formats. I've developed a collaborative workflow that allows me to interpret creative briefs accurately, incorporate stakeholder feedback efficiently, and deliver polished, print-ready or production-ready files on tight timelines.\nWhat defines my work is purposeful restraint. I believe great graphic design doesn't shout, it speaks with confidence. I'm drawn to clean layouts, thoughtful type pairings, and compositions that feel balanced rather than busy. I create work that serves the message first and enhances it visually without distraction.\n\nI'd welcome the chance to discuss how my approach and experience could contribute to your creative projects.",https://www.behance.net/bammie,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-17T21:05:34.869Z,2026-01-17T21:05:34.869Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768683930726_David Olanlokun Graphic Designer CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,
