696d0e4a6b4632601d56eec8,Oshunbiyi Adeboye Folarinde,+2348145895259,folarinoshunbiyi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Adeboye Folarinde Oshunbiyi, a Computer Science graduate and multidisciplinary artist with over nine years of hands-on creative experience. My journey began with graphic design, illustration, and painting, where I built a strong visual foundation and mastered tools within the Adobe Creative Suite, including Photoshop, Illustrator, and InDesign.\n\nDriven by curiosity and a love for storytelling, I transitioned into motion graphics, visual effects, video editing, and sound design using After Effects and Premiere Pro. Over time, my passion for immersive visuals led me into the world of 3D art, where I now focus most of my creative work.\n\nI currently work with tools such as Blender, Maya, Substance Painter, and Unreal Engine, blending technical knowledge with artistic expression to create compelling visuals, animations, and interactive experiences.",https://www.behance.net/folzyo,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-18T16:46:02.595Z,2026-01-18T16:46:02.595Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768754759918_CURRENT CV OSHUNBIYI FOLARINDE Document.pdf,Applied,,,,,
