696e2010d17960f1ca64c739,david okoro,+23408089680590,okorodavidobehi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is David Okoro. I’m a brand and graphic designer who enjoys creating clean, thoughtful designs and helping brands communicate clearly. I’ve worked on logos, brand identities, and digital designs, and I really enjoy the process of turning ideas into visuals that make sense and feel intentional.\n\nOutside of work, I enjoy learning new things, exploring creative ideas, and improving myself both personally and professionally. I like spending time reading, watching design and business content, and occasionally playing football to stay active. I’m naturally curious, detail-oriented, and I enjoy working independently while still collaborating with others when needed.\n\nI’m comfortable working remotely, I manage my time well, and I take responsibility for my work. Overall, I’m someone who’s committed to growth, open to feedback, and genuinely enjoys what I do.",Behance.net/davidokoro,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-19T12:14:08.690Z,2026-01-19T12:14:08.690Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768824844688_Okoro David Obehi (CV).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
696e21ecd17960f1ca64c764,Onasanya Abraham,+23408054086639,onasboluwatife2002@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a dedicated Graphic Designer and Printer with a strong foundation built from hands-on experience in the renowned Printing Village of Mushin, Lagos, where I began learning my craft in 2018. Immersed in the vibrant printing community, I developed a deep understanding of both traditional and modern printing techniques, while honing my creative design skills to meet diverse client needs.\nSince 2021, I have been working as a freelance designer and printer, collaborating with individuals, businesses, and organizations to deliver high-quality visual solutions. Over the years, I have had the privilege of working with major brands, including Showtime Flag Football Nigeria, as well as several foreign brands, further strengthening my reputation for excellence and adaptability in diverse markets.\nWith a blend of creativity and technical skill, I bring ideas to life through design and print, helping brands stand out and communicate their message with clarity and style. My journey from Mushin’s Printing Village to freelancing for Various brands has shaped me into a versatile professional who values craftsmanship, innovation, and excellence.\n\n",https://www.behance.net/abrahamiliyas,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-19T12:22:04.282Z,2026-01-19T12:22:04.282Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768825320454_MY CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
696e4bb3d17960f1ca64c8ec,Curtis Maro,+2349161734652,oghenemaro.iteire@icloud.com,Nigeria,"I’m a perspicacious, all-ground nice guy and graphic designer who believes design should do more than look good, it should work.\n\nWith almost a decade of hands-on experience, I bring clarity, strategy, and intention to every project, combining strong visual intelligence with real business sense. I don’t just chase trends; I build brands that last.\n\nSo, If you’re the best at what you do, don’t settle for “good” designers. Hire someone who thinks deeper and executes cleaner (me)",https://www.behance.net/gallery/239480405/Curtis-Maro-Portfolio,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-19T15:20:19.545Z,2026-01-19T15:20:19.545Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768836016710_Curtis Maro Resume N.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
