696eb16fc1f65ace677d5232,Izuchukwu Chinedum Igwe,+2347030477981,izuigwe39@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Izuchukwu, but you can also call me 'Izuthecreator'. I'm a visual designer with about 3 years of experience. Within these years, I've explored different areas of design, such as Graphic design, UI/UX and a little bit of Motion design. I've also worked on a large variety of projects as a freelancer. When I'm less busy, I play video games, or engage in any physical activity like workouts, dancing, hiking, etc.\nCurrently, I'm looking to function in design roles where I can be creative, be myself, add value, and also receive value and grow further in my career.",https://www.behance.net/izuchukwuigwe1,,6966006701bf490134411807,Associate Product Designer,2026-01-19T22:34:23.631Z,2026-01-19T22:34:23.631Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768862060821_Igwe Izuchukwu CV UI-UX.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
696ebc8ec1f65ace677d5263,Sarah Umoru,+23409134503504,sarahumoru123@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a product designer who enjoys turning messy ideas into clear, usable products. Over the past couple of years, I’ve worked on live products where I wasn’t just pushing pixels, I was thinking through user problems, edge cases, and how designs would actually ship. I care a lot about clarity, accessibility, and building systems that scale, and I work best in close collaboration with engineers and product teams. I’m always looking to improve how people experience products, not just how they look.",https://sarahumoruportfolio.framer.website/,,6966006701bf490134411807,Associate Product Designer,2026-01-19T23:21:50.235Z,2026-01-19T23:21:50.235Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768864906777_Sarah Umoru_Associate_Product_Designer.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
696ebcafc1f65ace677d526a,Tijesuni Olawoore,+2348140880362,olawooretijesuni@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a creative and detail-oriented Graphic Designer with experience designing across digital and print platforms. I’m skilled in Adobe Photoshop, Illustrator, and InDesign, and I enjoy turning ideas into clear, engaging visuals that align with brand goals.\n\nI work well in collaborative environments, take feedback positively, and manage multiple projects while meeting deadlines. I’m passionate about continuous growth, creativity, and delivering quality design that communicates effectively.",https://pinterest.com/Tijesuniolawoore,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-19T23:22:23.508Z,2026-01-19T23:22:23.508Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768864940665_Tijesuni Olawoore_CV Graphic Designer.docx.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
696f1299c1f65ace677d52cf,Joshua Sopruchim ,+2348132487317,ozogbudaj@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I possess complete knowledge of the different design principles and their applications in; Branding, Motion Design & Video Production, Print Designs, UI Design, Social Media ADs, promote conversion rate and also deliver a great first impression.\n\n",https://www.instagram.com/designs.joe?igsh=eDNvZnl1bmJqNHBt,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-20T05:28:57.237Z,2026-01-20T05:28:57.237Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768886933750_JOSHUA S.O CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
696f23a7c1f65ace677d52f4,Regina Ezinne Apakama,+23407032925870,reginaapakama@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Myname is Regina Apakama, a passionate and creative Product Designer with a strong foundation in design principles and a desire to contribute innovative solutions. Eager to learn and collaborate with cross-functional teams to create user-centered products. As a recent entrant into the field, I bring fresh perspectives and a hunger for growth. I completed a certification course in Product Design from AltSchool Africa and Internship training with Programmify. During my training, I gained proficiency in design software such as Figma. My coursework included user research, prototyping, and interaction design, which equipped me with a solid foundation in product design principles. As part of my coursework, I collaborated on a team project to design a web app for online transactions of goods and services with escrow payment system. I conducted the user research and result analysis and contributed in the user interface (UI) design, ensuring a seamless and intuitive experience for users. I also participated in a Web 3 hackathon organized by Women in Blockchain Africa. I led a team of 5 to design a web application of an educational platform for women to access tech program, focusing on enhancing usability and visual appeal. I am passionate about creating products that solve real-world problems and delight users. I believe in a human-centered approach, where empathy and understanding drive design decisions. I pay meticulous attention to details, from pixel-perfect icons to smooth animations. I understand that small design choices can significantly impact the overall user experience. I thrive in collaborative environments and enjoy working with cross-functional teams. I am adaptable and open to feedback, always seeking opportunities for growth. I am impressed by the company's commitment to innovation and user-centric design. I am confident that my skills and enthusiasm align well with your team’s vision. I would love the chance to discuss how I can contribute to your upcoming projects. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to further discuss my qualifications. Growth is essential to my continued career success, and I am excited for the chance to be a part of the industry leading team. I believe my growth trajectory, problem solving and entrepreneurial mindset are the greatest asset I have to make a difference.","www,behance.net/reginaapakama/",,6966006701bf490134411807,Associate Product Designer,2026-01-20T06:41:43.400Z,2026-01-20T06:41:43.400Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768891300888_Product Design CV Copiable.docx,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
696f28c5c1f65ace677d5317,Nwachukwu Chukwudi,+23409037366518,chuddyn95@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Nwachukwu Chukwudi Augustine, and I am a Graphic Designer, 3D Modeller and 3D Animator with residence in Lagos, Nigeria.\n\nI have 3 years of experience as a graphics Designer working for various companies and clients as a full time employee or freelancer. \nThroughout my experience, I have been involved in projects that include brand visualization, digital design, 3D modeling and animation, as well as managing social media platforms. Some brands I have worked with include Jtech Global Resources a trading company, Machid Integrated Services a production company, and Insidemarket.ng an e-commerce company on which I delivered services such as creating marketing material, edited videos, and brand presentation visuals. \n\nMy strengths are:\nEffective visual storytelling and brand interpretation\nKnowledge in using design and 3D softwares that is standard practice.\nExperience in interdisciplinary teamwork\nPassionate about displaying my creativity \nA Fast Learner and a good listener.",https://www.behance.net/CudiNwachukwu,,6965fe9801bf490134411806,Associate Graphic Designer,2026-01-20T07:03:33.241Z,2026-01-20T07:03:33.241Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1768892609879_Chukwudi Nwachukwu Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
