6989d4d94c122ff72e60a285,Oluwapelumi Agbebunmi ,+2348131271806,pelumiagbebunmi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hello, I’m Pelumi; an operations professional with over five years of experience across technology, energy, and education. What truly defines my approach is my ability to stay calm under pressure, ensuring smooth and effective outcomes even in fast-paced or demanding environments.\n\nI bring an innovative mindset to process improvement, always looking for smarter ways to enhance efficiency and service quality. My passion lies in building and leading teams, nurturing stakeholder relationships, and driving tangible results that make a difference.\n\nBeyond the operational details, I’m deeply curious; always eager to learn, adapt, and connect with new people and ideas. Whether managing logistics, coordinating remote teams, or improving daily workflows, I believe in leading with clarity, empathy, and a solutions-focused attitude.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/agbebunmi-oluwapelumi-5684081a9,,6989c258be2e747d922bc798,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-09T12:36:41.182Z,2026-02-09T12:36:41.182Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1770640598535_Oluwapelumi resume om.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
