698a076a4c122ff72e60a4c0,Jacob Abua Orim,+2348148385318,orimabua47@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I started my career as an accountant in a real estate firm where I worked closely with operational control, asset tracking, reconciliations, and ensuring spending aligned with actual site and property activities. That experience built my foundation in systems, accountability, and process discipline.  \n  \nI then moved into Organisation Development and consulting, supporting companies to document processes, align teams to strategy, and improve execution through SOPs, dashboards, and structured coordination across departments.  \n  \nIn a fintech role as a Performance Manager, I managed performance systems for over 300 staff, translating strategy into KPIs, tracking deliverables, and ensuring teams stayed aligned through consistent follow-up and reporting.  \n  \nAcross these roles, my work has consistently involved keeping teams organized, maintaining documentation, coordinating projects, supporting recruitment and onboarding processes, and ensuring execution does not break between people and priorities. That is why this role strongly aligns with what I have been doing.  \n  ",,,6989c258be2e747d922bc798,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-09T16:12:26.131Z,2026-02-09T16:12:26.131Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1770653543457_Abua_Jacob_Orim_OM.docx.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
