698c52794c122ff72e60b71d,Sarah Chat Atta,+2349080983901,sarahatta90@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am someone who genuinely enjoys keeping things organized and moving forward. Over the past several years, I have worked in operations and coordination roles across both public and private organizations, supporting leadership with planning, documentation, recruitment processes, reporting, and day-to-day execution.\n\nMost of my work involves creating structure and clarity. I track deadlines, follow up consistently, document processes, and help turn ideas into clear action steps. I am comfortable working across different teams and managing multiple priorities at once while maintaining strong attention to detail.\n\nIn my current role, I support planning and reporting processes, maintain key documents and trackers, and coordinate with stakeholders to ensure projects stay on schedule. I work well independently and take ownership of my responsibilities, especially in remote environments where accountability matters.\n\nI take pride in being dependable, calm under pressure, and clear in my communication. I like knowing that because I am keeping things organized behind the scenes, others can focus on bigger decisions with confidence.\n",,,6989c258be2e747d922bc798,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-11T09:57:13.538Z,2026-02-11T09:57:13.538Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1770803830150_Sarah Atta - Resume 11022026.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
698cac17ecdfcccc9730e5f3,Chinedu Ike,+23408134591188,ikechinedu360@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a procurement and supply chain professional focused on ensuring operational efficiency through data-driven decision-making.\n\nI graduated from the University of Nigeria, Nsukka in 2022 with a degree in Business Management, where I developed a strong foundation in supply chain operations and business processes. Very shortly after graduation, I was selected as one of 30 participants from over 2,000 applicants for the SAP Young Professionals Program. This was an intensive training program that launched my career in Business, Technology and Digital Transformation whilst also allowing me focus on the key business pathways that Supply Chain Management encompasses.\n\nOver the last two years, I have worked as a Procurement Inventory and Supply Chain Analyst with SAP specialization at WYZE Consulting Services, where I've supported end-to-end business processes, inventory optimization, supply chain management and digital transformation processes across multiple industries including Industrial Manufacturing, FMCG, Oil & Gas etc.  I have been thoroughly involved in the full length and breadth of it.\n",,,6989c258be2e747d922bc798,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-11T16:19:35.730Z,2026-02-11T16:19:35.730Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1770826772884_Chinedu Ike_SAP Functional Analyst_CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
