698e6d82a99b5f1d41f11d7e,Anita Nkwocha,+23407049418642,writeanita.n@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a passionate software engineer with hands-on experience building responsive, user-centric web applications. I recently completed an Advanced Diploma in Software Engineering from Aptech Computer Education, where I developed a strong foundation in programming principles, data structures, and full-stack development.\nCurrently, I work as a Software Engineer at Dakat Pay, where I build and maintain responsive user interfaces for a fintech platform using Next.js and TailwindCSS. I focus on creating secure, intuitive user flows for features like airtime conversion, wallet funding, and gift card trading, while collaborating closely with backend engineers to integrate APIs and ensure seamless communication between frontend and server-side services.\nBeyond my professional work, I'm deeply interested in AI and interactive technologies. I've built projects like DropMotion, an AI-powered gesture control application using computer vision, and PredictCasa-AI, a machine learning web app for house price prediction. I've also completed certifications in Machine Learning and Data Structures & Algorithms, which complement my technical skill set.\nI'm someone who thrives on learning new technologies and pushing the boundaries of what's possible in web development, which is why I'm excited about opportunities that involve innovation and cutting-edge tools.",,,698d92dcbe2e747d922bc7b1,Associate Frontend Developer,2026-02-13T00:17:06.053Z,2026-02-13T00:17:06.053Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1770941822835_Anita N's Resume (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
