698ec4c7a99b5f1d41f11d9d,Mahbub Noyon,+88001687874697,mahbub4noyon96@gmail.com,Bangladesh,"I am a Software Engineer with over 3.5 years of professional experience specializing in the Next.js and TypeScript ecosystem. My background is rooted in building high-performance, scalable web applications where performance and user experience are paramount. I have a strong foundation in React Native for cross-platform mobile development and a deep interest in the intersection of AI and frontend engineering. I’ve spent my career translating complex requirements into pixel-perfect interfaces, focusing on clean architecture, Redux state management, and robust testing using frameworks like Cypress.",https://mahbub-noyon.vercel.app/,,698d92dcbe2e747d922bc7b1,Associate Frontend Developer,2026-02-13T06:29:27.747Z,2026-02-13T06:29:27.747Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1770964165273_mahbubNoyonResume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
698ecbe4a99b5f1d41f11de6,Kelvin Ofoeyeno,+23408141170610,kelvinofoeyeno1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a fullstack and mobile developer with over five years of experience building web and mobile applications from end to end. I work across the stack — from designing backend APIs with Node.js and managing databases to building responsive, user-focused interfaces with React, Next.js, and TypeScript, as well as mobile apps with React Native.\n\nOn the frontend, I focus on writing clean, scalable code and building intuitive user experiences. I’ve worked with REST APIs, structured Next.js applications for maintainability, and optimized performance for production environments. I enjoy translating product ideas into interactive, responsive interfaces that users actually enjoy using.\n\nBecause I come from a fullstack background, I naturally think about frontend decisions in relation to backend architecture, performance, and scalability. That perspective helps me build solutions that are not just visually appealing, but technically sound.\n\nI value collaboration, code quality, and continuous improvement, and I’m excited about opportunities where I can contribute to building engaging and scalable digital products.",https://github.com/kelzleo,,698d92dcbe2e747d922bc7b1,Associate Frontend Developer,2026-02-13T06:59:48.528Z,2026-02-13T06:59:48.528Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1770965985389_Kelvin-Ofoeyeno_CV (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
