698f4edaa99b5f1d41f1221a,Ayomide Babaoye,+2349019857993,babaoyeoladele@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Senior Fullstack Software Engineer with 8+ years of experience architecting and delivering scalable web and mobile solutions for clients across Nigeria and the UK.  I specialize in building modern full-stack applications using technologies such as React, React Native,nextjs,typescript,Laravel (PHP), Node.js (Express), Golang, Java, and Python — combined with Tailwind CSS, HTML5, and JavaScript for beautiful, responsive frontends.  On the backend, I’ve built and optimized high-performance RESTful APIs, microservices, and real-time features using Laravel, Node.js, and Golang. I deploy reliably using AWS, Render, and Vercel, and integrate CI/CD pipelines to ensure smooth, automated delivery.  I’ve contributed to impactful projects including Nuvify (a UK HealthTech platform connecting nurses and medical organizations) and Savannah Global Commodities (UK), where I built scalable platforms that handled transactions and users globally.  I thrive in Agile/Scrum environments, collaborating closely with cross-functional teams to turn complex problems into clean, maintainable solutions. I’m passionate about engineering excellence, developer experience, and mentoring younger engineers.  💼 Key Domains: Turning Ideas Into Reality. 🧰 Tech Stack: React, React Native, Node.js, Golang, Laravel (PHP), Python, Java, Tailwind CSS, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, PostgreSQL, MySQL, Docker, AWS, Vercel, Render, CI/CD ",LinkedIn.com/in/babaoye,,698d92dcbe2e747d922bc7b1,Associate Frontend Developer,2026-02-13T16:18:34.248Z,2026-02-13T16:18:34.248Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1770999511427_Babaoye_Ayomide_Senior_Developer.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
