699049e1a99b5f1d41f12447,Emmanuel Adewunmi,+23409023490952,emmanueladewunmi51@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Dear Hiring Manager,\n\nMy name is Emmanuel Adewunmi, and I am a frontend-focused software developer with over five years of experience building scalable, high-performance digital products across healthcare, Web3, EdTech, and enterprise environments. I am deeply passionate about creating user-centered interfaces that are not just visually polished but architecturally sound, performant, and impactful.\n\nThroughout my career, I have specialized in Next.js and React.js, building applications that serve thousands of users globally. I enjoy working at the intersection of clean frontend architecture, performance optimization, and emerging technologies such as AI integration.\n\nMy experience aligns closely with your requirements:\n\n5+ years of professional frontend development experience with strong expertise in Next.js and React.js\n\nAdvanced proficiency in JavaScript (ES6+) and TypeScript\n\nCross-platform mobile development using React Native and Flutter\n\nProven experience integrating AI/ML models into production applications\n\nStrong understanding of Redux, RESTful APIs, and state management\n\nFrontend performance optimization and SEO best practices\n\nHands-on experience with Git and Agile/Scrum workflows\n\nTesting experience and structured development practices\n\nOne of my key projects is Carefluxa AI, an enterprise-grade AI-powered Patient Risk Assessment System that analyzes patient data to predict risk levels and support proactive healthcare decisions. This project required secure architecture, AI model integration, real-time dashboards, and scalable frontend systems.\n\nBeyond development, I have strong prompt engineering skills and have integrated AI capabilities into several applications. I have also built AI-powered extensions for Visual Studio Code to improve developer productivity and debugging workflows.\n\nI am highly collaborative, solution-oriented,