6992010ea99b5f1d41f12845,Abdulrasheed Madamidola,+23409038450563,aomadamidola@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Frontend Engineer based in Lagos with a track record of building high-performance, data-driven applications. My experience spans both the corporate fintech space and the innovative AI landscape.\n\nDuring my time at AFEX, where I recently engineered a $200M+ digital marketplace, I focused on building resilient frontend systems for complex financial markets. This role required extreme precision in TypeScript and React, as I was responsible for implementing dashboards and real-time data visualizations that farmers and investors rely on for commodity trading.\n\nBuilding on that foundation of scale and reliability, I recently developed Dr. Drills, an AI-powered medical education platform. This project allowed me to dive deep into Next.js and React Native, specifically focusing on integrating AI-powered APIs and managing native configurations in Expo to create a seamless, intelligent user experience.\n\nI hold a degree from the University of Ibadan and pride myself on being a ""build and execution"" developer. I don't just write code; I build clean, scalable, and user-centric interfaces that solve real-world problems, whether that's financial inclusion at a national level or bringing AI to mobile education.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/yinkaah,,698d92dcbe2e747d922bc7b1,Associate Frontend Developer,2026-02-15T17:23:26.075Z,2026-02-15T17:23:26.075Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1771176202997_CV - Abdulrasheed Madamidola Olayinka. (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
