699497ca6b919cd566860071,muhammad mukhtar,+2347088350179,amirmukhtarme@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a frontend developer with 4+ years of experience building web and mobile applications using Next.js, React Native, and TypeScript. I've worked on 8+ production applications across fintech, logistics, and EdTech, with 4 currently live on the Play Store.\n\nBeyond standard frontend work, I build AI-powered products. I've integrated OpenAI and Claude APIs across multiple projects, including a mentoring platform, a university navigation app, and PathFive - a gamified leadership development game I built and currently maintain. I also built KylianERP with an MCP (Model Context Protocol) server that lets users navigate and interact with the app through natural language AI commands.\n\nI'm obsessed with creating experiences that users actually enjoy, whether that's smooth mobile interactions, gamified learning systems, or AI features that feel natural rather than gimmicky. I work remotely, move fast, and care deeply about code quality and user experience.",https://muhammad-mukhtar.vercel.app/,,698d92dcbe2e747d922bc7b1,Associate Frontend Developer,2026-02-17T16:31:06.729Z,2026-02-17T16:31:06.729Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1771345863362_Muhammad_Mukhtar_Frontend_Developer_Tobams.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
