699da87d4664ea526d618b80,Bada Solomon Oluyemi,+23408052471320,badaoluyemi2@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a highly organized HR and operations professional with hands-on experience supporting recruitment, coordination, documentation, and day-to-day execution across teams. I recently worked as an HR Associate, where I supported end-to-end recruitment, maintained records, tracked KPIs, coordinated onboarding, and ensured smooth follow-through on people and operational processes. I’m very comfortable working across multiple priorities and keeping things moving without constant supervision.\n\nBeyond HR, I’ve led and supported complex projects that required structure and execution. As Project Head for a large university event, I coordinated stakeholders, managed timelines and budgets, handled vendors, and ensured delivery from planning through execution. That experience strengthened my ability to turn high-level ideas into actionable plans, manage documentation, and follow up relentlessly until outcomes were achieved.\n\nI’m extremely organized, detail-driven, and comfortable with tools like Google Workspace, Excel/Sheets, and task trackers. I work well remotely, communicate clearly, and take ownership of outcomes rather than waiting for direction. This role aligns strongly with my interest in business operations, scaling systems, and supporting growth across recruitment, product delivery, and stakeholder engagement.",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-24T13:32:45.662Z,2026-02-24T13:32:45.662Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1771939962167_BADA SOLOMON OLU CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
699df3764664ea526d618c00,Precious Iwuegbu,+23408087417857,iwuegbuprecious@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Precious Iwuegbu, and I graduated from Covenant University in 2021 with a degree in Management Information Systems. Since then, I’ve worked across fintech, fashion, and consulting, mostly in roles where I supported operations, coordinated projects, and helped teams stay organized and aligned.\n\nOver time, I’ve realized that I genuinely enjoy being the operational backbone of a business from tracking tasks, maintaining documentation, coordinating recruitment processes, preparing reports, and making sure timelines are met. I like being the person who keeps things structured and ensures nothing slips through the cracks, especially when multiple teams are involved.\n\nAs a creative and professional, creativity and structure are two things I’m really passionate about in my work. I’m drawn to the process of turning scattered ideas into something tangible and I believe strong ideas deserve clear frameworks, and clear frameworks deserve a creative touch. My creativity even sneaks into my daily tasks as I can’t make a to-do list without color-coding it. Different tasks get different colors, deadlines get highlighted, and somehow everything feels clearer and easier to manage. It’s a small thing, but that mix of creativity and structure is how I stay organized when juggling multiple moving parts.\n",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-24T18:52:38.026Z,2026-02-24T18:52:38.026Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1771959155063_Precious Iwuegbu's Resume_Tobams .pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
699eb4f44664ea526d618c4c,Nneoma Edebeatu ,+2348023132631,nneoma101@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nI’m an operations-focused retail leader with strong experience in coordination, systems implementation, and performance tracking. I enjoy bringing structure to fast-moving environments and ensuring tasks don’t fall through the cracks. My MBA in E-commerce has also strengthened my interest in digital and cross-functional operations, which is why this role feels like a natural next step for me.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/nneoma-edebeatu-39a188122,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-25T08:38:12.702Z,2026-02-25T08:38:12.702Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772008688833_Nnelabel.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
699efe834664ea526d618d28,Adunola Fasanmi,+2348146216509,adunola31@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a detail-oriented and analytical professional with a strong interest in business operations and process improvement. I thrive in structured environments where efficiency, clear communication, and measurable results matter. I enjoy identifying gaps, optimizing workflows, and supporting teams to ensure projects are executed smoothly and on time.\nWorking remotely has strengthened my ability to stay organized, self-motivated, and accountable. I am comfortable tracking KPIs, coordinating across teams virtually, and using data to support decision-making. I bring a proactive mindset, strong prioritisation skills, and a continuous improvement approach to help drive operational excellence.",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-25T13:52:03.333Z,2026-02-25T13:52:03.333Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772027520814_Adunolaâs Operations CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
