699f02d44664ea526d618da3,Esosa Mitchel Uhunmwagho,+23408126278474,esossauhunmwagho@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a first-class Economics graduate with hands on experience in business coordination, administrative management and operational support across hospitality and consulting environments. my background combines analytical thinking with practical execution. I am comfortable working with data, tracking financial and operational reports, and ensuring day to day operations run efficiently. \nIn my current and previous roles, i have coordinated meetings and client communications, supported HR processes, and helped streamline internal workflows. I naturally gravitate towards structure, building systems,  and ensuring smooth execution of deliverables. My goal is to grow into a  strategic operation leader who drives efficiency, profitability and sustainable growth within organizations and communities. ",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-25T14:10:28.825Z,2026-02-25T14:10:28.825Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772028622897_Esosa Mitchel Work Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
