699f05d04664ea526d618dc2,Taiwo Oyebode Francis,+23408113920474,taiwooyebode67@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a remote-work-savvy professional with a knack for organizing chaos—think scheduling, tracking tasks, and keeping teams aligned. In my last [project/role], I [example: built a simple workflow that cut follow-up emails by 30% / coordinated volunteers across time zones / managed budgets for a student org]. I’m comfortable with spreadsheets, quick to learn new tools, and I ask clarifying questions early (saves everybody headaches later).",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-25T14:23:12.799Z,2026-02-25T14:23:12.799Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772029389696_TAIWO_UPDATED_CV[2].docx,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
699f08584664ea526d618de9,Orioye Blessing Esther ,+23409054286423,orioyeesther2019@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a graduate of Tai solarin university of education where i studied physics and telecommunications, with a diverse professional background across finance, technology, and education. Over the years, I have gained hands-on experience applying data-driven solutions in different environments, which has strengthened my analytical thinking and problem-solving skills. I also hold professional certifications in Data Analysis, Data Science, and Machine Learning, which have equipped me with strong technical expertise and a solid understanding of turning data into actionable insights.",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-25T14:34:00.483Z,2026-02-25T14:34:00.483Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772030036795_Orioye Blessing CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
699f08d94664ea526d618dfa,Chinenye Ngozi Chukwu,+2348064184851,thechinenyechukwu@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a business operations and product-focused professional who enjoys bringing structure to fast-moving teams. Over the past few years, I’ve worked across product management, project management and coordination, business analysis, and workflow optimization roles where my core responsibility has been turning ideas into organized, trackable execution.\n\nI’m someone who naturally thinks in systems. When I join a team, I look at how work flows, where things get stuck, and how we can improve clarity around roles, timelines, and accountability. I’ve supported cross-functional teams by managing documentation, tracking KPIs, coordinating deliverables, and ensuring clear communication so nothing falls through the cracks.\n\nI’ve also been involved in recruitment coordination, stakeholder communication, and product launch support, which required strong follow-up discipline and attention to detail. I’m very comfortable working remotely, managing multiple workstreams, and staying proactive without needing constant supervision.\n\nWhat excites me about this role is the combination of operations, product delivery, and expansion support. I genuinely enjoy being in roles where I can create order, support leadership, and help teams execute efficiently. That’s where I do my best work.",https://aboutchinenyechukwu.my.canva.site/chinenye-chukwu-project-mgt-portfolio,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-25T14:36:09.695Z,2026-02-25T14:36:09.695Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772030166339_01 CHINENYE CHUKWU Operations Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
