699f4b2b4664ea526d619041,Olayiwola Oluwakayode,+23407040362114,olayiwolaoluwakayode110@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Olayiwola Oluwakayode. I am a results-driven professional with experience in operations and administrative coordination. Over the years, I have developed strong skills in process improvement, team collaboration, and ensuring tasks are completed efficiently.\nIn my previous roles, I have handled responsibilities such as coordinating workflows, managing documentation, and supporting operational performance targets. I pride myself on being detail-oriented, dependable, and proactive in solving problems.\nI’m now looking for an opportunity where I can contribute my skills, continue to grow professionally, and add value to the organization.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/olayiwola-oluwakayode-6413402a7?utm_source=share&utm_campaign=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=android_app,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-25T19:19:07.244Z,2026-02-25T19:19:07.244Z,,,"https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772047143684_OLAYIWOLA, Oluwakayode.pdf",Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
699f6a864664ea526d61907b,Moromoluwa Olusanjo,+2349020641562,moromoluwa.olusanjo@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a business operations and product-minded professional with experience supporting cross-functional teams, improving execution processes, and keeping complex projects on track. My background sits at the intersection of operations, strategy, and coordination. I enjoy turning plans into structured workflows that teams can actually execute.\n\nOver the past few years, I’ve supported project delivery, documentation, and stakeholder coordination across multiple workstreams. I’m particularly strong in organising processes, tracking deliverables, and ensuring communication flows smoothly between teams. I also have a growing interest in business intelligence and use data insights to support decision-making and operational improvements.\n\nI recently began my MBA to deepen my strategic and analytical capabilities, and I’m passionate about organisations that use innovation and education to create impact. I thrive in fast-paced environments where structure, follow-through, and systems thinking are essential, and I’m excited about the opportunity to contribute to operational excellence and expansion initiatives at Tobams Group.",https://moromoluwaolusanjo.vzy.io/,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-25T21:32:54.952Z,2026-02-25T21:32:54.952Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772055172088_Product&Programs Moromoluwa Olusanjo CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
