699fdcdc4664ea526d6190ec,Adesegun Adesipo,+23407080844027,adesegunadesipo@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a professional with over five years of experience in business operations and project coordination, where I focused on optimizing processes and supporting teams to achieve measurable results. In my role as a Dispatcher and Customer Experience Officer, I managed logistics for over thirty drivers, ensuring timely deliveries and efficient resource use. I led a strategic initiative to restructure route assignments, which improved delivery timelines by fifteen percent and reduced operational costs by ten percent through data analysis. This required quick decision making and coordination during emergencies, skills that translate directly to supporting individuals in care settings.\n\nAs a Corporate Sales Associate, I worked with cross functional teams to execute B2B initiatives, reducing sales cycles by twenty five percent through structured lead qualification and CRM tracking. I also managed key accounts, growing one by fifty percent through strategic relationship building. This experience taught me how to communicate effectively with diverse stakeholders and adapt to their needs while maintaining a focus on efficiency.\n\nIn customer care roles, I maintained service level agreements, resolved issues promptly, and contributed to retention programs, reducing repeat complaints by twenty five percent through proactive troubleshooting. My work in banking involved supporting end to end onboarding processes, ensuring compliance with regulatory standards, and educating clients on digital platforms, which boosted self service engagement by forty percent.\n\nThroughout my career, I have demonstrated reliability, problem solving, and a commitment to process improvement. I am eager to apply these skills in a health care support context, where I can contribute to team success and patient wellbeing through structured coordination and empathetic communication.",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-26T05:40:44.788Z,2026-02-26T05:40:44.788Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772084441421_ADESIPO ADESEGUN ADEDARE.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
