69a055afaaa8a375b46d69f5,Paulyn Abu,+23408106494641,abupaulyni@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a business operations professional with over eight years of experience supporting inventory management, procurement, supply coordination and executive operations within manufacturing and corporate environments. I recently worked as a Business Operations Executive, where I coordinated co-packing operations, vendor and client engagements, procurement documentation, logistics activities and executive reporting. I hold an MBA in Production and Operations Management and I am experienced in using SAP, Tally and Excel to support operational tracking, purchasing processes and workflow improvement. I am detail-oriented, structured and comfortable working across teams to ensure daily operations run smoothly and efficiently.",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-26T14:16:15.311Z,2026-02-26T14:16:15.311Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772115371794_Paulyn ABU-CV-3.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
