69a076aabad969fa8fb739c0,Nollah Ayomide Stephen ,+23409055058319,aynolly22@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Ayomide Nollah Stephen. I have experience in business operations, lead management, and workflow coordination. In my previous roles, I supported daily operations by tracking performance, managing communication between teams, organizing documentation, and ensuring processes ran smoothly.\n\nI’m highly structured and detail-oriented. I enjoy identifying inefficiencies and finding practical ways to improve systems and performance. I’m comfortable working with CRM tools, spreadsheets, and reporting systems to monitor progress and support decision-making.\n\nAs a Junior Business Operations Manager, I aim to contribute by maintaining operational efficiency, supporting team productivity, and ensuring tasks are completed accurately and on time. I’m proactive, accountable, and always open to learning better systems that drive growth.",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-26T16:36:58.591Z,2026-02-26T16:36:58.591Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772123815849_CV UPDATE .pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
