69a1425ebad969fa8fb73a55,Vanessa Mmerichukwu Okoloaja,+2349064124531,mmerichukwunessa77@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi, my name is Vanessa Okoloaja. I have hands-on experience leading software development projects in Agile environments.\n\nCurrently, I work as an Associate Product Manager at NotJustEvent, where I own features end-to-end, from requirement gathering and writing PRDs to prioritizing backlogs in Jira and facilitating sprint ceremonies. I work closely with engineering, design, QA, and stakeholders to deliver web and mobile features, and I’ve helped the team consistently meet about 95% of sprint commitments while maintaining a 98% defect-free release rate through structured UAT testing.\n\nBefore that, I worked as a Junior Project Coordinator at Recreax One Universe, where I assisted in facilitating, Agile ceremonies, managed cross-functional teams, mitigated risks, and improved delivery timelines by about 50%. I was also recognized as Best Junior Project Manager for March and April 2025.\n\nI’m very customer-centric in my approach, I enjoy translating user pain points into actionable product improvements. With my background in Economics from the University of Nigeria, Nsukka, I approach operations from data and efficiency perspective, bringing analytical thinking and business awareness into product decisions.\n\nOverall, I’m passionate about building scalable SaaS products that solve real problems, and I’m excited about opportunities where I can contribute to product growth while up scaling my career.",https://bit.ly/4c2whCe,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-27T07:06:06.334Z,2026-02-27T07:06:06.334Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772175962813_Vanessa Mmerichukwu O_PM_CV (1) (1) (2).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
