69a17ee4c682b1c40fc77c21,Oby Bosah,+23407039505057,obygoz@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a business operations professional with over 10 years of experience working across diverse industries, supporting organizations to improve execution, strengthen processes, and drive operational efficiency. My experience spans project management, business strategy and governance, strategic partnerships, performance management, data analysis, recruitment and onboarding, and customer experience.\nI am known for my integrity, professionalism, and strong attention to detail, and I take pride in delivering reliable results while maintaining strong stakeholder relationships. Outside of work, I enjoy research, travel, and exploring new relationships, which has strengthened my curiosity and adaptability in both professional and personal settings.",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-27T11:24:20.986Z,2026-02-27T11:24:20.986Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772191457845_Oby Bosah's CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69a18439c682b1c40fc77c34,Owuama Chikezie Williams ,+2349069771725,chikzyowuama@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Currently, I'm a certified data analyst, having recently completed my certification on February 2, 2026. This program equipped me with hands-on expertise in Microsoft Excel, including advanced data manipulation, dashboard creation, and visual storytelling to communicate insights effectively to stakeholders. I also developed strong skills in identifying business problems through data patterns and recommending actionable, data-driven solutions to drive improvements.\nPrior to this, I worked as a Customer Service Representative for Chowdeck and Airtel through an outsourcing firm. In these fast-paced roles, I successfully managed high volumes of customer inquiries daily, coordinated real-time delivery tracking, prepared detailed performance reports, and proactively identified and mitigated fraudulent customer onboarding attempts, all while maintaining high standards of accuracy and customer satisfaction.\nI'm now eager to leverage my frontline operational experience,particularly in handling large datasets, spotting trends and anomalies, and delivering clear reports,combined with my new data analysis skills, to transition into a role where I can provide deeper insights and support strategic decision-making.",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-27T11:47:05.333Z,2026-02-27T11:47:05.333Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772192817920_OWUAMA WILLIAM CHIKEZIE .Ikj.docx,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
