69a1a072c682b1c40fc77c6a,Jethro,+23409032686770,olumudijethro@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m an operations professional with over four years of experience supporting teams, improving processes, and making sure projects run smoothly. In my current role, I coordinate procurement, logistics, inventory, and reporting, and I’ve helped improve efficiency by building better tracking systems and clearer workflows.\n\nI started my career in customer support, which taught me how to manage multiple priorities, communicate with different people, and follow through until issues are fully resolved. Over time, I moved into operations, where I now focus on keeping teams aligned, meeting deadlines, and turning data into useful insights for decision-making.\n\nI enjoy working behind the scenes to bring structure and clarity to fast-moving environments, and I’m especially interested in this role because it combines execution, coordination, and impact in an organisation that is focused on growth and learning.",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-27T13:47:30.437Z,2026-02-27T13:47:30.437Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772200047836_Jethro_Olumudi_Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69a1b2163e4e499f785af9ee,Onome Joy Agaje,+23408186585718,agajeonome@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Onome, a business operations professional with experience supporting cross-functional teams, strengthening internal processes, and ensuring workstreams move forward without friction.\n\nI started out in customer-facing roles, which gave me a strong foundation in attention to detail, stakeholder communication, and issue resolution. Over time, my work evolved more into operations support, coordinating tasks, maintaining documentation, supporting recruitment workflows, and making sure priorities don’t stall.\n\nI’ve built a reputation for being reliable and structured. I naturally track gaps, follow up persistently, and bring order to fast-moving environments. What motivates me most is helping teams execute cleanly, not just planning work, but ensuring it actually gets done well.\n\nAt this stage, I’m especially drawn to roles where I can support scalable operations and cross-functional execution, which is what makes this opportunity particularly interesting to me.",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-27T15:02:46.505Z,2026-02-27T15:02:46.505Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772204563649_Onome_Agaje_Tobams_Junior_Business_Ops.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69a23523a223fc68955af60e,Sotomi Michael,+2347082996492,shotomimichael07@gmail.com,Nigeria,I’m a Pharmacist from the university of Lagos with experience in managing a lot of operations and projects. \n\nI’m also a content creator and social media manager. ,,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-28T00:21:55.719Z,2026-02-28T00:21:55.719Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772238112676_Pharm. Sotomi Michael Curriculum vitae .pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69a24f35a223fc68955af620,Chisom Destiny Osuji,+23409164968940,osujichisomdestiny@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Business Operations Manager with a strong focus on building systems that help people and teams do their best work, without burning out.\n\nMy background sits at the intersection of operations, workflow design, and execution. I work closely with founders and cross-functional teams to turn ideas into clear processes, streamline day-to-day operations, and make sure nothing falls through the cracks. I enjoy taking complex, messy situations and turning them into simple, scalable systems that actually work in real life.\n\nWhat drives me is impact. I care about how decisions affect the team, the customer experience, and the long-term health of the business. I’m naturally detail-oriented, but I also keep the bigger picture in mind, priorities, timelines, and outcomes.\n\nAt my core, I’m someone who brings structure, clarity, and calm to fast-moving environments, so leaders can focus on growth while teams feel supported and empowered to perform.",https://placid-staircase-491.notion.site/Hey-I-m-Chisom-Destiny-Osuji-20eaf2bc69858096a3fbd2e11b8d4e06,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-28T02:13:09.696Z,2026-02-28T02:13:09.696Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772244787114_Chisom Destiny Osuji Opp.docx,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69a3657ea223fc68955af68d,Olasimbo Jejelola,+23409031613154,olasimbojejelola1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I work as a Business Operations professional and have over three years of experience helping with projects, processes, and teams in busy, fast-moving environments. I have worked in both on-site and remote positions, supporting the smooth running of operations, following up on important projects, creating reports, and ensuring that nothing gets overlooked. In my current job, I help handle big workloads for teams around the world, which has made me better at managing many tasks, explaining things clearly, and getting things done on time even when there's a lot to do. I like working on roles where I can add order to complicated tasks, help teams from the background, and watch projects go from planning to actually being done.",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-02-28T22:00:30.818Z,2026-02-28T22:00:30.818Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772316027451_Olasimbo_Jejelola_CV_Tobamsgroup.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69a48581a223fc68955af6df,Balogun Yemisi Anuoluwa ,+2348067813616,balogunyemisi242@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a detail-oriented operations and administrative professional with experience supporting business processes, coordinating cross-functional activities, and ensuring smooth day-to-day operations. Over time, I’ve developed strong skills in process improvement, reporting, financial coordination, and stakeholder communication.\nI’ve worked in roles that required me to manage priorities, support leadership, and maintain operational efficiency, which has strengthened my analytical thinking and problem-solving abilities. I’m particularly interested in roles where I can combine structure, data, and strategic support to improve business performance.",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-03-01T18:29:21.844Z,2026-03-01T18:29:21.844Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772389759197_Balogun  Yemisi CV - (Remote).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69a4b31fa223fc68955af711,Omadevuae Theresa Iturimiruke ,+2349164540305,rukeomas@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Ruke. \n\nI am a highly organized and proactive professional with hands on experience coordinating projects, managing digital operations, and ensuring consistent execution across different business arms.\n\nI have built and managed systems for content planning, client onboarding, task delegation, and performance tracking. \n\nManaging brands has also strengthened my time management, prioritization, and decision making skills and I am eager to bring this mindset into a role where I can support sustainable business growth.",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-03-01T21:43:59.729Z,2026-03-01T21:43:59.729Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772401437046_Omadevuae Theresa Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69a4b686a223fc68955af72a,onyeanusi chukwudalu pascal,+23409123507981,onyeanusichukwudalu@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m interested in this role because it aligns closely with my experience in administrative support and project coordination. I enjoy working behind the scenes to ensure tasks are organized, deadlines are tracked, and teams stay aligned.\nThrough my internship at Dynamo Group Limited and my previous role at ALX, I’ve developed strong documentation, reporting, and communication skills. I believe this role gives me the opportunity to apply those skills in a more structured operations environment while also growing in business operations and cross-functional collaboration.",https://docs.google.com/document/d/1qJ60VTJWI5PGTV87bxtdGLMrszxnE5d_PhTggUu2ulE/edit?usp=drivesdk,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-03-01T21:58:30.183Z,2026-03-01T21:58:30.183Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772402307444_onyeanusi Chukwudalu pascal CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69a5332da223fc68955af757,MADUKWE KELECHI,+23408149091475,madukwejoy19@gmail.com,Nigeria,"“I am a results-driven Business Development Manager with a strong background in identifying growth opportunities, building strategic partnerships, and driving revenue expansion. I have experience in market research, client relationship management, and developing strategies that increase profitability and brand visibility.\nIn my previous roles, I focused on generating leads, negotiating contracts, and maintaining long-term client relationships. I enjoy analyzing market trends and using data to make informed decisions that support business growth. My strength lies in communication, strategic thinking, and the ability to understand client needs and turn them into sustainable business opportunities.\nI am passionate about helping organizations grow, entering new markets, and improving performance through innovative and structured business strategies.”",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-03-02T06:50:21.664Z,2026-03-02T06:50:21.664Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772434218785_KELECHI-JOY-RESUME (1)(24).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69a55c83a223fc68955af7a3,Olumuyiwa Aluko,+23408039448792,tundealuko1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a technology leader with over 11 years of IT experience and 13 years of overall professional experience, currently serving as Deputy ICT Manager. My career has evolved from hands-on technical support into enterprise technology leadership, where I oversee infrastructure, governance, service management, security, and digital transformation initiatives.\n\nWhat defines me professionally is my ability to connect technology to business outcomes. I’ve led the setup of a Network Operations Center, implemented IT service management platforms, driven asset management transformation, and supported enterprise systems such as ERP and collaboration platforms. I’ve also played a key role in IT governance, risk management, compliance alignment, and strategic planning — ensuring technology doesn’t just function, but supports long-term organizational goals.\n\nOver time, my focus has shifted from purely operational excellence to strategic technology architecture and innovation. I’m particularly interested in scalable platforms, AI-driven systems, cloud-native infrastructure, and data-informed decision-making. I enjoy building structured environments — establishing DevOps discipline, governance frameworks, reporting dashboards, and performance metrics — that allow innovation to scale sustainably.",linkedin.com/in/olumuyiwa-aluko-6310a632/,,6931498680f08ae4c5823fdd,Chief Technology Officer - CTO,2026-03-02T09:46:43.458Z,2026-03-02T09:46:43.458Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772444800658_Olumuyiwa Aluko CV 2026.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69a57787a223fc68955af965,Kingsley Ekokotu,+23408165991710,ekokotuakpos@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a results-driven operations professional with over six years of experience supporting and leading operational processes across different industries. My background includes overseeing daily operations, improving workflows, coordinating cross-functional teams, managing vendors, and tracking performance metrics to ensure efficiency and accountability. I have strong experience in documentation, KPI reporting, stakeholder coordination, and process optimization, supported by proficiency in tools such as Microsoft Excel, Power BI, and ERP systems.\n\nI am highly organized, analytical, and comfortable working in structured yet fast-paced environments. I enjoy building systems that improve clarity and execution, whether through refining SOPs, coordinating projects, or conducting research to support strategic decisions. I am particularly interested in roles that combine operational structure, research, and execution which is why the Junior Business Operations Manager role strongly aligns with my skills and career goals.",,,699c6e6cbe2e747d922bc7bd,Junior Business Operations Manager,2026-03-02T11:41:59.977Z,2026-03-02T11:41:59.977Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772451716985_Kingsley Ekokotu Resume(2).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69a6c5fef0accb3224832aec,Kelechukwu Ikechukwu Obiefuna,+23407026191739,obiefunakelechukwu@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Kelechukwu, a Senior Frontend Engineer with 6+ years of experience building and scaling web, mobile, and backend applications across fintech, crypto, and edtech. I’ve led engineering efforts across multiple startups, driving end-to-end product development, architecting scalable frontends, and delivering high-performance user experiences that serve thousands of users daily.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/kelechukwu-ikechukwu,,6931498680f08ae4c5823fdd,Chief Technology Officer - CTO,2026-03-03T11:29:02.248Z,2026-03-03T11:29:02.248Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772537339429_Kelechukwu Ikechukwu Obiefuna.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
