69ab527dc4150aec38da61f3,wamayi Garki Ismaila,+23408037093198,wamayiismaila3@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nHello! I'm Wamayi Ismaila, a results-driven data analyst based in Abuja, Nigeria. With a B.Tech (Hons) in Architecture from Modibbo Adama University of Technology, I've built strong analytical and problem-solving skills through professional experience in data handling and stakeholder engagement.\n\nCurrently, I'm an Analyst in Network and Systems at IHS Towers (July 2024–present), where I monitor network performance, analyze downtime data in Excel, prepare daily/weekly reports, and support data quality assurance. Previously, I was an ESG Analyst Intern at Excelerate (Dec 2025–Feb 2026), focusing on ESG data collection, verification, reporting, dashboards, and sustainability best practices. At Transsion Holdings (Jan–Jul 2024), as a Data Analyst Graduate Trainee, I analyzed sales data for Tecno, Infinix, and itel brands, created visualizations, and provided strategic insights. Earlier, at Habok Logistic and Transportation Ltd (2022–2023), I designed dashboards, conducted predictive modeling, and documented processes for operational improvements.\n\nMy key skills include data collection/cleaning/analysis/visualization (Excel, PowerPoint, Google Forms), report writing, stakeholder engagement, project management, and monitoring & evaluation—backed by certifications like Monitoring and Evaluation Professional (Dataville, 2025), Data Analysis and Visualization (Leyomart, 2024), PMP, and others.\n\nI've also contributed to community service as Corpers' Liaison Officer (NYSC, 2021) and WHO volunteer (2020) for immunization and HIV/AIDS awareness, earning an award for Field Equality, Diversity, and Inclusion from Save the Children.\n\nI'm passionate about using data to drive impact, especially in innovative areas like edtech, and I'm excited to bring my attention to detail and adaptability to your team!\n\n", linkedin.com/in/wamayi-ismaila,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-06T22:17:33.321Z,2026-03-06T22:17:33.321Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772835448127_WAMAYI_ISMAILA_Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
