69ab5ca5c4150aec38da6236,Oseremen Umolu,+2347037474594,Oseumolu@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Ose Umolu. I am a data analyst with a strong background in data analysis, business intelligence, and data science modeling. I hold both a Bachelor’s and a Master’s degree in Estate Management and Valuation, which gave me a strong analytical and problem-solving foundation.\n\nOver time, I developed a strong interest in data and technology, which led me to build skills in tools such as Excel, SQL, Power BI, and Python for data analysis. I have worked on several projects involving data cleaning, visualization, and extracting insights to support decision-making.\n\nIn addition to my technical work, I have also trained individuals in data analysis during a six-month program associated with the World Bank through Jos Business School, helping beginners understand data concepts and practical tools.\n\nI enjoy solving problems with data, building dashboards, and helping organizations make better decisions using insights from their data. I’m always eager to learn new technologies and apply my skills to create impactful solutions.",,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-06T23:00:53.261Z,2026-03-06T23:00:53.261Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772838050400_Ose cv.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
