69ab71f4c4150aec38da6287,Adegboye Ibrahim Alani,+23408133361532,ibrahimadegboye60@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Ibrahim Alani Adegboye, a Backend Developer with hands-on experience in building scalable backend systems and RESTful APIs using Node.js, Express.js, Django, and MongoDB. I graduated from the ALX Backend Software Engineering Program, where I worked on several projects, including an E-Commerce Receipt Generator API that uses asynchronous job queues to process transactions and send automated email receipts, and a property rental platform where I implemented search, filtering, and booking APIs.\n\nI enjoy solving real-world problems through clean and efficient backend solutions and have experience in authentication systems, database modeling, and collaborating in team projects using Git workflows. I’m particularly passionate about building robust backend systems that integrate seamlessly with frontend applications and AI-powered features. I am eager to bring my skills, curiosity, and strong work ethic to a dynamic team like Tobams Group and continue learning in a fast-paced, innovative environment.",GITHUB: https://github.com/Kwanza247,,69a7e52c934396ba8bb60df2,Backend Developer Intern,2026-03-07T00:31:48.220Z,2026-03-07T00:31:48.220Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772843505107_Ibrahimtech_CV.docx.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
