69abc000c4150aec38da6380,Jachike Paul-Obiekunie Nwoka,+2348166109232,nwokapauljachike@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Jachike [JC if the former proves difficult to pronounce] a graduate with a Bachelor of engineering degree but I'm guessing that isn't important for this job(I wanted to state that I have a university education). I started my design journey during the covid sit at home period in 2020. I watched a lot of YouTube videos on graphic design, read a couple of articles and books and I was particularly drawn to Brand Identity design, I spent most of that period doing practice work with a bunch business owned by my family and friends. After the sit at home was done and school restarted I fell off a bit and was more focused on my final year. Any way after graduation I was back at it practising and designing I have held a short term contract role with Kraks tv which was my first job after my NYSC was done. I've been freelancing since then.\nI look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team and am available at your convenience for an Interview.",https://dribbble.com/Jopjachi https://www.behance.net/nwokapaulj1267 https://www.instagram.com/jcgrphx/,,69a6fefa934396ba8bb60ded,Graphic Design Intern,2026-03-07T06:04:48.678Z,2026-03-07T06:04:48.678Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772863485911_JACHIKE PAUL-OBIEKUNIE NWOKA Graphic designer.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69abd8fac4150aec38da63ce,Praise Samuel ,+2349039958015,praisesam23@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Praise Samuel, an accounting professional currently transitioning into finance and data analytics. I have about two years of experience in financial accounting and bookkeeping, where I’ve worked with financial records, reconciliations, and reporting across different industries.\n\nOver time, I became increasingly interested in how data can be used to drive business decisions, not just record financial outcomes. That curiosity led me to develop skills in tools like Excel, Power BI, SQL, and QuickBooks, which I now use to analyze financial data and identify insights that can support better planning and strategy.\n\nCurrently, I’m also gaining practical exposure through a finance internship, where I’m learning how businesses operate, how teams collaborate, and how analytical thinking supports decision-making. What excites me about a business analyst role is the opportunity to combine financial understanding, data analysis, and problem-solving to help organizations make smarter strategic decisions.\n\nI’m particularly interested in opportunities like this internship where I can continue developing my analytical skills while contributing meaningfully to real business challenges.",,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-07T07:51:22.288Z,2026-03-07T07:51:22.288Z,,,"https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772869879223_Samuel, Praise Amarachi_CV.pdf",Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69abdb99c4150aec38da63e5,Agbaje Adam,+2348124574818,agbajeadam78@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a designer who marries strategic thinking with visual craft to deliver digital experiences that feel effortless and alive. From Ipaja, Lagos, Nigeria, I shape elegance that’s contemporary, purposeful, and impossible to forget.\nI specialize in interfaces that strike the perfect balance between beauty and function — distilling complex concepts into clear, intuitive products that users intuitively understand and enjoy.\nAt heart, I’m drawn to the sweet spot where motion, micro-interactions, and real human purpose converge, creating moments that don’t just look good… they feel right.",https://ayomideadam.netlify.app/,,69a6fefa934396ba8bb60ded,Graphic Design Intern,2026-03-07T08:02:33.102Z,2026-03-07T08:02:33.102Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1772870550525_Adam Ayom1ide Agbaje CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
