69ae8c02c4150aec38da6ccf,IGBOAYAKA JOHNPETER IGBOAYAKA,+2349160944188,sapphirecreativity@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Frontend Developer passionate about building responsive, user-focused web applications and continuously improving my engineering skills through hands-on projects.\n\nI have developed several practical applications, including websites, Forex Learning Management System (LMS),  and an E-commerce Dashboard that supports full CRUD operations. While building these projects, I worked with technologies such as React, Redux Toolkit for state management, Axios for API communication, Clerk and Firebase for user authentication. These experiences helped me strengthen my understanding of component architecture, asynchronous data handling, and scalable frontend development.\n\nCurrently, I am building a Property Listing Platform using Next.js that connects property owners with property seekers, allowing users to list and discover properties in a streamlined interface. I'm very much excited about this project as it pushes me to go beyond the limits being just a frontend developer. Although this project is still under active development and not yet included in my portfolio, the codebase and ongoing progress are available on my GitHub. https://github.com/Sapphire-Creativity\n\nI enjoy transforming ideas into functional digital products and continuously learning better ways to write maintainable, efficient code. I am now seeking a Frontend Developer Internship where I can contribute to real projects, learn, collaborate with experienced developers, and continue growing as a software engineer.\n",https://sapphirecreativity.com.ng/,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-09T08:59:46.584Z,2026-03-09T08:59:46.584Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773046782028_LATEST CV - IGBOAYAKA JOHNPETER IZUCHUKWU.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
