69af4ae70e6e0d602ab692b9,Rita Echere,+2348146790213,chetachiechere@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Chetachi Rita Echere. I’m a Product Designer with a background in Finance from the University of Lagos, and I specialize in creating user-centered digital experiences. \n\nOver the past few years, I’ve worked on fintech and digital product platforms where I’ve been responsible for understanding user behavior, designing intuitive interfaces, and collaborating with teams to improve how people interact with digital products. Through this work, I’ve developed a strong ability to think from the user’s perspective and communicate ideas clearly.\n\nBeyond design, I also have experience creating digital content and supporting social media engagement, which has helped me understand how brands connect with their audiences online. I enjoy combining creativity, design thinking, and communication to help products and brands grow.\n\nOverall, I see myself as someone who is creative, analytical, and very user-focused, and I’m excited about opportunities where I can contribute to building engaging digital experiences and strong brand presence.",This is the link to my design portfolio  https://www.behance.net/ritaechere  projects I worked on Public transportation system   https://www.figma.com/proto/Iiuwg7k4x3rWAjC8aO9GUl/APP-DESIGN?node-id=1261-4874&node-type=frame&t=zMCB6Wt2AXAZbYf3-0&scaling=scale-down&content-scaling=fixed&page-id=1261%3A2&starting-point-node-id=1261%3A4874&show-proto-sidebar=1   School base system prototype   https://www.figma.com/proto/PbvS670Ck3boGcuq6HPfg2/school-base-system?node-id=1-9655&node-type=frame&t=6TtUjGVVbxYXUU8E-0&scaling=min-zoom&content-scaling=fixed&page-id=0%3A1&starting-point-node-id=1%3A965  Fintech applications  https://www.figma.com/proto/gaVLjgNYaOgIldR2VlVQmE/Untitled?node-id=34-24&node-type=frame&t=CXCMGWSOBmJDHu54-1&scaling=scale-down&content-scaling=fixed&page-id=0%3A1&starting-point-node-id=34%3A24  Health Application   https://www.figma