69af83440e6e0d602ab692ff,Ifeoluwapo Soderu ,+2348101035765,jics.ux@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Ifeoluwapo Soderu, a product designer with about two years of practical experience designing digital products from research to final hi-fi design. My background is actually in Pharmacy, which gives me a slightly different perspective when I approach problems. I tend to think deeply about real-world impact and usability, not just how an interface looks.\nOne of my biggest strengths is how I approach problems. I like to properly understand the user and the problem before jumping into design. During my training at Vephla University, I worked on several projects, one of them is  Moneva, a budgeting platform designed to help users manage spending and savings more effectively. These projects helped me develop strong skills in design thinking process, using design tools like Figma as well as collaborating with cross-functional teams.\nWhat sets me apart is clarity in how I think and communicate, my ability to work well with teams, and the sense of responsibility I bring to my work. I like to properly understand problems before designing, collaborate openly with others, and take full ownership of the tasks I’m given.",https://www.behance.net/IfeoluwapoSoderu,,69aefa4c05d00a25722c84c2,Product Designer Intern,2026-03-10T02:34:44.817Z,2026-03-10T02:34:44.817Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773110080879_Ifeoluwapo Soderu Resume (2).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
