69b12b2a0e6e0d602ab69e25,Soliu Sulyman,+2349051772499,hilosthonesulyman@gmail.com,Niger,"I am a passionate Software Engineer and Front-End Developer with strong experience in building modern, responsive, and user-friendly web applications. I specialize in React.js, Next.js, and React Native, and I have solid experience working with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to create scalable and high-performance user interfaces.\n\nI am proficient in Git and GitHub for version control, and I have experience working with API integration, enabling applications to communicate effectively with backend services. My focus is on writing clean, maintainable code while ensuring a smooth and engaging user experience.\n\nBeyond development, I am actively involved in teaching and mentoring students in software engineering, which has helped me strengthen my problem-solving abilities and deepen my understanding of frontend architecture and best practices.\n\nI am always eager to learn new technologies, collaborate with talented teams, and contribute to projects that create real value.\n",https://hilosthone-portfolio.netlify.app/,,69a6fe3c934396ba8bb60dec,Frontend Developer Intern,2026-03-11T08:43:22.014Z,2026-03-11T08:43:22.014Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773218599036_HILOSTHONE SULYMAN _ CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
