69b14df00e6e0d602ab6aa05,Farid Akinsanya,+23409133719753,faridakinsanya22@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a highly motivated and detail-oriented aspiring Data Scientist with a strong academic background in Computer Science. I have developed a solid foundation in data analysis, machine learning, statistical modeling, and artificial intelligence through academic projects, research work, and practical labs.\n\nI enjoy working with data to uncover insights and build intelligent solutions that support data-driven decision-making. Through my studies and hands-on practice, I have gained experience using analytical and programming tools to solve real-world problems.\n\nI am eager to continue learning, improving my technical skills, and contributing to impactful projects. This internship is an exciting opportunity for me to apply my knowledge, gain industry experience, and grow within a collaborative data science environment.\n",https://www.linkedin.com/in/farid-akinsanya-78abb6245?,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-11T11:11:44.253Z,2026-03-11T11:11:44.253Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773227500997_Fareed Akinsanya Tech Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69b14e750e6e0d602ab6aa27,Eniola Adedokin,+2349012261336,adedokuneniola8@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a lawyer transitioning into business analysis, and the combination of those two backgrounds is something I think makes me genuinely useful in a BA role.\nI completed a Business Analysis program with Product Hub Africa where I worked on real product cases, from mapping a broken fulfillment workflow for a logistics company to defining requirements for an online ordering system for a bakery and scoping an MVP checkout flow for a food delivery app. Those projects taught me how to ask the right questions, document what actually needs to happen, and communicate it in a way that different teams can act on.\nBefore that, I spent time in legal practice across a few firms in Lagos, and most recently as the sole legal officer at a startup where I owned everything from incorporation to commercial contracts. That experience gave me a strong instinct for precision and risk, which I think translates directly into BA work.\nWhat draws me to Tobams specifically is Recycled Learning. Building an AI-powered learning platform for children and getting schools, governments, and institutions to actually adopt it is a complex, multi-stakeholder challenge, and that is exactly the kind of work I want to be close to. I am at a point in my career where I am actively building my BA skills and I am looking for an environment where I can learn from experienced people while contributing real work from day one.",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1I_m-GKW5VzJO1wzb8rJdLbYfHeeBTSuR/view?usp=drivesdk,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-11T11:13:57.222Z,2026-03-11T11:13:57.222Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773227634367_Cv BA.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
