69b159e00e6e0d602ab6af19,Abdulganiy sarafdeen ,+23408164403874,sherifdeenabdulganiy1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a motivated and growth driven individual with a strong interest in digital marketing, social media management, and customer service. I enjoy learning new skills, solving problems, and helping businesses connect better with their audience online.\nI have experience engaging with customers, handling inquiries, and using tools like Google Forms to collect feedback and improve customer experience. I also enjoy creating content, managing online interactions, and supporting brands in building a positive online presence.\nIn addition, I run Shiffy Store, a phone accessories business where I interact with customers, promote products, and manage sales. This has helped me develop skills in communication, marketing, and customer relationship management.\nI am always eager to learn, take on new challenges, and contribute my skills to a team or organization where I can grow and make a meaningful impact.",https://bit.ly/3M6O9Bj,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-11T12:02:40.561Z,2026-03-11T12:02:40.561Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773230557527_updated CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
