69b18e880e6e0d602ab6c065,Christy Odeh oghenesuvwe,+23408117882827,palmerchristy19@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Odeh Christy Oghenesuvwe, and I am an aspiring UI/UX designer with a strong interest in creating simple, useful, and user-friendly digital experiences. I recently developed an interest in UI/UX design because I enjoy solving problems and thinking about how people interact with websites and mobile applications. I like the idea of turning ideas into designs that make technology easier for people to use.\n\nOver time, I have been learning the fundamentals of UI/UX design, including user research, wireframing, prototyping, and designing interfaces that are both functional and visually clear. I am familiar with design tools such as Figma and I enjoy practicing by working on design projects that help me improve my skills and understanding of user-centered design. I am especially interested in learning how to build consistent and responsive interfaces that work well across different screen sizes.\n\nI am a curious learner who enjoys improving my skills and exploring new ideas in design. I pay attention to details and I like thinking about how small design decisions can improve a user’s overall experience. I also enjoy collaborating with others, receiving feedback, and using that feedback to grow and refine my work.\n\nI am applying for this UI/UX internship because I want to gain practical experience, learn from professionals in the field, and contribute my creativity and dedication to real projects. I believe this opportunity will help me develop my skills further and grow into a confident and effective UI/UX designer.",https://www.figma.com/file/gvHH43D8Zhqrobgnh6dh6h?node-id=0:1&locale=en&type=design,,69aefa4c05d00a25722c84c2,Product Designer Intern,2026-03-11T15:47:20.070Z,2026-03-11T15:47:20.070Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773244037183_Odeh Christy .pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
