69b1a13d0e6e0d602ab6c4da,Aisosa Oghagbon,+23407080917041,oghagbonfav@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a full-stack developer with over a year of experience, specializing in JavaScript/Typescript technologies, particularly React, Next.js, Node.js, Nest.js also Postgresql MongoDB. I enjoy building interfaces that feel intuitive and complex backend architecture that don't fall apart under pressure.\n\nI transitioned into software development after developing a strong interest in building digital products and solving real-world problems. Since then, I’ve gained hands-on experience through internships and personal projects where I’ve worked on implementing responsive interfaces, optimizing performance, and building REST APIs.\n\nI’m naturally a problem solver and I really enjoy creating products that make people’s lives easier.",http://aisodev.vercel.app/,,69a6fe3c934396ba8bb60dec,Frontend Developer Intern,2026-03-11T17:07:09.968Z,2026-03-11T17:07:09.968Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773248824259_OGHAGBON AISOSA CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
