69b1a2c20e6e0d602ab6c509,Muhammad-Nabeel Olaoye,+23408025645677,princeakinola05@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a skilled frontend engineer with experience building web and mobile applications using React, Next.js, TypeScript, and React Native. I’ve worked on production platforms including fintech dashboards, event systems, and SaaS applications where I focused on building responsive user interfaces, integrating APIs, and optimizing performance. I enjoy turning complex product requirements into clean, scalable UI systems and continuously improving my skills across both web and mobile development.",www.dtechbro.xyz,,69a6fe3c934396ba8bb60dec,Frontend Developer Intern,2026-03-11T17:13:38.778Z,2026-03-11T17:13:38.778Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773249215178_Muhammad-Nabeel -- Resume-new.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69b1a33d0e6e0d602ab6c529,Oketona Samuel Ayobami,+23408165609129,ayobamioketona@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Chemical Engineering student with a strong interest in technology and product development, currently building my skills as an aspiring frontend developer. While my academic background focuses on engineering principles like problem-solving, analysis, and system optimization, I’ve developed a growing passion for web development and creating user-friendly digital experiences.\n\nI have been learning and working with modern frontend technologies such as HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and React, building responsive interfaces and interactive web applications. I enjoy turning ideas into clean, functional designs and continuously improving my skills by working on projects and exploring new tools that make development faster and more efficient.\n\nI’m particularly interested in internships where I can gain real-world experience, collaborate with other developers, and contribute to meaningful products while growing both my technical and professional skills. Combining my engineering mindset with frontend development allows me to approach problems logically and build solutions that are both efficient and user-focused.",https://ay-portfolio-lime.vercel.app,,69a6fe3c934396ba8bb60dec,Frontend Developer Intern,2026-03-11T17:15:41.176Z,2026-03-11T17:15:41.176Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773249338361_Ay resume.docx,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
