69b1f099700560090278d187,Chibuike Ezejiofor,+2349028453510,ezejioforchibuike635@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Ezejiofor Chibuike Emmanuel, and I’m a Geology student at Nnamdi Azikiwe University. Over time, I’ve developed a strong interest in data analysis and how it can be used to support business decisions. Through some of my academic work and projects, I’ve had the chance to work with datasets, look for patterns, and try to understand what the data is really saying. One project I worked on involved analyzing hotel reservation data. The goal was to understand things like booking trends, cancellations, and customer behavior. I used Excel to create dashboards and charts that helped show the patterns in the data. From the analysis, I was able to suggest a few ideas that could help improve booking management and reduce revenue loss. That experience made me even more interested in business analysis and how data can help organizations make better decisions. Aside from technical work, I also enjoy working with people and being part of a team. I currently serve as the Webmaster for the SEG UNIZIK chapter, where I help manage and organize online content for the association. Working with the team has helped me improve how I communicate ideas and collaborate with others.\n\n",,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-11T22:45:45.666Z,2026-03-11T22:45:45.666Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773269125934_Purple and White Clean and Professional Resume_20260311_234415_0000.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
