69b1f152700560090278d1a6,Adedoyin Sonubi,+23408180005111,doyinadeoye@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"I am a Business Professional with a background in Business Administration; a BSc in Business Administration from the University of Ilorin and an MBA from Birmingham City University, UK. \nI also completed professional training in Business Analysis in 2023, covering Business Analysis, Scrum, Product Ownership, and Software Testing.\n\nI currently run a Fashion Education and Garment Production business where I design operational systems, analyze business processes, and implement structured workflows to improve efficiency and service delivery.\n\nThrough managing these operations, I have developed practical experience in identifying business problems, mapping processes, and implementing solutions that improve outcomes.\n\nI am interested in deepening my practical experience in Business Analysis within a professional environment where I can contribute my operational perspective while continuing to develop my analytical and documentation skills.\n", https://docs.google.com/document/d/1e5U5waMuEyLGmZxpb7k8eGKLxlzUEIYd2oq_Qg2hkEU/edit?usp=drive_link                                                                    ,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-11T22:48:50.877Z,2026-03-11T22:48:50.877Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773269327468_Adedoyin Sonubi CV-BA.docx,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
