69b1ffcc700560090278d2e1,Olatunji Emmanuel Olusegun,+23408039522075,emmanuelolusegun.co@gmail.com,Nigeria,"With 3years of experience designing and building scalable backend systems across fintech, payments, and enterprise platforms, I am confident that my background aligns strongly with the technical and operational needs of your engineering team.\n\nCurrently, I work as a Backend Engineer at TM30 Global Limited where I design and maintain high-performance backend services using Java (Spring Boot), PostgreSQL, and distributed messaging systems. My work has involved building secure payment integrations, developing high-throughput APIs, and optimizing data processing pipelines for real-time applications. I also contributed to the development of a billers aggregation platform that enables payments for multiple service providers across Nigeria.\n\nPreviously, I worked at Waya Multi Link Technology where I helped build core backend services for digital POS infrastructure, virtual account systems, and transaction analytics APIs used in fintech payment workflows. My experience also includes integrating banking and third-party APIs, building secure authentication systems using OAuth2 and JWT, and implementing CI/CD pipelines for reliable deployments.\n\nTechnically, my strengths include backend architecture, microservices design, API development, database optimization, and system performance tuning. I primarily work with Java (Spring Boot), SQL/NoSQL databases, Redis caching, Docker, and cloud infrastructure while following strong engineering practices such as test-driven development, clean architecture, and Agile delivery.\n\nI am particularly interested in the opportunity at Providus Bank because of its reputation for innovation in the Nigerian banking ecosystem, and I would welcome the chance to contribute to building reliable and scalable financial systems that serve millions of users.\n\nPlease find my CV attached for your review. I would be grateful for the opportunity to discuss how my experience and technical skills can contribute to your team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration.\n\nKind regards,\nEmmanuel Olatunji\nBackend Engineer\n📞 +234 803 952 2075\n✉ [emmanuelolusegun.co@gmail.com](mailto:emmanuelolusegun.co@gmail.com)\nGitHub: https://github.com/Olusegun-eo\nLinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/emmanuel-olatunji-eo/\n",,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-11T23:50:36.082Z,2026-03-11T23:50:36.082Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773273032809_Olatunji_Emmanuel__o_resume (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
