69b260b2700560090278d55f,Opeyemi Fasedemi,+23408072679500,fasedemiopeyemi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a recent graduate of Business Administration from the University of Lagos with a strong interest in business operations, coordination, and process improvement.\n\nDuring my time in university, I developed strong organizational and administrative skills through academic projects and leadership roles where I coordinated teams, managed timelines, and ensured tasks were completed efficiently. I also completed Salesforce training, which strengthened my understanding of data management, workflow systems, and how structured processes improve business performance.\n\nCurrently, I work as a Virtual Assistant where I support administrative workflows, manage communications, and help maintain structured systems for productivity. These experiences have helped me develop attention to detail, strong follow-up skills, and the ability to manage multiple tasks effectively.\n\nI’m someone who enjoys bringing structure to processes and supporting teams so that projects run smoothly, which is why I’m particularly interested in roles within business operations.",,,69a7e2fa934396ba8bb60df1,Business Operations Intern,2026-03-12T06:44:02.904Z,2026-03-12T06:44:02.904Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773297839985_Opeyemi_Fasedemi_CV (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
