69b27d3f700560090278dc67,Obiorah Gloria Ijeoma,+2349066032252,glo.obiorah@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Software Engineer and a Mathematics and Computer Science student with a strong focus on backend development. My experience centers on building scalable RESTful APIs, designing PostgreSQL databases, and working within microservice architectures. In my recent role, I developed webhook listeners and integrated payment APIs using TypeScript. I also have hands-on experience with AI integration, having built a chatbot using the Gemini API, and I possess foundational knowledge in Python for data-driven tasks. I always aim to write clean, secure code, which I recently put to use building a full user-access system (RBAC) for an e-commerce platform.\n\nWhen my screen isn't filled with code, you can usually find me playing chess. I am currently learning the game, and honestly, figuring out the right moves feels a lot like designing a good backend architecture because it is all about strategy, planning ahead, and making sure all the pieces work perfectly together.\n",https://gloriaobiorah.vercel.app/,,69a7e52c934396ba8bb60df2,Backend Developer Intern,2026-03-12T08:45:51.022Z,2026-03-12T08:45:51.022Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773305147582_Obiorah_Gloria_CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
