69b27dd2700560090278dca4,Adams Solomon,+2349039676422,solex247@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a passionate and self-driven developer with a background in Mechanical Engineering and hands-on experience in backend and full-stack development. My primary experience includes working with the MERN stack (MongoDB, Express.js, React, and Node.js) as well as backend frameworks like Python Django and Flask.\nThrough my learning journey, I have developed and experimented with building RESTful APIs, managing databases, and implementing server-side logic for web applications. I enjoy designing the backend systems that power applications, ensuring they are efficient, scalable, and reliable.\nI have also worked on practical projects where I applied these technologies to solve real problems, which helped me gain experience with API development, authentication systems, and database integration. These projects strengthened my understanding of how different components of modern web applications interact.\nI am naturally curious and enjoy continuously learning new technologies and improving my problem-solving skills. I am currently looking for an internship opportunity where I can contribute to real-world projects, collaborate with experienced developers, and deepen my expertise in backend engineering.",,,69a7e52c934396ba8bb60df2,Backend Developer Intern,2026-03-12T08:48:18.967Z,2026-03-12T08:48:18.967Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773305296094_ADAMS_SOLOMON_CV_Redacted.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69b27f05700560090278dcf5,Success Osakioduwamen Obazee,+23409061640703,successmichael69@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an organized and detail-oriented administrative professional with experience supporting business operations, project coordination, and team workflows. My background includes administrative support, recruitment coordination, documentation management, and data reporting. I have worked in both remote and hybrid environments where I supported leadership teams by managing schedules, tracking tasks, preparing reports, and maintaining structured records.\n\nI recently completed training in Virtual Assistance and Data Analytics, which strengthened my ability to work with spreadsheets, organize operational data, and support decision-making through structured information. I am proficient in Google Workspace and Microsoft Office tools, and I am comfortable maintaining trackers, monitoring timelines, and following up on action items to ensure tasks are completed.\n\nI enjoy working in structured environments where coordination, communication, and accountability are important. I am particularly interested in business operations because it involves improving processes, supporting teams, and ensuring projects move forward efficiently.\n\nI am eager to contribute, learn from experienced professionals, and support the execution of operational and project activities within a fast-paced and collaborative environment.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/success-obazee-0a56381aa/,,69a7e2fa934396ba8bb60df1,Business Operations Intern,2026-03-12T08:53:25.431Z,2026-03-12T08:53:25.431Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773305602215_Success Obazee.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
