69b294f0700560090278e3d3,Ireayomide Oladele-Ojo,+2348142332084,ireayolad@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Ireayomide Oladele-Ojo, a creative and analytical graphic designer with experience in crafting designs that connect with audiences and communicate ideas effectively. I enjoy combining visual storytelling with functionality, whether it’s digital marketing materials, social media graphics, or branding assets. I’m passionate about staying up to date with design trends while finding unique ways to make every project visually impactful.",https://ireayomideoladele-ojo.netlify.app/,,69a6fefa934396ba8bb60ded,Graphic Design Intern,2026-03-12T10:26:56.705Z,2026-03-12T10:26:56.705Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773311213110_IO Resume 2026.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
