69b29661700560090278e434,Alabi Fathiu,+2349068060967,alabiabolore4@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a self-taught backend developer of over 3 years working experience based in Lagos with a strong focus on building real-world systems. I started with JavaScript and Node.js, then pushed myself further by learning Go to understand how concurrency and system design actually work under the hood. I've built and deployed two full-stack projects a real estate management platform with Node.js, Prisma, PostgreSQL, JWT authentication, Cloudinary and Stripe integration, and a concurrent payroll engine in Go that processes 250 employees simultaneously using goroutines, channels and a semaphore pattern. Both are live and on GitHub and some others. I enjoy the backend because it's where the real decisions happen  architecture, performance, data integrity and I'm always looking for environments where I can grow that thinking further.",https://abolore-portfolio.vercel.app/,,69a7e52c934396ba8bb60df2,Backend Developer Intern,2026-03-12T10:33:05.807Z,2026-03-12T10:33:05.807Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773311583024_3pages.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
