69b297a8700560090278e474,Oluwakemi Toyosi Adesina,+23407084175595,oluwakemiadesina3@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I naturally gravitate toward roles where I can bring structure to moving parts. I enjoy figuring out how things work, where processes break, and how to make them run more smoothly.\n\nOver the past few years, I’ve worked across operations, project coordination, and systems support in both startups and small business environments. At Eazipay, for example, I supported operations across two products where my work involved maintaining internal trackers, coordinating with different teams to resolve issues, and making sure daily operational tasks didn’t fall through the cracks.\n\nOutside that, I also run a small food business where I handle supplier coordination, inventory planning, and daily operational decisions. That experience has taught me a lot about execution, accountability, and making things work even with limited resources.\n\nSo the way I see myself is someone who helps teams move from ideas to execution by keeping systems organised, tasks tracked, and people aligned.\n\nOverall, I enjoy building structure, supporting teams, and ensuring that plans turn into well-executed outcomes.",,,69a7e2fa934396ba8bb60df1,Business Operations Intern,2026-03-12T10:38:32.526Z,2026-03-12T10:38:32.526Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773311909603_Oluwakemi CV-Operations associate.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
