69b2ce4e9276d25980a8109d,Musa Bello Mohammed,+23408039346443,musabellomohammed@unimaid.edu.ng,Nigeria,"I am a Computer Engineering graduate from the University of Maiduguri with a Second Class Upper Division. I have several years of professional experience in ICT, networking, and software development within the University of Maiduguri environment. Currently, I work as a Hardware and Network Engineer where I supervise and maintain computer systems, networking devices, and servers.\n\nIn addition to my technical role, I serve as an instructor at Cisco Academy and a tutor under the University of Maiduguri Consultancy Services, where I teach networking concepts such as VLAN configuration and inter-VLAN routing, as well as IT Essentials. I also have experience in system programming and data processing, having previously worked as a System Programmer responsible for university websites and portals.\n\nMy technical skills include programming languages such as C, C++, Python, JavaScript, PHP, HTML, and CSS, along with experience in web development, networking, and system administration. I am passionate about technology, particularly in networking, software engineering, and website development. I enjoy contributing to projects that improve digital systems and support learning and innovation.",,,69a7e52c934396ba8bb60df2,Backend Developer Intern,2026-03-12T14:31:42.801Z,2026-03-12T14:31:42.801Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773325898949_CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
