69b2cf409276d25980a81120,Beryl Christine Atieno,+2540704454824,berylatieno30@gmail.com,Kenya,"I am a backend developer with a strong interest in building applications that solve real issues. For the past 2 years, I have focused on learning and developing backend API with Python, Typescript, and Go. I am proficient in developing REST API and other aspects of backend systems that ensure application security and reliability. \n\nI have experience working on real life applications, which has helped me to develop a strong understanding of backend systems. One project that I am particularly proud of is the Zedu messaging app, a project that I joined during my internship at HNG Tech. I have been one of the main contributors to the backend of this project, where I have learned how to structure backend systems, focus on user logic, and make reliable applications. I have also learned important skills in communication and collaboration while working on this project with a remote team based in Nigeria. This experience gives me confidence that I can fit right into the Tobams Group team and immediately be productive.\n\nI am currently looking for an opportunity where I can contribute to a development team, improve my backend engineering skills, and build scalable applications while learning from experienced developers.",https://github.com/berylxo,,69a7e52c934396ba8bb60df2,Backend Developer Intern,2026-03-12T14:35:44.088Z,2026-03-12T14:35:44.088Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773326140607_Beryl_I_Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
