69b2d54e9276d25980a81386,Brian Odhiambo Ojunga,+254794990075,brianojunga3@gmail.com,Kenya,"I am a backend developer with a background in industrial chemistry, currently focused on backend development and cloud engineering with AWS. I have experience building web applications using JavaScript, TypeScript, Node.js, Python, Django, and modern web technologies, and I enjoy designing APIs and backend systems that power scalable applications.\n\nRecently, I’ve been strengthening my skills in cloud computing, infrastructure as code, and backend architecture through my studies and projects. I’ve also been exploring areas such as AI-driven systems, automation, and distributed architectures, which align with modern data-driven applications.\n\nI’m passionate about solving real-world problems with technology, writing clean and maintainable code, and continuously learning new tools that improve system reliability and performance. I’m excited about opportunities where I can contribute to building impactful products while growing as a backend engineer.",https://github.com/Brianojunga,,69a7e52c934396ba8bb60df2,Backend Developer Intern,2026-03-12T15:01:34.584Z,2026-03-12T15:01:34.584Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773327691696_Brian_Ojung'a CV.docx,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
