69b2d9629276d25980a81482,Abiodun Okesooto,+23409061229983,okesooto.mayowa@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Data Analyst with a background in quantitative analysis and business intelligence. I hold a Bachelor’s degree in Quantity Surveying, which gave me a strong foundation in analytical thinking, cost analysis, and data-driven decision-making.\n\nOver the past couple of years, I’ve developed practical experience working with data using tools such as SQL, Python, Excel, Power BI, and Tableau. My work has involved cleaning and validating datasets, analyzing trends and anomalies, and building dashboards that help translate complex information into clear insights for decision-making. I’ve worked on projects involving sales data, transaction records, market trends, and operational datasets.\n\nWhat I enjoy most about data analysis is the process of turning raw data into meaningful insights that can guide strategy and improve outcomes. I’m naturally detail-oriented, curious about patterns in data, and comfortable collaborating with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.",https://analyst-mayor.github.io/AbiodunOkesooto.github.io/,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-12T15:18:58.772Z,2026-03-12T15:18:58.772Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773328735664_Abiodun Okesooto_ CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
