69b2da6f9276d25980a814d6,Anthony Akpan ,+2347037806971,akpananthonyjonah@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Data Analyst and ICT professional with experience in data analysis, reporting, and business intelligence tools. I currently work as a Data Analyst and ICT Teacher at Dorssy College in Lagos, where I analyze performance data, build dashboards, and automate reporting processes to support data-driven decision-making. \n\nMy technical background includes SQL, Python, Power BI, Tableau, and Excel, which I use for data cleaning, analysis, and visualization. I also have experience working with KPI monitoring, exploratory data analysis, and structured reporting. \n\nBeyond my technical skills, I am passionate about using data to solve real business problems and improve operational efficiency. I enjoy transforming raw data into meaningful insights that support strategic decisions. I am eager to further develop my analytical and consulting skills through practical experience in a dynamic organization like Tobams Group.",GitHub: https://github.com/akpananthonyjonah-glitch/Palmoria-gender-analysis,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-12T15:23:27.912Z,2026-03-12T15:23:27.912Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773329004448_AKPAN ANTHONY JONAH PROFESSIONAL CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
