69b2dc8f9276d25980a81558,Tricket Natukunda,+2560784236706,tricketnatukunda123@gmail.com,Uganda,"I’m Tricket Natukunda, and I hold a Bachelor of Science in Information Technology with a strong foundation in data analysis, problem‑solving, and stakeholder support. Over the past few years, I’ve built practical experience through roles where I provided ICT support, analyzed data, and worked closely with users to understand their needs — including my work with the University ICT Services team at Uganda Christian University and my volunteer experience with the Uganda Red Cross Society.\nI’ve developed skills in Excel, SQL, Python, and data visualization, and I enjoy using data to improve processes and inform decisions. I’m currently deepening my skills through the Women Techsters Fellowship and BYU Pathway, where I’ve been working on real analytical projects such as consumer‑spending dashboards and predictive analytics.\nWhat motivates me most is using technology to solve real problems, especially in education and community development. That’s why I’m excited about Tobams Group and the Recycled Learning initiative — the idea of transforming learning for children through tech aligns strongly with my values and experience.\nI’m eager to bring my analytical skills, my ability to work well with people, and my passion for meaningful, tech‑driven solutions to the Business Analysis team while continuing to grow and learn",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Cy7xadv8yQuh7XcPc9R4HXZuIHyxegOW?usp=sharing,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-12T15:32:31.172Z,2026-03-12T15:32:31.172Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773329548452_cv-tricket.doc,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
