69b2ef5c9276d25980a819e2,OROMBI K.BRIELLE PATRICIA,+256789962969,briellepatriciak@gmail.com,Uganda,"I am a results-driven professional with an uncommon combination of Law and Data Science under my belt, currently working in the field of Governance, Risk, and Compliance (GRC). Holding an Advocate of the High Court qualification and having worked in National Strategic Planning, I have dedicated my career to an interesting cross-section between intricate policy and business growth. My career trajectory has been defined by an inherent passion and mission: leveraging raw data into legally sound and actionable business strategies.\n\nMy entry into Business Analytics was catalyzed by my work at the National Planning Authority, where I recognized that the most robust business decisions are underpinned by audited and high-quality data. To fill the information void between policy and practical implementation, I undertook an immersive AI and Data Science bootcamp, learning how to leverage SQL, Power BI, and Python programming in automating reports and determining operational trends.",,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-12T16:52:44.378Z,2026-03-12T16:52:44.378Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773334359585_OROMBI K. BRIELLE PATRICIA Resume  ..docx,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
