69b3119a9292616f7be52cf0,Ejima Favour Ojonugwa ,+2348132775123,ejimafavour@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am writing to express my interest in the Data Analyst Internship role with your company. With a background in customer service, data analysis, and recent training in digital tools, I am eager to contribute to the Success of your company.\n\nIn my previous role at Strix Technologies Ltd., I developed and maintained Excel and Power BI dashboards to track sales performance and customer trends, which improved decision-making and contributed to a 15% increase in peak-period revenue. At Enugu Electricity Distribution Company, I analyzed customer reports using Excel and SQL, reducing complaint resolution time by 15% and improving case retrieval speed by 30%. These experiences strengthened my ability to transform raw data into actionable insights and collaborate across teams to resolve challenges.\n\nBeyond my work experience, I have completed a Data Analyst Boot Camp and training in Digital for All (Tech4Dev), where I deepened my skills in SQL, Tableau, and Python.\n I also recently enrolled in a Data Analysis learning track with DataCamp where I am currently broadening, practicing and learning vastly about Data and Analysis using different tools like SQL, Python, Excel, Power BI, Tableau. \nI have also undertaken personal projects, including developing Power BI dashboards on video game sales and SQL-driven employee performance reports. These projects demonstrate my curiosity, adaptability, and commitment to continuous learning.\n\nI am particularly drawn to this role because  I would get to work with real Datasets and I am confident that my analytical mindset, technical expertise, and eagerness to learn will make me a strong fit for your team.\n\nI would welcome the opportunity to further discuss how my skills and experiences align with your organization’s goals.",,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-12T19:18:50.640Z,2026-03-12T19:18:50.640Z,,,https://dev-