69b311a99292616f7be52cf7,Elizabeth Ayoola,+2349012184180,elizabethayoola05@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a finance student at the University of Lagos with a growing interest in business analysis and data-driven decision-making. My experience in financial research and analytical work has helped me develop strong problem-solving skills, particularly in interpreting data and presenting insights in a clear and structured way.\n\nBeyond academics, I actively explore how data and analysis can support better business decisions. I am currently strengthening my data analysis skills and enjoy working on projects that involve identifying trends, evaluating performance, and translating information into actionable insights. I am eager to gain practical experience through this internship while contributing meaningfully to the team.",,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-12T19:19:05.291Z,2026-03-12T19:19:05.291Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773343142415_ELIZABETH AYOOLA.docx.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
