69b3223c9292616f7be53070,Mary Akinbadeni,+23408022566980,olafusi1mary1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Mary, a recent graduate of Economics at the University of Lagos.  A data analyst in view  with a strong communication and organisation, problem-solving and team work skills. \nI also have a six month experience serving as an operations intern in a commercial bank. I am a fast learner.",,,69a7e2fa934396ba8bb60df1,Business Operations Intern,2026-03-12T20:29:48.763Z,2026-03-12T20:29:48.763Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773347385666_Mary's CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69b322899292616f7be5307b,Tope James,+23407026584091,jamestope340@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Tope James. I am a passionate and goal-oriented Creative Designer. I started my design career in 2023. Before that, I had worked in places where they needed someone who could design a simple flyer, but no one could. I got interested in design and started learning it primarily to help the enterprise I was working with. But after learning, I decided to make a career out of it. I started freelancing, and in 2025, I interned with Plug99 for a few months. And after the internship ended, I continued with my freelancing up till now. \n\nI am good to work with because I prioritise my time and always meet deadlines. I am a fast learner who is always open to constructive criticism and usse feedbacks to grow in my craft. I am always ready to lend a helping hand where there are gaps.",nce.net/topejames001,,69a6fefa934396ba8bb60ded,Graphic Design Intern,2026-03-12T20:31:05.931Z,2026-03-12T20:31:05.931Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773347462693_Tope_James_Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69b322c59292616f7be53086,Blessing Inyang,+23407082477451,inybless@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Blessing Inyang. I’m passionate about product design and how technology can be used to create simple and meaningful user experiences. I’ve been learning and developing my skills in product design, focusing on understanding user needs, problem-solving, and creating intuitive solutions. I enjoy exploring design tools, researching user behavior, and thinking about how digital products can be improved to better serve people.\nI’m excited about this internship at Tobams Group because it will give me the opportunity to learn from experienced designers, work on real projects, and continue growing my design skills while contributing to impactful products.",https://sites.google.com/u/0/d/1JtHeGBpO0EPru97z_BjOujYMtbNMGVaP/preview,,69aefa4c05d00a25722c84c2,Product Designer Intern,2026-03-12T20:32:05.279Z,2026-03-12T20:32:05.279Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773347521501_Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69b323d19292616f7be530a8,Adeyemi Matilda Oluwadarasimi ,+23408023158593,adematilda22@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a detail-oriented professional with a background in health education and a transition into data analytics. I recently completed an intensive data analysis program where I mastered tools like Excel (advanced formulas and pivot tables), SQL for database management, and Power BI for creating interactive dashboards. My experience as a registered Health Educator has equipped me with strong analytical thinking and the ability to translate complex information into actionable insights. I am also a creative entrepreneur, which has taught me the importance of operational efficiency and meeting client-specific needs through structured problem-solving.",https://github.com/MatildaAdeyemi/executive-sales-dashboard,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-12T20:36:33.110Z,2026-03-12T20:36:33.110Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773347789857_Matildaâs CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69b325879292616f7be530d6,JOY KOLAWOLE,+23409134144500,joykolawole99@outlook.com,Nigeria,"I am a third-year Economics undergraduate at Lagos State University with a strong interest in how organizations manage operations and coordinate projects to achieve results. Through my studies and learning experiences, I have developed analytical thinking, attention to detail, and strong organizational skills. I also completed the Goldman Sachs Operations Analyst virtual simulation, where I analyzed operational workflows, identified discrepancies in datasets, and proposed process improvements. I am comfortable working with tools such as Excel and Google Workspace for documentation, tracking tasks, and organizing information, and I enjoy working in collaborative environments where I can learn and contribute.",NILL,,69a7e2fa934396ba8bb60df1,Business Operations Intern,2026-03-12T20:43:51.434Z,2026-03-12T20:43:51.434Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773348228158_Joy_Kolawole_CV (2).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
