69b331389292616f7be532e2,Boluwaji Michael Adedayo,+23407061696242,adedayoboluwaji@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"I didn’t start out thinking deeply about design. At first, I was just curious about how brands looked and why some visuals felt more memorable than others. That curiosity slowly turned into practice. I began experimenting with simple graphics, learning tools like Adobe Illustrator and Photoshop, and taking on small projects whenever I could.\n\nOne project led to another. Soon I found myself designing brand assets, presentation decks, and social media visuals for different clients. Each project taught me something new, not just about making things look good, but about how design helps people understand ideas faster and how consistency builds trust in a brand. Over time, I also started exploring motion design, realizing that animation could bring static visuals to life and make communication even more engaging.\n\nFour years later, that curiosity has turned into real experience. I now work confidently with tools like Illustrator, Photoshop, InDesign, and Figma, and I integrate motion design and modern AI tools when they help improve the creative process. What motivates me most is seeing how thoughtful design can help brands communicate clearly and stand out.\n\nThat’s why the opportunity at Tobams Group stands out to me. A company focused on innovation and talent development is exactly the kind of environment where design plays an important role in communicating ideas and creating opportunities. As a graphic design intern, I’m excited about the chance to contribute my creativity while continuing to learn and grow within a team that is shaping how people learn and access opportunities.",https://www.behance.net/boluwajiadedayo,,69a6fefa934396ba8bb60ded,Graphic Design Intern,2026-03-12T21:33:44.217Z,2026-03-12T21:33:44.217Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773351221411_Adedayo Boluwaji Cv . portfolio.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
