69b43c7c842eb8a3f1858dea,Emmanuel Edache Adikwu,+2349137118577,emmanueledache54@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Full-Stack Software Developer and Electrical/Electronics Engineering graduate with a passion for building scalable, data-driven applications. My expertise lies in the MERN stack (MongoDB, Express, React, Node.js), TypeScript, and React Native.\nBeyond just writing code, I’m passionate about how backend architecture can solve real-world problems. I’ve spent time working on personal projects where I implemented JWT-based authentication and explored Docker for containerization. I’m a collaborative learner who enjoys participating in code reviews and architectural discussions, and I thrive in fast-paced environments where I can bridge the gap between complex data logic and seamless user experiences.",https://emmanuelportfolio-nine.vercel.app/,,69a7e52c934396ba8bb60df2,Backend Developer Intern,2026-03-13T16:34:04.303Z,2026-03-13T16:34:04.303Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773419640477_Emmanuel_Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
