69b44d7b842eb8a3f1858e5d,Mahabubulah Adebiyi,+2348105698403,adebiyimahabubulah1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Mahabubulah Adebiyi, and I’m an aspiring Business Analyst with a strong interest in using data to support business decision-making and improve processes. I recently completed my degree in Educational Technology from Lagos State University and have developed analytical skills in tools such as SQL, Python, Excel, and Power BI. Through my current role as a Data Operations Specialist and various data analysis projects, I’ve gained hands-on experience cleaning and organizing data, building dashboards, and analyzing datasets to uncover insights that support operational and strategic decisions. I enjoy translating complex data into clear, actionable insights and I’m seeking a Business Analyst internship where I can continue developing my analytical skills while contributing to data-driven business solutions.",https://github.com/DanFalak7,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-13T17:46:35.196Z,2026-03-13T17:46:35.196Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773423985765_Mahabubulah Adebiyi - CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
