69b47af3842eb8a3f1858f89,Oluwaseun Salisu,+2348135384788,oluwaseunsalisu1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Product Designer who enjoys turning ideas into simple and meaningful digital experiences. I am passionate about creating products that are not only visually appealing but also easy and intuitive for people to use. My design approach focuses on understanding user needs and solving real problems through thoughtful design decisions.\n\nOver the past few years, I have worked on different types of digital products including fintech platforms, web applications, and company websites. I have designed user flows, wireframes, prototypes, and high fidelity interfaces while collaborating with developers and product teams to bring ideas to life. Recently, I worked on the website experience for Wovant and also designed web applications and digital platforms at Alvac Company Limited. These experiences helped me strengthen my skills in user research, interaction design, and building clean and consistent interfaces using tools like Figma.\n\nI am always curious about how products work and how design can make them better, which keeps me constantly learning and improving.",https://oluwaseunportfolio.framer.website/,,69aefa4c05d00a25722c84c2,Product Designer Intern,2026-03-13T21:00:35.242Z,2026-03-13T21:00:35.242Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773435631257_Oluwaseun_Salisu - CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
