69b57e50842eb8a3f18593ad,thomas ogunmakinju,+23409130340087,gunmakinthomas7@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an aspiring Machine Learning Engineer and Data Analyst with a background in Materials Engineering. My academic and project experience has allowed me to develop strong analytical and problem-solving skills, particularly in working with data to solve real-world problems. I have experience using tools such as Python, SQL, and machine learning libraries to analyze datasets, build predictive models, and communicate insights effectively.\n\nOne of my recent projects involved developing a corrosion prediction model using machine learning algorithms such as XGBoost, where I worked on data preprocessing, model training, evaluation, and deployment using Streamlit. Through this experience, I gained practical knowledge in data pipelines, model evaluation techniques, and building user-friendly applications for data-driven solutions.\n\nBeyond technical skills, I am passionate about applying artificial intelligence and data science to engineering, industry, and emerging technologies. I am continuously learning and expanding my skills in machine learning, data analytics, and software development. I am excited about this internship opportunity because it will allow me to gain hands-on industry experience, collaborate with professionals, and further develop my ability to apply data and AI solutions to real-world challenges",https://github.com/Engrtom75360264,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-14T15:27:12.037Z,2026-03-14T15:27:12.037Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773502028057_thomas_tech_ cv.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
