69b6d978842eb8a3f18596a6,GRACIOUS KINGSLEY,+23408067120157,joelwendy36@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an MSc in Business Administration graduate from the National Open University of Nigeria with a strong numbers-first mindset and a habit of turning messy data into clear recommendations. I've worked with Excel, SQL, and Power BI to clean data and build quick dashboards. In my Master's project, I created a forecasting model that helped highlight key trends, which taught me how to frame questions before jumping into analysis.\n\nI am a curious person and like collaborating with non-technical peers, and I'm comfortable learning on the fly. Outside work, I'm a mum who cooks and bakes most weekends. Whether I'm tweaking recipes for picky eaters, budgeting groceries, or juggling meal prep with school runs, I'm constantly analysing constraints, testing variations, and communicating results—skills I bring straight to business analysis. I'd love to channel that same curious, adaptive mindset into an internship and learn from your team.",,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-15T16:08:24.266Z,2026-03-15T16:08:24.266Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773590896258_GRACIOUS KINGS 1.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
