69b7d274842eb8a3f1859b24,Adeola Oluwaseyi Ademola,+23408141770983,wizarphics@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an experienced Frontend Developer with expertise in React and React Native, seeking an internship opportunity. My background includes developing user interfaces, implementing responsive designs, and optimizing application performance. I am eager to contribute to a dynamic team and further enhance my skills in a practical, hands-on environment. I am particularly drawn to Tobams Group's commitment to innovation and talent development.",https://github.com/wizarphics,,69a6fe3c934396ba8bb60dec,Frontend Developer Intern,2026-03-16T09:50:44.549Z,2026-03-16T09:50:44.549Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773654641461_Frontend Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69b7d42c4f02245e36fd8fdb,Adeola Oluwaseyi Ademola,+23408141770983,wizarphics@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a highly motivated and results-oriented Backend Developer with a passion for building robust, scalable, and data-driven software solutions. My experience aligns perfectly with Tobams Group's requirements, and I am eager to contribute to your growing engineering team.\n\nHere's a summary of my key strengths:\n\n*  Technical Proficiency: I possess a strong foundation in JavaScript, TypeScript, and Node.js (NestJS/Express.js), with a deep understanding of RESTful API principles and database management (MongoDB, PostgreSQL, MySQL). I am also familiar with authentication/authorization methods (JWT, OAuth2) and version control systems (Git).\n*   Problem-Solving and Collaboration: I thrive in collaborative environments and possess excellent problem-solving skills. I am adept at working with cross-functional teams, including product managers, designers, AI/ML engineers, and frontend developers, to deliver seamless user experiences.\n*   Backend Development Expertise: I have experience in designing and building scalable backend services, maintaining existing systems, and implementing backend logic for gamification features. I am also proficient in API documentation, code reviews, and CI/CD processes.\n*   Adaptability and Growth Mindset: I am a quick learner, adaptable to new technologies, and eager to embrace challenges in a fast-paced, remote team environment. I am committed to continuous learning and staying updated with the latest industry trends.\n\nI am particularly excited about the opportunity to contribute to Tobams Group's mission of transforming tech talent development. My skills and experience make me a strong candidate to design, develop, and maintain the backend systems that power your web applications. I am confident that I can make a significant contribution to your team.",https://github.com/wizarphics,,69a7e52c934396ba8bb60df2,Backend Developer Intern,2026-0