69b917cf0bfe312f08dfddfa,Peace Daniel ,+2348134290169,peacedaniel612@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a product designer with several years of experience designing end-to-end digital products across edtech, health, and fintech. My work sits at the intersection of user needs, business goals, and technical feasibility.\nAcross my experience, I’ve led and contributed to product design from discovery through delivery: conducting user research, defining flows, prototyping, and collaborating closely with engineers and product managers to ship high-impact features. \nIn fintech especially, I’ve worked on products where trust, clarity, and usability are critical, which has strengthened my attention to detail and my ability to design for sensitive, high-stakes user journeys which is shown in my recent work at Dokwa.",www.behance.net/fiddyhamma,,69aefa4c05d00a25722c84c2,Product Designer Intern,2026-03-17T08:58:55.811Z,2026-03-17T08:58:55.811Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773737932641_Peace_Daniel_resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69b946440bfe312f08dfdf12,Oluwagbenga Alli,+23408103032367,alligbenga00@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a UI/UX designer with a strong interest in building products that are both intuitive and meaningful. I’ve been working on projects like booking platforms and product-based interfaces, where I focus on simplifying user flows and creating clean, functional designs. I’m very comfortable with Figma and enjoy working on everything from wireframes to high-fidelity designs. Right now, I’m really looking to grow as a product designer by working on real, impactful products and collaborating with a team.",https://alliemmanuel7.framer.website,,69aefa4c05d00a25722c84c2,Product Designer Intern,2026-03-17T12:17:08.058Z,2026-03-17T12:17:08.058Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1773749825415_Alli Oluwagbenga Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69b94ea10bfe312f08dfdf2b,KEFAS PETER AKUSO,+2348063320434,AKUSOKEFAS@GMAIL.COM,Nigeria,"I am a multifaceted creative and tech professional with a strong foundation in Computer Science and a deep passion for the intersection of design, community, and education. My work is driven by the goal of bridging the gap between technical complexity and user-centric storytelling.\n\nWhat I Do\nDesign & UI/UX: I specialize in creating intuitive digital experiences using tools like Figma, Photoshop, and Illustrator. I believe that good design isn't just about aesthetics; it's about solving problems and making technology accessible.\n\nData Analysis: I leverage data to drive informed decision-making and project scaling. This includes analyzing community engagement metrics, tracking the performance of digital content, and using technical insights to optimize outreach strategies and educational interventions.\n\nContent Strategy: I manage digital projects focused on global landmarks and history, transforming complex historical data into engaging visual narratives for international audiences.\n\nCommunity Building: I have a strong background in grassroots organizing, developing scalable templates and playbooks to help tech communities and NGOs grow their impact.\n\nProject Management: From coordinating educational interventions to managing digital marketing campaigns, I thrive on bringing structure to ambitious projects.\n\nMy Philosophy\nI am a firm believer in continuous learning and process optimization. Whether it’s finding the perfect plugin to streamline a workflow or developing a new strategy to reach a global audience, I am always looking for ways to innovate and improve.\n\nI’m currently focused on expanding my reach in the tech and social impact sectors, specifically looking at how AI-assisted tools can empower local communities and creative creators alike.",,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-17T12:52:49.697Z,2026-03-17T12:52:49.697Z,,,https://dev-ta