69c0d6bcae5d9e4d18cd7bf0,LAKSHAY NAGDA,+918112256981,lakshay18n@gmail.com,India,"I'm Lakshay Nagda, a second-year Computer Science student at Poornima College of Engineering, Jaipur, with a CGPA of 8.5. But more than my academics, I define myself by what I build.\n\nI've been building full-stack web applications since my first year of college — from MedVault, a secure health record and medicine reminder app built on React and Supabase, to a Matrimony platform that handled 500+ active users at launch. I work primarily with the MERN stack and have a strong eye for frontend craft — clean component architecture, responsive design, and user-first thinking are things I genuinely care about, not just checkboxes I tick.\n\nBeyond code, I've always had a builder's mindset. At 18, I founded Aftermedia, a video editing service business where I acquired clients, led a small team, and delivered projects end-to-end. I also served as Vice-Captain and Captain of my college's Student Council, where I managed events, led teams, and drove sponsorship for our Annual Fest. These experiences taught me that the best work happens when technical skills meet leadership and accountability.\n\nI'm someone who learns fast, takes ownership seriously, and is always working on something — whether it's a new project, a new skill, or a new idea.\n\n",https://lakshaynagda.vercel.app/,,69a6fe3c934396ba8bb60dec,Frontend Developer Intern,2026-03-23T05:59:24.537Z,2026-03-23T05:59:24.537Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1774245561798_lakshay_resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
