69c4a456c778e78a80dc12a9,Isaac Hayab,+2347076225974,isaachayab0@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Isaac, a second-year Computer Science student with a strong interest in backend systems and how things work under the hood. I gravitate toward the lower layers — I enjoy thinking about concurrency, data flow, and why systems behave the way they do, not just making them work.\nMost of my projects have been backend-focused. I recently built a distributed job queue system using Fastify, BullMQ, Redis, and PostgreSQL — designing the worker and server as independent processes and thinking carefully about queue durability and failure modes. Before that, I built a Dropbox-like file storage API with Express, MongoDB, MinIO, and JWT authentication, containerised end-to-end with Docker.\nOutside of pure code, I'm interested in psychology and philosophy — particularly how people think and make decisions. I find that background actually makes me a better engineer: it shapes how I reason about system design trade-offs and how I communicate technical ideas to non-technical people.\nI'm looking for an environment where I can work on real problems, learn from experienced engineers, and grow fast. Tobams Group caught my attention because of the combination of scalable backend work and AI integration — that's exactly the intersection I want to develop in.",https://naiih001.github.io,,69a7e52c934396ba8bb60df2,Backend Developer Intern,2026-03-26T03:13:26.946Z,2026-03-26T03:13:26.946Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1774494804054_isaac_hayab_tobams_application.docx.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69c4c28ac778e78a80dc12b7,Bolutife Adegoke,+23408066710875,bolutifeadegoke@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Keep it sharp, human, and senior:\n\nI’m a UI/UX and AI Product Designer with over 5 years of experience designing across fintech, legaltech, edtech, and AI-driven platforms. I focus on turning complex systems into intuitive, usable experiences, not just visually clean interfaces, but products that actually work in real-world conditions.\n\nOver time, I’ve worked on platforms like digital legal filing systems and AI-powered products, where clarity, trust, and system thinking are critical. My approach blends product thinking, user research, and interaction design to create experiences that balance usability with business goals.\n\nI’m particularly interested in designing systems that scale and solving problems where complexity is high but user expectations are even higher.",https://bolutifeadegoke.framer.website/,,69aefa4c05d00a25722c84c2,Product Designer Intern,2026-03-26T05:22:18.255Z,2026-03-26T05:22:18.255Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1774502533828_BOLUTIFE ADEGOKE_RESUME.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
