69c50c6cc778e78a80dc1bd7,Stephen Oluwaseun Oladipupo ,+23407040459902,oladipupos052@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Stephen Oluwaseun, a detail-oriented data analyst based in Akure with a strong background in organizing and interpreting data to help businesses make better decisions. Recently, I’ve been focusing on my growth as a Business and Data Analyst, building a solid technical foundation in tools like Excel, SQL, Power BI, and Python at SelahTech Academy in Akure. Where I undergo 3month internsive training.\nI really enjoy taking messy, raw information and turning it into something clear and actionable. For example, I’ve built interactive sales dashboards in Excel to track KPIs and used SQL to help HR departments understand workforce trends. I’m very comfortable working in remote environments and pride myself on being a clear communicator who can collaborate effectively with a team to get results.",,,69a71dac934396ba8bb60def,Business Analyst Intern,2026-03-26T10:37:32.192Z,2026-03-26T10:37:32.192Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1774521446971_compressed-4.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
