69c61d60c0c69d505a12035c,Adanna Nwogu,+2348141515540,nwoguadanna85@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Computer Science graduate with a strong interest in building practical, real-world solutions using technology. Over time, I’ve developed experience in both mobile and full-stack development, particularly working with NestJS and backend APIs to create applications that are not just functional, but genuinely useful.\n\nWhat really drives me is the ability to take an idea and turn it into something people can interact with. I’ve worked on projects involving machine learning integration and data-driven systems, which has helped me think more deeply about how software can solve real problems, especially in areas like agriculture and intelligent systems.\n\nI’m someone who enjoys learning by doing. I like figuring things out, improving my code, and understanding the “why” behind decisions, not just the “how.” I’m also very comfortable working independently, but I value collaboration and feedback because it helps me grow faster.\n\nAt this stage, I’m looking for opportunities where I can gain more hands-on experience, contribute meaningfully, and continue developing both my technical and problem-solving skills.\n",https://github.com/adabekeee,,69a7e52c934396ba8bb60df2,Backend Developer Intern,2026-03-27T06:02:08.084Z,2026-03-27T06:02:08.084Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1774591324420_Adanna(CV).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
