69c65f4ce48cb3c0f6101a66,Uzochukwu Richmond Ekezie,+2348158974291,ekezierichmond90@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a backend engineer with a diploma in data engineering. I have over 3 years of experience building, learning and designing backend systems that are scalable and efficient. I have experience in database design, schema handling, api integration and management, data modeling, business logic implementation, debugging and analysis. \n\nSome of the products I have built include; a bookkeeping system for business to be able to take record of inventory, customer details and sale so as to manage income and expenses in the day to day running of their businesses. A hotel management system that help hotels manage guest accommodation and schedule so as to be able to know the amount of business being done on a day to day basis. \n\nCurrently I am working on a project that analyzes electricity billing in both business and house holds to help understand the consumption of electricity by customers and businesses. \n\nI am familiar with python, PostgresSQL, MySQL, mongoDB, typescript, docker and lots more. \n\nI also have experience in technical documentation as well. ",https://ekezieju.vercel.app/,,69a7e52c934396ba8bb60df2,Backend Developer Intern,2026-03-27T10:43:24.190Z,2026-03-27T10:43:24.190Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1774608200953_Uzochukwu_Ekezie_cv.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
