69c6bb9de48cb3c0f6102099,Chimuanya Frances Francis,+250785853484,chimmuanyantoo@gmail.com,Rwanda,"My name is Francis Frances. I’m a first-year university student with a strong interest in technology, creativity, and personal growth.\n\nBefore I got into university, I had already taken time to learn web programming, graphic design, and other creative skills. I enjoy building things, designing, and bringing ideas to life, especially in the tech space.\n\nI also run a YouTube channel where I create and edit my own videos. My content is mainly focused on faith-based messages, life advice, and personal growth. Through my videos, I aim to encourage, inspire, and help people stay strong in their faith and daily lives.\n\nCreating content has helped me develop my video editing skills, creativity, and consistency. It has also taught me how to communicate better, pay attention to details, and connect with people through meaningful messages.\n\nI’m someone who is hardworking and determined. I like to challenge myself and I’m always looking for opportunities where I can grow, gain experience, and improve my skills. I believe starting small is okay, as long as I keep moving forward.\n\nI also value my faith in God, and it plays a big role in my life. It helps me stay focused, disciplined, and motivated, even during challenges.\n\nIn my free time, I enjoy singing, watching movies, and connecting with people. I like learning from others and sharing ideas.\n\nOverall, I’m someone who is passionate about growth, open to new opportunities, and committed to becoming the best version of myself.",https://www.canva.com/design/DAHCbxveuuM/Pmg1s65wa1uS5_DmKgbCeA/edit?utm_content=DAHCbxveuuM&utm_campaign=designshare&utm_medium=link2&utm_source=sharebutton,,69a6fefa934396ba8bb60ded,Graphic Design Intern,2026-03-27T17:17:17.667Z,2026-03-27T17:17:17.667Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1774631834485_Frances's CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
