69cacb208b571b9772b1f34e,Daniel Victor Udo,+23409026876052,dannyudo15@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Daniel Victor Udo, a React Developer and UI/UX-focused engineer who builds products that don’t just work, they scale, engage, and deliver real impact.\nI specialize in JavaScript (ES6+), React, and React Native, which means I don’t just build for the web, I also develop high-performance mobile applications with a seamless user experience across platforms. My strength lies in turning complex ideas into clean, intuitive, and fast interfaces backed by solid architecture, and integrating API'S into the front end to make it communicate with the backend.\nWhat separates me from most developers is execution at a product level. I’m the founder of MyEasySchool, a platform I built and scaled to serve over 3,000+ students, helping them improve academically through structured learning tools and performance tracking. I didn’t just develop it, I solved real problems around user experience, data handling, and system reliability, including implementing secure session systems and continuously refining the platform based on real user behavior.\nI’ve delivered solutions across multiple industries, education, Web3, cooperatives, and wellness, consistently creating products that are not only functional but strategically designed to connect with users and drive results.\nI move fast, I take ownership, and I don’t need hand holding to deliver value. I understand both the technical and product side of building software, which allows me to contribute beyond code into growth, usability, and long term scalability.\nIf you’re looking for someone who combines technical depth, product thinking, and proven execution, I’m that person.",https://danny-portfolio-lilac.vercel.app/,,69ca7ab1cc542dfc1db2f6d4,Frontend Developer Intern,2026-03-30T19:12:32.413Z,2026-03-30T19:12:32.413Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1774897948946_My CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
