69cbece149efb29554af6564,Raymond Joseph,+23408027197229,amraymondjoseph@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Raymond Joseph, a frontend developer focused on building clean, user-centered web applications with a strong emphasis on UI/UX and real-world usability.\n\nI primarily work with JavaScript and TypeScript, and my core stack includes React / Next.js, along with modern styling tools like Tailwind CSS, SCSS, and UI libraries such as Material UI. I also use animation libraries like Framer Motion and GSAP to create engaging, interactive user experiences.\n\nI have hands-on experience building full projects from scratch, not just isolated components. Some of my work includes:\n\nAn e-commerce platform with cart logic and authentication flow\nA hospital management system with role-based structure (admins, doctors, branches)\nA marketplace platform for listings like houses, cars, and land\nA multi-step event creation form with location integration\nProjects using Sanity CMS, Firebase, and API integrations\n\nI follow a component-based architecture and prioritize scalability, maintainability, and performance in my work. While my primary focus is frontend development, I also have experience working with backend tools like Express, Mongoose, and Firestore, which helps me collaborate effectively across the stack.",https://raydev.netlify.app,,69ca7ab1cc542dfc1db2f6d4,Frontend Developer Intern,2026-03-31T15:48:49.494Z,2026-03-31T15:48:49.494Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1774972125915_RAYMOND JOSEPH FRONTEND DEVELOPER.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
