69ccf4e2eb64f5ad0aad14d5,Ifeoluwa Adegbulugbe,+2347047588567,ifeoluwaadegbulugbe@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a UI/UX designer who enjoys creating thoughtful and engaging digital experiences. I’ve worked on a range of products across fintech, Web3, and consumer apps, where I’ve been involved from early ideas through to final design.\n\nI focus a lot on understanding user needs, identifying pain points, and turning that into clear and well-structured design solutions. I’ve worked on research, wireframing, prototyping, usability testing, and design systems using tools like Figma, FigJam, and Miro.\n\nI also enjoy working closely with teams, sharing ideas, and improving products through feedback and iteration. I’m especially interested in building products that have real impact and make everyday experiences better.",https://ifeoluwasweb.framer.website,,69ca44c94e5d9fe46aef7610,Product Designer Intern,2026-04-01T10:35:14.778Z,2026-04-01T10:35:14.778Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775039712017_Ifeoluwa_Adegbulugbe.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
