69ccf651eb64f5ad0aad1507,Grace Chizara Agor,+23408181754219,graceagor9@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Grace Chizara Agor, and I have a background in Accountancy with experience in sales, customer service, and digital marketing. Over the years, I have developed strong analytical and communication skills through working with clients, understanding their needs, and providing solutions that improve business outcomes.\n\nI am currently building my career in business analysis because I enjoy working with data, solving problems, and helping organizations make better decisions. I am also passionate about continuous learning and adapting to new tools and systems, especially in fast-paced environments","I am currently building my portfolio to showcase my growing skills in business analysis, including data analysis, reporting, and process improvement. I would be happy to share samples of my work upon request.",,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-01T10:41:21.726Z,2026-04-01T10:41:21.726Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775040078550_Grace Chizara Agor Resume .pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69cd025aeb64f5ad0aad1656,MEIKIZEDEK CHIBUZOR,+2348139189782,meikizedek1327@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a versatile learner with experience across business sales, business intelligence, and data analysis, where I focus on turning data into meaningful insights that support better business decisions. I enjoy working with tools like Excel, Power BI, MySQL, and other analytics platforms to analyze performance, identify trends, and improve how businesses operate.\nAlongside my analytical work, I’m also comfortable handling administrative and coordination responsibilities such as managing schedules, organizing meetings, supporting communication, and assisting HR processes like onboarding and recruitment. This balance allows me to contribute both on the technical side and in day-to-day operational support. I’m someone who is adaptable, proactive, and always eager to learn. I enjoy working with people, collaborating in teams, and understanding different perspectives so I can contribute effectively. I also stay calm under pressure, manage my time well, and approach problems in a practical and solution-focused way.\nIn general, I see myself as a growing learner who connects data, business, and people and I’m motivated to keep improving while contributing positively to any team I’m part of.\n","linkedin.com/in/billiways-business-solutions, https://github.com/meikizedek1327-bot/wdd130",,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-01T11:32:42.918Z,2026-04-01T11:32:42.918Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775043158775_Business Analyst Intern Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
