69cd2e7feb64f5ad0aad1783,Aigbodion Dominion Eromosele,+2348076911452,alexgrate606@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Aigbodion Dominion, a 200-level Computer Science student at Caleb University and a self-taught full stack developer with a strong focus on backend engineering.\n\nI specialize in building robust server-side applications using Django and REST APIs, paired with PostgreSQL for data management. I have hands-on experience developing e-commerce platforms where I designed and implemented secure APIs for user authentication, product management, order processing, and payment integrations. These projects taught me the importance of writing clean, scalable, and well-documented code that can handle real-world traffic and data integrity.\n\nBeyond coding, I am passionate about problem-solving and continuously improving my skills through personal projects on GitHub[](https://github.com/alexgrate).\n\nI am eager to bring my backend development experience, quick learning ability, and strong work ethic to the team as a Backend Developer intern.",https://github.com/alexgrate,,69ca44f74e5d9fe46aef7611,Backend Developer Intern,2026-04-01T14:41:03.029Z,2026-04-01T14:41:03.029Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775054459942_Aigbodion_Dominion_Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
