69cd34e1eb64f5ad0aad1860,Victor Uhuo,+2349136786600,victoruhuo@yahoo.com,Nigeria,"My name is victor uhuo with a background in computer science, i have worked as an administrative executive and operations coordinator with a marketing communications film and a health care services and consulting film. i have supported executive reporting, correspondence management, managing workflows and documentation systems, contract onboarding and team coordination.\ni have a learners mindset, highly organized, discrete and confident in my ability to support organization operational excellence. \n",nil,,69ca45174e5d9fe46aef7612,Business Operations Intern,2026-04-01T15:08:17.275Z,2026-04-01T15:08:17.275Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775056093157_Victor Uhuo_cv.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
