rello, Google Meet and others.  As a person, I am ambidextrous, a fast and ready learner, keen to solve problems or resolve complexities, sound communicator, humble and hopeful. Thank you.\r\n",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Xoz7Y3lIf8R-lbaY7UfxHKvxfX-arvd6,,69ca45174e5d9fe46aef7612,Business Operations Intern,2026-04-01T15:59:21.827Z,2026-04-01T15:59:21.827Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775059157433_Edidiong Etuk's HRM CV (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
