69cd57c8eb64f5ad0aad1919,Tunde Yinusa,+23408139367772,tunde.d.yinusa@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a backend-focused developer with experience building RESTful APIs using Node.js, Express, MongoDB, and TypeScript. I enjoy designing scalable server-side solutions, implementing authentication, and working with databases. I have developed projects such as a Job Tracker API that includes user authentication, filtering, and error handling. I am eager to continue learning, contribute to real-world applications, and grow in a collaborative development environment.\n",https://github.com/TundeYinusa/JOB-TRACKER-API,,69ca44f74e5d9fe46aef7611,Backend Developer Intern,2026-04-01T17:37:12.249Z,2026-04-01T17:37:12.249Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775065029684_Tunde_Yinusa_Backend_Developer_CV_Up.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
