69d01e5ddba4f810e6375647,Deborah Moore,+2347084548443,mooredebbiefaith114@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a proactive virtual assistant with a growing specialization in project management. I completed my virtual assistant training two years ago, where I developed strong skills in task coordination, scheduling, research, and administrative support, all aimed at improving efficiency and productivity. Apart from this, I am also involved in private coaching/tutoring, where I support learners with specific academic needs, especially those who are struggling or those who want to stay ahead in their academic performance.\n\nCurrently, I am building my capacity in project management, learning how to plan, track, support, and automate projects effectively while ensuring tasks are completed on time and aligned with set goals. I enjoy bringing structure to processes, following up on deliverables, and supporting teams to stay organized and focused. I also enjoy exploring tech tools, and my interest in project management has pushed me to work with essential tools such as Asana, Trello, Microsoft Suite, and Google Workspace.\n\nWhile I know that I am just starting out in this space, I am confident that with my skills, I will be able to make a meaningful impact in this prestigious organization. I am highly adaptable, quick to learn, and take initiative with minimal need for supervision. I am excited about this opportunity to apply my skills, gain hands-on experience, and contribute meaningfully to business operations.",https://canva.link/026tf92pbyh1p3u,,69ca45174e5d9fe46aef7612,Business Operations Intern,2026-04-03T20:09:01.143Z,2026-04-03T20:09:01.143Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775246938199_Deborah Moore CPS CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
