69d3e559dba4f810e6376505,Silas Adegoke,+2349023413635,silasadegoke331@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a frontend-focused developer with over three years of experience building web applications using React, Next.js, and TypeScript. Over time, I’ve also developed backend skills with Node.js and Express, where I’ve worked on building APIs, handling data, and integrating services.\n\nI enjoy creating scalable, user-focused applications and have worked on projects involving messaging systems, contact management, and API integrations. I’m particularly interested in how frontend and backend systems connect, which is why I’m expanding my backend knowledge and exploring areas like system design and performance optimization.\n\nI’m someone who learns quickly, enjoys solving problems, and values writing clean, maintainable code. I’m excited about this opportunity because it will allow me to strengthen my backend skills while contributing to real-world projects in a collaborative team environment.",https://portfolio-pi-fawn-kft9m71boa.vercel.app/,,69ca44f74e5d9fe46aef7611,Backend Developer Intern,2026-04-06T16:54:49.264Z,2026-04-06T16:54:49.264Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775494486314_Silas_Adegoke_FlowCV_Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
