69d41fbfdba4f810e6376707,Oluwaremilekun Eniola Adedoyin-Bamido,+2348163339875,oluwaremilekun.adedoyin@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a recent graduate with a strong background in research, data analysis, and community engagement. Through my academic and professional experiences, I have developed strong analytical and problem-solving skills, as well as the ability to translate complex information into clear, actionable insights. I have worked on projects that involved collecting and analyzing data, preparing reports, and communicating findings to diverse audiences, which has strengthened both my attention to detail and my ability to collaborate effectively with stakeholders.\n\nI am particularly interested in business analysis because it allows me to combine my curiosity, analytical mindset, and communication skills to help organizations make informed decisions. I am eager to contribute to projects at Tobams Group, learn from experienced professionals, and gain hands-on experience in requirement elicitation, process improvement, and data-driven decision-making in a fast-paced, technology-driven learning environment.",,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-06T21:03:59.998Z,2026-04-06T21:03:59.998Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775509437492_RESUME_Oluwaremilekun Adedoyin.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d421ccdba4f810e637672d,Oluwaremilekun Eniola Adedoyin-Bamido,+2348163339875,oluwaremilekun.adedoyin@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a recent graduate with experience in project coordination, data management, and community engagement. Through my work with the Rebekah Foundation and other experiences, I have developed strong organizational skills, attention to detail, and the ability to manage multiple tasks simultaneously. I have experience maintaining records, tracking project progress, preparing reports, and collaborating with diverse teams to achieve objectives.\n\nI am interested in business operations because it allows me to combine my analytical skills, coordination abilities, and problem solving mindset to ensure smooth project execution. I am eager to contribute to daily operations, assist with recruitment and crossfunctional projects, and support initiatives that drive efficiency and impact. I am also enthusiastic about learning new tools, improving processes, and growing professionally in a dynamic and remote work environment.",,,69ca45174e5d9fe46aef7612,Business Operations Intern,2026-04-06T21:12:44.244Z,2026-04-06T21:12:44.244Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775509961594_RESUME_Oluwaremilekun Adedoyin.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d42a31dba4f810e6376753,Shinkut Dorathy John,+2349038742810,johndorathy61@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Dorathy John Shinkut, a graduate of English Studies from Kaduna State University with strong training in data analytics. Over the past few years, I’ve worked as an Administrative Assistant and Customer Service Representative, where I managed schedules, records, and reports while ensuring accuracy and professionalism.\nI have completed certifications in Data Analytics with KAD ICT Hub, Arewa Ladies 4Tech, and DigiGirls, gaining practical skills in Excel, SQL, Tableau, and Power BI. I am detail-oriented, organized, and eager to apply my analytical skills to support decision-making and contribute to your team.\n",,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-06T21:48:33.374Z,2026-04-06T21:48:33.374Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775512108922_Dorathy's CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d431b5d50204c995403bd7,Oyelude Favour,+2349057165905,favouroyelude@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a first-class graduate of Electrical and Electronics Engineering at Covenant University. I started my data analysis journey while I was still in university, beginning with my small snacks business. Initially, I kept records on paper, but as the data volume increased, I had to migrate to Microsoft Excel. However, entering records into Excel alone was not enough, so I built a better solution that allowed me to type in a customer's name and have it return all their past sales records, especially if they are in debt. I also included an inventory management section and a dashboard to provide basic business insights.\nLater, I joined Enchant Gifts, an e-commerce business specialising in gift items. At the early stage, I just applied the same simple system I used for my own business, but as the company scaled, we started to have problems such as order mix-ups and delayed order processing. To address this, I developed a more advanced Excel and Power BI solution that integrated the sales, operations, and management teams into a single, structured workflow.\nI have undertaken multiple projects, including a comprehensive analysis of the root causes of power outages in the United States, in which a decade of historical data was analysed, and a step-by-step report was developed to significantly reduce outage frequency. Another was an A/B testing analysis for Maven cafe to understand how customers responded to various promotional offers and ad campaigns to determine the most effective marketing strategies. Additionally, I acted as an analytics consultant for Massachusetts General Hospital and developed a high-level dashboard to provide insights into their re-admission and mortality rates, and the effect of different health insurance programs on patient treatment.\nUltimately, I would say I am result-driven, resilient and a fast learner, which helps me pick up new tools quickly. As an analyst, I ensure I bridge the gap between business needs and technical solutions to deliver meaningful business impact.",https://github.com/FOyelude,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-06T22:20:37.178Z,2026-04-06T22:20:37.178Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775514032637_CV PDF.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d43aebd50204c995403bf5,Elizabeth Ayoola,+2349012184180,elizabethayoola05@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a First-Class Banking and Finance undergraduate at the University of Lagos, currently ranked in the top 1% of my class. While my academic background is in finance, my experience has evolved into supporting business operations, coordination, and data-driven execution across different teams.\n\nIn my current role as an Operations Analyst at Afrimetrics, I work closely with teams to track KPIs, maintain operational dashboards, and coordinate reporting workflows, ensuring that projects stay on track and decisions are backed by clear data. I’ve also had experience managing content workflows as a finance writer, where I handled research, structured delivery timelines, and collaborated with teams to meet publishing goals.\n\nBeyond that, I’ve been actively involved in logistics and finance roles within student organizations, where I’ve supported event coordination, managed budgets, and improved internal processes. These experiences have helped me build strong organizational skills, attention to detail, and the ability to manage multiple workstreams effectively.\n\nI’m particularly interested in this role because it sits at the intersection of operations, execution, and impact. I enjoy building structure, improving processes, and supporting teams to deliver efficiently, and I’m looking to grow in a role where I can contribute to scaling systems and driving meaningful outcomes.",,,69ca45174e5d9fe46aef7612,Business Operations Intern,2026-04-06T22:59:55.968Z,2026-04-06T22:59:55.968Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775516392706_ELIZABETH AYOOLA.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d43e72d50204c995403c01,Vincent Grace ,+2348141829366,gracetamara88@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a motivated and detail-oriented individual with a strong interest in continuous learning and professional growth. I have developed skills in communication, problem-solving, and teamwork through my academic and practical experiences. I am passionate about delivering quality results and adapting quickly in dynamic environments. I take initiative, work well under pressure, and always strive to improve myself and contribute positively to any organization.",Nom,,69ca45174e5d9fe46aef7612,Business Operations Intern,2026-04-06T23:14:58.560Z,2026-04-06T23:14:58.560Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775517295202_Vincent CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d44b9bd50204c995403c33,Oluwabusayomi Tanimowo,+23408079509807,busayomit006@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a motivated and detail-oriented Public Health graduate with a strong academic foundation and practical experience in administrative support, coordination, and stakeholder engagement across both international and local environments. I have developed strong organisational, analytical, and communication skills through roles in education support, retail operations, and regulatory services, where I was responsible for documentation, record-keeping, reporting, and working with diverse teams.\n\nIn my previous experience as a Teaching Assistant in the United Kingdom, I supported structured learning activities, maintained accurate records, and coordinated tasks to ensure smooth daily operations. I also gained customer service and operational experience working with the British Red Cross, where I handled stock processing, supported store operations, and assisted customers in a fast-paced environment. Additionally, during my National Youth Service Corps placement, I contributed to compliance and inspection activities, supported documentation processes, and worked closely with cross-functional teams in a structured public sector environment.\n\nI am highly comfortable working with data, trackers, and documentation systems, and I am proficient in Microsoft Office tools and digital platforms. I enjoy working in structured environments where organisation, follow-up, and attention to detail are essential. I am also proactive, quick to learn, and capable of managing multiple responsibilities effectively while maintaining accuracy and accountability.\n\nI am particularly interested in business operations because it combines coordination, problem-solving, and process improvement—areas where I am eager to grow and contribute. I am excited about the opportunity to support operational processes, assist with project coordination, and contribute to efficient execution within a dynamic and fast-paced team.",,,69ca45174e5d9fe46aef7612,Business Operations Intern,2026-04-07T00:11:07.252Z,2026-04-07T00:11:07.252Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775520663753_Oluwabusayomi Tanimowo CV 1.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d44bafd50204c995403c3a,John Chukwuemeka Okoli,+23408148533066,okoli4john@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a UI/UX designer, currently gaining hands-on professional experience on Product design through a remote internship with Genesys Tech Hub. I have worked on real-world projects including an e-commerce website for farm produce ( https://shorturl.at/z8iCF ) and a food ordering app ( https://shorturl.at/cN4dU ), both designed in Figma. These experiences have sharpened my eye for visual design, user flows, and intuitive interfaces. I am passionate about creating products that are both beautiful and functional, and I am eager to keep growing within a collaborative, impact-driven team like Tobams Group.",https://shorturl.at/z8iCF,,69ca44c94e5d9fe46aef7610,Product Designer Intern,2026-04-07T00:11:27.994Z,2026-04-07T00:11:27.994Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775520685095_John-Okoli_Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d455dcd50204c995403c50,Saviour Micheal Akpan ,+2347011117377,saviour.michealboy@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a data analyst with a strong interest in business analysis and problem-solving. I have experience using Excel, SQL, and Power BI to analyze data and create insights for decision-making.\nI have an experience and also have worked on projects involving data cleaning, reporting, and dashboard creation, and I enjoy translating data into meaningful information for stakeholders. I’m excited about this role because it combines analysis with real impact, especially in the education space, and I’m eager to learn and contribute",saviour-micheal.framer.website,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-07T00:54:52.987Z,2026-04-07T00:54:52.987Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775523290179_Saviour Micheal_CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d469b7d50204c995403c70,Olowu Abraham Aduragbemi,+2349160366834,olowu.tayo200@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a data analyst based in Lagos with experience turning raw datasets into structured findings and stakeholder-facing reports. My background spans fintech, retail, and education — I've worked with everything from 600,000+ financial transactions to student performance data during my NYSC year. I build things too: I shipped a production AI platform and a SaaS inventory product solo. I'm precise with data, clear in communication, and I don't hand over a report unless it actually answers the question it was supposed to answer.",https://ethminer001.github.io/,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-07T02:19:35.926Z,2026-04-07T02:19:35.926Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775528373604_Olowu_Aduragbemi_Resume_TobamsGroup.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d4a8ffd50204c995403cd5,Micah miraclejewel ,+2348082116322,quivercreatives@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a graphic designer with a BSc degree, currently serving (NYSC), and I’m passionate about creating clean, engaging visuals that communicate ideas clearly.\nI have experience designing social media content, flyers, and branding materials using tools like Canva, Photoshop, and Illustrator. I enjoy turning ideas into visuals that attract attention and help brands grow their online presence.\nI’m someone who is always learning, open to feedback, and eager to improve my skills. Right now, I’m looking for an opportunity where I can gain more hands-on experience, contribute creatively to a team, and build a strong professional portfolio.",Linktr.ee/quiverrx,,69ca456d4e5d9fe46aef7614,Graphic Design Intern,2026-04-07T06:49:35.768Z,2026-04-07T06:49:35.768Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775544569852_v.1 Portfolio and cv-compressed (1) (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
