69d4ae29d50204c995403d13,Benedict Achikeh ,+2349032416644,achikeh2003@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Computer Engineering graduate with a growing focus on business analysis and using data to solve real-world problems. I’ve built hands-on experience working with tools like Python, SQL, Excel, and Power BI to analyze data, uncover trends, and present insights in a way that supports decision-making. During my internship, I didn’t just work with data, I focused on understanding the context behind it and how it can improve business outcomes. I’m particularly interested in roles where I can bridge the gap between data and business needs, contribute to process improvements, and continuously develop my analytical and communication skills in a fast-paced environment.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/benedict-achikeh-36021225b,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-07T07:11:37.661Z,2026-04-07T07:11:37.661Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775545894203_Benedict Achikeh's Business Analyst CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d4af3bd50204c995403d24,Chinecherem Success Ezea,+23409010077528,successezea@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a detail oriented accounting graduate currently pursuing my ICAN qualification, with a strong interest in business operations, finance, and structured problem solving. My academic journey has helped me develop analytical thinking, discipline, and the ability to work with processes and deadlines.\n\nI am particularly interested in roles that involve coordination, planning, and execution, where I can contribute to improving systems and ensuring tasks are delivered efficiently. I am organized, adaptable, and eager to learn, and I enjoy working in environments that challenge me to grow.\n\nI am looking to build a solid professional foundation while contributing meaningfully to a team, especially in an organization focused on impact, innovation, and development like Tobams Group.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/ezea-chinecherem-577a6025a?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_ios,,69ca45174e5d9fe46aef7612,Business Operations Intern,2026-04-07T07:16:11.535Z,2026-04-07T07:16:11.535Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775546167079_Ezea Chinecherem cv.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d4b319d50204c995403dad,Awam Chimere Marvellous,+2347089823013,awamchimere@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Awam Chimere, and I’m a final-year student at the University of Nigeria, Nsukka, studying Agricultural Economics. Alongside my academic background, I’m a backend-focused software developer with a strong interest in building reliable APIs and backend services that support real users.\nMy core strengths are in JavaScript and TypeScript, particularly with Node.js for server-side development. I enjoy designing clean, maintainable RESTful APIs, with a focus on clear structure, good documentation, and writing code that other developers can easily understand and build on.\n\nI’m especially interested in backend challenges that involve real product complexity—things like authentication and authorization, database design, performance optimization, and building systems that can scale as usage grows. I also value collaboration and have experience working in remote environments, where clear communication, openness to feedback, and continuous improvement through code reviews are essential.\n\nAt this stage of my career, I’m intentionally looking for opportunities where I can develop strong engineering habits—working with production standards, understanding CI/CD pipelines, monitoring systems, and learning how to design backend architectures that are both scalable and maintainable.",https://github.com/Devchimereawam,,69ca44f74e5d9fe46aef7611,Backend Developer Intern,2026-04-07T07:32:41.508Z,2026-04-07T07:32:41.508Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775547158657_Software Engineer Resume (4).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d4b454d50204c995403dc7,Praise Samuel ,+2349039958015,praisesam23@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Praise Samuel, and I have a background in Accounting. Over time, I have developed a strong interest in working with data, particularly in using it to support decision-making and improve business processes.\nI have built skills in tools like Excel and Power BI, and I’ve had experience working with financial data; from preparing reports to analyzing trends during my internship and previous roles.\nWhat’s been shaping my career recently is my transition into business and financial analysis, where I can combine my accounting knowledge with analytical thinking. I enjoy breaking down problems, understanding what the numbers are really saying, and translating that into useful insights.\nAt this stage, I am focused on gaining more hands-on experience in a structured environment where I can continue to grow and contribute meaningfully.\n",,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-07T07:37:56.130Z,2026-04-07T07:37:56.130Z,,,"https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775547471314_Samuel, Praise Amarachi_CV.pdf",Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d4b626d50204c995403dd9,Godswill Amos ,+2348169035424,amosgodswill00@gmail.com,Nigeria,"​I am a Backend Engineer and AI-Driven Systems Developer currently pursuing a degree in Computer Engineering at the Federal University of Technology, Akure (FUTA). I specialize in building robust, scalable backend services and have a proven track record of integrating real-time AI models into production environments. My experience spans from developing microservices at Kloud6 to leading technical teams at the Smart System Research Laboratory.",GitHub.com/Godswillamos0 ,,69ca44f74e5d9fe46aef7611,Backend Developer Intern,2026-04-07T07:45:42.804Z,2026-04-07T07:45:42.804Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775547939233_DOC-20251110-WA0022. (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d4bdc6d50204c995403e60,Blessing Sarah Eriaremhen,+23407032879165,preciousb703@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a highly organised, people-first professional who brings both empathy and measurable results to every role I take on. I thrive in structured environments where planning, attention to detail, and effective time management are key, ensuring that tasks are completed efficiently and to a high standard.\n\nAt the core of my approach is a strong focus on people. I value clear communication, teamwork, and building positive relationships, and I always strive to create supportive and respectful experiences for those I work with, whether colleagues, clients, or patients.\n\nWhat sets me apart is my ability to balance this human-centered approach with a results-driven mindset. I pay close attention to outcomes, using data and performance indicators to guide my decisions, improve processes, and deliver tangible impact. I take pride in not only doing my job well, but in making a meaningful difference while achieving measurable success.",,,69ca45174e5d9fe46aef7612,Business Operations Intern,2026-04-07T08:18:14.149Z,2026-04-07T08:18:14.149Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775549891182_BLESSING SARAH ERIAREMHEN EA.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
