69d4f089081e2389a92dd76c,Velma Richards,+23234341922,velmarichards01@gmail.com,Sierra Leone,"Hello.  A bit about myself. \nMy name is Velma and I have 10 years experience maintaining SOPs, trackers, performance reports, and project briefs across multi-client environments. I have managed operational delivery and supported end-to-end hiring throughout my career including defining role requirements, coordinating assessments, and managing onboarding. \nOn market research, I have conducted competitor and market analysis to support business strategy across multiple sectors. On stakeholder communications, I have prepared presentations and proposals for enterprise clients including Interswitch Nigeria, and managed external relationships at senior level.\nI am a Nigerian citizen working remotely from Freetown with reliable connectivity, flexible availability across time zones. I am comfortable with the junior-level compensation and I am not looking for a title , I am looking for the right organization to grow with.\n\nIf you value operational capability, learning agility, and genuine mission alignment over perfect sector credentials, I would love to contribute to Tobam's  mission of empowering 10 million Tech Talents across Africa by 2030.\n",,,69ca45174e5d9fe46aef7612,Business Operations Intern,2026-04-07T11:54:49.876Z,2026-04-07T11:54:49.876Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775562886491_Velma Richards_2026_Remote_ Business Operations.docx_.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
