69d4fad4081e2389a92dd7ad,Mogbojuri oluwatobi Oluwasegun,+23407016661930,oluwasegunmogbojuri49@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\n\nI am Mogbojuri Oluwasegun, a BSc in Accounting and an accomplished IT developer with nearly 3 years of experience in delivering comprehensive solutions using C#,Java, React, SQL, AWS. In a digital age, being tech-savvy is essential. I am well-versed in technology and have experience using various software and tools, which can be an asset in a rapidly digitizing world. I firmly believe that my unique blend of skills and qualities makes me a deserving candidate for the company.\n\nMy core strengths include effective teamwork, a passion for solving complex challenges, and a commitment to continuous learning. I don't merely embrace learning; I enthusiastically welcome fresh challenges as opportunities for growth.  I am ready to contribute my energy, enthusiasm, and skills to your team. I understand that this program offers a unique opportunity for growth and development, and I am fully committed to making the most of it. \nThank you for considering my application.",github.com/mogbojuri-s,,69ca44f74e5d9fe46aef7611,Backend Developer Intern,2026-04-07T12:38:44.993Z,2026-04-07T12:38:44.993Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775565521867_oluwasegun cv3in1.jpg,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d4fb7b081e2389a92dd7b7,Opeyemi Sarah Fasedemi,+23408072679500,fasedemiopeyemi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a recent Business Administration graduate and a virtual administrative assistant with hands-on experience supporting business operations through scheduling, calendar management, research, and workflow coordination. I have worked closely with clients to manage their daily activities, organize tasks, and ensure that nothing falls through the cracks.\n\nI enjoy helping teams stay organized and improving how work flows from one stage to another. This includes coordinating schedules, tracking deadlines, and structuring information in a way that makes it easy to act on. My experience has also strengthened my ability to communicate clearly, manage priorities, and remain reliable in fast-paced or remote work environments.\n\nI am detail-oriented, proactive, and comfortable using tools such as Google Workspace and workflow automation systems to support efficient operations. I am always looking for ways to improve processes, reduce manual effort, and contribute to smoother day-to-day business activities.",,,69ca45174e5d9fe46aef7612,Business Operations Intern,2026-04-07T12:41:31.259Z,2026-04-07T12:41:31.259Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775565687458_Opeyemi Cv (8).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
