69d531ead0f5fb6b3c4ecd6f,Lena Ukachi,+2349044675516,ukachilena2@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m someone who enjoys working behind the scenes to keep things organized and moving. I’ve developed an interest in operations, especially around coordinating tasks, supporting onboarding processes, and making sure things don’t fall through the cracks. I’m naturally detail-oriented, and I tend to take ownership of tasks to ensure they’re followed through properly.\n\nAfter the internship call, I had a clearer picture of what the role involves, and it made me more interested in being part of it. I like that it’s hands-on and gives exposure to different parts of the business, especially the mix of coordination, structure, and working across different areas of the team from recruitment to project coordination.\n\nI’m comfortable working remotely, managing my time, and staying accountable. I’m also still learning and improving, but I’m intentional about doing things well and contributing wherever I can.",,,69ca45174e5d9fe46aef7612,Business Operations Intern,2026-04-07T16:33:46.405Z,2026-04-07T16:33:46.405Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775579623125_Lena Ukachi_2026 Business Operation CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
