69d536f0d0f5fb6b3c4ecea8,Kenfack Djoumetio Channel Ange,+237680252774,channelkenfack1@gmail.com,Cameroon,"I am a Computer Management student at UCAC‑ICY with hands‑on experience in backend development, system administration, and full‑stack web projects. My technical foundation spans Java, Python, C++, SQL, and Dart/Flutter, with a strong focus on building scalable APIs, database‑driven applications, and modular architectures.\n\nBeyond coding, I bring a unique blend of business acumen and technical expertise. Through internships in fintech and customer support, I’ve designed digital administrative systems, optimized financial workflows, and supported clients with practical solutions. I also led a team in the SchulZ International Entrepreneurship Competition, where I managed financial planning and presented a tech‑based business project—demonstrating leadership and problem‑solving under pressure.\n\nKey strengths I offer:\n\nBackend Development: Database design, API integration, server‑side logic, and performance optimization.\n\nSystems & Tools: Linux administration, virtualization (VirtualBox/Kali), and networking troubleshooting.\n\nFull‑Stack Experience: Web development with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and SQL integration.\n\nBusiness & Communication: Ability to translate technical solutions into business value, backed by customer support and operations experience.\n\nI thrive in environments where technical precision meets business impact. My goal is to contribute to backend systems that are not only robust and efficient but also aligned with organizational growth.\n\nAnd i am perfectly fluent in both English and French",https://www.credly.com/users/channel-ange-kenfack-djoumetio.2f06a8b8,,69ca44f74e5d9fe46aef7611,Backend Developer Intern,2026-04-07T16:55:12.823Z,2026-04-07T16:55:12.823Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775580909932_CV - KENFACK CHANNEL.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
