69d6886cd9126eb277a7897a,Omeke Lovina Ifebuche ,+2348063949116,lovinaifebuche9@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a UX/UI designer who focuses on creating simple, user-centered digital experiences. I’m particularly interested in understanding user behavior and turning complex ideas into intuitive interfaces.\nI’ve worked on improving usability and visual clarity in my projects, and I enjoy the process of researching, prototyping, and refining designs based on feedback. I’m always looking to improve how products feel and function, not just how they look. Though I just have prior experience and I want to learn and improve more ",,,69ca44c94e5d9fe46aef7610,Product Designer Intern,2026-04-08T16:55:08.647Z,2026-04-08T16:55:08.647Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775667304716_Lovina Cv.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d68a0dd9126eb277a789ae,Martins Otuya,+23409039656267,Martinsotuya1997@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a Mathematics undergraduate at Lagos State University with a strong interest in product design and problem-solving. I’m naturally curious and enjoy understanding the reasoning behind how things work, which is why I approach design not just as a visual exercise, but as a structured process of solving real user problems.\n\nMy background in mathematics has trained me to think logically, analyse systems, and break down complex problems into clear solutions. I bring that same mindset into design — focusing on creating simple, thoughtful experiences that make products easier and more effective for users.\n\nI’m always learning and exploring new ideas, and I’m excited about opportunities where I can combine analytical thinking with creativity to build meaningful digital experiences.\n",https://otuyamartins.framer.website/,,69ca44c94e5d9fe46aef7610,Product Designer Intern,2026-04-08T17:02:05.287Z,2026-04-08T17:02:05.287Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775667722385_My CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
