69d68b42d9126eb277a789de,Gift Onyeje,+2349036877848,onyejegift59@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Gift Onyeje, a UI/UX designer based in Asaba, Delta State,  My academic background is in Hospitality and Tourism Management, which shaped how I approach design   hospitality is fundamentally about people and how they feel when they interact with a service, and I carry that thinking into every product I work on.\nI've built my skills through  projects, the most recent being NURA, a mobile health management app where I handled user research, information architecture, design system creation, and a fully interactive prototype. I also have experience designing for fintech and other product categories. Alongside design, I'm currently learning HTML/CSS and Framer to deepen my understanding of how products are built.\nI'm drawn to Tobams Group because of the focus on building technology that creates real-world impact. I'm a fast learner, I take initiative, and I'm looking for an environment where I can grow while contributing meaningfully from day one.\n", behance.net/giftonyeje ,,69ca44c94e5d9fe46aef7610,Product Designer Intern,2026-04-08T17:07:14.671Z,2026-04-08T17:07:14.671Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775668031987_GIFT ONYEJE.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
