69d6aae8d9126eb277a78b5a,Sharon Imaledo,+2348169075828,sharonimaledo@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m an analytical graduate with a strong foundation in data analysis and a growing focus on business problem-solving. Through my internship experiences, I’ve worked on analyzing performance data, building reports, and identifying trends, but more importantly, I’ve learned how to connect those insights to real business decisions.\n\nBeyond the technical side, I’m particularly interested in understanding how businesses operate, how processes are structured, how decisions are made, and where improvements can be introduced. I’ve taken time to learn about the business analysis lifecycle, and I enjoy breaking down problems, asking the right questions, and thinking through practical solutions.\n\nI’m now looking to deepen that skill set in a role where I can contribute not just through analysis, but by supporting business needs, improving processes, and working closely with stakeholders to drive meaningful outcomes.",https://github.com/sharonimaledo,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-08T19:22:16.872Z,2026-04-08T19:22:16.872Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775676132780_Sharon Imaledo's CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
