69d782e29ca7cd6259989411,Emmanuel Adikwu,+2349137118577,emmanueledache54@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Backend Engineer and Full-Stack Developer with a Bachelor of Engineering in Electrical and Electronics Engineering. I specialize in the MERN stack (MongoDB, Express, React, Node.js) and have a strong foundation in architecting scalable server-side systems.\nMost recently, I served as the Backend Auth Lead at Truemind Innovation Ltd, where I directed the development of secure identity systems using Node.js and Redis for high-efficiency session management. My technical toolkit also includes Docker for containerization and building CI/CD pipelines to ensure stable production environments. Beyond coding, I am a Graduate Member of the Nigerian Society of Engineers (GMNSE) and have experience leading cross-functional teams of over 50 developers. I am passionate about building software that solves real-world problems, ranging from real estate automation to educational health tools.",https://emmanuelportfolio-nine.vercel.app/,,69ca44f74e5d9fe46aef7611,Backend Developer Intern,2026-04-09T10:43:46.783Z,2026-04-09T10:43:46.783Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775731423839_Emmanuel_Resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
