69d81c9a6469458c6f9204da,Samuel Alawode ,+2349124497514,samuelolaoluwa394@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m someone who genuinely loves to learn and grow. I’m always curious whether it’s picking up new skills, understanding people better, or improving how I approach my work. Learning keeps me sharp and helps me bring fresh ideas into everything I do.\n\nI also enjoy connecting with people, even in simple ways. I value meaningful conversations, shared ideas, and building relationships that feel real and intentional. I may not always be the loudest in the room, but I’m present, attentive, and easy to talk to.\n\nNaturally, I’m a bit reserved and calm. I like to observe, think things through, and move with a quiet confidence. I’d describe my vibe as cool, collected, and easygoing, I don’t rush, I don’t force things, I just stay grounded and focused while doing what I do best.\n",https://www.linkedin.com/in/samuel-alawode-a91325344?utm_source=share&utm_campaign=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=android_app,,69ca44c94e5d9fe46aef7610,Product Designer Intern,2026-04-09T21:39:38.254Z,2026-04-09T21:39:38.254Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775770774278_SAMUEL OLAOLUWA ALAWODE CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
