69d828bf6469458c6f92051b,Pleasant Yomi,+23407040354205,pleasantyomi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Pleasant, and I’m a frontend developer with a strong focus on building modern web applications using React, Next.js, and TypeScript.\n\nI’ve worked on several projects where I handled things like API integration, building responsive user interfaces, and managing application state. For example, I’ve built systems that involve real-time data handling and interactive dashboards, which helped me improve both my technical and problem-solving skills.\n\nI’m also someone who enjoys learning by building, so I constantly challenge myself with projects that push me to understand how things work beyond just the surface level.\n\nCurrently, I’m looking to grow in a more structured environment where I can contribute to real-world products, collaborate with a team, and continue developing as a frontend engineer.\n",https://pleasantyomi.vercel.app,,69ca7ab1cc542dfc1db2f6d4,Frontend Developer Intern,2026-04-09T22:31:27.652Z,2026-04-09T22:31:27.652Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775773884846_resume.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
