69d867df6469458c6f92061c,Longinus Onyekwere,+23409050808761,longychuks@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Longinus Izuchukwu Onyekwere is a multidisciplinary creative and technologist from Nigeria with a background in Computer Science from Bayero University Kano. He is the director of 58STUDIOS and founder of The Arrivals Artist Mine, initiatives that blend art, music, and technology to empower creators. With experience in app testing, audio production, video editing, and community building, Longinus is passionate about innovation, digital expression, and supporting creative talent through accessible tools and strategic development.",,,69ca45174e5d9fe46aef7612,Business Operations Intern,2026-04-10T03:00:47.232Z,2026-04-10T03:00:47.232Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775790044452_Longinus Izuchukwu Onyekwere Resume.PDF.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
