69d8bb6ff625e5d1a9117940,Patience Yada,+23409119086909,patienceyada@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Good day sir /ma,\nMy name is patience Yada, a graduate of Bingham university with a Bsc. in sociology. I have 4 years work experience in anNGO as a data collector and enumerator. I've also worked in a school as a high school Teacher. \nI am eager to learn new skills, explore and learn from the world because I believe there's so much the world can offer me and I also can use these skills to make positive changes in the life's of people, organizations and communities. ",,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-10T08:57:19.394Z,2026-04-10T08:57:19.394Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775811436280_YADA PATIENCE UPDATED CV (3).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d8bbcdf625e5d1a911794d,Oluwatooni Mapayi,+2349036422454,oluwatoonimapayi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Oluwatooni is currently a Business Intelligence analyst who is transitioning into Business Analysis. I have an academic background in Applied Economics, combined with hands-on experience in data analysis, business strategy, and process optimization. This has strengthened my ability to translate insights into actionable development outcomes. \n\nIn my current capacity, I contribute to strategic initiatives that optimize business processes, leverage analytics for decision-making, and support cross-functional teams in achieving growth objectives. My work has also exposed me to the operational realities of African businesses—ranging from financial inclusion to agricultural value chains. This has equally fueled my passion for creating data-driven solutions to structural challenges facing emerging economies.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/oluwatoonimapayi/,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-10T08:58:53.952Z,2026-04-10T08:58:53.952Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775811530972_CV_Oluwatooni MAPAYI.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
