69d8c52ff625e5d1a91179ef,Ogbodo Precious Chinenye,+2348104964313,ogbodoprecious77@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am an analytical and detail-oriented professional with a growing foundation in business analysis, data interpretation, and problem-solving. I am passionate about understanding business needs, identifying gaps, and translating insights into actionable solutions that improve decision-making. I have been developing my skills in data analysis, stakeholder communication, and requirement gathering, and I enjoy working in environments where I can bridge the gap between business goals and technical execution. I am particularly interested in using data-driven insights to support strategy, optimize processes, and deliver measurable business value.",,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-10T09:38:55.899Z,2026-04-10T09:38:55.899Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775813933180_Precious sales cv.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d8c8f8f625e5d1a9117a3d,Irene Best Edward,+2349069926629,ireneedward30@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I pay attention to what most people overlook in data.\n\nI’m Irene Edward, a data analyst with hands-on experience using Excel, SQL, and Power BI to turn raw data into decisions people can actually act on. At AFRIMENT, I didn’t just analyze datasets,  I translated them into insights that supported real business choices. I’ve also tracked performance in teaching and project settings, so I understand how data connects to outcomes, not just reports.\n\nWhat drives me is simple: I like figuring out what the numbers are really saying and what to do next.",https://github.com/theibe,,69ca45174e5d9fe46aef7612,Business Operations Intern,2026-04-10T09:55:04.728Z,2026-04-10T09:55:04.728Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775814901483_Edward Irene Best- Cv.pdf.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
