69d8d3e7f625e5d1a9117af6,Fiyinfoluwa Farayola ,+2349157724841,farayolapraise16@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Fiyinfoluwa, and I am a UI/UX designer focused on creating intuitive and user-centered digital experiences. I specialize in UX research, UX design, interaction design, visual design, information architecture, wireframing and prototyping, with a strong interest in solving real user problems through thoughtful design. I enjoy transforming complex ideas into simple, engaging, and functional interfaces that improve usability and deliver value to users.",https://farayolafiyinfoluwa.framer.website,,69ca44c94e5d9fe46aef7610,Product Designer Intern,2026-04-10T10:41:43.979Z,2026-04-10T10:41:43.979Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775817700235_Fiyinfoluwa Farayola_Resume_111150.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69d8d3fff625e5d1a9117b04,Egede Precious ,+2349048031066,egedep9@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am passionate about leveraging data to solve real-world problems and drive efficient decision-making. \n\nIn today’s data-driven world, I strongly believe that decisions should be guided by facts rather than assumptions, and I am committed to transforming data into actionable insights that create value.\n\nAs a Business Analyst, I recognize that not everyone easily interprets numbers and complex datasets. To bridge this gap, I use storytelling as a tool to communicate insights—translating data into clear, relatable narratives that enable stakeholders to understand and act with confidence.\n\nI believe that data analysis alone does not guarantee effective decision-making. Rather, it is the clarity, relevance, and understanding of those insights that truly drive meaningful outcomes and conversions.",https://github.com/Gem-Precious,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-10T10:42:07.842Z,2026-04-10T10:42:07.842Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775817724053_Egede Precious CV 1.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
