69d8f70df625e5d1a9117d0c,Dorcas Popoola,+2349163448322,popooladorcas89@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a UI/UX designer with a strong interest in product design, focused on creating simple, intuitive experiences from complex ideas.\n\nI’ve worked on projects ranging from responsive web designs to interactive product flows, where I focused on improving clarity, usability, and overall user experience. Through this, I’ve developed skills in user research, wireframing, and designing interfaces that don’t just look good but are easy to use.\n\nI’m particularly interested in understanding user behavior and translating that into thoughtful design decisions that solve real problems.\n\nI’m currently looking to grow in a collaborative environment where I can learn, contribute, and refine my skills as a product designer.",https://www.notion.so/Dorcas-Popoola-UI-UX-Designer-2fcff313723680759a01d301699a185b?source=copy_link,,69ca44c94e5d9fe46aef7610,Product Designer Intern,2026-04-10T13:11:41.020Z,2026-04-10T13:11:41.020Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775826698057_Dorcas CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
