69da3077f625e5d1a91182c2,Chinedu Favour Ohakwe,+23409020532282,faveohak1103@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm a UI/UX designer based in Lagos. My background is in architecture, which sounds like an odd path into product design until you realize that architecture is fundamentally about understanding how people move through and interact with spaces. The translation to digital interfaces wasn't that big a leap.\nI've spent the past year working across two product teams: a fintech startup where I built out design system components and ran usability testing, and a digital agency where I worked on web and mobile interfaces alongside developers and PMs. Both roles were small enough that I had to be generalist. Research, wireframes, prototypes, design reviews, the whole thing.\nOutside of work I've been going deep on AI. I've completed Anthropic's AI Fluency and Claude 101 certifications, and I use Claude regularly as part of how I actually work, not just as a novelty. I'm curious about where design and AI intersect, which is a big part of why this role caught my attention.",https://favourohakwe.wordpress.com,,69ca44c94e5d9fe46aef7610,Product Designer Intern,2026-04-11T11:28:55.555Z,2026-04-11T11:28:55.555Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775906930339_Chinedu_Favour_Ohakwe_CV UIUX (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
