69da6d14f625e5d1a9118502,Omokhoa Oshose Tosayoname,+23407031464786,tosayoname@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a multidisciplinary Data Analyst and emerging Data Scientist with a background in Mechanical Engineering and hands-on experience in data analytics, business intelligence, and applied machine learning. I have completed internships with Codveda Technologies and a Deloitte job simulation, where I built interactive dashboards, performed exploratory data analysis, and communicated data-driven insights to stakeholders using Python, SQL, Tableau, and Power BI. I also hold certifications in Data Analysis and Python for Data Science from ALX, and have led team-based analytics projects that involved cross-functional collaboration and stakeholder reporting. Beyond technical skills, I bring strong documentation habits, project management experience, and a genuine passion for turning complex data into clear, actionable narratives.",https://github.com/Tosa9,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-11T15:47:32.740Z,2026-04-11T15:47:32.740Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775922449657_Data_Analytics.Business_Analyst.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
