69da9edbf625e5d1a911854d,Franklin Iwuamadi ,+23409034842606,iwuamadifranklin@hotmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a creative UI/UX designer that focuses on user centric designs, I focus on user research and personas as well as defining the problem statement that needs to be solved, I am well adept in ideate and prototyping processes to ensure a product come to life.",https://www.behance.net/fi26,,69ca44c94e5d9fe46aef7610,Product Designer Intern,2026-04-11T19:19:55.860Z,2026-04-11T19:19:55.860Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775935192205_Franklin Iwuamadi UI&UX.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69daa2d9f625e5d1a911856f,Azubuike Chima,+23408163077401,chimafrancis94@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I've spent three years building production React applications, and while I've developed responsive dashboards and data visualization components, I need to be honest about where my experience aligns with your specific requirements and where I'd be learning on the job.\nMy relevant experience includes building real-time dashboards that processed streaming data from WebSocket connections, displaying updates without degrading performance as data volume increased. I implemented role-based UI rendering where different user types saw completely different interfaces based on their permissions—not just hidden buttons, but fundamentally different data views and capabilities. I've worked extensively with React and TypeScript, using type safety to prevent the kind of runtime errors that are particularly painful in data-heavy applications.",https:socheemaportfolio.vercel.app,,69ca7ab1cc542dfc1db2f6d4,Frontend Developer Intern,2026-04-11T19:36:57.651Z,2026-04-11T19:36:57.651Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775936214880_azubuike_resume (1) (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69daba7ef625e5d1a91185ab,Oluwaseun Funmilayo Sunmonu,+2347046309650,oluwaseun.sunmonu64@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Oluwaseun Funmilayo Sunmonu, an Accounting graduate from the University of Benin with a Second Class Upper Division. My academic training in financial analysis, auditing, and business law built a strong analytical foundation, which I further developed through my final year research on forensic accounting and fraud detection across 133 professionals in Nigerian organizations. That project involved designing data gathering tools, running regression analysis, and translating findings into clear recommendations, experiences that closely mirror the core responsibilities of a Business Analyst.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/funmilayo-sunmonu-212693211,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-11T21:17:50.837Z,2026-04-11T21:17:50.837Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775942266970_Oluwaseun_Funmilayo_Sunmonu_Business_Analyst_Intern_CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69dabfb9f625e5d1a91185bb,Marvelous Opene,+23407033272440,openemarvelous@gmail.com,Nigeria,"Hi, My Name is Opene C. Marvelous, I am a UI/UX product designer, I'm all about crafting experiences that are both intuitive and delightful. I dive deep into user needs, build wireframes and prototypes, and test them out to make sure they're spot on. Collaboration with devs, stakeholders, and users is key for me, I make sure everyone is, on the same page. As a UIUX Product designer, solving problems that make life easier for people is what I dedicate my time on mostly; like mobile-first solutions for widespread mobile use.",https://www.linkedin.com/in/opene-marvelous-a61bb5253/overlay/contact-info/?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Ad_flagship3_profile_view_base%3BVqctRRAdRZys6zX7Vm331A%3D%3D,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-11T21:40:09.616Z,2026-04-11T21:40:09.616Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775943605831_Marvelous_Opene_Resume_Optimized 33.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
