69dad312f625e5d1a911862f,Somto Kingsley Onwuagba,+23407032486127,onwuagbasomto@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am Somto Onwuagba Kingsley, a product designer with 3 years of professional experience. I'm passionate about crafting intuitive and beautiful digital experiences that make a real impact. \n\nWith skills in Figma, Adobe Illustrator, I've worked on projects that blend user-centered design with creative problem-solving. Outside of design, I love exploring new trends, learning about emerging tech(AI), and collaborating with others to push creative boundaries.",https://somtokingsley.framer.website/,,69ca44c94e5d9fe46aef7610,Product Designer Intern,2026-04-11T23:02:42.306Z,2026-04-11T23:02:42.306Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775948559398_Somto_Onwuagba_CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69dad96ff625e5d1a911863e,chukwuemeka Donald Daniel,+23408065709749,chukwuemekadaniel51@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Data Analyst with a strong foundation in financial accounting and process automation\nCurrently, I serve as an Outlet Accountant, but my focus has shifted entirely toward operational efficiency. Recently, I built a custom working capital engine using my background in SQL and Data Analysis I automated our audit trail to detect cashflow shortages and entry errors instantly. This shifted our process from finding and fixing problems month-end to proactive daily precision fixes \nI hold a B.Sc. in Accountancy and a certification in Python for Data Analysis, which allows me to bridge the gap between complex financial data and actionable business insights",,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-11T23:29:51.811Z,2026-04-11T23:29:51.811Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775950189377_Daniel Donald Chukwuemeka cv (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69dadfc9f625e5d1a9118652,UZOIGWE TOBECHI,+2348167688150,uzoigwetobechi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"\nI am a detail oriented researcher and data analyst with strong interest in business analysis, process improvement, and data driven decision making. I have over five years of experience working with datasets, applying statistical tools such as Excel, SPSS, Jamovi, and SmartPLS to identify patterns, trends, and actionable insights. My work involves translating raw data into clear findings that support planning, reporting, and decision making.\n\nI have developed strong analytical and problem solving skills through academic research and quantitative projects, including survey design, hypothesis testing, regression analysis, and structured reporting. I am comfortable working with documentation, preparing reports, and presenting findings in a clear and structured format for stakeholders.\n\nI am highly motivated to grow within a fast paced, technology driven environment where I can apply my analytical abilities to real business problems. I am particularly interested in requirement gathering, process improvement, and supporting project delivery through accurate analysis and clear documentation.\n\nI am eager to contribute to team based projects, learn from experienced professionals, and develop practical business analysis skills that align with organizational goals.\n",https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=_NV-Yq0AAAAJ&hl=en,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-11T23:56:57.099Z,2026-04-11T23:56:57.099Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775951813393_Tobechi Uzoigwe Researcher 2025 CV-edit.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69db200ef625e5d1a9118669,Akinyode Mary K.,+23407047492315,akinyodemary4@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a software engineering student with a strong interest in frontend development, especially working with JavaScript ad React to build user interfaces.\n\nI have been actively improving my skills by learning and building, and I enjoy turning ideas into functional and responsive design. I also enjoy working in collaborative environments where I can both learn from others and contribute my own ideas.\n\nI’m currently focused on gaining real-world experience alongside my studies, so I can apply what I’m learning in practical situations and continue growing as a developer.",https://engrmarykay.vercel.app,,69ca7ab1cc542dfc1db2f6d4,Frontend Developer Intern,2026-04-12T04:31:10.371Z,2026-04-12T04:31:10.371Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775968267286_Mary Akinyode.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69db2fe7f625e5d1a911867b,Cindy Ayirebono Akenma,+233551972704,akenmacindy25@gmail.com,Ghana,"My name is Cindy Ayirebono Akenma, and I am an Electrical and Electronics Engineering student with a growing interest in data and artificial intelligence. I have become really interested in how data, when properly analyzed, can help people and businesses make better decisions, both now and in the future.\n\nI am naturally curious, especially when it comes to business and entrepreneurship, and that is what pushed me to start learning more about data and how it can be used to solve real problems. I am also interested in how AI can be applied to make work easier, faster, and more efficient.\n\nOverall, I am someone who enjoys learning, exploring new ideas, and finding ways to use technology to create meaningful impact. I am excited about opportunities where I can grow and also contribute what I’m learning in a practical way.",,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-12T05:38:47.740Z,2026-04-12T05:38:47.740Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775972324607_CINDY AKENMA'SCV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69db4973f625e5d1a91186a3,Jefferson Oyintare Jituboh ,+23408090932327,jitubohjefferson@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Brand Identity Designer with experience of about 4 years now. I graduated from the University of Lagos, from the Department of Mathematics.\n\nMy first job was with Invade Merchandising, a company in Abuja which was mainly into print design. We worked on various projects, but the main project was Africa Internet Governance Forum (AfIGF, 2023). I worked remotely with the company, from Lagos State.\n\nI have since then, been a Freelancer. I volunteered at MADHouse by Tikera, a creative hub in The University of Lagos (UNILAG) from May 2025 to October 2025, where I worked in The Communications Department with Photographers, Content Creators, Videographers, Video Editors, alongside my Line Manager, who is a Communications Expert. It was a fully immersive role as I got to learn a lot on how communication is structured within an organization, and how it is passed across to the audience (Target Audience).\n\nWe also collaborated with other departments, like the Programs and Project Department, Admin and Operations amongst others. I gained hands-on experience for the first time, working in a fully-structured organization.",www.behance.net/9a4103bc,,69ca456d4e5d9fe46aef7614,Graphic Design Intern,2026-04-12T07:27:47.671Z,2026-04-12T07:27:47.671Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775978863805_JEFFERSON JITUBOH RESUME.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69db62d1f625e5d1a91186d4,Joy Aitomun,+2348155325771,aitomunjoy@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a UI/UX designer with hands-on experience designing end-to-end digital products, including a Learning Management System (LMS) and a Hotel Management System (HMS). In these projects, I worked as the sole designer, handling both user experience and interface design—from structuring user flows and defining product architecture to designing high-fidelity interfaces.\n\nThrough these experiences, I have developed a strong foundation in user-centered design, information architecture, and creating intuitive, visually consistent interfaces. I have also gained experience thinking through complex systems and translating ideas into practical, user-friendly solutions.",https://client-lms-mu.vercel.app/,,69ca44c94e5d9fe46aef7610,Product Designer Intern,2026-04-12T09:16:01.659Z,2026-04-12T09:16:01.659Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1775985358743_Product Designer CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
