69dd21d2f625e5d1a91191c6,Okoli Akachukwu Abel,+23407025416405,abelokoli02@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I would describe myself as a proactive and growth-oriented individual with a background in Computer Science and hands-on experience across web development and digital strategy. I’ve worked as a Web Development Intern and Software Developer Intern, where I built and optimized web applications using tools like React, and collaborated in team-based projects. More recently, during my NYSC, I worked as a Social Media Strategist and Graphics Designer, where I managed content strategies, designed visual materials, and supported the deployment of a CBT system, which strengthened both my technical and project management skills.\n\nOutside of work, I enjoy exploring technology, improving my design and development skills, and engaging in creative activities like graphic design and content creation. Overall, I enjoy building solutions, working with people, and continuously improving myself.",https://akachukwua.github.io/abbie-main/,,69ca7ab1cc542dfc1db2f6d4,Frontend Developer Intern,2026-04-13T17:03:14.593Z,2026-04-13T17:03:14.593Z,,,"https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1776099790848_CV - OKOLI, AKACHUKWU ABEL (1).pdf",Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
