69dd2279f625e5d1a9119207,Azeezat Onigemo,+2349073126413,onigemoazeezat1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m an aspiring business analyst who loves turning messy, confusing data into clear, useful stories. I recently completed focused training in data analytics, where I learnt that being a good analyst isn’t just about knowing the tools, it’s about asking the right questions and double-checking your assumptions.\n\nMy technical toolkit includes:\n- SQL for pulling and joining data from relational databases  \n- Excel (lookups, pivot tables, power query) for quick, reliable analysis  \n- Python (pandas, numpy, matplotlib) for cleaning and exploring larger datasets  \n- Tableau & Power BI for building dashboards \n\nI’ve applied this mindset to projects like the following:\n- Analyzing customer support ticket data to identify common bottlenecks  \n- Building a KPI dashboard for a mock e-commerce store  \n- Cleaning and merging messy survey data to uncover user trends  \n\nI know I’m at the start of my journey, but I’m hungry to learn from real-world data, real teammates, and real business problems. I’m not afraid to ask for help, I document my work obsessively, and I show up ready to contribute even on the less glamorous tasks like data validation or updating reports.\n\nIn short: I’m curious, careful, and committed to growing into an analyst you can trust with important questions.\n",https://github.com/onigemoazeezat1-code,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-13T17:06:01.755Z,2026-04-13T17:06:01.755Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1776099959104_Onigemo Azeezat DA CV2.docx (3).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69dd227af625e5d1a911920e,Efeosa Aizesogie,+2349069666967,efeaizesogie@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Efeosa, a frontend engineer with about three years of commercial experience building production web applications. I’ve worked across fintech, SaaS, and geospatial companies, shipping features with React, NextJs, Angular, GraphQL, and Redux. My background is a bit unusual for a frontend person. I hold a second-class upper division degree in Geomatics, which means I think a lot about spatial data, systems, and how information gets turned into something people can actually use.\n\nOutside my day-to-day work, I’ve built personal projects like a lead generation tool powered by AI and a portfolio-building agent, and I stay active in Web3 communities where I moderate and create content. I like building things that solve real problems, and I’m always looking for roles where I can grow while contributing something meaningful.",https://efe-portfolio-next.vercel.app/,,69ca7ab1cc542dfc1db2f6d4,Frontend Developer Intern,2026-04-13T17:06:02.877Z,2026-04-13T17:06:02.877Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1776099960197_Efeosa Aizesogie_Developer U - (Open to remote).docx.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
