69dd22a1f625e5d1a9119224,Oluwagbenga Ajetomobi,+2347069562772,ajet.gbenga@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a data and financial analyst with over five years of professional experience across corporate finance, revenue administration, and operations, working with organisations in Nigeria and remotely for Canadian advisory clients. I have strong foundations in SQL, Power BI, Excel, and Python, and I have spent most of my career doing work that sits right at the edge of business analysis: gathering requirements from stakeholders, documenting workflows, identifying inefficiencies, analysing data to inform decisions, and presenting findings in formats that drive action. I was recognised as Rising Superstar of the Year at Grovane Advisory Partners in 2024 for the quality and impact of my cross-functional work. I am now making a deliberate move toward formalising my identity as a Business Analyst, and I am looking for an environment that combines mentorship with hands-on practice.",https://www.linktr.ee/emmajet,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-13T17:06:41.550Z,2026-04-13T17:06:41.550Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1776099996275_Ajetomobi_TobamsGroup_BAIntern_CV.jpg,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
