69dd27a5f625e5d1a91192ce,Micheal Odunayo Obolo,+2347081796248,obolomicheal1@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I would describe myself as someone who likes structure and clarity. I’ve had the opportunity to work remotely as a research support assistant in a consulting firm, and that experience shaped how I think about work. I wasn’t just writing, I was coordinating tasks, handling data analysis, organizing information, and making sure projects were completed properly and on time.\nWorking with different clients taught me how to manage expectations, pay attention to details, and stay organized even when multiple things were happening at once. I realized that I enjoy being in roles where things need to be coordinated behind the scenes to make everything run smoothly.\nI’m generally calm, analytical, and intentional about whatever I’m involved in. I prefer understanding how a system works rather than just doing tasks blindly. That’s the kind of environment I’m looking to grow in, one where I can contribute meaningfully while also learning how operations function in a practical setting.",,,69ca45174e5d9fe46aef7612,Business Operations Intern,2026-04-13T17:28:05.302Z,2026-04-13T17:28:05.302Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1776101281876_Micheal Obolo_CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
