69dd7a57f625e5d1a91196cd,Kalu Gift Nneoma,+2347058701817,giftkalu247@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m Gift Kalu, a data-driven problem solver with a strong interest in using data and technology to improve systems and decision-making. My background is in data science, where I’ve developed skills in Python, SQL, data visualisation, and analytical tools like Pandas, PowerBI, and ScikitLearn. Through my work and projects, I’ve become particularly interested in how data can inform strategy, improve processes, and help organisations better understand user needs.\n\nBeyond technical skills, I’ve also had experience in leadership and stakeholder-focused roles. I served as Head Girl of Queen’s College and currently contribute to initiatives within the Queen’s College Old Girls Association, where I help coordinate opportunities and development initiatives for students. I’ve also worked in marketing and community roles in organisations like Google Developer Student Club and Cowrywise, where I collaborated with teams, communicated insights, and supported initiatives that improved engagement and impact.\n\nWhat excites me about business analysis is the intersection of data, people, and strategy. I enjoy translating complex information into clear insights, documenting processes, and identifying opportunities for improvement. I’m particularly drawn to Tobams Group because of your focus on education and technology through the Recycled Learning initiative. The idea of using innovative learning systems to bridge educational gaps aligns with my passion for building solutions that create meaningful opportunities for people.\n\nI’m eager to bring my analytical mindset, curiosity, and collaborative skills to this internship while also learning from experienced professionals and gaining deeper exposure to business analysis in practice.",Giftkalu.github.io,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-13T23:20:55.622Z,2026-04-13T23:20:55.622Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.