69de1044f625e5d1a9119e00,Thomas Ogunmakinju,+23409130340087,gunmakinthomas7@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a Materials and Metallurgical Engineering graduate with a strong interest in data analysis, problem-solving, and technology-driven solutions. Over time, I have developed a growing passion for using data and digital tools to support decision-making and improve systems, which is why I am transitioning toward business and data analysis roles.\nI have hands-on experience working on a corrosion prediction web application using Streamlit, where I applied data preprocessing, model evaluation, and visualization to generate insights. This project strengthened my ability to analyze data, structure workflows, and communicate findings clearly—skills that are highly relevant to business analysis.\nI am particularly interested in this internship because it combines requirement gathering, stakeholder communication, and data-driven decision-making. I am eager to learn how business processes are translated into technical solutions and how to support organizations in improving efficiency through analysis.\nI am a fast learner, highly analytical, and comfortable working in collaborative environments. My goal is to grow into a professional who can bridge the gap between technical systems and business needs, and I see this opportunity as an important step in that direction.",https://drive.google.com/file/d/1B3XTM4b-R1cn4khswFSLK_yAYh-GWViv/view?usp=drivesdk,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-14T10:00:36.453Z,2026-04-14T10:00:36.453Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1776160833054_Thomas_tech_AI_ML_cv.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
