69de26caf625e5d1a9119f25,Olamilekan Rasaq,+23409038485302,rasaqola196@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a frontend developer currently advancing my skills through the ALX ProDev Frontend program, where I’ve been building responsive and user-focused web applications using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and React. I also have prior experience in full-stack software engineering training, which has given me a solid understanding of how frontend interfaces connect with backend systems.\nI’ve worked on projects like an e-commerce website and a portfolio platform, where I focused on creating clean UI, responsive layouts, and interactive user experiences. I’m comfortable using tools like Git, Figma, and modern frontend workflows.\nBeyond technical skills, I bring experience in teaching and customer-facing roles, which has helped me develop strong communication, problem-solving, and collaboration skills. I’m passionate about continuous learning and improving my craft, especially in building products that are both functional and visually appealing.",https://github.com/rasaq-ola,,69ca7ab1cc542dfc1db2f6d4,Frontend Developer Intern,2026-04-14T11:36:42.084Z,2026-04-14T11:36:42.084Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1776166599462_OLA SE CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69de2c09f625e5d1a9119f82,Oyindamola Osho,+23408111581713,oshooyindamola7@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a graduate of microbiology with a strong foundation in data analysis and research. During my studies, I worked with experimental data analyzing results, identifying patterns, and presenting findings which helped me develop strong attention to detail and problem-solving skills.\n\nThrough this experience, I became interested in how data can be used beyond the lab to support decision-making in a business context. That’s what motivated me to pursue a Business Analyst role.\n\nAs an intern, I’m particularly eager to learn from experienced professionals, build my skills in data analysis and business processes, and contribute wherever I can. I’m excited about the opportunity to apply my analytical thinking in a practical environment while continuing to grow.",,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-14T11:59:05.851Z,2026-04-14T11:59:05.851Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1776167937030_Business_Analyst_CV_Updated.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69de2d1bf625e5d1a9119f8c,Gopep Chorbe Jacob,+2348160523119,jaybee4903u@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m an analytical and detail-oriented professional with over two years of experience working with data in fast-paced environments. My background in data entry and monitoring support has given me a strong foundation in data cleaning, validation, and ensuring accuracy, particularly using tools like Excel and Google Forms.\nBeyond handling data, I’ve developed a strong interest in understanding what the data means for business decisions. I enjoy identifying patterns, spotting inconsistencies, and translating information into insights that support planning and performance improvement.\nOutside of my professional work, I actively play basketball, which has helped me develop strong teamwork, discipline, and strategic thinking skills. These qualities influence how I approach problem-solving and collaboration in a work environment.\nI’m a fast learner who adapts quickly, and I’m particularly interested in this Business Analyst role because it allows me to combine my analytical skills with problem-solving to support better decision-making and business outcomes.\n",https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15H1apk8QAp7pFPjstiE3eXkcNumZb0Dm,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-14T12:03:39.299Z,2026-04-14T12:03:39.299Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1776168216261_CHORBE GOPEP data analyst.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69de2df3f625e5d1a9119f9d,John Nnanna Eke ,+2348160751250,johnekennanna@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is John Nnanna Eke, and I am a Nigerian graduate with a Bachelor’s Degree in Agricultural Extension. I currently work as a Financial Sales Executive at Prudential Zenith Life Insurance, where I have developed strong analytical, communication, and problem-solving skills that align closely with the role of a Business Analyst Intern.\n\nIn my current role, I regularly interact with clients to understand their financial needs, assess risks, and recommend suitable insurance solutions. This experience has strengthened my ability to gather and interpret data, identify customer pain points, and provide tailored solutions—key responsibilities of a Business Analyst. I also analyze sales performance, track client trends, and contribute to improving customer retention strategies, which has enhanced my data-driven decision-making abilities.\n\nMy academic background in Agricultural Extension has equipped me with skills in research, data collection, and community-based problem analysis. I have experience evaluating systems, identifying gaps, and recommending improvements, particularly in rural and development-focused contexts. These skills are highly transferable to business analysis, where understanding stakeholder needs and optimizing processes are critical.\n\nI am particularly interested in the Business Analyst Intern role because it offers the opportunity to bridge business needs with data insights. I am eager to further develop my skills in requirement gathering, data analysis, and business process modeling while contributing value to organizational goals.\n\nWith my combination of field experience, analytical mindset, and strong interpersonal skills, I am confident in my ability to learn quickly and make meaningful contributions as a Business Analyst Intern.",,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-14T12:07:15.004Z,2026-04-14T12:07:15.004Z,,,https://dev-tale