69de3522f625e5d1a911a050,Bazunu Oghenefejiro Odinekachukwu,+2348165397512,odihandchi@gmail.com,Nigeria,"My name is Bazunu Oghenefejiro, and I am an entrepreneur and certified Data Analyst with a focus on business optimization. I hold a degree in Agricultural Economics from the University of Benin, which provided me with a strong foundation in resource management and extension services.\n\nIn 2021, I founded Odihandchi Medical Supplies. I grew the business from a small startup into a venture with a current investment value of 3 million Naira, serving over 10 institutional clients. This experience taught me the fundamentals of requirement elicitation, stakeholder management, and the importance of data-driven inventory control.\n\nDriven by a desire to solve more complex business problems, I recently completed the Google Data Analytics Professional Certificate. I am a high-velocity learner; I completed the 6-month curriculum in just one month, mastering SQL, R, Tableau, and Excel. I particularly enjoy using R for complex data manipulation and am eager to apply these technical skills within a consultancy environment. I am now looking to leverage my dual experience in business leadership and data analytics to help Tobams Group drive impactful educational and digital solutions.",Kaggle URL: https://www.kaggle.com/bazunuoghenefejiroLinkedIn URL: https://www.linkedin.com/in/oghenefejiro-bazunu-88a354381,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-14T12:37:54.272Z,2026-04-14T12:37:54.272Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1776170270815_CURRICULUM VITAE.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
