69de35ebf625e5d1a911a073,Peter Olasunkanmi Eyinade,+23407051354847,eyinadepeter2@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I’m a passionate and detail-oriented developer with a strong focus on building modern web applications using React and Next.js. I enjoy turning ideas into clean, functional user interfaces and continuously improving my skills by working on real-world projects.\n\nI’ve been working on projects that involve dynamic content rendering, component-based architecture, and integrating CMS tools like Prismic to manage data efficiently. I like having full control over my code, so I often build and structure components manually to better understand how everything works under the hood.\n\nBeyond coding, I’m someone who values problem-solving, teamwork, and growth. I’m always eager to learn new technologies, adapt quickly, and contribute meaningfully to any team or project I’m part of.",https://my-portfolio-gilt-ten-42.vercel.app/,,69ca7ab1cc542dfc1db2f6d4,Frontend Developer Intern,2026-04-14T12:41:15.271Z,2026-04-14T12:41:15.271Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1776170472040_Eyinade Peter.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
