69dfef24f625e5d1a911b72b,Kehinde Grace Adebayo,+23408165571979,kennyadebayo127@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a business analysis enthusiast with a background in customer service and digital marketing, and a growing interest in using data and structured analysis to solve business problems. \nOver time, I have developed skills in requirements gathering, process mapping, and data analysis using tools like Excel, SQL, and Power BI. I have also worked on business analysis projects where I analyzed business processes, documented requirements, and identified opportunities for improvement. \nMy experience working in customer-facing roles has strengthened my communication and problem-solving skills, which are essential for understanding stakeholder needs. I am currently focused on building my career in business analysis and gaining practical experience that allows me to contribute to data-driven decision making in organizations.",https://medium.com/@kennyadebayo127,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-15T20:03:48.477Z,2026-04-15T20:03:48.477Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1776283425150_Kehinde Grace Adebayo CV.docx (1).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69dff925f625e5d1a911b752,Bakare Emmanuella Itunu,+2348166910688,emmanuellaitunu8@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I'm Bakare Emmanuella Itunu, and I am a final-year student of History and International Studies. My academic background has strengthened my ability to research, analyze information critically, and present clear, structured insights.\n\nI am passionate about community development, global governance, business, and problem-solving. Over time, I have developed a strong interest in using data and analysis to understand real-world issues and contribute to practical solutions.\n\nTo support this, I have been building my data analytics skills. I have completed two projects, one self-initiated using a Kaggle dataset and another through TS Academy, where I applied structured learning to solve data problems. I am currently preparing to start a third project in Power BI. I also have intermediate knowledge of Excel and Power BI and I am learning SQL, which I practice consistently.\n\n I am analytical, disciplined, adaptable, communicative, and eager to learn, with a strong interest in applying my skills in a professional setting.",https://bakareemmanuellasportfolio.netlify.app/,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-15T20:46:29.671Z,2026-04-15T20:46:29.671Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1776285985799_BAKARE EMMANUELLA DATA RESUME.docx,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69dffeb4f625e5d1a911b76c,whesin daniel,+2348101175981,whesindaniel60@gmail.com,Nigeria,"I am a backend developer with a strong foundation in Computer Science  and hands on experience building scalable server side applications using Python, JavaScript, and TypeScript. I have worked on multiple backend projects where I designed and implemented RESTful APIs, structured database schemas, and collaborated with frontend developers to deliver seamless user experiences.\n\nDuring my experience at Fanrave and Stardelite Ltd, I contributed to building real-world applications including e-commerce systems and data-driven platforms. I have worked with technologies such as Django, Node.js, and relational and non-relational databases like PostgreSQL, MySQL, and MongoDB. I am also familiar with version control workflows using Git and have participated in code reviews, debugging, and testing processes.\n\nI have a strong interest in building efficient, scalable systems and recently worked on integrating generative AI into backend workflows, which has deepened my curiosity about AI-powered applications. I enjoy solving problems, learning new technologies, and working in collaborative environments where I can continue to grow as a backend engineer.",,,69ca44f74e5d9fe46aef7611,Backend Developer Intern,2026-04-15T21:10:12.959Z,2026-04-15T21:10:12.959Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1776287410122_WHESIN BACKEND CV.pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
