69e083a4f625e5d1a911b904,Funmilayo Oba,+23408105406668,funmilayo.oba@outlook.com,Nigeria,"I am a Frontend Developer with a growing focus on building responsive and user-friendly web applications using React, Vue, and modern JavaScript tools. My passion for coding started at a young age, which led me to pursue and obtain two degrees in Computer Science. I am keen on working in an environment that supports growth, collaboration, and continuous learning. I bring strong communication, problem-solving, and teamwork skills into my tech journey, and I genuinely enjoy collaborating with others.\n\nOver time, I have built projects that have strengthened my understanding of component-based architecture, responsive design, API integration, and clean code practices. I enjoy turning ideas into functional and visually appealing interfaces, and I am particularly interested in expanding my skills into mobile development using React Native.\n\nI am eager to learn, open to feedback, and committed to continuous improvement. I enjoy contributing meaningfully to projects and working within teams to achieve shared goals.\n\nI developed a strong interest in Tobams Group from the moment I attended the internship briefing. The organization reflects the kind of environment I have always desired, one that values growth, innovation, and collaboration. It would be a great privilege to contribute to and grow within your team.",https://funmilayooba.vercel.app/,,69ca7ab1cc542dfc1db2f6d4,Frontend Developer Intern,2026-04-16T06:37:24.996Z,2026-04-16T06:37:24.996Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1776321442097_FUNMI-OBA CV (2).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
69e0a0a3f625e5d1a911bd02,Harshita Chandaiya,+917389551522,harshitachandaiya@gmail.com,India,"I am a recent BBA graduate with a specialization in marketing and currently pursuing an MSc in Data Science. I have a strong interest in business analysis and data-driven decision-making. I recently completed the Google Data Analytics Professional Certificate, where I gained hands-on experience with tools such as Excel, SQL, Python, and Power BI.\n\nI enjoy working with data to identify patterns, generate insights, and support business decisions. Along with my technical skills, I have a good understanding of business concepts and strong communication skills, which help me effectively present findings and collaborate with stakeholders.\n\nAs a fresher, I am eager to gain practical experience, learn from industry professionals, and contribute meaningfully to projects. I am particularly interested in roles that allow me to combine analytical thinking with business strategy, and I see this internship as a great opportunity to grow in that direction.\n",https://github.com/HarshitaChandaiya,,69ca45374e5d9fe46aef7613,Business Analyst Intern,2026-04-16T08:41:07.110Z,2026-04-16T08:41:07.110Z,,,https://dev-talent-form-test.s3.eu-north-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1776328864530_Harshita Chandaiya (10).pdf,Applied,,,,,Tobams Group
